Then the other descriptions add more: Oneness as a unified state of consciousness, dissolution of divisions, fostering harmony, unity, love, compassion, transformation at various levels, highest enlightenment, interconnected nature of all existence, reduced passion and self-obsession, inseparable nature of all existence, harmonized within a unified whole.

