ion.", created_at:1779144528, source_id:"chunk-371c6c26a34760723cf924823ebf0f83<SEP>chunk-37f26db11e149c4af43719c414b748ce", entity_id:"Prosperity and Love"}}, {_id:6, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"CFO is a character mentioned in the text who discusses a meditation app and maintains inner stillness during conversations.", created_at:1779135262, source_id:"chunk-371c6c26a34760723cf924823ebf0f83", entity_id:"CFO"}}, {_id:7, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A financial crisis is a situation where financial assets are suddenly devalued, resulting in a loss of confidence.<SEP>Financial crisis is a scenario where connection becomes a channel to divine support and life transformation.<SEP>Financial Crisis involves economic hardship, where connection provides strength to overcome challenges.<SEP>Financial crisis involves severe economic difficulties or instability.<SEP>Financial crisis denotes severe economic difficulties impacting individuals or communities.", created_at:1779219003, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5<SEP>chunk-969db65cd4de00b6ac88dc7de2088f7a<SEP>chunk-56d49489b1f42f899d9566a254886c2c<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f<SEP>chunk-1638eab96ec57bc1b768b7d70d8ef77f<SEP>chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674", entity_id:"Financial Crisis"}}, {_id:8, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A health crisis is an emergency situation in which the normal healthcare system is overwhelmed or fails to provide adequate care.<SEP>Health crisis is a situation where connection acts as a soothing balm for emotional and physical struggles.<SEP>Health Crisis represents a period of seve