Lokaa embodies inner clarity, enthusiasm, and a non-conflicted state, serving as a bridge between the physical and spiritual realms. As the daughter of Preethaji and Krishnaji, she represents the unity of divine grace and human devotion. Her recovery from a life-threatening lake incident symbolizes spiritual resilience. She is celebrated in poetic form as an embodiment of transcendent love and wisdom.", source_id:"chunk-2d7f2293587016371499185adff2fbdb<SEP>chunk-456c0903cb899bf0e406dbdbcff13b6b<SEP>chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1<SEP>chunk-95d009c63a3449c63c28d254570391b6<SEP>chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-30b3ce6bb0954806ce5e0dee5f14e7c3<SEP>chunk-65c5a866de092cd58e4d4a2b1044a21e<SEP>chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc<SEP>chunk-f184ea56bcea598aa525718d96f6e142<SEP>chunk-53499f381af4c99f9a37a7d03455b285<SEP>chunk-37f26db11e149c4af43719c414b748ce<SEP>chunk-8a3ef14b4ae6173889d682a026ec55c0<SEP>chunk-8539e53b3407e35921fe5963280d3207<SEP>chunk-00283c6d3847e844c97d2dea1db37c97<SEP>chunk-2bd00175db71e25481fb9ce67f057b84<SEP>chunk-50d6ad908c447f2c1930066f85129418<SEP>chunk-e92892e6fc3f2eca65cd533bfb485c1c<SEP>chunk-50804a0cd2fabf8122814121f088fb8d<SEP>chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b", entity_id:"Lokaa"}}, {_id:62, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: ht