ki is an artifact used during the family vacation that tipped over, causing Preethaji and Lokaa to be stranded in icy water.<SEP>The Jet Ski is the recreational vehicle involved in the incident that capsized, leaving the family stranded in icy water.`<SEP>The Jet Ski is the recreational vehicle involved in the incident that capsized, leaving the family stranded in icy water.`", created_at:1779183058, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1<SEP>chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-50d6ad908c447f2c1930066f85129418<SEP>chunk-e92892e6fc3f2eca65cd533bfb485c1c", entity_id:"Jet Ski"}}, {_id:68, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Kanna is the narrator who experienced the Jet Ski accident and attempted to rescue Preethaji and Lokaa.", created_at:1779135494, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1", entity_id:"Kanna"}}, {_id:69, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Soaked phones belonging to the group, rendered non-functional due to water exposure.", created_at:1779135494, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1", entity_id:"Soaked Phones"}}] AS row
