UNWIND [{_id:70, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The marina is the location where the group received safety instructions before the incident.<SEP>The marina is a location where the narrator encountered poor instructions and a Jet Ski operator.<SEP>Marina is the location where the narrator and others were at risk due to neglecting life jackets.<SEP>The marina is the location where the narrator and their family were in danger before being rescued.", created_at:1779174406, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1<SEP>chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-03f4910a466e54c3db3456e161f19c10<SEP>chunk-00283c6d3847e844c97d2dea1db37c97", entity_id:"Marina"}}, {_id:71, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The seven-minute mark refers to the timeframe during which the Jet Ski was expected to sink, heightening urgency for rescue.", created_at:1779135494, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1", entity_id:"Seven-Minute Mark"}}, {_id:72, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Icy water in which the group was stranded, causing frigid conditions and soaked phones.<SEP>Icy water is a natural object where Preethaji and Lokaa were stranded after the Jet Ski incident.", created_at:1779135634, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1<SEP>chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41", entity_id:"Icy Water"}}, {_id:73, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Life jackets worn by the group for safety during the incident.<SEP>Life jackets are safety equipment critical for preventing drowning, neglected by the narrator initially.<SEP>Life jackets are safety equipment that the narrator initially dismisses but later acknowledges as crucial for survival.<SEP>Life jackets are safety equipment mentioned in the context of the family's near-drowning incident.`<SEP>Life jackets are safety equipment mentioned in the context of the family's near-drowning incident.`", created_at:1779183058, source_id:"chunk-0ef124c94bd0c01cb115a99182209cb1<SEP>chunk-03f4910a466e54c3db3456e161f19c10<SEP>chunk-00283c6d3847e844c97d2dea1db37c97<SEP>chunk-50d6ad908c447f2c1930066f85129418", entity_id:"Life Jackets"}}, {_id:74, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", created_at:1779142675, description:"Sri Bhagavan founded a school combining conventional education with teachings on joyful relationships.<SEP>Educational institution founded by the father that combines conventional education with joyful relationship training.<SEP>The institution where Sunil's daughter attends, referenced in the context of her interactions with friends.<SEP>School is a location mentioned as a place the Narrator is encouraged to attend.<SEP>A school hosting the foundation's event for teenagers.", source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-e5fa2d640a5c60cb68e25b39b952c1d0<SEP>chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922<SEP>chunk-aa9fb91dec3c3871071d93754b61c5e8<SEP>chunk-84d2a4edbdbc9a3e5f2a16c04a23d9aa", entity_id:"School"}}, {_id:75, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779179737, description:"Sri Bhagavan is a spiritual teacher, founder of Oneness, and experienced mystic visions of a golden orb of light during childhood.<SEP>Sri Bhagavan is Preethaji's father-in-law and co-founder of Oneness, a spiritual organization.` - Correct.<SEP>Sri Bhagavan is a spiritual teacher and founder of Oneness, a spiritual organization.", source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-d83a359a3b08bc2ee4dd9304ff1558fc<SEP>chunk-df1ee8c2e900dce3525e47875fd865ea", entity_id:"Sri Bhagavan"}}, {_id:76, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A mystical vision of a gigantic golden orb of light appeared to Sri Bhagavan during childhood, prompting spiritual pursuits.<SEP>A gigantic golden orb of light appeared in mystic visions, prompting chanting and meditation.", created_at:1779179738, source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-df1ee8c2e900dce3525e47875fd865ea", entity_id:"Gigantic Golden Orb of Light"}}, {_id:78, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Joyful relationships are taught in Sri Bhagavan's school as part of holistic education.<SEP>Joyful Relationships is a teaching method in Oneness's school, emphasizing positive interpersonal dynamics.", created_at:1779179737, source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-df1ee8c2e900dce3525e47875fd865ea", entity_id:"Joyful Relationships"}}, {_id:79, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mystic vision refers to the spiritual experience involving the golden orb that inspired Sri Bhagavan's teachings.<SEP>Mystic Vision refers to the appearance of a gigantic golden orb of light that inspired chanting and meditation.", created_at:1779179737, source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-df1ee8c2e900dce3525e47875fd865ea", entity_id:"Mystic Vision"}}, {_id:80, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Liberation of humankind is the spiritual goal driving Sri Bhagavan's teachings and practices.<SEP>The liberation of humankind is the purpose behind Sri Bhagavan's chanting and meditation practices.", created_at:1779179737, source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-df1ee8c2e900dce3525e47875fd865ea", entity_id:"Liberation of Humankind"}}, {_id:81, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: y2ZgKdt4Cj0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y2ZgKdt4Cj0)<SEP>YouTube Video: ds6FM6QEDWM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ds6FM6QEDWM)<SEP>YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779518302, description:"Narrator is a multifaceted figure characterized by inherited visions, shared consciousness, and frustration over instructional failures. In some accounts, the narrator experiences anger, self?reflection, and eventually realizes that self?centric thinking is the root of suffering. The narrator also demonstrates an empathic connection, perceiving others? emotions as if they were one?s own, and describes this connection as a natural state of being. Additionally, the narrator reflects on personal relationships, including marriage and emotional experiences with Krishnaji and their daughter, as well as broader familial dynamics. In another context, the narrator recounts an accident, receives help from a compassionate woman, and reflects on the nature of right action and its link to spontaneous compassion. Finally, the narrator undergoes intense self?reflection, anger, and ultimately attains enlightenment regarding the nature of suffering and self?centric thinking.<SEP>Narrator is the speaker reflecting on spiritual vision and its impact on life experiences, contrasting it with goal-oriented thinking.<SEP>The storyteller who engages the gentleman in dialogue, offering insights on gratitude and self-awareness.<SEP>The narrator is a person reflecting on their relationship with their daughter and attending the Field of Abundance event with their father.<SEP>The Narrator describes personal experiences of heightened consciousness and spiritual awakening, including timeless states and dissolution of self-identity.<SEP>The narrator is a person who developed a transformational teaching method after participating in OCLC programs, aiming to 