Paragraph 3: \"The Divine is referenced as a source of spiritual energy and enlightenment, central to the spiritual path of Mukthi. It represents a spiritual entity or concept central to the chant, symbolizing unity and presence within the self. The Divine represents a spiritual or universal force that responds to prayers and blessings, influencing outcomes through compassion and gratitude. It symbolizes a higher power or spiritual connection invoked in prayers for healing and strength. The Divine refers to a spiritual or higher power connected to universal intelligence. It is associated with universal intelligence, and a spiritual or transcendent entity associated with universal intelligence. The Divine represents a transcendent power connected to universal intelligence in the text's framework.\"

Count: 1: The, 2: Divine, 3: is, 4: referenced, 5: as, 6: a,", source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-a77f1fee05f090e6b596f48781d6d33a<SEP>chunk-6b79e6b00a623d29a4805b544a6d5b42<SEP>chunk-7f215aec5e563fe08c9394af87e3712d<SEP>chunk-4003efce0728e0c0f59a1a3a79c95022<SEP>chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b<SEP>chunk-baf2b6300d9383f209a9838b89760571<SEP>chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c<SEP>chunk-e485856c846e316df06cb23fc5d1ca15<SEP>chunk-f02bf32393ef9705110f96bbc12d8064<SEP>chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43<SEP>chunk-92612cb49d206542f94c805b305ba93b<SEP>chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc<SEP>chunk-28d2d5c18afc1fb40fd31cf708261f0e<SEP>chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be<SEP>chunk-fa51e84ddb49268093fbbf38c48a6abb<SEP>chunk-a1a5a74c6d8e05a60b03459a012aa68f<SEP>chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77<SEP>chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f<SEP>chunk-1638eab96ec57bc1b768b7d70d8ef77f<SEP>chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674<SEP>chunk-484bc3d2121acfeffdb578822d602a80<SEP>chunk-eae1f6658ba1fd4f52f2452752071fc4<SEP>chunk-f78b0e4aa7017a9c67d7f42fb709f53c<SEP>chunk-2937f9db737764b56ab13c05271ce216<SEP>chunk-654ba1397813fb7e7e5aa81442780460<SEP>chunk-b65b7a91b3418aca3d1c110687b32d7d<SEP>chunk-80d013da8e30699bb74f5c6c773c8701<SEP>chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d<SEP>chunk-4a88b9900bf621d698b72b33414ac811<SEP>chunk-0de990c9c98448c49e9565dc513c171a<SEP>chunk-e7c9f032dc546ceb8596a807018125ca<SEP>chunk-a10d491711164b21994f76ff0fb53caa<SEP>chunk-79727c38a2ca8d63adfca02ee83cd218<SEP>chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87<SEP>chunk-eff8e4dcfe33dc3f019672706583990a<SEP>chunk-fd5ce10ac8b9d8fd71b9d99f866818d3<SEP>chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d<SEP>chunk-feadf97235c8f111320838dcf92b6b01<SEP>chunk-f35ecb38bfeca95ba27fabf08e8561a8<SEP>chunk-7796e9953e60bd3bb11c46251f992983<SEP>chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c", entity_id:"Divine"}}, {_id:109, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"War Within Ourselves refers to internal conflict and psychological struggle described as a source of suffering.", created_at:1779135635, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41", entity_id:"War Within Ourselves"}}, {_id:110, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Beautiful Life signifies an ideal state of being free from separation and suffering, framed as humanity's destiny.<SEP>A philosophical stance symbolizing self-acceptance and contentment with one's existence.<SEP>The purpose of visiting Ekam Kshetra is to start a beautiful life.<SEP>The beautiful life is a state of consciousness where existence is celebrated as it is, free from \"should be\" or \"should not be.\"<SEP>Beautiful Life signifies an ideal state of harmony and purpose.<SEP>A beautiful life is associated with living in a harmonious, purposeful state aligned with universal balance.", created_at:1779209798, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699<SEP>chunk-9503d97a23d03f63c7c514a61b68c6b4<SEP>chunk-6d0566c8fa6f2aed45fb2e69b00761b1<SEP>chunk-d3ac0c14051bad6207731777eb7b7f65<SEP>chunk-bb8776e3af3003e2566aad28f28875b7<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5", entity_id:"Beautiful Life"}}, {_id:113, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The One represents the unified universal organism where all existence is interconnected as a single entity.", created_at:1779135635, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41", entity_id:"The One"}}, {_id:114, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Rescue Team is an organization that arrived to assist Preethaji and Lokaa after their Jet Ski incident.<SEP>The rescue team arrives to save the narrator's family from the water, marking the end of the physical danger.<SEP>The Rescue Team is the group that arrived to save Preethaji and her family after the incident.`<SEP>The Rescue Team is the group that arrived to save Preethaji and her family after the incident.`", created_at:1779183059, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-00283c6d3847e844c97d2dea1db37c97<SEP>chunk-50d6ad908c447f2c1930066f85129418", entity_id:"Rescue Team"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:115, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: cHAJiF2byzg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHAJiF2byzg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGosHULQQk0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3weAVHuSCxg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Freedom is a desired state of liberation from inner conflict, separation, and suffering, often linked to the concept of Beautiful Life. It is characterized by freedom from societal judgments and internal conflicts, achieved by moving beyond the constraints of unresolved desires and self?imposed struggles. In this view, Freedom is the state of being free from anger and blame, attainable by letting go of negative thoughts and actions.  

Freedom is also presented as a paradoxical choice involving negative emotions, emphasizing liberation through self?awareness. Some descriptions note that Freedom is a choice of negative emotions and is only for the wise, highlighting a nuanced perspective that not all can attain it. This paradoxical nature underscores the complexity of achieving true Freedom. Another facet of Freedom is its association with liberation from addiction and self?imposed slavery, which is emphasized as the core of life's purpose. It is also described as the state of being free from anger and blame, achievable by letting go of negative thoughts and actions, tying Freedom to the broader goal of overcoming self?imposed constraints. Freedom is closely linked to enlightenment, described as the absence of fear and a quiet mind amidst life's noise. This connection suggests that Freedom is not merely the absence of external constraints but also the cultivation of inner peace and clarity. Together, these perspectives portray Freedom as a multifaceted concept that integrates emotional, psychological, and spiritual dimensions.  

Freedom is described as a complex and debated concept, with references to its perceived absurdity in modern contexts. In this context, Freedom relates to autonomy over personal choices and lifestyle, emphasizing the individual's capacity to shape their own path. A debated concept in the video, analyzed for its perceived contradictions and societal implications, further highlights the contested nature of Freedom.  

Freedom is presented as a goal or state that individuals seek on social media platforms, but it is contrasted with the loss of privacy. Additionally, Freedom is presented as the ultimate aim of meditation, representing liberation and a state of being aligned with life's flow. This ultimate aim of meditation underscores Freedom as a spiritual objective, representing liberation and alignment with life's flow.  

Some of the provided descriptions are repeated, but the core ideas?liberation from inner conflict, the paradoxical nature of negative emotions, the link to enlightenment, and the various contexts (philosophical, meditative, social?media, and video analysis)?are consistently reflected across the list.<SEP>Freedom is presented as a desired outcome, achieved through emotional release and acceptance.", created_at:1779737968, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-c3c756183e3f4bbcd6f10defea6c686f<SEP>chunk-6a2ca3b4a00fd65d72ac5932a227e2a8<SEP>chunk-6254a0998449b5aae9f36e202e6ddd4f<SEP>chunk-58209224da39691b43cec61c729a13d1<SEP>chunk-94adc3d4525b736bf33ffd5d5752ec38<SEP>chunk-339fa6ee789d0451cedd5e2548222d96<SEP>chunk-97418c51f26c4090e6f6b986b0a848a6<SEP>chunk-e2d0ff9dea6a5334fbc3569bce6e4413<SEP>chunk-922e23e61222fa7ebaae80af23f09b19<SEP>chunk-04a5cce20e9ca029b1d885a9ee7c4ec6<SEP>chunk-ecff7e1995c8cfd62a765753318d7dab<SEP>chunk-f7a7b6ec5216cd073aa9baeaf426fc77<SEP>chunk-e3a9d3b4e75a6781f9fb7a4d35559a14<SEP>chunk-f3cc07a478604197eefad4556e973256<SEP>chunk-07cef1cacdb43780b9533bba3a4b7ad2<SEP>chunk-e5a191d0b4c345edce809b4d1989b5be<SEP>chunk-0bcd34bbf2440bb034ae1a5607edb427", entity_id:"Freedom"}}, {_id:116, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ypG1mlekNY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=