lobally.`<SEP>An internationally acclaimed academy founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, offering consciousness studies courses to over 69,500 students globally.", source_id:"chunk-4460c53283867cf0e7a6a331fc3daa9a<SEP>chunk-dad86cc04528a53c723f853b94021683<SEP>chunk-81f7d5b351616383eb1a7cca9b4d2b48", entity_id:"Academy for Consciousness Studies"}}, {_id:122, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779187388, description:"The teenage daughter of Preethaji and the author, representing the next generation.<SEP>Mike's teenage daughter insisted he attend a four-day course, indicating her influence on his participation.<SEP>Mike's teenage daughter insisted he attend the four-day course, initiating his journey of self-discovery.`", source_id:"chunk-4460c53283867cf0e7a6a331fc3daa9a<SEP>chunk-cd472120781d30f6deb417cdc30ee13c<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051", entity_id:"Teenage Daughter"}}, {_id:123, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)<SEP>YouTube Video: PFNP4c1cOSI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PFNP4c1cOSI)<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Xk1KsO3efP4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xk1KsO3efP4)<SEP>YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"Entity Name: Humanity\
\
Description List:\"}
{\"Description\": \"Humanity represents the collective human consciousness needing a shift towards Oneness.\"}
{\"Description\": \"The term \\\"Humanity\\\" is capitalized in the original text but should be lowercase \\\"humanity\\\" as it refers to the general concept.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Humanity refers to all human beings collectively facing the problem of divisiveness and requiring a shift towards Oneness.\"}
{\"Description\": \"The collective human population, whose consciousness is targeted by the concept of Oneness for promoting unity.\"}
{\"Description\": \"The collective human population, whose consciousness is targeted by the concept of Oneness for promoting unity.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Humanity refers to all human beings collectively and is associated with addressing global challenges.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Humanity represents the collective human population and its shared consciousness.\"}<SEP>Humanity is referenced in discussions about collective fear and the pursuit of freedom.<SEP>Humanity refers to all human beings collectively, currently facing crises due to self-centered behavior and unwise signals.<SEP>Humanity is a collective entity representing all human beings, currently facing global crises and environmental challenges.<SEP>Humanity refers to the collective existence of humans sharing evolutionary history and interconnectedness across genetic, neurological, mental, emotional, and spiritual dimensions.<SEP>Collective term for all human beings, responsible for actions affecting the environment and other living beings.<SEP>Collective existence of humans as interconnected and inseparable.", created_at:1779723878, source_id:"chunk-4460c53283867cf0e7a6a331fc3daa9a<SEP>chunk-53a9324ebf298fdd4dfdc6bd565dba9d<SEP>chunk-b4387a01e271d1d16068a0288faa84e5<SEP>chunk-161257a3b15bcafcf939769dfff5e967<SEP>chunk-00283c6d3847e844c97d2dea1db37c97<SEP>chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc<SEP>chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c<SEP>chunk-638abb6fbdf727a0284e50fe14e82b1f<SEP>chunk-acb941e2e31d401b209b5294a9065fb1<SEP>chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253<SEP>chunk-ce09b6c6a2ea185889fd9682aa9fd726<SEP>chunk-2e434306df5b4f2083250fff41e8b701<SEP>chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a<SEP>chunk-d2b88d2b3bf551cfbcb60d2a9d77ae9c<SEP>chunk-ac599df176221b3c1e3e9b33cb62fa37<SEP>chunk-86b06c28798f4c4a7bd03b34bd895d71<SEP>chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513<SEP>chunk-8b2fbaa3ebe33f5b431669abfbee9a40<SEP>chunk-d459696e63e5250812e4b59a48640c43<SEP>chunk-08c5fbdcd35ed15300b9915ca1fced8a<SEP>chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04<SEP>chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546<SEP>chunk-817243e49afe8b11df3c2d2ea2541519<SEP>chunk-a674092e280907c9a7ef3fa28f1ef9b8<SEP>chunk-f11387cad436a63