(URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779397715, description:"<think>
