tions that may be affected by unresolved issues from past ones.", created_at:1779140531, source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80<SEP>chunk-aff6c19ce49adbdf7e2d1f8c08ebd1a9", entity_id:"New Relationships"}}, {_id:149, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: fiABnex9O6Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fiABnex9O6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"We need to produce a comprehensive summary of the entity \\\"Transcendental States\\\"... etc.", created_at:1779518128, source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80<SEP>chunk-2177b8057ec605d01dc4819162240231<SEP>chunk-3a296ec9ad2af5d46dab6c458e4a48dd<SEP>chunk-a6edb23148812a00c784704ababdb3ee<SEP>chunk-3cb8947ae1a7d163a44b8090dbb139a7<SEP>chunk-18fa3a7d8837c4f0b21f7ce5e53f50b2<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72<SEP>chunk-07bbbe415fc6ff4eb6e48c047d81efd5<SEP>chunk-f2ff2524cafc909c25f1c32f713185d4<SEP>chunk-9d5ed1319932eeba02c60354b423c137<SEP>chunk-94684d3c1e91618d6299c39872dafbdf<SEP>chunk-57c07a0512777570587c500dccd8311d", entity_id:"Transcendental States"}}, {_id:150, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Damaged relationships that undergo healing and transformation in a beautiful state, leading to nourishing connections.<SEP>Strained or conflicted connections with others, often resulting from prolonged negative emotional states.><SEP>Strained or conflicted connections with others, often resulting from prolonged negative emotional states.>", created_at:1779183060, source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72", entity_id:"Damaged Relationships"}}, {_id:151, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779183921, description:"Suering refers to uncomfortable emotional experiences ranging from mild (irritation, apprehension, disappointment) to severe stages (anger, anxiety, sadness, rage, vengeance, panic, depression) and is deemed damaging when prolonged.<SEP>Suering refers to uncomfortable emotional experiences ranging from mild (irritation, apprehension) to severe (rage, vengefulness, panic, depression). Prolonging it is considered damaging.<SEP>Suering is described as a state of being that perpetuates self-obsession and is contrasted with a \"beautiful state.\"<SEP>Suering refers to distressing emotional states such as anger, anxiety, or frustration, often mistaken for motivation or intelligence in the text.<SEP>Suering is the state of suffering, which includes habitual states like anxiety, stress, anger, disappointment, and jealousy.", source_id:"chunk-2177b8057ec605d01dc4819162240231<SEP>chunk-3a296ec9ad2af5d46dab6c458e4a48dd<SEP>chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612<SEP>chunk-b08d62f86bbc31949dd35e6cc9e75def", entity_id:"Suering"}}, {_id:152, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>YouTube Video: tOi1Ho5Kwhk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tOi1Ho5Kwhk)<SEP>YouTube Video: uNkgwv4dqEs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNkgwv4dqEs)<SEP>YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"Consciousness refers to the state of being aware and aware of and able to think about oneself, oneself in the world, and one's surroundings.\"}<SEP>consciousness is described as unawakened and filled with conflict and pain, representing a state of human existence requiring awakening.<SEP>consciousness is portrayed as the level at which karma operates, with individual states and actions determining life outcomes and karmic manifestations.<SEP>Consciousness is described as a state that can be transformed or awakened to create destiny through intention and clarity.", created_at:1779675496, source_id:"chunk-2177b8057ec605d01dc4819162240231<SEP>chunk-733de9dd05ca934b499c631de611275e<SEP>chunk-4387dd7058fa0d482c87322707ef132a<SEP>chunk-b9f36968ebf7bca3d8efa72e74d0fd0d<SEP>chunk-606a5dddaf8cbb6d5e610e78907fcb44<SEP>chunk-ff56e69789b9f87a6e727c24b67b6e7c<SEP>chunk-ded082abd496ba4dd1acaf011d64e44c<SEP>chunk-cd8e8c16e2620c27c2e75a44c149d1ff<SEP>chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939<SEP>chunk-8a461472fe05e6987628f029e17d9f22<SEP>chunk-cb58e055a049ad330cf62961e6ace3a0<SEP>chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48<SEP>chunk-c221b35beb5903b6212b49e01a938f47", entity_id:"consciousness"}}, {_id:153, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Suering encompasses a spectrum of emotional experiences progressing from mild to severe stages.", created_at:1779135997, source_id:"chunk-2177b8057ec605d01dc4819162240231", entity_id:"emotional experiences"}}, {_id:154, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Prolonging suering is described as damaging and potentially leading to obsessive states.", created_at:1779135997, source_id:"chunk-2177b8057ec605d01dc4819162240231", entity_id:"damage"}}, {_id:155, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: XFFgRTgP8Rs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFFgRTgP8Rs)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vNj7OSHos1I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779723396, description:"<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and prompt templates mixed with the real content about the entity \"Problem\".

First, I need to identify the real spiritual content. The descriptions 1 through 8 are the key parts here. The rest is instructions on how to process them. The task is to synthesize these descriptions into a clean summary without any of the meta-text.

Looking at the descriptions:

1. Problem is an external challenge, minor to major, resolved through suffering or positive approach.
2. Similar to 1, mentions responses depend on suffering or beautiful state.
3. Distinguishes external origin from internal suffering.
4. Problem as underlying issue misattributed to external factors (e.g., B score) not self-image.
5. Problem as underlying issue (e.g., self-image fixation) causing suffering, not surface challenge.
6 &7: Unresolved societal/personal issues leading to fear and hurdles.
8: Central theme in various forms like relationships, finance, health.

The instructions mention handling contradictions between 4 and 5. So, need to present both viewpoints. Also, the summary should be in paragraphs, starting with \"Problem is...\", covering all key points without exceeding 600 tokens.

Now, I need to structure this into 1-4 sentences. Let's start with the main definition: Problem as an external challenge, ranging from minor to major, requiring resolution through suffering or positive approach. Then mention that responses depend on the state (suffering or positive). Next, distinguish from internal suffering by external origin. Then, note the two viewpoints from 4 and 5: underlying issue misattributed to external factors vs. underlying issue perpetuating suffering. Also, include unresolved societal/personal issues leading to fear and hurdles, and that it's a central theme in", source_id:"chunk-b9eed6b91a21f212612d0bb96c4d8857<SEP>chunk-ddc2a8c2bf46af1d243c4bae41044efd<SEP>chunk-98ebbba09ead01df2486b7e4f58bcc9b<SEP>chunk-6202900249469971e378d57b74b99662<SEP>chunk-87e2f7787298d3205ec139c556ef83c0<SEP>chunk-53efe9fd171ffdc347c0abe139250e7d<SEP>chunk-5ccc31c8e1d16623e7633752bbd5a9ab<SEP>chunk-9f51181a0a82fab99daeacb192359f2b<SEP>chunk-2abf9b76c25a40660c2457bb0ad9b00e<SEP>chunk-539d32cffeac32af158844b70b3aafe4<SEP>chunk-d9460f64cea48e6bb2a99898a9572005<SEP>chunk-c47a850c80a21ed6c67cbed2bc4b8ec0<SEP>chunk-bb8c7007984e1dbf803d7545148dee09", entity_id:"Problem"}}] AS row
