tless consciousness, is an ancient concept associated with expanded consciousness and specific brain structures.<SEP>Brahma Garbha refers to the womb of limitless consciousness, associated with brain structures like the pineal, pituitary, and hypothalamus.<SEP>Brahma Garbha refers to the ancient Indian concept of limitless consciousness, discovered by sages and foundational to the mystical aspects of Soul Sync.<SEP>Brahma Garbha refers to the ancient concept of limitless consciousness, associated with brain structures such as the pineal, pituitary, and hypothalamus.", created_at:1779183668, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655<SEP>chunk-2984b976f037a27596b29e94de8e3b21<SEP>chunk-b694dcc1bb7e7bd6fa7878c3592e7c19<SEP>chunk-08a8bfd8ab34e14f6fb9afe4224d7966<SEP>chunk-1d01b8567ae6021fb37c32daeed210ed<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb", entity_id:"Brahma Garbha"}}, {_id:227, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The pineal gland is part of the brain linked to consciousness studies and ancient concepts like Brahma Garbha.<SEP>The pineal is part of the brain's axes associated with Brahma Garbha.", created_at:1779136988, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"Pineal"}}, {_id:228, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The pituitary gland is part of the brain associated with hormonal regulation and consciousness.<SEP>The pituitary is part of the brain's axes associated with Brahma Garbha.", created_at:1779136988, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"Pituitary"}}, {_id:229, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The hypothalamus is part of the brain involved in regulating bodily functions and consciousness.<SEP>The hypothalamus is part of the brain's axes associated with Brahma Garbha.", created_at:1779136988, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"Hypothalamus"}}, {_id:230, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X3LKG0Ycl3A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Heartfelt intentions are intentions that can manifest through activated consciousness as part of the Soul Sync practice.<SEP>Heartfelt Intentions refer to sincere desires or goals sought through meditation.<SEP>Genuine desires and goals that drive personal and collective action.<SEP>Heartfelt intentions are emotional goals that individuals seek to manifest through experiential practices like Soul Sync.", created_at:1779728755, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-e33cc736eed5cf4e4f8010ad3999f876<SEP>chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf<SEP>chunk-6f90bcd92d07d52aa1d337005e488437", entity_id:"Heartfelt Intentions"}}, {_id:231, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"India?s ancient sages pioneered the understanding of Brahma Garbha and its neurological basis.<SEP>Ancient Indian sages pioneered the science of consciousness, forming the foundation for practices like Soul Sync.<SEP>Ancient Sages were pioneers of the science of consciousness, associated with the discovery of Brahma Garbha.<SEP>Ancient sages are revered teachers who articulated profound spiritual wisdom through myths, symbols, and rituals.", created_at:1779187840, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-41c1bda9fe4419dedb032ea23f9b8780<SEP>chunk-b694dcc1bb7e7bd6fa7878c3592e7c19<SEP>chunk-08a8bfd8ab34e14f6fb9afe4224d7966<SEP>chunk-50804a0cd2f