s:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779183668, description:"Important decision-making scenarios where Soul Sync is applied for clarity and alignment.<SEP>A critical choice context where practitioners apply Soul Sync to cultivate clarity and mindful awareness.<SEP>Important Decision is a time when individuals may practice Soul Sync to seek clarity and alignment.", source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-6a673bc29a23c9663aab9afdf1dc3d74<SEP>chunk-6e3b92943a430e127a61bead1ab61d60", entity_id:"Important Decision"}}, {_id:248, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A genuine, emotional desire that practitioners focus on during Soul Sync to manifest in the present.<SEP>A deeply held aspiration visualized in present reality during Soul Sync practice to anchor emotional and intentional alignment.", created_at:1779137064, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-6a673bc29a23c9663aab9afdf1dc3d74", entity_id:"Heartfelt Desire"}}, {_id:249, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Morning is a time period when Soul Sync is practiced to calm and set intentions for the day.", created_at:1779136469, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794", entity_id:"Morning"}}, {_id:250, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Agitated mental states during which Soul Sync is used to transition to calmness.", created_at:1779136469, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794", entity_id:"Agitated State"}}, {_id:251, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A unified, boundless expanse where thought and matter are interconnected, central to the practice of Soul Sync.<SEP>The field of consciousness is a conceptual framework representing the collective awareness or energy that interacts with human emotional states.<SEP>Universal consciousness field recognized through spiritual and scientific frameworks.<SEP>The field of consciousness is another concept mentioned as part of the same broader field.<SEP>Field of Consciousness is a philosophical concept representing collective awareness and interconnectedness of all beings.<SEP>Field of consciousness is a term used to describe the indivisible, unitary consciousness, all the Devas, the Suras, and the spirits that pervade other Lokas to Abraham.", created_at:1779666216, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b<SEP>chunk-e41aa29188359857d686593b398cb57d<SEP>chunk-e2e44adeb9e364c8a1e4597e2d7040b0<SEP>chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1<SEP>chunk-e62e4366c052c78d46a09bec53d2a9c4", entity_id:"Field of Consciousness"}}, {_id:252, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", created_at:1779666379, description:"Organizations are groups that align team members and establish shared objectives. They experience cooperation fostered by spiritual vision and develop cooperative cultures when guided by spiritual vision, transcending superficial dynamics. Heartfelt connection is essential in organizational dynamics for fostering cooperation. Organizations are called upon to create wiser cultures that promote respect and reduce bias, and are urged to foster wiser cultures that reject color-based discrimination.

Organizations are listed among entities requiring health through individual transformation. They can nurture individuals by fostering judgment-free environments and connected conversations. Organizations are acknowledged to work on improving social conditions, though their efforts are deemed insufficient without inner-world changes.

Additionally, organizations can be involved in wars and can pray for peace.<SEP>Organizations are acknowledged to work on improving social conditions, though their efforts are deemed insufficient without inner-world changes.<SEP>Organizations include couples, families, institutions, movements, and destinations as systems requiring purpose-driven alignment.<SEP>Organizations are social structures or groups that operate at various levels, such as couples, families, institutions, movements, or destinations.<SEP>Organizations, particularly competitive ones, are environments where social alienation is frequently practiced as a response to stress.<SEP>Structured groups exhibiting heightened social alienation practices under competitive pressures.", source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750<SEP>chunk-dfd063e448fde077331ddbd4cc16008f<SEP>chunk-2acd70e04c811fbe48a08cf9d14bef96<SEP>chunk-982f35660cd8beb5ada701f1b74f7110<SEP>chunk-6a12fdf86752a3b47cf3eb0ac92a6887<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785<SEP>chunk-54304c335de80180a629fdfe3979a92e<SEP>chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-c0dc5060d878117d8549ed7941c43cb2<SEP>chunk-6f53ead9b7c14c9d4c207b785760c5a8<SEP>chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4<SEP>chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Organizations"}}, {_id:253, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Graduate is an entrepreneur who implemented Soul Sync as a daily practice for their team, leading to manifesting intentions and business opportunities.<SEP>An academy graduate who experienced a transformative consciousness shift and business impact.", created_at:1779136521, source_id:"chunk-af1f3e77a2a78e84609a5fa93d1c5d2a<SEP>chunk-7965b694f54cff06f41a6e6d6edbcac5", entity_id:"Graduate"}}, {_id:254, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)<SEP>YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Entity Name: Organization

Description List:<SEP>Organization refers to structured groups where Oneness Consciousness fosters authentic cooperation and innovation.<SEP>Organization refers to structured groups where Oneness Consciousness fosters authentic cooperation and innovation.", created_at:1779560012, source_id:"chunk-af1f3e77a2a78e84609a5fa93d1c5d2a<SEP>chunk-e897fef731236d55e77f48600e6eadf5<SEP>chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-ba8be2f785637451bf56a7dc7363715b<SEP>chunk-0e5b03097ca1fd70284be6d33317832d<SEP>chunk-1796cb7b9f907d9fc5966ef158afc7a9<SEP>chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57<SEP>chunk-6537d9939653cd5b7d036dced5f9de7b<SEP>chunk-5be4ab3ffc3d58a2d8190326819f706c<SEP>chunk-e3279f0867e1797d155f31a8f57b0737<SEP>chunk-c9caee3e34754dd743fb5e0f90ac1a6b<SEP>chunk-6ae1a5128f5bd3988c5b8902bc010873<SEP>chunk-2e64ecd5baa03b517e5215b8fbc577e4<SEP>chunk-c639141ec491d448e8e3d57ed9e03d3d<SEP>chunk-feadf97235c8f111320838dcf92b6b01", entity_id:"Organization"}}, {_id:255, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shared Intention refers to the team's collective focus on a specific goal for three-week periods, which manifests into real-world outcomes.", created_at:1779136494, source_id:"chunk-af1f3e77a2a78e84609a5fa93d1c5d2a", entity_id:"Shared Intention"}}, {_id:256, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A collaborative workspace provided to the start-up as part of the support package.<SEP>A shared workspace provided by the organization to support the graduate?s start-up.", created_at:1779137118, source_id:"chunk-7965b694f54cff06f41a6e6d6edbcac5<SEP>chunk-52efbbecc3ca1f1cad613a6c2cf607a8", entity_id:"Co-Working Space"}}, {_id:257, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"strategy", truncate:"", description:"A collaborative branding initiative between the start-up and its supporters.<SEP>A collaborative branding initiative proposed by the CEO to the graduate.", created_at:1779137119, source_id:"chunk-7965b694f54cff06f41a6e6d6edbcac5<SEP>chunk-52efbbecc3ca1f1cad613a6c2cf607a8", entity_id:"Co-Branding"}}, {_id:258, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"A start-up receiving support including co-working space, marketing assistance, and co-branding opportunities.", created_at:1779136521, source_id:"chunk-7965b694f54cff06f41a6e6d6edbcac5", entity_id:"Start-Up"}}, {_id:259, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The commercial and professional domain where transformed consciousness impacts outcomes.", created_at:1779136521, source_id:"chunk-7965b694f54cff06f41a6e6d6edbcac5", entity_id:"Business World"}}, {_id:260, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779183431, description:"Individuals practicing Soul Sync who report synchronicities and intentional manifestations through the practice.<SEP>Practitioners of the Soul Sync method who document stories of synchronicities and intention manifestation.<SEP>Individuals who practice the Soul Sync method and experience synchronicities in daily life.", source_id:"chunk-7965b694f54cff06f41a6e6d6edbcac5<SEP>chunk-52efbbecc3ca1f1cad613a6c2cf607a8<SEP>chunk-3c49e28407e5138bcf1195c71da21835", entity_id:"Soul Sync Practitioners"}}] AS row
