ving entity embracing and healing the protagonist's wounded self during her meditation experience.<SEP>The universe is described as a unified, interconnected organism where all existence is interdependent.<SEP>The Universe is described as a living being that embraces and heals Maureen.<SEP>The universe is perceived by the man as no longer being his friend, contributing to his feelings of existential conflict.<SEP>The Universe is described as becoming a supportive friend when one opens themselves to deeper connection and awareness.", source_id:"chunk-ae33a0629a1035831d09370dbcb6fa05<SEP>chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655<SEP>chunk-f850af926a91f1ef0f0f13f7bd908f06<SEP>chunk-00283c6d3847e844c97d2dea1db37c97<SEP>chunk-1a4e20db18753630cc0835f806d71f29<SEP>chunk-165a6947c193c6485a15dca83d2b7887<SEP>chunk-7c9b4082908bfb46d220e1c2f401f693", entity_id:"The Universe"}}, {_id:298, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of calmness and peace, one of the experiences within a beautiful state.<SEP>A positive emotional foundation of the beautiful state, promoting clarity and peace.><SEP>A positive emotional foundation of the beautiful state, promoting clarity and peace.>", created_at:1779183061, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72", entity_id:"Serenity"}}, {_id:299, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9S9Hh4aBN8)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JYqlxlBZHc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https:/