Description List:<SEP>Happiness is described as not achievable through perfecting physical appearance, emphasizing internal contentment.", created_at:1779655664, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc<SEP>chunk-0e910622cdbaf731d9c63e3af759ab25<SEP>chunk-c3c756183e3f4bbcd6f10defea6c686f<SEP>chunk-5d7bc721d374a5cb0cba9dd3f98f763b<SEP>chunk-64534fa37e2772d16d26e6098d4409b0<SEP>chunk-ba6b7dbad29f123e1a2c91144bb54a85<SEP>chunk-5c61cf6a11b484a07796c6dda3777527<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72<SEP>chunk-035b6c44730bb7cdf05bfef04ef27b03<SEP>chunk-66f6c16a0cd4b4ef4b399e98335000b4<SEP>chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-cdbfc6e200f4cd4487961cefed0a0954<SEP>chunk-13115d12efdf6f06cb94255cf212ccfd<SEP>chunk-04a5cce20e9ca029b1d885a9ee7c4ec6<SEP>chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880<SEP>chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96<SEP>chunk-f87f1002a8699b889bcce1050f8f041d<SEP>chunk-97eda5ea96b7f1db5f0d7a104094ffd9", entity_id:"Happiness"}}] AS row
