UNWIND [{_id:302, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The power of a beautiful state allows individuals to influence consciousness and manifest aspirations through heightened awareness.", created_at:1779136831, source_id:"chunk-3a296ec9ad2af5d46dab6c458e4a48dd", entity_id:"Impact on Consciousness"}}, {_id:304, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Suering can escalate from mild discomfort to severe states like rage or vengefulness if unaddressed.", created_at:1779136853, source_id:"chunk-3a296ec9ad2af5d46dab6c458e4a48dd", entity_id:"Rage/Vengefulness"}}, {_id:305, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fKvjHOD_kQ)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \\\"Anterior Cingulate\\\" ...\"}
{\"Description\": \"The anterior cingulate is another brain region that contributes to connection in relationships.\"}<SEP>The anterior cingulate is a part of the brain associated with relationships, which experiences increased blood flow during the practice.<SEP>The anterior cingulate is a brain region associated with emotional regulation and social behavior, activated by heart centered meditations.<SEP>The anterior cingulate cortex is a brain region linked to emotional regulation, empathy, and social behavior.", created_at:1779734442, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb<SEP>chunk-53e525d93caa11247db9588a7b9a8e7a<SEP>chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625<SEP>chunk-4e775b554bb52f0e7b422520123fe5a4<SEP>chunk-a806b7026395d82c6e1fe100191449c6<SEP>chunk-9174f4aac6278b492855cabdc7a615b1<SEP>chunk-6cf55136aa5e4ce74dabd0e6bc9c5c31<SEP>chunk-753484c5afd977c9b325d198ce9f7e53<SEP>chunk-af42e7cfdd624cdf90c9e6e7cda51567", entity_id:"Anterior Cingulate"}}, {_id:306, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Parent role refers to the functional aspect of parenting focused on daily actions and responsibilities.", created_at:1779136902, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709", entity_id:"Parent Role"}}, {_id:307, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779672418, description:"Blood flow in the brain, particularly to the anterior cingulate and frontal lobes, correlates with emotional regulation.<SEP>Blood flow refers to the circulation of blood in the body, particularly to brain regions.<SEP>The video explains how negative states reduce blood flow to the prefrontal cortex and anterior cingulate.\" Here, Blood Flow is part of the relationship description but not an entity. If Blood Flow is a Concept, then it should be an entity. So that's a missed entity.<SEP>The circulation of blood, particularly to brain regions, affected by negative states.<SEP>Physiological process involving increased blood circulation to specific brain regions, linked to cognitive and relational benefits.<SEP>Physiological process involving increased blood circulation to specific brain regions, linked to cognitive and relational benefits.<SEP>Blood flow to specific brain regions increases intelligence and improves relationships.", source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-53e525d93caa11247db9588a7b9a8e7a<SEP>chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625<SEP>chunk-4e775b554bb52f0e7b422520123fe5a4<SEP>chunk-9174f4aac6278b492855cabdc7a615b1", entity_id:"Blood Flow"}}, {_id:308, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"aj is a character or individual associated with Preethaji in the context of the YouTube video.<SEP>aj is a person referenced in the source data with associations to Preethaji.", created_at:1779210021, source_id:"chunk-0e8b873a2e6f233e651ed407fb70ee30<SEP>chunk-3f81c8a3ca3245af06944c9fd04ec3de", entity_id:"aj"}}, {_id:309, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779748639, description:"Passion is an emotional state characterized by deep engagement with actions or states of being, serving as a driving force for meaningful impact and abundance. It is essential for successful relationships, involving intense emotions and desires that can shift with relational status or external circumstances. It is associated with a connected state and vision, often contrasting fear.", source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-1131fb555cf5cb5c110e8720fad1eacd<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482<SEP>chunk-534aa5b1bce760dde6fcebe7d2a8da54<SEP>chunk-a0a737121c6d2b4ce7ac662967a310aa<SEP>chunk-e28a16af170670aaf61d68da07b71294<SEP>chunk-f911f447e8921c9205ec53996cfbe423<SEP>chunk-87ae4401ec344e0f145a40afa02041af<SEP>chunk-9d8a8416ae7a083477cbb7ac15043bbb", entity_id:"Passion"}}, {_id:310, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"natural_object", truncate:"", description:"The frontal lobes are brain regions involved in higher-order thinking and emotional regulation.<SEP>The Frontal Lobes are brain regions responsible for higher-order functions, with blood flow increased by Soul Sync.", created_at:1779183669, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb", entity_id:"Frontal Lobes"}}, {_id:311, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stressful State is a mental and emotional condition marked by tension, anxiety, negative emotions, lack of joy, self-preoccupation, and habitual focus on past or future events. It is characterized by self-centric thinking, reactive patterns, and a sense of being overwhelmed, leading to poor outcomes in daily life. The state is one of two possible existence states, binary with a beautiful state, and is considered the default human state when not actively choosing the beautiful state. It is the opposite of calm, joyful, and beautiful states, and is associated with disconnection and suffering.

The manifestations of a stressful state include tension, anger, fear, frustration, and possibly loneliness. Triggers can be past or present circumstances, emotional turmoil, or any situation that induces anxiety. Associated behaviors involve overcomplication, irrationality, agitation, and emotional separation. Cognitively, the state features internal conflict, confusion, repetitive thinking, and poor decision-making. Consequences of being in a stressful state include health risks, unwise choices, and poor outcomes, as well as a general inability to experience life fully.

A concise description of the stressful state is that it is a mental state characterized by tension and anxiety, leading to inferior responses to challenges. This definition aligns with the broader description, emphasizing the negative impact on decision-making and overall functioning. The stressful state, when not consciously chosen, defaults to the human condition, making it a prevalent and often unconscious state for many individuals.<SEP>Stressful State signifies a mindset marked by anxiety, conflict, and lack of confidence, driving negative outcomes.`<SEP>Stressful State signifies a mindset marked by anxiety, conflict, and lack of confidence, driving negative outcomes.`<SEP>A state of consciousness marked by anxiety, pressure, and negative emotional responses.<SEP>A state marked by tension and negativity that hinders personal and collective growth.", created_at:1779560342, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709<SEP>chunk-78e55709d93c5c1d09f2b5a02398b24d<SEP>chunk-25a61dd1a643342f5252980f3c78e37e<SEP>chunk-ad8061bbea71b4b58c920eb95c67cb44<SEP>chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9<SEP>chunk-688e0592e6058a0f8fa853433206f1bf<SEP>chunk-bdc4a608530faeb54a567f51d21bad5a<SEP>chunk-1fc805671f75f5c49fede8b02e05b8db<SEP>chunk-665f72ba5123be26210ce8f477e2012f<SEP>chunk-23f4ae85323a27ae180ceca7fa33c13a<SEP>chunk-81f7d5b351616383eb1a7cca9b4d2b48<SEP>chunk-8b68736730809289d016abf18cb33a9d<SEP>chunk-8c0fbc02d7372a76ebf44b3a7fb627dc<SEP>chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912<SEP>chunk-81a80670e6aa7bf176b0cacf73a6f715<SEP>chunk-921bac8d531822a1c218a0ec38fab591<SEP>chunk-710d5353b76529c73b545b6e7e4050a9<SEP>chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5<SEP>chunk-2996cf05c59c4a2d1ccea6c5e1750952<SEP>chunk-65663b0201354a6434222ff714a6bcfd<SEP>chunk-289fa3c790540a34a24858f5f191d9ca<SEP>chunk-d18ebd8ed5109a40c69cb7a69ecd8f61<SEP>chunk-a6934bb5f3e6b9a7dbc975f40692be35<SEP>chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf", entity_id:"Stressful State"}}, {_id:312, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stress-free state represents calmness and emotional balance, enabling effective action.", created_at:1779136903, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709", entity_id:"Stress-Free State"}}, {_id:313, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual vision helps dissolve suffering by fostering a beautiful, focused state.", created_at:1779136923, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709", entity_id:"Dissolving Suffering"}}, {_id:314, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The story contrasts Yesmi's calmness with Nomi's stress to highlight the impact of inner states.", created_at:1779136923, source_id:"chunk-9068ddb93a07ecf743249c1b3afe8709", entity_id:"Story of Yesmi and Nomi"}}, {_id:316, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Science of Consciousness refers to ancient Indian sages' discoveries about expansive consciousness, forming the foundation of Soul Sync.", created_at:1779136944, source_id:"chunk-41c1bda9fe4419dedb032ea23f9b8780", entity_id:"Science of Consciousness"}}, {_id:317, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Yemi is a beautiful, stress-free state characterized by calm actions that foster peace, connection, and effective solutions without causing stress.<SEP>Yemi represents a state of being characterized by peace and clarity, contrasting with the stressful state of Nomi.", created_at:1779183669, source_id:"chunk-41c1bda9fe4419dedb032ea23f9b8780<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb", entity_id:"Yemi"}}, {_id:318, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Brahma Garbha is associated with the pineal gland in the brain.", created_at:1779136989, source_id:"chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"pineal"}}, {_id:319, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Practicing Soul Sync leads to synchronicities as the universe rearranges itself.", created_at:1779136989, source_id:"chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"synchronicities"}}, {_id:320, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Brahma Garbha is associated with the pituitary gland in the brain.", created_at:1779136989, source_id:"chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"pituitary"}}, {_id:321, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Brahma Garbha is associated with the hypothalamus in the brain.", created_at:1779136990, source_id:"chunk-3b92b4052d6a99939db85bec203a2655", entity_id:"hypothalamus"}}, {_id:322, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Soul Sync enhances the motor and coordination centers of the brain, increasing efficiency and facilitating memory processes.", created_at:1779137016, source_id:"chunk-0844c69b3c79ff988a0ed78f618b906a", entity_id:"Motor and Coordination Centers"}}, {_id:323, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Andrew Newberg and Mark Robert Waldman's research supports the enhancement of motor and coordination centers through repetitive hand movements.<SEP>Andrew Newberg is a neuroscientist who researched the effects of meditation practices on brain activity.", created_at:1779183669, source_id:"chunk-0844c69b3c79ff988a0ed78f618b906a<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb", entity_id:"Andrew Newberg"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:324, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of perception where all entities, experiences, and aspirations exist as an interconnected, undifferentiated energy field without separation.", created_at:1779137064, source_id:"chunk-6a673bc29a23c9663aab9afdf1dc3d74", entity_id:"Unified Field of Consciousness"}}, {_id:325, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a merged description for the entity \"Soul Sync Practice\". The input includes multiple description objects. We need to synthesize them into a comprehensive, cohesive summary, multiple paragraphs, plain text, objective, third-person, mention the full name at the beginning, no extra formatting, within 600 tokens, in English, retain proper nouns.

We must handle conflicts: there are no conflicts, but we need to incorporate all key information.

Key points from the descriptions:

1. Soul Sync Practice is a meditation practice involving setting intentions and leveraging synchronicities to overcome challenges, often applied at the end of life journeys.
2. It is a deep meditation method designed to fulfill heartfelt intentions and is mentioned in the context of the Breathing Room app.
3. The practice incorporates breath work, sound vibration, and visualization to achieve a state of calm and expansion.
4. It is an 11-minute meditation technique designed to transition the brain from beta to alpha states, enhancing calmness and focus.
5. It is described as a simple meditation technique that serves as a method to transition between brain states.
6. It is referenced in the text as a method to transition between brain states, and its use is noted for its ability to promote calm and focus.
7. The practice is presented as a simple meditation technique that can be used to achieve a state of calm and expansion.

We need to combine without redundancy.

