\"Loved ones are individuals toward whom the text emphasizes the importance of feeling and understanding before judging their emotional states.\" Also, \"Loved ones represent family members or dependents of medical workers, often physically separated from them.\" Also, \"Loved ones are mentioned as beneficiaries of the wealth creation process, alongside society and the world.\" Also, \"Loved ones refer to people close to an individual, who may be lost or distanced due to anger-driven behavior.\" Also, \"Loved ones symbolize societal or relational expectations influencing self-worth and behavior.\" Also, \"Loved ones are", created_at:1779669102, source_id:"chunk-7396fcd90672d9f711109393f3be35b2<SEP>chunk-1131fb555cf5cb5c110e8720fad1eacd<SEP>chunk-8e03152ba26c428e5446f721ab8114a4<SEP>chunk-56e3a53798dcd66226e03f0b100c4961<SEP>chunk-e8c3861302e4fee45689e6fb65d84e48<SEP>chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d<SEP>chunk-a0a737121c6d2b4ce7ac662967a310aa<SEP>chunk-a9818a0388e6c7fbe12a262f4b70178a<SEP>chunk-e28a16af170670aaf61d68da07b71294<SEP>chunk-472321605b70f46b6792fb017a049d8d<SEP>chunk-313c3c4bd3fa26c1b3b5e358022a1e6b<SEP>chunk-607beefb79fd1c2b867abf7979a1dbfc", entity_id:"Loved Ones"}}, {_id:334, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A psychological state where the protagonist feels trapped and overwhelmed by their own mind, metaphorically represented by an intrusive crowd.<SEP>Self-imposed claustrophobia refers to a psychological state where individuals feel trapped by their own critical thoughts and past experiences.`", created_at:1779179024, source_id:"chunk-7396fcd90672d9f711109393f3be35b2<SEP>chunk-b75e52bdeada1ddd1aebcff0a658afb0", entity_id:"Self-Imposed Claustrophobia"}}, {_id:335, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphorical crowd representing people who have wronged the protagonist, including parents, siblings, and friends, causing emotional overwhelm.", created_at:1779137197, source_id:"chunk-7396fcd90672d9f711109393f3be35b2", entity_id:"Crowd"}}, {_id:336, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphor for emotional rigidity and resistance to change rooted in past experiences.", created_at:1779137256, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Inner Ice"}}, {_id:337, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphor representing life's continuous forward motion and opportunities for growth and change.", created_at:1779137256, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Life as a River"}}, {_id:338, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Wounded Child is a psychological state rooted in unresolved past trauma, characterized by emotional rigidity and feelings of being unloved or unappreciated, which can hinder personal progress and lead to self-centric misery or half-hearted engagement with life. It contrasts with the Happy Child's state of being, and represents a condition where past disappointment and unmet emotional needs persist into adulthood, influencing behavior and relationships. The Wounded Child can also be viewed as a frozen condition in past pain, shame, and self-judgment, which ties individuals to stagnation.

Additionally, the concept is described as a metaphorical state of carrying past burdens, requiring healing to achieve freedom and joy. This state reflects a deep-seated emotional pain that stems from childhood experiences and continues to affect the individual's present life.

In specific contexts, the Wounded Child is applied to individual identities: for example, it describes Jaya's core identity, where unresolved childhood pain persists despite her outward persona, and it is discussed in Krishnaji's work as inner trauma and past experiences hindering personal growth. These references illustrate how the Wounded Child can be both a general psychological construct and a personal or philosophical framework.", created_at:1779183769, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60<SEP>chunk-41b3a29187ba0c1a38ac4f058b4fd20f<SEP>chunk-4c210ebd42ece17aa2cbb5a935a96e78<SEP>chunk-c0e08ca8392db0f9984988041685087e<SEP>chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7<SEP>chunk-8b9c1604faa1ea45879aac48740ef02f<SEP>chunk-42e3465bd48ea87621d94e9d33063209<SEP>chunk-697da9f4d9cac1cfedd243857a8b8ccc<SEP>chunk-b75e52bdeada1ddd1aebcff0a658afb0<SEP>chunk-6e5caa7e31ebe95d72aef04edb890b5c<SEP>chunk-da0dcd44b642ae88bb5ae6bfa953a323<SEP>chunk-5d0f74c4239eabf7a6fea87da28be5d8", entity_id:"Wounded Child"}}, {_id:339, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Symbolizes negative self-talk and societal judgments that obscure inner clarity.", created_at:1779137256, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Raucous Crowd"}}, {_id:340, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Represents unproductive attachment to the past and lack of forward momentum.", created_at:1779137256, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Stagnant Banks"}}, {_id:341, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphor for persistent negative thoughts or influences occupying mental/emotional space.", created_at:1779137256, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Unwanted Guests"}}, {_id:342, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Refers to conflicting internal narratives about self-worth and morality.", created_at:1779137256, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Voices in the Mind"}}, {_id:343, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Represents progress toward goals and embracing present possibilities.", created_at:1779137257, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Forward Motion"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:344, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"State of full engagement with the present moment and conscious choice-making.<SEP>Emphasizes mindful awareness of others' emotions as a nurturing force in relationships and family dynamics.<SEP>Presence is emphasized as a core component of connection, involving active listening and non-judgmental awareness.<SEP>Presence involves mindful engagement with others, essential for authentic connection.<SEP>Presence is the state of being fully attentive and engaged with a loved one.", created_at:1779665557, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60<SEP>chunk-ff2be9cdc909be640e9aaf71298fc4c9<SEP>chunk-02f292000f544446b15f0519998d1dbc<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f<SEP>chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43", entity_id:"Presence"}}, {_id:345, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The river's flow presents chances for emotional connection and expansion.", created_at:1779137257, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Opportunities for Love"}}, {_id:346, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The river's flow presents chances for emotional connection and expansion.", created_at:1779137257, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Opportunities for Connection"}}, {_id:347, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The river's flow presents chances for emotional connection and expansion.", created_at:1779137257, source_id:"chunk-e88f2f26245ad8ca0468808d9150fa60", entity_id:"Opportunities for Expansion"}}, {_id:348, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https:/