.`<SEP>The Happy Child represents a state of joy and freedom from fear, characterized by resilience and readiness for new experiences.", created_at:1779183716, source_id:"chunk-41b3a29187ba0c1a38ac4f058b4fd20f<SEP>chunk-8b9c1604faa1ea45879aac48740ef02f<SEP>chunk-b75e52bdeada1ddd1aebcff0a658afb0<SEP>chunk-6e5caa7e31ebe95d72aef04edb890b5c", entity_id:"Happy Child"}}, {_id:351, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"The YouTube video has garnered over 114 million views, indicating its widespread popularity and resonance with audiences.", created_at:1779137307, source_id:"chunk-41b3a29187ba0c1a38ac4f058b4fd20f", entity_id:"114 Million Views"}}, {_id:352, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7NVPsHdyw_Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)<SEP>YouTube Video: leypd9opVSc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=leypd9opVSc)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQEGJ0OaIPo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"{\\\"Description\\\": \\\"We need to produce a merged description for the entity \\\\\\\"Mother\\\\\\\". The description list includes multiple descriptions. The input format is a JSON object with a \\\\\\\"Description List\\\\\\\" key, and then each description is a JSON object on a new line? Actually, the input is:\"}
{\"Description\": \"The mother is a character in the narrative, depicted as experiencing depression and poverty after her son's death.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Mother is explicitly mentioned as part of the bonding experience between parents and the future child.\"}
{\"Description\": \"The mother is a parent who may become judgmental due to aggressive ambition, affecting her relationship with her child.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Mother imparts ideals that shape one's understanding of life's right and wrongs through teachings.\"}
{\"Description\": \"Mother imparts ideals that shape one's understanding of life's right and wrongs through teachings.\"}
{\"Description\": \"The mother of a five-year-old child uses an Earth Day message to teach her son about environmental consciousness and habit change.\"}
{\"Description\": \"The mother of a five-year-old child uses an Earth Day message to teach her son about environmental consciousness and habit change.\"}<SEP>Mother represents the biological or adoptive maternal figure who nurtures and sustains life through love, lullabies, and guidance.<SEP>Represents the nurturing and creative role of a mother, both biological and adoptive, in sustaining life and shaping a child's development.", created_at:1779687981, source_id:"chunk-41b3a29187ba0c1a38ac4f058b4fd20f<SEP>chunk-e7fcee974f06e1422c855e53a17a24ae<SEP>chunk-9924c7e219f96915a4ef19eba2cb5f62<SEP>chunk-533c11dca17ed148bc0fe09075977a5a<SEP>chunk-c85036006eb9517f84fbb3ee7717030e<SEP>chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35<SEP>chunk-369f0db74a66636fddaa77ce9a54b9b6<SEP>chunk-84d2a4edbdbc9a3e5f2a16c04a23d9aa<SEP>chunk-0e5b03097ca1fd70284be6d33317832d<SEP>chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e<SEP>chunk-85380b1903edbe83293a14871258c806<SEP>chunk-ded082abd496ba4dd1acaf011d64e44c<SEP>chunk-2628a53249868fff005017c0b9ca7f19<SEP>chunk-654ba1397813fb7e7e5aa81442780460<SEP>chunk-41a69529bb31744f3a07ba326cfab626<SEP>chunk-12c41632c244e5787f737f83514e30b2<SEP>chunk-519cd4a91883594546bbe5c947089bed<SEP>chunk-255bf350d451faa2df8677aa580dc07b<SEP>chunk-4da1e45ca993decf20ec10e31d56d36e<SEP>chunk-7988ea96a08eaf2fe8d7d16c8063ffbe<SEP>chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1<SEP>chunk-439f02067105223fb4f1c1b8d3263e52<SEP>chunk-b99209818242fa366169c6ab46e01f5f", entity_id:"Mother"}}, {_id:353, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)<SEP>YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779667193, description:"The Wounded Child represents a state of suffering and self-centric misery, contrasting with the Happy Child's joyful existence.<SEP>Suffering refers to the emotional pain experienced by the daughter, which was alleviated by the spiritual transformation.<SEP>suffering is described as a karmic legacy transmitted through parental consciousness and genes, affecting children's lives.", source_id:"chunk-41b3a29187ba0c1a38ac4f058b4fd20f<SEP>chunk-c51a2c0f14fc17ea0d067007e59e63a3<SEP>chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"suffering"}}, {_id:354, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The happy child state is a concept discussed in the video, representing a<SEP>The happy child state represents a joyful, carefree emotional condition where one feels connected to the world and experiences universal love.<SEP>The happy child state is a psychological concept characterized by feelings of belonging, love, and kinship transcending cultural, linguistic, and racial boundaries.<SEP>Happy Child State signifies emotional healing and joy achieved via the Soul Sync Exercise, contrasting with the wounded child state.<SEP>The happy child state represents a carefree, joyful mindset free from fear, judgment, or self-centric misery, characterized by unconditional emotions and simplicity.`<SEP>The happy child state embodies joy, trust, and freedom from past burdens, associated with innate innocence and unconditional self-acceptance.", created_at:1779183826, source_id:"chunk-e7fcee974f06e1422c855e53a17a24ae<SEP>chunk-c9bf814a48dc1240281eb32fd8bfe8b4<SEP>chunk-345cde2de9df7f9434b23cd5a304db8f<SEP>chunk-da4a30723d6bfb88a08e73a51a9a3d62<SEP>chunk-6b077b95a5e468c5e42f57a37944c07d<SEP>chunk-0c3de714c4e42df4c68c8fd79dfac5ad", entity_id:"Happy Child State"}}, {_id:355, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.c