ts of Disappointment"}}, {_id:413, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)<SEP>YouTube Video: ZD1nQPtpojM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZD1nQPtpojM)<SEP>YouTube Video: r_l2RNcSPPA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Trust is a relational bond that involves the ability to rely on others emotionally and the willingness to be vulnerable. It is presented as foundational to experiencing love and essential for emotional connection, with its absence directly tied to emotional disconnection, pain, and conflict. Trust can be undermined by fear, past pain, and repeated heartbreak; when the wounded child is in control, the bond may close off, hindering emotional openness. The ability to rely on others emotionally becomes harder to maintain after repeated heartbreak, and trust is eroded by vulnerability and repeated disappointment. Trust is a critical component of relationships that, when compromised, can lead to isolation and disconnection. The breakdown of trust, especially when individuals share feelings, results in emotional consequences, further reinforcing the difficulty of maintaining trust in emotionally intimate contexts.<SEP>A relational dynamic characterized by reliance on another's integrity, which when violated, can lead to significant emotional distress.<SEP>Trust is a foundational element in partnerships and cooperation, often lacking in modern business environments due to short-term vision and fear-driven decision-making.<SEP>Trust relates to interpersonal challenges in maintaining eye contact and open communication.", created_at:1779414169, source_id:"chunk-c0e08ca8392db0f9984988041685087e<SEP>chunk-aff6c19ce49adbdf7e2d1f8c08ebd1a9<SEP>chunk-322c357b48b096d2f7b5c99e2d2d2519<SEP>chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94<SEP>chunk-bb8776e3af3003e2566aad28f28875b7<SEP>chunk-baa29517ede049854e2aecf133575342<SEP>chunk-f34fb6f27b6128e7888cfaefe712d84a<SEP>chunk-1049ffa49a880db4b5369cf84bcae432<SEP>chunk-4a6a915d04810354808f8de013c1de1f<SEP>chunk-10375887a7aa4a1c7205e37d5e7b18dc<SEP>chunk-455b122fda4addf20dfaf68404d297db<SEP>chunk-a8e26840aa3a5bf7f8632efb251d8ee5", entity_id:"Trust"}}, {_id:414, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Jaya's two younger siblings whom she played the role of savior to during her traumatic childhood.", created_at:1779137604, source_id:"chunk-749e889c128e710cc18adc38c4d377cb", entity_id:"Jaya's Siblings"}}, {_id:415, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Wounded Child?s Two Faces is a concept discussing the dual aspects of the wounded child state and its impact on adult behavior.", created_at:1779137604, source_id:"chunk-749e889c128e710cc18adc38c4d377cb", entity_id:"Wounded Childs Two Faces"}}, {_id:416, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Traumatic Childhood describes Jaya's experiences growing up with an abusive mother and enduring violence and hunger.<SEP>Jaya's traumatic childhood involved abuse, violence, and neglect, shaping her later emotional state.", created_at:1779183757, source_id:"chunk-749e889c128e710cc18adc38c4d377cb<SEP>chunk-da0dcd44b642ae88bb5ae6bfa953a323", entity_id:"Traumatic Childhood"}}, {_id:417, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Jaya is a person who experienced a traumatic childhood marked by abuse and poverty. She endured the abuse, ran away from home at the age of twelve, and later recontextualized her trauma as a source of empowerment, using storytelling and team motivation to shape her narrative. Despite these efforts, she maintains a successful career, leveraging her experiences to drive her professional achievements.

Jaya is driven by a deep-seated anger and an intense need to prove herself, which leads her to mask her childhood pain and construct an outward image of independence. This defensive posture leaves her struggling with unresolved emotional wounds, making it difficult for her to trust or form intimate relationships.

Jaya undergoes a personal metamorphosis, during which she metaphorically describes her childhood as radioactive waste emitting harmful radiation in her mind. She grapples with emotional connection, discipline, and workplace relationships, which culminate in employee turnover and personal isolation. Her rage, bitterness, and difficulty in trust further exacerbate these challenges.

Overall, Jaya's life reflects a complex interplay between past trauma and present coping mechanisms. While she has achieved professional success and attempts to transform her pain into empowerment, she continues to confront inner struggles with emotional connection, self-awareness, and the lingering effects of her early experiences.<SEP>Jaya is a self-made individual who struggles with emotional connections, viewing love as a weakness and maintaining unresolved resentment toward her mother. She disciplines her children but lacks emotional intimacy, and her workplace conflicts lead to high employee turnover.<SEP>Jaya is a person who endured an abusive childhood, built a successful career, and later realized her inner turmoil stemmed from unresolved trauma.` - This is a good summary.", created_at:1779183757, source_id:"chunk-749e889c128e710cc18adc38c4d377cb<SEP>chunk-0e0d8ce525e6e00265646821c7a82b74<SEP>chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7<SEP>chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-dd609ab9c79e0fc5514db3c901de7f50<SEP>chunk-ba4ba0d6f181ef0bbd4fc17f6bc9ea4d<SEP>chunk-25634a7e16db511e9e5b4a8597da99fd<SEP>chunk-697da9f4d9cac1cfedd243857a8b8ccc<SEP>chunk-0e5b03097ca1fd70284be6d33317832d<SEP>chunk-da0dcd44b642ae88bb5ae6bfa953a323", entity_id:"Jaya"}}, {_id:418, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Jaya's mother is an abusive, alcoholic individual who contributed to Jaya's traumatic childhood.", created_at:1779137604, source_id:"chunk-749e889c128e710cc18adc38c4d377cb", entity_id:"Jaya's Mother"}}, {_id:419, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mask of Independence represents Jaya's self-constructed identity as a self-made woman who outgrew the need for love, later recognized as a facade.", created_at:1779137626, source_id:"chunk-0e0d8ce525e6e00265646821c7a82b74", entity_id:"Mask of Independence"}}, {_id:420, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Empowerment Through Suffering is Jaya's belief system where she reinterpreted her pain as strength and purpose.", created_at:1779137626, source_id:"chunk-0e0d8ce525e6e00265646821c7a82b74", entity_id:"Empowerment Through Suffering"}}, {_id:421, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Childhood Trauma refers to the abuse and inhumanity Jaya endured as a child, which she initially glorified as purposeful.", created_at:1779137626, source_id:"chunk-0e0d8ce525e6e00265646821c7a82b74", entity_id:"Childhood Trauma"}}, {_id:422, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Two younger siblings are individuals Jaya acted as a savior to, though their names and specific roles are not detailed in the text.", created_at:1779137626, source_id:"chunk-0e0d8ce525e6e00265646821c7a82b74", entity_id:"Two Younger Siblings"}}, {_id:423, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Academy Retreat is the location where Jaya experienced a transformative meditative journey decades later.", created_at:1779137626, source_id:"chunk-0e0d8ce525e6e00265646821c7a82b74", entity_id:"Academy Retreat"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:424, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The past symbolizes Jaya?s unresolved experiences and repeated attempts to reinterpret them, keeping her emotional history alive.", created_at:1779137647, source_id:"chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7", entity_id:"The Past"}}, {_id:425, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Jaya?s self-constructed image of being invincible and self-made, masking her vulnerability and need for love.", created_at:1779137647, source_id:"chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7", entity_id:"Image of Independence"}}, {_id:426, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Jaya?s mother represents a contrasting influence, with Jaya?s actions motivated by the need to disprove her mother?s views.", created_at:1779137647, source_id:"chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7", entity_id:"Jayas Mother"}}, {_id:427, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"L sevk Center appears as a possible typo or formatting artifact in the input.", created_at:1779210957, source_id:"chunk-6239363e43b90d034be5850e9ec19b9d", entity_id:"L sevk Center"}}, {_id:428, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Jaya persists with the feeling that nobody cares for her despite helping others through charitable efforts, highlighting a contradiction between her actions and emotional state.", created_at:1779137647, source_id:"chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7", entity_id:"Feeling That Nobody Cared for Her"}}, {_id:429, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Jaya?s rage against life persists despite her charitable efforts, driving her actions and emotional struggles.", created_at:1779137648, source_id:"chunk-abf598569eb5f03bc21c09bf7af4abf7", entity_id:"Rage Against Life"}}, {_id:430, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Childhood is the period of early life marked by formative experiences that influence adult perspectives and behaviors. It includes numerous instances and experiences that individuals reflect upon, often associated with the recollection of past events.  

This stage is also characterized as a past event where change in others was not possible, underscoring its fixed nature. Furthermore, childhood is described as a time marked by unmet needs for kindness and warmth, which contrasts with the present transformative consciousness that emerges later.  

The concept of childhood also emphasizes its role as a period of reflection, where individuals look back on the numerous experiences that have shaped them, and it is often contrasted with the transformative consciousness that characterizes later life.<SEP>Childhood refers to the period of life from birth up to adulthood, often associated with formative experiences and development.<SEP>Childhood refers to the period of life from birth up to adulthood, often associated with formative experiences and development.", created_at:1779669295, source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc<SEP>chunk-5d0f74c4239eabf7a6fea87da28be5d8<SEP>chunk-c1d8dd3f6ee4794537974077b8f6d5c9<SEP>chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292<SEP>chunk-967a1ebc79cd7d83afc2b43d42c8ab36<SEP>chunk-a1a3adb6e659bbb8209f01781e8bec78<SEP>chunk-5775fa967c3333ec10bee1ba6077c7ce<SEP>chunk-c088c9de5db4ddb6d01a048401214aef<SEP>chunk-472321605b70f46b6792fb017a049d8d<SEP>chunk-313c3c4bd3fa26c1b3b5e358022a1e6b<SEP>chunk-607beefb79fd1c2b867abf7979a1dbfc<SEP>chunk-e9d2d065e530e86a6fbd6e76094e9842<SEP>chunk-4f083f509b73a704942cae198b15e4c6", entity_id:"Childhood"}}, {_id:431, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"emotion", truncate:"", created_at:1779179499, description:"Persistent anger toward life and relationships drives Jaya's behavior and emotional isolation.<SEP>Rage is a suering state of consciousness used as a motivating tool.<SEP>Rage is an emotion experienced by Maureen due to her traumatic past and feelings of disrespect.<SEP>Rage is an intense emotional response linked to Jaya's past trauma and her interactions with others.<SEP>Rage is the emotion Maureen felt after her traumatic experience.", source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-ae6d476e13e2477cf2c7c9d3b6783d89<SEP>chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94<SEP>chunk-697da9f4d9cac1cfedd243857a8b8ccc<SEP>chunk-1a4e20db18753630cc0835f806d71f29", entity_id:"Rage"}}, {_id:432, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Jaya's meditation session marks the beginning of her self-discovery and metamorphosis.<SEP>A moment of introspection during which Jaya realizes her inability to connect emotionally with others.", created_at:1779183757, source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-0e5b03097ca1fd70284be6d33317832d", entity_id:"Deep Meditation"}}, {_id:433, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Jaya's employees frequently leave her organization due to her inability to respect them and anger over minor mistakes.", created_at:1779137676, source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86", entity_id:"Jaya's Employees"}}, {_id:434, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Jaya's workplace organization experiences high employee turnover due to her management style.", created_at:1779137676, source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86", entity_id:"Jaya's Organization"}}, {_id:435, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Jaya's children are her children whom she disciplines and supports educationally/career-wise but struggles to connect with emotionally.", created_at:1779137676, source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86", entity_id:"Jaya's Children"}}, {_id:436, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779564568, description:"Bitterness toward her mother influences Jaya's interactions with others.<SEP>Resentment toward her mother and circumstances fuels Jaya's behaviors and relationships.<SEP>Resentment refers to a strong dislike or anger stemming from emotional pain or perceived injustice.", source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-697da9f4d9cac1cfedd243857a8b8ccc<SEP>chunk-dadf662841fb50b7a5b2c3f5fc8512f2", entity_id:"Resentment"}}, {_id:437, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779214338, description:"Jaya undergoes metamorphosis through deep meditation, leading to self-discovery.<SEP>Metamorphosis refers to a profound transformation process, often symbolized by the journey from a caterpillar to a butterfly.<SEP>Metamorphosis refers to a transformative process described as part of the universe's influence on individuals.", source_id:"chunk-c0eee090a2741e82903b80d77573da86<SEP>chunk-252f684aa6870ba2bb42b8de04c97683<SEP>chunk-0ae97484cbc8d612b5fe9689eed0747f", entity_id:"Metamorphosis"}}, {_id:438, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779179020, description:"Andrew is a character with a troubled childhood, marked by hatred toward his father and internal conflict about his relationships.<SEP>Andrew is a man struggling with anger and emotional distress in his relationships, particularly with his wife, and seeks to heal from his wounded child state to improve his career and family life.<SEP>Andrew is a person who sought approval through various behaviors driven by a desire for love and acceptance, eventually undergoing emotional healing and forgiveness.<SEP>Andrew is a person who experienced healing of his inner child, leading to business growth and reduced anxiety. He lost inhibition to reach out to people and no longer fears being hurt.<SEP>Andrew is a character who grapples with childhood trauma, anger, and disconnection, later undergoing transformation through self-awareness and forgiveness.`", source_id:"chunk-dd609ab9c79e0fc5514db3c901de7f50<SEP>chunk-faa97c15f888df1c3373e6c7826983c8<SEP>chunk-7b7a166e2f9193b1ff8c08a022ddcedc<SEP>chunk-a9d020dcb738c9a9aed8990751ac8667<SEP>chunk-ba4ba0d6f181ef0bbd4fc17f6bc9ea4d<SEP>chunk-25634a7e16db511e9e5b4a8597da99fd", entity_id:"Andrew"}}, {_id:439, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Andrew's father, who caused him pain and hatred, and is central to Andrew's internal conflict.<SEP>Andrew's father is referenced as a potential figure for reconciliation, though not directly involved in the narrative.", created_at:1779137735, source_id:"chunk-dd609ab9c79e0fc5514db3c901de7f50<SEP>chunk-faa97c15f888df1c3373e6c7826983c8", entity_id:"Andrew's Father"}}, {_id:440, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Andrew's anger toward his father bleeds into his relationship with his wife, as seen in his behavior like ordering lunch.", created_at:1779137718, source_id:"chunk-dd609ab9c79e0fc5514db3c901de7f50", entity_id:"His Wife"}}, {_id:441, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Healing his heart represents Andrew's resolve to free himself from internalized pain and resentment to achieve emotional liberation.", created_at:1779137735, source_id:"chunk-faa97c15f888df1c3373e6c7826983c8", entity_id:"Healing His Heart"}}, {_id:442, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Andrew's wife is depicted as a source of frustration for Andrew, with their interactions often leading to conflict due to his inability to accept her choices.", created_at:1779137735, source_id:"chunk-faa97c15f888df1c3373e6c7826983c8", entity_id:"Andrew's Wife"}}, {_id:443, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Andrew engaged in silent meditation to achieve mental clarity and clarity of memories.\"<SEP>Andrew engaged in silent meditation to achieve mental clarity and clarity of memories.", created_at:1779137763, source_id:"chunk-7b7a166e2f9193b1ff8c08a022ddcedc", entity_id:"silent meditation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:444, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Sacred Presence is a spiritual entity described as permeating all of Andrew's life, encompassing love without reason and including all people in his life, even his father.", created_at:1779137783, source_id:"chunk-a9d020dcb738c9a9aed8990751ac8667", entity_id:"Sacred Presence"}}, {_id:445, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Andrew's spare-auto-parts business experienced steady growth following his emotional healing and forgiveness.", created_at:1779137783, source_id:"chunk-a9d020dcb738c9a9aed8990751ac8667", entity_id:"Spare-Auto-Parts Business"}}, {_id:446, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: tegTDWT3SDc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tegTDWT3SDc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Inner Child represents Andrew's wounded emotional state, characterized by a hunger for love and acceptance, which fueled his behaviors and eventual healing.<SEP>Inner Child refers to the exploration of one's early developmental stage during the healing journey, addressing unresolved emotional patterns.", created_at:1779524452, source_id:"chunk-a9d020dcb738c9a9aed8990751ac8667<SEP>chunk-680dd7bb1c61258ea018e46f2177de41", entity_id:"Inner Child"}}, {_id:447, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Andrew's healing led to the growth of his spare-auto-parts business and reduced anxiety.", created_at:1779137809, source_id:"chunk-ba4ba0d6f181ef0bbd4fc17f6bc9ea4d", entity_id:"spare-auto-parts business"}}, {_id:448, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphorical approach to achieving mental clarity by addressing unresolved emotional states like the wounded child.", created_at:1779137830, source_id:"chunk-f34d4c3475c783164c62af4dbf5b6c3c", entity_id:"Calming the Muddy Waters of the Mind"}}, {_id:449, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W2ZzApmqJmo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779757648, description:"<think>
