 lawyer.<SEP>South Africa is a country that experienced racial segregation and apartheid policies partly stemming from plague-era quarantine measures.", created_at:1779519209, source_id:"chunk-42e3465bd48ea87621d94e9d33063209<SEP>chunk-51b5d128cc55be8ec4b28c0575f1cf41<SEP>chunk-ceb359127e8a043974d8be0d50ff7d93<SEP>chunk-dec047b5cab8e88110c88f8cc2cfcd7d<SEP>chunk-0c3de714c4e42df4c68c8fd79dfac5ad<SEP>chunk-dbf66e2de209f9688955866d38e39e63<SEP>chunk-3bbc23f7da347ce4b93776c537570fa8", entity_id:"South Africa"}}, {_id:475, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Nonviolence is a philosophy and method central to Mahatma Gandhi's transformation and the weak's triumph over oppression.<SEP>Nonviolence is a principle central to Mahatma Gandhi's philosophy, emphasizing peaceful resistance as a path to social change and inner truth.", created_at:1779183826, source_id:"chunk-42e3465bd48ea87621d94e9d33063209<SEP>chunk-0c3de714c4e42df4c68c8fd79dfac5ad", entity_id:"Nonviolence"}}, {_id:476, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Mahatma Gandhi (meaning \"the Great Soul\") symbolizes the embodiment of nonviolent resistance and oppressed peoples' victory.<SEP>Mahatma Gandhi was a leader who guided India to independence from British rule through non-violent resistance.<SEP>Mahatma Gandhi is referenced as having a historic brush with inner truth.<SEP>Mahatma Gandhi is the title given to Gandhi, meaning \"the Great Soul,\" and he is a key influencer in human history.<SEP>Mahatma Gandhi, originally Gandhi, is a historical figure transformed into a symbol of nonviolent resistance and spiritual greatness after his awakening to inner truth.<SEP>Mahatma Gandhi is a key influencer in human history, associated with nonviolence and the victory of the weak over oppressors.<SEP>Mahatma Gandhi led India to independence through nonviolent resistance rooted in compassion rather than personal hatred.", created_at:1779183860, source_id:"chunk-42e3465bd48ea87621d94e9d33063209<SEP>chunk-37e9823f1b7627730cb977ca684bcc4a<SEP>chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-dec047b5cab8e88110c88f8cc2cfcd7d<SEP>chunk-0c3de714c4e42df4c68c8fd79dfac5ad<SEP>chunk-dbf66e2de209f9688955866d38e39e63<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612", entity_id:"Mahatma Gandhi"}}, {_id:477, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual growth requires inner truth to transcend superficial ideals and achieve genuine transformation.<SEP>Spiritual growth involves the pursuit of higher consciousness and self-realization, requiring alignment with inner truth for meaningful transformation.", created_at:1779183827, source_id:"chunk-42e3465bd48ea87621d94e9d33063209<SEP>chunk-0c3de714c4e42df4c68c8fd79dfac5ad<SEP>chunk-203b5a3ea5b85d8a381ff6db8958a7d3<SEP>chunk-ec5154bb4ad96ae0dc3ba90ae132dc81", entity_id:"Spiritual Growth"}}, {_id:478, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"This concept highlights the triumph of marginalized groups through nonviolent resistance, exemplified by Mahatma Gandhi.", created_at:1779138000, source_id:"chunk-42e3465bd48ea87621d94e9d33063209", entity_id:"Weak's Victory Over Oppressors"}}, {_id:479, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oalnb5-fHjY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)<SEP>YouTube Video: fiABnex9O6Y (URL