path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hard-core evidence refers to hypothetical information that could challenge perceptions of Lee's character.", created_at:1779138255, source_id:"chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5", entity_id:"Hard-Core Evidence"}}, {_id:511, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779671870, description:"Angry reflects Christina's later emotional progression after leaving the room.<SEP>Anger is an emotional response linked to disintegration.<SEP>Anger is an emotional response linked to disintegration.<SEP>One of the negative emotions listed as a consequence of the 70 percent.", source_id:"chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5<SEP>chunk-b4ecf7e4c6ac98b4463f375b4140f36f<SEP>chunk-7d201146e40d123c544e6caf9225da91", entity_id:"Angry"}}, {_id:512, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The act of attempting to comprehend another person's viewpoint, distinguished from inner truth as it focuses on external perspectives rather than self-awareness.", created_at:1779138279, source_id:"chunk-0e9d5c35a3513fef882cbbe59c504a44", entity_id:"Understanding Another Persons Perspective"}}, {_id:513, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779183920, description:"Self-help practices often involve analyzing external reasons for disturbances, differing from the sacred secret?s focus on inner self-awareness.<SEP>A category of methods focused on external explanations, distinguished from the \"sacred secret of inner truth.\"<SEP>Self-help practices are contrasted with inner truth, emphasizing external strategies rather than observing the mind's totality.", source_id:"chunk-0e9d5c35a3513fef882cbbe59c504a44<SEP>chunk-b66967ff647e15e2ccfdb242ffc22fb6<SEP>chunk-21bacf187c7f2b778c240499081154ba", entity_id:"Self-Help Practices"}}, {_id:514, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779183922, description:"The sacred secret of inner truth emphasizes observing disturbances without justification or condemnation, contrasting with self-help practices focused on external problem-solving.<SEP>The Sacred Secret of Inner Truth is a method to prevent separation and loss in relationships.<SEP>A practice aimed at preventing suffering and reducing harmful emotional habits through inner truth.<SEP>A philosophical concept emphasizing self-derived truth over external understanding, contrasted with self-help practices.<SEP>Sacred Secret of Inner Truth is a specific practice that helps prevent the escalation of negative emotions and mitigates suffering.", source_id:"chunk-0e9d5c35a3513fef882cbbe59c504a44<SEP>chunk-3cea1660026a8c404547b5881940bd50<SEP>chunk-031bd1294ef04a689b10ae93123dbc7a<SEP>chunk-b66967ff647e15e2ccfdb242ffc22fb6<SEP>chunk-b08d62f86bbc31949dd35e6cc9e75def", entity_id:"Sacred Secret of Inner Truth"}}, {_id:516, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Analogy frames pandemic response as natural force adaptation.", created_at:1779210989, source_id:"chunk-6239363e43b90d034be5850e9ec19b9d", entity_id:"Coronavirus Response"}}, {_id:517, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2DLb6hDIhmg)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The Government of India implemented early restrictions to combat the coronavirus pandemic.", created_at:1779211081, source_id:"chunk-9428dc8eb300302fda718c2a6b0b9f94", entity_id:"Government of India"}}, {_id:518, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A transformati