d in water droplets symbolize the wonder of simple natural phenomena experienced in childhood.", created_at:1779138763, source_id:"chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc", entity_id:"Rainbows in Water Droplets"}}, {_id:596, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of being characterized by unconditional happiness and lack of internal division.", created_at:1779138763, source_id:"chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc", entity_id:"Joyful, Complete, Whole"}}, {_id:597, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Competition arises from societal structures that frame peers as rivals rather than collaborators.<SEP>Competition undermines true friendship through rivalry.", created_at:1779675623, source_id:"chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc<SEP>chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Competition"}}, {_id:598, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779669299, description:"Judgment refers to the act of analyzing or evaluating others from a position of separation.", source_id:"chunk-3b972b1465c1099f09b7fe384e4ebabc<SEP>chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-3b8dde7779e0c2342011917f0bce24aa<SEP>chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5<SEP>chunk-e8c3861302e4fe