b4a3116f1a065a295316<SEP>chunk-41455e0c00724b359d7c3da19a31a17a<SEP>chunk-1904f983c50eda6d8dfd79dd7f0b88ea<SEP>chunk-7f34b765e8eccb327fac73e52a1c873a<SEP>chunk-87e9f6f06dda3bab56cb02db087a043c<SEP>chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880<SEP>chunk-10a63ebc48cb5367889fe83878ad4257<SEP>chunk-efef91f79f63a3dccc0da4a26bee1fef<SEP>chunk-f8d4df49e2bb59337f3b12dcef1d6f2c<SEP>chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f", entity_id:"Children"}}, {_id:685, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779563408, description:"Selfishness is differentiated from self-obsession, with the text clarifying their distinct meanings in the context of personal behavior.<SEP>Selfishness is distinguished from self-obsession as acting without regard for others, whereas self-obsession involves internal preoccupation.<SEP>A trait diminished during transformation, replaced by empathy and presence.", source_id:"chunk-bfc9ac02b4b45204e93a15d51a959bb6<SEP>chunk-5c02e046d7832f0655166e3f716f3e10<SEP>chunk-6cdea9db2f882e51edbd9de21797726f", entity_id:"Selfishness"}}, {_id:686, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-obsession is described as the root of unhappiness, often mistaken for selfishness, and linked to internal and external conflicts.", created_at:1779139176, source_id:"chunk-bfc9ac02b4b45204e93a15d51a959bb6", entity_id:"Self-obsession"}}, {_id:687, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The \"silver spoon\" metaphor symbolizes privilege and external advantages contrasted with internal self-perception.", created_at:1779139219, source_id:"chunk-c756fff1f643175625bc8f48eb702151", entity_id:"Silver Spoon"}}, {_id:688, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nen-DB_tz4M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nen-DB_tz4M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779449783, description:"Self-preoccupation describes a state of being overly focused on one's own thoughts and feelings, creating cycles of internal conflict.<SEP>A habitual state of being overly focused on one's own emotions and needs, leading to strained relationships.` The description is a bit long. The instructions say \"concise yet comprehensive\". This might be okay, but I'll keep it in mind.<SEP>A habitual state of being overly focused on one's own emotions and needs, leading to strained relationships.` This is a valid entity.<SEP>Self-preoccupation is a concept that is emphasized as a negative trait in relationships.<SEP>Being caught up in one's own thinking and thought-created miseries leads to alienation.<SEP>Excessive focus on one's own thoughts and emotions, leading to disconnection from others.", source_id:"chunk-c756fff1f643175625bc8f48eb702151<SEP>chunk-107b2dccdd97eea5e4e04ec3f64a95a9<SEP>chunk-4fa62785a13cb6543b898c589a3bd605<SEP>chunk-5a1740daf11f031bb2f4e4877b90a316<SEP>chunk-710110c627104c0a94bd8c9545f51f89", entity_id:"Self-Preoccupation"}}, {_id:689, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: PFNP4c1cOSI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PFNP4c1cOSI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unhappiness is an emotional state that arises from self?preoccupation and unresolved inner conflict. It can also be triggered by societal norms and a lack of authenticity, and by self?criticism or other internal tensions. In some perspectives, unhappiness is linked to stagnant or superficial relationships, serving as a breeding ground for inner turmoil and dissatisfaction. The state is described as a condition of distress or sorrow that may be shared with others, and it can manifest as a breeding ground for inner conflict and dissatisfaction.

The experience of unhappiness is often characterized by inner turmoil, dissatisfaction, and a sense of distress or sorrow. It may result from unresolved inner conflict, self?preoccupation, or external factors such as societal expectations and lack of authenticity. In some accounts, it is portrayed as a consequence of societal norms and lack of authenticity, not resolved by external solutions.

Addressing unhappiness can involve supportive responses from others, such as Krishnaji?s empathetic engagement with the narrator?s sadness. It also includes conscious efforts to alleviate inner disturbances, connection via empathy, and the cultivation of deeper, more meaningful relationships. Some descriptions emphasize that unhappiness can be shared, allowing for mutual support and understanding.

While some viewpoints suggest that unhappiness stems from self?preoccupation and inner conflict, others highlight the role of societal norms, lack of authenticity, and stagnant relationships. The entity is thus a multifaceted emotional state that may require both internal reflection and external support to be mitigated. It is noted that unhappiness can be a shared experience, and that addressing it may involve empathy, conscious effort, and supportive interactions.", created_at:1779347541, source_id:"chunk-c756fff1f643175625bc8f48eb702151<SEP>chunk-53499f381af4c99f9a37a7d03455b285<SEP>chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-c85036006eb9517f84fbb3ee7717030e<SEP>chunk-5c02e046d7832f0655166e3f716f3e10<SEP>chunk-66f6c16a0cd4b4ef4b399e98335000b4<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482<SEP>chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f<SEP>chunk-ac599df176221b3c1e3e9b33cb62fa37", entity_id:"Unhappiness"}}, {_id:690, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"External situations refer to external circumstances such as height or success comparisons, which are contrasted with internal self-perception in the context of self-obsession.<SEP>External situations are circumstances that trigger or reinforce mental states like anxiety.", created_at:1779173421, source_id:"chunk-c756fff1f643175625bc8f48eb702151<SEP>chunk-58262216b12d3a82c0194e2a972ecdde<SEP>chunk-dc33576be7c40b3be079f258d63f03be", entity_id:"External Situations"}}, {_id:691, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conict (likely a typo for \"conflict\") refers to the ongoing struggle within oneself due to self-obsession.<SEP>Conict is a concept representing conflict, often arising from spiritual ambition and self-image.", created_at:1779143821, source_id:"chunk-c756fff1f643175625bc8f48eb702151<SEP>chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Conict"}}, {_id:692, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2DLb6hDIhmg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Refusal to change and adapt is highlighted as a critical factor leading to the extinction of civilizations and emphasized as a cautionary lesson for humanity.", created_at:1779211124, source_id:"chunk-eabf34c739b02ca3de693a11f2216499", entity_id:"Refusal to Change and Adapt"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:693, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Problems and chaos refer to the accumulation of difficulties and disorder in one's life, often resulting from self-obsession and negative thought patterns.", created_at:1779139248, source_id:"chunk-1acfe53455f3d50d7655cd19bae06dae", entity_id:"Problems and Chaos"}}, {_id:694, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mananam Trayati Iti Mantra is a specific mantra phrase described as silencing the mind, though its grammatical structure and interpretation are debated.", created_at:1779212300, source_id:"chunk-0a2c974bf936eb57ae5447e3de45ce75", entity_id:"Mananam Trayati Iti Mantra"}}, {_id:695, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779564634, description:"We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \"Injustice\". The input is a JSON list of descriptions. The first description is more detailed, covering both personal and systemic aspects. The rest are identical, focusing on systemic cycles of power imbalances and need for accountability.

