uli, impacting their perception of affection.<SEP>A state where emotional barriers prevent love from being experienced by another person.", source_id:"chunk-468fc234a44cb0396e4202675d40e771<SEP>chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b<SEP>chunk-d1580b380e66d60231e8bb1500c438e9<SEP>chunk-7876881b163cb9e8fd183208ace12836<SEP>chunk-69c518552350983af20c342ffe0b1ce1", entity_id:"Disconnected State"}}, {_id:711, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779667270, description:"A spontaneous state of connection emerges through embracing self-disconnectedness without resistance.<SEP>Beautiful State of Connection is a shared state of connection that is possible for all as they make peace with themselves, their past, and their present.<SEP>A state of evolution and connection achieved by observing and accepting inner shadows rather than escaping them.<SEP>A state of being characterized by dissolving separation and emerging connection, where relating and living become joyful experiences.<SEP>The CEO's empathetic connection with employees, fostering collaboration.<SEP>A state of profound self-awareness and inner harmony used to address moral dilemmas.<SEP>A harmonious mental state achieved through empathy and understanding of others' inner experiences.", source_id:"chunk-468fc234a44cb0396e4202675d40e771<SEP>chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec<SEP>chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a<SEP>chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0<SEP>chunk-5424541c24943ffc408f99bb3aa45c96<SEP>chunk-bf98c80e4c8e0ceabdc9951dcc42a4ec<SEP>chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b", entity_id:"Beautiful State of Connection"}}, {_id:712, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A new order emerges from witnessing chaos, symbolizing personal transformation.", created_at:1779139300, source_id:"chunk-468fc234a44cb0396e4202675d40e771", entity_id:"New Order"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
