nsformative experience where Maureen and others explored states of consciousness and healing.<SEP>A spiritual retreat organized by the group where teachings on enlightenment and consciousness are shared, leading to profound personal experiences.<SEP>A spiritual retreat where the seeker with skin cancer experienced transformative consciousness shifts.<SEP>A spiritual retreat where the seeker with skin cancer experienced transformative consciousness shifts.", created_at:1779665838, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94<SEP>chunk-697da9f4d9cac1cfedd243857a8b8ccc<SEP>chunk-7146bcb62c68c22b68c6b0cc9e8d3a09<SEP>chunk-0f5cc695879f69fa0bc7fb0810db881c<SEP>chunk-cd8bf67cc8d8498084f884afbf901342", entity_id:"Retreat"}}, {_id:718, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The corporate world represents Maureen's professional environment, where she held a major portfolio and exhibited efficiency and ruthlessness.<SEP>Corporate World is the environment where Maureen worked and projected a tough exterior.", created_at:1779179499, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94<SEP>chunk-1a4e20db18753630cc0835f806d71f29", entity_id:"Corporate World"}}, {_id:719, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The stranger is an individual who raped Maureen as a child, leaving her with lasting trauma and self-disrespect.", created_at:1779139327, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94", entity_id:"Stranger"}}, {_id:720, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The wounded self refers to Maureen's internalized pain and negative self-perception stemming from childhood trauma and societal judgment.<SEP>Wounded Self refers to the inner state of pain and trauma that Maureen experienced.", created_at:1779179499, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94<SEP>chunk-1a4e20db18753630cc0835f806d71f29", entity_id:"Wounded Self"}}, {_id:721, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Limitless Field meditation is a meditative technique that facilitates deep self-observation and detachment from emotional wounds.<SEP>Limitless Field meditation is a spiritual practice aimed at transcending ego and connecting with universal consciousness.", created_at:1779150612, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94<SEP>chunk-449f6963d54a8ba71d9c6f5f49484dc0<SEP>chunk-7146bcb62c68c22b68c6b0cc9e8d3a09", entity_id:"Limitless Field meditation"}}, {_id:722, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Hanuman's ego-victory symbolizes the meditative focus on selflessness during mantra chanting.", created_at:1779212331, source_id:"chunk-04b32295251921d572678567c60204df", entity_id:"Egolessness"}}, {_id:723, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A meditative state achieved during the retreat, enabling Maureen to observe her life without emotional reactivity.", created_at:1779139328, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94", entity_id:"Meditative State"}}, {_id:724, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ekam mantra chanting demonstrated cognitive improvement in a child through parental practice.", created_at:1779212331, source_id:"chunk-04b32295251921d572678567c60204df", entity_id:"Intelligence Enhancement"}}, {_id:725, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"The practice of repeating a mantra to achieve mental calmness and silence the amygdala.", created_at:1779212552, source_id:"chunk-9656a8edd47ef08164c3565d2801af16", entity_id:"Repetition of Mantra"}}, {_id:726, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An unusual experience during meditation where Maureen felt embraced by the universe, transcending her wounded self.", created_at:1779139328, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94", entity_id:"Uncommon Experience"}}, {_id:727, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Maureen's Organization is the workplace where she mentors young entry-level employees after her transformative experience.", created_at:1779139354, source_id:"chunk-f850af926a91f1ef0f0f13f7bd908f06", entity_id:"Maureen's Organization"}}, {_id:728, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The promotion represents a career opportunity offered to the protagonist, which she declined to prioritize personal growth over professional advancement.", created_at:1779139354, source_id:"chunk-f850af926a91f1ef0f0f13f7bd908f06", entity_id:"Promotion"}}, {_id:729, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3weAVHuSCxg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779737968, description:"The broken heart symbolizes the protagonist's past pain and trauma, which is metaphorically repaired through her transcendental experience.<SEP>A broken heart describes the intense emotional pain and longing resulting from a relationship's dissolution.<SEP>Broken Heart symbolizes emotional distress following a relationship's end, associated with prolonged suffering.", source_id:"chunk-f850af926a91f1ef0f0f13f7bd908f06<SEP>chunk-801a54bafa1f63f0a4d091331cafc3d9<SEP>chunk-0bcd34bbf2440bb034ae1a5607edb427", entity_id:"Broken Heart"}}, {_id:730, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtub