iption:"Defeat is a concept related to acceptance without justification.", created_at:1779139406, source_id:"chunk-bdbd2fe36ae96adf18be4a84f4f759a5", entity_id:"Defeat"}}, {_id:745, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI)<SEP>YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779406354, description:"Words are a concept that do not affect self-perception.<SEP>Words are explicitly stated as not the primary means of human-universe communication.<SEP>Words are communication tools, often superficial in modern interactions, leading to emptiness.<SEP>Words are linguistic expressions used in communication, which may lack emotional depth.<SEP>Words are a form of communication, but not the only way.", source_id:"chunk-bdbd2fe36ae96adf18be4a84f4f759a5<SEP>chunk-be5b7210ecbddf5ded747efb6c288c98<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719", entity_id:"Words"}}, {_id:746, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779235107, description:"Failure is a concept discussed in the context of assimilation without blame.<SEP>Failure is mentioned as a negative outcome in relationships.<SEP>A challenge mentioned in the context of parenting struggles.`", source_id:"chunk-bdbd2fe36ae96adf18be4a84f4f759a5<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-938d8c7cf2e140a4e60de3b5d9b45278", entity_id:"Failure"}}, {_id:747, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mental chatter refers to overactive or unnecessary thoughts that mantra practice aims to silence.", created_at:1779212552, source_id:"chunk-9656a8edd47ef08164c3565d2801af16", entity_id:"Mental Chatter"}}, {_id:748, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dharana is a meditation technique that involves focusing one's attention on a specific form or essence to cultivate mental discipline. It is also understood as a spiritual concept that denotes contemplation or meditation, and within yoga and philosophical systems it is commonly associated with concentration and focus.

In many spiritual traditions, Dharana is described as a practice that may be combined with mantra, and it is recognized as a spiritual practice mentioned in various texts. The technique emphasizes focused attention or contemplation, often involving the visualization or contemplation of a deity or abstract concept. By concentrating on a particular object or idea, practitioners aim to deepen their meditative experience and enhance mental clarity. Dharana thus serves both as a method of meditation and as a broader philosophical notion of focused mental activity, integral to spiritual and yogic disciplines.", created_at:1779259850, source_id:"chunk-17890cf557b38c3e4b57609d8dd9d028<SEP>chunk-5bdd4af6edc5e8065c7f95fb8fc0543f<SEP>chunk-f4e31e3d7acd5226175acba9778623e9<SEP>chunk-fe04edafc045a28a3551d9aaa81cc514<SEP>chunk-e9d6a455cfecdcbfbf4b9187a0f8773c<SEP>chunk-242c86adb935c1461785f26c0c3f9e28<SEP>chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79<SEP>chunk-86fb5c9368dde9170c4844b23678c8ad<SEP>chunk-ff46b53ab89c597d3fb954e4982613d0", entity_id:"Dharana"}}, {_id:749, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Silencing the amygdala leads to reduced painful mental chatter.", created_at:1779212595, source_id:"chunk-5bdd4af6edc5e8065c7f95fb8fc0543f", entity_id:"mental chatter"}}, {_id:750, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"egolessness refers to a state of being without ego, discussed in the context of spiritual practice and corrected as a valid spelling variant.<SEP>egolessness is a term discussed in the context of spiritual practices, considered a common variant but left unchanged in the original text.", created_at:1779212650, source_id:"chunk-afe36d24117a71892315d804e0792496<SEP>chunk-f4e31e3d7acd5226175acba9778623e9", entity_id:"egolessness"}}, {_id:751, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Failure is assimilated without the need to blame oneself or another.", created_at:1779139407, source_id:"chunk-bdbd2fe36ae96adf18be4a84f4f759a5<SEP>chunk-747dd6f3fc344d596e672f021c5892ee", entity_id:"Blame"}}, {_id:752, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Community is a multifaceted concept that encompasses both spiritual and social dimensions. It is often described as a group of people sharing a spiritual vision, providing collective support akin to a mother?child bond, and embodying the interconnectedness of individuals working toward collective well?being. In this view, community is seen as part of the universe, accepted without judgment, and as the ultimate form of change emerging from the breakdown of old systems such as government, medicine, and corporations, playing a central role in resolving problems and fostering peace.

However, community also carries negative connotations. It can refer to collective norms and traditions that impose expectations conflicting with personal fulfillment, and it may serve as a conduit for the transmission of violence. Additionally, community is recognized as a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices, shaping personal identity and actions.

Thus, community is simultaneously a source of mutual nurturing and spiritual solidarity, and a structure that can impose constraints and transmit harmful patterns. Its role in societal transformation and personal development remains contested, reflecting both its potential for collective empowerment and its capacity for oppression.<SEP>The community is a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices.<SEP>The community is a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices.<SEP>The community is a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices.<SEP>The community is a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices.<SEP>The community is a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices.<SEP>The community is a social group that interacts with and influences individual behaviors and practices.", created_at:1779551791, source_id:"chunk-6a2ca3b4a00fd65d72ac5932a227e2a8<SEP>chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983<SEP>chunk-39ae671b46577f26845d7bb862a61c36<SEP>chunk-02f292000f544446b15f0519998d1dbc<SEP>chunk-faa6974a8318ba2e0ef63f3f66ff8ef6<SEP>chunk-2937f9db737764b56ab13c05271ce216<SEP>chunk-654ba1397813fb7e7e5aa81442780460<SEP>chunk-13115d12efdf6f06cb94255cf212ccfd<SEP>chunk-e1d5e0073f33e1ee1857e1f6302d5b7f<SEP>chunk-9eea478f3eb12a678ce672d3075c4af8", entity_id:"Community"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
