e4401ec344e0f145a40afa02041af<SEP>chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2<SEP>chunk-93d9522c9ab38104a94e5ffe196677ac<SEP>chunk-bb8c7007984e1dbf803d7545148dee09<SEP>chunk-c4d7f4af9b573478ba698a2b03258543<SEP>chunk-64efe8180cefe24f9560acd6c262cd84", entity_id:"Peace"}}, {_id:756, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Hanuman is identified as a proper name requiring no modifications in the text.", created_at:1779212621, source_id:"chunk-afe36d24117a71892315d804e0792496", entity_id:"proper noun"}}, {_id:757, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779184195, description:"Lokaa's authentic self-expression through poetry contrasts with societal pressures to conform, highlighting a rebellion against expectations.<SEP>Norms and pressures imposed by society, often conflicting with individual desires.", source_id:"chunk-f184ea56bcea598aa525718d96f6e142<SEP>chunk-141a97b20b5f2eb10f6f1ca4b573307d<SEP>chunk-66f6c16a0cd4b4ef4b399e98335000b4", entity_id:"Societal Expectations"}}, {_id:758, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Authenticity refers to aligning with one's true self, emphasized as key to addressing the root cause of unhappiness and achieving fulfillment.<SEP>Authenticity is highlighted as crucial for genuine connections.<SEP>Alignment with one's true self, free from societal pressures or external validation.<SEP>Authenticity is a concept that is emphasized as a positive trait in relationships.<SEP>Authenticity is a concept that is emphasized as important in relationships.", created_at:1779186869, source_id:"chunk-53499f381af4c99f9a37a7d03455b285<SEP>chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35<SEP>chunk-66f6c16a0cd4b4ef4b399e98335000b4<SEP>chunk-4fa62785a13cb6543b898c589a3bd605", entity_id:"Authenticity"}}, {_id:759, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Societal norms include competition and self-criticism that lead to inner conflict and unhappiness by pressuring individuals to conform.", created_at:1779139498, source_id:"chunk-53499f381af4c99f9a37a7d03455b285", entity_id:"Societal Norms"}}, {_id:760, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Authenticity and genuine choices are emphasized as essential for a fulfilling life, contrasting with external solutions.", created_at:1779139516, source_id:"chunk-53499f381af4c99f9a37a7d03455b285", entity_id:"Fulfilling Life"}}, {_id:761, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oalnb5-fHjY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The practice of self-criticism observed with kindness rather than anger, framed as a natural human tendency.<SEP>Self-criticism involves internalized judgment that diminishes self-worth and perpetuates emotional suffering.`<SEP>Self-criticism is the act of judging oneself harshly, often manifesting as anger or jealousy toward aspects of one's identity.<SEP>The act of judging oneself harshly, resulting in dissatisfaction and self-doubt.<SEP>Self-criticism involves constant commentary on oneself, driving comparison and inner war.<SEP>Self-criticism refers to the habit of judging oneself harshly, leading to emotional distress.", created_at:1779220992, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699<SEP>chunk-b75e52bdeada1ddd1aebcff0a658afb0<SEP>chunk-6d0566c8fa6f2aed45fb2e69b00761b1<SEP>chunk-66f6c16a0cd4b4ef4b399e98335000b4<SEP>chunk-f02b83f12f802c289fd8c9176c6dc8a9<SEP>chunk-a5d16b7b208928b7a3800de53c2fa4eb", entity_id:"Self-Criticism"}}, {_id:762, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of mind leading to calm and inner wholeness through acceptance of reality.", created_at:1779139613, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699", entity_id:"Serene Observation of What Is"}}, {_id:763, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"egolessness is acknowledged as a valid spelling choice in the context of spiritual terminology.", created_at:1779212621, source_id:"chunk-afe36d24117a71892315d804e0792496", entity_id:"spelling variant"}}, {_id:764, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Internal conflict described as ending when replaced by self-acceptance and a new perspective.", created_at:1779139613, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699", entity_id:"War with Yourself"}}, {_id:765, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqUq_a0DyLs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779655644, description:"Individuals' perception of themselves, which the text links to dissatisfaction and negative life outcomes.<SEP>Self-perception relates to how individuals view themselves, influenced by external validation and internal judgment.", source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699<SEP>chunk-982f35660cd8beb5ada701f1b74f7110<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-a85ada8ef40f654a099ee00af9f2432f<SEP>chunk-4ef399a9836bd5861ce4607a41690699", entity_id:"Self-Perception"}}, {_id:766, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Consequence of internal conflict, manifesting as indecisiveness and lack of confidence.", created_at:1779139614, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699", entity_id:"Poor Decision-Making"}}, {_id:767, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Central theme addressing dissatisfaction rooted in self-perception and internal conflict.", created_at:1779139614, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699", entity_id:"Self-Discontentment"}}, {_id:768, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A result of self-discontentment affecting personal and professional life choices.", created_at:1779139614, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699<SEP>chunk-2bd00175db71e25481fb9ce67f057b84", entity_id:"Indecisiveness"}}, {_id:769, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Darshan is a domain-specific term referring to the divine vision or experience of a deity.", created_at:1779212650, source_id:"chunk-f4e31e3d7acd5226175acba9778623e9", entity_id:"Darshan"}}, {_id:770, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dissatisfaction with self-perception negatively impacts relationships, self-image, and happiness.", created_at:1779139614, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699", entity_id:"Dissatisfaction with Self-Perception"}}, {_id:771, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Observing self-criticism with kindness initiates personal growth and self-acceptance.<SEP>Kindness emerges naturally from peaceful consciousness as a direct expression of human responsibility.><SEP>Kindness is a beautiful aspect embodied by loved ones, recognized as deeply impactful and irreplaceable in fostering love.<SEP>Kindness is a beautiful aspect embodied by loved ones, recognized as deeply impactful and irreplaceable in fostering love.<SEP>Kindness is a concept involving compassionate behavior and communication.", created_at:1779668922, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699<SEP>chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983<SEP>chunk-5bd21ff5a870ab22c344b6bc7a8c56b4<SEP>chunk-472321605b70f46b6792fb017a049d8d", entity_id:"Kindness"}}, {_id:772, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Accepting reality through serene observation fosters calmness and emotional balance.", created_at:1779139614, source_id:"chunk-e22f7c2305a6d6df213efae54a651699", entity_id:"Calm and Inner Wholeness"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:773, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Manana that protects is the corrected term meaning a protective spiritual concept.", created_at:1779212650, source_id:"chunk-f4e31e3d7acd5226175acba9778623e9", entity_id:"Manana That Protects"}}, {_id:774, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Manenath trananath is a term mistakenly transcribed from \"manana that protects.\"<SEP>Manenath trananath is a term incorrectly used in the text to describe a protective concept resulting from combining mantra and dharana.<SEP>Manenath trananath is a term described in the text as \"that which protects,\" though it is noted to be a non-standard or incorrect term.<SEP>Manenath trananath is a term interpreted as \"that which protects,\" derived from the combination of dharana and mantra.", created_at:1779212913, source_id:"chunk-f4e31e3d7acd5226175acba9778623e9<SEP>chunk-fe04edafc045a28a3551d9aaa81cc514<SEP>chunk-e9d6a455cfecdcbfbf4b9187a0f8773c<SEP>chunk-242c86adb935c1461785f26c0c3f9e28", entity_id:"Manenath Trananath"}}, {_id:775, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779212884, description:"The term \"manenath trananath\" is identified as incorrect and is the subject of correction.<SEP>Incorrect term intended to mean \"that which protects\", derived from the combination of dharana and mantra.<SEP>manenath trananath is a term inferred to mean \"that which protects,\" resulting from the combination of dharana and mantra.", source_id:"chunk-22ae4a6d383bcd6eb1c726163e13f796<SEP>chunk-9b83c76bc3fe3180b40c2a152ab4f314<SEP>chunk-e326636f3919b50a883c59b61202f73d", entity_id:"manenath trananath"}}, {_id:776, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"King Ravana is a character from the Ramayana, illustrating how internal conflict can lead to destructive behavior.<SEP>King Ravana, a character from the Ramayana, exemplifies how internal conflicts can lead to destructive behavior despite outward virtues.`", created_at:1779184192, source_id:"chunk-afc14563513f7a4dcf36c1ff3fddd517<SEP>chunk-3bc441c03c9cd5688b0f20314b1b1b3b", entity_id:"King Ravana"}}, {_id:777, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Destructive behavior arises from unresolved internal conflicts, despite outward appearances of virtue.", created_at:1779139639, source_id:"chunk-afc14563513f7a4dcf36c1ff3fddd517", entity_id:"Destructive Behavior"}}, {_id:778, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Internal conflicts refer to psychological struggles that affect behavior and decision-making.", created_at:1779139639, source_id:"chunk-afc14563513f7a4dcf36c1ff3fddd517", entity_id:"Internal Conflicts"}}, {_id:780, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The Third Sacred Secret is a concept from Preethaji's teachings, focusing on Universal Intelligence as the driving force behind biological complexity.", created_at:1779139665, source_id:"chunk-30c84c53b6b4f178532cf06dec726c9f", entity_id:"Third Sacred Secret: Awaken to Universal Intelligence"}}, {_id:781, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Qu5IQo0ghbs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qu5IQo0ghbs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779518079, description:"Inner Peace is a state of mental calmness and harmony that can be achieved through meditation practices. It is also described as a state achieved through a program, characterized as a ?deep inner calm.? This condition naturally generates human responsibility, kindness, and ethical action without reliance on external moral frameworks. It is regarded as the desired outcome of meditation and is a longed-for experience of tranquility. Additionally, Inner Peace represents a profound sense of harmony and contentment that develops during the journey toward achieving this state.<SEP>Inner peace is a state achieved through the program, described as a \"deep inner calm.\"<SEP>Inner peace is a state achieved through the program, described as a \"deep inner calm.\"", source_id:"chunk-30c84c53b6b4f178532cf06dec726c9f<SEP>chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983<SEP>chunk-b66dbb231f9e1be7773d5bb448709c92<SEP>chunk-837bb3388ec47b611e5d50b7a992682e<SEP>chunk-0adee7c41f1cb41998ac9e8e2dce0473<SEP>chunk-1a14104939cf6c7cde138464e4bad5e7<SEP>chunk-a10d491711164b21994f76ff0fb53caa<SEP>chunk-79727c38a2ca8d63adfca02ee83cd218<SEP>chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795", entity_id:"Inner Peace"}}, {_id:782, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"The Sixth Step of Meditation involves imagining oneself as a peaceful, beautiful self to achieve inner peace and self-acceptance.", created_at:1779139665, source_id:"chunk-30c84c53b6b4f178532cf06dec726c9f", entity_id:"Sixth Step of Meditation"}}, {_id:783, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The 60 Elements of Nature constitute the human body, with six key elements making up 99% of its composition.", created_at:1779139665, source_id:"chunk-30c84c53b6b4f178532cf06dec726c9f", entity_id:"60 Elements of Nature"}}, {_id:784, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: uZg9XnRub7w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZg9XnRub7w)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqUq_a0DyLs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779655664, description:"Entity Name: Human Body

Description List:<SEP>The human body is the physical vessel that contains the experience of ecstatic bliss and oneness with all life, as described in the context of Kundalini energy.<SEP>The human body is described as part of a deranged system overwhelmed by excessive stimuli and lack of balance.<SEP>The human body is described as part of a deranged system overwhelmed by excessive stimuli and lack of balance.<SEP>The human body is a biological entity that possesses fighting abilities and releases defense proteins.<SEP>The human body is a biological entity that possesses fighting abilities and releases defense proteins.<SEP>The human body is described as inherently dynamic and subject to aging, contrasting with the pursuit of static perfection.", source_id:"chunk-30c84c53b6b4f178532cf06dec726c9f<SEP>chunk-7e2d719adb7748553f200eb42b7b4c3e<SEP>chunk-ff2be9cdc909be640e9aaf71298fc4c9<SEP>chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9<SEP>chunk-924b77c112ecc0d58074213d49a1a3d2<SEP>chunk-3372e5d9566c081ee06a41f5a3cb4448<SEP>chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1<SEP>chunk-85ff6540f61eaa4adc3ec9e5f4057b70<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719<SEP>chunk-4bd79f66852d1c2f19b39d0fa5b7850d<SEP>chunk-10a63ebc48cb5367889fe83878ad4257<SEP>chunk-3da16f4292642f8022ca187ac2cb1ede<SEP>chunk-97eda5ea96b7f1db5f0d7a104094ffd9", entity_id:"Human Body"}}, {_id:785, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ypG1mlekNY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: MJYpyUlwxg0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MJYpyUlwxg0)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Universal Intelligence\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The output must be a plain text summary, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting, within 600 tokens, objective, third-person, mention the full name at the beginning.

We need to integrate all key information from every description. The descriptions are:

1. A long description about Universal Intelligence as foundational basis, unified source, principle of oneness, underlying reality, singular all-encompassing essence, higher consciousness accessible through spiritual practices, guiding ethical and emotional decisions, spiritual compass, source of profound insight, metaphysical notion.

2. \"Universal Intelligence is a term for a higher, all-encompassing intelligence or consciousness.\"

3. \"The field of intelligence that is everywhere and everything, experienced as the unmanifest divine.\"

