ures and history.>", created_at:1779139779, source_id:"chunk-f5de2c27f19510cae539acf2532e7901", entity_id:"Universal consciousness"}}, {_id:802, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The Vatican is the location of Michelangelo's artwork illustrating the transcendental-mundane dynamic.>", created_at:1779139779, source_id:"chunk-f5de2c27f19510cae539acf2532e7901", entity_id:"Vatican"}}, {_id:803, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The transcendental represents the higher, spiritual realm aspiring to connect with everyday consciousness.>", created_at:1779139779, source_id:"chunk-f5de2c27f19510cae539acf2532e7901", entity_id:"Transcendental"}}, {_id:804, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Alternate reality refers to mystical perceptions of reality accessible through transcendent experiences.>", created_at:1779139779, source_id:"chunk-f5de2c27f19510cae539acf2532e7901", entity_id:"Alternate reality"}}, {_id:805, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The meaning of the term \"manenath trananath\" is provided as \"that which protects\".", created_at:1779212701, source_id:"chunk-22ae4a6d383bcd6eb1c726163e13f796", entity_id:"that which protects"}}, {_id:806, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Universal intelligence describes accessible intelligence experienced through mental states of letting go.>", created_at:1779139780, source_id:"chunk-f5de2c27f19510cae539acf2532e7901", entity_id:"Universal intelligence"}}, {_id:807, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cultural perspectives describe diverse interpretations of the divine-human relationship as