The Academy is an educational institution fostering a sense of family and shared connection among students. It offers transformative practices, including philosophy and meditation, to help individuals overcome challenges and create new destinies through consciousness transformation. The Academy operates hands-on, designing courses and teaching higher classes while supporting global businesses and charities that impact villagers and students. It also served as the location for Krishnaji?s special process with Diego and hosted a transformative spiritual experience for two children.", source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec<SEP>chunk-be5e79cc66746a0a24382426cfe2a8ff<SEP>chunk-7769be7ae0544b9b85386becf7e58bed<SEP>chunk-64534fa37e2772d16d26e6098d4409b0<SEP>chunk-1ba7f5be1d21e67ddd5d6d9988215271<SEP>chunk-999192b96103e7c498639cfadd062722<SEP>chunk-ac2f8cb722c994eb19c13fbd7a35cc4f", entity_id:"The Academy"}}, {_id:865, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Silent Power is the same as the Elixir of Life, representing a state of connection free of expectation.", created_at:1779140273, source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec", entity_id:"Silent Power"}}, {_id:866, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Elixir of Life is described as a state of connection that helps navigate challenges and conquer them.", created_at:1779140273, source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec", entity_id:"Elixir of Life"}}, {_id:867, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shared Connection is a state of connection that is free of all expectation and is metaphorically called the Elixir of Life.", created_at:1779140273, source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec", entity_id:"Shared Connection"}}, {_id:868, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mutual Evolution is a shared commitment to evolution that is essential for the thriving of intimate relationships.", created_at:1779140273, source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec", entity_id:"Mutual Evolution"}}, {_id:869, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Intimate Relationship is a relationship that requires mutual evolution and is enhanced by self-acceptance and acceptance.", created_at:1779140273, source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec", entity_id:"Intimate Relationship"}}, {_id:870, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oalnb5-fHjY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-Acceptance leads to acceptance in relationships, allowing for genuine connection and mutual respect.<SEP>Acceptance is highlighted as a shared human longing, transcending differences in expression.<SEP>Acceptance involves embracing failures and defeats without justification or condemnation.", created_at:1779220992, source_id:"chunk-c219578ff4da1678ae1ff2890bf677ec<SEP>chunk-0abffe0fa33b9e8c05e4d3ce9e08d67e<SEP>chunk-53a9324ebf298fdd4dfdc6bd565dba9d<SEP>chunk-a5d16b7b208928b7a3800de53c2fa4eb", entity_id:"Acceptance"}}, {_id:871, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Literary works by Anne Sexton that explore themes from ?The Frog Prince.?", created_at:1779140303, source_id:"chunk-a6d5fb2d9a6f95d89ee353ec0e3d3252", entity_id:"Anne Sextons Poetry"}}, {_id:872, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A fairy tale narrative involving a princess, a talking frog, and themes of transformation and hidden identity.<SEP>The Frog Prince is a fairy tale featuring a princess and a talking frog, rich in symbolism and analyzed by mythologists.", created_at:1779141730, source_id:"chunk-a6d5fb2d9a6f95d89ee353ec0e3d3252<SEP>chunk-828fe791bfee22158562b2e56c06c719", entity_id:"The Frog Prince"}}, {_id:873, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"An adaptation of ?The Frog Prince? featuring Oprah Winfrey, produced by Disney.<SEP>A Disney animated movie adaptation of \"The Frog Prince\" featuring Oprah Winfrey.", created_at:1779141730, source_id:"chunk-a6d5fb2d9a6f95d89ee353ec0e3d3252<SEP>chunk-828fe791bfee22158562b2e56c06c719", entity_id:"Disney Animated Movie"}}, {_id:874, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"A collection of traditional German folktales, including ?The Frog Prince,? which has inspired various adaptations and analyses.", created_at:1779140303, source_id:"chunk-a6d5fb2d9a6f95d89ee353ec0e3d3252", entity_id:"Grimms Fairy Tale"}}, {_id:875, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A character in the fairy tale who loses her golden ball and interacts with the frog/prince.<SEP>The princess is a character in \"The Frog Prince\" who loses her golden ball and interacts with a talking frog.", created_at:1779141730, source_id:"chunk-a6d5fb2d9a6f95d89ee353ec0e3d3252<SEP>chunk-828fe791bfee22158562b2e56c06c719", entity_id:"Princess"}}] AS row
