The relevant parts are: Moon is a student at the academy, teaches yoga classes, and experiences a car accident. She also experiences emotional conflict, self-reflection, anxiety, and contemplates ending her relationship with her boyfriend. She interacts with her boyfriend and police after the accident, shares feelings with him, and", source_id:"chunk-bc8e5c6e2903c7efd30d7faf6ff8221b<SEP>chunk-363a12a794ef9201d57ba8dde0d7af3e<SEP>chunk-fb2bfbb0245a907569e445c30ae49755<SEP>chunk-94c65ff085b8aa85472655475c787e84<SEP>chunk-3371fee7dc2e5f20ad27eaf69ba00c32<SEP>chunk-5849ade76c5b4eb2790b0b03a838cc07<SEP>chunk-c8cc27957b68d36b9eca4a85d95d3c9f<SEP>chunk-bda2d2f720df9a2377a09a7b416beb0e<SEP>chunk-724531516c99b2814a8e329894ee9bdf<SEP>chunk-faad39bb9ba8730957c6d719dd0fa2bc<SEP>chunk-463d3565b6195eb54c22ef1f1f467400", entity_id:"Moon"}}, {_id:887, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Thought patterns refer to ingrained mental habits that influence perceptions of relationships and self.", created_at:1779140334, source_id:"chunk-bc8e5c6e2903c7efd30d7faf6ff8221b", entity_id:"Thought Patterns"}}, {_id:888, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dreams of love represent idealized expectations of romantic relationships, often clashing with reality.", created_at:1779140334, source_id:"chunk-bc8e5c6e2903c7efd30d7faf6ff8221b", entity_id:"Dreams of Love"}}, {_id:889, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Nightmare symbolizes the frustration and disillusionment experienced in failing relationships.<SEP>Being stuck in unresolved experiences is likened to an inescapable nightmare.`", created_at:1779228759, source_id:"chunk-bc8e5c6e2903c7efd30d7faf6ff8221b<SEP>chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281", entity_id:"Nightmare"}}, {_id:890, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The car's airbag deployed during the accident, preventing injury.<SEP>Airbag deploys during the accident, preventing serious injury to Moon.", created_at:1779186055, source_id:"chunk-363a12a794ef9201d57ba8dde0d7af3e<SEP>chunk-3371fee7dc2e5f20ad27eaf69ba00c32", entity_id:"Airbag"}}, {_id:891, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779144084, description:"The car was involved in the accident and was badly damaged.<SEP>A vehicle involved in a collision with a rock, leading to the man's life-threatening accident.<SEP>The car is an artifact involved in the man?s accident and subsequent near-death experience.", source_id:"chunk-363a12a794ef9201d57ba8dde0d7af3e<SEP>chunk-bcdc6f717c6627075a9723ba584173eb<SEP>chunk-047b4478344df168d1315f3ec6d2549f", entity_id:"Car"}}, {_id:892, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", created_at:1779186733, description:"The location where Moon reports the car accident to the police.<SEP>Police Station is the location where Moon sits contemplating her relationship and the boyfriend handles formalities.<SEP>Police station is the location where Moon reports the car accident aftermath.<SEP>Nearby location where Moon reports the accident and interacts with authorities.<SEP>The police station is the location where Moon reports the car accident and interacts with her boyfriend and police.` - Correct.", source_id:"chunk-363a12a794ef9201d57ba8dde0d7af3e<SEP>chunk-fb2bfbb0245a907569e445c30ae49755<SEP>chunk-3371fee7dc2e5f20ad27eaf69ba00c32<SEP>chunk-5849ade76c5b4eb2790b0b03a838cc07<SEP>chunk-c8cc27957b68d36b9eca4a85d95d3c9f", entity_id:"Police Station"}}, {_id:893, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The car accident involving Moon and the subsequent police report.<SEP>The Incident refers to the family's traumatic experience of the Jet Ski capsizing and being stranded in icy water.`<SEP>The Incident refers to the family's traumatic experience of the Jet Ski capsizing and being stranded in icy water.`", created_at:1779183059, source_id:"chunk-363a12a794ef9201d57ba8dde0d7af3e<SEP>chunk-50d6ad908c447f2c1930066f85129418", entity_id:"Incident"}}, {_id:894, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Police are involved in the investigation, with the boyfriend managing inquiries and formalities related to the case.<SEP>The police are the governing body handling the accident report and formalities.` - Correct.<SEP>Police are law enforcement agencies that enforce laws and maintain public order.<SEP>Police are law enforcement agencies that enforce laws and maintain public order.", created_at:1779520562, source_id:"chunk-fb2bfbb0245a907569e445c30ae49755<SEP>chunk-c8cc27957b68d36b9eca4a85d95d3c9f<SEP>chunk-3f4d48e02ed3cffc983ab81c8c5b5555", entity_id:"Police"}}, {_id:895, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Second Sacred Secret of Inner Truth is a principle Moon discovers, emphasizing self-awareness and emotional clarity.<SEP>The second sacred secret of inner truth is a concept related to achieving emotional freedom and self-awareness through inner stillness.", created_at:1779141412, source_id:"chunk-fb2bfbb0245a907569e445c30ae49755<SEP>chunk-3324f1848f747970d99d374e6a692e91", entity_id:"Second Sacred Secret of Inner Truth"}}, {_id:896, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Academy?s Course is an educational event attended by Moon that provided insights influencing her later self-realization.", created_at:1779140389, source_id:"chunk-fb2bfbb0245a907569e445c30ae49755", entity_id:"Academys Course"}}] AS row
