UNWIND [{_id:937, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shadows refer to negative states like hurt and staleness that create separation and division in relationships when spiritual vision is absent.", created_at:1779140632, source_id:"chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750", entity_id:"Shadows"}}, {_id:938, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Second fellow in the fable who repeatedly warns others about potential dangers.<SEP>Second fellow repeatedly warns others about the risks of their actions but is ignored, ultimately climbing a tree for safety.", created_at:1779142088, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"Second Fellow"}}, {_id:939, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"First fellow in the fable who reconstructs bones into a skeleton despite warnings.<SEP>First fellow is a character who reconstructs a skeleton using his learning, ignoring warnings about potential consequences.", created_at:1779142088, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"First Fellow"}}, {_id:940, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", created_at:1779186988, description:"A giant lion carcass created by the third fellow after adding flesh and meat to the skeleton.<SEP>Lion carcass is a giant animal carcass formed by the third fellow by adding flesh and meat to the skeleton.<SEP>A lifeless lion carcass created by the third friend in the fable, representing escalating emotional states.`", source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"Lion Carcass"}}, {_id:941, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Fourth fellow in the fable who attempts to breathe life into the lion carcass.<SEP>Fourth fellow attempts to breathe life into the lion carcass, prompting the second fellow to seek safety.", created_at:1779142088, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"Fourth Fellow"}}, {_id:942, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Third fellow in the fable who adds flesh and meat to the skeleton, creating a lion carcass.<SEP>Third fellow transforms the skeleton into a lion carcass by adding flesh and meat, disregarding warnings.", created_at:1779142088, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"Third Fellow"}}, {_id:943, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779186988, description:"A reconstructed skeleton of a giant animal created by the first fellow.<SEP>Skeleton is a reconstructed giant animal skeleton created by the first fellow using his learning.<SEP>A reconstructed skeleton from bones in the fable, symbolizing the manifestation of unresolved hurt.`", source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"Skeleton"}}, {_id:944, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"An ancient Indian fable illustrating the consequences of ignoring caution and overreaching.<SEP>A narrative illustrating how unaddressed hurt leads to destructive outcomes in relationships.`", created_at:1779186989, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"Ancient Indian Fable"}}, {_id:945, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779142252, description:"An abstract concept representing stagnation and division mentioned in the text.<SEP>The shadow of staleness is a metaphor for inner emptiness or dissatisfaction with life, driving people to avoid it through various behaviors.<SEP>The shadow of staleness refers to complacency or lack of growth in relationships, countered by spiritual vision to maintain vitality.<SEP>Symbolizes stagnation or lack of progress, also casting a long shadow on the characters' journey.<SEP>A metaphorical concept representing stagnation or unresolved emotional states.", source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a<SEP>chunk-dfd063e448fde077331ddbd4cc16008f<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-2be9c30d5eb8cae8ce6cd1e6425921bc", entity_id:"Shadow of Staleness"}}, {_id:946, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A tall tree climbed by the second fellow to escape the potential danger of the fourth fellow's actions.<SEP>Tall tree is climbed by the second fellow to escape potential danger during the fourth fellow's attempt to animate the carcass.", created_at:1779142088, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a", entity_id:"Tall Tree"}}, {_id:947, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779142089, description:"An abstract concept representing hurt and division mentioned in the text.<SEP>The shadow of hurt represents emotional pain that can create separation in relationships when not addressed through spiritual connection.<SEP>Represents the lingering impact of past hurts on the characters' lives, casting a long shadow.", source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-dfd063e448fde077331ddbd4cc16008f<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a", entity_id:"Shadow of Hurt"}}, {_id:948, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"An evening spent with a loved one, which can be disrupted by negative emotional states.", created_at:1779140708, source_id:"chunk-03b29c0cb578765bf920a3ecd5cb3b97", entity_id:"Evening with Loved One"}}, {_id:949, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An emotional state that can hijack an evening with a loved one, leading to conflict.", created_at:1779140708, source_id:"chunk-03b29c0cb578765bf920a3ecd5cb3b97", entity_id:"Awful Mood"}}, {_id:950, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779186989, description:"The Three Stages of Disconnection is a framework outlining the progression from hurt to emotional obsession in relational dynamics.<SEP>The Three Stages of Disconnection is a framework explaining the process of emotional disconnection through three progressive stages.<SEP>The process of disconnection in relationships, likened to the root system of an invasive plant.<SEP>The Three Stages of Disconnection describe the progressive deterioration of relationships through hurt, judgment, and eventual emotional separation.`", source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b<SEP>chunk-e267787286890ad0751663f8a3e06d5c<SEP>chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"The Three Stages of Disconnection"}}, {_id:951, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Js7ongWaW64 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Js7ongWaW64)<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: XFFgRTgP8Rs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFFgRTgP8Rs)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779671870, description:"Hurt is an entity that, according to the video's analysis of human behavior, is identified as the psychological origin of comparison. This perspective suggests that hurt serves as a foundational factor that drives comparative processes in human cognition and behavior.

Additionally, hurt is described as emotional pain or trauma that arises from past experiences. Such hurt can generate feelings of inadequacy and foster a tendency to compare oneself unfavorably with others, reinforcing negative self-perception.

Furthermore, hurt is characterized as a negative state that has the capacity to perpetuate itself when spread. When individuals share or transmit hurt, it can amplify suffering within a group or community, creating a cycle of increasing distress.<SEP>Hurt is mentioned as a negative state that perpetuates itself when spread, leading to increased suffering.<SEP>One of the negative emotions listed as a consequence of the 70 percent.", source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b<SEP>chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511<SEP>chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-fa73522aa96594208b9f43ea66a6493e<SEP>chunk-b0b6f9f02020768407fee531e6074a4d<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-aaa5c02ef780f417e1e3498aff83c60b<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482<SEP>chunk-834da746d2aa7b2a05efc6fe3ab1fc17<SEP>chunk-c18e39fa455d4e81a05127af456a216c<SEP>chunk-bf6e1c8e25957956967b751c441a4ec5<SEP>chunk-fafff025e01a29bbcee9969fc4559382<SEP>chunk-87e2f7787298d3205ec139c556ef83c0<SEP>chunk-d305977f98ef25807e2b5a0d7a24ce2c<SEP>chunk-0e593bb50eabcacd46122f257190fe7f<SEP>chunk-3a5d8d7606e9b8e3d7ef11bf46090954<SEP>chunk-e27a47feac82bbd6f6606fd0582e97d1<SEP>chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1<SEP>chunk-7d201146e40d123c544e6caf9225da91", entity_id:"Hurt"}}, {_id:952, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional Obsession represents the culmination of unresolved hurts, manifesting as persistent negative fixation that obstructs connection.", created_at:1779140730, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b", entity_id:"Emotional Obsession"}}, {_id:953, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Passive Attention is a technique to acknowledge inner states of being, preventing the escalation of hurt into deeper disconnection.", created_at:1779140730, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b", entity_id:"Passive Attention"}}, {_id:954, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Complaint Mode describes a mental state where hurt morphs into accusatory thoughts, signaling progression toward disconnection.", created_at:1779140730, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b", entity_id:"Complaint Mode"}}, {_id:955, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779186988, description:"Stage Two: Judgment is the phase where hurt transitions into judgment and disconnection, characterized by forming negative conclusions about a partner.<SEP>Stage Two: Judgment is the second stage of disconnection where hurt morphs into forming judgments about others.<SEP>Stage Two of disconnection involves forming negative judgments about a partner through labels and comparisons.`", source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-e267787286890ad0751663f8a3e06d5c<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"Stage Two: Judgment"}}, {_id:956, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779672216, description:"<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and meta-commentary mixed with the real content about \"Respect.\"

First, I need to identify the actual spiritual content. The user mentioned that the real content is in the list of 8 descriptions, but the text is messy with instructions. The key is to look for the parts that define or describe \"Respect\" in a spiritual or conceptual sense.

Looking through the contaminated text, the main descriptions are:

1. Respect is mutual regard, appreciation, consideration.
2. It's a moral imperative, especially towards darker-skinned women.
3. A foundational element of healthy relationships.
4. Necessary for love.
5. Something that must be done (action).
6. A desired outcome of achievements, sometimes sought through comparison or anger.

There are conflicting statements here. The task mentions reconciling these, but the user wants the actual teaching. The spiritual aspects would be the positive attributes and moral imperatives. The contradictions (like respect as an action vs. an outcome) might be part of the content but need to be presented as conflicting viewpoints.

I need to present these points in a clean, concise manner without the developer instructions. The output should be 1-4 sentences, plain English, no bullet points. Also, mention the entity at the beginning and handle conflicts by noting them.

So, the clean description would start with \"Respect is a concept defined as mutual regard, appreciation, and consideration...\" Then include the moral imperative, foundational element, necessity for love. Then mention the conflicting views: some see it as an action, others as an outcome from achievements, sometimes through negative means. Conclude by noting the uncertainty in reconciling these perspectives.

Check for any remaining meta-text or instructions. The contaminated text ends mid-sentence, but the key points", source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-a3a9654c6c8f7858ec4d287082297caa<SEP>chunk-9233fc2d9357336158890082052af34c<SEP>chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5<SEP>chunk-1585d67082ac380dcec744bed4f90b26<SEP>chunk-e28a16af170670aaf61d68da07b71294<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Respect"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:957, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Brain chemistry alterations in judgment cause distorted perceptions, magnifying negativity and impairing objective view of a partner.<SEP>Brain chemistry refers to the biochemical processes in the brain that can be altered by anger.", created_at:1779557464, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-fdbf9aca2a79a0d5bef7d0b7c7804d67", entity_id:"Brain Chemistry"}}, {_id:958, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Inward comparison fosters judgmental mindset, leading to dissatisfaction and relational deterioration.", created_at:1779140776, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f", entity_id:"Inward Comparison"}}, {_id:959, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stage Three: Aversion is the third stage of disconnection characterized by judgment and aversion, where partners perceive each other negatively and lose respect.", created_at:1779140776, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f", entity_id:"Stage Three: Aversion"}}, {_id:960, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Insensitive expressions manifest judgment as hurtful words or decisions that damage self-respect and condence.", created_at:1779140776, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f", entity_id:"Insensitive Expressions"}}, {_id:961, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Negative light describes distorted perception of a partner under judgment, emphasizing flaws and magnifying dissatisfaction.<SEP>Negative Light describes an attitude where individuals perceive everything through a pessimistic or critical lens.<SEP>Negative Light describes an attitude where individuals perceive everything through a pessimistic or critical lens.", created_at:1779648280, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-3df6d7e17b29056ecebd37bab054ca0d", entity_id:"Negative Light"}}, {_id:962, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-respect refers to personal dignity and confidence, eroded by judgment and aversion in relationships.", created_at:1779140776, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f<SEP>chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d", entity_id:"Self-Respect"}}, {_id:963, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of total disregard for others, leading to distorted experiences and interpersonal conflict.", created_at:1779140802, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511", entity_id:"Loss Of Respect"}}, {_id:964, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Temporary behaviors like indulging in luxuries (e.g., coffee, alcohol, cookies) to alleviate negative emotions.<SEP>Dopamine-fueled escapes refer to temporary behaviors like consuming coffee, martinis, or cookies to alleviate emotional pain, though they do not resolve underlying issues.", created_at:1779142173, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511<SEP>chunk-8aad6ef1fd3889e4b8c9933c17173354", entity_id:"Dopamine-Fueled Escapes"}}, {_id:965, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An emotional condition marked by hurt, loneliness, and unaddressed disappointments that obstruct joy and connection.", created_at:1779140802, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511", entity_id:"Painful State"}}, {_id:966, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779213240, description:"buoyancy is mentioned repeatedly in the text, though its relevance is unclear, possibly as a placeholder or concept.<SEP>Buoyancy is a concept related to the ability of a fluid to resist external forces, as discussed in the YouTube video.<SEP>A term that is repeated multiple times, indicating its importance.", source_id:"chunk-70481ae3ddabb1adcaf55702b0b1f2a9<SEP>chunk-1ee21367fd4b548afa67a98953c2520f<SEP>chunk-1d706281d83752de9ce523ace4a7c904", entity_id:"buoyancy"}}, {_id:967, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779213135, description:"A physics concept related to the ability of an object to float in a fluid, repeatedly emphasized in the video.<SEP>Scientific concept of buoyancy, repeatedly emphasized in the video's content.<SEP>Buoyancy is a concept related to the physics of fluids, repeatedly mentioned in the YouTube Video.<SEP>Buoyancy is a scientific concept related to fluid mechanics, repeatedly emphasized in the video.<SEP>A scientific concept related to fluid dynamics, repeatedly mentioned in the video.", source_id:"chunk-8c448954f44e55adfb78a88bf94086a4<SEP>chunk-bf3f97cb451463455d671e0a082344f3<SEP>chunk-1c8d4bc914611703bebe2542ed5cda16<SEP>chunk-e7917c269a8f8474e277f4da3ddd7c86<SEP>chunk-0035351daa774a335861e47cf4f9373b", entity_id:"Buoyancy"}}, {_id:968, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Villagers in rural India use a method involving desserts and tree hollows to catch monkeys.<SEP>Villagers are people in rural India who use a method to catch mischievous monkeys.<SEP>Villagers in rural India who catch mischievous monkeys using a trap involving desserts.<SEP>Villagers are people in rural India who catch mischievous monkeys using a trapping method involving desserts.", created_at:1779237971, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-b0b6f9f02020768407fee531e6074a4d<SEP>chunk-f0801bcd006400c8824a3d4098716493<SEP>chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5", entity_id:"Villagers"}}, {_id:969, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Monkey catchers are individuals who relocate monkeys to jungles using the villagers' method.<SEP>Individuals who relocate monkeys to jungles away from civilization.", created_at:1779142251, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-2be9c30d5eb8cae8ce6cd1e6425921bc", entity_id:"Monkey Catchers"}}, {_id:970, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Desserts are aromatic and juicy treats used in the monkey-catching method to lure monkeys.<SEP>Desserts are aromatic and juicy desserts used as bait in the trapping method.<SEP>Aromatic and juicy desserts used as bait in the monkey catching method.<SEP>Aromatic desserts left in a tree hole by villagers to trap monkeys.", created_at:1779237847, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-b0b6f9f02020768407fee531e6074a4d<SEP>chunk-71a9fb4bfe84373a489e9a88ded57dae<SEP>chunk-f0801bcd006400c8824a3d4098716493", entity_id:"Desserts"}}, {_id:971, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stages of disconnection refer to the progressive emotional detachment described in the text.<SEP>Stages of disconnection include hurt, aversion, and disconnection, describing emotional progression after conflict.", created_at:1779142412, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-41c56c693f43ab87b485549113485860", entity_id:"Stages of Disconnection"}}, {_id:972, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Inner void describes a painful emotional state resulting from unfulfilled relational needs.<SEP>Inner void refers to emotional emptiness created by holding onto aversion, prompting reliance on temporary fixes.<SEP>An inner void is created by holding onto a state of disrespect and fragmented self, leading to temporary fixes.<SEP>The Inner Void refers to Mike's unaddressed feelings of inadequacy and emptiness that he attempted to fill through wealth and success.", created_at:1779143094, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1<SEP>chunk-41c56c693f43ab87b485549113485860<SEP>chunk-07e3a1c90936c5a3ded21ee310a7ca5a<SEP>chunk-cd472120781d30f6deb417cdc30ee13c", entity_id:"Inner Void"}}, {_id:973, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Tree hollow is a natural cavity in a tree used to trap monkeys by restricting their withdrawal.", created_at:1779140838, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1", entity_id:"Tree Hollow"}}, {_id:974, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Villagers' Method is a trapping technique using aromatic desserts and tree hollows to capture monkeys by exploiting their attachment to food", created_at:1779140839, source_id:"chunk-bb336118db8922490b3e05a79c11dba1", entity_id:"Villagers' Method"}}, {_id:975, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Monkeys are mischievous creatures targeted by villagers using a trapping method involving desserts and tree hollows.<SEP>Monkeys are burly, mischievous creatures that steal from homes and are trapped using a method involving desserts.<SEP>The monkeys represent obstacles and fears that Swami Vivekananda confronts, illustrating the theme of overcoming challenges.<SEP>Mischievous monk