ruggling with disconnection but later awakening to profound compassion.", source_id:"chunk-c4f9e407e113bf4f292d2bfecfb8c361<SEP>chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3<SEP>chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2<SEP>chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922<SEP>chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b<SEP>chunk-7f41805cd78c323a0c0383328a52c327<SEP>chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a", entity_id:"Sunil"}}, {_id:1027, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Campus is a versatile location that serves as the setting for multiple individuals and programs. It is where Sunil met Krishnaji for a mentoring session, and where Sunil had a similar mentoring interaction with Krishnaji.

The campus also functions as the destination for a couple who eventually arrives at O&O Academy. Additionally, it is the site where Doris and Clark undergo a transformative process. Campus is also the place where Scott came to feel lost and sought introspection.

It is the physical location for the Oneness Achievers program, which will be conducted there. Finally, Campus is where Diego resides, and it is the setting for his interactions and emotional journey.", created_at:1779187087, source_id:"chunk-c4f9e407e113bf4f292d2bfecfb8c361<SEP>chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3<SEP>chunk-2be9c30d5eb8cae8ce6cd1e6425921bc<SEP>chunk-ca39129be392f8feb82a946e1e47ca81<SEP>chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-8828f50e6038efd15058fd650efc925a<SEP>chunk-214089f71bed8468f80247a24979283e<SEP>chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a", entity_id:"Campus"}}, {_id:1028, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Check is a financial instrument given by Sunil's father on his 20th birthday, which Sunil rejected.", created_at:1779141275, source_id:"chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3", entity_id:"Check"}}, {_id:1029, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", created_at:1779451903, description:"Sunil worked in Mumbai and faced unkindness there.\" That's correct. But the reason for going to Mumbai is his decision to quit school. The original output doesn't have a relationship between Sunil and his decision to quit school. However, the decision is part of the narrative but not an entity. So maybe no missed relationship here.<SEP>Mumbai is the city where Sunil worked and experienced emotional pain.<SEP>Mumbai is a city in India, home to Prachiti and Dhani.", source_id:"chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3<SEP>chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a<SEP>chunk-9631a67f046d45e3e2ba8f3d8b8dfbfd<SEP>chunk-880c5aea7c1b0fb74f62e8111debe91d", entity_id:"Mumbai"}}, {_id:1030, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"experience", truncate:"", description:"Sunil endured unkindness in Mumbai, affecting his well-being.\" That's correct.", created_at:1779141275, source_id:"chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3", entity_id:"Unkindness"}}, {_id:1031, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Money Sent Home refers to the 50% of Sunil's salary he sent to his father monthly, which was reinvested.", created_at:1779141275, source_id:"chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3", entity_id:"Money Sent Home"}}, {_id:1032, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Reinvestment refers to the father's use of Sunil's sent money for financial gain.", created_at:1779141276, source_id:"chunk-5f6e567050111ca1e6e0891a182bd7b3", entity_id:"Reinvestment"}}, {_id:1033, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An educational or spiritual program that includes the Mystic Limitless Field meditation as part of its curriculum.", created_at:1779141311, source_id:"chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2", entity_id:"The course"}}, {_id:1034, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"A meditation practice that induces deep introspection and spiritual realization, part of a course Sunil was taking.<SEP>Mystic Limitless Field meditation is a spiritual practice that induces profound emotional transformation and connection with nature and others.", created_at:1779186658, source_id:"chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2<SEP>chunk-7f41805cd78c323a0c0383328a52c327", entity_id:"Mystic Limitless Field meditation"}}, {_id:1035, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Sunil's father is a parent who reinvested money sent by Sunil and later offered him a check, symbolizing financial support and reconciliation.", created_at:1779141311, source_id:"chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2", entity_id:"Sunil's father"}}, {_id:1036, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Sunil's wife is a patient woman who becomes controlling when their daughter is born, leading to marital conflict and eventual divorce.<SEP>Sunil's wife is his ex-partner, who divorced him due to his refusal to prioritize family responsibilities, reflecting a conflict over parenting roles.", created_at:1779186658, source_id:"chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2<SEP>chunk-7f41805cd78c323a0c0383328a52c327", entity_id:"Sunil's wife"}}, {_id:1037, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Their daughter is Sunil and his wife's child, who becomes a source of duty for Sunil after their separation.", created_at:1779141311, source_id:"chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2", entity_id:"Their daughter"}}, {_id:1038, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"A small marine animal that triggers profound compassion and love in Sunil during his meditation.", created_at:1779141311, source_id:"chunk-562a8cc0548c2eafa4b1166a020d46a2", entity_id:"crab"}}, {_id:1039, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Mystic Limitless Field is a spiritual concept representing boundless consciousness, referenced in Sunil's meditation practice.", created_at:1779141338, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Mystic Limitless Field"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1040, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Beautiful Partner is a person who considers herself fortunate to have met Sunil after his transformation.<SEP>Sunil's partner who considers herself fortunate to have met him and is described as beautiful.", created_at:1779141371, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922<SEP>chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Beautiful Partner"}}, {_id:1041, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The laughter of children heard by Sunil symbolizes joy and connection to life's simple pleasures.", created_at:1779141338, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Laughter of Children"}}, {_id:1042, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"A crab observed by Sunil during his meditation, triggering feelings of compassion and interconnectedness.<SEP>A crab encountered during Sunil's meditation triggered his profound emotional awakening to compassion.", created_at:1779187070, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922<SEP>chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a", entity_id:"Crab"}}, {_id:1043, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Be it someone is a concept related to a grammatical structure.<SEP>Be it someone is a concept related to a grammatical", created_at:1779213745, source_id:"chunk-b0299a0d78edfc930128232df6ad17a7", entity_id:"Be it someone"}}, {_id:1044, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A heightened emotional state experienced by Sunil, enabling him to connect deeply with his daughter's emotions and perspectives.<SEP>A \"state of love\" is described as a transformative emotional condition required for meaningful connection and love-sharing.", created_at:1779247244, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922<SEP>chunk-1049ffa49a880db4b5369cf84bcae432", entity_id:"State of Love"}}, {_id:1045, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Exuberant communication from Sunil's daughter reflecting their strengthened bond.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Joyful Chatter"}}, {_id:1047, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Group of individuals involved in squabbles with Sunil's daughter, mentioned in the context of their relationship dynamics.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Friends at School"}}, {_id:1048, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Physical manifestation of Sunil's intense emotions during interactions with his daughter.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Chest Being Sore"}}, {_id:1049, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sunil's profound emotional awakening that reshaped his worldview and relationships.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Experience of Love"}}, {_id:1050, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sunil's feeling of connection to nature, humanity, and his daughter post-transformation.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Sense of Belonging"}}, {_id:1051, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sunil's ability to understand and align with his daughter's emotional needs and perspectives.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Connection to Desires and Views"}}, {_id:1052, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conflicts experienced by Sunil's daughter with peers, now understood through Sunil's new perspective.", created_at:1779141339, source_id:"chunk-f8449165361188bfe6afa260ab623922", entity_id:"Squabbles with Friends"}}, {_id:1053, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The well-being and contentment of employees, which Sunil prioritizes in his workplace.", created_at:1779141371, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Happiness of Employees"}}, {_id:1054, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"Yatha Rasaha Tatho Karmaha\" is corrected to \"Yatha Rasah Tattah Karmakah\" to illustrate the connection between expressions and subsequent actions.", created_at:1779213761, source_id:"chunk-84231a38981e55784ff03ce5211e679e", entity_id:"Yatha Rasah Tattah Karmakah"}}, {_id:1055, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Individuals attracted into one?s life due to being in a beautiful state.", created_at:1779141371, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Kind and Loving People"}}, {_id:1056, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Circumstances a beautiful state is not about enduring.", created_at:1779141371, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Unhappy or Dangerous Situations"}}, {_id:1057, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Immediate satisfaction sought by lackadaisical lovers, which the journey into truth does not cater to.", created_at:1779141372, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Instant Gratification"}}, {_id:1058, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Individuals seeking instant gratification, contrasting with those on the journey into truth.", created_at:1779141372, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Lackadaisical Lovers"}}, {_id:1059, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A transformative process of self-discovery and consciousness that requires courage and passion.", created_at:1779141372, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Journey into Truth"}}, {_id:1060, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Tremendous courage and passion required for the journey into truth and conscious living.", created_at:1779141372, source_id:"chunk-6159dcadf48bbe1bd234217f23bacc7b", entity_id:"Courage and Passion"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
