 entity_id:"What Is Connection?"}}, {_id:1087, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"The section \"What Are We Seeking?\" discusses what people seek in relationships.", created_at:1779141815, source_id:"chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35", entity_id:"What Are We Seeking?"}}, {_id:1088, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Relationship problems are linked to the gap between early ideals and reality.", created_at:1779141817, source_id:"chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35", entity_id:"Relationship Problems"}}, {_id:1089, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Idealized notions of love are critiqued for leading to relationship problems.", created_at:1779141817, source_id:"chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35", entity_id:"Idealized Notions of Love"}}, {_id:1090, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Lasting love is presented as an outcome of true connection.", created_at:1779141817, source_id:"chunk-b54ac9ad4f0146c0455d735ab73fde35", entity_id:"Lasting Love"}}, {_id:1091, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Desolate lives refer to a state of emotional emptiness and lack of fulfillment in personal existence.", created_at:1779141851, source_id:"chunk-322c357b48b096d2f7b5c99e2d2d2519", entity_id:"Desolate Lives"}}, {_id:1092, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A fundamental human desire driving meaningful relationships, emphasizing connection over independence.", created_at:1779141895, source_id:"chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94", entity_id:"Deep Connection"}}, {_id:1093, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cycles of heartbreak resulting from past pain affecting trust and vulnerability in relationships.", created_at:1779141895, source_id:"chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94", entity_id:"Heartbreak Cycles"}}, {_id:1094, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The duration spent apart from a partner, impacting relationship dynamics.", created_at:1779141895, source_id:"chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94", entity_id:"Time Away"}}, {_id:1095, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional or physical separation between partners, addressed through time management and mutual understanding.<SEP>Emotional or physical separation between people in a relationship.", created_at:1779186112, source_id:"chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94<SEP>chunk-3e351e3f449821330f87c8b4e26de0d2", entity_id:"Distance"}}, {_id:1096, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779673124, description:"<think>
