Confucius is a philosopher and teacher associated with parables exploring themes of honesty and justice. One story involves him judging a case where a boy stole a horse to feed his family, with conflicting accounts about the outcome: some versions claim Confucius reversed his decision based on the son's honesty, while others emphasize the ethical complexity of the situation. These variations reflect differing interpretations of his teachings on moral judgment and compassion.", source_id:"chunk-843a288acbc9e654c4e8d31eb046a7fa<SEP>chunk-05a2f5d02725dc2dcf8ad2e755a9ea94<SEP>chunk-5d7bc721d374a5cb0cba9dd3f98f763b<SEP>chunk-83844586a5265192561cceab641ac4ba<SEP>chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-46f092e49beb29848499bc5cec4e1faf<SEP>chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8", entity_id:"Confucius"}}, {_id:1185, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Obsession refers to an intense fixation on an ideal or role model, leading to loss of self and secondhand living.<SEP>Obsession denotes an excessive preoccupation with a particular interest or concern, potentially hindering other priorities.<SEP>Obsession refers to excessive focus on a partner's actions, leading to relational disconnection and emotional distance.<SEP>Obsession refers to excessive focus on a partner's actions, leading to relational disconnection and emotional distance.<SEP>Obsession is another concept that animals and plants lack, according to the original text.", created_at:1779717655, source_id:"chunk-843a288acbc9e654c4e8d31eb046a7fa<SEP>chunk-9f1528e052c091ff9a2052d88bff2e72<SEP>chunk-428c28379181a7cdc217fc69118ccc4d<SEP>chunk-718eaa0299a4e69592d1bfeffc841e25", entity_id:"Obsession"}}, {_id:1186, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An ideal is a guiding principle that can drive actions and lead to obsession when pursued obsessively.", created_at:1779142791, source_id:"chunk-843a288acbc9e654c4e8d31eb046a7fa", entity_id:"Ideal"}}, {_id:1187, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Living a secondhand life refers to adopting the behaviors and identity of others rather than maintaining one's own authenticity.", created_at:1779142791, source_id:"chunk-843a288acbc9e654c4e8d31eb046a7fa", entity_id:"Secondhand Life"}}, {_id:1188, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 3ITFXvYIPqg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ITFXvYIPqg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A role model is a figure admired for their qualities, often leading to obsession when emulated excessively.<SEP>An idealized standard of perfection that society enforces through upbringing.<SEP>A role model is a perfect individual against which others measure themselves, leading to self-dissatisfaction.<SEP>An idealized standard of perfection that society enforces through upbringing.", created_at:1779524828, source_id:"chunk-843a288acbc9e654c4e8d31eb046a7fa<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5", entity_id:"Role Model"}}, {_id:1189, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Defined Language refers to the specific communication rules established by Confucius to promote order and virtue.", created_at:1779142791, source_id:"chunk-843a288acbc9e654c4e8d31eb046a7fa", entity_id:"Defined Language"}}, {_id:1190, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779187565, description:"The horse was stolen by the young man's father, leading to a moral dilemma.<SEP>The Horse is the object stolen by the boy to feed his family, central to the story's moral conflict.<SEP>Metaphor for the state of being, which directs the \"cart\" of career and relationships.", source_id:"chunk-05a2f5d02725dc2dcf8ad2e755a9ea94<SEP>chunk-46f092e49beb29848499bc5cec4e1faf<SEP>chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b", entity_id:"Horse"}}, {_id:1191, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The royal adviser questioned the young man's decision to report his father.", created_at:1779142812, source_id:"chunk-05a2f5d02725dc2dcf8ad2e755a9ea94", entity_id:"Royal Adviser"}}, {_id:1192, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Honesty is portrayed as an ideal that the son obsesses over, becoming more important than human connection.<SEP>Honesty is discussed in the Confucius example, highlighting its perceived idealism versus connection-based truth.<SEP>The moral principle that compelled the young man to report his father, emphasizing integrity over familial loyalty.<SEP>Honesty is an ideal practiced within the context of human interactions and self-awareness.", created_at:1779562203, source_id:"chunk-5d7bc721d374a5cb0cba9dd3f98f763b<SEP>chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e<SEP>chunk-c0dc5060d878117d8549ed7941c43cb2", entity_id:"Honesty"}}, {_id:1193, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UbCEX5KBbPw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)<SEP>YouTube Video: j7EZJwH8uCM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j7EZJwH8uCM)<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>YouTube Video: OnAAtrwsfOc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OnAAtrwsfOc)<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779560693, description:"Health is a multidimensional concept that encompasses physical, mental, and social well?being and is not to be sacrificed in the pursuit of right action, with happiness being valued. It signifies physical well?being that can be enhanced through meditative relaxation of the body, and it is the result of perfect communication among cells, enzymes, and neuropeptides. Health also represents the collective presence of three intelligences?body, heart, and consciousness intelligence?and is necessary for manifesting well?being.

In the context of yoga, health is a current focus and an intended purpose, contrasting with its original spiritual purpose. Health is also described as a stated intended purpose of yoga, with several descriptions emphasizing this role.

Health is defined as a state of complete physical, mental, and social well?being, which can be negatively impacted by chronic stress, anger, and stress. It is an aspect of well?being addressed through consciousness law principles, leading to wonderful health outcomes, and is in perfect harmony with domain?specific principles such as consciousness law, where bodily systems function optimally. At the same time, health is an aspect of life that can be disrupted by chaos.

Health is determined by effective communication between trillions of bodily cells, as per Dr. Rosedale's medical insights. It is also described as a holistic state encompassing the body, mind, and consciousness in harmony, with the capacity to heal and rebuild, and is linked to Mukthi and connection.

Health is a critical factor for longevity, with the planet's health directly impacting the survival and well?being of all beings. Health is also presented as a blessing that can be felt through the mantra, and is emphasized as essential for longevity.

Health requires attention to individual conditions, as it is linked to the three intelligences: body, heart, and consciousness intelligence. It is also described as a state that requires attention to individual conditions, as it is linked to Mukthi and connection.<SEP>Health refers to physical and mental well-being, negatively impacted by anger and stress.<SEP>Health is discussed in the context of physical decline due to stress and the potential for healing through Oneness consciousness.<SEP>Health represents the physical and mental well-being negatively impacted by persistent brain activity.<SEP>Health refers to the state of complete physical, mental, and social well-being, discussed in the context of stress and anxiety.", source_id:"chunk-5d7bc721d374a5cb0cba9dd3f98f763b<SEP>chunk-70c6bbdb11e53c9f8f6f300d287b2520<SEP>chunk-6dd6f0aed7fea431a27783bb1609b0ed<SEP>chunk-56d49489b1f42f899d9566a254886c2c<SEP>chunk-91b2aa787cfc2f8f82f250a6e1012946<SEP>chunk-3372e5d9566c081ee06a41f5a3cb4448<SEP>chunk-65dfea79d783b0403b775689b17817eb<SEP>chunk-8c2cc5514a536fb11e09433f01ed2e85<SEP>chunk-92de552ab3b343ec94bcf5b612359aba<SEP>chunk-ad4544e5cec6ee250e4823e5b924afdf<SEP>chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa<SEP>chunk-82b4b0dbb1bf7ada138b9c4293afb2ad<SEP>chunk-6ceaf029b184877ef7237e73de7e90eb<SEP>chunk-84fd7b14281eebe067a21784a7a955d0<SEP>chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa<SEP>chunk-85ff6540f61eaa4adc3ec9e5f4057b70<SEP>chunk-3c35da3ef16cded7b3dd200cbc19a5f4<SEP>chunk-b0711a74429c017f31e7a7d0d9eeca01<SEP>chunk-4b35201ea3b2c1a816e4f9f7600e1284<SEP>chunk-cbc63c32944f9f552dca3de43ae2906d<SEP>chunk-fcb0245a76a7b396fd778f0392cfe0f8<SEP>chunk-6988c802643ab5986cfc41940a6f6b44<SEP>chunk-f11387cad436a638d2f57c99446730e6<SEP>chunk-d89831c29a65e71a84017ad0bb3212c4<SEP>chunk-729a868fcc915b32e3804866576c1ee4<SEP>chunk-3c35c8046e4068fa71b3df5521e81022", entity_id:"Health"}}, {_id:1194, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: htt