 when aligned with passion.", created_at:1779418239, source_id:"chunk-559824e00f03935bd6001bc6f83f121d<SEP>chunk-d097880e58e4b221fa91dccc5ac053c2", entity_id:"wealth creation"}}, {_id:1208, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The crocodile represents the endless loop of financial problems and the life of mediocrity resulting from self-obsession.", created_at:1779143014, source_id:"chunk-c8545c7b1dfe1b63a7ef3407fb082e4d", entity_id:"the crocodile"}}, {_id:1209, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The pit symbolizes the unconscious, aggressive, and ambitious pursuit of wealth creation driven by fear rather than joy or purpose, manifesting as various societal pressures like parental expectations or corporate demands.", created_at:1779143014, source_id:"chunk-c8545c7b1dfe1b63a7ef3407fb082e4d", entity_id:"the pit"}}, {_id:1210, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The vine symbolizes hope, which is fragile and vulnerable to erosion over time.", created_at:1779143014, source_id:"chunk-c8545c7b1dfe1b63a7ef3407fb082e4d", entity_id:"the vine"}}, {_id:1211, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The white and black mice represent the passage of time (night and day) that gradually erode hope.", created_at:1779143014, source_id:"chunk-c8545c7b1dfe1b63a7ef3407fb082e4d", entity_id:"white and black mice"}}, {_id:1212, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779708743, description:"<think>
