</think>

Mike is a CEO of a successful architecture firm who faces downfall due to arrogance and jealousy, prompting existential fear and a life review during a meditation journey. His struggles with inadequacy, hollow success, and fear of being a \"nobody\" lead him to a transformative four-day self-reflection course. Through this process, he confronts prioritizing external success over self-awareness and shifts from negative motivations to pursuing the greater good via knowledge utilization. The narrative illustrates the consequences of ignoring inner feelings and the potential for renewal through introspection and conscious transformation", source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c<SEP>chunk-cd472120781d30f6deb417cdc30ee13c<SEP>chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1<SEP>chunk-4254fba3cd08eeac830728e39c9bc049<SEP>chunk-200c896d057fae8b41a69675f296365e<SEP>chunk-a3883befbc3677e763ade9f571892747<SEP>chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051<SEP>chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Mike"}}, {_id:1217, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphorical energy state characterized by chaos and mediocrity resulting from living in an inferior consciousness.", created_at:1779143040, source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c", entity_id:"Negative Vortex of Energy"}}, {_id:1218, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A shameful feeling stemming from being ditched by a loved one for a richer person, which persisted into adulthood and fueled Mike's behavior.", created_at:1779143040, source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c", entity_id:"Shameful Feeling"}}, {_id:1219, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"True financial abundance is tied to conscious wealth creation, not ego-driven pursuits or filling inner emptiness.<SEP>Financial abundance represents an obsessive focus on monetary wealth, distorting relationships and causing emotional distress.", created_at:1779143409, source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c<SEP>chunk-bff75bb2f7b2ca92ac4ac1a9d943c725", entity_id:"Financial Abundance"}}, {_id:1220, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779670566, description:"A state of arrogance developed by Mike as a defense mechanism against shame, creating a negative energy vortex and mediocrity in life.<SEP>Arrogance contributes to overt and covert violence through societal denial.<SEP>Arrogance is criticized as a human trait driving exploitation of nature and other species.", source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c<SEP>chunk-18dfe327019b4987cc16243e45ad4a98<SEP>chunk-fbc362953fe784a8510b72471b749390", entity_id:"Arrogance"}}, {_id:1221, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Nobody State represents a higher consciousness that transcends ego-driven pursuits like financial success and social status.<SEP>The Nobody State refers to a psychological condition characterized by delirium and obsession with wealth/status, distorting reality and hindering stable achievements.", created_at:1779143409, source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c<SEP>chunk-bff75bb2f7b2ca92ac4ac1a9d943c725", entity_id:"The Nobody State"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1222, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The firm's success did not fulfill Mike's hoped-for happiness, highlighting his inner emptiness.", created_at:1779143066, source_id:"chunk-7503a6ae65b185937e995c2f50e85b5c", entity_id:"Recognition"}}, {_id:1223, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779187388, description:"A four-day course organized by Mike's daughter, which he attended reluctantly.<SEP>A self-reflection course where Mike begins to confront his addictive behaviors and self-perception.<SEP>A transformative course involving meditation and introspection, where Mike confronts his \"Nobody State\" and redefines his sense of self.`", source_id:"chunk-cd472120781d30f6deb417cdc30ee13c<SEP>chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051", entity_id:"Four-Day Course"}}, {_id:1224, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Media played a role in tarnishing Mike's image through the public dissemination of his downfall and failures.<SEP>Public perception and news outlets that tarnish Mike's reputation after his attempts to sabotage a competitor.", created_at:1779187322, source_id:"chunk-cd472120781d30f6deb417cdc30ee13c<SEP>chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa", entity_id:"Media"}}, {_id:1225, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The Great Fire is a metaphorical or literal fire consuming discontent within Mike.", created_at:1779143143, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Great Fire"}}, {_id:1226, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The navel region is the area where Mike experiences intense heat during meditation.", created_at:1779143143, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Navel Region"}}, {_id:1227, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The heart and gut are body parts associated with Mike's feelings of discontent.", created_at:1779143143, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Heart and Gut"}}, {_id:1228, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The Great Heat is a physical sensation arising in Mike's navel region during meditation.", created_at:1779143143, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Great Heat"}}, {_id:1229, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Purposeless Existence is the realization that Mike's life lacked meaningful impact.", created_at:1779143144, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Purposeless Existence"}}, {_id:1230, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sweet Sleep represents a state of peaceful rest experienced by Mike after meditation.", created_at:1779143144, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Sweet Sleep"}}, {_id:1231, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Life Review is a process where Mike reflects on his life and its futility during a plane ride.", created_at:1779143144, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Life Review"}}, {_id:1233, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Paralyzing Fear is the fear of dying as a nobody, gripping Mike during meditation.", created_at:1779143144, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Paralyzing Fear"}}, {_id:1235, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Aggression and ruthlessness are behaviors driving Mike's pursuit of success, stemming from his feelings of inadequacy.", created_at:1779143144, source_id:"chunk-b8797891f91bec3ca8041425168acbf1", entity_id:"Aggression and Ruthlessness"}}, {_id:1236, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The \"Perfect Self\" refers to an idealized version of oneself, with efforts to achieve it described as futile and tiresome.<SEP>The Perfect Self is an idealized image of oneself, formed through collective knowledge from ancestors, parents, teachers, friends, and societal opinions, characterized by emotional virtue, intellectual brilliance, physical attractiveness, and financial abundance.<SEP>The Perfect Self is an idealized image of oneself, characterized by emotional virtue, intellectual brilliance, physical attractiveness, and financial abundance, formed through collective knowledge from ancestors and society.<SEP>The Perfect Self is an idealized image shaped by societal messages about virtue, success, and attractiveness, often modeled after admired public figures.<SEP>The text discusses the concept of the Perfect Self.<SEP>The Perfect Self represents an idealized state of being, from which individuals deviate as they experience the Nobody State and despair.<SEP>An internalized, idealized version of success and self-worth shaped by societal and familial expectations, often leading to self-measurement and despair.`", created_at:1779187388, source_id:"chunk-4254fba3cd08eeac830728e39c9bc049<SEP>chunk-3ab82e092d6b5c626c21e659e899eea6<SEP>chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956<SEP>chunk-f072f6c1aecbc4e4e511168e02ba440e<SEP>chunk-6bd5636c13f54dcbb4aa1a8db98334b5<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051", entity_id:"Perfect Self"}}, {_id:1237, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A seeker is someone actively searching for spiritual or personal transformation.<SEP>A seeker is portrayed as someone on the journey to enlightenment, requiring physical and energetic alignment.<SEP>One who actively pursues enlightenment through conscious living and spiritual practices.<SEP>A Seeker is an individual actively pursuing spiritual growth and enlightened states of consciousness.<SEP>A seeker with terminal illness who attended the retreat, experienced spiritual transformation, and overcame fear of death through enlightenment.<SEP>A seeker with terminal skin cancer attended a retreat, transcended fear of death, and experienced profound sacredness in everyday life.", created_at:1779665932, source_id:"chunk-252f684aa6870ba2bb42b8de04c97683<SEP>chunk-ae85e43970032506c9fc6caf0b0538ed<SEP>chunk-8cc3598abebcf159e6f8db2b03c316fe<SEP>chunk-d0f73f6be38d246bcc320bc477e06c62<SEP>chunk-7fd1a34e003778b212b04bd1c6c64ad5<SEP>chunk-360f7674da2e91f036d52739a28095ed<SEP>chunk-0f5cc695879f69fa0bc7fb0810db881c<SEP>chunk-25679c68ddef27fd2e2fa60d50bdcb05", entity_id:"Seeker"}}, {_id:1238, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"natural_object", truncate:"", description:"Butterfly symbolizes the outcome of metamorphosis, representing beauty and transformation.<SEP>Butterfly is a natural object included in the description.", created_at:1779659820, source_id:"chunk-6c15a75af214595c325b0cdb5584b6a9<SEP>chunk-a1db67931b8b2b2ca86238a361b1b4df<SEP>chunk-252f684aa6870ba2bb42b8de04c97683<SEP>chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01", entity_id:"Butterfly"}}, {_id:1239, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Nobody State can result in three distinct paths: failure, painful success, and self-sabotage.<SEP>Potential outcomes of operating from the \"Nobody State,\" including futile wealth pursuit, painful success, and self-sabotage.`", created_at:1779187388, source_id:"chunk-3ab82e092d6b5c626c21e659e899eea6<SEP>chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051", entity_id:"Three Different Paths"}}, {_id:1240, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Steve Jobs is referenced as an example of the Perfect Self archetype, embodying intellectual brilliance and success.<SEP>Steve Jobs is a historical figure referenced as an example of leadership and innovation.<SEP>Steve Jobs is a technology giant known for moving away from everyday activities.<SEP>Steve Jobs is a technology innovator who used seclusion to drive innovation.", created_at:1779245471, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956<SEP>chunk-84231a38981e55784ff03ce5211e679e<SEP>chunk-550e13cc834f4b3fe1d51617d1c42fa2<SEP>chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32", entity_id:"Steve Jobs"}}, {_id:1241, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Warren Buffett is referenced as an example of the Perfect Self, embodying financial abundance and success.", created_at:1779143250, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Warren Buffett"}}, {_id:1242, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Gigi Hadid is mentioned as an example of the Perfect Self, symbolizing physical attractiveness and desirability.", created_at:1779143250, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Gigi Hadid"}}, {_id:1243, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The Dalai Lama is included as an example of the Perfect Self, representing emotional virtue and spiritual authority.", created_at:1779143250, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Dalai Lama"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1244, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Societal messages about success, happiness, and morality shape the formation of the Perfect Self ideal from early life.", created_at:1779143250, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Societal Messages"}}, {_id:1245, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Desire is framed as a natural human drive that should not be suppressed, contrasting with compromises.<SEP>Desire is a fundamental human experience that can lead to obsessive craving and suffering when fixated on objects of desire.", created_at:1779173395, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956<SEP>chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a", entity_id:"Desire"}}, {_id:1246, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unreasonable contrasts with \"reasonable,\" representing nonconformity to societal norms.", created_at:1779143251, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Unreasonable"}}, {_id:1247, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Inner Gauge represents the subconscious measurement of one's reality against the Perfect Self ideal.", created_at:1779143251, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Inner Gauge"}}, {_id:1248, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Reasonable refers to subjective societal standards used to judge acceptable behavior or expectations.", created_at:1779143251, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956", entity_id:"Reasonable"}}, {_id:1249, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: PFNP4c1cOSI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PFNP4c1cOSI)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X3LKG0Ycl3A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Constant comparison between the Perfect Self and reality leads to disappointment when ideals are unmet.<SEP>Reality is described as the state of a relationship after romance fades.<SEP>Reality encompasses the entire scope of existence, including all phenomena and experiences.<SEP>Reality encompasses the entire scope of existence, including all phenomena and experiences.<SEP>The actual state of existence, perceived without the mind's divisive nature in expanded consciousness.<SEP>The actual state of existence perceived neutrally in expanded consciousness.<SEP>Reality refers to the state of things as they exist, often contrasted with perception or imagination in the context of manifestation.", created_at:1779728754, source_id:"chunk-e9621dc7d3757b01547188c8c828f956<SEP>chunk-d97614999399e6f5f1181bdaebd85f12<SEP>chunk-ecacbf92f0c8b457e3e7365b88b0c5b9<SEP>chunk-ac599df176221b3c1e3e9b33cb62fa37<SEP>chunk-beeabf4db9d94499feff9e07a340c9a1<SEP>chunk-6d16539213ab1e4cb0268da2ab5977c1<SEP>chunk-6f90bcd92d07d52aa1d337005e488437", entity_id:"Reality"}}, {_id:1250, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The text describes a state of being in childhood.<SEP>State of being is transformed through awakened consciousness, affecting achievement and creation.", created_at:1779675447, source_id:"chunk-f072f6c1aecbc4e4e511168e02ba440e<SEP>chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"state of being"}}, {_id:1251, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The text describes a state of innocence as a paradise.", created_at:1779143278, source_id:"chunk-f072f6c1aecbc4e4e511168e02ba440e", entity_id:"state of innocence"}}, {_id:1252, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The text describes a state of innocence as a paradise.", created_at:1779143278, source_id:"chunk-f072f6c1aecbc4e4e511168e02ba440e", entity_id:"paradise"}}, {_id:1253, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Caterpillar symbolizes the initial stage of transformation before metamorphosis.", created_at:1779214109, source_id:"chunk-252f684aa6870ba2bb42b8de04c97683", entity_id:"Caterpillar"}}, {_id:1254, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779143278, description:"The text describes a state of peace.", source_id:"chunk-f072f6c1aecbc4e4e511168e02ba440e", entity_id:"state of peace"}}, {_id:1256, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)<SEP>YouTube Video: 7lggUuJtZXY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7lggUuJtZXY)<SEP>YouTube Video: o6X1TVEFHAY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6X1TVEFHAY)<SEP>YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779433204, description:"Entity Name: Wealth Creation

Description List:<SEP>The process of generating wealth through conscious alignment and expanded awareness.`<SEP>The process of generating wealth through conscious alignment and expanded awareness.`<SEP>Wealth creation is redefined as a process emerging from passion and creation dimensions, not struggle, with societal and personal impact.<SEP>Wealth creation is described as an effortless process driven by passion, innovation, and a desire to create positive impact in one's life, loved ones, society, and the world.<SEP>Wealth creation is described as effortless and driven by expansion, intuition, team creation, and innovation.<SEP>Wealth Creation is tied to Buddhi's role in nurturing prosperity.", source_id:"chunk-6bd5636c13f54dcbb4aa1a8db98334b5<SEP>chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334<SEP>chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51<SEP>chunk-d47f9b2e2b97109267ed4aa51e7ce893<SEP>chunk-7969e4168ecd055a3fbcda3d1911b288<SEP>chunk-edee740a602e9fade69883d02224f2fa<SEP>chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-203b5a3ea5b85d8a381ff6db8958a7d3<SEP>chunk-ec5154bb4ad96ae0dc3ba90ae132dc81<SEP>chunk-bd96767e11f046d35a62e0d27fa43bb7<SEP>chunk-bb6c9ed766984ed67a3284de5a2b4231<SEP>chunk-ab021105bc7fcb29c05b5af446cd2565<SEP>chunk-87c7719422a9d8333cc199f60bc9b163<SEP>chunk-c89b8cdd64ac1b6adbb6cecedd0bf3f0<SEP>chunk-a0a737121c6d2b4ce7ac662967a310aa<SEP>chunk-b818c65344c12c13e644d0fa2726456e<SEP>chunk-fb861a7ad5968de00a0781413686a72d", entity_id:"Wealth Creation"}}, {_id:1257, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Bhavah is the corrected version of Bhavaha.", created_at:1779214148, source_id:"chunk-d5209ab8570771473f1dc46fb7d0a708", entity_id:"Bhavah"}}, {_id:1258, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Bhavaha is a term in the text that was corrected to Bhavah.", created_at:1779214148, source_id:"chunk-d5209ab8570771473f1dc46fb7d0a708", entity_id:"Bhavaha"}}, {_id:1259, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Manah is the corrected version of Manaha.", created_at:1779214148, source_id:"chunk-d5209ab8570771473f1dc46fb7d0a708", entity_id:"Manah"}}, {_id:1260, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Yatha Manah Tatho Bhavah is a Sanskrit phrase, often misheard as \"Yatha Manah Tatho Bhavah\".", created_at:1779214206, source_id:"chunk-ea3fb72d901386059c3468d2efb887ac", entity_id:"Yatha Manah Tatho Bhavah"}}, {_id:1261, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Yatha Drishti Tatho Manaha is a Sanskrit phrase, often misheard as \"Yatha Drishti Tatho Manah\".", created_at:1779214206, source_id:"chunk-ea3fb72d901386059c3468d2efb887ac", entity_id:"Yatha Drishti Tatho Manaha"}}, {_id:1262, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Correction of spelling from \"self-centricness\" to \"self-centeredness\".", created_at:1779214246, source_id:"chunk-ea3fb72d901386059c3468d2efb887ac", entity_id:"self-centeredness"}}, {_id:1263, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779214314, description:"Correction of Sanskrit phrase spelling from \"Yatha Drishti Tatho Manaha\" to \"Yatha Drishti Tatho Manah\".<SEP>Yatha Drishti Tatho Manah is a classical saying from Natya Shastra.<SEP>Yatha Drishti Tatho Manah is a Sanskrit principle stating \"Where your sight goes, there your thought follows,\" emphasizing the connection between perception and cognition.", source_id:"chunk-ea3fb72d901386059c3468d2efb887ac<SEP>chunk-6b1d348d30a4810b6faddaada697a8bb<SEP>chunk-2d2eb7415c7c2507d0b30788e61632a1", entity_id:"Yatha Drishti Tatho Manah"}}, {_id:1264, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Correction of Sanskrit phrase spelling from \"Yatha Manaha Tatho Bhavah\" to \"Yatha Manah Tatho Bhavah\".", created_at:1779214246, source_id:"chunk-ea3fb72d901386059c3468d2efb887ac", entity_id:"Yatha Manaha Tatho Bhavah"}}] AS row
