stainable decisions, explicitly highlighted in the context of individual actions.", created_at:1779252052, source_id:"chunk-200c896d057fae8b41a69675f296365e<SEP>chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1<SEP>chunk-9332e7a3f9bcce1d2eddd640a5990242<SEP>chunk-de9bbf67da91036286c4d2bcad673eb7", entity_id:"Greater Good"}}, {_id:1303, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The state disrupts positive circumstances and societal harmony.", created_at:1779143519, source_id:"chunk-200c896d057fae8b41a69675f296365e", entity_id:"Auspiciousness"}}, {_id:1304, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Online delivery of architectural knowledge and services to learners through a team led by \"him.\"", created_at:1779143548, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334", entity_id:"Architectural Solutions Online"}}, {_id:1305, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mental or emotional conditions (e.g., lack, fear) that hinder manifestation of goals and dreams.<SEP>Destructive states like discontent, anger, and desire to control are linked to I-consciousness and arise from self-engrossment.<SEP>Destructive states of being including discontent, anger, hate, fear, pain, and desire to control/dominate, associated with I-consciousness.<SEP>Mental or emotional states (e.g., anxiety, disconnection) that hinder goal manifestation and abundance creation.<SEP>Negative mental or emotional states hindering manifestation of goals.<SEP>Negative mental or emotional patterns that hinder personal growth and manifestation of goals.", created_at:1779407887, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334<SEP>chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa<SEP>chunk-c6d1ac7b77c644cdbe0e473d070e10a0<SEP>chunk-bb6c9ed766984ed67a3284de5a2b4231<SEP>chunk-e8122b558719002ee0dce799548c0a97<SEP>chunk-ab021105bc7fcb29c05b5af446cd2565", entity_id:"Destructive States"}}, {_id:1306, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Process of transitioning from traditional wealth-building methods to a consciousness-driven approach focused on abundance and creativity.", created_at:1779143548, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334", entity_id:"Journey to Conscious Wealth Creator"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1307, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Philosophy advocating wealth creation through awareness, creativity, and alignment with deeper consciousness rather than scarcity.<SEP>A philosophy focused on aligning with deeper creativity and connection to manifest abundance without operating from lack.<SEP>Methodology for creating abundance through conscious practices and avoiding destructive states.<SEP>Emphasizes creating abundance through mental and emotional alignment rather than scarcity-driven methods.", created_at:1779407887, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334<SEP>chunk-bb6c9ed766984ed67a3284de5a2b4231<SEP>chunk-e8122b558719002ee0dce799548c0a97<SEP>chunk-ab021105bc7fcb29c05b5af446cd2565", entity_id:"Consciousness Approach"}}, {_id:1308, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Philosophical foundation for the team's operations, emphasizing harmony and driven motivation.", created_at:1779143548, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334", entity_id:"States of Peace and Passion"}}, {_id:1309, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779217200, description:"The circulatory system is one of the body systems destroyed by stress.<SEP>The circulatory system is part of the human body responsible for transporting blood and is damaged when the parasympathetic nervous system shuts off.<SEP>The circulatory system is affected by stress, leading to health deterioration.", source_id:"chunk-4bca5a7f563e294879e45b9c3fe1993e<SEP>chunk-436cdd40c65f094c48fcf797f8be28ab<SEP>chunk-20e8a5aac153987a81136025a2c382fd", entity_id:"Circulatory System"}}, {_id:1310, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4ytgjpow498)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779734201, description:"The parasympathetic nervous system is a component of the autonomic nervous system that, when shut off by stress, leads to the destruction of other systems.<SEP>The parasympathetic nervous system regulates bodily functions at rest, including digestion and recovery, and is shut off during stress responses.<SEP>The parasympathetic nervous system is a biological system that regulates bodily functions and is affected by stress, leading to shutdown and health issues.<SEP>The parasympathetic nervous system is shut off during stress, redirecting energy to the limbs for rapid response.<SEP>The parasympathetic nervous system regulates bodily functions at rest and is involved in recovery; its shutdown due to stress leads to health deterioration.<SEP>The parasympathetic nervous system regulates bodily functions associated with rest and calm, which is suppressed during prolonged stress states.<SEP>The parasympathetic nervous system regulates bodily functions to promote relaxation and is central to activating the immune system for survival in infection-filled environments.", source_id:"chunk-2984b976f037a27596b29e94de8e3b21<SEP>chunk-b694dcc1bb7e7bd6fa7878c3592e7c19<SEP>chunk-4bca5a7f563e294879e45b9c3fe1993e<SEP>chunk-91b2aa787cfc2f8f82f250a6e1012946<SEP>chunk-436cdd40c65f094c48fcf797f8be28ab<SEP>chunk-671c6ddc6c8ba583342b564958bff7bd<SEP>chunk-20e8a5aac153987a81136025a2c382fd<SEP>chunk-45a029373e612fccf7c03c14e620d14c<SEP>chunk-190acc93a27012825956522182c7d1a4", entity_id:"Parasympathetic Nervous System"}}, {_id:1311, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)<SEP>YouTube Video: 7lggUuJtZXY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7lggUuJtZXY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779418315, description:"Conscious Wealth Creator is a state of being characterized by awareness of one's motivations, purpose, and the impact of wealth creation on the surrounding ecosystem. It involves creating abundance and positive impact through conscious choices, meaningful and joyful work aligned with higher consciousness, and emphasizes connection, purpose, and ecosystem impact over traditional wealth accumulation.

The approach to financial success is guided by mindfulness and intentionality, reflecting an elevated state of being where wealth creation is effortless and aligned with consciousness. This state operates from a place of expansion, passion, and creation, enabling effortless wealth creation and societal impact.", source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5<SEP>chunk-1131fb555cf5cb5c110e8720fad1eacd<SEP>chunk-935058526f2844e4cf8a154aae8963aa<SEP>chunk-bb6c9ed766984ed67a3284de5a2b4231<SEP>chunk-ab021105bc7fcb29c05b5af446cd2565<SEP>chunk-87c7719422a9d8333cc199f60bc9b163<SEP>chunk-c89b8cdd64ac1b6adbb6cecedd0bf3f0", entity_id:"Conscious Wealth Creator"}}, {_id:1312, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"CEO's wife questioned the CEO's decision-making state (fear vs. love) during a corporate crisis.", created_at:1779143587, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5", entity_id:"CEO's Wife"}}, {_id:1313, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"The company represents...` -> The name is `Company`. The type is `organization`. The description is a full sentence. This is correct.\"}<SEP>The company experienced miraculous growth with minimal advertising, attributed to employees' dedication and the practice of Soul Sync.<SEP>The company experienced miraculous growth with minimal advertising, attributed to employees' dedication and the practice of Soul Sync.", created_at:1779560221, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5<SEP>chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff<SEP>chunk-ce77326926352a7c47bb2a49044d5832<SEP>chunk-b684949fd5d74edd7eab4babc4752e9f<SEP>chunk-ec0775a84f775c1f45594bb341b87476<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce<SEP>chunk-5424541c24943ffc408f99bb3aa45c96<SEP>chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e", entity_id:"Company"}}, {_id:1314, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779217200, description:"The digestive system is one of the body systems destroyed by stress.<SEP>The digestive system processes food and nutrients, and is negatively impacted by stress-induced shutdown of the parasympathetic nervous system.<SEP>The digestive system is negatively impacted by stress, contributing to health issues.", source_id:"chunk-4bca5a7f563e294879e45b9c3fe1993e<SEP>chunk-436cdd40c65f094c48fcf797f8be28ab<SEP>chunk-20e8a5aac153987a81136025a2c382fd", entity_id:"Digestive System"}}, {_id:1315, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Board of Directors placed responsibility on the CEO to address the company's financial crisis.<SEP>The governing body overseeing the company, influencing the CEO's accountability.", created_at:1779555417, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5<SEP>chunk-5424541c24943ffc408f99bb3aa45c96", entity_id:"Board of Directors"}}, {_id:1316, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The board is the governing body overseeing the CEO, whose perception he fears.", created_at:1779143635, source_id:"chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff", entity_id:"Board"}}, {_id:1317, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"We need to synthesize the list of descriptions into a single comprehensive summary. The entity name is \"Employees\". The descriptions are:

1. A meta-description about the task: \"We need to produce a merged description for the entity \\\"Employees\\\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \\\"Description\\\" field. The descriptions are:\
