"}}, {_id:1327, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stressed State describes a mindset of suffering leading to burdensome responsibilities, contrasting with a \"beautiful state.\"", created_at:1779143724, source_id:"chunk-cf3bc78e02d58d61212dd4fe3b5c8715", entity_id:"Stressed State"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1328, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: zGOKGrTNlk4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGOKGrTNlk4)<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Any state of inner disturbance is referred to as stress, encompassing states like anger, fear, and loneliness.<SEP>Inner disturbance is alleviated through connection via conscious efforts to help others.<SEP>Inner disturbance refers to a state of emotional or mental turmoil that negatively affects individuals and contributes to global suffering.<SEP>Inner disturbance refers to a state of emotional or psychological unrest that requires conscious attention to prevent escalation.<SEP>Inner disturbance refers to emotional or psychological turmoil that requires conscious attention to prevent escalation.<SEP>Inner disturbance is a state experienced by individuals.", created_at:1779399387, source_id:"chunk-8853b5baf81ba75f9ee5305c84800872<SEP>chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f<SEP>chunk-c9caee3e34754dd743fb5e0f90ac1a6b<SEP>chunk-0ddbd4446b0368311d8844f5869734c4<SEP>chunk-28084224d33efa95fcb7e18cd0d14748<SEP>chunk-bf6e1c8e25957956967b751c441a4ec5", entity_id:"Inner Disturbance"}}, {_id:1329, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: oXRZhJTHuOA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oXRZhJTHuOA)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779661910, description:"Web of Life is an interconnected system that encompasses all living and non-living elements on the planet, representing a holistic framework that connects all life on Earth. This concept emphasizes that actions in one part of the system affect the whole, illustrating the profound interdependence of all life. The web is shaped by human actions and states, as well as by actions emerging from deep connection, spiritual states, and abundance consciousness. Contributions from individuals, especially when performed from a state of abundance, can benefit the interconnected system, promoting collective well-being. The concept serves as a framework for understanding how the planet's living and non-living components are linked, and how human behavior and consciousness can either support or disrupt this network.

The interconnected system of all living beings and their relationships, influenced by conscious actions, is a core aspect of the Web of Life. Human behavior and consciousness play a pivotal role, with actions and states?whether ordinary or arising from deep connection, spiritual awareness, or abundance?affecting the broader existence. These contributions can either support the network or cause disruption, depending on the nature of the actions.

In practice, the Web of Life is also described as a metaphorical interconnected network of all beings through which light and energy flow. This metaphorical view highlights the dynamic flow of energy and the spiritual dimension of the system, reinforcing the idea that all beings are linked through energetic exchanges.

Overall, the Web of Life concept underscores the holistic nature of existence, where any action, regardless of its origin, influences the broader system. It provides a lens for understanding the intricate relationships among living and non-living elements, and the impact of human consciousness on the planet's interconnected network.<SEP>A metaphorical representation of interconnectedness between all beings, emphasized during the meditation.<SEP>The interconnected system of all living beings and their relationships.", source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b<SEP>chunk-9146e187edbee9cdbc50b048c433c6f9<SEP>chunk-3e00aec0d824214dc3b1bf504e305af0<SEP>chunk-8c7d4ae28dcb0e3eed4f5fc9c1814de9<SEP>chunk-cd538a6e8a311df1e5a60102db1f1b82<SEP>chunk-2bbc3803605e2adf00675f6eca362196<SEP>chunk-94684d3c1e91618d6299c39872dafbdf<SEP>chunk-43e5b5923e8d509b9e9edf60b61ff56b<SEP>chunk-4c6054ccc3bee7f9d86c600fc50b5dc7<SEP>chunk-8570f0aea49283824eb9980842a005e9", entity_id:"Web of Life"}}, {_id:1330, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of interconnectedness, emphasizing that actions have wide-reaching effects on the web of life.", created_at:1779143772, source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b", entity_id:"Interconnectedness of All Things"}}, {_id:1331, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The Elders are an organization that arbitrated the dispute over the swan, ruling in favor of the Buddha.", created_at:1779143820, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Elders"}}, {_id:1332, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The Swan is a natural object, a bird that was shot by Devadatta and later tended to by the Buddha.<SEP>The swan symbolizes...` -> The name is `Swan`. The type is `natural object`. The description is a full sentence. This is correct.<SEP>The swan symbolizes the object of Devadatta?s desire and the source of his conflict with the Buddha.` - Correct.", created_at:1779187564, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce", entity_id:"Swan"}}, {_id:1333, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Devadatta is a person, a cousin of the Buddha, known for his ambition and conflict with the Buddha.<SEP>Devadatta, the Buddha?s cousin, exemplifies the destructive effects of the Nobody State through jealousy and unfulfilled ambition.` - Correct.", created_at:1779187564, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce", entity_id:"Devadatta"}}, {_id:1334, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Spiritual Path is a concept referring to the pursuit of knowledge and skills for display, often from a state of ambition.", created_at:1779143820, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Spiritual Path"}}, {_id:1335, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)<SEP>YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Buddha, the historical and spiritual figure, is also regarded as a religious figure and a concept symbolizing enlightenment, inner peace, and balance. He exemplified compassion, as illustrated by tending to a wounded swan, and chose seclusion for spiritual enlightenment. As a spiritual teacher, he achieved enlightenment and taught the path to self-realization and awakening, emphasizing the realization of awakened consciousness and the illusion of self. His teachings stress inner peace, the transcendence of ego, and the potential for awakening in all beings, presenting a central figure in religious and philosophical discourse.

Buddha's teachings are inclusive, asserting that awakening is not exclusive to him, and he is presented as a central figure whose guidance is inclusive. He is also a concept that guides actions, embodying compassion and the pursuit of self-realization. Buddha symbolizes enlightenment, balance, and the need to transcend ego, as illustrated in the Thai story of mud obscuring enlightenment. He is referenced in the context of guiding actions and the grand vision.

Buddha is also described as a historical figure known for spiritual teachings, who experienced anger, and as a spiritual leader cited for teaching about the consequences of anger. In some narratives, Buddha demonstrated forgiveness through a silent smile after being spat on, and he is referenced in a story about handling anger and promoting self-compassion through mindful awareness. These anecdotes highlight his compassionate response to adversity.

Some descriptions focus on Buddha as the state of enlightenment or the ideal of achieving Buddhahood, while others emphasize his role in teaching about the consequences of anger. The incomplete description \"Budd\" is truncated and does not provide sufficient information for inclusion. Overall, Buddha is portrayed as a multifaceted figure whose teachings and actions embody compassion, forgiveness, and the pursuit of awakening.<SEP>Budd<SEP>Buddha is a spiritual leader", created_at:1779564551, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-8e03152ba26c428e5446f721ab8114a4<SEP>chunk-50a3afd25409a52a572d62a449dbc4ec<SEP>chunk-3ba320b05f330dd38ee53d270146e432<SEP>chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce<SEP>chunk-550e13cc834f4b3fe1d51617d1c42fa2<SEP>chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32<SEP>chunk-40b40d077b6b6ad2e3eb8995f7aa43cd<SEP>chunk-52d567ecc552b96b146755df515ac0bd<SEP>chunk-49ad825cb7cba993a98976aa8215c0f0<SEP>chunk-955183a7876a0d1c45e94af3baafdb73<SEP>chunk-353087e1120c5c6d7a54cec358cac19d<SEP>chunk-cb4fc2fbd442df7df8271a138eea2d39<SEP>chunk-205423882b48f788157f2fc6f5ec5467<SEP>chunk-abf954b4076fde8130baee4b61745658<SEP>chunk-9a50f8f9005c610dcbdc56af435e96a8<SEP>chunk-fdbf9aca2a79a0d5bef7d0b7c7804d67<SEP>chunk-a9818a0388e6c7fbe12a262f4b70178a<SEP>chunk-ea1f0fc5a4bd6b550f008cf8e4905da5<SEP>chunk-3907dc38c0d0edd5d39a312bc7148a7e<SEP>chunk-b580aa2839ef18f449209c7066e083d0<SEP>chunk-24b5f3611aa0088cf040177e4f897986", entity_id:"Buddha"}}, {_id:1336, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: XFFgRTgP8Rs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XFFgRTgP8Rs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-Image is a concept where individuals escape real-life challenges by clinging to a lofty image of otherworldliness.<SEP>Self-image refers to a person's perception of themselves, influencing their emotional responses and behaviors, particularly in situations of perceived failure or criticism.<SEP>Self-image is the internal perception of one's abilities, worth, and identity, which influences emotional responses to challenges.<SEP>Self-Image refers to one's perception of themselves, influencing their emotional and behavioral responses.", created_at:1779519326, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-6202900249469971e378d57b74b99662<SEP>chunk-87e2f7787298d3205ec139c556ef83c0<SEP>chunk-d305977f98ef25807e2b5a0d7a24ce2c", entity_id:"Self-Image"}}, {_id:1337, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Despair is a concept representing a state of hopelessness, isolation, and conflict.", created_at:1779143821, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Despair"}}, {_id:1338, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Speech is a concept mentioned as a skill, with Devadatta being acknowledged as skilled in it.<SEP>Speech is mentioned as a medium that can be made more kind, warm, and loving.<SEP>Speech is mentioned as a medium that can be made more kind, warm, and loving.<SEP>Speech represents communication through spoken language, with qualities like kindness being discussed in the text.<SEP>Speech represents communication through spoken language, with qualities like kindness being discussed in the text.", created_at:1779669295, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-c088c9de5db4ddb6d01a048401214aef<SEP>chunk-4f083f509b73a704942cae198b15e4c6", entity_id:"Speech"}}, {_id:1339, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Isolation is a concept linked to the state of despair and the path of the Nobody State.<SEP>Isolation results from excessive engagement with digital content and lack of human connection.", created_at:1779218869, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674", entity_id:"Isolation"}}, {_id:1340, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Wandering is a concept describing the path of despair, isolation, and conflict.", created_at:1779143821, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Wandering"}}, {_id:1341, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Little Voice is a concept representing an internal voice of doubt or questioning.", created_at:1779143821, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Little Voice"}}, {_id:1342, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual Seeking is a concept of pursuing knowledge and skills for display, often from a state of ambition.", created_at:1779143821, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Spiritual Seeking"}}, {_id:1343, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Otherworldliness is a concept where individuals escape real-life challenges by clinging to a lofty self-image.", created_at:1779143821, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Otherworldliness"}}, {_id:1344, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The spiritual state is characterized by ambition and the accumulation of skills.<SEP>The spiritual path leads to a spiritual state, such as the Nobody State.<SEP>The spiritual state can lead to conflict and isolation.<SEP>The spiritual state can lead to isolation and despair.", created_at:1779143822, source_id:"chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e", entity_id:"Spiritual State"}}, {_id:1345, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Technology refers to the use of technological innovations to improve animal lives, pioneered by the Young Korean gentleman.<SEP>Technology refers to the innovations developed by the student to enhance animal welfare, pioneered during his college years.", created_at:1779143907, source_id:"chunk-b684949fd5d74edd7eab4babc4752e9f<SEP>chunk-ec0775a84f775c1f45594bb341b87476<SEP>chunk-f7a7b6ec5216cd073aa9baeaf426fc77", entity_id:"Technology"}}, {_id:1346, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Young Korean gentleman is a person who built a company to improve animal lives and faced leadership challenges and stress.", created_at:1779143881, source_id:"chunk-b684949fd5d74edd7eab4babc4752e9f", entity_id:"Young Korean Gentleman"}}, {_id:1347, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779666024, description:"Entity Name: Spiritual Journey

Description List:<SEP>Spiritual journey is a collective process that fosters team connection and inspiration.", source_id:"chunk-ec0775a84f775c1f45594bb341b87476<SEP>chunk-a6ebf53761366dcfd806d1bd7405b9ee<SEP>chunk-982f35660cd8beb5ada701f1b74f7110<SEP>chunk-6a12fdf86752a3b47cf3eb0ac92a6887<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-a3a9654c6c8f7858ec4d287082297caa<SEP>chunk-fa94329119384e436889db983f1732d8<SEP>chunk-7796e9953e60bd3bb11c46251f992983<SEP>chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082", entity_id:"Spiritual Journey"}}] AS row
