Paragraph 2: \"The program incorporates these practices to support participants in exploring their inner landscape and developing a deeper understanding of themselves and their relationships with others", created_at:1779651845, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6<SEP>chunk-a10d491711164b21994f76ff0fb53caa<SEP>chunk-79727c38a2ca8d63adfca02ee83cd218<SEP>chunk-02c476f06b018b2911ffd93038b4567f", entity_id:"Processes"}}, {_id:1370, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"A salon where the stylist worked, providing hair services to clients.", created_at:1779144144, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Fancy Salon"}}, {_id:1371, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Individuals receiving hair services from the stylist, with whom she now connects deeply.", created_at:1779144144, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Clients"}}, {_id:1372, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779187754, description:"A stylist at a fancy salon who experienced a transformation in her work perspective after undergoing a process.<SEP>Former salon stylist who experienced a transformation in work perspective and emotional connection with clients after undergoing a process.<SEP>The stylist is a person who transformed her work through awakening to love, connects with clients, and launched earth-friendly products.", source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6<SEP>chunk-b14b79dd6088b9676b5e759c61265472<SEP>chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57", entity_id:"Stylist"}}, {_id:1373, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The emotional experience of joy felt by clients, such as a working mother after styling her hair.", created_at:1779144144, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"State of Joy"}}, {_id:1374, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A sense of self-assurance experienced by clients, like a teenager after a haircut for college.", created_at:1779144144, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Confidence"}}, {_id:1375, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Hair services performed by the stylist, transformed into acts of connection.", created_at:1779144145, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Coloring and Cutting Hair"}}, {_id:1376, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The intentional effort to create meaningful effects on others' lives through work.", created_at:1779144145, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Impact People"}}, {_id:1377, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Purposeful, loving actions aimed at positively impacting others, replacing survival-driven work.", created_at:1779144145, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Conscious Act of Love"}}, {_id:1378, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Physical danger denotes situations requiring immediate survival responses, such as escaping threats like predators.<SEP>Physical danger refers to life-threatening situations (e.g., facing predators) that historically triggered stress responses in humans.", created_at:1779217374, source_id:"chunk-91b2aa787cfc2f8f82f250a6e1012946<SEP>chunk-45a029373e612fccf7c03c14e620d14c", entity_id:"Physical Danger"}}, {_id:1379, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Enhanced productivity and effectiveness resulting from awakened interconnectedness.", created_at:1779144145, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6", entity_id:"Efficiency"}}, {_id:1380, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W2ZzApmqJmo)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Ancient times refers to historical periods where humans faced frequent life-threatening stressors.<SEP>Ancient times represent a period when survival mechanisms shaped the human brain's memory retention traits.<SEP>Ancient Times refers to early human history where survival depended on threat awareness and memory of dangers.<SEP>Ancient times are cited as the origin of spiritual and scientific death-related inquiries.<SEP>Ancient times are cited as the origin of spiritual and scientific death-related inquiries.", created_at:1779670978, source_id:"chunk-91b2aa787cfc2f8f82f250a6e1012946<SEP>chunk-4d55dfbe4972cfb9a0847506f1eaa432<SEP>chunk-729a868fcc915b32e3804866576c1ee4<SEP>chunk-8afdbda86ff5c184cd2f7d6fbf294ca1", entity_id:"Ancient Times"}}, {_id:1381, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8XASiz30oE)<SEP>YouTube Video: 9-NMv5E-18s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-NMv5E-18s)<SEP>YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)<SEP>YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqUq_a0DyLs)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"We need to parse the input. The user gave a description list in JSON format, each JSON object on a new line. The input is:<SEP>World is the location where depression is prevalent.<SEP>The world is the global context where the issues of hate, violence, and division occur.<SEP>The world's peace is linked to collective inner peace among individuals.<SEP>The World represents the broader environment and context in which individuals interact, encompassing both the external and internal realms.", created_at:1779736949, source_id:"chunk-ed3411d338194fc612909c3d7018f6a6<SEP>chunk-1131fb555cf5cb5c110e8720fad1eacd<SEP>chunk-8e03152ba26c428e5446f721ab8114a4<SEP>chunk-9d2a0ad692331733d51852934ce7b3f5<SEP>chunk-76ae728c8b06838498707d7f45c78764<SEP>chunk-6ec42cc6cebe26fa5a4c2948ec287d48<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-29839d6d7d0e5b2cd1270aaf6c732c38<SEP>chunk-52c5f3147f6ff09e1eb20afd47fa7a49<SEP>chunk-c9caee3e34754dd743fb5e0f90ac1a6b<SEP>chunk-d51e7d7fdd9bf5d32d4f076f7cdbb5be<SEP>chunk-7a50476fe3717f3e56d4d65eb5669d3f<SEP>chunk-a0a737121c6d2b4ce7ac662967a310aa<SEP>chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731<SEP>chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a<SEP>chunk-97418c51f26c4090e6f6b986b0a848a6<SEP>chunk-e32359164f62f64b8a0367195694bf0f<SEP>chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf<SEP>chunk-b4ecf7e4c6ac98b4463f375b4140f36f<SEP>chunk-9deb1452ed9eae4ab1315fc2eb8f47d0<SEP>chunk-135103709a97907be3b711741152d729<SEP>chunk-97a582a6bc26174c8bc3002eb473cbb9<SEP>chunk-c4d7f4af9b573478ba698a2b03258543<SEP>chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea", entity_id:"World"}}, {_id:1382, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Scott is a 32-year-old individual who is self-made and holds a high managerial position at his organization.<SEP>Scott is a self-made individual in a high managerial position who grapples with existential questions and undergoes personal transformation by letting go of anger and recognizing others' influence on his life.<SEP>Scott is a person who completed a course in India and experienced a shift in perception of purpose and connection.<SEP>Scott is mentioned as a reference point for those with more experience in the field.<SEP>Scott is a 32-year-old in a high managerial position who feels lost and questions his purpose in his organization.<SEP>Scott is a self-made man who felt lost but transformed his consciousness and rediscovered his sense of purpose.", created_at:1779187754, source_id:"chunk-5544939adb0270d35384808f93f43007<SEP>chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-2acd70e04c811fbe48a08cf9d14bef96<SEP>chunk-733de9dd05ca934b499c631de611275e<SEP>chunk-1796cb7b9f907d9fc5966ef158afc7a9<SEP>chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57", entity_id:"Scott"}}, {_id:1383, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The Earth-Friendly Products Line is a line of products launched by Scott, focusing on earth-friendly and sustainable items.", created_at:1779144166, source_id:"chunk-5544939adb0270d35384808f93f43007", entity_id:"Earth-Friendly Products Line"}}, {_id:1384, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"self-perception", truncate:"", description:"...\" uses \"Self-Made Identity\" as a keyword, but there's no entity for it. So that's a possible issue. If \"Self-Made Identity\" is a concept, it should be an entity. The original output didn't include it, so that's a missed entity.", created_at:1779144207, source_id:"chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57", entity_id:"Self-Made Identity"}}, {_id:1385, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: I6yC-aUQUvw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6yC-aUQUvw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"...\" is correct. But the original entity \"Three Questions\" is described as \"Existential questions...\", which is accurate.<SEP>Three rhetorical questions posed in the text: \"What happened to us? How have we become so disconnected? Why do we resist finding a little room to breathe?\" addressing themes of disconnection and priorities.", created_at:1779415229, source_id:"chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-c7379196e71801ae32380230fbd6d871", entity_id:"Three Questions"}}, {_id:1386, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779562102, description:"Scott's personal possession symbolizing his connection to his capabilities and loves.<SEP>Favorite car symbolizes Scott's attachment to personal possessions and capabilities.<SEP>The manager's favorite car, which he relies on instead of human connections.", source_id:"chunk-35066d143982984b9a29f99d425abcdb<SEP>chunk-1796cb7b9f907d9fc5966ef158afc7a9<SEP>chunk-fa94329119384e436889db983f1732d8", entity_id:"Favorite Car"}}, {_id:1387, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"His Team is an organization that supports Scott through various acts of assistance.", created_at:1779144238, source_id:"chunk-2acd70e04c811fbe48a08cf9d14bef96", entity_id:"His Team"}}] AS row
