I-Consciousness is a self-obsessed state of individual awareness characterized by self-centered thinking, destructive emotions like anger, fear, and discontent, and a desire to control or dominate. It generates harmful behaviors, limited self-perception, and is associated with negative energy or \"pollution.\" Contrasted with One-Consciousness, it represents a restricted form of awareness that can transform into collective consciousness energy through personal and communal shifts.", source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa<SEP>chunk-c6d1ac7b77c644cdbe0e473d070e10a0<SEP>chunk-a6edb23148812a00c784704ababdb3ee<SEP>chunk-18fa3a7d8837c4f0b21f7ce5e53f50b2<SEP>chunk-bcbe9d15ce49d684cccca9bf4b6bb70a<SEP>chunk-baf2b6300d9383f209a9838b89760571<SEP>chunk-0a965090c99c9c63ccbf84e7a2e66878<SEP>chunk-07bbbe415fc6ff4eb6e48c047d81efd5", entity_id:"I-Consciousness"}}, {_id:1467, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"One-consciousness represents a transformed state of awareness transcending self-obsession, associated with unity and higher understanding.<SEP>One-consciousness represents an expanded state of interconnectedness with self, others, nature, and the universe, marked by progressive self-expansion and holistic awareness.<SEP>One-consciousness is an expanding state of being where the sense of self increases and expands.<SEP>One-Consciousness is described as a unified state of awareness comprising three progressive planes: beautiful, transcendental, and enlightened states.<SEP>A unified state of awareness transcending individual identity, likened to exploring deep-sea beauties.<SEP>One-consciousness is an expanding state of being marked by deep connection with self, others, nature, and the universe. It generates harmony, intelligence, and transformative energy, enabling enlightenment.", created_at:1779187997, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa<SEP>chunk-c6d1ac7b77c644cdbe0e473d070e10a0<SEP>chunk-386e51b3b7144cbed3517afa02fbb181<SEP>chunk-a6edb23148812a00c784704ababdb3ee<SEP>chunk-18fa3a7d8837c4f0b21f7ce5e53f50b2<SEP>chunk-07bbbe415fc6ff4eb6e48c047d81efd5", entity_id:"One-Consciousness"}}, {_id:1468, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ancient myths from Eastern and Western traditions depict symbolic wars (e.g., gods vs. demons, light vs. darkness) that metaphorically represent internal consciousness conflicts.", created_at:1779144808, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa", entity_id:"Ancient Myths"}}, {_id:1469, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oalnb5-fHjY)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)<SEP>YouTube Video: RBb_3sgOgFY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RBb_3sgOgFY)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"Krishna and Satyabhama engage in a war against Narakasura to liberate beings from his torture.\"}<SEP>War is a concept encompassing historical conflicts characterized by violence, loss of life, and societal disruption.<SEP>War is discussed as a complex moral and strategic concept, often framed as a necessary act of self-defense to protect innocent citizens and uphold duty (Dharma).<SEP>War and human activities contribute to planetary destruction and biodiversity loss.<SEP>A state of armed conflict between nations or groups, addressed through the video's message.", created_at:1779726874, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa<SEP>chunk-f02b83f12f