ousness, particularly amplified through sacred spaces like Ekam.", created_at:1779188027, source_id:"chunk-7e637a18b58bf595a06a2db9ad36bf77<SEP>chunk-9d5ed1319932eeba02c60354b423c137", entity_id:"Cosmic Energies"}}, {_id:1506, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Very rare ground is the site where Ekam is constructed, described as a unique and rare location with special energetic properties.", created_at:1779145096, source_id:"chunk-7e637a18b58bf595a06a2db9ad36bf77", entity_id:"Very Rare Ground"}}, {_id:1507, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Ekam Abundance Festival is an annual event hosted at Ekam, built on principles challenging linear cause-effect assumptions in life.<SEP>Annual festival at Ekam focused on reversing linear cause-effect paradigms through non-local consciousness principles.<SEP>Ekam Abundance Festival is a spiritual event where participants experience transformative experiences and healing.<SEP>Ekam Abundance Festival is an event where participants experience transformations and awakenings, leading to overcoming addictions.<SEP>The Ekam Abundance Festival is a global sports competition featuring top athletes in track and field.<SEP>Ekam Abundance Festival is an event where the individual experienced a massive awakening of the heart and connected with his eldest son.", created_at:1779225177, source_id:"chunk-d4f348195cac29cb9f7fb85f914fa19c<SEP>chunk-9d5ed1319932eeba02c60354b423c137<SEP>chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-f3c9a2b1053591399fd7351098da3627<SEP>chunk-6924307324d5ba84e533d49dbdf29d98<SEP>chunk-c124eb457ddeb5ac1234d8e03a8dc522", entity_id:"Ekam Abundance Festival"}}, {_id:1508, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Ekam Enlightenment Festival is an annual event focused on spiritual awakening and oneness.<SEP>An annual global event where millions meditate collectively for world peace, organized by Ekam to promote enlightened states of consciousness.<SEP>Celebration of non-dual consciousness states and their impact on human collective awareness.<SEP>The Ekam Enlightenment Festival is a seven-day celebration held annually in December to guide participants through five classical enlightened states of consciousness through meditation and transformative experiences.`", created_at:1779188117, source_id:"chunk-d4f348195cac29cb9f7fb85f914fa19c<SEP>chunk-aa6df70374eb253c7ca1bd643516678c<SEP>chunk-9d5ed1319932eeba02c60354b423c137<SEP>chunk-68272ee7ebb0f34dcf88d287b8d9983d", entity_id:"Ekam Enlightenment Festival"}}, {_id:1509, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Awakened Consciousness is a state of heightened awareness that can be achieved through meditation at Ekam, enabling an impact on the human collective. It is also a concept representing enlightenment and serves as a solution to global challenges by fostering compassion and oneness.  

This state is characterized as enabling harmony with the world and functions as a powerful life movement. Moreover, awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.<SEP>Awakened consciousness is emphasized as the foundation for overcoming division and fostering understanding.", created_at:1779536296, source_id:"chunk-d4f348195cac29cb9f7fb85f914fa19c<SEP>chunk-136e0828d80d107f75974ede595c760a<SEP>chunk-49ad825cb7cba993a98976aa8215c0f0<SEP>chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290<SEP>chunk-122b26a4cc30222007d37133d11cda63", entity_id:"Awakened Consciousness"}}, {_id:1510, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The human collective represents the interconnected consciousness of humanity, influenced by Ekam's processes.", created_at:1779145153, source_id:"chunk-d4f348195cac29cb9f7fb85f914fa19c", entity_id:"Human Collective"}}, {_id:1511, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sacred healing energies refer to the earth's and universe's energies amplified by Ekam's architecture to uplift human consciousness.", created_at:1779145153, source_id:"chunk-d4f348195cac29cb9f7fb85f914fa19c", entity_id:"Sacred Healing Energies"}}, {_id:1512, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A powerful field at Ekam guides meditators into oneness and transcendental realms during processes.", created_at:1779145154, source_id:"chunk-d4f348195cac29cb9f7fb85f914fa19c", entity_id:"Powerful Field"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1513, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sacred laws are universal principles governing reality, including subatomic behavior where effect precedes cause.", created_at:1779145192, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1", entity_id:"Sacred Laws"}}, {_id:1514, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Men in gray suits symbolize traditional peacemaking efforts through political decisions like disarmament agreements.", created_at:1779145192, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1", entity_id:"Men in Gray Suits"}}, {_id:1515, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cross-border terrorism is cited as a challenge addressed through political peacemaking efforts.", created_at:1779145192, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1", entity_id:"Cross-Border Terrorism"}}, {_id:1516, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Peacemaking refers to the process of resolving conflicts and promoting peace, as discussed in the document.", created_at:1779145235, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884", entity_id:"Peacemaking"}}, {_id:1517, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-u6ZDfHdB54)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>YouTube Video: uNkgwv4dqEs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNkgwv4dqEs)<SEP>YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)<SEP>YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"Conflict refers to internal or external struggles, including opposing desires or directions.\"}", created_at:1779726849, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-caff4fa153aca65c602a6ac671b90d21<SEP>chunk-1f4f1bcfd84ca14411b1cd0d6255f42f<SEP>chunk-f75c5d6ff6cf90a0c79623ead0773fbc<SEP>chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-ce09b6c6a2ea185889fd9682aa9fd726<SEP>chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5<SEP>chunk-cdbfc6e200f4cd4487961cefed0a0954<SEP>chunk-a85ada8ef40f654a099ee00af9f2432f<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-08c5fbdcd35ed15300b9915ca1fced8a<SEP>chunk-122b26a4cc30222007d37133d11cda63<SEP>chunk-088b2986c8580178cc7f54a0f65ceaa7<SEP>chunk-8b53cedbcd4de86ef1b08281380f9428<SEP>chunk-07c1dc21c4027ac436f9a07ccf7cc636<SEP>chunk-28f74829653c4417f524f54649fb5c5d<SEP>chunk-c4d7f4af9b573478ba698a2b03258543", entity_id:"Conflict"}}, {_id:1518, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional or physical abuse is a form of conflict that individuals may experience, highlighting the need for peace.<SEP>Emotional or physical abuse refers to harmful experiences impacting individuals, fostering awareness of peace's value.", created_at:1779188026, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-caff4fa153aca65c602a6ac671b90d21", entity_id:"Emotional or Physical Abuse"}}, {_id:1519, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Division or separation refers to conflicts arising from personal or social divisions, impacting the pursuit of peace.<SEP>Division or separation describes personal or social fragmentation, highlighting the need for peace.", created_at:1779188026, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-caff4fa153aca65c602a6ac671b90d21", entity_id:"Division or Separation"}}, {_id:1520, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"other", truncate:"", description:"World leaders and mediators are entities traditionally associated with conflict resolution and peace efforts.<SEP>World leaders and mediators are figures traditionally associated with formal peacemaking efforts, though the text argues peace requires broader participation.", created_at:1779188026, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-caff4fa153aca65c602a6ac671b90d21", entity_id:"World Leaders and Mediators"}}, {_id:1521, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", created_at:1779520898, description:"Meditation for peace is a practice suggested in the document to foster inner peace and global harmony.<SEP>Meditation for peace is suggested as a collective practice to evolve human consciousness and reduce violence.`<SEP>Meditation focused on peace infuses the thought sphere of humanity with peacefulness, countering violence and anger.`", source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Meditation for Peace"}}, {_id:1522, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of the world transitioning toward peace is a goal discussed in the document.", created_at:1779145236, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884", entity_id:"World Moving Toward Peace"}}, {_id:1523, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: tOi1Ho5Kwhk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tOi1Ho5Kwhk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The external world represents the physical and social environment shaped by collective consciousness.<SEP>The external world is impacted by the individual's internal mental state.<SEP>The external world contains problems and challenges, but suffering is not a necessary response to them.<SEP>The realm of tangible reality and external outcomes, influenced by internal states like beautiful or suffering consciousness.<SEP>External world pertains to outward circumstances and material reality addressed by the Abundance Festival.<SEP>External world pertains to outward circumstances and material reality addressed by the Abundance Festival.<SEP>External world pertains to outward circumstances and material reality addressed by the Abundance Festival.", created_at:1779428640, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-aaa5c02ef780f417e1e3498aff83c60b<SEP>chunk-58262216b12d3a82c0194e2a972ecdde<SEP>chunk-0b9ac55d2cab188fc69b15917905c7be<SEP>chunk-ac6391e06ee1d9f0eaf83699fa502ac7", entity_id:"External World"}}, {_id:1524, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cultivated virtue refers to qualities developed through effort, contrasted with the innate state of peace.", created_at:1779145236, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884", entity_id:"Cultivated Virtue"}}, {_id:1525, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A peaceful external world is the desired outcome of individual and collective efforts toward peace.", created_at:1779145236, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884", entity_id:"Peaceful External World"}}, {_id:1526, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779663147, description:"Individual consciousness influences collective consciousness, affecting societal outcomes like war or peace.<SEP>Individual consciousness refers to personal awareness and experiences shaping one's perception of peace.<SEP>Individual consciousness steeped in conflict leads to global violence.", source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884<SEP>chunk-caff4fa153aca65c602a6ac671b90d21<SEP>chunk-4529c1884cd3f5e14f3ad9c161d86e76", entity_id:"Individual Consciousness"}}, {_id:1527, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"August is the month during which the Ekam World Peace Festival is held annually.", created_at:1779145277, source_id:"chunk-4e6b8198f0f9d175c647ec3cce9d4ad7", entity_id:"August"}}, {_id:1528, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Religious tolerance is a focus area of the collective meditation, emphasizing respect for diverse beliefs.", created_at:1779145277, source_id:"chunk-4e6b8198f0f9d175c647ec3cce9d4ad7", entity_id:"Religious Tolerance"}}, {_id:1529, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Peacemakers are individuals worldwide who participate in collective meditation during the Ekam World Peace Festival to promote peace.", created_at:1779145277, source_id:"chunk-4e6b8198f0f9d175c647ec3cce9d4ad7", entity_id:"Peacemakers"}}, {_id:1530, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Collective Meditation is a structured practice conducted during the festival to address aspects of peace, including religious tolerance and social harmony.", created_at:1779145277, source_id:"chunk-4e6b8198f0f9d175c647ec3cce9d4ad7", entity_id:"Collective Meditation"}}, {_id:1531, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779720857, description:"Edits made to fix transcription errors, including pluralization adjustments and sentence restructuring.<SEP>The process of fixing transcription errors by replacing phrases and adding punctuation.<SEP>The process of fixing transcription errors by replacing phrases and adding punctuation.<SEP>The process of fixing transcription errors by replacing phrases and adding punctuation.<SEP>The process of fixing transcription errors by replacing phrases and adding punctuation.<SEP>The correction involved changing \"the penguins the polar bears\" to \"penguins and polar bears\" for better accuracy.<SEP>The correction involved changing \"the penguins the polar bears\" to \"penguins and polar bears\" for better accuracy.", source_id:"chunk-ac963c80865bf4f33baf1d166cbe42de<SEP>chunk-883157a96b051a9c01b5808f02cc4271<SEP>chunk-e13b3b3dd6b43643b1596294c861a1aa<SEP>chunk-3ebec0a6bd0b8d4a56b71320d898bc4e<SEP>chunk-2c0832be01060a0787bff6232c9d283d<SEP>chunk-c32bf7fcfe6dd8d2fa78dd2f0cb30726", entity_id:"Correction"}}, {_id:1532, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Change from singular \"life\" to plural \"lives\" to correct grammatical agreement.", created_at:1779217246, source_id:"chunk-ac963c80865bf4f33baf1d166cbe42de", entity_id:"Pluralization Correction"}}] AS row
