, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: uNkgwv4dqEs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNkgwv4dqEs)<SEP>YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The festival at Akam Kshetra is a spiritual gathering where seekers move into Turiya.<SEP>The festival is a recurring event attended by the father and son, serving as a cultural and spiritual gathering.<SEP>Original incorrect term in the text that was later corrected to \"Limitless Field\".<SEP>The festival serves as a gathering aimed at transforming human consciousness by teaching participants to transcend suffering and contribute positively to collective awareness.<SEP>The festival serves as a gathering aimed at transforming human consciousness by teaching participants to transcend suffering and contribute positively to collective awareness.<SEP>Gathering aimed at teaching participants to live free of suffering and contribute positively to collective consciousness.", created_at:1779519729, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-94adc3d4525b736bf33ffd5d5752ec38<SEP>chunk-c7631ad5e3d35c705d34d256a37100ba<SEP>chunk-86b06c28798f4c4a7bd03b34bd895d71<SEP>chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e", entity_id:"Festival"}}, {_id:1648, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The dreamless deep sleep state, one of the four states of consciousness in yoga philosophy.<SEP>Nidra Avastha is a state of consciousness characterized by dreamless deep sleep.", created_at:1779147722, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-1685a3c1f2fe3dbf55dfa2a4eee6833c", entity_id:"Nidra Avastha"}}, {_id:1649, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A condition where lack of sleep negatively impacts bodily and mental energies.<SEP>Sleeplessness refers to a state of lack of sleep, which negatively impacts the body's subtle energies.", created_at:1779147722, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-1685a3c1f2fe3dbf55dfa2a4eee6833c", entity_id:"Sleeplessness"}}, {_id:1650, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state where awareness is aware of itself and all phenomena, described in the text.", created_at:1779147584, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4", entity_id:"Self-Aware State"}}, {_id:1651, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Turiya refers to a transcendent state of pure awareness in Advaita Vedanta philosophy.<SEP>Turiya is the transcendent state of pure awareness, surpassing waking, dreaming, and deep sleep.", created_at:1779147700, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-daee63fc8106d8a10a17ec73a8e7fc6b", entity_id:"Turiya"}}, {_id:1652, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Subtle energy governing immunity, strength, and vitality in the body.<SEP>Urges are subtle energies responsible for immunity, strength, and bodily functions.", created_at:1779147722, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-1685a3c1f2fe3dbf55dfa2a4eee6833c", entity_id:"Urges"}}, {_id:1654, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: tegTDWT3SDc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tegTDWT3SDc)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)<SEP>YouTube Video: cHAJiF2byzg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHAJiF2byzg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Prana is defined as the life force or vitality energy that underlies bodily functions and overall energy. It is also described as breath energy that governs physiological processes and vitality.

In yogic philosophy, Prana represents the vital energy present in the physical body. It is believed to enter the body during inhalation, where it cleanses and energizes cells. Through practices such as pranayama, Prana can be retained, influencing consciousness.

Beyond its physiological role, Prana is considered a mystical life force that can be manipulated during energy body work. It signifies not only vitality and energy levels but also the broader concept of life force in various spiritual contexts.<SEP>Ancient Sanskrit term for breath, considered the life force and sacred energy connecting all living beings.<SEP>Prana is the Sanskrit term for breath, representing life force and sacredness.<SEP>Prana refers to life force or spiritual energy, corrected from the misheard term \"Pyram.\"<SEP>A spiritual concept related to life force or energy, contrasted with physical limitations.<SEP>Domain-specific spiritual concept discussed in the video, misheard as \"Pyram\".", created_at:1779662114, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-daee63fc8106d8a10a17ec73a8e7fc6b<SEP>chunk-1685a3c1f2fe3dbf55dfa2a4eee6833c<SEP>chunk-aaeba0a2e3dac75ac3bf2d72063fa0eb<SEP>chunk-680dd7bb1c61258ea018e46f2177de41<SEP>chunk-e15affa7e924b9530baaf1cc0152bad4<SEP>chunk-3f9b4215b066d2d74445f8aa497138dc<SEP>chunk-7234398961838f3894f5b3cb8bdb630b<SEP>chunk-b32e50c1e5924b6f3ca08fb982fe71de<SEP>chunk-ecff7e1995c8cfd62a765753318d7dab<SEP>chunk-ccf8c615204507c39f3ca144b897ce7d", entity_id:"Prana"}}, {_id:1655, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779147722, description:"Subtle energy representing brilliance, intellectual ability, and radiance.<SEP>Tejas symbolizes radiance, clarity, and intellectual energy in the body, linked to mental sharpness.<SEP>Tejas represents brilliance, intellectual ability, and mental clarity.", source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-daee63fc8106d8a10a17ec73a8e7fc6b<SEP>chunk-1685a3c1f2fe3dbf55dfa2a4eee6833c", entity_id:"Tejas"}}, {_id:1656, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Historical practitioners who managed prolonged sleep deprivation through yogic techniques.<SEP>Ancient Yogis practiced breath fasting and yogic principles to master bodily and mental functions.", created_at:1779147947, source_id:"chunk-973b1f2ebeea7c21fa93382f4eedfdd4<SEP>chunk-9dee8f46d29882e9ac37655a29e4adbd", entity_id:"Ancient Yogis"}}] AS row
