...<SEP>Ugadi is a festival celebrated as the first day of the lunar calendar of Chaitra Masa, symbolizing new beginnings and cyclical renewal.<SEP>Ugadi is the New Year's Day in the Hindu lunisolar calendar, marked by cultural and religious observances.", created_at:1779519080, source_id:"chunk-a96284309a8df2d35afbd3fdb0e45ad7<SEP>chunk-80b6135a8c5f98aa06b34dde60b95f6b<SEP>chunk-b2060cce5c790369f1297fb5121e7ed9<SEP>chunk-27a4dfd2bd2512da5799c450f509330b<SEP>chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c<SEP>chunk-37d176f97b7ba2ae42fdf4ae41e9150e<SEP>chunk-4ab4bc9db393a14f0ecfea6c76d9e372<SEP>chunk-6b7fcb0be46e5dc8bc514960fa89b8be<SEP>chunk-61c739c46e4f6213506db20ff0e52508<SEP>chunk-6af3220a340f626ce621832ca3542da1<SEP>chunk-f34e8e10dbf92b5936295383ee0c7f10<SEP>chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87", entity_id:"Ugadi"}}, {_id:1680, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Immunity is the body's ability to resist disease, which can be enhanced by eating protein-rich foods. `", created_at:1779147949, source_id:"chunk-9dee8f46d29882e9ac37655a29e4adbd<SEP>chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Immunity"}}, {_id:1681, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779148082, description:"Vak Shakti represents the power of speech to manifest goals through truthful, joyful communication.<SEP>Vak shakti refers to the power of speech to manifest goals through truthful, joyful, and harmonious verbal expression.<SEP>Vak Shakti (power of speech) is a concept emphasizing the transformative potential of conscious verbal expression in spiritual practices.", source_id:"chunk-9dee8f46d29882e9ac37655a29e4adbd<SEP>chunk-2a50761feb8fad8d98aa8399b70c426c<SEP>chunk-29914f29d90ea749173faf5f8e44e499", entity_id:"Vak Shakti"}}, {_id:1682, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Solar Energy Flow refers to the physiological process aiding digestion when breath flows through nostrils.", created_at:1779147949, source_id:"chunk-9dee8f46d29882e9ac37655a29e4adbd", entity_id:"Solar Energy Flow"}}, {_id:1683, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779218247, description:"Gudi Bhadva is a domain-specific term that was misheard and needs correction.<SEP>Gudi Bhadva is a domain-specific term that was misheard as \"Gudi Padma\".<SEP>Gudi Bhadva is a festival observed in some regions, symbolizing the renewal of life and acceptance of all experiences.<SEP>Gudi Bhadva is a festival celebrated in parts of India, traditionally marking the New Year with cultural and religious observances.<SEP>Gudi Bhadva is a term used in the context of a cultural or religious celebration, previously referred to as \"Gudi Padma\" but corrected for consistency.", source_id:"chunk-a96284309a8df2d35afbd3fdb0e45ad7<SEP>chunk-12bed1be4bf6242f57b4ecc660b06100<SEP>chunk-27a4dfd2bd2512da5799c450f509330b<SEP>chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c<SEP>chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de", entity_id:"Gudi Bhadva"}}, {_id:1684, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqUq_a0DyLs)<SEP>YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779672559, description:"Entity Name: Homophones and misheard words

