Domain-specific names and terms are specialized spiritual terminology requiring accurate transcription, including names like Sri Preethaji, Sri Krishnaji, and concepts such as Ekam, Deeksha, Sadhana, Limitless Field, Ugadi, and Gudi Bhadva. This category focuses on correcting transcription errors and refining specialized terms within the spiritual domain to ensure precision in spiritual contexts.", source_id:"chunk-a96284309a8df2d35afbd3fdb0e45ad7<SEP>chunk-50f259044416b29784cc45b625bee372<SEP>chunk-86fb5c9368dde9170c4844b23678c8ad<SEP>chunk-8b875733f77c698a06c289ab42079023<SEP>chunk-40386efc054d2a63eab72a4be3e3ca8d<SEP>chunk-bec56b6242f0eca74d023780e327ea4a<SEP>chunk-01a665cc999ec2aa5c1057270e435616<SEP>chunk-c391a595a103c05727c9d5b88922a252<SEP>chunk-401f6e4a8020f9da8c11540192c40ac3<SEP>chunk-70ceef7ff7f990edee772d00621069d8<SEP>chunk-d280003ef7ab568a7c05f623b80e00e6<SEP>chunk-3241f766664a9ff72b39e5b760b67398", entity_id:"Domain-specific names and terms"}}, {_id:1686, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Eating provides proteins that form Antibodies to fight diseases.<SEP>Eating is mentioned as an activity where full engagement is often lacking.<SEP>Eating is mentioned as an activity where full engagement is often lacking.", created_at:1779676179, source_id:"chunk-9dee8f46d29882e9ac37655a29e4adbd<SEP>chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f", entity_id:"Eating"}}, {_id:1687, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Langanam Parama Avshadam is a principle that needs correction.<SEP>Langanam Parama Avshadam is a traditional Indian principle emphasizing fasting and balanced practices for holistic health.", created_at:1779148036, source_id:"chunk-da65d8513f47f315e294fdae16ca03d0<SEP>chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742", entity_id:"Langanam Parama Avshadam"}}, {_id:1688, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Fasting is described as the ultimate medicine.<SEP>Fasting refers to voluntary abstinence from food or specific foods, practiced for health benefits and self-healing.<SEP>Fasting is highlighted as a method for achieving mental, emotional, spiritual, and physical health, termed the \"ultimate medicine.\"<SEP>Fasting is a voluntary abstinence from food for health or spiritual purposes.", created_at:1779148145, source_id:"chunk-da65d8513f47f315e294fdae16ca03d0<SEP>chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742<SEP>chunk-69914c3739a9945b1b33a3476b78c932<SEP>chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Fasting"}}, {_id:1689, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Intermittent fasting is a dietary method involving periodic fasting intervals for metabolic and immune benefits.<SEP>Intermittent fasting is a dietary practice involving periodic abstinence from food.", created_at:1779148144, source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742<SEP>chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Intermittent Fasting"}}, {_id:1690, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Soup fasting restricts intake to liquid soups, balancing nutrition and digestive rest during fasting.<SEP>Soup fasting involves consuming only soup during fasting periods.", created_at:1779148144, source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742<SEP>chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Soup Fasting"}}, {_id:1691, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Protein intake supports immunity by providing essential immunoglobulins for disease resistance.", created_at:1779148036, source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742", entity_id:"Protein"}}, {_id:1692, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Water fasting involves consuming only water for a defined period to promote detoxification and healing.<SEP>Water fasting is a type of fasting where only water is consumed.", created_at:1779148144, source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742<SEP>chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Water Fasting"}}, {_id:1693, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Right nostril breath is linked to enhanced digestion and solar energy flow in Ayurvedic practices.", created_at:1779148036, source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742", entity_id:"Right Nostril Breath"}}, {_id:1694, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779164341, description:"Digestive fire refers to metabolic activity regulating hunger and efficient nutrient absorption.<SEP>Digestive Fire is a concept in Ayurveda referring to the body's ability to digest and process food, determining when one should eat.<SEP>Digestive fire is a concept in ancient Indian practices, signaling hunger and guiding when to eat.", source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742<SEP>chunk-b7b52be74b8fe2742a9e4d6ec70ae0ec<SEP>chunk-2d3e2b583a33b1dd3f28054d2d3f1c75", entity_id:"Digestive Fire"}}, {_id:1695, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779148144, description:"Eating Right is the third langanam in Langanam Parama Avshadam, focusing on proper dietary intake to support immunity and health.<SEP>Eating right involves consuming the appropriate amount of protein to enhance immunity through dietary intake.<SEP>Eating right emphasizes proper dietary habits to enhance health and immunity.", source_id:"chunk-5f95b172448640801fae7c555ba54742<SEP>chunk-2a50761feb8fad8d98aa8399b70c426c<SEP>chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Eating Right"}}, {_id:1696, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the given entity \"Animals\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are in plain text. We need to merge them into a single summary, in plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English. Must retain proper nouns.

