le_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The user has provided a strict set of rules for correction, including focusing on homophones, domain terms, and punctuation/capitalization.", created_at:1779217683, source_id:"chunk-a96284309a8df2d35afbd3fdb0e45ad7", entity_id:"Correction rules"}}, {_id:1707, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UZHSssZflFQ)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: idoWVpnJz-Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idoWVpnJz-Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FP5O9F9JiOk)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", created_at:1779721998, description:"The \"ancients in India\" are referenced as proponents of a simple principle related to health and well-being.<SEP>Ancient Indian sages or scholars who referred to consciousness as 'Chit' and contributed to the philosophical understanding of Chit Shakti.<SEP>The Ancients in India recognized five essential roles and attributes of a father in their cultural and philosophical traditions.<SEP>The ancients in India recognized five essential roles for a father, emphasizing his multifaceted contributions to a child's life.<SEP>The ancients in India are a group that observed and understood the life cycle and agricultural processes, as mentioned in the original text.<SEP>The ancients in India observed and conceptualized Karma through agricultural practices, linking actions to natural outcomes.<SEP>The ancients in India are referred to as proponents of philosophical teachings about karma and its mechanisms, particularly in the context of spiritual and moral law.", source_id:"chunk-69914c3739a9945b1b33a3476b78c932<SEP>chunk-47ff0b70c2d73a9b2c6fbe556ff0baf0<SEP>chunk-a0d6a357e4a9a2e2dd0c278e4793f48a<SEP>chunk-ed9bd777897b8b08ed12f0776796982a<SEP>chunk-295ff82e6931c82451b6f00c8154605e<SEP>chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9<SEP>chunk-e6bccf95254b72b0d63718f7708bb634", entity_id:"Ancients in India"}}, {_id:1708, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"These are the four aspects of health emphasized in the text as goals achievable through practicing langanams.", created_at:1779148102, source_id:"chunk-69914c3739a9945b1b33a3476b78c932", entity_id:"Mental, Emotional, Spiritual, and Physical Health"}}, {_id:1709, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Four Langanams refer to the four practices recommended for achieving holistic health, as mentioned in the text.<SEP>Four Langanams are a set of health practices including fasting food, mentioned in the context of maintaining overall well-being.", created_at:1779148123, source_id:"chunk-69914c3739a9945b1b33a3476b78c932<SEP>chunk-b7b52be74b8fe2742a9e4d6ec70ae0ec", entity_id:"Four Langanams"}}, {_id:1710, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Infections are health conditions that can result from improper eating habits, as mentioned in the text.", created_at:1779148123, source_id:"chunk-b7b52be74b8fe2742a9e4d6ec70ae0ec", entity_id:"Infections"}}, {_id:1711, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Infections are a negative outcome of improper eating.", created_at:1779148124, source_id:"chunk-b7b52be74b8fe2742a9e4d6ec70ae0ec", entity_id:"Health Consequences"}}, {_id:1712, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The four langanams provide a framework for health guidelines.", created_at:1779148124, source_id:"chunk-b7b52be74b8fe2742a9e4d6ec70ae0ec", entity_id:"Health Guidelines"}}, {_id:1713, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779148234, description:"Langanam refers to a fasting practice involving breath regulation and dietary discipline.<SEP>Langanam is a concept related to breath fasting and control of speech, as discussed in the YouTube video.<SEP>Langanam refers to a spiritual practice or concept discussed in the text, with a grammatical correction suggested.", source_id:"chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9<SEP>chunk-f9f0f6c35c8d39fc9be5729404f9c14d<SEP>chunk-e78849d328e3a33491b015a1e6ba7265", entity_id:"Langanam"}}, {_id:1714, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Engine serves as a metaphor for energy efficiency and metabolic processes.<SEP>An engine referenced in the phrase \"the more heat an engine produces,\" central to the grammatical discussion.<SEP>A mechanical device producing heat as discussed in the example sentence analyzed in the article and video.<SEP>An engine is a machine that converts energy into mechanical work, commonly associated with heat production.", created_at:1779148348, source_id:"chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9<SEP>chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e<SEP>chunk-16cb17d50adced4f0b0959b822d03a3e<SEP>chunk-791613ee96d428f562709fadee905618", entity_id:"Engine"}}, {_id:1715, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Heat production metaphorically relates to energy expenditure and metabolic processes.", created_at:1779148145, source_id:"chunk-8beba43872c2a4b73d69ad70815212d9", entity_id:"Heat Production"}}, {_id:1716, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)<SEP>YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Cells are described as engines that are powered by the intake of breath.<SEP>Biological units within organisms that communicate through biochemical processes involving enzymes and neuropeptides.<SEP>Cells communicate with each other through enzymes and neuropeptides, and a perfect state of communication is health.<SEP>Cells are biological components through which destructive emotions from past generations can be inherited and influence present emotions.<SEP>Cells are biological components mentioned in the context of synchronized power and bodily healing through Oneness consciousness.<SEP>Cells are discussed in the context of carrying generational information and uniqueness.", created_at:1779565423, source_id:"chunk-f9f0f6c35c8d39fc9be5729404f9c14d<SEP>chunk-6dd6f0aed7fea431a27783bb1609b0ed<SEP>chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719<SEP>chunk-9dcd575f5f6aeb9b5b2721f919d303c4<SEP>chunk-d89831c29a65e71a84017ad0bb3212c4<SEP>chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13", entity_id:"Cells"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1720, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vak shakti refers to the power of speech, which grows when one speaks truthfully and joyfully.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Vak shakti"}}, {_id:1721, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The divine being is mentioned in the context of fasting movement and chanting.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Divine being"}}, {_id:1722, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The third langanam is a principle or rule that involves controlling speech to avoid causing harm or pessimism.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Third langanam"}}, {_id:1723, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Sitting still is a method used in fasting movement to reduce restlessness.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Sitting still"}}, {_id:1724, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"This is a state that can be reduced by sitting still.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Restlessness in your body"}}, {_id:1725, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Fasting movement is defined by sitting still, observing breath, listening to nature, or chanting the divine being's name.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Fasting movement"}}, {_id:1726, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"This type of speech is to be avoided as per the third langanam.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Hurtful and pessimistic speech"}}, {_id:1727, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"This is the kind of speech that enhances vak shakti.", created_at:1779148209, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"True and joyful speech"}}, {_id:1728, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Observing breath is a method within fasting movement.", created_at:1779148210, source_id:"chunk-42e81b4f05e078ec2af83230faa7d66a", entity_id:"Observing breath"}}, {_id:1729, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"An engine\" is referenced in a sentence discussing heat production, with grammatical corrections applied.", created_at:1779148234, source_id:"chunk-e78849d328e3a33491b015a1e6ba7265", entity_id:"an engine"}}, {_id:1730, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Avshadam is a term in the original text later replaced with \"Deeksha\" to improve clarity.", created_at:1779148234, source_id:"chunk-e78849d328e3a33491b015a1e6ba7265", entity_id:"Avshadam"}}, {_id:1731, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Lankanas is the corrected plural form of \"langanam,\" reflecting a terminology adjustment in the text.", created_at:1779148234, source_id:"chunk-e78849d328e3a33491b015a1e6ba7265", entity_id:"lankanas"}}, {_id:1732, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"An engine\" is discussed in relation to heat production, with grammatical adjustments for accuracy.", created_at:1779148236, source_id:"chunk-e78849d328e3a33491b015a1e6ba7265", entity_id:"heat production"}}, {_id:1733, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The physical phenomenon of heat produced by an engine, central to the grammatical and technical debate.<SEP>A form of energy discussed in the context of engine output within the example sentence.", created_at:1779148305, source_id:"chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e<SEP>chunk-16cb17d50adced4f0b0959b822d03a3e", entity_id:"Heat"}}, {_id:1734, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Controversy surrounding the appropriate article (\"the\" or \"an\") in the context of the phrase, with conflicting arguments about grammatical correctness.<SEP>Article usage refers to the correct application of articles (an, a, the) in English grammar to form grammatically correct sentences.", created_at:1779148391, source_id:"chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e<SEP>chunk-8aa2f59e36f19c5d55a059a126d62dac", entity_id:"Article Usage"}}, {_id:1735, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779148348, description:"The grammatical concept of articles (\"the\" vs. \"an\") in the context of the phrase \"the more heat an engine produces,\" with conflicting arguments about correctness.<SEP>An article debated for its grammatical accuracy in describing the relationship between heat and engine output.<SEP>The article refers to a written piece discussing grammatical accuracy, specifically the correct use of articles with engines.", source_id:"chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e<SEP>chunk-16cb17d50adced4f0b0959b822d03a3e<SEP>chunk-791613ee96d428f562709fadee905618", entity_id:"Article"}}, {_id:1736, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Contested linguistic phrase analyzed in the YouTube video, with debates over article placement and grammatical validity.", created_at:1779148260, source_id:"chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e", entity_id:"Phrase \"the more heat an engine produces\""}}, {_id:1737, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ongoing discussion about correct article usage (\"the\" vs. \"an\") in the phrase \"the more heat an engine produces,\" focusing on grammatical accuracy and linguistic principles.", created_at:1779148260, source_id:"chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e", entity_id:"Grammatical Debate"}}, {_id:1738, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Specific grammatical structure of the phrase \"the more heat an engine produces,\" central to the debate over article usage and sentence construction.", created_at:1779148260, source_id:"chunk-802854365651bf3a642cd664c309c83e", entity_id:"Linguistic Structure"}}, {_id:1739, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The debated sentence \"the more heat an engine produces\" central to the grammatical discussion in the article and YouTube video.", created_at:1779148305, source_id:"chunk-16cb17d50adced4f0b0959b822d03a3e", entity_id:"The More Heat an Engine Produces"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1740, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Linguistic guidelines governing article usage (\"an\" vs. \"the\") in the example sentence.", created_at:1779148305, source_id:"chunk-16cb17d50adced4f0b0959b822d03a3e", entity_id:"Grammar Rule"}}, {_id:1741, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"\"The more heat an engine produces\" ? a sentence debated for its grammatical correctness in the article and video.", created_at:1779148305, source_id:"chunk-16cb17d50adced4f0b0959b822d03a3e", entity_id:"Example Sentence"}}, {_id:1742, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fdPQxZsPAwI)<SEP>YouTube Video: smrj15-QOAI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=smrj15-QOAI)<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Grammatical Error is a mistake in language that violates the rules of syntax, morphology, or punctuation, leading to awkward phrasing, incorrect subject?verb agreement, improper article usage, missing verbs, or sentence fragments. Such errors can disrupt the coherence of a text and affect readability. They may arise in articles, transcripts, videos, or any written material.

Specific examples include an article that misuses articles with engines, awkward phrasing such as ?We are not being capable? and ?how we manage our life,? and a correction from singular ?life? to plural ?lives.? Other issues involve an awkward phrasing with a misplaced colon and incorrect verb tense, and a subject?verb agreement error in the sentence ?Discrimination and separation is no matter how you show it,? where the compound subject requires a plural verb. Errors in the video?s text also appear, such as incorrect grammar and awkward phrasing, and broader categories like improper punctuation, missing verbs, or sentence fragments that disrupt text coherence.

The list of descriptions also notes duplicate entries for the subject?verb agreement issue, indicating that the same example appears twice. No conflicting information about distinct entities was identified; the variations are all within the same grammatical error context. Some descriptions also mention that grammatical errors can involve multiple types simultaneously, such as a combination of punctuation and missing verbs.

Overall, grammatical errors are defined by their capacity to impair clarity and flow, and they can manifest in various forms across different media, including articles, transcripts, and video text. Addressing these errors typically involves revising phrasing, correcting agreement, fixing punctuation, and ensuring proper verb usage to restore coherence.", created_at:1779735001, source_id:"chunk-791613ee96d428f562709fadee905618<SEP>chunk-ac963c80865bf4f33baf1d166cbe42de<SEP>chunk-6ccd1f5debd2817e69e48d59df4cdf36<SEP>chunk-576f10f06b7632e1972cb071c6564b42<SEP>chunk-c3bdf300b2509154604072df1057a411<SEP>chunk-c32bf7fcfe6dd8d2fa78dd2f0cb30726<SEP>chunk-8e15fc85d32ce342ec9c480484b3580f", entity_id:"Grammatical Error"}}, {_id:1743, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"\"the more heat an engine produces\" is the grammatically correct phrase.", created_at:1779148348, source_id:"chunk-791613ee96d428f562709fadee905618", entity_id:"Correct Phrase"}}, {_id:1744, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"\"the more heat, an engine produces\" is the incorrect phrase used in the article.", created_at:1779148348, source_id:"chunk-791613ee96d428f562709fadee905618", entity_id:"Incorrect Phrase"}}, {_id:1745, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Grammatical structure pertains to the arrangement of words in a sentence to create well-formed sentences, including the placement of articles.<SEP>The grammatical structure of the sentence is analyzed to correct the error.<SEP>The grammatical structure of the sentence is analyzed to correct the error.", created_at:1779724082, source_id:"chunk-8aa2f59e36f19c5d55a059a126d62dac<SEP>chunk-b9ba88cfef7cc3d89fa60742ba68dc94", entity_id:"Grammatical Structure"}}, {_id:1746, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Sentence correction involves modifying sentences to improve grammatical accuracy, such as adjusting article usage (an/a/the) for proper syntax.<SEP>A technique for refining sentence structure by addressing issues like run-on sentences, fragments, and unclear phrasing to enhance readability and meaning.", created_at:1779673109, source_id:"chunk-8aa2f59e36f19c5d55a059a126d62dac<SEP>chunk-e00176cad030937cceed8d9e04c9350c", entity_id:"Sentence Correction"}}, {_id:1747, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Sviya sakhyata encourages self-awareness and emotional observation to prevent depression through spiritual practices.`", created_at:1779148546, source_id:"chunk-a77f1fee05f090e6b596f48781d6d33a", entity_id:"Sviya Sakhyata (Friendship with Self)"}}, {_id:1748, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"natural_object", truncate:"", description:"Oxytocin is a neuropeptide released during prolonged loving touch, associated with bonding and emotional healing.`<SEP>Oxytocin is a hormone secreted by women during motherhood, fostering nurturing behavior and unconditional love for children.<SEP>Oxytocin is a hormone secreted by women during motherhood, fostering nurturing behavior and unconditional love for children.<SEP>A hormone naturally secreted by women, fostering intense maternal bonding and self-sacrificing love.<SEP>A hormone whose secretion is reduced by the mother's aggressive ambition, impacting bonding.", created_at:1779558323, source_id:"chunk-a77f1fee05f090e6b596f48781d6d33a<SEP>chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d<SEP>chunk-bdaca57c11a3d551259155ef196cf16d<SEP>chunk-4da1e45ca993decf20ec10e31d56d36e", entity_id:"Oxytocin"}}, {_id:1749, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Kathana emphasizes communal storytelling as a means to foster belonging and counteract loneliness, a precursor to depression.`", created_at:1779148546, source_id:"chunk-a77f1fee05f090e6b596f48781d6d33a", entity_id:"Kathana (Storytelling)"}}, {_id:1750, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779148669, description:"Yuktis are spiritual and neuroscience-based strategies to prevent depression, including storytelling, loving touch, and self-friendship.`<SEP>Yuktis are five strategies to prevent depression, combining spiritual wisdom and neuroscience as their foundation.<SEP>Yuktis are five methods or techniques that are presented as stoppers for depression, and they are described as powerful.", source_id:"chunk-a77f1fee05f090e6b596f48781d6d33a<SEP>chunk-f72535558ce867c4994087fd8e358aea<SEP>chunk-60c3c70200e066b81d62b44f1233373d", entity_id:"Yuktis"}}, {_id:1751, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Sneha sparshanam involves prolonged physical affection to release oxytocin, promoting bonding and emotional healing.`", created_at:1779148546, source_id:"chunk-a77f1fee05f090e6b596f48781d6d33a", entity_id:"Sneha Sparshanam (Loving Touch)"}}, {_id:1752, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Kathana (storytelling) is the first Yukti, emphasizing communal storytelling traditions and connection to the divine.", created_at:1779148634, source_id:"chunk-f72535558ce867c4994087fd8e358aea", entity_id:"Kathana"}}, {_id:1753, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sannidhi refers to the practice of connecting to the universe or the divine through storytelling, as part of the Kathana Yukti.", created_at:1779148634, source_id:"chunk-f72535558ce867c4994087fd8e358aea", entity_id:"Sannidhi"}}, {_id:1754, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual wisdom underpins the Yuktis, emphasizing universal human experiences and cosmic connection.", created_at:1779148634, source_id:"chunk-f72535558ce867c4994087fd8e358aea", entity_id:"Spiritual Wisdom"}}, {_id:1755, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Neuroscience provides scientific basis for the Yuktis, explaining mental processes and depression mechanisms.", created_at:1779148634, source_id:"chunk-f72535558ce867c4994087fd8e358aea", entity_id:"Neuroscience"}}, {_id:1756, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Breathing Exercises involve deep inhalation and exhalation to calm the mind and facilitate sleep, as part of the Yuktis.", created_at:1779148636, source_id:"chunk-f72535558ce867c4994087fd8e358aea", entity_id:"Breathing Exercises"}}, {_id:1758, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Gudi Padma is a specific term that was left uncorrected.<SEP>Gudi Padma is a festival celebrated by the dians, mentioned alongside Ugadi as part of cultural observances.", created_at:1779218059, source_id:"chunk-c77adc402edc6371084db858a52c3f14<SEP>chunk-b2060cce5c790369f1297fb5121e7ed9<SEP>chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c<SEP>chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de", entity_id:"Gudi Padma"}}, {_id:1759, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Antriyamin is a specific term that was left uncorrected.<SEP>Antriyamin is a domain-specific term that requires correction to its standard spelling.<SEP>The Divine presence described as existing within all hearts, central to meditation and spiritual connection.<SEP>Antriyamin is a term representing the Divine, commonly transliterated without diacritical marks for simplicity and widespread recognition.", created_at:1779218247, source_id:"chunk-c77adc402edc6371084db858a52c3f14<SEP>chunk-12bed1be4bf6242f57b4ecc660b06100<SEP>chunk-b2060cce5c790369f1297fb5121e7ed9<SEP>chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de", entity_id:"Antriyamin"}}, {_id:1760, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: r_l2RNcSPPA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqUq_a0DyLs)<SEP>YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779656487, description:"<think>
