UNWIND [{_id:1761, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ypG1mlekNY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779240317, description:"divine is a term used in the method to refer to a higher power or a spiritual entity, and it is used in the context of offering and asking.<SEP>A transcendent or spiritual reality beyond the physical world.<SEP>Divine is a concept mentioned as a source of courage and a friend in the text.<SEP>divine refers to a supernatural force that opened Ekam's heart and revealed his son's loneliness.<SEP>divine represents a spiritual entity or energy emphasized in the text.<SEP>divine is a key term repeatedly mentioned in the text, signifying a central thematic element or concept.<SEP>divine is a key term repeatedly mentioned in the text, signifying its importance in the discussed context.", source_id:"chunk-60c3c70200e066b81d62b44f1233373d<SEP>chunk-264fb8cd6c5c93babb84a7f63f71ecc5<SEP>chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-a00a616ea914a3f9cb6efa32114cd948<SEP>chunk-37d176f97b7ba2ae42fdf4ae41e9150e<SEP>chunk-150d1802c7f2f9f844e7a7ed9bbbcaa8<SEP>chunk-7c8195207887687ae475450be6514d9b", entity_id:"divine"}}, {_id:1763, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Birth and death are framed as cyclical experiences within human life, often institutionalized in hospitals according to the text.", created_at:1779217951, source_id:"chunk-cdb6ddc2b47b984a3a935456e27dbbae", entity_id:"Birth And Death"}}, {_id:1765, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Health and ill health are described as natural fluctuations within life's cycles, impacting human well-being.", created_at:1779217951, source_id:"chunk-cdb6ddc2b47b984a3a935456e27dbbae", entity_id:"Health And Ill Health"}}, {_id:1766, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779255762, description:"Hamsa Soham is a mantra referenced in the text, maintained in its correct form as per the source.<SEP>Hamsa Soham is a spiritual or conceptual term repeatedly invoked in the transcript, possibly representing a mantra or a state of being.<SEP>Hamsa Soham is a person associated with the repeated phrase \"He comes Hamsa Soham\" in a YouTube video.<SEP>Hamsa Soham is a spiritual mantra or phrase repeated in the text, associated with a sense of arrival or presence.<SEP>A phrase used in the chant, potentially a mantra or spiritual term, repeated throughout the transcription.<SEP>Hamsa Soham is a repeated phrase in the text, analyzed as part of the content correction process.<SEP>Hamsa Soham is a phrase repeated in the chant, possibly indicating a spiritual or ritualistic concept.", source_id:"chunk-cdb6ddc2b47b984a3a935456e27dbbae<SEP>chunk-caa85f32ffc0c3a29fe33b1e490f121c<SEP>chunk-4141763ab2bb39a8620a4f109e7ecc7b<SEP>chunk-f02d58016cb210cdabb5a0e4e34489b9<SEP>chunk-863f9e536320fb607179b5b22c477c8c<SEP>chunk-41070a47242b017794bd4b01d9403428<SEP>chunk-60aa7e0f613ad00996175e977fb3fc07", entity_id:"Hamsa Soham"}}, {_id:1767, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779218136, description:"Human life is characterized by cyclical movements encompassing contrasting states like order/disorder.<SEP>Cyclical Movement is a concept describing repetitive patterns in natural and human systems, such as cosmic and biological processes.<SEP>A concept describing movement in cycles, corrected from \"moves in cycles\" in the input text.", source_id:"chunk-cdb6ddc2b47b984a3a935456e27dbbae<SEP>chunk-0c7f86b942d7f89bb8ff0cf5ae6c0035<SEP>chunk-35442728b17ce6c92b86dbe8515489b2", entity_id:"Cyclical Movement"}}, {_id:1768, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ekam Mantra is presented as a spiritual concept central to the text's themes.", created_at:1779217975, source_id:"chunk-cdb6ddc2b47b984a3a935456e27dbbae", entity_id:"Spiritual Concept"}}, {_id:1769, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The epidemic represents a global health crisis that necessitates societal cooperation for containment and mitigation.<SEP>An epidemic affecting a population over one billion, prompting calls for global solidarity and stillness.", created_at:1779218059, source_id:"chunk-80b6135a8c5f98aa06b34dde60b95f6b<SEP>chunk-b2060cce5c790369f1297fb5121e7ed9", entity_id:"Epidemic"}}, {_id:1770, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Gudi Padva is a festival marking the New Year in the Marathi calendar, symbolizing the cyclical nature of life and renewal.", created_at:1779218003, source_id:"chunk-80b6135a8c5f98aa06b34dde60b95f6b", entity_id:"Gudi Padva"}}, {_id:1771, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779675447, description:"Stillness refers to a state of calm and introspection, encouraged during the current global situation to foster inner growth.<SEP>Describes inner calm amidst life's noise as a hallmark of enlightenment.<SEP>Describes inner calm amidst life's noise as a hallmark of enlightenment.<SEP>Stillness is a state of calm and quietude achieved through awareness.", source_id:"chunk-80b6135a8c5f98aa06b34dde60b95f6b<SEP>chunk-922e23e61222fa7ebaae80af23f09b19<SEP>chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"Stillness"}}, {_id:1772, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Seva signifies selfless service, particularly relevant in containing the epidemic through collective responsibility.<SEP>Seva is a term in Indian philosophy referring to selfless service or compassionate action for the benefit of others.", created_at:1779218207, source_id:"chunk-80b6135a8c5f98aa06b34dde60b95f6b<SEP>chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c", entity_id:"Seva"}}, {_id:1773, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Dians are described as a population over one billion facing an epidemic, encouraged to celebrate festivals and meditate.", created_at:1779218059, source_id:"chunk-b2060cce5c790369f1297fb5121e7ed9", entity_id:"Dians"}}, {_id:1775, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Electrons are subatomic particles orbiting atomic nuclei, integral to atomic structure and chemical interactions.", created_at:1779218097, source_id:"chunk-0c7f86b942d7f89bb8ff0cf5ae6c0035", entity_id:"Electrons"}}, {_id:1776, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The nucleus is the central part of an atom, containing protons and neutrons, around which electrons orbit.", created_at:1779218097, source_id:"chunk-0c7f86b942d7f89bb8ff0cf5ae6c0035", entity_id:"Nucleus"}}, {_id:1777, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"family is mentioned as a group that is affected by depression, and it is used in the context of the stoppers for depression.<SEP>Family represents the unit of togetherness and sacredness in the context of the blessing.<SEP>family background influences an individual's stress response patterns and behavioral tendencies.<SEP>Family becomes beautiful when individuals transition to One Consciousness, reflecting harmony and unity.<SEP>A social unit where harmony, connection, and purpose are experienced when in the state of oneness.", created_at:1779648084, source_id:"chunk-60c3c70200e066b81d62b44f1233373d<SEP>chunk-b064115910fcd1227cf02905073a96e1<SEP>chunk-38046723cd74f27b125edb0953caff31<SEP>chunk-3a0add62a70895b5ac3db1f7977a8549<SEP>chunk-be5f080de6d70d3597be3fed655ffb6c<SEP>chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2<SEP>chunk-09bf0a07734e74605b4d135353c1c8b6", entity_id:"family"}}, {_id:1778, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aDQhPZUnDqA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Saptapadi is a domain-specific term for a seven-promise ceremony in a relationship, with correct spelling and alternative forms like \"Saat Fere\".<SEP>Saptapadi is a domain-specific term related to the ceremony.<SEP>Saptapadi is a key domain-specific term with spelling variations (\"Sapthapadi\") requiring standardization.<SEP>Saptapadi is a term that requires standardization from \"Sapthapadi\" to ensure consistency in terminology.<SEP>Saptapadi is a term requiring standardizat