s the final chakra before full Kundalini awakening, linked to self-expression and truth.", created_at:1779150280, source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047", entity_id:"Throat Chakra"}}, {_id:1843, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)<SEP>YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779552306, description:"Practitioners experience Kundalini fluctuations and must navigate blocks during spiritual ascension.<SEP>The practitioner performing the meditation, referred to as \"you\" in the text, who visualizes connections and abundance.", source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047<SEP>chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1<SEP>chunk-4c6054ccc3bee7f9d86c600fc50b5dc7", entity_id:"Practitioner"}}] AS row
