The ACAM Abundance Festival is a spiritual event focused on actualizing concepts of wealth and consciousness through abundance consciousness and wealth creation teachings. It is described as a global festival where these principles are emphasized and put into practice, serving as a platform for integrating spiritual and practical approaches to prosperity. The event is", source_id:"chunk-ccfc9de0cdb366c2facd9b971eb19ab0<SEP>chunk-2baff9ff7ae96c7443216aa06ccb2687<SEP>chunk-71510604a44bc705b1a00eb06fb8c047<SEP>chunk-57f3f1da68619bd5db8224c6378fdf46<SEP>chunk-e35dd83b9f6f21495051421d4dd6fc35<SEP>chunk-b9f36968ebf7bca3d8efa72e74d0fd0d<SEP>chunk-862528746f60f5678c41b67748425947<SEP>chunk-3cf67bb7dd92ee291f3034c55c2bac9c<SEP>chunk-674c0b6869a2ec7b481f591d80662e39<SEP>chunk-cc573a1ed7984ac5ddefcc442d2f95bf", entity_id:"ACAM Abundance Festival"}}, {_id:1896, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual art of wealth creation refers to the principles and practices for generating enduring prosperity.<SEP>Spiritual Art of Wealth Creation is a concept related to the spiritual aspects of generating wealth.<SEP>Spiritual art of wealth creation refers to the principles and practices for generating wealth through spiritual awareness.<SEP>Spiritual Art of Wealth Creation is a philosophical framework for aligning consciousness with wealth manifestation.", created_at:1779152982, source_id:"chunk-ccfc9de0cdb366c2facd9b971eb19ab0<SEP>chunk-2baff9ff7ae96c7443216aa06ccb2687<SEP>chunk-3cf67bb7dd92ee291f3034c55c2bac9c<SEP>chunk-cc573a1ed7984ac5ddefcc442d2f95bf", entity_id:"Spiritual Art of Wealth Creation"}}, {_id:1897, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779152982, description:"Spiritual science of wealth creation is a systematic approach to wealth creation rooted in consciousness.<SEP>Spiritual Science of Wealth Creation is a concept outlining the scientific principles behind wealth creation.<SEP>The spiritual science of wealth creation is essential for learning and evolving into abundance consciousness.<SEP>Spiritual science of wealth creation is described as knowledge essential for humans to learn and evolve into for wealth creation.<SEP>Spiritual Science of Wealth Creation refers to systematic principles for wealth creation through spiritual awareness.", source_id:"chunk-ccfc9de0cdb366c2facd9b971eb19ab0<SEP>chunk-2baff9ff7ae96c7443216aa06ccb2687<SEP>chunk-862528746f60f5678c41b67748425947<SEP>chunk-3cf67bb7dd92ee291f3034c55c2bac9c<SEP>chunk-cc573a1ed7984ac5ddefcc442d2f95bf", entity_id:"Spiritual Science of Wealth Creation"}}, {_id:1898, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hands symbolize action or energy flow in the context of nurturing consciousness for wealth.<SEP>Hands metaphorically represent the transient nature of material wealth retention.", created_at:1779152340, source_id:"chunk-ccfc9de0cdb366c2facd9b971eb19ab0<SEP>chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9", entity_id:"Hands"}}, {_id:1899, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Earth-consciousness enables individuals to become heart leaders attracting enduring wealth.<SEP>A heart leader is an individual transformed by compassion, capable of guiding others toward embracing diversity.", created_at:1779666082, source_id:"chunk-ccfc9de0cdb366c2facd9b971eb19ab0<SEP>chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4", entity_id:"Heart Leader"}}, {_id:1900, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ugadi or Gudi Bhadva symbolizes life's wholeness and acceptance of all experiences.", created_at:1779218178, source_id:"chunk-27a4dfd2bd2512da5799c450f509330b", entity_id:"Ugadi or Gudi Bhadva"}}, {_id:1901, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ekanta (solitude) is a practice followed by Tapatis for spiritual focus.<SEP>Ekanta refers to the practice of solitude or seclusion, central to the Tapatis' spiritual discipline.", created_at:1779152458, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c<SEP>chunk-e485856c846e316df06cb23fc5d1ca15", entity_id:"Ekanta"}}, {_id:1902, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Swayambhu refers to self-manifested sculptures emerging naturally from the earth.", created_at:1779152180, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c", entity_id:"Swayambhu"}}, {_id:1903, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Tapatis are described as individuals who enter altered states of consciousness for spiritual creation.<SEP>Tapatis are practitioners who follow Ekanta and engage in Tapas, seeking spiritual enlightenment through solitude and divine connection.", created_at:1779152458, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c<SEP>chunk-e485856c846e316df06cb23fc5d1ca15", entity_id:"Tapatis"}}, {_id:1904, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The gods of Hinduism are described as concealing secrets in their forms.", created_at:1779152183, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c", entity_id:"Gods of Hinduism"}}, {_id:1905, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Chants and prayers are part of the Tapatis' spiritual practices for divine guidance.", created_at:1779152183, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c", entity_id:"Chants and Prayers"}}, {_id:1906, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The current crisis is referenced in the video's discussion about wealth and consciousness.", created_at:1779152183, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c", entity_id:"Current Crisis"}}, {_id:1907, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mola Viran is described as the central deity of the temple and the form of the deity held by the stone.<SEP>Mola Viran represents the form of the deity held within a sacred stone, symbolizing divine manifestation.", created_at:1779152458, source_id:"chunk-1d93dc520a0588d5566528e75d99011c<SEP>chunk-e485856c846e316df06cb23fc5d1ca15<SEP>chunk-16d47febfdf4ea34c291088fcb018b9f", entity_id:"Mola Viran"}}, {_id:1908, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Indians collectively represent the population of India, referenced in the context of epidemic containment efforts.", created_at:1779218207, source_id:"chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c", entity_id:"Indians"}}, {_id:1910, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Tapas is a concept involving periods of spiritual practice, during which the Divine form is revealed.<SEP>Tapas denotes a period of intense spiritual austerity and focus, during which Tapatis undergo rigorous practices.", created_at:1779152458, source_id:"chunk-1d93dc520a0588d5566528e75d99011c<SEP>chunk-e485856c846e316df06cb23fc5d1ca15", entity_id:"Tapas"}}, {_i