e", entity_id:"Movement and Rush"}}, {_id:1919, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The earth goddess is a deity associated with prosperity and sustenance, explicitly linked to Vasudha in the narrative.", created_at:1779152247, source_id:"chunk-9b565339d56c09f532ad6cd52561f8d6", entity_id:"earth goddess"}}, {_id:1921, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vasudha is an alternative name for the earth goddess, symbolizing prosperity and sustenance.", created_at:1779152247, source_id:"chunk-9b565339d56c09f532ad6cd52561f8d6", entity_id:"Vasudha"}}, {_id:1923, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stillness and togetherness with family are concepts emphasized in the context of meditation and future celebration.", created_at:1779218247, source_id:"chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de", entity_id:"Stillness and Togetherness"}}, {_id:1924, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Happy Again represents a state of joy or contentment in the future, explicitly mentioned in the context of celebrating movement and rush alongside present stillness.<SEP>A phrase corrected to have proper capitalization, changing from \"happy again.\" to \"Happy again.\" in the text.", created_at:1779218291, source_id:"chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de<SEP>chunk-ad83a42d4454f2529f372618bda5e249", entity_id:"Happy Again"}}, {_id:1925, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Bhudevi is another interconnected aspect of the divine, representing another facet of the same unified divine principle.<SEP>Bhudevi represents an earthly or foundational consciousness linked to nurturing and sustaining prosperity.", created_at:1779152339, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9", entity_id:"Bhudevi"}}, {_id:1926, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The creation of the earth goddess refers to the collective existence and interconnectedness of all elements within her domain.", created_at:1779152278, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b", entity_id:"Creation of the Earth Goddess"}}, {_id:1927, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1gF90_cBl4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", created_at:1779246679, description:"A beetle is a natural entity contributing to the thriving of the rest of creation.<SEP>Beetles contribute actively to the thriving of other life forms.<SEP>A beetle is part of the creations of the Earth, embodying the universal \"tune\" through its existence.", source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-5be4ab3ffc3d58a2d8190326819f706c<SEP>chunk-d55433c844408160c1f2461994f2e753", entity_id:"Beetle"}}, {_id:1928, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The earth goddess is a personification of a state of consciousness, symbolizing the interconnectedness of all creation.", created_at:1779152278, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b", entity_id:"Earth Goddess"}}, {_id:1929, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sri Devi is described as an interconnected aspect of the divine, representing one facet of a unified divine principle.", created_at:1779152278, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b", entity_id:"Sri Devi"}}, {_id:1930, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1gF90_cBl4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A shrub is a natural entity contributing to the thriving of the rest of creation.<SEP>A shrub is part of the creations of the Earth, embodying the universal \"tune\" through its existence.", created_at:1779246680, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-d55433c844408160c1f2461994f2e753", entity_id:"Shrub"}}, {_id:1931, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-u6ZDfHdB54)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1gF90_cBl4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"natural_object", truncate:"", created_at:1779659819, description:"A bee is a natural entity contributing to the thriving of the rest of creation.<SEP>An insect mentioned in the corrected textual context.<SEP>Bees contribute actively to the thriving of other life forms.<SEP>A bee is part of the creations of the Earth, embodying the universal \"tune\" through its existence.<SEP>Bee is a natural object referenced in the context of Mother Earth.", source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-42408707c5d0317901f331fccaa3c6ec<SEP>chunk-5be4ab3ffc3d58a2d8190326819f706c<SEP>chunk-d55433c844408160c1f2461994f2e753<SEP>chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01", entity_id:"Bee"}}, {_id:1932, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1gF90_cBl4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)<SEP>YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Entity Name: Tree

Description List:<SEP>A tree observed by the entrepreneur during his enlightened state, symbolizing the dissolution of ego boundaries.<SEP>A tree observed by the entrepreneur during his post-initiation experience, triggering a sense of oneness.", created_at:1779665974, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-d55433c844408160c1f2461994f2e753<SEP>chunk-075b8e71a3c71d11c785be4bbfe965ed<SEP>chunk-b85547a9c5ce2c1aff2a86073a2bcb87<SEP>chunk-cd11c060af63780157ebf40717dc0fe2<SEP>chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28<SEP>chunk-e94d81180e7457d6f36d99965cfbf34d<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b<SEP>chunk-fd5ce10ac8b9d8fd71b9d99f866818d3<SEP>chunk-6d16539213ab1e4cb0268da2ab5977c1<SEP>chunk-f911f447e8921c9205ec53996cfbe423<SEP>chunk-56da25e7d132b4ecea54c551b7809f75<SEP>chunk-e5d8a73bfe09b1e5fab115705dfa0fe7<SEP>chunk-46d6abd520d390d99cea37e408f7a403<SEP>chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-ade616c2567b32dc9ebbc4ced1ffc773", entity_id:"Tree"}}, {_id:1933, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A willow is a natural entity contributing to the thriving of the rest of creation.<SEP>A tree mistakenly included in a list of insects and plants, likely due to a transcription error.", created_at:1779152312, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc", entity_id:"Willow"}}, {_id:1934, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A spider is a natural entity contributing to the thriving of the rest of creation.", created_at:1779152278, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b", entity_id:"Spider"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:1935, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w1gF90_cBl4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", created_at:1779246680, description:"A vine is a natural entity contributing to the thriving of the rest of creation.<SEP>The vine represents hope, which is fragile and eroded over time by external factors.<SEP>A vine is part of the creations of the Earth, embodying the universal \"tune\" through its existence.", source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b<SEP>chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8<SEP>chunk-d55433c844408160c1f2461994f2e753", entity_id:"Vine"}}, {_id:1936, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"Antriy?min\" is simplified to \"Antriyamin\" to align with common transliteration practices.", created_at:1779218270, source_id:"chunk-5c9875e9473ebfe7d72af1ccccd742de", entity_id:"Antriy?min"}}, {_id:1937, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Wealth creators are individuals or entities involved in generating wealth, discussed in the context of inclusivity.<SEP>Individuals or leaders involved in creating wealth, requiring fundamental shifts in behavior.", created_at:1779420212, source_id:"chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc<SEP>chunk-2e64ecd5baa03b517e5215b8fbc577e4", entity_id:"Wealth Creator"}}, {_id:1938, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A philosophical concept where all beings and wealth creators are integral to life's flourishing.", created_at:1779152312, source_id:"chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc", entity_id:"Narrative of the Flourishing of Life"}}, {_id:1939, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chanchala is an epithet describing Lakshmi's characteristic of being easily leaving or wandering away, as in \"She who can easily leave you and wander away, and is called Chanchala.\"<SEP>A term associated with a sentence fragment describing someone who can \"easily leave you and wander away,\" connected to readability improvements.", created_at:1779152387, source_id:"chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc<SEP>chunk-a11c112e105d6254fe79f88881c975e6", entity_id:"Chanchala"}}, {_id:1940, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A transcription error noted in the text, where \"The?The?The\" is identified as a mistake.", created_at:1779218291, source_id:"chunk-ad83a42d4454f2529f372618bda5e249", entity_id:"The?The?The"}}, {_id:1941, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=46g5U6v3SGc)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Corrected to \"Happy again.\" with proper capitalization.", created_at:1779218293, source_id:"chunk-ad83a42d4454f2529f372618bda5e249", entity_id:"happy again."}}, {_id:1942, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The willow is a tree mistakenly included in the list, likely a transcription slip.", created_at:1779152314, source_id:"chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc", entity_id:"List of Insects and Plants"}}, {_id:1943, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"All beings are part of the narrative, including those who work with wealth creators.", created_at:1779152314, source_id:"chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc", entity_id:"Beings"}}, {_id:1944, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Embracing inclusivity leads wealth creators to nurture the whole through their actions.", created_at:1779152314, source_id:"chunk-a20cdc5ec963420afa2e1d88b5539cdc", entity_id:"Inclusive Actions"}}, {_id:1945, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779188629, description:"Luck is presented as a finite resource that can be exhausted, contrasting with conscious awareness.<SEP>Reliance on chance due to indecision.<SEP>Luck is described as a phenomenon the man can create through heightened awareness and consciousness.", source_id:"chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-035b6c44730bb7cdf05bfef04ef27b03<SEP>chunk-890ca3741fc1ec113b793f3ce221523d", entity_id:"Luck"}}, {_id:1946, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shri Devi is a deity associated with divine authority and cosmic balance in the context of wealth and prosperity.", created_at:1779152339, source_id:"chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9", entity_id:"Shri Devi"}}, {_id:1947, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: K-AFDVOkIoE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Crisis is a period of intense difficulty, trouble, or danger, often characterized by anxiety and panic, and can be a critical situation that may develop gradually or strike suddenly.

It is also described as a time when wealth rapidly diminishes from human hands, reflecting instability in economic structures. In the context of global finance, a crisis manifests as an economic downturn that leads to job losses, diminished savings, and company devaluation, while also exposing the fragility and vulnerability of financial systems, as exemplified by the impact of a virus. These economic dimensions highlight how a crisis can erode financial security and create widespread instability.

Beyond economic implications, crisis serves as a context for personal growth, where individuals can leverage challenges to rise higher in life.

It is also framed as a period of instability or challenge that is contextualized within spiritual evolution and planetary sustainability, suggesting that crises can be opportunities for transformation and broader ecological awareness.

Overall, crisis is a complex and dynamic condition that simultaneously presents severe challenges and potential for growth, affecting individuals, economies, and even planetary systems.<SEP>A global crisis arises from humanity's unwise signals, environmental destruction, and fear.", created_at:1779663974, source_id:"chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-969db65cd4de00b6ac88dc7de2088f7a<SEP>chunk-56d49489b1f42f899d9566a254886c2c<SEP>chunk-bb8776e3af3003e2566aad28f28875b7<SEP>chunk-7c8c081356f803e6e944675013e90777<SEP>chunk-0de990c9c98448c49e9565dc513c171a<SEP>chunk-28a9278165fe13a505446b814c02e9dc<SEP>chunk-1858c31999fe39fe76b1a067f13f934d<SEP>chunk-b1e9b7eb495ce02a274d514dffa406f5<SEP>chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a", entity_id:"Crisis"}}, {_id:1948, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: oXRZhJTHuOA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oXRZhJTHuOA)<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Money is an entity that functions as a material manifestation of wealth, vulnerable to depletion, and serves as a medium of exchange and economic value. It is a tangible representation of economic value and security, frequently scavenged to fill personal voids, and plays a role in community and individual decision-making. Money also acts as a determinant of social behavior and resource access, influencing how individuals and groups interact and allocate resources. Beyond its economic functions, Money symbolizes wealth and economic power, evoking complex emotional and psychological responses. It is a material concept examined in relation to human desires and existential significance, reflecting deeper meanings beyond mere utility. Money is highlighted as a determinant of social behavior and resource access, and it represents economic resources that play a role in community and individual decision-making.

In certain cultural contexts, Money is related to the act of making a son, indicating symbolic or social associations. This relation underscores the multifaceted nature of Money, which is not only a material and economic entity but also a cultural and symbolic one. Money's role in decision-making and its impact on social behavior further illustrate its pervasive influence across various domains. Money is a material manifestation of wealth that can be depleted, highlighting its finite nature, and it serves as a medium of exchange and economic value, shaping how individuals and groups interact and allocate resources.<SEP>Money represents economic resources that play a role in community and individual decision-making.<SEP>Money is highlighted as a determinant of social behavior and resource access.", created_at:1779551879, source_id:"chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-fdd895baa3282f9ed911c72eae7a3d65<SEP>chunk-9233fc2d9357336158890082052af34c<SEP>chunk-407afcc34149e3cdc533c3a522a0ac53<SEP>chunk-075b8e71a3c71d11c785be4bbfe965ed<SEP>chunk-a9f29aa70d2aed842238204adf8a81c5<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-9eea478f3eb12a678ce672d3075c4af8", entity_id:"Money"}}, {_id:1949, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Generational continuity is emphasized as essential for enduring prosperity.<SEP>Generation refers to societal or cultural shifts across different age groups.<SEP>A social or biological group through which the mental infection of violence is transmitted across time.<SEP>A group that popularized the formula equating suffering with growth, imposing it on younger generations.<SEP>A group that popularized the formula equating suffering with growth, imposing it on younger generations.", created_at:1779524064, source_id:"chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-022a3570c97c271d9a9570710325a861<SEP>chunk-e1d5e0073f33e1ee1857e1f6302d5b7f<SEP>chunk-e32359164f62f64b8a0367195694bf0f", entity_id:"Generation"}}, {_id:1950, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The gods are mentioned as entities requiring wealth growth, contrasting with human needs.<SEP>Gods represent a form of the manifest divine, embodying universal intelligence in a relatable form.", created_at:1779671755, source_id:"chunk-7f167e0e6ad11f51a72e88b506b459a9<SEP>chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c", entity_id:"Gods"}}, {_id:1951, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A goal of the edits to streamline wordy phrases and improve textual efficiency.", created_at:1779152387, source_id:"chunk-a11c112e105d6254fe79f88881c975e6", entity_id:"Conciseness"}}, {_id:1952, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)<SEP>YouTube Video: I6yC-aUQUvw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6yC-aUQUvw)<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Readability is defined as the<SEP>Readability is a focus area for the task.", created_at:1779726798, source_id:"chunk-a11c112e105d6254fe79f88881c975e6<SEP>chunk-2f27f813b0cd20fbf8655bc9f1f8f0e6<SEP>chunk-c7379196e71801ae32380230fbd6d871<SEP>chunk-2117c284d143a0b06c5cfb98ca8fe397<SEP>chunk-d08234aef1ec6afbd127700e08544b48<SEP>chunk-fbfd88a298992820a55b4002c8cc0934<SEP>chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312<SEP>chunk-6c24ec7da9fe1934f51cad895f6bb5af<SEP>chunk-7756246b3abfc0beb67b4b123552595d", entity_id:"Readability"}}, {_id:1953, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A reference to a thematic element mentioned in the text, connected to contextual coherence.", created_at:1779152387, source_id:"chunk-a11c112e105d6254fe79f88881c975e6", entity_id:"Inclusivity Theme Song"}}, {_id:1954, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The fragment is linked to \"Chanchala,\" resolving ambiguity and improving readability.", created_at:1779152404, source_id:"chunk-a11c112e105d6254fe79f88881c975e6", entity_id:"She who can easily leave you..."}}] AS row
