 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The scientific principles behind wealth creation through spiritual evolution.", created_at:1779152803, source_id:"chunk-48b6f5afbbb30d33dc95910a500c6a85", entity_id:"spiritual science of wealth creation"}}, {_id:1989, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Every human being must learn and evolve into spiritual wealth creation concepts.", created_at:1779152803, source_id:"chunk-48b6f5afbbb30d33dc95910a500c6a85", entity_id:"human being"}}, {_id:1990, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shanti is a likely intended word in the original text, discussed as a possible correction.<SEP>Shanti symbolizes peace in Indian traditions, ending chants to invoke harmony in heart and humanity.<SEP>The Sanskrit term for peace, often invoked in mantras and prayers.<SEP>Shanti is a concept representing peace, mentioned in the mantra \"Om shanti shanti shanti hi.\"", created_at:1779241008, source_id:"chunk-48b6f5afbbb30d33dc95910a500c6a85<SEP>chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e<SEP>chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79<SEP>chunk-b8d18accff7354006bbf1baf5cc50967", entity_id:"Shanti"}}, {_id:1991, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrected phrase replacing \"s hands,\" derived from domain-specific terminology (\"Sri\") and contextual analysis.", created_at:1779152864, source_id:"chunk-aca9d54e5d1155c5ca91bdd11d1930ba", entity_id:"Sri hands"}}, {_id:1992, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)<SEP>unknown_sour