daa733157", entity_id:"prefrontal cortex"}}, {_id:2012, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Logical thinking is a mental process associated with the prefrontal cortex, enabling rational analysis and decision-making.", created_at:1779154213, source_id:"chunk-0477849d5d78d8358972a23daa733157", entity_id:"Logical thinking"}}, {_id:2013, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shifting activity to the prefrontal cortex enables logical thinking and cognitive control.<SEP>Logical thinking refers to reasoning based on structured principles of validity and sound reasoning.", created_at:1779154548, source_id:"chunk-6254a0998449b5aae9f36e202e6ddd4f<SEP>chunk-510c74de625674a35dffb4f0f8a8acb0", entity_id:"Logical Thinking"}}, {_id:2014, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Observing emotions leads to detachment and improves mental health.", created_at:1779154239, source_id:"chunk-6254a0998449b5aae9f36e202e6ddd4f", entity_id:"Detachment, Mental Health"}}, {_id:2015, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Observing emotions leads to detachment and improves mental health.", created_at:1779154240, source_id:"chunk-6254a0998449b5aae9f36e202e6ddd4f", entity_id:"Observing Emotions"}}, {_id:2016, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779154609, description:"Negative emotions lead to habits, which can be broken down through awareness.<SEP>Habits are repetitive behaviors or emotional states that become ingrained in human behavior, including negative emotional patterns.<SEP>Behavioral patterns such as eating sweets, excessive talking, gossiping, and alcohol consumption.", source_id:"chu