:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", created_at:1779154678, description:"Mental Health Practice involves observing emotions like anger, anxiety, and sadness without attempting to change them, then shifting awareness to the eyebrow center to visualize a tiny flame for mental well-being improvement.<SEP>A mental health practice described in the video, criticized for language choices like \"for your mental health\" instead of \"to improve your mental health.\"<SEP>Mental health practice involves observing emotions and shifting awareness to improve mental well-being.", source_id:"chunk-dd06aca0e8b0e45b68bcb022e995fab4<SEP>chunk-805b2382ae3a6fc492c6ba7733728205<SEP>chunk-2946fd6f690a4f147698b0825594b6df", entity_id:"Mental Health Practice"}}, {_id:2028, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3weAVHuSCxg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sadness is an emotion that is included in the practice's observational framework and is mentioned in the text as part of emotional recognition. It is a negative emotional state characterized by sorrow or unhappiness.  

Sadness can become a persistent baseline mood if underlying states are not transformed. It can also transform into fear if unaddressed, as highlighted in the text.  

Sadness is an emotional state that children may experience, which parents can recognize. It is another emotional response linked to economic problems, categorized as an internal experience.  

Sadness is an emotional state that leaves impressions on clothes and skin, requiring cleansing rituals like turmeric water or salt.<SEP>An emotional state that affects the quality and impact of prepared food.<SEP>An emotional state that affects the quality and impact of prepared food.<SEP>Sadness is an emotional state of sorrow or unhappiness, often linked to loss or unfulfilled desires.<SEP>Sadness is a fundamental emotion linked to loss and pain, mentioned as a suffering state post-separation.", created_at:1779737968, source_id:"chunk-dd06aca0e8b0e45b68bcb022e995fab4<SEP>chunk-2946fd6f690a4f147698b0825594b6df<SEP>chunk-c29e446278bb16bd97c026c06682add6<SEP>chunk-5d0f74c4239eabf7a6fea87da28be5d8<SEP>chunk-6537d9939653cd5b7d036dced5f9de7b<SEP>chunk-1e483a5aae3e722cbcbaae7e0a2f3d19<SEP>chunk-9b20e4da8cf63963d1d2795ec8336f99<SEP>chunk-e32359164f62f64b8a0367195694bf0f<SEP>chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f<SEP>chunk-295ece324351da0c7194c4e2d4f58e99<SEP>chunk-801a54bafa1f63f0a4d091331cafc3d9<SEP>chunk-0bcd34bbf2440bb034ae1a5607edb427", entity_id:"Sadness"}}, {_id:2032, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Na?ve is a concept representing wisdom or understanding, used to correct the misheard word \"naked\" in the phrase \"freedom is a choice of negative emotions and only the wise naked.\">", created_at:1779154476, source_id:"chunk-63d51e5603b1ddfb42503cb776ec9717", entity_id:"Na?ve"}}, {_id:2033, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Velcro is referenced as a noun to describe a material or texture, highlighting its use in the phrase \"like a velcro.\">", created_at:1779154493, source_id:"chunk-63d51e5603b1ddfb42503cb776ec9717", entity_id:"material"}}, {_id:2034, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"freedom is a choice of negative emotions and only the wise naked\" contains a mishearing where \"naked\" should be corrected to \"na?ve\" for clarity and context.>", created_at:1779154493, source_id:"chunk-63d51e5603b1ddfb42503cb776ec9717", entity_id:"freedom is a choice of negative emotions and only the wise naked"}}, {_id:2035, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Velcro is referenced as a noun to describe a material or texture, highlighting its use in the phrase \"like a velcro.\"><SEP>A material commonly used in fasteners, mentioned in the video as a potential error in analogy (\"like a velcro for anything that is negative\").", created_at:1779154523, source_id:"chunk-63d51e5603b1ddfb42503cb776ec9717<SEP>chunk-0de2aa96810cf511e8f01e5a2ce5d71a", entity_id:"velcro"}}, {_id:2036, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Transform signifies personal evolution through embracing connection and presence.<SEP>The third stage of spiritual evolution involves transformation through awakening the heart, leading to a shift from unenlightened to enlightened living and experiencing profound change in worldly experiences.", created_at:1779563366, source_id:"chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-b49cabb6cbf6a92062b2c4decee8543b", entity_id:"Transform"}}, {_id:2037, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Declutter refers to the process of removing unnecessary mental or physical clutter.<SEP>Declutter is the corrected term identified in the text, replacing the typo \"declut\".", created_at:1779154678, source_id:"chunk-510c74de625674a35dffb4f0f8a8acb0<SEP>chunk-2946fd6f690a4f147698b0825594b6df", entity_id:"Declutter"}}, {_id:2038, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Superficial friendships are contrasted with true connection, lacking depth and mutual appreciation.", created_at:1779218870, source_id:"chunk-959b75d8730e8069b5cdeee7b801f17f", entity_id:"Superficial Friendships"}}, {_id:2039, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Being human is the essence of connection and the fundamental nature of existence.", created_at:1779218871, source_id:"chunk-1638eab96ec57bc1b768b7d70d8ef77f", entity_id:"Being Human"}}, {_id:2040, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"for your mental health\" is grammatically correct as per the original text, with no need for stylistic adjustment.", created_at:1779154550, source_id:"chunk-510c74de625674a35dffb4f0f8a8acb0", entity_id:"For Your Mental Health"}}] AS row
