 to \"about what\".<SEP>Edits made to improve readability, including adding a comma in the third stage's description of optimal eating time.", source_id:"chunk-805b2382ae3a6fc492c6ba7733728205<SEP>chunk-de099e096802b9695bfbc56e18138d75<SEP>chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312", entity_id:"Grammatical Corrections"}}, {_id:2046, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A demographic group of individuals aged 15 to 44, highlighted in self-harm statistics as the leading cause of death.", created_at:1779219005, source_id:"chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674", entity_id:"People Aged 15-44"}}, {_id:2047, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Three common states people make into habits are, Anger related states like irritation, frustration or road rage.", created_at:1779154579, source_id:"chunk-805b2382ae3a6fc492c6ba7733728205", entity_id:"Sentence 2"}}, {_id:2048, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional states including tension, stress, anxiety, and panic.", created_at:1779154609, source_id:"chunk-dabd16cfc5754a0c92699b66acfbb348", entity_id:"Fear-Related States"}}, {_id:2049, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of irritation or frustration, possibly related to road rage as mentioned in the context.", created_at:1779154609, source_id:"chunk-dabd16cfc5754a0c92699b66acfbb348", entity_id:"Ritation"}}, {_id:2050, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"compulsivebehaviors", truncate:"", description:"Habits can evolve into addictions tied to negative emotions.\" That seems correct.", created_at:1779154609, source_id:"chunk-dabd16cfc5754a0c92699b66acfbb348", entity_id:"Addictions to Negative Emotions"}}, {_id:2051, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional states including loneliness, dullness, insecurity, and depression.", created_at:1779154609, source_id:"chunk-dabd16cfc5754a0c92699b66acfbb348", entity_id:"Sadness-Related States"}}, {_id:2052, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"scientific understanding of the human brain refers to knowledge about neurological processes and their impact on emotions.", created_at:1779154629, source_id:"chunk-579650a6f70b3f2b2d60dd8265f59c4b", entity_id:"scientific understanding of the human brain"}}, {_id:2053, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"riod of seclusion refers to a period of isolation where negative emotions are internalized, leading to habitual responses.", created_at:1779154629, source_id:"chunk-579650a6f70b3f2b2d60dd8265f59c4b", entity_id:"riod of seclusion"}}, {_id:2054, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Prolonged seclusion reinforces negative emotional patterns, making them habitual.", created_at:1779154630, source_id:"chunk-579650a6f70b3f2b2d60dd8265f59c4b", entity_id:"negative emotions"}}, {_id:2055, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B8wapoLAu84)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Scientific knowledge of the brain's functions aids in ensuring survival by managing negative emotions.", created_at:1779154630, source_id:"chunk-579650a6f70b3f2b2d60dd8265f59c4b"