But wait, the user also provided a list of aspects that need to be covered in the summary. These include problematic in relationships, source of duality, separation, suffering, need to maintain \"I\", distracts from present experiences, human stubbornness, resistance to life's flow, haughtiness, illusory sense of self that experiences bloating in pleasure and shrinking in suffering, concept where one believes they cannot be wrong, leading to blaming others, self-centered thinking, resistance to self-awareness, tendency to blame others.

