ion:"Buddhahy represents the intellect or discriminatory agency as the third dimension of the mind.<SEP>The third dimension, referring to the intellect that discriminates and categorizes thoughts.", created_at:1779220119, source_id:"chunk-5250e80e79b58c377f139a5f0c1cbb95<SEP>chunk-6df1d0ea6f9bdedd3be52be35afd52d9", entity_id:"Buddhahy"}}, {_id:2091, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chitta is the fourth dimension of the mind's matrix, symbolizing self-awareness and wisdom.<SEP>Chitta is the fourth layer of the matrix of the mind, associated with awareness and self-observation.", created_at:1779220142, source_id:"chunk-5250e80e79b58c377f139a5f0c1cbb95<SEP>chunk-168f7db76a78fdae540996d31ccc165d", entity_id:"Chitta"}}, {_id:2092, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9S9Hh4aBN8)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Original Text Analysis contains sections of text provided for error correction.", created_at:1779155370, source_id:"chunk-53ce4df265a9fed9ae9cc25d4a08cff7", entity_id:"Original Text Analysis"}}, {_id:2093, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9S9Hh4aBN8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2DLb6hDIhmg)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Ancient India is the historical context for Chanakya's teachings.<SEP>Historical setting where the teacher's philosophical teachings originated.", created_at:1779211103, source_id:"chunk-53ce4df265a9fed9ae9cc25d4a08cff7<SEP>chunk-2ed6c538824d03e53845129e9fe68f60", entity_id:"Ancient India"}}, {_id:2094, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h9S9Hh4aBN8)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)<SEP>YouTube Video: ZD1nQPtpojM (URL: https://www.y