UNWIND [{_id:2145, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Discussion of a worldwide crisis referenced in the text.<SEP>The global crisis is a central theme, involving economic uncertainty and the oneness of human experience.<SEP>Global crisis refers to a widespread economic, environmental, or social disruption affecting multiple regions or systems.<SEP>The global crisis has caused widespread loss of lives and businesses, exacerbating social issues like domestic violence.", created_at:1779254179, source_id:"chunk-b05adb44a9c000b3a3a1231da35d601a<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7<SEP>chunk-6621e22e95953fd207176f306376a217<SEP>chunk-4043681cb90e5032a1d66db36f936a98", entity_id:"Global Crisis"}}, {_id:2146, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video featuring the repetitive phrase \"The chemistry of chemistry\" as its central theme, hosted on YouTube with the URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0.", created_at:1779220210, source_id:"chunk-46b52879ce56639e2cba6ca746955a6e", entity_id:"ry. The chemistry of chemistry"}}, {_id:2147, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Philosophical theme exploring unity in human experiences.<SEP>The oneness of human experience is highlighted as more transparent during the global crisis.", created_at:1779157849, source_id:"chunk-b05adb44a9c000b3a3a1231da35d601a<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7", entity_id:"Oneness of Human Experience"}}, {_id:2148, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Caste is a social term used to describe cultural divisions within societies. It is understood as a social hierarchy that shapes community interactions and influences individual opportunities. The concept of caste functions as a persistent social category that continues to influence social dynamics, despite varying interpretations of its effect on collective identity.

