Multiple descriptions emphasize that caste refers to a social hierarchy that affects community interactions and individual opportunities. The repeated statements highlight that caste is a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion, and that it is a social hierarchy influencing community interactions and individual opportunities. The concept of caste continues to be a subject of interpretation regarding its effect on collective identity.<SEP>Caste is noted as a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion.<SEP>Caste refers to a social hierarchy that affects community interactions and individual opportunities.<SEP>Caste is noted as a persistent social divisor affecting community cohesion.<SEP>Caste is mentioned alongside gender as a basis for outdated social differentiation.<SEP>Caste is mentioned alongside gender as a basis for outdated social differentiation.", created_at:1779701483, source_id:"chunk-b05adb44a9c000b3a3a1231da35d601a<SEP>chunk-f97c33bc1c34505752dbdf13ce792596<SEP>chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c<SEP>chunk-b1776121cc5dfb12d2007497b9b6d6fe<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-9eea478f3eb12a678ce672d3075c4af8<SEP>chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3", entity_id:"Caste"}}, {_id:2149, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Global epidemic mentioned in the text as part of the crisis context.<SEP>Pandemic is a worldwide health emergency caused by a new disease, leading to widespread disruption.<SEP>The pandemic is directly associated with the flat world concept.<SEP>A pandemic is a global health crisis that leaves lasting societal impacts, such as behavioral changes.<SEP>Pandemic refers to widespread disease outbreaks that have historically impacted human societies, often leaving lasting cultural and social marks.<SEP>A pandemic is a global health crisis that leaves lasting societal impacts, such as behavioral changes.", created_at:1779519253, source_id:"chunk-b05adb44a9c000b3a3a1231da35d601a<SEP>chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7<SEP>chunk-39252be9066242f35311d64c382dc3da<SEP>chunk-3bbc23f7da347ce4b93776c537570fa8", entity_id:"Pandemic"}}, {_id:2150, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8fKvjHOD_kQ)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", created_at:1779734442, description:"Meditate is a corrected spelling of the word \"Mediate\" from the original text.<SEP>Meditate is the correct method of meditation, involving chanting the Hamsa Soham Ekam mantra.<SEP>Meditate is the correct verb that should replace \"mediate\" in the text.<SEP>Meditate refers to practices aimed at fostering inner peace and collective consciousness.<SEP>Meditate is a practice involving focused attention and mindfulness, recommended for stress reduction and cognitive benefits.", source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff<SEP>chunk-72df86939588b2a5102970dc8a2c70b2<SEP>chunk-56e3a53798dcd66226e03f0b100c4961<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b<SEP>chunk-af42e7cfdd624cdf90c9e6e7cda51567", entity_id:"Meditate"}}, {_id:2151, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"amsa Soham Ekam is a spiritual term that was correctly identified in the previous extraction.", created_at:1779157540, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff", entity_id:"amsa Soham Ekam"}}, {_id:2152, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"the atheist and the theist is a phrase from the original text that was corrected to \"The atheist and the theist\".", created_at:1779157540, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff", entity_id:"the atheist and the theist"}}, {_id:2153, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"cuss words is a term from the original text that was left unchanged as it is not considered an error.", created_at:1779157540, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff", entity_id:"cuss words"}}, {_id:2154, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Antaryamen is a specific term from the original text that was left unchanged as it is correctly spelled.", created_at:1779157541, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff", entity_id:"Antaryamen"}}, {_id:2155, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779157953, description:"Theist refers to individuals with religious beliefs, facing similar struggles as atheists during crises.<SEP>Theists are experiencing confusion due to quarantine, similar to atheists.<SEP>A theist is a character experiencing quarantine-related confusion in the text.", source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7<SEP>chunk-56e3a53798dcd66226e03f0b100c4961", entity_id:"Theist"}}, {_id:2156, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Atheist denotes individuals who do not believe in deities, experiencing shared challenges during quarantine.<SEP>Atheists are experiencing confusion due to quarantine, similar to theists.<SEP>An atheist is a character experiencing quarantine-related confusion in the text.<SEP>Atheist is a person who does not believe in a divine being.`", created_at:1779661691, source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7<SEP>chunk-56e3a53798dcd66226e03f0b100c4961<SEP>chunk-71c647fd13898f185a71091bf9fbd510", entity_id:"Atheist"}}, {_id:2157, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Global epidemic describes a pandemic affecting multiple nations simultaneously, such as the mentioned crisis.<SEP>The global epidemic is presented as a consequence of the flat world concept.", created_at:1779157849, source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7", entity_id:"Global Epidemic"}}, {_id:2158, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Globalization refers to the interconnectedness of the world through communication, commerce, and travel, now including global health crises.<SEP>Globalization is discussed in the context of a flat world, leading to unexpected global consequences.", created_at:1779157849, source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7", entity_id:"Globalization"}}, {_id:2159, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Economic uncertainty arises from unpredictable financial conditions affecting individuals and societies.<SEP>Economic uncertainty is a component of the global crisis, affecting both rich and poor.", created_at:1779157849, source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852<SEP>chunk-a7fbaa495ffdc0fabab227cc5f153ed7", entity_id:"Economic Uncertainty"}}, {_id:2160, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)", en