e.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779667193, description:"A universal human emotion characterized by intensity, which can manifest in different ways.<SEP>Anger is an emotion that contributes to the body's survival state and prevents peace.<SEP>anger is associated with karmic consequences, generating problems related to anger when spread through consciousness.", source_id:"chunk-264fb8cd6c5c93babb84a7f63f71ecc5<SEP>chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d<SEP>chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"anger"}}, {_id:2171, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A person cherished by another, experiencing universal human emotions.", created_at:1779157776, source_id:"chunk-264fb8cd6c5c93babb84a7f63f71ecc5", entity_id:"loved one"}}, {_id:2172, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A person in a close relationship, sharing common human experiences.", created_at:1779157776, source_id:"chunk-264fb8cd6c5c93babb84a7f63f71ecc5", entity_id:"partner"}}, {_id:2173, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UbCEX5KBbPw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Divine is a spiritual concept representing the ultimate reality or ultimate truth, often associated with the presence of a higher power in all beings. It is also described as a spiritual entity referenced in the text, linked to blessings and spiritual practices, and appears as a repetitive phrase in the video serving as a spiritual affirmation.

Within the video's message, The Divine is portrayed as a central spiritual concept, tied to blessings, sacredness, and unity, and is invoked for blessings and togetherness. The Divine is a spiritual entity that blesses individuals to accept and celebrate sacredness, togetherness, and life, and is regarded as the source of blessings, thanked by the speaker. Additionally, The Divine is characterized as a spiritual entity representing higher power or divinity, central to blessings and unity in the text.", created_at:1779254386, source_id:"chunk-3c249cf152a26fbb005f67817b9cc0e5<SEP>chunk-e3376cbf8644429a9850c44c882cd1fa<SEP>chunk-75c783fcdd09bf8a8394a04be5197385<SEP>chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0<SEP>chunk-62eeebe6c2fe0edb5198c7526c02ef79<SEP>chunk-b064115910fcd1227cf02905073a96e1<SEP>chunk-ad4544e5cec6ee250e4823e5b924afdf<SEP>chunk-22fbf22f17126e6b5377570cdb342627", entity_id:"The Divine"}}, {_id:2174, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UbCEX5KBbPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779232792, description:"Antaryamin is a concept referring to the divine presence within all hearts, symbolizing the inner connection to the divine.<SEP>Antaryamin is a specific spiritual term used correctly in the text.<SEP>Antaryamin represents the divine presence perceived within all hearts, transcending form or name.<SEP>Antaryamin represents the Divine presence within all beings, symbolizing universal connection and sacredness.<SEP>Antaryamin is a term mentioned in the text.<SEP>Antaryamin refers to the divine presence within oneself, central to the spiritual practices described.<SEP>Antaryamin is a divine power to which the mantra connects the user.", source_id:"chunk-3c249cf152a26fbb005f67817b9cc0e5<SEP>chunk-ab8e2d9488a9370f5cf8db7c366d83fa<SEP>chunk-ba6b7dba