64d70b8365<SEP>chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7<SEP>chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02<SEP>chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713<SEP>chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47<SEP>chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6<SEP>chunk-00591c268a7fa36d70f44ba9311e9bba<SEP>chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c<SEP>chunk-60c1c33e6390faeb5d8d230c828095d7<SEP>chunk-829692316cdc441972a3bef1cc6809ef<SEP>chunk-4c5c53ea662d003ac96f0faa52dfe234<SEP>chunk-393e1029671c8cd325c8aaceacba56f1<SEP>chunk-eac7e627d7c0ee92a60f4bbbfb0776c3<SEP>chunk-d4970d6b99dd25f2175abb5b84e2f52c<SEP>chunk-db646f91c44917314e3ecaeda5d3d784<SEP>chunk-9db93c0b45cbf139f6a12d613ee43436<SEP>chunk-b0aa1897202602a9be2a7516d39d5400<SEP>chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01<SEP>chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1<SEP>chunk-22e861448de43c78f776c4d84f1409bd<SEP>chunk-5f51161e463ac960fab8b2a50bc6505c<SEP>chunk-b7f51f52125fd52ba3d4f9070154d664<SEP>chunk-fbc362953fe784a8510b72471b749390<SEP>chunk-427deb5cc43b417a4dd893f3e73a5d18<SEP>chunk-e4cf02903a0735df8c35d1ebc9a0cf97<SEP>chunk-4728462b4c7e2d372f2b1e40f07184a9", entity_id:"Mother Earth"}}, {_id:2233, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"a stress-free life involves living in alignment with one's values and managing external pressures effectively.", created_at:1779221446, source_id:"chunk-a7619f77eafbc391703609d89706c93c", entity_id:"stress-free life"}}, {_id:2234, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"creating a difference refers to the impact of individuals on the world through positive transformation.", created_at:1779221446, source_id:"chunk-a7619f77eafbc391703609d89706c93c", entity_id:"creating a difference"}}, {_id:2235, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Ants are creatures that receive a portion of food as part of the ritual offering.", created_at:1779164372, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed<SEP>chunk-f0844ae59861d6cd8c7dc29c46407869", entity_id:"Ants"}}, {_id:2236, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The User must maintain a specific tone and style in the output.", created_at:1779221493, source_id:"chunk-7651e3f88938aa416a882ccdc7e8497a", entity_id:"Tone and Style"}}, {_id:2237, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)<SEP>YouTube Video: LFTx6ZYMZ1g (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LFTx6ZYMZ1g)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The current generation is the group of young people facing unprecedented pressures.<SEP>The current generation is referenced as the group that developed the formula for teaching teens.", created_at:1779524179, source_id:"chunk-f6de882ef63b995a9da5918fd43ea741<SEP>chunk-5df41a8775a9f9e045f9f017cbfd63e0", entity_id:"Current Generation"}}, {_id:2238, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"A portion of food is offered to ants on Earth as part of the ritual practice.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed", entity_id:"food offering"}}, {_id:2239, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The group offers thanks to Mother Earth for providing food as part of their ritual.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed", entity_id:"offering thanks"}}, {_id:2240, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The method involves checking if breath flows through the right nostril to determine solar energy dominance.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed", entity_id:"right nostril"}}, {_id:2241, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The method involves checking if breath flows through the left nostril to determine lunar energy dominance.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed", entity_id:"left nostril"}}, {_id:2242, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Psychological pressure is a type of pressure related to mental stress and emotional strain.<SEP>Psychological pressure stems from peer, family, societal, job, and biological factors, leading to addiction, academic issues, and loss of purpose.", created_at:1779555939, source_id:"chunk-f6de882ef63b995a9da5918fd43ea741<SEP>chunk-2d5e1779572c80b9567627b5320742fc", entity_id:"Psychological Pressure"}}, {_id:2243, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Irreplaceable is a term used multiple times in the text.", created_at:1779164439, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc", entity_id:"Irreplaceable"}}, {_id:2244, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pranic veins are mentioned as potentially redundant terminology compared to \"nadis\" in the text.<SEP>An awkwardly phrased term in the video's text (\"70,000 nadis or pranic veins\") describing energy channels, considered stylistically problematic.", created_at:1779164499, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc<SEP>chunk-b5530be5eab0247d7b2ab891abe11909", entity_id:"Pranic Veins"}}, {_id:2245, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mechanistic chores are repetitive tasks mentioned in the text, potentially causing stylistic concerns.", created_at:1779164439, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc", entity_id:"Mechanistic Chores"}}, {_id:2246, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Nadi refers to energy channels in the text.", created_at:1779164439, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc", entity_id:"Nadi"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2247, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The term \"mechanistic\" is used twice, once in \"mechanistic chores,\" which might be repetitive.", created_at:1779164441, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc", entity_id:"Mechanistic"}}, {_id:2248, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: OnAAtrwsfOc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OnAAtrwsfOc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o_eg6YTifRE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"The concept of repeated phrases in the video, identified as a primary error.\"}<SEP>Intentional repetition of \"Let us begin\" for emphasis.", created_at:1779733232, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc<SEP>chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d<SEP>chunk-a395387e60480713a88c70d27d01c1ab<SEP>chunk-2f27f813b0cd20fbf8655bc9f1f8f0e6<SEP>chunk-ed0382ebc411ad60ea4424aaf41dfd82<SEP>chunk-6195ca7f73d379cf72b6e612c1bd422a<SEP>chunk-c072e5291bc196493af69ebd61f4717e<SEP>chunk-1439496c0597ca312586a923b138c34d<SEP>chunk-bfcd000f989f64e4758805fcc0709f83<SEP>chunk-9dc446aa1478fdaca34017fdd93d325e<SEP>chunk-7265380f9c03aee6859d84871017d191<SEP>chunk-f102a5e8fd32e6bf3d8333de67a27c68", entity_id:"Repetition"}}, {_id:2249, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The youth of the world face various pressures including peer, parental, educational, and societal pressures.<SEP>Represents global youth being guided toward enlightenment and stress-free living.<SEP>Represents global youth being guided toward enlightenment and stress-free living.", created_at:1779556299, source_id:"chunk-f6de882ef63b995a9da5918fd43ea741<SEP>chunk-922e23e61222fa7ebaae80af23f09b19", entity_id:"Youth of the World"}}, {_id:2250, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Kids are children who are affected by the pressure behaviors of adults in their lives.", created_at:1779221599, source_id:"chunk-ec30e8bcff38a8016afa767698da187c", entity_id:"Kids"}}, {_id:2251, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pranic channels are energy pathways, suggested as a correction to \"pranic veins\".>", created_at:1779164471, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a", entity_id:"pranic channels"}}, {_id:2252, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sacredness is mentioned in the context of eating with a sense of reverence.>", created_at:1779164471, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a", entity_id:"sacredness"}}, {_id:2253, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vital energy is described as flowing through nadis or pranic channels.>", created_at:1779164471, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a", entity_id:"vital energy"}}, {_id:2254, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Eating is discussed in the context of sacredness and conversational examples.>", created_at:1779164471, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a", entity_id:"eating"}}, {_id:2255, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pranic veins is a term used in the text, which is considered a potential error and suggested to be corrected to \"pranic channels\" or \"nadis\".>", created_at:1779164471, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a", entity_id:"pranic veins"}}, {_id:2256, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Nadis are energy channels in the body, suggested as a correction to \"pranic veins\".>", created_at:1779164471, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a", entity_id:"nadis"}}, {_id:2257, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779728184, description:"An error in the video's text where \"Let us meditate and experience the Divine Now\" incorrectly capitalizes \"Divine\" in the phrase.<SEP>Grammatical error involving incorrect lowercase usage of \"a\" instead of \"A\" in the phrase \"a short chain in this whole process.\"<SEP>An error in the use of capitalization, such as incorrect capitalization of words within a sentence.", source_id:"chunk-b5530be5eab0247d7b2ab891abe11909<SEP>chunk-6af63924e67c9180602f526dba74319a<SEP>chunk-0891d811d05e0ff0fd82c20d195e706c<SEP>chunk-ad60b7629c9db6404156fce16e4bd4c1", entity_id:"Capitalization Error"}}, {_id:2258, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A grammatical mistake in the video's text where \"Their love, affection, support and connection is irreplaceable\" uses incorrect verb agreement (\"is\" instead of \"are\").", created_at:1779164499, source_id:"chunk-b5530be5eab0247d7b2ab891abe11909", entity_id:"Grammar Error"}}, {_id:2259, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Examples of awkward or clunky phrasing in text that require editing.", created_at:1779164564, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a", entity_id:"Clunky Phrasing"}}, {_id:2260, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779164719, description:"Repetitive, routine tasks driven by necessity rather than meaningful engagement.<SEP>Mechanical chores refer to repetitive tasks performed out of necessity, as mentioned in the context.<SEP>Mechanical chores are repetitive, mundane tasks performed out of necessity.", source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a<SEP>chunk-b8fe06323eb7bb1ed460d4a5226c84d8<SEP>chunk-599e9e03a48987549ae86e0c6effc7bb", entity_id:"Mechanical Chores"}}, {_id:2261, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779397863, description:"The routine activities and experiences that constitute everyday existence.<SEP>Daily life refers to routine activities and experiences that constitute everyday existence.<SEP>Daily life refers to the everyday experiences and existence of individuals, which can be influenced by consciousness.<SEP>Daily life encompasses everyday activities and interactions.", source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a<SEP>chunk-599e9e03a48987549ae86e0c6effc7bb<SEP>chunk-52d567ecc552b96b146755df515ac0bd<SEP>chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944<SEP>chunk-86e735695491236221c7103cab19fd22", entity_id:"Daily Life"}}, {_id:2262, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Method of removing unnecessary phrases to enhance text quality.", created_at:1779164564, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a", entity_id:"Remove"}}, {_id:2263, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Method of rephrasing sentences to improve clarity and flow.", created_at:1779164564, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a", entity_id:"Rephrase"}}, {_id:2264, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Relatives include family members who can influence children through their handling of pressure.<SEP>Relatives are family members of the lottery winner who become envious of their wealth.", created_at:1779556036, source_id:"chunk-aab1cb8ec22effc5abff8b57b4b03ad3<SEP>chunk-f02bf32393ef9705110f96bbc12d8064<SEP>chunk-ec30e8bcff38a8016afa767698da187c<SEP>chunk-9c1aa39a1d495c6095f631b7613571fb", entity_id:"Relatives"}}, {_id:2265, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Adults are individuals who may struggle with pressure and affect others, particularly children.", created_at:1779221599, source_id:"chunk-ec30e8bcff38a8016afa767698da187c", entity_id:"Adults"}}, {_id:2266, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Thriving state is a body state where the body focuses on growth and well-being, occurring in the presence of peace.", created_at:1779221840, source_id:"chunk-3372e5d9566c081ee06a41f5a3cb4448", entity_id:"Thriving State"}}] AS row
