watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Ekam mantra is a spiritual chant emphasized in the video, featuring the term \"Ekam\" as its central element.<SEP>The Ekam mantra is a Sanskrit term meaning \"one,\" referenced in the YouTube video as a powerful spiritual chant to be recited.", created_at:1779165163, source_id:"chunk-75c783fcdd09bf8a8394a04be5197385<SEP>chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0", entity_id:"Ekam mantra"}}, {_id:2275, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", created_at:1779672499, description:"<think>
