UNWIND [{_id:2287, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The intended spiritual message is \"We are one,\" representing unity and interconnectedness.", created_at:1779165081, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be", entity_id:"We Are One (Intended Message)"}}, {_id:2288, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The garbled version includes repetitive phrases like \"And a Divine... We are one. We are one. We are one,\" with non-sequitur elements disrupting coherence.<SEP>A corrupted or unreadable section of text discussed in the video as an error to be addressed.", created_at:1779261695, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be<SEP>chunk-609eba9953b128ee5842ae83faafcdb9", entity_id:"Garbled Text"}}, {_id:2289, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The user aims to simplify the text by removing structural errors and repetitive elements to align with the intended message.", created_at:1779165081, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be", entity_id:"User's Intent"}}, {_id:2290, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The objective to fix transcription errors while preserving the original meaning and avoiding stylistic changes.", created_at:1779165138, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab", entity_id:"Transcription Correction Task"}}, {_id:2291, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The central theme \"We are one\" repeated throughout the text, intended as the primary content.", created_at:1779165138, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab", entity_id:"Core Message"}}, {_id:2292, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"And a Divine...\" interpreted as a grammatical and logical inconsistency in the text.", created_at:1779165138, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab", entity_id:"Confusing Phrase"}}, {_id:2293, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The original garbled text in the YouTube video containing repetitive phrases like \"a Divine, a Divine...\" before correction.", created_at:1779165163, source_id:"chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0", entity_id:"Original Message"}}, {_id:2294, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"We Are One is a declaration of unity, repeated multiple times in the text.<SEP>The concept of unity and collective consciousness emphasized in the spiritual message, reflecting interconnectedness and shared transcendence.", created_at:1779165258, source_id:"chunk-fa51e84ddb49268093fbbf38c48a6abb<SEP>chunk-b064115910fcd1227cf02905073a96e1", entity_id:"We Are One"}}, {_id:2295, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMrOMT4mfno)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Prithaji is an individual who experienced a revelation leading to the conceptualization of Ekam Kshetra.<SEP>Prithaji is a personified representation of the Earth in Vedic traditions.<SEP>Prithaji is the original term that was misheard and needed correction to \"Preethaji.\"<SEP>Prithaji is a person mentioned in the video as a champion for peace and humanity.<SEP>Prithaji is acknowledged for her efforts in promoting love, compassion, and peace, and for her work with children.<SEP>Prithaji is acknowledged for her efforts in promoting love, compassion, and peace, and for her work with children.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-96e7034ec10353f076fb39e1a418516e<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e<SEP>chunk-9a28cb6f3aba46853905402269a06aba<SEP>chunk-3facf3692bcb0f8ed274e373920e52f3<SEP>chunk-967a1ebc79cd7d83afc2b43d42c8ab36<SEP>chunk-bfcad8a2e2d4df5f6523bcfa541887ac<SEP>chunk-37d0d91f60cf0c0cf3f8569ec5103472", entity_id:"Prithaji"}}, {_id:2296, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ekam Kshetra is a divine playfield representing non-dual consciousness, described as a sacred space with extraordinary gridlines for cosmic energy convergence.<SEP>Ekam Kshetra is a divine power place where spiritual practices like Upasanas and Siddhis are conducted to manifest intentions and dissolve obstacles.<SEP>Ekam Kshetra is a location, referred to as the oneness field and a divine power place, intended for visitors to spend a few days.<SEP>Ekam Kshetra signifies the unified field or realm of existence in Vedic thought.", created_at:1779167145, source_id:"chunk-96e7034ec10353f076fb39e1a418516e<SEP>chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-9503d97a23d03f63c7c514a61b68c6b4<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Ekam Kshetra"}}, {_id:2297, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The Rig Veda is a sacred text referenced in relation to the worship of Hiranyagarbha at Ekam Kshetra.<SEP>The Rig Veda is an ancient sacred text of Hinduism containing hymns and spiritual knowledge.", created_at:1779167145, source_id:"chunk-96e7034ec10353f076fb39e1a418516e<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Rig Veda"}}, {_id:2298, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Hiranyagarbha\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The output must be a plain text summary in multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting, objective third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning, and integrate all key information. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English.

