We need to", created_at:1779225559, source_id:"chunk-96e7034ec10353f076fb39e1a418516e<SEP>chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e<SEP>chunk-9cc01d3ebb7c00cd64ce3517df7de5fd<SEP>chunk-23cb579d7ea483826ac50f3d8de4f099<SEP>chunk-ea7d74ec407517f9b38e9ad416479a66<SEP>chunk-eae1f6658ba1fd4f52f2452752071fc4", entity_id:"Hiranyagarbha"}}, {_id:2299, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Amruta Kalesha is a sacred component of Ekam where the first rays of the sun charge the ground with celestial energy every morning.<SEP>Amruta Kalesha denotes a state of divine bliss or immortality in spiritual traditions.", created_at:1779167145, source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Amruta Kalesha"}}, {_id:2300, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779232604, description:"Surya Yantra is the three-dimensional design basis for Ekam, symbolizing solar energy and cosmic harmony.<SEP>Surya Yantra refers to a symbolic or ritualistic device associated with solar energy in Vedic practices.<SEP>Surya Yantra is a symbolic representation of the sun's energy, used in spiritual and ritual contexts.", source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e<SEP>chunk-6b7fcb0be46e5dc8bc514960fa89b8be", entity_id:"Surya Yantra"}}, {_id:2301, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Siddhis are transformative spiritual states achieved through prolonged seclusion and practices at Ekam Kshetra.<SEP>Siddhis represent supernatural powers or spiritual achievements in yogic traditions.", created_at:1779167146, source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Siddhis"}}, {_id:2302, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Upasanas are spiritual practices conducted at Ekam Kshetra to dissolve obstacles and manifest intentions through divine connection.<SEP>Upasanas are ritualistic practices of worship and meditation in Hindu traditions.", created_at:1779167145, source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Upasanas"}}, {_id:2304, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Visiting Ekam Kshetra is recommended as the best start to a beautiful life, emphasizing its transformative spiritual power.", created_at:1779167088, source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3", entity_id:"divine life start"}}, {_id:2305, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Hiranyagarbha is the primordial source from which all other divine forms emerge according to the Rig Veda.", created_at:1779167088, source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3", entity_id:"divine forms"}}, {_id:2306, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Prana Upasanas at Ekam Kshetra trigger the rise of Kundalini energy and surreal consciousness.<SEP>Prana Upasanas involve the worship of life force or breath in spiritual practices.", created_at:1779167146, source_id:"chunk-9f2392959877074397c1ce18b8f748b3<SEP>chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Prana Upasanas"}}, {_id:2307, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_yRNKupugs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Survival state is a turbulent state where the body remains in turmoil due to negative emotions.", created_at:1779221911, source_id:"chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d", entity_id:"survival state"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2308, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_yRNKupugs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pride is an emotion that contributes to the body's survival state and prevents peace.", created_at:1779221911, source_id:"chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d", entity_id:"pride"}}, {_id:2309, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ekam is used correctly in the text without errors.", created_at:1779167180, source_id:"chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Correct Usage"}}, {_id:2310, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Prithaji embodies the Earth in Vedic personification.", created_at:1779167180, source_id:"chunk-5dcadb28ba25332dd33280807411fe6e", entity_id:"Prithvi"}}, {_id:2311, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_yRNKupugs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shame is an emotion that contributes to the body's survival state and prevents peace.", created_at:1779221911, source_id:"chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d", entity_id:"shame"}}, {_id:2314, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_yRNKupugs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Worry is an emotion that contributes to the body's survival state and prevents peace.", created_at:1779221912, source_id:"chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d", entity_id:"worry"}}, {_id:2316, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_yRNKupugs)<SEP>YouTube Video: cu-Tx7ehQvM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cu-Tx7ehQvM)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779675447, description:"Peace is the natural state of the human body and the foundation for balance and healing.<SEP>Peace is framed as a goal requiring the eradication of divisiveness and systemic injustice.<SEP>Peace, clarity, intelligence, and stillness emerge through the practice of awareness.", source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e<SEP>chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d<SEP>chunk-3f3bafe6f6c90c708d53427b40b9a1a7<SEP>chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"peace"}}, {_id:2317, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A continuous, unbroken sentence structure ending with \"Thank you,\" intentionally used to create a specific narrative rhythm.", created_at:1779167296, source_id:"chunk-2571a5b04e1099d62f3684e457e34d71", entity_id:"Run-On Sentence"}}, {_id:2318, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Thank You is a phrase used in the run-on sentence from the YouTube video.", created_at:1779167396, source_id:"chunk-a9697fcde15e625c6897be6f1b0218f7", entity_id:"Thank You"}}, {_id:2319, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The process of adding punctuation to improve readability in a text with excessive repetition and lack of structure.", created_at:1779167414, source_id:"chunk-d488fbfb15a8f79f360ab3c5b1d504a1", entity_id:"Punctuation Fixing"}}, {_id:2320, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"An excessively long, continuous sentence with repeated \"a world\" phrases and a concluding \"Thank you,\" requiring punctuation fixes.", created_at:1779167414, source_id:"chunk-d488fbfb15a8f79f360ab3c5b1d504a1", entity_id:"Massive Sentence"}}, {_id:2321, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dhiira is a spiritual term defined as one whose intellect shines with the light of dharma or universal principles.", created_at:1779168383, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3", entity_id:"dhiira"}}, {_id:2322, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Swami Vivekananda is a historical figure and spiritual leader referenced in the story, demonstrating courage by facing fears and monkeys in Varanasi.<SEP>Historical figure referenced in the text.<SEP>Swami Vivekananda is a historical figure whose life story is used as an example in the text.", created_at:1779168383, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64<SEP>chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77", entity_id:"Swami Vivekananda"}}, {_id:2323, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Courage is a concept discussed in relation to dhiira and overcoming fears.", created_at:1779168383, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3", entity_id:"courage"}}, {_id:2324, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual concept correctly used in the text.<SEP>Dharma is a concept mentioned in the context of dhiira.<SEP>A term relevant to the context of the video text, retained as it is correctly used without requiring modification.", created_at:1779668380, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64<SEP>chunk-fd21d2b8f77b77ecda29029645f27574", entity_id:"dharma"}}, {_id:2325, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Varanasi is the city where Swami Vivekananda encountered the monkeys and demonstrated courage.<SEP>City mentioned in the text as a location.<SEP>Varanasi is the city where Swami Vivekananda was walking when he encountered the monkeys.", created_at:1779168383, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64<SEP>chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77", entity_id:"Varanasi"}}, {_id:2326, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F_yRNKupugs)<SEP>YouTube Video: cHAJiF2byzg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHAJiF2byzg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779662166, description:"Fear is a concept that is overcome through courage and divine will.<SEP>Fear is an emotion that contributes to the body's survival state and prevents peace.<SEP>Fear is a concept discussed in the context of the coronavirus pandemic, with mentions of exponential growth in fear levels.", source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-b2d8b4d71527eb902bd535fd3a2ab41d<SEP>chunk-e264e9dc0aed2215851420aa0c3de19d", entity_id:"fear"}}, {_id:2327, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Shri Rama is a mythological figure cited as an example of courage and spiritual resolve.<SEP>Mythological figure referenced in the text.<SEP>Shri Rama is mentioned as an example of someone who walked into the forest.", created_at:1779168384, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64<SEP>chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77", entity_id:"Shri Rama"}}, {_id:2328, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Heal the mind implies restoring mental well-being or resolving inner conflicts.", created_at:1779222232, source_id:"chunk-484bc3d2121acfeffdb578822d602a80", entity_id:"Heal the Mind"}}, {_id:2329, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Incorrect entity due to factual error in the text; should be corrected to Malala Yousafzai.<SEP>Malala Yusuf Sai is mentioned as an example of someone who took a bullet for a cause, though the name is noted as potentially incorrect.", created_at:1779168384, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3<SEP>chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64", entity_id:"Malala Yusuf Sai"}}, {_id:2330, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Monkeys are the creatures that chased Swami Vivekananda and were overcome by courage.", created_at:1779168384, source_id:"chunk-716f70c82340a863624fa47098e63ad3", entity_id:"monkeys"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2331, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779168785, description:"Spiritual concept correctly used in the<SEP>A term analyzed for consistency and potential errors in the text, repeatedly referenced across multiple sentences.<SEP>dhira is a term used in a repetitive chain-like structure within the input text, with no explicit attributes or activities described beyond its recurrence.", source_id:"chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64<SEP>chunk-3a19e2b6dcc9df696732acc1d63e7a4d<SEP>chunk-db89048ca459bd3b97b42a85019fcf29", entity_id:"dhira"}}, {_id:2332, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Malala Yousafzai is a Nobel laureate and advocate for education, mentioned as an example of courageous rebellion.<SEP>Corrected entity; Nobel laureate who took a bullet for her activism and beliefs.", created_at:1779168384, source_id:"chunk-270fcc29517d133cdb2e1b97b5e80e64<SEP>chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77", entity_id:"Malala Yousafzai"}}, {_id:2333, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dhira refers to an awakened being or a state of fearlessness and spiritual resilience emphasized in the narrative.<SEP>Dhira is an incorrect transcription of \"dheera,\" identified as a homophone error in the input text.", created_at:1779168812, source_id:"chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77<SEP>chunk-271085d12c313edac6a7a133c3463606", entity_id:"Dhira"}}, {_id:2334, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A sannyasi is a wandering ascetic who advises Swami Vivekananda to face the monkeys, symbolizing wisdom.", created_at:1779168385, source_id:"chunk-379dcbaa1fba64cd1d562fe797bdcf77", entity_id:"Sannyasi"}}, {_id:2335, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Transcend the mind signifies surpassing mental limitations through spiritual or conscious awareness.", created_at:1779222232, source_id:"chunk-484bc3d2121acfeffdb578822d602a80", entity_id:"Transcend the Mind"}}, {_id:2336, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Process of identifying and categorizing errors such as homophones or misheard words in the text.", created_at:1779168746, source_id:"chunk-3a19e2b6dcc9df696732acc1d63e7a4d", entity_id:"error analysis"}}, {_id:2337, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Methodology used to examine each sentence of the text for errors or inconsistencies.", created_at:1779168746, source_id:"chunk-3a19e2b6dcc9df696732acc1d63e7a4d", entity_id:"sentence analysis"}}, {_id:2338, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Type of error involving words that sound similar but have different meanings or spellings.", created_at:1779168746, source_id:"chunk-3a19e2b6dcc9df696732acc1d63e7a4d", entity_id:"homophones/misheard words"}}, {_id:2339, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dheera refers to a state of courage and victory, central to the spiritual context of Mukthi Guru.", created_at:1779168812, source_id:"chunk-271085d12c313edac6a7a133c3463606", entity_id:"Dheera"}}, {_id:2340, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dheera embodies courage and victory, key themes in Mukthi Guru's spiritual context.", created_at:1779168839, source_id:"chunk-271085d12c313edac6a7a133c3463606", entity_id:"Courageous and Victorious"}}, {_id:2341, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"These elements are primary focus areas for correcting transcription errors in Mukthi Guru's content.", created_at:1779168839, source_id:"chunk-271085d12c313edac6a7a133c3463606", entity_id:"Homophones, Domain-Specific Terms, Punctuation"}}, {_id:2342, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A term symbolizing courage, victory, and strength, central to the input text's thematic focus.", created_at:1779168883, source_id:"chunk-62e25e090c1f38b8ad8fb3b011d0eb34", entity_id:"dheera"}}, {_id:2343, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Input Text is a generic term for various types of text that require correction. It can appear in multiple contexts, such as a Sanskrit-like text that needs correction based on domain-specific terms, a transcript from a YouTube video analyzed for compliance with correction rules, or a guided meditation script containing intentional and unintentional errors. The term also applies to a string of transcription errors, exemplified by the sequence '?l?l?l...', which indicates a transcription error.  

The input text may exhibit several issues, including repetitive use of the word \"critical\" and the mention of \"dheera,\" a term associated with courage and victory. It often lacks conversational filler and may contain transcription errors, mishearings, domain-specific terms, and punctuation issues. For instance, the text might feature a string of '?l?l?l...' as a transcription error, or it might be a guided meditation script with both intentional and unintentional errors.  

Correction of the input text involves addressing domain-specific terms, punctuation, and the identified errors. The process follows correction rules, which may include handling intentional and unintentional errors. The goal is to ensure the text is accurate and compliant with the required standards, whether it is a Sanskrit-like text, a YouTube transcript, or a meditation script.", created_at:1779736467, source_id:"chunk-62e25e090c1f38b8ad8fb3b011d0eb34<SEP>chunk-6239363e43b90d034be5850e9ec19b9d<SEP>chunk-4aa2186804f084108c45c41993118d21<SEP>chunk-32d242f8b8589873c418da28de2aa7f5<SEP>chunk-ac6391e06ee1d9f0eaf83699fa502ac7<SEP>chunk-25c321e128bae2ec1d82719bef8c6996<SEP>chunk-591036e7b8f7e9576e9f165456e4f909<SEP>chunk-55556acea804a1064101176b4fd1d907", entity_id:"Input Text"}}, {_id:2344, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zp2w7DTmOwc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A term used repetitively in the input text to emphasize significance, associated with achieving \"dheera\" and overcoming challenges.", created_at:1779168883, source_id:"chunk-62e25e090c1f38b8ad8fb3b011d0eb34", entity_id:"critical"}}, {_id:2345, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Person sitting next to you is a participant in the meditation exercise, receiving wishes for well-being.", created_at:1779172719, source_id:"chunk-688e0592e6058a0f8fa853433206f1bf", entity_id:"Person Sitting Next to You"}}, {_id:2346, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"A location in California where the family experienced an accident, serving as the setting for Sri Krishnaji's realization.<SEP>Big Bad Lake is a location in California where the accident took place.", created_at:1779172719, source_id:"chunk-bdc4a608530faeb54a567f51d21bad5a<SEP>chunk-665f72ba5123be26210ce8f477e2012f", entity_id:"Big Bad Lake"}}, {_id:2347, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"What the stars have to say is a musical composition by Stephen Devassy played during the meditation session to enhance the atmosphere.", created_at:1779172719, source_id:"chunk-688e0592e6058a0f8fa853433206f1bf", entity_id:"What the Stars Have to Say"}}, {_id:2348, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Three-question meditation is a guided self-observation practice involving three reflective questions about one's mental and emotional state.", created_at:1779172719, source_id:"chunk-688e0592e6058a0f8fa853433206f1bf", entity_id:"Three-Question Meditation"}}, {_id:2349, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Life event leading to Krishnaji?s realization about the root cause of human suffering.` - Looks correct. `event` is valid. Description is good.", created_at:1779172720, source_id:"chunk-1fc805671f75f5c49fede8b02e05b8db", entity_id:"Accident at Big Bear Lake"}}, {_id:2350, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Global conflicts arising from self-centeredness, as explained in the narrative?s philosophical framework.` - Looks correct. `concept` is valid. Description is good.", created_at:1779172720, source_id:"chunk-1fc805671f75f5c49fede8b02e05b8db", entity_id:"War and Division"}}] AS row
