UNWIND [{_id:2351, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Limitless power of consciousness describes boundless mental or spiritual potential.", created_at:1779222232, source_id:"chunk-484bc3d2121acfeffdb578822d602a80", entity_id:"Limitless Power of Consciousness"}}, {_id:2352, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"An accident occurred at Big Bad Lake in California eight years ago involving a family.<SEP>An accident occurred at Big Bad Lake in California eight years ago.", created_at:1779172720, source_id:"chunk-665f72ba5123be26210ce8f477e2012f", entity_id:"Accident at Big Bad Lake"}}, {_id:2353, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Yasmi is a monk who helps the woman by carrying her across the river.", created_at:1779172720, source_id:"chunk-665f72ba5123be26210ce8f477e2012f", entity_id:"Yasmi"}}, {_id:2354, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Marie For Leo Website hosts discussions, content, and resources related to personal growth and transformation.", created_at:1779173009, source_id:"chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5", entity_id:"Marie For Leo Website"}}, {_id:2355, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Everything is Figureoutable is a book by Marie Forleo emphasizing problem-solving and mindset.<SEP>Everything is Figureoutable is a book promoting the belief that challenges can be resolved through mindset shifts.", created_at:1779173009, source_id:"chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5<SEP>chunk-3d84d66881e27df882507ec43ab5fd29", entity_id:"Everything is Figureoutable"}}, {_id:2356, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Connected State is a concept describing a mindset of unity with universal intelligence that leads to peace and clarity. It is also a state of being characterized by love, peace, compassion, courage, and passion, which is associated with bringing order to life. This positive emotional state fosters order in one's existence and is linked to alignment with others and purpose, thereby promoting a positive organizational culture and collaboration.

The Connected State implies a harmonious or interlinked existence that enables mutual love experiences between individuals. It is a state of emotional connection that allows love to be shared and reciprocated effectively. In this condition, individuals communicate with consciousness, which helps bring about order. The concept also suggests that a connected state can create a \"magical destiny,\" reflecting a deeper, perhaps spiritual, dimension to the experience.

Overall, Connected State integrates personal emotional qualities with a broader sense of universal connection, resulting in clarity, peace, and order. It serves as both an internal mindset and an external relational dynamic, influencing how individuals interact with others and perceive their environment.<SEP>A connected state implies a harmonious or interlinked existence, enabling the creation of a \"magical destiny.\"<SEP>Connected State is a state of consciousness described as essential for creating destiny through interconnectedness.<SEP>Connected State is a state of consciousness described as essential for creating destiny through interconnectedness.<SEP>State of being connected, which is part of creating a magical destiny.<SEP>State of being connected, which is part of creating a magical destiny.", created_at:1779686715, source_id:"chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5<SEP>chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b<SEP>chunk-7969e4168ecd055a3fbcda3d1911b288<SEP>chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f<SEP>chunk-534aa5b1bce760dde6fcebe7d2a8da54<SEP>chunk-d1580b380e66d60231e8bb1500c438e9<SEP>chunk-69c518552350983af20c342ffe0b1ce1<SEP>chunk-1de41cf0c7dd51f4c24f73f5f21d78fe<SEP>chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393<SEP>chunk-fedec056ab462ac623268f5f37e05639", entity_id:"Connected State"}}, {_id:2358, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Four-Day Retreat is a global event where participants undergo transformation through collective cultivation of a beautiful state.", created_at:1779173009, source_id:"chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5", entity_id:"Four-Day Retreat"}}, {_id:2359, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Collective Suffering stems from global disconnection and division, affecting future generations.<SEP>Collective Suffering arises from global disconnection and impacts individuals and communities.", created_at:1779173010, source_id:"chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5<SEP>chunk-b4387a01e271d1d16068a0288faa84e5", entity_id:"Collective Suffering"}}, {_id:2360, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Generational Transformation occurs through the cultivation of a beautiful state across retreats and individuals.", created_at:1779173010, source_id:"chunk-a29dd9226d9c6641c3dfa10db6f15eb5", entity_id:"Generational Transformation"}}, {_id:2361, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Marie Forleo is a person featured in the input text as the host of MarieTV and a speaker discussing life and business.`<SEP>Marie Forleo is a host and entrepreneur who discusses personal and professional growth on her show MarieTV.", created_at:1779173010, source_id:"chunk-3d84d66881e27df882507ec43ab5fd29<SEP>chunk-50a3afd25409a52a572d62a449dbc4ec", entity_id:"Marie Forleo"}}, {_id:2362, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Limitations of the mind represent constraints or boundaries of human cognition.", created_at:1779222232, source_id:"chunk-484bc3d2121acfeffdb578822d602a80", entity_id:"Limitations of the Mind"}}, {_id:2363, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"MarieTV is a television show categorized as a platform for discussing business and life strategies.`<SEP>MarieTV is a platform for discussing business and life strategies, hosted by Marie Forleo.", created_at:1779173011, source_id:"chunk-3d84d66881e27df882507ec43ab5fd29<SEP>chunk-50a3afd25409a52a572d62a449dbc4ec", entity_id:"MarieTV"}}, {_id:2364, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTe11DlB4QI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)<SEP>YouTube Video: 6j6EGVpQkI8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6j6EGVpQkI8)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Thoughts are mental processes that can repeat over time and contribute to the formation of one's internal state. They are described as processes that can be repeated, and in some contexts, they may be considered neutral, but generally they are part of the mind's ongoing activity.

In many cases, thoughts exhibit a negativity bias, with a majority?83%?described as negative and repetitive. Other sources report that thoughts are categorized as repetitive (80-85%) and negative (70%), with an average of 15,000-60,000 per day. This bias includes self-obsessed tendencies.

Mental processes are observed during meditation, not attributed to a self. Additionally, mental states, including thoughts, can be influenced by the emotional energy of food and environments.

The average number of thoughts per day is estimated at 15,000?60,000, reflecting the high volume and repetitive nature of mental activity.

These descriptions collectively highlight that thoughts are dynamic, often negative, and subject to external influences such as diet and surroundings, while also being observable in meditative states without self-referential attribution.<SEP>The mind is composed of thoughts, with an average of 15,000 to 60,000 per day.", created_at:1779672418, source_id:"chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-bd988ca2fbb6c189e4b536ea7d78104c<SEP>chunk-a395387e60480713a88c70d27d01c1ab<SEP>chunk-23221c5b17e3851e48fb2c99d16575d0<SEP>chunk-f75c5d6ff6cf90a0c79623ead0773fbc<SEP>chunk-ba586743a140b7df40d5cacb7f238ed9<SEP>chunk-e7076c6d9101be02063cc3fee9b2fbba<SEP>chunk-e56919e461f379123fc8b4b2380a2a52<SEP>chunk-b04f7ebc196bc2024dc00fdd71633076<SEP>chunk-295ece324351da0c7194c4e2d4f58e99<SEP>chunk-53e525d93caa11247db9588a7b9a8e7a<SEP>chunk-331ce489e777434104c9abde748a4203<SEP>chunk-a806b7026395d82c6e1fe100191449c6<SEP>chunk-9174f4aac6278b492855cabdc7a615b1", entity_id:"Thoughts"}}, {_id:2365, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dominant category of human thoughts (85%), contributing to suffering and reduced intelligence.`<SEP>Negative thoughts constitute 83% of daily thoughts, contributing to suffering and self-obsession.<SEP>Negative thoughts described as \"huge debris of thoughts in our consciousness\" affecting mental state and signaling to the universe.<SEP>Negative thoughts are common, involving fear, anger, or hurt.", created_at:1779672419, source_id:"chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-bd988ca2fbb6c189e4b536ea7d78104c<SEP>chunk-53e525d93caa11247db9588a7b9a8e7a<SEP>chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625<SEP>chunk-9174f4aac6278b492855cabdc7a615b1", entity_id:"Negative Thoughts"}}, {_id:2366, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual action emerges from dissolving suffering and connecting with others, prioritizing collective well-being.<SEP>A principle guiding decisions in moral conflicts, rooted in inward connection.<SEP>Spiritual action refers to principles guiding moral decisions in conflicts between moral/ethical dilemmas and human survival.<SEP>Spiritual action is applied in situations involving moral or ethical conflicts.", created_at:1779655487, source_id:"chunk-0b93a19f07fdaada8a87bb7bfa37fae9<SEP>chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6<SEP>chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1<SEP>chunk-419f2bb193b6ad2621108753e0e6993e", entity_id:"Spiritual Action"}}, {_id:2367, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 6j6EGVpQkI8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6j6EGVpQkI8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779520401, description:"Memories are components of the mind, influencing emotions and potentially becoming corrupted, leading to recurring feelings and suffering states.<SEP>Memories in enlightenment are retained as factual information without emotional attachment or preoccupation.<SEP>Memories in enlightenment are retained as factual information without emotional attachment or preoccupation.<SEP>Memories in enlightenment are retained as uncharged information, without attachment or emotional impact.", source_id:"chunk-f1b4fdaeda1ac88655f980287b031a38<SEP>chunk-e7076c6d9101be02063cc3fee9b2fbba<SEP>chunk-e56919e461f379123fc8b4b2380a2a52", entity_id:"Memories"}}, {_id:2369, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_X5jRvqxEEo)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779666709, description:"<think>
