UNWIND [{_id:2373, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"80% of negative thoughts, reinforcing suffering through cyclical self-absorption.`<SEP>Cluttered mental state characterized by recurring, unproductive thoughts that hinder clear thinking and decision-making.<SEP>A subset of thoughts characterized by repetition, constituting 80?85% of daily mental activity.<SEP>A significant portion of thoughts are repetitive, leading to repetitive thinking.", created_at:1779672418, source_id:"chunk-bd988ca2fbb6c189e4b536ea7d78104c<SEP>chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5<SEP>chunk-331ce489e777434104c9abde748a4203<SEP>chunk-9174f4aac6278b492855cabdc7a615b1", entity_id:"Repetitive Thoughts"}}, {_id:2374, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Evolutionary cognitive tendency favoring survival-focused negative thinking, conflicting with Beautiful State.`", created_at:1779173013, source_id:"chunk-bd988ca2fbb6c189e4b536ea7d78104c", entity_id:"Negativity Bias"}}, {_id:2375, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Biological mechanisms designed for survival, now counterproductive to modern well-being.`", created_at:1779173013, source_id:"chunk-bd988ca2fbb6c189e4b536ea7d78104c", entity_id:"Ancient Circuitry"}}, {_id:2376, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hwNlLB1sze0)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: zGOKGrTNlk4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGOKGrTNlk4)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", created_at:1779396467, description:"Serene Mind Practice is a meditation technique designed to dissolve anxiety, desperation, and self?obsession by cultivating present?moment awareness and a sense of connection. It involves observing emotions without becoming attached to them, thereby reducing suffering and fostering serenity.  

The practice is structured as a three?step meditation, though some sources describe it as a three?minute technique, emphasizing its brevity and accessibility. It is presented as a simple yet effective method to break anxiety habits, release fear, and shift consciousness. Brain?training aspects are noted, with the technique claimed to activate specific brain regions, thereby altering consciousness and external outcomes.  

Serene Mind Practice is used globally by a diverse range of individuals, including leaders, spiritual seekers, teenagers, and children, to prevent obsessive states, enhance clarity, and manage stress in various situations. It is also described as a mental technique to move from self?obsession to a state of serenity and as a pathway to accessing universal intelligence, offering a method to release anxiety and fear while cultivating a more balanced mental state.<SEP>Serene mind practice is a technique recommended to dissolve suffering and find solutions to problems.<SEP>Serene mind practice is a technique to dissolve suffering and problems through mental connection.<SEP>Serene mind practice is a method to dissolve suffering and anxiety, facilitating transition to stillness.<SEP>Serene mind practice is a method to prevent the buildup of suffering by consciously acknowledging and addressing disturbances.<SEP>Serene mind practice involves intentional awareness to manage inner disturbances and prevent suffering buildup.", source_id:"chunk-b4387a01e271d1d16068a0288faa84e5<SEP>chunk-46f092e49beb29848499bc5cec4e1faf<SEP>chunk-0b9ac55d2cab188fc69b15917905c7be<SEP>chunk-214089f71bed8468f80247a24979283e<SEP>chunk-999192b96103e7c498639cfadd062722<SEP>chunk-5b0bc29474343c900abfcb530ac6bf39<SEP>chunk-a8aa437c4036f2bcb15546966bd2e573<SEP>chunk-bbc81bf6a0558d20de7cf1bfde2d1f2a<SEP>chunk-956d12a94e0e0bb6b9859844aca052b9<SEP>chunk-0de990c9c98448c49e9565dc513c171a<SEP>chunk-e7c9f032dc546ceb8596a807018125ca<SEP>chunk-0ddbd4446b0368311d8844f5869734c4<SEP>chunk-28084224d33efa95fcb7e18cd0d14748", entity_id:"Serene Mind Practice"}}, {_id:2377, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Four Stages is a framework to access universal intelligence through letting go of anxiety, opening awareness, visualizing desires, and collective action.", created_at:1779173044, source_id:"chunk-b4387a01e271d1d16068a0288faa84e5", entity_id:"Four Stages"}}, {_id:2378, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779565373, description:"The Boy is a character who stole a horse to feed his family, leading to a moral dilemma and judgment by Confucius.<SEP>An eight-year-old boy who played Gilly and faced family backlash after an incident.<SEP>The boy is a character who is part of a dynamic involving punishment and attitude.", source_id:"chunk-46f092e49beb29848499bc5cec4e1faf<SEP>chunk-8bc46e0d57c8aca69ad6ab17dc5cfd03<SEP>chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13", entity_id:"The Boy"}}, {_id:2379, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JYqlxlBZHc4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The Father is the boy's parent, released by Confucius while the boy was jailed for stealing the horse.<SEP>The Father is a deceased individual who was the source of the man's unresolved anger and need for validation.", created_at:1779188759, source_id:"chunk-46f092e49beb29848499bc5cec4e1faf<SEP>chunk-165a6947c193c6485a15dca83d2b7887", entity_id:"The Father"}}, {_id:2380, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mind file corruption refers to the deterioration of mental stability, manifesting as chaotic thoughts, insomnia, and inability to slow down reactions.", created_at:1779222440, source_id:"chunk-29eb5de3144659c00743987c869aa476", entity_id:"Mind File Corruption"}}, {_id:2381, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Defective programs in the mind represent negative emotional states like anger, fear, and disappointment that disrupt life.", created_at:1779222440, source_id:"chunk-29eb5de3144659c00743987c869aa476", entity_id:"Defective Programs"}}, {_id:2382, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"A woman is a central figure in the story, whose interaction with Nomi and Yesmi triggers the main conflict about carrying and touching a woman.", created_at:1779173067, source_id:"chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43", entity_id:"woman"}}, {_id:2383, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The transmission breaking is mentioned as a significant challenge in Nomi's life, representing a practical problem.", created_at:1779173067, source_id:"chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43", entity_id:"transmission"}}, {_id:2384, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional hurt is described as a bug that spreads through relationships and leads to depression, corrupting the mind's system.<SEP>Emotional pain or distress caused by ridicule, teasing, or broken trust, as analyzed in the text.<SEP>Emotional hurt refers to the manager's past disappointments and anger affecting his decisions.<SEP>Emotional hurt refers to the manager's past disappointments and anger affecting his decisions.", created_at:1779561653, source_id:"chunk-3324f1848f747970d99d374e6a692e91<SEP>chunk-29eb5de3144659c00743987c869aa476<SEP>chunk-baa29517ede049854e2aecf133575342<SEP>chunk-6f1a73ee81a735372368488ff67b808c", entity_id:"Emotional Hurt"}}, {_id:2385, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k5RDNv-CH9M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Virus is used metaphorically to describe how emotional hurt spreads and corrupts the mind's system, similar to a virus infecting a computer system.", created_at:1779222440, source_id:"chunk-29eb5de3144659c00743987c869aa476", entity_id:"virus"}}, {_id