UNWIND [{_id:2454, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ehkqJ54DIC0)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4Fjf6IQsjQs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4Fjf6IQsjQs)<SEP>YouTube Video: HZIuHUGmnGY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HZIuHUGmnGY)<SEP>YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Enlightened State is a condition of oneness and great compassion, characterized by the experience of bliss permeating all sensory and mental experiences and by the integration of these experiences into a unified whole. It is described as a state of being free from the matrix of the mind and its four mattresses, which enables intelligent decisions. In this state, individuals are able to channel the universe's intelligence toward positive outcomes such as problem-solving and enlightenment. The enlightened state is also a required mental condition for humans to effectively channel and utilize the universe's inherent intelligence. Furthermore, it represents a transcendent mode of existence free from suffering, emphasized as a transformative goal. The state thus combines compassion, bliss, and integration, and serves as a necessary mental framework for accessing higher intelligence and achieving transformative, suffering?free existence.<SEP>A state of being free from suffering, associated with awakened consciousness and positive contribution to collective consciousness.", created_at:1779519729, source_id:"chunk-9a28cb6f3aba46853905402269a06aba<SEP>chunk-168f7db76a78fdae540996d31ccc165d<SEP>chunk-3a9b1e90fab2bdbcbb151bc873bcb657<SEP>chunk-55cc26bf031f0db4fced411b5d43e45c<SEP>chunk-c195d5abc160d6408ccad089d03fdf8f<SEP>chunk-5da4be811aa540e35dbc3127e30549e4<SEP>chunk-86b06c28798f4c4a7bd03b34bd895d71<SEP>chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e", entity_id:"Enlightened State"}}, {_id:2455, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Shri Sri Preethaji is a spiritual teacher and humanitarian who founded the Loka Foundation, led reconciliation initiatives in Colombia, and advocates for healing and forgiveness.<SEP>Shri Sri Preethaji is described as a rare sage who leads peace meditation and healing seminars.", created_at:1779174144, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-9d2a0ad692331733d51852934ce7b3f5<SEP>chunk-136e0828d80d107f75974ede595c760a", entity_id:"Shri Sri Preethaji"}}, {_id:2456, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Peace in Your Eyes is a reconciliation event in Colombia organized by Shri Sri Preethaji, designed to bring together conflicting groups and foster healing and forgiveness. The event focuses on facilitating dialogue and mutual understanding among participants, with the aim of promoting inner peace and acceptance. It is also referenced as a phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, which is mentioned in the context of healing and transformation, highlighting its broader symbolic significance beyond the specific event.

The phrase ?Peace in Your Eyes? is also used to denote a personal state of inner calm and acceptance, often invoked during periods of personal growth and transformation. Its usage in the context of healing underscores the connection between inner peace and the process of reconciliation, both at individual and collective levels.<SEP>A phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, mentioned in the context of healing and transformation.<SEP>Peace in Your Eyes is an event led by Sri Preethaji focused on healing and reconciliation.<SEP>A phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, mentioned in the context of healing and transformation.<SEP>Peace in Your Eyes is an event led by Sri Preethaji focused on healing and reconciliation.<SEP>A phrase representing inner peace and acceptance, mentioned in the context of healing and transformation.<SEP>Peace in Your Eyes is an event led by Sri Preethaji focused on healing and reconciliation.", created_at:1779756051, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-030392b491fddbfc0e19d2b0f73dcc1f<SEP>chunk-d26a33b7890276490920b92132c786db", entity_id:"Peace in Your Eyes"}}, {_id:2457, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Chaos in health (e.g., diabetes) leads to battles in solving problems.", created_at:1779222882, source_id:"chunk-7969e4168ecd055a3fbcda3d1911b288", entity_id:"Solving Problems"}}, {_id:2458, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A former guerrilla leader who attended Shri Sri Preethaji's event in Colombia and later renounced violence after experiencing healing.", created_at:1779173646, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f", entity_id:"Guerrilla Leader"}}, {_id:2459, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sustainable villages are communities built using local materials like mud bricks, prioritizing eco-friendly practices and self-construction.", created_at:1779173646, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f", entity_id:"Sustainable Villages"}}, {_id:2460, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Everything is a concept that appears in the provided text and is listed among the concepts, indicating its inclusion in the conceptual framework of the document. It is presented as a distinct entry within the list of concepts, emphasizing its role as a defined term. The description of Everything is repeated multiple times in the description list, each time reiterating that it is a concept mentioned in the text and part of the list of concepts. The input also includes a header indicating the entity name as 'Everything' and the existence of a description list.<SEP>Everything is a concept mentioned in the text, part of the list of concepts.<SEP>Everything is a concept mentioned in the text, part of the list of concepts.<SEP>Everything is a concept mentioned in the text, part of the list of concepts.<SEP>Everything is a concept mentioned in the text, part of the list of concepts.<SEP>Everything is a concept mentioned in the text, part of the list of concepts.", created_at:1779695316, source_id:"chunk-7969e4168ecd055a3fbcda3d1911b288<SEP>chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6<SEP>chunk-b08f45193924d9c9045e2c6dd99944d2", entity_id:"Everything"}}, {_id:2461, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Mud bricks are traditional building materials used in sustainable village construction, replacing cement and steel.<SEP>Mud bricks are the construction material used by the Loka Foundation to build sustainable village homes.<SEP>Mud bricks are the construction material used by the Loka Foundation to build sustainable village homes.<SEP>Mud bricks are the construction material used by the Loka Foundation to build sustainable village homes.<SEP>Mud bricks are the construction material used by the Loka Foundation to build sustainable village homes.<SEP>Mud bricks are the construction material used by the Loka Foundation to build sustainable village homes.", created_at:1779748670, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-cecd189888b143617d34f8b0b2e301b7", entity_id:"Mud Bricks"}}, {_id:2462, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDcy09esbe8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779735334, description:"<think>
