 and chaos dynamics, though its exact definition remains implicit in the text.<SEP>Consciousness Law is a domain-specific principle that, when followed, leads to order in various aspects of life and contributes to a magnificent life.", created_at:1779223517, source_id:"chunk-29839d6d7d0e5b2cd1270aaf6c732c38<SEP>chunk-ea86eced1dc5f4afd9febcb64617c6b8<SEP>chunk-65dfea79d783b0403b775689b17817eb<SEP>chunk-8c2cc5514a536fb11e09433f01ed2e85<SEP>chunk-92de552ab3b343ec94bcf5b612359aba<SEP>chunk-edee740a602e9fade69883d02224f2fa", entity_id:"Consciousness Law"}}, {_id:2468, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Characterized as the medium through which consciousness operates and communicates.<SEP>Universal energy field acknowledged across cultures and validated by modern science.<SEP>The field of energy is a concept discussed as part of a larger field validated by science.<SEP>Field of Energy is a metaphysical concept described as a universal presence connecting all matter and consciousness.", created_at:1779404473, source_id:"chunk-29839d6d7d0e5b2cd1270aaf6c732c38<SEP>chunk-e41aa29188359857d686593b398cb57d<SEP>chunk-e2e44adeb9e364c8a1e4597e2d7040b0<SEP>chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1", entity_id:"Field of Energy"}}, {_id:2470, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of fear is an emotional condition marked by anxiety or dread, linked to disruptions in the field of consciousness and life chaos.", created_at:1779223109, source_id:"chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b", entity_id:"State of Fear"}}, {_id:2471, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of anger is an emotional condition characterized by hostility or frustration, described as communicating with the field of consciousness to manifest chaos.", created_at:1779223109, source_id:"chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b", entity_id:"State of Anger"}}, {_id:2472, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The Frankly Speaking show is a platform for discussions on transformation and consciousness.<SEP>Frankly Speaking is a television or radio show where Sri Sri Krishnaji and Navigaji participate in discussions on healing and connecting within.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-1c3c80dce751d1f7b79cbb9a20a4e9ce<SEP>chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c", entity_id:"Frankly Speaking"}}, {_id:2473, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Navigaji is a participant in the Frankly Speaking show.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-1c3c80dce751d1f7b79cbb9a20a4e9ce", entity_id:"Navigaji"}}, {_id:2474, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Connecting Within is a concept discussed on the Frankly Speaking show, focusing on internal connections.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-1c3c80dce751d1f7b79cbb9a20a4e9ce", entity_id:"Connecting Within"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2475, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Individual transformation is a key focus, involving living in states of compassion and oneness.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c<SEP>chunk-64efe8180cefe24f9560acd6c262cd84", entity_id:"Individual Transformation"}}, {_id:2476, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Collective transformation is achieved through individual transformation, impacting humanity's consciousness.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c", entity_id:"Collective Transformation"}}, {_id:2477, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The human body's cells, enzymes, and organs communicate in a state of oneness, promoting health.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c", entity_id:"Human Body Communication"}}, {_id:2478, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Broken mirrors represent internal conflicts from external voices, hindering oneness.", created_at:1779173648, source_id:"chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c", entity_id:"Broken Mirrors"}}, {_id:2479, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Desire can lead to obsessive craving when fixated on achieving an object of desire.", created_at:1779173786, source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a", entity_id:"Obsessive Craving"}}, {_id:2480, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779395892, description:"Meditation shifts brain activity from the limbic system to the medial prefrontal cortex, promoting calmness.<SEP>The limbic system processes unconscious tendencies and emotional memories influencing conscious thought and behavior.<SEP>The limbic system is a part of the brain associated with emotions and processes unconscious tendencies from childhood, maternal influence, or past lives.", source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a<SEP>chunk-ba586743a140b7df40d5cacb7f238ed9<SEP>chunk-019177d585b65eb10f97dfb309cde652", entity_id:"Limbic System"}}, {_id:2481, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"An ancient Thai story about flushing mud to experience the true Buddha is referenced as similar to the teachings on enlightenment.", created_at:1779173787, source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a", entity_id:"Ancient Story"}}, {_id:2482, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"An ancient Thai story about flushing mud to experience the true Buddha is referenced as similar to the teachings on enlightenment.", created_at:1779173788, source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a", entity_id:"Thailand"}}, {_id:2483, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Meditation activates the medial prefrontal cortex, associated with calm and awareness.<SEP>The medial prefrontal cortex is a brain region associated with rational thought and emotional regulation, counteracting the amygdala's negativity.<SEP>The medial prefrontal cortex is a brain region associated with rational thought and emotional regulation, counteracting the amygdala's negativity.<SEP>The medial prefrontal cortex is a brain region associated with rational thought and emotional regulation, counteracting amygdala activity during awareness.<SEP>The medial prefrontal cortex is a brain region associated with rational thought and emotional regulation, counteracting amygdala activity during awareness.", created_at:1779561286, source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a<SEP>chunk-1b0c6f6cf5b3451d482de925f92b2a15<SEP>chunk-2c9bcdcac30e6029287eee4161a0477b", entity_id:"Medial Prefrontal Cortex"}}, {_id:2484, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The garden analogy explains how repeated mental states create ingrained neural pathways.", created_at:1779173788, source_id:"chunk-58262216b12d3a82c0194e2a972ecdde", entity_id:"Neural Pathways"}}, {_id:2485, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The individual's mental state directly influences the life situations they encounter.", created_at:1779173789, source_id:"chunk-58262216b12d3a82c0194e2a972ecdde", entity_id:"Mental State"}}, {_id:2486, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Internal State refers to the emotional and mental condition of individuals and society, encompassing one's psychological well-being and influencing relationships and self-perception. It is shaped by the external environment, which in turn affects the internal state, creating a reciprocal relationship. While physical advancements have been achieved, the internal state of both individuals and society is noted as not improving and is described as deteriorating. This deterioration is characterized by persistent issues such as family breakdown and addiction, indicating a decline in social and emotional health despite progress in other domains. The concept of internal state is applied to both personal and collective contexts, highlighting that the same mental and emotional dynamics affect personal relationships and broader societal well-being. The observed decline in internal state across society is linked to increasing family breakdown and addiction, which are viewed as symptoms of a broader erosion of social and emotional health.<SEP>The internal state of individuals and society is described as deteriorating, with issues like family breakdown and addiction.<SEP>The internal state of individuals and society is described as deteriorating, with issues like family breakdown and addiction.", created_at:1779551793, source_id:"chunk-58262216b12d3a82c0194e2a972ecdde<SEP>chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0<SEP>chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-5f06ba1ae7a3d1eb5ae89a5a7db786f0", entity_id:"Internal State"}}, {_id:2487, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Individual mental states contribute to collective unconscious signals affecting the universe.", created_at:1779173789, source_id:"chunk-58262216b12d3a82c0194e2a972ecdde", entity_id:"Individual Experiences"}}, {_id:2488, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Soul Sync Meditation leads to a calm, quiet consciousness and dissolution of stress.` This is also a duplicate/rephrasing of the first `Soul Sync Meditation` relationship. It's redundant.<SEP>Soul Sync Meditation leads to a calm, quiet consciousness and dissolution of stress.`", created_at:1779173790, source_id:"chunk-02f292000f544446b15f0519998d1dbc", entity_id:"Calm State"}}, {_id:2489, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Soul Sync Meditation is a structured practice for cultivating inner calm and dissolving ego-driven patterns.` The first one is more about the outcome, the second is about the method. The first one seems more distinct. The second one is a bit circular.", created_at:1779173791, source_id:"chunk-02f292000f544446b15f0519998d1dbc", entity_id:"Calm State` seems to be a re-statement or a slightly different version of `Soul Sync Meditation"}}, {_id:2490, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Lack of clarity leads to merging external challenges with internal experiences, perpetuating suffering.", created_at:1779173791, source_id:"chunk-0b9ac55d2cab188fc69b15917905c7be", entity_id:"Internal World"}}, {_id:2491, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779174165, description:"Shri Sri Preethaji and Shri Sri Krishnaji discussed forgiveness, healing, and societal reconciliation during a public discourse.<SEP>Shri Sri Krishnaji is a mystic, philosopher, and spiritual master co-creating Aekam, known for healing seekers and promoting enlightenment.` -> Looks correct.<SEP>Shri Sri Krishnaji is a mystic, philosopher, and spiritual master co-creating Aekam, known for healing seekers and promoting enlightenment.`<SEP>Shri Sri Krishnaji is a spiritual figure and astrology podcast host addressing karmic challenges like Pitra Dosh.", source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-136e0828d80d107f75974ede595c760a<SEP>chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47", entity_id:"Shri Sri Krishnaji"}}, {_id:2492, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", created_at:1779173830, description:"Sri Krishnaji understands Telugu.", source_id:"chunk-9a28cb6f3aba46853905402269a06aba", entity_id:"Telugu"}}, {_id:2493, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", created_at:1779173830, description:"Lack of oneness leads to loneliness.", source_id:"chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c", entity_id:"Lack of Oneness"}}, {_id:2494, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of guilt is an emotional condition involving remorse or self-reproach, associated with signaling imbalance to the field of consciousness.", created_at:1779223109, source_id:"chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b", entity_id:"State of Guilt"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2495, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of insecurity reflects self-doubt or lack of confidence, described as triggering chaotic outcomes through its interaction with the field of consciousness.", created_at:1779223109, source_id:"chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b", entity_id:"State of Insecurity"}}, {_id:2497, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"State of guilt is an emotional state that, when present, communicates to consciousness that one is not fine, leading to chaos in life.", created_at:1779223134, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"State Of Guilt"}}, {_id:2498, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"State of fear is an emotional state that, when present, communicates to consciousness that one is not fine, leading to chaos in life.", created_at:1779223134, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"State Of Fear"}}, {_id:2499, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"State of anger is an emotional state that, when present, communicates to consciousness that one is not fine, leading to chaos in life.", created_at:1779223134, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"State Of Anger"}}, {_id:2500, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779520761, description:"Governments are mentioned as one of the old systems breaking down, and are contrasted with the need for community-based solutions.<SEP>Nations globally grapple with discrimination and systemic issues, reflecting shared human challenges.<SEP>Nations are political entities that can experience economic decline due to external factors like virus infestations.<SEP>Nations are entities that can be involved in wars and can pray for peace.<SEP>Nations refer to political entities or communities of people, as mentioned in the context of global peace aspirations.", source_id:"chunk-faa6974a8318ba2e0ef63f3f66ff8ef6<SEP>chunk-3ae96ad01fcb39bd7a75f6d45072f0d6<SEP>chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d<SEP>chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480<SEP>chunk-070ab85d13e241f53294ba4c4f14edc8<SEP>chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-c1132eb602efecba3dcd1e9547e3e420", entity_id:"Nations"}}, {_id:2501, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"State of insecurity is an emotional state that, when present, communicates to consciousness that one is not fine, leading to chaos in life.", created_at:1779223134, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"State Of Insecurity"}}, {_id:2502, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chaos in life is a state of disorder that can be opened up by negative emotional states.", created_at:1779223134, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"Chaos In Life"}}, {_id:2503, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Problems in relationships are one of the aspects of life affected by negative emotional states.", created_at:1779223135, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"Problems In Relationships"}}, {_id:2504, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"awakened wealth creators are individuals driven by purpose larger than themselves, contributing to sustainability and peace through wealth creation.", created_at:1779174138, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"awakened wealth creators"}}, {_id:2505, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Order in life is a state of balance that can be opened up by positive emotional states.", created_at:1779223135, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"Order In Life"}}, {_id:2506, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Problems in finances are one of the aspects of life affected by negative emotional states.", created_at:1779223135, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"Problems In Finances"}}, {_id:2507, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Various life aspects include relationships, finances, health, and other areas of life.", created_at:1779223135, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"Various Life Aspects"}}, {_id:2508, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Problems in health are one of the aspects of life affected by negative emotional states.", created_at:1779223135, source_id:"chunk-9c20c8f0dd5caad4ba7b2edbb0325b1f", entity_id:"Problems In Health"}}, {_id:2509, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An idiomatic phrase indicating that aspects of life start to align in order, resulting from the connected state.", created_at:1779223176, source_id:"chunk-534aa5b1bce760dde6fcebe7d2a8da54", entity_id:"Fall In Order"}}, {_id:2510, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Lokathalyana refers to universal well-being, emphasizing harmony and collective prosperity through spiritual awakening.", created_at:1779174139, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"Lokathalyana"}}, {_id:2511, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Misheard phrase corrected to \"order starts to come into every aspect of your life.\"", created_at:1779223231, source_id:"chunk-ff56e69789b9f87a6e727c24b67b6e7c", entity_id:"fall in order"}}, {_id:2512, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrected phrase indicating order in life aspects.", created_at:1779223231, source_id:"chunk-ff56e69789b9f87a6e727c24b67b6e7c", entity_id:"order starts to come into every aspect of your life"}}, {_id:2513, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrected phrase about problems disappearing.", created_at:1779223231, source_id:"chunk-ff56e69789b9f87a6e727c24b67b6e7c", entity_id:"Where you had problems, they will start to disappear"}}, {_id:2514, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Common errors in speech where words sound similar but have different meanings, such as \"Where\" vs. \"Whenever\" and \"it's.\"", created_at:1779223260, source_id:"chunk-1f4c7c24a99c61450ba6af5fa672f0b9", entity_id:"Homophone Errors in Transcript"}}, {_id:2515, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A lifestyle focused solely on oneself, leading to social disconnection and conflict.", created_at:1779223260, source_id:"chunk-1f4c7c24a99c61450ba6af5fa672f0b9", entity_id:"Self-Centered Living"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2516, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A principle discussing the balance between order and chaos in consciousness, particularly the \"second consciousness law.\"", created_at:1779223260, source_id:"chunk-1f4c7c24a99c61450ba6af5fa672f0b9", entity_id:"Consciousness Law of Order and Chaos"}}, {_id:2517, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The joy and well-being of others, which self-centered individuals disregard in their focus on themselves.", created_at:1779223260, source_id:"chunk-1f4c7c24a99c61450ba6af5fa672f0b9", entity_id:"Joy and Well-Being of Others"}}, {_id:2518, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphorical conflicts arising from self-centered behavior, as described in the video.", created_at:1779223260, source_id:"chunk-1f4c7c24a99c61450ba6af5fa672f0b9", entity_id:"Metaphorical Battles"}}, {_id:2519, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Challenges in personal relationships caused by self-centered behavior.", created_at:1779223306, source_id:"chunk-ea86eced1dc5f4afd9febcb64617c6b8", entity_id:"Battles in Relationship"}}, {_id:2520, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"crime rates decline with collective meditation, indicating societal harmony.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"crime rates"}}, {_id:2521, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"economic growth correlates with meditation practices promoting universal well-being.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"economic growth"}}, {_id:2522, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"car accidents decrease with meditation, reflecting heightened collective awareness.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"car accidents"}}, {_id:2523, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"hospital admissions reduce with peace-focused meditation, symbolizing societal health.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"hospital"}}, {_id:2524, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"brain scans demonstrate physiological changes during collective meditation on peace and compassion.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-9d9744dacd10c03b653c5a3fe39dda9e", entity_id:"brain scans"}}, {_id:2525, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A joyful song representing happiness and unity, central to the lyrical theme.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Joyful Song"}}, {_id:2526, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A peaceful embrace symbolizing harmony and connection, highlighted in the lyrics.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Peaceful Embrace"}}, {_id:2527, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: co9vrSiN8ak (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=co9vrSiN8ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779552819, description:"An abstract representation of boundless light and enlightenment, described as \"wide open ocean of light.\"<SEP>The ocean of light symbolizes the infinite field of consciousness, characterized by boundless energy and vibration.<SEP>Metaphorical description of universal consciousness as an infinite, luminous expanse.", source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8<SEP>chunk-14f9aad35378ea842ed9adc84e1e533e<SEP>chunk-095655c628157e4cc94eedb07a0968a6", entity_id:"Ocean of Light"}}, {_id:2528, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779563521, description:"Entity Name: Grace

Description List:", source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8<SEP>chunk-61a7ee017159ac7e6854fff065426b75<SEP>chunk-0390556d788c91f6a96de617dfba0674<SEP>chunk-efcb91e5fdaab3bfd47bb92c605956fe<SEP>chunk-feadf97235c8f111320838dcf92b6b01<SEP>chunk-6f1a73ee81a735372368488ff67b808c<SEP>chunk-5ccc31c8e1d16623e7633752bbd5a9ab", entity_id:"Grace"}}, {_id:2529, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The presence of love and affection permeating the atmosphere, emphasized in the text.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Love in the Air"}}, {_id:2530, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An invitation to radiate positivity and guidance, referenced in the closing lines.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Shine Your Light"}}, {_id:2531, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A physical gesture of connection and unity, mentioned in the opening line of the text.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Holding Hands"}}, {_id:2532, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A moment of movement and joy described in the lyrics, symbolizing spontaneity and presence.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Dancing Today"}}, {_id:2533, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: cu-Tx7ehQvM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cu-Tx7ehQvM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779659866, description:"Unity is a concept described in the provided descriptions as the recognition of the value in diverse perceptions and the realization of collective peace. Alternatively, it is also described as the realization of the value in diverse perceptions and the foundation for collective peace.

These two perspectives highlight different aspects of the same idea: one emphasizes the act of recognizing the value in varied viewpoints, while the other focuses on the actualization of that value. Both descriptions agree that Unity involves the acknowledgment of value across different perceptions and the establishment of a basis for collective peace. The distinction lies in whether the emphasis is on the cognitive recognition or the practical realization of that value.<SEP>Unity is described as the realization of the value in diverse perceptions and the foundation for collective peace.<SEP>Unity is described as the recognition of the value in diverse perceptions and the realization of collective peace.<SEP>Unity is described as the realization of the value in diverse perceptions and the foundation for collective peace.<SEP>Unity is described as the recognition of the value in diverse perceptions and the realization of collective peace.<SEP>Unity is described as the recognition of the value in diverse perceptions and the realization of collective peace.<SEP>Unity reflects the text?s theme of interconnectedness with the Earth and collective existence.", source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8<SEP>chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253<SEP>chunk-817243e49afe8b11df3c2d2ea2541519<SEP>chunk-122b26a4cc30222007d37133d11cda63<SEP>chunk-a28c71d3080d41b1e18683441ac8c1c6", entity_id:"Unity"}}, {_id:2534, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of harmonious togetherness, reflected in the repetition of \"all together as one.\"", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-66c9d2b7ebbf4aa02386f608fa1ab6e8", entity_id:"Collective Unity"}}, {_id:2535, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"?kam is a spiritual movement founded by Sri Sri Preethaji and Sri Sri Krishnaji, spreading across over a hundred nations and leading millions to direct experiences of their personal divine and miracles.", created_at:1779174140, source_id:"chunk-5c61cf6a11b484a07796c6dda3777527", entity_id:"?kam"}}] AS row
