COVID is a global pandemic viewed through spiritual and metaphorical lenses as a shared human experience of karma, manifesting through lockdowns, masks, societal disruption, and health crises.", source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47<SEP>chunk-161257a3b15bcafcf939769dfff5e967<SEP>chunk-3a0add62a70895b5ac3db1f7977a8549<SEP>chunk-c1d8dd3f6ee4794537974077b8f6d5c9<SEP>chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e<SEP>chunk-e1d5e0073f33e1ee1857e1f6302d5b7f<SEP>chunk-00b63395d5ef5274c1baeb0f4e99541f<SEP>chunk-3bbc23f7da347ce4b93776c537570fa8", entity_id:"COVID"}}, {_id:2583, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vastu Dosh relates to negative energies from imbalanced or hostile environments, impacting health and relationships.<SEP>Vastu Dosh relates to negative energies from house or land configurations impacting well-being, discussed in the context of spatial harmony.<SEP>Vastu Dosh relates to imbalances caused by land or architectural factors, influencing karma.`", created_at:1779174164, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47<SEP>chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51<SEP>chunk-8828f50e6038efd15058fd650efc925a", entity_id:"Vastu Dosh"}}, {_id:2584, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FP5O9F9JiOk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Negative Karma manifests as problems like health issues, relationship conflicts, and societal challenges.<SEP>conflict resolution, mutual respect<<SEP>Negative Karma is the consequence that was ended by Ahalya's transformation.<SEP>Negative karma is a concept that can be cleared through awakening.<SEP>Negative karma is a concept that can be cleared through awakening.", created_at:1779722181, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47<SEP>chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51<SEP>chunk-e92892e6fc3f2eca65cd533bfb485c1c<SEP>chunk-6a0ae176234daa0b99856020306df342<SEP>chunk-3252cf650a481bf3542ef91ee7acaae1", entity_id:"Negative Karma"}}, {_id:2585, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pitra Dosh refers to negative karmic consequences from ancestors' actions, affecting individuals' lives and relationships.", created_at:1779174164, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47", entity_id:"Pitra Dosh"}}, {_id:2586, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Humanity's Karma refers to the collective karmic experiences of all humans, exemplified by events like COVID-19 and societal challenges.<SEP>Humanity's Karma describes collective experiences like the COVID-19 pandemic, where universal challenges affected all equally.`", created_at:1779174164, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47<SEP>chunk-8828f50e6038efd15058fd650efc925a", entity_id:"Humanity's Karma"}}, {_id:2587, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Brain Modes refer to neural activity states (beta, alpha, theta, etc.) influencing mental clarity and emotional balance.<SEP>Brain modes (Beta, Alpha, Theta, etc.) represent different states of brain activity linked to mental states like stress or focus, discussed in the context of Soul Sync's effects.", created_at:1779174165, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47<SEP>chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51", entity_id:"Brain Modes"}}, {_id:2588, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Sri Pritharjee is a creator of the Soul Sync meditation program and a proponent of karmic solutions.", created_at:1779174165, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47", entity_id:"Sri Pritharjee"}}, {_id:2589, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Homas are fire rituals believed to clear negative energies, though their effectiveness depends on inner state alignment.", created_at:1779174165, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47", entity_id:"Homas"}}, {_id:2590, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Vastu Corrections involve adjusting environments to neutralize negative energies, often requiring expert guidance.", created_at:1779174165, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47", entity_id:"Vastu Corrections"}}, {_id:2591, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Kidneys are biological organs whose harmonious functioning contributes to overall health.<SEP>The kidneys are part of the body's systems that function in harmony when there is perfect communication between bodily systems.", created_at:1779223434, source_id:"chunk-8c2cc5514a536fb11e09433f01ed2e85<SEP>chunk-f1afa41b3519d740bacb88dad54ed44e", entity_id:"Kidneys"}}, {_id:2592, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Oneness Achievers is a proposed 5-day program (twice yearly) focused on transforming leaders by addressing inner states, challenges, and fostering clarity, courage, and intelligence.<SEP>Oneness Achievers is a program designed to help leaders transform their mindset by focusing on inner clarity and calmness to handle challenges effectively and achieve success.`", created_at:1779174165, source_id:"chunk-161257a3b15bcafcf939769dfff5e967<SEP>chunk-8828f50e6038efd15058fd650efc925a", entity_id:"Oneness Achievers"}}, {_id:2593, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Personality development coach from Latin America attended the Ekam Abundance Festival and experienced a spiritual awakening.<SEP>Personality development coach from Latin America attended the Ekam Abundance Festival and experienced a heart awakening.", created_at:1779224867, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-f3c9a2b1053591399fd7351098da3627<SEP>chunk-6924307324d5ba84e533d49dbdf29d98", entity_id:"Personality Development Coach"}}, {_id:2594, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Mental Health Awareness Month is observed globally to promote discussions about mental health and wellness.<SEP>Mental Health Awareness Month is an event observed in the original text.<SEP>Mental Health Awareness Month is a global observance focused on raising awareness about mental health issues and related challenges such as addiction.<SEP>Mental Health Awareness Month is observed globally as a month dedicated to raising awareness about mental health issues.", created_at:1779224904, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-65e592e96dcb520be6fd6fe6ab9612ea<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-782fc68234c609b298ab73b8f6469f59", entity_id:"Mental Health Awareness Month"}}, {_id:2595, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779224948, description:"Alcohol addiction involves dependency on alcohol, with global statistics indicating over 300 million affected individuals.<SEP>Alcohol addiction is a classical addiction linked to significant global statistics, with over 300 million alcohol addicts worldwide and 14 million in India.<SEP>Alcohol addiction is a classical addiction characterized by excessive consumption of alcoholic beverages, with over 300 million global cases.<SEP>Alcohol addiction is a type of behavioral addiction characterized by compulsive consumption of alcoholic beverages despite adverse consequences.", source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-29187c924e9a374fb8f3996bb7bb3fb9", entity_id:"Alcohol Addiction"}}] AS row
