UNWIND [{_id:2596, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779224948, description:"Internet gaming addiction affects at least 100 million people, characterized by compulsive engagement with digital platforms.<SEP>Internet gaming addiction is a modern addiction affecting at least 100 million people, driven by compulsive behavior.<SEP>Internet gaming addiction describes compulsive engagement with online gaming, affecting at least 100 million people globally.<SEP>Internet gaming addiction involves excessive and compulsive engagement with online gaming platforms, interfering with daily life.", source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-29187c924e9a374fb8f3996bb7bb3fb9", entity_id:"Internet Gaming Addiction"}}, {_id:2597, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Coach's son was a source of public shame for the coach but experienced transformation after the coach's festival experience.", created_at:1779224496, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db", entity_id:"Coach's Son"}}, {_id:2598, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779672187, description:"Addictions are characterized as a self-perpetuating or vicious cycle that consumes individuals both physically and emotionally, thereby hindering their ability to achieve personal goals or find meaning and purpose in life. This cyclical nature creates a persistent pattern of behavior that is difficult to break without intervention.

The behavioral dependencies associated with Addictions often arise from external pressures and internal struggles. Societal expectations and an inability to self-accept can foster these dependencies, while stress and anxiety also serve as catalysts for their development. In children, such dependencies may manifest as negative behaviors stemming from feelings of being judged, leading to further emotional and psychological challenges.<SEP>Addictive behaviors resulting from stress and anxiety as per the transcript's assertion.<SEP>Addictive behaviors resulting from stress and anxiety as per the transcript's assertion.<SEP>Addictions are framed as manifestations of moral decay and loss of ethical grounding.<SEP>Addictions are framed as manifestations of moral decay and loss of ethical grounding.<SEP>Addictions represent harmful dependencies on substances or behaviors linked to escapism from societal pressures.`", source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-65e592e96dcb520be6fd6fe6ab9612ea<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-782fc68234c609b298ab73b8f6469f59<SEP>chunk-f1b80dca74bf6e05c17db254a9158b6f<SEP>chunk-7909a6563f5b96191ad7c41fa18cd126<SEP>chunk-7ac9109abdb5bdc9de2685e960e358c1<SEP>chunk-4043681cb90e5032a1d66db36f936a98<SEP>chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc<SEP>chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7<SEP>chunk-e53aa20908f0e3dc300b2226e52897f3<SEP>chunk-e27c90d3f030c932363441c1ed78bf62<SEP>chunk-fafff025e01a29bbcee9969fc4559382<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5<SEP>chunk-4da1e45ca993decf20ec10e31d56d36e<SEP>chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6<SEP>chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9<SEP>chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Addictions"}}, {_id:2599, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779224948, description:"Nicotine addiction, primarily through smoking, is projected to cause over a billion deaths in the century and affects 100 million people currently.<SEP>Nicotine addiction involves dependency on tobacco or nicotine products, linked to significant health risks and mortality.<SEP>Nicotine addiction involves dependence on tobacco products containing nicotine, leading to physical and psychological withdrawal symptoms.", source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-29187c924e9a374fb8f3996bb7bb3fb9", entity_id:"Nicotine Addiction"}}, {_id:2600, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Drug addiction is a chronic, relapsing condition characterized by compulsive use of psychoactive substances despite harmful effects. It is categorized as a classical addiction with severe societal and health consequences, and it pertains to substance abuse involving illicit or prescription drugs, contributing to physical and psychological harm.

Drug addiction is also cited as a rising crisis linked to societal disintegration and as a rising social issue requiring state intervention.

The societal consequences of drug addiction are profound, often leading to disintegration of communities and increased burden on healthcare systems. The condition's chronic nature means that relapse is common, making sustained treatment essential. Public health responses typically involve state-led interventions, including prevention programs, treatment services, and policies aimed at reducing the availability of harmful substances.

In summary, drug addiction is a multifaceted problem that combines chronic, relapsing behavior with severe health and societal consequences. It is driven by the misuse of psychoactive substances, both illicit and prescription, and is increasingly recognized as a rising crisis tied to societal disintegration. Effective responses require state-led interventions, including prevention, treatment, and policy measures, to mitigate its impact on individuals and communities.", created_at:1779551877, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa<SEP>chunk-29187c924e9a374fb8f3996bb7bb3fb9<SEP>chunk-25f394f47fe40575ea9fbcd110df6414<SEP>chunk-5f06ba1ae7a3d1eb5ae89a5a7db786f0", entity_id:"Drug Addiction"}}, {_id:2601, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"group", truncate:"", description:"Alcohol addicts represent a demographic with over 300 million individuals globally, including 14 million in India.", created_at:1779224497, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d", entity_id:"Alcohol Addicts"}}, {_id:2602, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779225057, description:"Smoking is a harmful habit linked to nicotine addiction, causing significant mortality and health risks.<SEP>Smoking is a harmful habit linked to addiction and health risks, with over a billion projected deaths worldwide in the century.<SEP>Smoking involves the use of tobacco products, which can develop into compulsive habits.", source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-afded1563688b8ea6c18ff58fee20328<SEP>chunk-f2f9786934d74ebda8763ab5342ee99b<SEP>chunk-6924307324d5ba84e533d49dbdf29d98", entity_id:"Smoking"}}, {_id:2603, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779225057, description:"Internet gaming is a modern activity that can transition into addiction when used compulsively.<SEP>Internet gaming is a modern addiction affecting at least 100 million people globally.<SEP>Internet Gaming describes online gaming activities that may escalate into addictive behaviors.", source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-afded1563688b8ea6c18ff58fee20328<SEP>chunk-f2f9786934d74ebda8763ab5342ee99b", entity_id:"Internet Gaming"}}, {_id:2604, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: RGFI6v2Biq0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGFI6v2Biq0)<SEP>YouTube Video: 3ITFXvYIPqg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ITFXvYIPqg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Civilization is described as \"addicted\" due to systemic reliance on speed, thrill, and pleasure-seeking behaviors.<SEP>Civilization is described as addicted to speed, thrill, and pleasure, reflecting a low quality of consciousness.<SEP>A civilization that prioritizes external achievements and relationships as pathways to happiness.<SEP>Civilization is described as overvaluing information and motivation, neglecting the quiet mind.<SEP>A collective entity representing human society, characterized by self-dissatisfaction and societal pressures to conform to external role models.<SEP>The civilization is responsible for bringing up the younger ones and inculcating values.<SEP>A collective entity representing human society, characterized by self-dissatisfaction and societal pressures to conform to external role models.", created_at:1779524828, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-afded1563688b8ea6c18ff58fee20328<SEP>chunk-cdbfc6e200f4cd4487961cefed0a0954<SEP>chunk-222632c14fa6c017ed35de349b2ef6bb<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5", entity_id:"Civilization"}}, {_id:2605, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mental and emotional wellness is contrasted with addictions, representing balance and health.", created_at:1779224497, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d", entity_id:"Mental and Emotional Wellness"}}, {_id:2606, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Deep unhappiness is a root cause driving individuals to seek escape through addictive behaviors.", created_at:1779224497, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d", entity_id:"Deep Unhappiness"}}, {_id:2607, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Addiction arises from attempts to escape unhappiness, failure, or existential meaninglessness through compulsive behaviors.<SEP>Life Struggles refer to personal challenges and unhappiness that drive individuals toward addictive behaviors.", created_at:1779224817, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-954c4e66e25d390d543a0361e6284f30", entity_id:"Life Struggles"}}, {_id:2608, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Irresistible temptation refers to an overwhelming urge driving addictive actions, making resistance nearly impossible.", created_at:1779224792, source_id:"chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa", entity_id:"Irresistible Temptation"}}, {_id:2609, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Compulsive habit describes a behavior that is difficult to resist despite negative consequences, often underlying addictive behaviors.", created_at:1779224792, source_id:"chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa", entity_id:"Compulsive Habit"}}, {_id:2610, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Preetika is a spiritual figure who experienced a Divine Encounter at age 11 and later founded the Oneness movement with her parents.", created_at:1779174167, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Preetika"}}, {_id:2611, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Shri Amma is the co-founder of the Oneness movement and Preetika's parent.", created_at:1779174167, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Shri Amma"}}, {_id:2612, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Shri Bhagwan is the co-founder of the Oneness movement and Preetika's parent.", created_at:1779174167, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Shri Bhagwan"}}, {_id:2613, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hiranya Garbha (Cosmic Womb) is a symbol of Oneness representing the source of creation, documented in the Rig Vedas and linked to the Big Bang Theory.", created_at:1779174167, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Hiranya Garbha"}}, {_id:2614, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Diksha Phenomena refers to the transfer of Divine energies from one person to another, enabling connection to personal Divine experiences.", created_at:1779174167, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Diksha Phenomena"}}, {_id:2615, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Ekam Center is a spiritual center in India where Hiranya Garbha is consecrated, designed for people to connect with their Divine and experience calm.", created_at:1779174167, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Ekam Center"}}] AS row
