tity_id:"Wealth Creators"}}, {_id:2650, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"n provides information about human potential and truth to individuals seeking transformation.", created_at:1779174263, source_id:"chunk-606a5dddaf8cbb6d5e610e78907fcb44", entity_id:"information"}}, {_id:2651, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"studying oneness redirects attention from material objects to universal interconnectedness.", created_at:1779174263, source_id:"chunk-606a5dddaf8cbb6d5e610e78907fcb44", entity_id:"material world"}}, {_id:2652, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"wholeness replaces ego-driven separation with interconnectedness and collective harmony.", created_at:1779174264, source_id:"chunk-606a5dddaf8cbb6d5e610e78907fcb44", entity_id:"separation"}}, {_id:2653, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"conscious awareness dissolves unconscious behaviors and limitations.", created_at:1779174264, source_id:"chunk-606a5dddaf8cbb6d5e610e78907fcb44", entity_id:"unconscious patterns"}}, {_id:2654, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Diksha enables recipients to experience Transcendental Mystical States and healing through Divine connection.", created_at:1779174296, source_id:"chunk-0672025ffa10c61fef9c8e0c57bed0e2", entity_id:"Transcendental Mystical States"}}, {_id:2655, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Laker Antenna measured Earth's energy emissions at Ekam's site, revealing exceptionally high readings that validated its spiritual potential.`: Looks correct. `source_entity` is `Laker Antenna`, `target_entity` is `Ekam`, `relationship_keywords` are `Earth's Energy`, `relationship_description` is accurate.<SEP>...`: `source_entity` is `Laker Antenna` (correct), `target_entity` is `Ekam` (implied, but the description is about the measurement at the site, so this is acceptable), `relationship_keywords` are `Earth's Energy` (correct), `relationship_description` is a single string (correct).", created_at:1779174297, source_id:"chunk-23cb579d7ea483826ac50f3d8de4f099", entity_id:"Earth's Energy"}}, {_id:2656, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The speaker inherits Amma Bhagawan's spiritual legacy, emphasizing service to humanity and natural spiritual growth from a young age.`: Looks correct. `source_entity` is `Amma Bhagawan`, `target_entity` is `Paddhaji` (implied, but the description is about inheritance), `relationship_keywords` are `spiritual lineage`, `relationship_description` is accurate.<SEP>...`: `source_entity` is `Amma Bhagawan` (correct), `", created_at:1779174297, source_id:"chunk-23cb579d7ea483826ac50f3d8de4f099", entity_id:"spiritual lineage"}}, {_id:2657, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"A cricket player from Karnataka improved batting performance after practicing Soul Sync meditation.", created_at:1779174298, source_id:"chunk-76149e88e75ab43aa17ddf5959e26b51", entity_id:"Cricket Player"}}, {_id:2658, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ekam's architecture and Earth's energies enable visitors to experience divine connection and personal transformation effortlessly.`: Looks correct. `source_entity` is `Ekam`, `target_entity` is `Amma Bhagawan` (implied, but the description is about the place enabling this), `relationship_keywords` are `divine manifestation`, `relationship_description` is accurate.", created_at:1779174299, source_id:"chunk-23cb579d7ea483826ac50f3d8de4f099", entity_id:"divine manifestation"}}, {_id:2659, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"New publications or products offered by Simon & Schuster.", created_at:1779174326, source_id:"chunk-e25c39bb1e659f873118af19e0e15068", entity_id:"new releases"}}, {_id:2660, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Special promotions available to subscribers of Simon & Schuster's mailing list.", created_at:1779174326, source_id:"chunk-e25c39bb1e659f873118af19e0e15068", entity_id:"exclusive offers"}}] AS row
