UNWIND [{_id:2681, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Two global charities founded by Krishnaji and Preethaji, providing aid to over 500,000 villagers in more than 1,000 villages.` - Looks correct.<SEP>Two enormous charities founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, impacting over 500,000 villagers in more than one thousand villages.`<SEP>Two enormous charities founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, impacting over 500,000 villagers in more than one thousand villages.`<SEP>Charities founded by The Academy have impacted over 500,000 villagers across more than one thousand villages and 220,000 students in Indian schools and colleges.`<SEP>Charities founded by The Academy have impacted over 500,000 villagers across more than one thousand villages and 220,000 students in Indian schools and colleges.`<SEP>Two large-scale charitable initiatives founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, impacting over 500,000 villagers across 1,000+ villages.", created_at:1779183475, source_id:"chunk-23f4ae85323a27ae180ceca7fa33c13a<SEP>chunk-dad86cc04528a53c723f853b94021683<SEP>chunk-1ba7f5be1d21e67ddd5d6d9988215271<SEP>chunk-81f7d5b351616383eb1a7cca9b4d2b48", entity_id:"Charities"}}, {_id:2682, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Business ventures guided by Krishnaji and Preethaji, reflecting their visionary approach to integrating consciousness with professional success.` - Looks correct.<SEP>Global businesses founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, where they serve as visionaries and guides.`<SEP>Global businesses founded by Preethaji and Krishnaji, where they serve as visionaries and guides.`<SEP>Global businesses established by The Academy are guided by visionaries and serve as economic ventures.`<SEP>Global businesses established by The Academy are guided by visionaries and serve as economic ventures.`<SEP>Business ventures guided by Preethaji and Krishnaji, established as visionaries and guides in recent years.", created_at:1779183475, source_id:"chunk-23f4ae85323a27ae180ceca7fa33c13a<SEP>chunk-dad86cc04528a53c723f853b94021683<SEP>chunk-1ba7f5be1d21e67ddd5d6d9988215271<SEP>chunk-81f7d5b351616383eb1a7cca9b4d2b48", entity_id:"Global Businesses"}}, {_id:2683, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"natural_object", truncate:"", created_at:1779183669, description:"The vagus nerve is a long, winding nerve that interfaces with the brain, heart, lungs, and digestive tract, activated during Soul Sync to induce relaxation and enhance brain efficiency.`<SEP>Vagus Nerve is a nerve that, when activated by Soul Sync, leads to the relaxation of the autonomic nervous system.<SEP>The Vagus Nerve is a cranial nerve involved in the autonomic nervous system, activated by practices like Soul Sync.", source_id:"chunk-2984b976f037a27596b29e94de8e3b21<SEP>chunk-b694dcc1bb7e7bd6fa7878c3592e7c19<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb", entity_id:"Vagus Nerve"}}, {_id:2684, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Addiction to alcohol is linked to feelings of failure and meaninglessness.<SEP>Addiction to Alcohol is a dependency on consuming alcoholic beverages despite negative consequences.", created_at:1779225057, source_id:"chunk-f3c9a2b1053591399fd7351098da3627<SEP>chunk-f2f9786934d74ebda8763ab5342ee99b", entity_id:"Addiction to Alcohol"}}, {_id:2685, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Addiction to smoking is connected to boredom and lack of purpose.<SEP>Addiction to Smoking involves compulsive tobacco use driven by psychological dependence.", created_at:1779225057, source_id:"chunk-f3c9a2b1053591399fd7351098da3627<SEP>chunk-f2f9786934d74ebda8763ab5342ee99b", entity_id:"Addiction to Smoking"}}, {_id:2686, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"India?s ancient sages pioneered the science of consciousness, discovering Brahma Garbha and its association with brain structures like the pineal gland.`<SEP>India?s ancient sages were pioneers of the science of consciousness and discovered concepts like Brahma Garbha.", created_at:1779183334, source_id:"chunk-2984b976f037a27596b29e94de8e3b21<SEP>chunk-1d01b8567ae6021fb37c32daeed210ed", entity_id:"Indias Ancient Sages"}}, {_id:2687, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The start-up is a newly launched company that adopted Soul Sync to align team intentions and achieve business goals.<SEP>The entrepreneur's new business venture that received significant support through Soul Sync intentions.", created_at:1779183431, source_id:"chunk-ba8be2f785637451bf56a7dc7363715b<SEP>chunk-f1fcfd5a753f74e11984fed8934aec32", entity_id:"Start-up"}}, {_id:2688, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Co-working space refers to a shared workspace provided by the organization to the start-up as part of their partnership.", created_at:1779174768, source_id:"chunk-ba8be2f785637451bf56a7dc7363715b", entity_id:"Co-working Space"}}, {_id:2689, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sacred architecture refers to ancient mystical principles used in designing the Ekam structure to enhance spiritual experiences.", created_at:1779174769, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87", entity_id:"Sacred Architecture"}}, {_id:2690, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"equipment", truncate:"", description:"Construction vehicles were blocked from entering the site by the Forest Department, halting progress.", created_at:1779174795, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87", entity_id:"Construction Vehicles"}}, {_id:2691, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"The workforce was mobilized for the project but faced challenges due to legal restrictions.", created_at:1779174795, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87", entity_id:"Workforce"}}, {_id:2692, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The 184-square-foot sanctum within Ekam is designed to facilitate profound spiritual experiences.", created_at:1779174795, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87", entity_id:"Sanctum"}}, {_id:2693, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The building authorities approved the project plans but failed to communicate the national forest restrictions.", created_at:1779174796, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87", entity_id:"Building Authorities"}}, {_id:2694, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Their teenage daughter is the child of Preethaji and Krishnaji, mentioned in the context of their parental role.`<SEP>Their teenage daughter is the child of Preethaji and Krishnaji, mentioned in the context of their parental role.`", created_at:1779178744, source_id:"chunk-dad86cc04528a53c723f853b94021683", entity_id:"Their Teenage Daughter"}}, {_id:2695, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", created_at:1779174954, description:"description` is followed.", source_id:"chunk-2984b976f037a27596b29e94de8e3b21<SEP>chunk-7bfa9b5709687eab441c16b01461b46d<SEP>chunk-dededd879a6495b8b3ec3f8c0e2e1ec9<SEP>chunk-7234398961838f3894f5b3cb8bdb630b<SEP>chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a<SEP>chunk-414fe5eb19105c1ee039ea0c37cea35c<SEP>chunk-66a8a0b1aaccb5bccc35d977f8203c58<SEP>chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"source"}}, {_id:2696, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", created_at:1779174954, description:"description` is followed.", source_id:"