ligns with one's heartfelt intentions and longing for support.", created_at:1779183235, source_id:"chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72", entity_id:"Hearts Longing"}}, {_id:2774, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A 2010 animal documentary highlighting challenges faced by tigers in the wild, used as a metaphor for human struggles with territory loss and adaptation.<SEP>Tiger Queen is a documentary film about tigers, referenced to illustrate parallels between human and animal challenges.` - Correct. An artifact.", created_at:1779183478, source_id:"chunk-ddc2a8c2bf46af1d243c4bae41044efd<SEP>chunk-98ebbba09ead01df2486b7e4f58bcc9b", entity_id:"Tiger Queen"}}, {_id:2775, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"This book contains stories aimed at inspiring women through emotional and spiritual narratives.", created_at:1779183267, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Chicken Soup for the Womans Soul: 101 Stories to Open the Hearts and Rekindle the Spirits of Women"}}, {_id:2776, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"An institution created to support spiritual seekers, initiated by Jennifer Read Hawthorne.", created_at:1779183268, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Center for the growing number of seekers"}}, {_id:2777, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A mental framework for transforming one?s inner world and achieving personal growth.", created_at:1779183268, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Spiritual vision"}}, {_id:2778, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of consciousness characterized by positivity, joy, and harmony.", created_at:1779183268, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Beautiful state"}}, {_id:2779, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A principle guiding individuals to cultivate spiritual visions for self-transformation.", created_at:1779183268, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Sacred secret"}}, {_id:2780, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Elevated mental states experienced spontaneously by the author from childhood.", created_at:1779183268, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Magnificent states of consciousness"}}, {_id:2781, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A carefree and joyful approach to life that coexists with spiritual experiences.", created_at:1779183268, source_id:"chunk-7d4c8c26b3558bb963e2145eec96c28f", entity_id:"Playfulness and fun"}}, {_id:2782, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Career Progress relates to professional achievements and dissatisfaction with one's work trajectory, linked to addiction triggers.", created_at:1779225055, source_id:"chunk-f2f9786934d74ebda8763ab5342ee99b", entity_id:"Career Progress"}}, {_id:2783, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pain of Feeling Unloved involves emotional suffering from perceived rejection or lack of affection, linked to addictive coping mechanisms.", created_at:1779225055, source_id:"chunk-f2f9786934d74ebda8763ab5342ee99b", entity_id:"Pain of Feeling Unloved"}}, {_id:2784, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The text defines spiritual vision as the two aspects of life: doing and being, contrasting external actions with internal experience.` This looks like a valid, missed relationship.<SEP>The text defines spiritual vision as the two aspects of life: doing and being, contrasting external actions with internal experience.`", created_at:1779183318, source_id:"chunk-ddc2a8c2bf46af1d243c4bae41044efd", entity_id:"Doing and Being"}}] AS row
