urce", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Relationship dynamics describe the tension and disillusionment in Moon's romantic partnership.", created_at:1779186055, source_id:"chunk-3371fee7dc2e5f20ad27eaf69ba00c32", entity_id:"Relationship Dynamics"}}, {_id:2897, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Future relationships potentially affected by unresolved past emotions and patterns.", created_at:1779186112, source_id:"chunk-3e351e3f449821330f87c8b4e26de0d2", entity_id:"Future Relationships"}}, {_id:2898, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"natural_object", truncate:"", description:"The lion carcass created in the fable, which came to life and killed the three fellows.", created_at:1779186309, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"The Lion"}}, {_id:2899, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stage One: Hurt is the initial stage of disconnection characterized by small hurts that can escalate if not addressed.<SEP>Stage One of disconnection involves initial emotional pain from small conflicts that escalate if not addressed.`", created_at:1779186988, source_id:"chunk-e267787286890ad0751663f8a3e06d5c<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"Stage One: Hurt"}}, {_id:2900, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The shadow that creeps upon us, creating separation and division when relationships are not founded on a spiritual vision.<SEP>The Shadow of Hurt represents a destructive inner state caused by unresolved pain that creates separation in relationships.`", created_at:1779186988, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc", entity_id:"The Shadow of Hurt"}}, {_id:2901, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The ancient Indian fable about four friends and the consequences of acting without knowledge.", created_at:1779186309, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"The Fable"}}, {_id:2902, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The forest where the four friends encountered the heap of bones.", created_at:1779186309, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"The Forest"}}, {_id:2903, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"This URL links to the YouTube video containing the discussed content and terminology analysis.", created_at:1779225677, source_id:"chunk-1cce98cd0aed40f77c27d3d6b1cb14b9", entity_id:"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw"}}, {_id:2904, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The three friends who acted without knowledge, leading to their demise in the fable.", created_at:1779186309, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"The Three Learned Fools"}}, {_id:2905, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The group of three friends (first, second, and third fellows) who encountered the bones.", created_at:1779186309, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"The Three Friends"}}, {_id:2906, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Unknown is the title of a YouTube video discussed in the source, with its content analyzed for terminology corrections.", created_at:1779225677, source_id:"chunk-1cce98cd0aed40f77c27d3d6b1cb14b9", entity_id:"Unknown (Video Title)"}}, {_id:2907, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"de-addiction\" is identified as a jarring term within the spiritual platform's context, possibly unintentionally included.", created_at:1779225739, source_id:"chunk-8563cc552e34b2ab4c93b1a1ee66f406<SEP>chunk-7fd8596e77267f333f42ebc055048d2e", entity_id:"text context"}}, {_id:2909, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The event where the lion sprang into action and killed the three fellows.", created_at:1779186310, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d", entity_id:"The Lion's Attack"}}, {_id:2910, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The sacred secrets are interconnected, and mastering all is necessary for creating an extraordinary destiny.", created_at:1779186361, source_id:"chunk-d46158568d6d67d2d4fe51b282a138b1", entity_id:"interconnectedness"}}, {_id:2911, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The intelligence can alleviate feelings of disconnection.", created_at:1779186362, source_id:"chunk-5e714c1a6ea0e14019d2ce93ffec1a74", entity_id:"alleviation of disconnection"}}, {_id:2912, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vNj7OSHos1I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779723367, description:"Inferiority is a concept that Clark struggles with.<SEP>A state where the ego feels lesser than others, associated with suffering.<SEP>Inferiority is another concept linked to social comparisons causing issues.", source_id:"chunk-23a9d70ceb9180c4dd396af6970d0186<SEP>chunk-beeabf4db9d94499feff9e07a340c9a1<SEP>chunk-bb8c7007984e1dbf803d7545148dee09", entity_id:"Inferiority"}}, {_id:2913, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8XASiz30oE)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown 