UNWIND [{_id:2956, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Actions taken from unwise emotional states, which are considered counterproductive to spiritual right action.", created_at:1779187171, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864", entity_id:"Unwise Actions"}}, {_id:2957, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unpredictable occurrences that arise as a result of spiritual right action, contributing to personal growth.", created_at:1779187171, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864", entity_id:"Unexpected Events"}}, {_id:2958, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Mike's teenage daughter insists he attend a self-reflection course, prompting his reluctant participation.", created_at:1779187322, source_id:"chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa", entity_id:"Mike's Daughter"}}, {_id:2959, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An addictive behavior Mike initially mistook for focus and drive, later recognized during the course as detrimental to his well-being.", created_at:1779187322, source_id:"chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa", entity_id:"addiction"}}, {_id:2960, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of self-importance and overconfidence that Mike adopted after his firm's struggles, leading to unethical actions.", created_at:1779187323, source_id:"chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa", entity_id:"arrogance"}}, {_id:2961, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Shri Preethaji and Shri Krishnaji will travel across five continents over two years to promote enlightenment.", created_at:1779226102, source_id:"chunk-77d6f5a3144b96f2147a4737563dbfb7", entity_id:"Five Continents"}}, {_id:2962, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conscious wealth creation involves aligning financial goals with universal intelligence and purpose.", created_at:1779187323, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8", entity_id:"Conscious Wealth Creation"}}, {_id:2963, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMrOMT4mfno)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779701131, description:"{\"Description\": \"Collective human consciousness refers to shared beliefs and attitudes influencing societal behavior.\"}<SEP>Collective human consciousness refers to shared beliefs and attitudes influencing societal behavior.", source_id:"chunk-77d6f5a3144b96f2147a4737563dbfb7<SEP>chunk-5ce3bc6c0c74a0d11ac1dfb141fbb291<SEP>chunk-7abe568e63ed3025b11ad246b7eb6e12<SEP>chunk-7fd8596e77267f333f42ebc055048d2e<SEP>chunk-4728462b4c7e2d372f2b1e40f07184a9", entity_id:"Collective Human Consciousness"}}, {_id:2964, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The young man is a protagonist who transitions from self-hate to embracing culinary passion after participating in a youth program.", created_at:1779187359, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c", entity_id:"The Young Man"}}, {_id:2965, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The call center represents the young man's unfulfilling job selling pickles, linked to his frustration and escape from self-hate.", created_at:1779187359, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c", entity_id:"Call Center"}}, {_id:2966, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"His mother is a homemaker and cook who becomes a mentor in traditional cuisine, fostering the young man's culinary growth.", created_at:1779187359, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c", entity_id:"His Mother"}}, {_id:2967, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Traditional dishes with secret ingredients, central to the young man's culinary mastery and cultural reconnection.", created_at:1779187360, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c", entity_id:"Native Varieties of Food"}}, {_id:2968, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMrOMT4mfno)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Shri Prithaji is a spiritual leader associated with Ekam and involved in inaugurating Chaar Param Rahasya.", created_at:1779226259, source_id:"chunk-5ce3bc6c0c74a0d11ac1dfb141fbb291", entity_id:"Shri Prithaji"}}, {_id:2969, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The horse that was stolen and reported to Confucius, central to the narrative's conflict.", created_at:1779187360, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e", entity_id:"Stolen Horse"}}, {_id:2970, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The underlying cause that motivated the father to steal the horse, highlighting the human element in the story.", created_at:1779187360, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e", entity_id:"Family Starvation"}}, {_id:2971, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The inherited aspirations, fears, and expectations from ancestors and society that crystallize the \"Perfect Self\" fantasy.`", created_at:1779187388, source_id:"chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051", entity_id:"Collective Inow"}}, {_id:2972, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A childlike, unapologetic acceptance of one's true self, free from societal judgments or self-measurement.`", created_at:1779187388, source_id:"chunk-d564739567a16e99326ecc627fbd4051", entity_id:"State of Innocence"}}, {_id:2973, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The honey represents temporary relief sought amid life?s chaos and insecurity.", created_at:1779187431, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8", entity_id:"Chaos and Insecurity"}}, {_id:2974, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The fear of being a nobody arises when parents compare individuals to siblings, exacerbating feelings of inadequacy.", created_at:1779187440, source_id:"chunk-d47f9b2e2b97109267ed4aa51e7ce893", entity_id:"Parental Comparisons"}}, {_id:2975, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The fear of being a nobody intensifies when teachers show preferential treatment to other students.", created_at:1779187441, source_id:"chunk-d47f9b2e2b97109267ed4aa51e7ce893", entity_id:"Teacher Favoritism"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:2976, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Romantic rejection triggers the Nobody State by reinforcing feelings of unworthiness.", created_at:1779187442, source_id:"chunk-d47f9b2e2b97109267ed4aa51e7ce893", entity_id:"Romantic Rejection"}}, {_id:2977, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Failure to achieve career goals deepens the Nobody State and despair.", created_at:1779187442, source_id:"chunk-d47f9b2e2b97109267ed4aa51e7ce893", entity_id:"Career Failure"}}, {_id:2978, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The four prime pursuits are a framework for human desires, including Kama, Dharma, and Mukti, which can be pursued from either a beautiful state or a suffering state.", created_at:1779187474, source_id:"chunk-dc9927460d19d840d6ca22cca3f93322", entity_id:"Four Prime Pursuits"}}, {_id:2979, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The architecture rm is the company owned by Mike, which faced financial crisis.", created_at:1779187474, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"architecture rm"}}, {_id:2980, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The board of directors imposed a crisis on the CEO, demanding cost-cutting.", created_at:1779187474, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Board of directors"}}, {_id:2981, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Economic turnaround is the recovery of the economy, leading to increased demand.", created_at:1779187475, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Economic turnaround"}}, {_id:2982, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Cost-cutting measures are actions taken to address financial crisis, including layoffs.", created_at:1779187475, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Cost-cutting measures"}}, {_id:2983, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMrOMT4mfno)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Chaar Param Rahasya is a book offering revolutionary insights into realizing pure blissful consciousness.", created_at:1779226259, source_id:"chunk-5ce3bc6c0c74a0d11ac1dfb141fbb291", entity_id:"Chaar Param Rahasya"}}, {_id:2984, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Company growth is the result of the CEO's spiritual approach and cost-cutting.", created_at:1779187475, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Company growth"}}, {_id:2985, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual awakening is a state of consciousness that the CEO achieved.", created_at:1779187475, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Spiritual awakening"}}, {_id:2986, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Wealth creation is the pursuit of abundance through a consciousness approach.", created_at:1779187475, source_id:"chunk-ecbc3c2d763ada03509e65f05c56b79c", entity_id:"Wealth creation"}}, {_id:2987, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The term \"inner desperation\" is used in the input text to describe a state of inner despair, which is contrasted with the idea of a way out.", created_at:1779227246, source_id:"chunk-9e24146a5276d3043bb79aebf95604aa", entity_id:"Inner Desperation"}}, {_id:2988, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The term \"financial abyss\" is used in the input text to describe a state of financial despair, which is contrasted with the idea of a way out.", created_at:1779227246, source_id:"chunk-9e24146a5276d3043bb79aebf95604aa", entity_id:"Financial Abyss"}}, {_id:2989, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"Break out of your inner desperation\" is presented as a solution or action to overcome the state of inner desperation.", created_at:1779227248, source_id:"chunk-9e24146a5276d3043bb79aebf95604aa", entity_id:"Break Out Of Your Inner Desperation"}}, {_id:2990, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bMGaQ2nUE5Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779688231, description:"Contributions refer to the value of services or efforts made by individuals, often undervalued in societal dynamics.<SEP>Contributions are the actions of people that form the basis for awareness and gratitude.<SEP>Contributions are the actions of people that form the basis for awareness and gratitude.<SEP>Contributions are the actions or efforts of others that form the basis for gratitude when acknowledged.", source_id:"chunk-fdd895baa3282f9ed911c72eae7a3d65<SEP>chunk-4cce82363fc6230a01c314614c6acbf3<SEP>chunk-737fcc2550e7f9481acd8dc6c1689aab", entity_id:"Contributions"}}, {_id:2991, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Inflammation from the Past represents unresolved historical grievances influencing present attitudes toward wealth.", created_at:1779187511, source_id:"chunk-fdd895baa3282f9ed911c72eae7a3d65", entity_id:"Inflammation from the Past"}}, {_id:2992, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Distaste for Money reflects aversion or disdain toward wealth, rooted in historical or psychological factors.", created_at:1779187511, source_id:"chunk-fdd895baa3282f9e