 truncate:"", description:"Pausing and grounding oneself in the present moment is described as an inner journey to observe one's relationship with wealth and self.<SEP>The man's personal exploration and self-discovery process, resulting in profound self-realization.<SEP>An inner journey signifies a personal or spiritual exploration leading to transformation.<SEP>Inner journey symbolizes introspection and personal exploration.", created_at:1779214458, source_id:"chunk-fdd895baa3282f9ed911c72eae7a3d65<SEP>chunk-165a6947c193c6485a15dca83d2b7887<SEP>chunk-252f684aa6870ba2bb42b8de04c97683<SEP>chunk-0f832cb08c68eddb0bb56bb1cb32ab6c", entity_id:"Inner Journey"}}, {_id:3002, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Life?s Purpose loses its liberating potential when pursued from stress and disconnection, as seen in the Korean gentleman?s story.` - Correct.", created_at:1779187564, source_id:"chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce", entity_id:"Lifes Purpose"}}, {_id:3003, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Workplace relationships are shaped by individual states, impacting team dynamics and organizational culture.", created_at:1779187565, source_id:"chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b", entity_id:"Relationships at Work"}}, {_id:3004, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The broader impact of one's work and actions on the surrounding environment or community.", created_at:1779187565, source_id:"chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b", entity_id:"Impact on Ecosystem"}}, {_id:3005, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphor for career, relationships, and impact, pulled in the direction chosen by one's state.", created_at:1779187565, source_id:"chunk-b46675c05bfa30223c5b090123b0a08b", entity_id:"Cart"}}, {_id:3006, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNO