ghtened efficiency and empathy.", created_at:1779187732, source_id:"chunk-b14b79dd6088b9676b5e759c61265472", entity_id:"Organizational Success"}}, {_id:3028, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A harmonious work environment is fostered by the man, leading to positive change.", created_at:1779187754, source_id:"chunk-d67f1ccb0ba7106556d6b51966372abe", entity_id:"Harmonious Work Environment"}}, {_id:3029, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Positive change occurs within the organization due to the man's actions.", created_at:1779187754, source_id:"chunk-d67f1ccb0ba7106556d6b51966372abe", entity_id:"Positive Change"}}, {_id:3030, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A conscious organization is one where individuals' consciousness is not limited, allowing for extraordinary impact.", created_at:1779187755, source_id:"chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57", entity_id:"Conscious Organization"}}, {_id:3031, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Scott's team supported him, helping him transform his consciousness and find purpose.<SEP>The team represents the group the manager nurtured, highlighting the importance of human connections.<SEP>The team represents the group the manager nurtured, highlighting the importance of human connections.", created_at:1779561653, source_id:"chunk-b628c030400a26f95b386175dbe5ab57<SEP>chunk-6f1a73ee81a735372368488ff67b808c", entity_id:"Team"}}, {_id:3032, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: PFNP4c1cOSI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PFNP4c1cOSI)<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Existence is a foundational philosophical concept, described as the state of being or occurring in reality. It is regarded as the fundamental state of being, pure and unadorned, underlying all phenomena. This perspective frames existence as a pure, intrinsic condition that underlies every aspect of reality.

Existence is also characterized as a pure, intrinsic state underlying all phenomena, including life, trees, rain, and human actions. The text describes this as ?pure existence,? forming the basis of metaphysical inquiry into intrinsic meaning. In the text, existence is presented as pure and intrinsic, serving as the foundational basis for exploring the intrinsic nature of reality.

Additionally, the description notes that consciousness encompasses all existence, with individuals being part of it. This relationship positions existence as a universal condition that is encompassed within the broader scope of consciousness.<SEP>The state of being or reality, framed as a pure, intrinsic phenomenon in the text.<SEP>Existence is the same as the unitary field of consciousness, existing in all things.<SEP>Existence denotes the state of being or reality, particularly in the context of individual or collective impact.", created_at:1779656853, source_id:"chunk-0ee45ed086ccf00bec8f02b0098563bd<SEP>chunk-ac599df176221b3c1e3e9b33cb62fa37<SEP>chunk-075b8e71a3c71d11c785be4bbfe965ed<SEP>chunk-b85547a9c5ce2c1aff2a86073a2bcb87<SEP>chunk-cd11c060af63780157ebf40717dc0fe2<SEP>chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28<SEP>chunk-e94d81180e7457d6f36d99965cfbf34d<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b<SEP>chunk-182703a5f6b3f0b44169765435446675<SEP>chunk-7438d62acfd111c95d021226c6581819", entity_id:"Existence"}}, {_id:3033, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: cHAJiF2byzg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHAJiF2byzg)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", created_at:1779662211, description:"New York is the location of Simon & Schuster, the publisher of the book.<SEP>New York is cited as a location where surveillance practices are exemplified.<SEP>New York is a location mentioned in the context of surveillance and tracking practices.", source_id:"chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b<SEP>chunk-f7a7b6ec5216cd073aa9baeaf426fc77<SEP>chunk-8d1735e497b4fb0d684267020bb40bf9", entity_id:"New York"}}, {_id:3034, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The festival involves global participants in collective meditation to amplify consciousness and achieve blissful states.", created_at:1779188199, source_id:"chunk-68272ee7ebb0f34dcf88d287b8d9983d", entity_id:"collective meditation"}}, {_id:3035, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dr. Newberg's research links meditation practices to brain changes and calmness.", created_at:1779188276, source_id:"chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b", entity_id:"meditation research"}}, {_id:3036, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Seth Porges analyzes the physiological benefits of slow breathing in Forbes.", created_at:1779188277, source_id:"chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b", entity_id:"breathing techniques"}}] AS row
