UNWIND [{_id:3037, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Lokaa is supported through two foundations established by her parents to empower youth and improve lives.", created_at:1779188277, source_id:"chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b", entity_id:"Two Foundations"}}, {_id:3038, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Krishnaji is recognized as a global meditation master with transformative teachings on consciousness.", created_at:1779188278, source_id:"chunk-3f7b8834c0b5fdd9d0b5f928c5733a2b", entity_id:"meditation master"}}, {_id:3039, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Draupadi is a historical figure from Indian history, described as a dark beauty and central to the Mahabharata narrative.<SEP>Draupadi is a character from the Mahabharata, central to the narrative of conflict and ethical dilemmas.`<SEP>Draupadi is a figure referenced in the video, commonly misspelled as \"Draupati\".<SEP>A character from the Mahabharata, correctly spelled as \"Draupadi\".<SEP>Draupadi is the corrected name for Draupati, a character from the Mahabharata.<SEP>Draupadi is the corrected name for Draupati, a character from the Mahabharata.", created_at:1779668308, source_id:"chunk-a265fa7ca94330810bb78b19f99a2ea9<SEP>chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c<SEP>chunk-6d57c4e7a0dfab13272b92d39272400b<SEP>chunk-a777766ccd192f3d87f1d3e0e9fa98c8<SEP>chunk-4b04f06e1e39aa9c677e71c36e21c89d", entity_id:"Draupadi"}}, {_id:3040, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779259795, description:"Parvati is a deity in Hindu mythology, whose character was influenced by the Mahabharata.<SEP>Parvati is a Hindu goddess associated with power, fertility, and devotion.<SEP>Parvati is a deity embodying love, beauty, and fertility in Hindu mythology.", source_id:"chunk-a265fa7ca94330810bb78b19f99a2ea9<SEP>chunk-5a85e64decd4f2a6f6b8b1a83aae1399<SEP>chunk-8b24420a54f14344af97a060057521ed", entity_id:"Parvati"}}, {_id:3041, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic that has shaped cultural and historical narratives, including the portrayal of characters such as Parvati, Shri Krishna, and Arjuna. It is also used to illustrate responses to inner violence and emotional conflict. The epic details a great war and its characters, serving as a narrative framework for exploring complex moral and philosophical themes.

Beyond the war, the Mahabharata delves into the concepts of Dharma, conflict, and non-violence, emphasizing principles like Ahimsa. Its characters, such as Shri Krishna and Arjuna, embody these ideas, and the epic is often cited as an epic that discusses these principles. The text also references the game Gilly, indicating its inclusion of diverse elements beyond the central conflict.

Overall, the Mahabharata stands as a comprehensive ancient Indian epic that integrates cultural narratives, philosophical discourse, and character-driven storytelling. It continues to influence cultural and historical understanding, offering insights into the human condition through its exploration of war, morality, and spiritual principles.<SEP>The Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic that discusses principles like Ahimsa and features characters such as Shri Krishna and Arjuna.<SEP>The Mahabharata is a significant event in Indian history and culture, referenced in the analysis.<SEP>Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic cited in the text and part of the required terms.<SEP>The Mahabharata is an ancient Indian epic depicting the Kurukshetra War and philosophical debates.`<SEP>The ancient Indian epic that explores the moral and ethical dilemmas faced by the Pandavas, including the concept of Dharma Sankhata.", created_at:1779667974, source_id:"chunk-a265fa7ca94330810bb78b19f99a2ea9<SEP>chunk-8bc46e0d57c8aca69ad6ab17dc5cfd03<SEP>chunk-dadf662841fb50b7a5b2c3f5fc8512f2<SEP>chunk-d0968f5f92c9347abb58d844c3aec5da<SEP>chunk-4529c1884cd3f5e14f3ad9c161d86e76<SEP>chunk-31d0c1d0868a0433b37bd7b3d6982020<SEP>chunk-9d3dc0d7e3d5f00409884918b93104a2<SEP>chunk-a86eca0b1f90f6c49a60c38f2bf9272a<SEP>chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c<SEP>chunk-151ea8496c9d62859f2ebee56a03be85", entity_id:"Mahabharata"}}, {_id:3042, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The Indian government is actively participating in dialogues on honoring people of all colors as part of societal change.<SEP>The Indian Government is noted as part of the dialogue on honoring people of all colors as a society.<SEP>The Indian government is a political entity actively engaging in dialogues about honoring people of all skin colors as part of societal progress.<SEP>Indian Government is part of the dialogue honoring people of all colors as a society.<SEP>The Indian 