 and addressed to foster harmony.<SEP>Bias refers to prejudiced attitudes or stereotypes, particularly those related to skin color and social hierarchy.<SEP>Bias is a truth that must be seen, leading to the door of abundance in family.<SEP>Bias is explicitly addressed as a societal flaw requiring recognition and overcoming.<SEP>Bias is mentioned as a reaction to differences in appearance or belief.", source_id:"chunk-982f35660cd8beb5ada701f1b74f7110<SEP>chunk-6a12fdf86752a3b47cf3eb0ac92a6887<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-a3a9654c6c8f7858ec4d287082297caa<SEP>chunk-97a582a6bc26174c8bc3002eb473cbb9", entity_id:"Bias"}}, {_id:3048, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vedic Wisdom is referenced as the philosophical basis for understanding the consequences of disrespecting individuals.<SEP>Vedic wisdom refers to ancient Indian philosophical principles addressing societal harmony and respect for all individuals, including those with darker complexions.<SEP>Vedic Wisdom is the source of the truth about bias and its consequences.<SEP>Vedic wisdom is a philosophical concept emphasizing the consequences of disrespecting women and the importance of familial harmony.", created_at:1779188421, source_id:"chunk-982f35660cd8beb5ada701f1b74f7110<SEP>chunk-6a12fdf86752a3b47cf3eb0ac92a6887<SEP>chunk-06d9eb4b9e32d7ec0c21f0adab1c6240<SEP>chunk-a3a9654c6c8f7858ec4d287082297caa", entity_id:"Vedic Wisdom"}}, {_id:3049, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Original text line: \"In giving that gift, will be your abundance.\" which required a comma addition.", created_at:1779227281, source_id:"chunk-d7334bb946031c17a3fae04787a343d3", entity_id:"Original Quote 6"}}, {_id:3050, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)<SEP>YouTube Vide