7. \"Shiva is a deity who meditated in the Himalayas, mastered the energy center of Vishuddhi, and burned the God of Desire through third-eye activation.\"

8. \"Shiva is a symbol of constant rejuvenation, represented by snakes that shed their skin, and is associated with enlightened consciousness and the potential for enlightenment in individuals.\"

