.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"ekam is a term to be corrected to \"Ekam\" as per the provided list.<SEP>ekam is a homophone candidate not present in the text, which could be confused with \"come\" or \"acomes\".<SEP>ekam is a homophone candidate not present in the text, which could be confused with \"come\" or \"acomes\".", created_at:1779670792, source_id:"chunk-d22846f24d18f20fdaf21ce0958a7d11<SEP>chunk-49b001b9176c6f2a9840cbab29ab25fc<SEP>chunk-e67cebe345867bb957f951bf07725fa1<SEP>chunk-5797c6b92be5c0efc461bac799bf75df", entity_id:"ekam"}}, {_id:3164, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"sadhana is a term to be corrected to \"Sadhana\", relating to spiritual practice.<SEP>sadhana is a Sanskrit term that was left uncorrected because it is considered a specific concept.", created_at:1779217683, source_id:"chunk-d22846f24d18f20fdaf21ce0958a7d11<SEP>chunk-c77adc402edc6371084db858a52c3f14<SEP>chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c", entity_id:"sadhana"}}, {_id:3165, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"limitless field is a term to be corrected to \"Limitless Field\", symbolizing boundless potential.", created_at:1779189917, source_id:"chunk-d22846f24d18f20fdaf21ce0958a7d11<SEP>chunk-06b512c92e682b8d2052145d11d7fba4", entity_id:"limitless field"}}, {_id:3166, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ekam Circles are communities within the Ekam platform where spiritual experiences and rituals are conducted.<SEP>Ekam Circles are spiritual gatherings where the community of Ekam mitras holds ceremonies and offers the gift of releasing the departed.", created_at:1779228938, source_id:"chunk-6995806c11a29b44fc7094ee22938f78<SEP>chunk-ff31f73b2ef0618c73b0f438087fdec4", entity_id:"Ekam Circles"}}, {_id:3167, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Mahale Amavasya is a special new moon day for honoring ancestors and releasing departed spirits, correctly retained in the text.<SEP>Mahale Amavasya is a special new moon day in Korean tradition for honoring ancestors and releasing departed souls.", created_at:1779228706, source_id:"chunk-6995806c11a29b44fc7094ee22938f78<SEP>chunk-fff4055f00cd2414c407b066c68e8d55", entity_id:"Mahale Amavasya"}}, {_id:3168, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779229062, description:"Kinmen is a Chinese festival for cleaning ancestral tombs and offering gratitude, correctly retained in the text.<SEP>Kinmen is a Chinese tradition involving cleaning ancestral tombs and offering gratitude.<SEP>Kinmen is a Chinese tradition involving cleaning ancestral tombs and offering gratitude.", source_id:"chunk-6995806c11a29b44fc7094ee22938f78<SEP>chunk-fff4055f00cd2414c407b066c68e8d55<SEP>chunk-5a061c3e192c4aaa5026aa79274bb0f1", entity_id:"Kinmen"}}, {_id:3169, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Chisok is a Korean festival for honoring ancestors, correctly retained in the text.<SEP>Chisok is a Korean festival observed to honor and revere ancestors.<SEP>Chisok is a Korean festival dedicated to honoring ancestors.<SEP>Chisok is a Korean festival dedicated to honoring ancestors and releasing departed souls stuck on the earthly plane.", created_at:1779229186, source_id:"chunk-6995806c11a29b44fc7094ee22938f78<SEP>chunk-fff4055f00cd2414c407b066c68e8d55<SEP>chunk-8c4fdae5005ad5ebdfceee30c70b21dc<SEP>chunk-5a061c3e192c4aaa5026aa79274bb0f1<SEP>chunk-dd4f29607e86446996b5a0f4d31130d7", entity_id:"Chisok"}}, {_id:3170, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"deeksha\" is corrected to \"Deeksha\" for proper noun consistency.", created_at:1779190065, source_id:"chunk-d22846f24d18f20fdaf21ce0958a7d11", entity_id:"deeksha"}}, {_id:3171, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A, B, C, D appears as a list of elements in the original text, possibly representing categories or steps.", created_at:1779190090, source_id:"chunk-c095541368132f0551b7c47961463ae4", entity_id:"A, B, C, D"}}, {_id:3172, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Old World History is a concept mentioned in the garbled text, possibly referring to historical context.", created_at:1779190090, source_id:"chunk-c095541368132f0551b7c47961463ae4", entity_id:"Old World History"}}] AS row
