nown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779193292, description:"A metaphorical exploration of societal or emotional pain and violence, analyzed through fragmented interpretations.<SEP>A painful event like the \"flesh set up\" triggers the resurgence of buried emotions and violence.`<SEP>A painful event triggers the resurgence of suppressed emotions like anger and hate.", source_id:"chunk-5dfdfcdd2cbf858ec3e2ec7a4a0c5489<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b", entity_id:"Painful Event"}}, {_id:3262, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A thematic representation of suffering and violence, discussed in the context of societal critique.", created_at:1779191701, source_id:"chunk-5dfdfcdd2cbf858ec3e2ec7a4a0c5489", entity_id:"Pain and Murder"}}, {_id:3263, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A call for peaceful activism to address conflict, requiring grammatical correction in the original text.", created_at:1779191701, source_id:"chunk-5dfdfcdd2cbf858ec3e2ec7a4a0c5489", entity_id:"Demonstrations for Violence to End"}}, {_id:3264, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Individuals embodying tranquility, proposed as agents of change through demonstrations.", created_at:1779191701, source_id:"chunk-5dfdfcdd2cbf858ec3e2ec7a4a0c5489", entity_id:"Peaceful People"}}, {_id:3265, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A philosophical objective prioritized by revolutionaries in the pursuit of global harmony.<SEP>Universal well-being is a collective goal requiring peace for all or none.<SEP>Universal well-being refers to the holistic welfare of all people, emphasized as a foundational goal for re