s.<SEP>Revolutionaries must prioritize universal well-being as their objective in societal change.<SEP>Revolutionary is an individual who prioritizes universal well-being as a core objective and seeks to create oneness and connection.", source_id:"chunk-5dfdfcdd2cbf858ec3e2ec7a4a0c5489<SEP>chunk-18dfe327019b4987cc16243e45ad4a98<SEP>chunk-f6f65d2ba1311425d1423e4faf375968", entity_id:"Revolutionary"}}, {_id:3270, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Racial Violence refers to acts of violence motivated by racial prejudice, representing a persistent social issue in America. It is rooted in historical and systemic factors, manifesting as repeated eruptions of hatred and anger that are often suppressed but recurring.

