s already there. But we need to output the summary. The user gave the input and then the output. The output is already there. But we need to output the summary. The user gave the input and then the output. The output is already there. But we need to output the summary. The", source_id:"chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c<SEP>chunk-a466e41ebd2dd29a05776a329c8e9dec<SEP>chunk-acb941e2e31d401b209b5294a9065fb1<SEP>chunk-2ed6c538824d03e53845129e9fe68f60<SEP>chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f<SEP>chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08<SEP>chunk-94684d3c1e91618d6299c39872dafbdf<SEP>chunk-57c07a0512777570587c500dccd8311d<SEP>chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6<SEP>chunk-7988ea96a08eaf2fe8d7d16c8063ffbe<SEP>chunk-2993029c625df32f843cfee8124d0621", entity_id:"Teacher"}}, {_id:3301, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Politicians and leaders are called to nurture compassion in governance and consciousness to foster peaceful societal transformation.", created_at:1779192138, source_id:"chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c", entity_id:"Politician and Leader"}}, {_id:3302, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779193293, description:"External revolution is redefined as a shift toward peaceful methods as catalysts for systemic change, moving beyond violent historical approaches.<SEP>External revolution is contrasted with inner evolution, emphasizing peaceful methods over violent upheaval.`<SEP>External revolution refers to traditional methods of social change involving upheaval.", source_id:"chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b", entity_id:"External Revolution"}}, {_id:3303, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Teachers actively route out division and discrimination, educating young minds on interconnectedness.<SEP>Division and discrimination are ideas to be eradicated from young minds through conscious education.`", created_at:1779192584, source_id:"chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-a466e41ebd2dd29a05776a329c8e9dec", entity_id:"Division and Discrimination"}}, {_id:3304, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Parents transmit values of connection and oneness to children through narratives and conversations.<SEP>Connection and oneness are values to be transmitted through generational storytelling and education.`", created_at:1779192584, source_id:"chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48", entity_id:"Connection and Oneness"}}, {_id:3305, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Human consciousness must evolve to use peaceful methods as triggers for external revolution, moving beyond violent approaches.", created_at:1779192139, source_id:"chunk-6e3da3d5c67b838008777970dd3f104c<SEP>chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c", entity_id:"Peaceful Methods"}}, {_id:3306, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Social discrimination refers to prejudice based on social factors, passed down via family stories and cultural behaviors.<SEP>Social discrimination is a systemic behavior transmitted across generations through narratives and interactions.`<SEP>Social discrimination involves prejudice based on social status or class, as seen in China's context.<SEP>Social discrimination involves unfair treatment based on social status or class.", created_at:1779193291, source_id:"chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b", entity_id:"Social Discrimination"}}, {_id:3307, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779193291, description:"Gender discrimination is a form of discrimination based on gender, inherited through societal norms and upbringing.<SEP>Gender discrimination is a harmful state of mind perpetuated through generational storytelling and cultural norms.`<SEP>Gender discrimination involves unfair treatment based on gender identity.", source_id:"chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b", entity_id:"Gender Discrimination"}}, {_id:3308, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Discrimination is transmitted across generations through family narratives and behaviors.<SEP>Successive generations through which prejudices are transmitted and perpetuated.", created_at:1779675573, source_id:"chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d<SEP>chunk-719340217eb366fadb6e6dd8b5dbf568", entity_id:"Generations"}}, {_id:3309, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Facial discrimination is a form of social discrimination passed down through generational behaviors and stories.`", created_at:1779192583, source_id:"chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48", entity_id:"Facial Discrimination"}}, {_id:3310, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The Italian rebellion killings and murders are violent events reflecting the consequences of unaddressed societal anger.`", created_at:1779192583, source_id:"chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48", entity_id:"Italian Rebellion Killings"}}, {_id:3311, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Grandparents and parents are cultural transmitters of values and behaviors to younger generations.`", created_at:1779192583, source_id:"chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48", entity_id:"Grandparents and Parents"}}, {_id:3312, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Peaceful lives lead to a peaceful afterlife for ancestors.`", created_at:1779228759, source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281", entity_id:"Peaceful Lives"}}, {_id:3313, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Paulus politicians and leaders must nurture compassion and address societal issues through conscious leadership.", created_at:1779192643, source_id:"chunk-a466e41ebd2dd29a05776a329c8e9dec", entity_id:"Paulus Politician"}}, {_id:3315, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Prolonged anger and hate lead to acts like crushing throats or burning homes.", created_at:1779192795, source_id:"chunk-a466e41ebd2dd29a05776a329c8e9dec", entity_id:"Violent Acts"}}] AS row
