s.<SEP>Gender (man, woman, transgender) is listed as a factor in leader selection criteria.", created_at:1779717911, source_id:"chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c<SEP>chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b<SEP>chunk-b1776121cc5dfb12d2007497b9b6d6fe<SEP>chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3<SEP>chunk-cbdab8b8a66000622cbde940d7277d78<SEP>chunk-7c228a9b72dc65306e081f6df42d4c27", entity_id:"Gender"}}, {_id:3321, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The fires of discrimination are a conceptual state that leads to negative emotions.", created_at:1779192848, source_id:"chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c", entity_id:"Fires of Discrimination"}}, {_id:3322, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Flesh Set-Up is a painful event that brings suppressed emotions to the surface.", created_at:1779192848, source_id:"chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c", entity_id:"Flesh Set-Up"}}, {_id:3323, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Discrimination leads to negative emotions like anger, insecurity, hate, and violence, which are passed down through generations.", created_at:1779192876, source_id:"chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c", entity_id:"Anger, Insecurity, Hate, Violence"}}, {_id:3324, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Most nations discriminate on the basis of gender, which is a form of societal discrimination.", created_at:1779192876, source_id:"chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c", entity_id:"Most Nations"}}, {_id:3325, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"YouTube is the source of the video content that discusses discrimination and its impacts.", created_at:1779192876, source_id:"chunk-1a2d9f9a94f699ed87aa72d476d3870c", entity_id:"Content Source"}}, {_id:3326, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=77dJnbTCwsA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Nation is a term that can refer to the collective identity and interests of a country's people. It can also be used in the plural to describe societal consciousness states, ranging from division to unity.

In some contexts, the term may be capitalized when referring to a specific entity, but as a general concept it should be lowercase. Additionally, the Nation is sometimes urged to confront its own prejudices and enter a 'crucible of truth' for societal change.<SEP>Nation refers to the collective identity and interests of a country's people.<SEP>Nation refers to the collective identity and interests of a country's people.<SEP>Nation refers to the collective identity and interests of a country's people.<SEP>Nation refers to the collective identity and interests of a country's people.<SEP>Nation refers to the collective identity and interests of a country's people.", created_at:1779719904, source_id:"chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480<SEP>chunk-89ab86758e55eda4e32bf5581a61d209<SEP>chunk-e22181d45ff680a216a2e1e3bb46c19d", entity_id:"Nation"}}, {_id:3327, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The crucible of truth symbolizes a transformative process of self-reflection and societal reckoning.", created_at:1779193223, source_id:"chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480", entity_id:"Crucible of Truth"}}, {_id:3328, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Objects of attachment or hate bind consciousness to past experiences post-death.`", created_at:1779228759, source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281", entity_id:"Objects of Attachment or Hate"}}, {_id:3329, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Priests conducted ancestral rituals and intuitively understood other worlds in ancient times.`", created_at:1779228759, source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281<SEP>chunk-ff31f73b2ef0618c73b0f438087fdec4", entity_id:"Priests"}}, {_id:3330, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)<SEP>YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Other worlds refer to spiritual realms understood through ancient philosophical and ritual practices.`<SEP>A concept discussed in the video, referring to alternate realities or dimensions.", created_at:1779651805, source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281<SEP>chunk-02c476f06b018b2911ffd93038b4567f", entity_id:"Other Worlds"}}, {_id:3331, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual realities are truths about existence beyond physical perception, requiring experiential validation.", created_at:1779228760, source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281", entity_id:"Spiritual Realities"}}, {_id:3332, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ancient Hindus performed ancestral samskaras to dissolve generational vasanas.<SEP>Ancestral samskaras are rituals performed by ancient Hindus to appease ancestral spirits.", created_at:1779229112, source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281<SEP>chunk-7ac9109abdb5bdc9de2685e960e358c1", entity_id:"Ancestral Samskaras"}}, {_id:3333, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779555235, description:"Life experiences determine the emotional state of consciousness in the afterlife.<SEP>Challenges such as failure, rejection, and self-doubt that children encounter during development.<SEP>Encompasses sensory experiences (e.g., taste, texture) and emotional connections to life and others.", source_id:"chunk-fd88fca76d8bbe7034dd353f047d1281<SEP>chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5<SEP>chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5", entity_id:"Life Experiences"}}, {_id:3334, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Arent and Grandparent are conscious beings who pass on beautiful states of connection and oneness to their children and grandchildren through stories and conversations.", created_at:1779193436, source_id:"chunk-acb941e2e31d401b209b5294a9065fb1", entity_id:"Arent and Grandparent"}}, {_id:3335, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Children and Grandchildren are the recipients of stories and conversations from parents and grandparents.", created_at:1779193436, source_id:"chunk-acb941e2e31d401b209b5294a9065fb1", entity_id:"Children and Grandchildren"}}] AS row
