339a0a2d51687157190393908f25", entity_id:"Blessings"}}, {_id:3456, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Tranquility and serenity characterize the first level of oneness as inner peace.<SEP>Tranquility represents the desired state of inner peace sought by the King.", created_at:1779559837, source_id:"chunk-f75c5d6ff6cf90a0c79623ead0773fbc<SEP>chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880", entity_id:"Tranquility"}}, {_id:3457, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Joyful states draw harmonious events and positive outcomes.", created_at:1779230028, source_id:"chunk-f75c5d6ff6cf90a0c79623ead0773fbc", entity_id:"Harmonious Events"}}, {_id:3458, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Heart opening enables feeling others' joys and sorrows as one's own.", created_at:1779230028, source_id:"chunk-f75c5d6ff6cf90a0c79623ead0773fbc", entity_id:"Others' Emotions"}}, {_id:3459, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"At the third level of oneness, separation and division dissolve, manifesting complete unity with all life, the universe, and the self.", created_at:1779230060, source_id:"chunk-b1776121cc5dfb12d2007497b9b6d6fe", entity_id:"Third Level of Oneness"}}, {_id:3460, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"At the second level of oneness, one experiences emotional connection with others' joys and sorrows as if they were their own, leading to compassion and love.", created_at:1779230060, source_id:"chunk-b1776121cc5dfb12d2007497b9b6d6fe", entity_id:"Second Level of Oneness"}}, {_id:3462, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"In the second level of oneness, faith, love, and compassion arise within the individual, transcending previous judgments.", created_at:1779230078, source_id:"chunk-b1776121cc5dfb12d2007497b9b6d6fe", entity_id:"Faith, Love, Compassion"}}, {_id:3463, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Living a life free of suffering is an enlightened state that fosters energy, strength, and problem-solving abilities.", created_at:1779230253, source_id:"chunk-86019daf1852abb84546a1585e862173", entity_id:"Life Free of Suffering"}}, {_id:3464, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MKOAMUmZ-RA)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"The Chhataka bird is a mythical creature that refuses to drink water from ponds or lakes, waiting for rainwater instead.<SEP>The Chhataka bird is a mythical creature that refuses to drink water from ponds or lakes, waiting instead for rainwater to fall from clouds before quenching its thirst.", created_at:1779230326, source_id:"chunk-86019daf1852abb84546a1585e862173<SEP>chunk-8ae7d2bf13d490cfea1a9347ee1a6a78", entity_id:"Chhataka Bird"}}, {_id:3467, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MKOAMUmZ-RA)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 2seBB2oByZc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2seBB2oByZc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779551857, description:"<think>
