n (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V5fBJwo_KQk)<SEP>YouTube Video: 9-NMv5E-18s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-NMv5E-18s)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A spiritual entity representing divine feminine energy, blessings, and abundance.<SEP>The Divine Mother is conceptualized as the ultimate witness consciousness and source of spiritual guidance.", created_at:1779416791, source_id:"chunk-cdb7e2c2a992ab4d052399a789ce199f<SEP>chunk-8cc3598abebcf159e6f8db2b03c316fe", entity_id:"Divine Mother"}}, {_id:3490, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V5fBJwo_KQk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphorical space in front of closed eyes where meditators focus their awareness during visualization.<SEP>The dark space refers to the mental or meditative space in front of one's closed eyes, often associated with focused contemplation or visualization.", created_at:1779259816, source_id:"chunk-cdb7e2c2a992ab4d052399a789ce199f<SEP>chunk-ff46b53ab89c597d3fb954e4982613d0", entity_id:"Dark Space"}}, {_id:3494, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V5fBJwo_KQk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779231426, description:"A grammatical term meaning added or attached, considered as a possible correction for \"Appendedents\" in the context of linguistic accuracy.<SEP>To add something as supplementary, considered as an alternative correction for \"Appendedents\".<SEP>Standard English verb, considered as a possible correction for the non-standard word \"Appendedents\".<SEP>A possible correction for \"Appendedents\", though less likely than \"Appurtenances\".", source_id:"chunk-53c678de7b319878f854b5b824232f14<SEP>chunk-4295ddd02a3292ede05e5c526f20348c<SEP>chunk-ba305c34677a8ecb23f50488bd7f48af<SEP>chunk-171cae3475dfcb996a091f49a00ad9f0<SEP>chunk-5905b0597e31ce6ff