en by awareness and action to create positive change, as nurtured by genuine gratitude.", created_at:1779231673, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e", entity_id:"Responsible Human Being"}}, {_id:3503, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779232074, description:"The educational system is based on division and fosters individual identity through differentiation.<SEP>The educational system emphasizes differences and superiority, forming the foundation for division and career achievements.<SEP>The educational system is described as the foundation for careers and achievements, with implications for societal structure.", source_id:"chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253<SEP>chunk-ce09b6c6a2ea185889fd9682aa9fd726", entity_id:"Educational System"}}, {_id:3504, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Civilizational progress and scientific advancement have increased societal divisions.<SEP>Civilizational progress is noted as a driver of increasing societal divisions.", created_at:1779232074, source_id:"chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-ce09b6c6a2ea185889fd9682aa9fd726", entity_id:"Civilizational Progress"}}, {_id:3505, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Scientific advancement has contributed to the proliferation of divisions in society.<SEP>Scientific advancement is linked to the proliferation of factors dividing people.", created_at:1779232074, source_id:"chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-ce09b6c6a2ea185889fd9682aa9fd726", entity_id:"Scientific Advancement"}}, {_id:3506, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<