Food is discussed in terms of its preparation, emotional imprint, and effects on consumers. It also symbolizes shared resources among true friends, reflecting both practical and emotional dimensions of nourishment and connection.", source_id:"chunk-aec7e5d9768233c70894ac1802b148a7<SEP>chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc<SEP>chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e<SEP>chunk-ce2308cda5fca23d965042def4191e27<SEP>chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f<SEP>chunk-eaeab9baa97a4cf5f954f6f446db65b6<SEP>chunk-463d3565b6195eb54c22ef1f1f467400<SEP>chunk-295ece324351da0c7194c4e2d4f58e99<SEP>chunk-78435e02477a2c8cddea91202785185f<SEP>chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6<SEP>chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Food"}}, {_id:3650, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Restaurants are mentioned as places where people eat alone, reflecting individualistic behavior.", created_at:1779236208, source_id:"chunk-aec7e5d9768233c70894ac1802b148a7", entity_id:"Restaurants"}}, {_id:3651, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mental disease refers to psychological conditions like loneliness and depression that impact human behavior and emotions.<SEP>Loneliness is characterized as a mental disease requiring conscious healing.", created_at:1779236430, source_id:"chunk-1f205cfd4f752f944e4f589c26e28701<SEP>chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc", entity_id:"Mental Disease"}}, {_id:3652, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Opportunities and openings are described as outcomes that flow into one's life when depression is overcome through self-awareness.", created_at:1779236252, source_id:"chunk-1f205cfd4f752f944e4f589c26e28701", entity_id:"Opportunities and Openings"}}, {_id:3653, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Partnered relationships involve mutual sensitivity and emotional support between partners to avoid depression.", created_at:1779236252, source_id:"chunk-1f205cfd4f752f944e4f589c26e28701", entity_id:"Partnered Relationships"}}, {_id:3654, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Artificial intelligence is portrayed as a technological force requiring counterbalance through heart intelligence.<SEP>Artificial Intelligence is a concept discussed in the video, contrasting with Heart Intelligence.<SEP>Artificial Intelligence is a concept that is taking over the world and necessitates Heart Intelligence to rise.<SEP>Artificial Intelligence is a transformative technology driving the Fourth Revolution, enabling advancements in law, education, and healthcare.<SEP>Artificial intelligence is a concept representing advanced technology that automates various aspects of human existence.<SEP>Artificial intelligence is a concept representing advanced technology that automates various aspects of human existence.<SEP>Artificial Intelligence is a technology taking over various spheres of human existence, leading to concerns about job displacement and future relevance.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-6537d9939653cd5b7d036dced5f9de7b<SEP>chunk-40bd05ead62aaeb01579393d5559a014<SEP>chunk-b4fe0cbe12e5b4a3116f1a065a295316<SEP>chunk-258f679e26eb593f69a947105d5b63a9<SEP>chunk-bf3e14052a899fd14050d312f32aa97b<SEP>chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Artificial Intelligence"}}, {_id:3655, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional connection involves mutual sensitivity and understanding between individuals, fostering healing.<SEP>Emotional connection is a hallmark of love, enabling shared joy and mutual support in overcoming unhappiness.<SEP>Emotional connection is a hallmark of love, enabling shared joy and mutual support in overcoming unhappiness.", created_at:1779556306, source_id:"chunk-6537d9939653cd5b7d036dced5f9de7b<SEP>chunk-e2d0ff9dea6a5334fbc3569bce6e4413", entity_id:"Emotional Connection"}}, {_id:3656, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Partnered Relationship describes mutual sensitivity and understanding between partners, enabling emotional support and healing.<SEP>Partnered Relationship is a type of relationship where partners can be sensitive to each other.", created_at:1779236478, source_id:"chunk-6537d9939653cd5b7d036dced5f9de7b<SEP>chunk-1e483a5aae3e722cbcbaae7e0a2f3d19", entity_id:"Partnered Relationship"}}, {_id:3657, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Tribes represent traditional social structures of communal living.", created_at:1779236387, source_id:"chunk-73cf209c2ca0aee45e9dc6e6411c0cb2", entity_id:"Tribes"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:3658, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Games symbolize social interaction or isolation depending on context.<SEP>Games are described as \"lonely games\" reflecting individualistic consumption.<SEP>Games represent activities engaged in by children.<SEP>Games represent activities engaged in by children.", created_at:1779676178, source_id:"chunk-73cf209c2ca0aee45e9dc6e6411c0cb2<SEP>chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc<SEP>chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f", entity_id:"Games"}}, {_id:3659, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-engrossment describes excessive focus on individual interests over communal bonds.<SEP>Self-engrossment refers to humanity's historical tendency to prioritize individualism over communal and environmental well-being.<SEP>Self-engrossment refers to humanity's historical tendency to prioritize individualism over communal and environmental well-being.<SEP>Self-engrossment refers to humanity's historical tendency to prioritize individualism over communal and environmental well-being.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-73cf209c2ca0aee45e9dc6e6411c0cb2<SEP>chunk-773bb390e5733f45d0f03f5875cbd4a0", entity_id:"Self-Engrossment"}}, {_id:3660, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Large families represent traditional extended family structures common in historical human societies.", created_at:1779236388, source_id:"chunk-73cf209c2ca0aee45e9dc6e6411c0cb2", entity_id:"Large Families"}}, {_id:3661, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8XASiz30oE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Desires are acknowledged as not always fulfillable, contributing to existential struggles.<SEP>Desires symbolize individual priorities that challenge shared family values and relationships.", created_at:1779242468, source_id:"chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc<SEP>chunk-8b1cb9338748404cabaa24ac4be68f56", entity_id:"Desires"}}, {_id:3662, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Business attempts are framed as potentially unsuccessful endeavors impacting mental state.", created_at:1779236429, source_id:"chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc", entity_id:"Business Attempts"}}, {_id:3663, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"Feeling human beings\" refers to a proposed state of emotional connection and shared humanity.", created_at:1779236430, source_id:"chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc", entity_id:"Feeling Human Beings"}}, {_id:3664, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Food consumption is characterized by individualistic and isolated practices.", created_at:1779236454, source_id:"chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc", entity_id:"Individualism"}}, {_id:3665, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Opportunities emerge from redefining human connection and emotional needs.", created_at:1779236454, source_id:"chunk-ad21c8251c43d2428c2c1fc6eaf57acc", entity_id:"Perspective Shift"}}, {_id:3666, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8XASiz30oE)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The corrected phrase \"becoming a feeling human being\" fixes the grammatical error in the original transcription.<SEP>The corrected phrase \"seven times. Up, thank you.\" is part of the video's content after punctuation and capitalization adjustments.", created_at:1779242251, source_id:"chunk-1e483a5aae3e722cbcbaae7e0a2f3d19<SEP>chunk-d82028575691c5fd663240ea4f28fcee", entity_id:"Corrected Phrase"}}, {_id:3668, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"group", truncate:"", description:"Partners in a relationship can be sensitive to each other, showing mutual care.<SEP>Partners can help each other overcome depression through listening and holding.", created_at:1779236716, source_id:"chunk-1e483a5aae3e722cbcbaae7e0a2f3d19<SEP>chunk-b4fe0cbe12e5b4a3116f1a065a295316", entity_id:"Partners"}}, {_id:3669, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Js7ongWaW64 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Js7ongWaW64)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional healing refers to the process of addressing emotional struggles and fostering global healing through heightened empathy and understanding, as emphasized in the text.<SEP>Emotional healing occurs through mutual understanding and connection, likened to shedding scales or negative emotions like hurt and disappointment.", created_at:1779394693, source_id:"chunk-e8c3861302e4fee45689e6fb65d84e48<SEP>chunk-c18e39fa455d4e81a05127af456a216c", entity_id:"Emotional Healing"}}, {_id:3670, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Neighbors are mentioned as a group to whom the text encourages feeling and understanding before making judgments about their behavior.<SEP>Neighbors are people living nearby who become envious of the lottery winner's wealth.", created_at:1779556036, source_id:"chunk-fdd895baa3282f9ed911c72eae7a3d65<SEP>chunk-e8c3861302e4fee45689e6fb65d84e48<SEP>chunk-9c1aa39a1d495c6095f631b7613571fb", entity_id:"Neighbors"}}, {_id:3671, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"group", truncate:"", description:"Colleagues are referenced as entities to whom the text advises applying empathy and emotional awareness to avoid misjudgment.<SEP>Colleagues can be healed through listening and holding.", created_at:1779236716, source_id:"chunk-e8c3861302e4fee45689e6fb65d84e48<SEP>chunk-b4fe0cbe12e5b4a3116f1a065a295316", entity_id:"Colleagues"}}, {_id:3672, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Ridicule is cited as a past experience that caused individuals to hide their pains, indicating it as a trigger for emotional concealment.", created_at:1779236581, source_id:"chunk-e8c3861302e4fee45689e6fb65d84e48", entity_id:"Ridicule"}}, {_id:3674, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A group of friends who experienced ridicule for their pains instead of being supported.", created_at:1779236630, source_id:"chunk-c2dfb10d73bb85ba3334f2281cc0afee", entity_id:"Group of Friends"}}, {_id:3675, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Modernization and cultural shifts are blamed for fostering loneliness and fragmented relationships.", created_at:1779236630, source_id:"chunk-c2dfb10d73bb85ba3334f2281cc0afee", entity_id:"Modernization and Culture"}}, {_id:3677, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Individualistic lifestyles are characterized by prioritizing personal independence over communal bonds, leading to increased loneliness.", created_at:1779236630, source_id:"chunk-c2dfb10d73bb85ba3334f2281cc0afee", entity_id:"Individualistic Lifestyles"}}, {_id:3679, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Parental Recognition involves parents being conscious of their children's emotional states.", created_at:1779236669, source_id:"chunk-41d7d19401b85a866185adb1962d3632", entity_id:"Parental Recognition"}}, {_id:3682, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Holding is a method used to help partners and colleagues heal from depression.", created_at:1779236716, source_id:"chunk-b4fe0cbe12e5b4a3116f1a065a295316", entity_id:"Holding"}}, {_id:3683, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A concept referenced in the corrected text, emphasizing global healing through heart intelligence as a central theme.", created_at:1779236758, source_id:"chunk-2b42ee8fd386f9e10963b4508c131024", entity_id:"World Healing"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:3684, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The original grammatically incorrect transcript of the TED talk requiring corrections.", created_at:1779236758, source_id:"chunk-2b42ee8fd386f9e10963b4508c131024", entity_id:"TED Talk Transcript"}}, {_id:3685, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The term \"immune\" is repeatedly mentioned in the video, potentially symbolizing a thematic or conceptual focus.<SEP>Immune is a concept related to biological or medical themes, frequently mentioned in the video's content.", created_at:1779236891, source_id:"chunk-e4f69c3d781bdabd783bd4c228c2e28c<SEP>chunk-e69254036bef20e8d5497ffdee26a7aa", entity_id:"Immune"}}, {_id:3686, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The term \"immune\" repeated extensively in the video's content, indicating a possible theme or focus.<SEP>The word \"immune\" repeated extensively in the video's content, potentially symbolizing a thematic focus or error in transcription.<SEP>A concept represented by the repeated word \"immune\" in the video's content, possibly indicating a theme or focus of the video.<SEP>The term \"immune\" is repeated multiple times in the input text, suggesting it is a central concept or keyword, possibly related to biology or a specific topic discussed in the source material.", created_at:1779237148, source_id:"chunk-6677368e048351336b65843a972054ea<SEP>chunk-3a18818ffd13339f2444819ee3a71fc2<SEP>chunk-b0973de9f5b8e587077d5f0e47cecd7e<SEP>chunk-f997d1d6ade7b75bc9ca2374e995779e", entity_id:"immune"}}, {_id:3687, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"The URL associated with the YouTube Video source.", created_at:1779236932, source_id:"chunk-6677368e048351336b65843a972054ea", entity_id:"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk"}}, {_id:3688, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The user identified \"desert\" as a typo and corrected it to \"dessert\" to fix the", created_at:1779237901, source_id:"chunk-61865db1533922fc67b59d104261e28a", entity_id:"desert"}}, {_id:3689, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The user identified \"desert\" as a typo and corrected it to \"dessert\" to fix the", created_at:1779237901, source_id:"chunk-61865db1533922fc67b59d104261e28a", entity_id:"dessert"}}, {_id:3690, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The tiny hole in a tree is a natural opening used by villagers to trap monkeys by placing desserts inside it.", created_at:1779237971, source_id:"chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5", entity_id:"Tiny Hole in a Tree"}}, {_id:3691, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Life's blows include events like losing respect, job, health, opportunities, friendships, or wealth due to wrong actions.", created_at:1779237971, source_id:"chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5", entity_id:"Life's Blows"}}, {_id:3692, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The angry mind is a metaphorical concept representing human anger that clings tightly to negative emotions despite life's challenges.", created_at:1779237971, source_id:"chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5", entity_id:"Angry Mind"}}, {_id:3693, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Wrong actions and words are consequences of clinging to anger, leading to negative outcomes and life's retribution.", created_at:1779237971, source_id:"chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5", entity_id:"Wrong Actions and Words"}}, {_id:3694, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Aromatic desserts are sweet items used by villagers to lure and trap monkeys in tree holes.", created_at:1779237971, source_id:"chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5", entity_id:"Aromatic Desserts"}}, {_id:3697, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779558115, description:"Blaming others for personal problems is a behavior stemming from anger, reflecting misplaced responsibility.<SEP>The act of attributing one's problems to others rather than oneself, perpetuating anger and lack of freedom.<SEP>The act of attributing personal problems to others' actions rather than self-reflection, perpetuating anger cycles.", source_id:"chunk-7bf65c644663a49c4d568dfba9827fc5<SEP>chunk-339fa6ee789d0451cedd5e2548222d96<SEP>chunk-04a5cce20e9ca029b1d885a9ee7c4ec6<SEP>chunk-855eeb4014bec08fbcd5dda2853ca446", entity_id:"Blaming Others"}}, {_id:3698, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The act of causing oneself pain or distress, often as a result of anger and negative thoughts.", created_at:1779238000, source_id:"chunk-339fa6ee789d0451cedd5e2548222d96<SEP>chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Self-harm"}}, {_id:3699, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Negative mental and behavioral patterns stemming from anger that lead to self-harm and loss.", created_at:1779238000, source_id:"chunk-339fa6ee789d0451cedd5e2548222d96", entity_id:"Angry Thoughts, Words, and Actions"}}, {_id:3700, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O1VkNuEChD4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The negative consequences resulting from anger, including damaged relationships and personal well-being.", created_at:1779238001, source_id:"chunk-339fa6ee789d0451cedd5e2548222d96", entity_id:"Loss"}}, {_id:3702, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Divine will is a spiritual concept mentioned in the text, associated with<SEP>Divine will is referenced as a condition for receiving divine intervention.", created_at:1779239009, source_id:"chunk-f6eaef482c63009d0b31a925045f09a2<SEP>chunk-36bdef1e637cf3b20139be1d1d34aa7d", entity_id:"Divine Will"}}, {_id:3703, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Nurture refers to mutual support and spiritual sustenance within communities, likened to a mother-child relationship.>", created_at:1779238769, source_id:"chunk-2937f9db737764b56ab13c05271ce216", entity_id:"Nurture"}}, {_id:3704, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779519729, description:"Human collective consciousness contains both positive and negative forces, influencing individual and group experiences.><SEP>Human collective consciousness represents the shared mental and emotional states passed through generations, shaping societal and individual experiences.<SEP>Human collective consciousness represents the shared mental and emotional 