ty_id:"Brahma"}}, {_id:3761, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Jayamana is a term in the corrected mantra, likely meaning 'victorious'.", created_at:1779240822, source_id:"chunk-398e965cd8ff044e9710f53404b93961", entity_id:"Jayamana"}}, {_id:3762, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Medha Devi is a goddess name mentioned in the corrected mantra.", created_at:1779240822, source_id:"chunk-398e965cd8ff044e9710f53404b93961", entity_id:"Medha Devi"}}, {_id:3763, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779241048, description:"Saraswati is the Hindu goddess of knowledge, music, art, wisdom, and learning.<SEP>Saraswati is a deity associated with the mantra mentioned in the text.", source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79<SEP>chunk-b8d18accff7354006bbf1baf5cc50967<SEP>chunk-6195ca7f73d379cf72b6e612c1bd422a", entity_id:"Saraswati"}}, {_id:3764, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Devi refers to the divine feminine principle in Hinduism, often associated with goddesses like Saraswati.<SEP>Devi is a person representing the goddess, mentioned in the mantra \"Om meda devi jushamana na aga.\"", created_at:1779241009, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79<SEP>chunk-b8d18accff7354006bbf1baf5cc50967", entity_id:"Devi"}}, {_id:3765, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The primordial sound considered the fundamental vibration of the universe in Hindu philosophy.<SEP>Om is a concept representing the universal sound, mentioned in the mantra \"Om shanti shanti shanti hi.\"", created_at:1779241008, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79<SEP>chunk-b8d18accff7354006bbf1baf5cc50967", entity_id:"Om"}}, {_id:3772, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A Hindu hymn invoking the protective grace of the goddess.", created_at:1779240823, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79", entity_id:"Devi Kavacham"}}, {_id:3773, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A Sanskrit text narrating the divine exploits of the goddess Durga.", created_at:1779240823, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79", entity_id:"Devi Mahatmyam"}}, {_id:3774, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The user reinterprets the garbled phrase as a coherent prayer invoking Brahma and Shashi (moon goddess).", created_at:1779240848, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79", entity_id:"Brahma-nakho shosi medaya pihitahat shudam legobhaya"}}, {_id:3775, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The user corrects the mantra to align with known spiritual terminology.", created_at:1779240848, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79", entity_id:"Om meda devi jushamana na aga"}}, {_id:3776, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The user interprets the phrase as a metaphorical expression of spiritual intoxication.", created_at:1779240848, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79", entity_id:"If my ear is intoxicated with the honey of the lotus..."}}, {_id:3777, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The user reinterprets the garbled phrase as a coherent prayer invoking Brahma and Shashi (moon goddess).", created_at:1779240848, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79", entity_id:"Brahma-nama, O Shashi, medha-pihita-ahat shudam, legobhaya"}}