The Sages of India were ancient scholars and enlightened sages from ancient India, credited with developing Sanskrit and its application in spiritual practices. They are recognized as the original practitioners and early proponents of yoga, with its origins deeply tied to their teachings. Known for deliberate seclusion, they attracted disciples seeking enlightenment and were central to the transmission of spiritual knowledge. Their legacy remains foundational to India's spiritual and philosophical traditions.", source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32<SEP>chunk-3c35da3ef16cded7b3dd200cbc19a5f4<SEP>chunk-3b0ee03e339b8be2a23ca314e0499ca6<SEP>chunk-b0711a74429c017f31e7a7d0d9eeca01<SEP>chunk-d7ea1b9fc81f64e7ae9644bf15bc144a<SEP>chunk-da64ae4026c154e16d22e9bdea555e82<SEP>chunk-fcb0245a76a7b396fd778f0392cfe0f8<SEP>chunk-508a8bdd4417bc922470bc1cee6c4244<SEP>chunk-6aebd99b80a116244470eacf183c4202<SEP>chunk-369c95aae7fc4dbe0b27e0f7e8e427f7", entity_id:"Sages of India"}}, {_id:3925, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mainstream represents widely accepted or popular trends in society.", created_at:1779245769, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9", entity_id:"Mainstream"}}, {_id:3926, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Business people are individuals engaged in commercial activities and wealth generation.<SEP>Business People are individuals in the business sector who seek spirituality to manage stress and enhance wealth creation.", created_at:1779245915, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-fc07b00b8be9ff28ca5f1fca3db2c5cb<SEP>chunk-203b5a3ea5b85d8a381ff6db8958a7d3", entity_id:"Business People"}}, {_id:3927, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", created_at:1779395821, description:"Business leaders are individuals in executive roles within organizations driving business decisions.<SEP>Business Leaders are executives who recognize the importance of spiritual growth for effective wealth generation and business success.<SEP>Business leaders are depicted as entities focused on achievement, success, and efficiency through strategic and intelligent actions like investments and timing.", source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-fc07b00b8be9ff28ca5f1fca3db2c5cb<SEP>chunk-203b5a3ea5b85d8a381ff6db8958a7d3<SEP>chunk-8542a80600889bb6e804d31658e4ffdd", entity_id:"Business Leaders"}}] AS row
