orts Earth's replenishment.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668", entity_id:"Home Practices"}}, {_id:4004, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Other life forms refer to all organisms and ecosystems on Earth, interconnected with human well-being.", created_at:1779250200, source_id:"chunk-2d0322e7ce560c7699ac3778c3495571", entity_id:"Other Life Forms"}}, {_id:4005, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Prolonged life refers to extending the lifespan of living beings and ecosystems.<SEP>Prolonged life is a concept explored through the possibility of slowing down decay and death, extending the lifespan of beings or celestial bodies.", created_at:1779250347, source_id:"chunk-2d0322e7ce560c7699ac3778c3495571<SEP>chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa", entity_id:"Prolonged Life"}}, {_id:4008, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Interconnection and inseparability as a concept related to power and unity.<SEP>Interconnection and inseparability between life forms are presented as foundational truths with transformative power.", created_at:1779250657, source_id:"chunk-4c3a75d278e14205cdb652a1dd294182<SEP>chunk-337cc1942c0c467cad10296df37b0661", entity_id:"Interconnection and Inseparability"}}, {_id:4010, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", created_at:1779250535, description:"The Pacific Ocean is the largest and deepest ocean on Earth, spanning from the Arctic to the Southern Ocean.<SEP>The Pacific Ocean is the largest body of water on Earth, containing the Mariana Trench.<SEP>The Pacific Ocean is the largest and deepest ocean on Earth, containing the Mariana Trench.", source_id:"chunk-4565491a2f82c499948bc59bd08ceda8<SEP>chunk-3fc0440bd350f3b05bf870c0f550544d<SEP>chunk-29504d0af63a387f3edf40d4bb13cddc", entity_id:"Pacific"}}, {_id:4011, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Standard atmospheric pressure at sea level is approximately 1013.25 hPa, serving as a baseline for measuring pressure changes.<SEP>Standard atmospheric pressure at sea level is compared to the extreme pressure conditions in the Mariana Trench.", created_at:1779250491, source_id:"chunk-4565491a2f82c499948bc59bd08ceda8<SEP>chunk-3fc0440bd350f3b05bf870c0f550544d", entity_id:"Standard Atmospheric Pressure"}}] AS row
