wn (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphorical phrase representing Earth's role in natural processes and resource creation.<SEP>The womb of Mother Earth is the source of primary manufacturing and energy production through decomposed organic matter.", created_at:1779251620, source_id:"chunk-6af63924e67c9180602f526dba74319a<SEP>chunk-69f7a386fbc619738707246584cb8e2a", entity_id:"Womb of Mother Earth"}}, {_id:4054, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase metaphorically represents Earth's role in sustaining manufacturing systems.", created_at:1779250982, source_id:"chunk-6af63924e67c9180602f526dba74319a", entity_id:"Manufacturing Processes"}}, {_id:4055, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Home sustainability involves minimizing the usage of fossil fuels.", created_at:1779251016, source_id:"chunk-72b375aeb11b7bdde0823bfbfcfc6334", entity_id:"fossil fuels"}}] AS row
