UNWIND [{_id:4146, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The goal of restructuring the repetitive chant text for better readability.", created_at:1779254801, source_id:"chunk-863f9e536320fb607179b5b22c477c8c", entity_id:"Readability Improvement"}}, {_id:4147, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Edited versions of the text with added punctuation (e.g., \"Soham. We come. Hamsa. Soham. We come.\") to improve readability and clarity.", created_at:1779254853, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2<SEP>chunk-6c24ec7da9fe1934f51cad895f6bb5af", entity_id:"Corrected Versions"}}, {_id:4148, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A textual correction method involving punctuation adjustments, repetition resolution, and structural simplification of the original chant-like phrases.<SEP>Editing process describes the textual corrections and restructuring performed to fix repetition and grammatical errors.", created_at:1779255426, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2<SEP>chunk-41070a47242b017794bd4b01d9403428", entity_id:"Editing Process"}}, {_id:4149, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779255762, description:"A repeated phrase in the original text, central to the chant-like structure, addressed through punctuation and repetition adjustments in the corrected versions.<SEP>We Come is a recurring phrase in the text, addressed during the editing process.<SEP>We Come is a phrase repeated in the chant, possibly expressing a collective or spiritual declaration.", source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2<SEP>chunk-41070a47242b017794bd4b01d9403428<SEP>chunk-60aa7e0f613ad00996175e977fb3fc07", entity_id:"We Come"}}, {_id:4150, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The central theme \"We come. Hamsa soham\" repeated in the text, representing a spiritual or philosophical concept.", created_at:1779254908, source_id:"chunk-fa4bb63d0902fb02ca5150a0e404f97c", entity_id:"Core Idea"}}, {_id:4152, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The theme of familial reconciliation and support for personal growth<SEP>Family Forgiveness refers to advice about apologizing and supporting family members within the text.", created_at:1779255426, source_id:"chunk-fa4bb63d0902fb02ca5150a0e404f97c<SEP>chunk-41070a47242b017794bd4b01d9403428", entity_id:"Family Forgiveness"}}, {_id:4153, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A restructured, readable version of the repetitive chant with punctuation and paragraph formatting.", created_at:1779254908, source_id:"chunk-fa4bb63d0902fb02ca5150a0e404f97c", entity_id:"Revised Chant Version"}}, {_id:4154, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Fixing Transcription Errors involves correcting repetitive text by adding punctuation and capitalization to form coherent sentences.", created_at:1779254977, source_id:"chunk-9cae7143f497353be3068de2f13fe25c", entity_id:"Fixing Transcription Errors"}}, {_id:4155, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Repetitive phrases such as \"Hamsa soham We come\" that require structural correction for clarity.<SEP>Repetitive phrases (\"The one who directed your father\") in the text, highlighting structural redundancy and potential unintended repetition.", created_at:1779261695, source_id:"chunk-9cae7143f497353be3068de2f13fe25c<SEP>chunk-609eba9953b128ee5842ae83faafcdb9", entity_id:"Repetitive Phrases"}}, {_id:4156, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A principle of familial harmony emphasizing forgiveness and mutual growth.", created_at:1779255117, source_id:"chunk-a838d7152e4bebf83c9201b3d383a669", entity_id:"Forgive and Support"}}, {_id:4157, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An act of reconciliation and emotional expression within familial relationships.", created_at:1779255117, source_id:"chunk-a838d7152e4bebf83c9201b3d383a669", entity_id:"Apologize to Loved Ones"}}, {_id:4158, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A repetitive phrase in the chant, possibly indicating a collective or ritualistic declaration.", created_at:1779255252, source_id:"chunk-b1305ddb839be73a31e060addb9a200a", entity_id:"We come"}}, {_id:4159, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779717654, description:"Refers to family members or close relationships, mentioned in the context of forgiveness.<SEP>Close individuals affected by the speaker's consciousness and transformation.<SEP>Loved ones is a term used in the original text, considered awkward and needing replacement.", source_id:"chunk-b1305ddb839be73a31e060addb9a200a<SEP>chunk-e9d2d065e530e86a6fbd6e76094e9842<SEP>chunk-718eaa0299a4e69592d1bfeffc841e25", entity_id:"Loved ones"}}, {_id:4161, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779257568, description:"Staying home is encouraged as a way to help during the pandemic by reducing physical movement and potential virus spread.><SEP>Staying home is a public health measure to limit virus transmission by reducing physical interactions.<SEP>Staying Home is presented as a necessary response during a disaster, involving actions taken from one's residence.", source_id:"chunk-0026168f5d0f7e1baf978deb6eacaf90<SEP>chunk-bad84b2ecffccfe0506f1c73dd5258df<SEP>chunk-4b6ce3c62d77ee2a30eede60a7aa63ac", entity_id:"Staying Home"}}, {_id:4162, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The viral outbreak necessitates unprecedented public health measures like seclusion to control transmission.><SEP>The viral outbreak refers to the spread of the virus, which governments aim to control through measures like seclusion.", created_at:1779257157, source_id:"chunk-0026168f5d0f7e1baf978deb6eacaf90<SEP>chunk-bad84b2ecffccfe0506f1c73dd5258df", entity_id:"Viral Outbreak"}}, {_id:4163, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Frontliners, including essential workers, face reduced strain due to collective seclusion efforts.><SEP>Frontliners refer to essential workers in critical sectors maintaining societal functions during crises.<SEP>Frontliners are acknowledged for their efforts in saving lives, with joy expressed in their actions.<SEP>Frontliners refer to individuals working in hospitals and on roads, highlighted for their service during crises.", created_at:1779257790, source_id:"chunk-0026168f5d0f7e1baf978deb6eacaf90<SEP>chunk-bad84b2ecffccfe0506f1c73dd5258df<SEP>chunk-dabe196345271fa16afe7578c3084aea<SEP>chunk-50f9429535917e274bee7a3453149639", entity_id:"Frontliners"}}, {_id:4164, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Governments are implementing and promoting seclusion measures to manage the viral outbreak effectively.><SEP>Governments refer to the governing bodies implementing public health strategies during the pandemic to manage the viral outbreak.", created_at:1779257157, source_id:"chunk-0026168f5d0f7e1baf978deb6eacaf90<SEP>chunk-bad84b2ecffccfe0506f1c73dd5258df", entity_id:"Governments"}}, {_id:4165, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Volunteering traditionally involves active community service, but current circumstances require alternative forms of support.>", created_at:1779256885, source_id:"chunk-0026168f5d0f7e1baf978deb6eacaf90", entity_id:"Volunteering"}}, {_id:4166, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779257790, description:"Healthcare professionals are frontline workers whose workload is alleviated by public adherence to seclusion guidelines.><SEP>Healthcare professionals are frontline medical workers supporting patients during the pandemic.<SEP>Healthcare professionals include doctors, nurses, and hospital staff mentioned in the message.", source_id:"chunk-0026168f5d0f7e1baf978deb6eacaf90<SEP>chunk-bad84b2ecffccfe0506f1c73dd5258df<SEP>chunk-50f9429535917e274bee7a3453149639", entity_id:"Healthcare Professionals"}}, {_id:4167, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"situation\" is considered in the context of seclusion.<SEP>Proposed phrase in the context of seclusion.", created_at:1779256888, source_id:"chunk-a92acbefa63c527fcc17b144a6bd6c40", entity_id:"Situation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:4168, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: cHAJiF2byzg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cHAJiF2byzg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Proposed phrase in the context of seclusion.<SEP>The word \"condition\" is suggested as the correct replacement for \"continent\" in the context of freedom.", created_at:1779662068, source_id:"chunk-a92acbefa63c527fcc17b144a6bd6c40<SEP>chunk-bc8be71ca178f551ef98cf124e252632", entity_id:"Condition"}}, {_id:4169, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Proposed phrase in the context of seclusion.", created_at:1779256889, source_id:"chunk-a92acbefa63c527fcc17b144a6bd6c40", entity_id:"State of mind"}}, {_id:4170, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Proposed phrase in the context of seclusion.", created_at:1779256889, source_id:"chunk-a92acbefa63c527fcc17b144a6bd6c40", entity_id:"State of being"}}, {_id:4171, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Proposed phrase in the context of seclusion.", created_at:1779256889, source_id:"chunk-a92acbefa63c527fcc17b144a6bd6c40", entity_id:"Place"}}, {_id:4172, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Preetajji is a person associated with Ekam, advocating for support towards healthcare professionals and frontliners.", created_at:1779257273, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21<SEP>chunk-ea6ac06a0214aa495f14ca8162f76be3", entity_id:"Preetajji"}}, {_id:4173, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Students at Ekam, encouraged to support healthcare professionals and frontliners.", created_at:1779257273, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21", entity_id:"Students of the Academy"}}, {_id:4174, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Healthcare professionals and frontline workers who are putting their safety and lives at risk to protect others.", created_at:1779257273, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21", entity_id:"Healthcare Professionals and Frontliners"}}, {_id:4175, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Families of healthcare professionals and frontliners, who also face anxiety and challenges due to their loved ones' work.", created_at:1779257273, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21", entity_id:"Their Families"}}, {_id:4176, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Individuals seeking guidance at Ekam, urged to assist healthcare workers.", created_at:1779257273, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21", entity_id:"Seekers at Ekam"}}, {_id:4177, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Those providing teachings at Ekam, also encouraged to support healthcare workers.", created_at:1779257273, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21", entity_id:"Deeksha Givers"}}, {_id:4178, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779257852, description:"A state of extreme tiredness experienced by healthcare workers due to prolonged work hours.<SEP>Fatigue is a state of extreme exhaustion experienced by healthcare workers due to prolonged shifts and emotional stress.<SEP>Fatigue describes physical and mental exhaustion experienced by medical workers due to demanding schedules.", source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21<SEP>chunk-80d013da8e30699bb74f5c6c773c8701<SEP>chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d", entity_id:"Fatigue"}}, {_id:4179, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Extended work shifts undertaken by healthcare professionals, contributing to fatigue.<SEP>18-hour shifts are prolonged work durations in healthcare settings, contributing to fatigue and stress.", created_at:1779257852, source_id:"chunk-e89be378630661d2c676d9886934ef21<SEP>chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d", entity_id:"18-Hour Shifts"}}, {_id:4180, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Healthcare workers are individuals working long shifts in high-stress environments, facing fatigue and health challenges while caring for patients during crises.", created_at:1779257336, source_id:"chunk-80d013da8e30699bb74f5c6c773c8701", entity_id:"Healthcare Workers"}}, {_id:4182, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The medical fraternity refers to healthcare workers and selfless servants who provide care and maintain order during crises, often facing physical and emotional strain.<SEP>The medical fraternity refers to healthcare workers and support staff serving selflessly in critical roles.", created_at:1779257852, source_id:"chunk-80d013da8e30699bb74f5c6c773c8701<SEP>chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d", entity_id:"Medical Fraternity"}}, {_id:4183, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Selfless service describes the act of serving others without expectation of reward, driven by empathy and societal responsibility.", created_at:1779257336, source_id:"chunk-80d013da8e30699bb74f5c6c773c8701<SEP>chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d", entity_id:"Selfless Service"}}, {_id:4185, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A phrase from the text considered acceptable after punctuation fixes.", created_at:1779257493, source_id:"chunk-fec773fce95fa8499da5e830de3153be", entity_id:"Look around you with your eyes and your heart."}}, {_id:4187, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A phrase identified as an error in the text due to being nonsensical in context.", created_at:1779257493, source_id:"chunk-fec773fce95fa8499da5e830de3153be", entity_id:"We are also in the first place."}}, {_id:4188, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The YouTube video includes the phrase \"Look around you with your eyes and your heart.\" as part of its content.", created_at:1779257524, source_id:"chunk-fec773fce95fa8499da5e830de3153be", entity_id:"Phrase 1"}}, {_id:4189, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Healthcare professionals are mentioned as recipients of support and encouragement to give them a breather.", created_at:1779257545, source_id:"chunk-dabe196345271fa16afe7578c3084aea", entity_id:"Healthcare professionals"}}, {_id:4190, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The speaker encourages actions that provide a breather to healthcare professionals.", created_at:1779257545, source_id:"chunk-dabe196345271fa16afe7578c3084aea", entity_id:"give a breather"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:4191, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Frontliners are acknowledged for saving lives, and the speaker expresses joy in their actions.", created_at:1779257545, source_id:"chunk-dabe196345271fa16afe7578c3084aea", entity_id:"saving lives"}}, {_id:4192, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Helping from Home is described as a method of contributing positively during a crisis, involving actions from home.", created_at:1779257568, source_id:"chunk-4b6ce3c62d77ee2a30eede60a7aa63ac", entity_id:"Helping from Home"}}, {_id:4193, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Disaster is referenced as the context for the speaker's advice, leading to the need for staying home.", created_at:1779257568, source_id:"chunk-4b6ce3c62d77ee2a30eede60a7aa63ac", entity_id:"Disaster"}}, {_id:4194, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Helping from home leads to a positive impact, making a world of difference.", created_at:1779257675, source_id:"chunk-4b6ce3c62d77ee2a30eede60a7aa63ac", entity_id:"Positive Impact"}}, {_id:4195, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Nurses are recognized for their role in healthcare and the need to support their families.", created_at:1779257790, source_id:"chunk-50f9429535917e274bee7a3453149639", entity_id:"Nurses"}}, {_id:4196, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Doctors are specifically mentioned as part of the healthcare workforce requiring support.<SEP>Doctors in some countries face moral dilemmas similar to Peter's.", created_at:1779655475, source_id:"chunk-50f9429535917e274bee7a3453149639<SEP>chunk-51a2b155e4eeb45d726ca7ab16117dcc<SEP>chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6", entity_id:"Doctors"}}, {_id:4197, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Hospital staff are acknowledged for working in various capacities during the pandemic.", created_at:1779257790, source_id:"chunk-50f9429535917e274bee7a3453149639", entity_id:"Hospital Staff"}}, {_id:4198, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mNM-x9RFMcE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Environment refers to the challenging working conditions and emotional atmosphere faced by medical workers.<SEP>Environment refers to the conditions enabling women to reach their full potential.<SEP>Environment refers to the conditions enabling women to reach their full potential.", created_at:1779701483, source_id:"chunk-1c356513974368f71d2bdbafe2a1f92d<SEP>chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3", entity_id:"Environment"}}, {_id:4200, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779260015, description:"A religious festival mentioned in the text.<SEP>Dashera is another Hindu festival during which the Upasana is traditionally performed.<SEP>Dashera is a Hindu festival marking the victory of good over evil, often linked to the worship of the Mother Goddess.<SEP>Dashera is a Hindu festival symbolizing the victory of good over evil, particularly through the worship of Lord Rama.<SEP>Dashera is another festival during which the Upasana practice is performed for the first three days.<SEP>Dashera is a Hindu festival celebrated over ten days, during which the Upasana is also performed.<SEP>Dashera is a Hindu festival marking the victory of good over evil, linked to the Mother Goddess.", source_id:"chunk-86fb5c9368dde9170c4844b23678c8ad<SEP>chunk-a348f3e70c609d0d7798352cd61a2781<SEP>chunk-35b63d2ee19735d06397a5b887beddb0<SEP>chunk-5a85e64decd4f2a6f6b8b1a83aae1399<SEP>chunk-5a811ca674072f39c34abb4651e492c5<SEP>chunk-c87bd389c5c5a0aa7ee00af0f32f42e6<SEP>chunk-8d66f25e14fdb745367662bcfd5df1bf", entity_id:"Dashera"}}, {_id:4201, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)<SEP>YouTube Video: 9-NMv5E-18s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9-NMv5E-18s)<SEP>YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Navratri is a Hindu religious festival, recognized as a significant religious festival in Hindu tradition. It is celebrated over nine nights (or nine days) and is dedicated to the worship of the Mother Goddess, embodying the divine feminine. The festival spans nine nights, during which devotees engage in Upasana, a ritual practice that honors the Goddess.

While Upasana is traditionally performed throughout the entire period, some traditions emphasize its observance during the first three days, reflecting a focus on initial rites of devotion. The festival symbolizes the journey of the seeker into consciousness, guided by the Goddess, and is considered a nine-day Hindu festival that marks the spiritual renewal of participants. Through its nine nights of worship, Navratri serves as a time for spiritual reflection, devotion, and the celebration of the divine feminine.<SEP>Navratri is a Hindu festival celebrating the Mother Goddess, symbolizing the journey of spiritual awakening and the dissolution of negative states like anger and greed.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Navratri is a nine-night celebration of the Mother Goddess and the feminine, also referred to as Dussehra.", created_at:1779519141, source_id:"chunk-86fb5c9368dde9170c4844b23678c8ad<SEP>chunk-a348f3e70c609d0d7798352cd61a2781<SEP>chunk-35b63d2ee19735d06397a5b887beddb0<SEP>chunk-5a85e64decd4f2a6f6b8b1a83aae1399<SEP>chunk-5a811ca674072f39c34abb4651e492c5<SEP>chunk-c87bd389c5c5a0aa7ee00af0f32f42e6<SEP>chunk-8d66f25e14fdb745367662bcfd5df1bf<SEP>chunk-d51e7d7fdd9bf5d32d4f076f7cdbb5be<SEP>chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-adf8cda164a53953c2d871599de03c16", entity_id:"Navratri"}}, {_id:4202, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779260015, description:"A domain-specific term that is not corrected in the text.<SEP>Mahadurka represents the symbolic form of the Mother Goddess in the spiritual practice.<SEP>Mahadurka represents the form of the Mother Goddess as a sacred geometric shape or symbol in meditation.<SEP>Mahadurka denotes a type of sacred headgear or ornament in Hindu iconography.<SEP>Mahadurka is a symbolic representation of the Mother Goddess in spiritual traditions.<SEP>Mahadurka is a specific form or representation of t