UNWIND [{_id:4264, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The version of the mantra with commas added and \"a dharana\" corrected to \"Dharana\".<SEP>Corrected mantra string: \"Bhakta Priyam, Bhakti Gamyam, Bhakta N?m Kirti Vardhikam, Bhavak Priyam, Satim Devim Vandt?vam, Bhakta Vatsalam, Annapurnam, Sadapurnam, Parvati, Parvapujitam, Maheshwarim, Risharudam, Vandt?vam, Parameswarim, Kalaratrim, Maharatrim, Moharatrim, Janeshwarim, Shiva Kantam, Shambhu Shaktim, Vandt?vam, Jananimumam, Jagatkatrim, Jagatdhatrim, Jagat Samhara Karinim, Muridissam Stuttam, Bhatram Vandt?vam, Mokshatayinim, Devadukkaharam, Vam Sada Devasahayim, Dharana upon her form in your chidakasha or the dark space in front of your closed eyes.\"", created_at:1779259954, source_id:"chunk-ff94932b6f3b0d226dc634858c45e539<SEP>chunk-521ddf24bfc548a5754de0c8b7f6c963", entity_id:"Corrected Mantra"}}, {_id:4265, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Original mantra phrase: \"Do a dharana\"", created_at:1779259954, source_id:"chunk-521ddf24bfc548a5754de0c8b7f6c963", entity_id:"Original Mantra Phrase"}}, {_id:4267, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Buddha Purnima, also known as Vaishaka Purnima, is the full moon day in the lunar month of Vaishakha celebrated by over 500 million people in honor of the Buddha's enlightenment.<SEP>Buddha Purnima (Vaishaka Purnima) is the full moon day in the lunar month of Vaishakha celebrated in honor of the Buddha's enlightenment.<SEP>Buddha Purnima is a full moon day in the lunar month of Vaishakha, celebrated globally to commemorate the Buddha's enlightenment.<SEP>Buddha Purnima is an event related to Buddha's enlightenment and is mentioned in the text.", created_at:1779390963, source_id:"chunk-955183a7876a0d1c45e94af3baafdb73<SEP>chunk-45b9957808782fcc232e5e0dfbb24ad0<SEP>chunk-46db2da052563452d1e385cea58f693a<SEP>chunk-49ad825cb7cba993a98976aa8215c0f0", entity_id:"Buddha Purnima"}}, {_id:4268, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of being Buddha involves realizing the illusion of a permanent, isolated self and understanding one's eternal, unified consciousness.", created_at:1779260738, source_id:"chunk-955183a7876a0d1c45e94af3baafdb73", entity_id:"Concept of Being Buddha"}}, {_id:4269, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Buddha's teachings explain the concept of being Buddha, which involves self-realization and realizing the illusion of self.", created_at:1779260739, source_id:"chunk-955183a7876a0d1c45e94af3baafdb73", entity_id:"Concept of being Buddha"}}, {_id:4271, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The five fathers are defined as the one who gave birth, initiated, gives wisdom, feeds, and liberates.", created_at:1779261133, source_id:"chunk-db4a0e7f56cb73058e9f9de5ef38915f", entity_id:"Five Fathers"}}, {_id:4274, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: idoWVpnJz-Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idoWVpnJz-Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: Fbd7ln2i9dw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fbd7ln2i9dw)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779665492, description:"Father's Day is a recent tradition celebrated on the third Sunday of June. The day is dedicated to fostering healing and connection between fathers and children, emphasizing the importance of familial bonds that extend beyond biological relationships.

It honors both biological fathers and father figures, including those who provided paternal support. By expanding the definition of fatherhood beyond biological ties, Father's Day recognizes a broader spectrum of paternal influence, encompassing non?biological father figures who contribute to the family's well?being.

The tradition seeks to strengthen ties within families and highlight the diverse ways fatherhood can be expressed. Through this celebration, the day promotes a more inclusive understanding of paternal roles, acknowledging the impact of paternal support on children's development and the healing of relationships.<SEP>Father's Day is a day to celebrate fathers, reflect on paternal relationships, and express gratitude for their contributions.<SEP>Father's Day is a day to remember fathers, reflect on relationships, and express gratitude for their contributions. It honors both biological fathers and father figures in one's life.<SEP>Father's Day is an event celebrating fathers and expressing gratitude to those who have played the role of a father.<SEP>Father's Day is an event where individuals are encouraged to perform three specific actions to honor and connect with their fathers, fostering mutual cherishing.<SEP>Father's Day is an event celebrated to honor fathers, with suggested activities to strengthen familial bonds.", source_id:"chunk-b996638425e80c3edd726b4647655b80<SEP>chunk-db4a0e7f56cb73058e9f9de5ef38915f<SEP>chunk-0bdbf1797b9374df3923aee96614874c<SEP>chunk-accdc31e9607c3940aed49cc5de73ff1<SEP>chunk-dc87b4124e027c8ceb12ac0f766b4f97<SEP>chunk-213b380b49b8d8407371ccc03fea59a4<SEP>chunk-a1980aa574f493c3c88959244cbe1135<SEP>chunk-0299e47f1b152a3bbc2dfc3315ac114a<SEP>chunk-a0d6a357e4a9a2e2dd0c278e4793f48a<SEP>chunk-ed9bd777897b8b08ed12f0776796982a<SEP>chunk-c1b8715ddbbe0589011d5273af6804ce<SEP>chunk-c93698531b3dac1e84db04c1babfa638<SEP>chunk-2356c92f9a3ba0c0acd302b505ca62a8", entity_id:"Father's Day"}}, {_id:4275, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"An ancient Hindu chant lists five father-like figures worthy of honor, including those who provide birth, spiritual guidance, wisdom, sustenance, and liberation from fear.<SEP>The Hindu chant is an ancient text that describes five fathers worthy of honor.<SEP>An ancient Hindu chant referencing five father-like figures, including those who give birth, guide spiritually, impart wisdom, nourish, and liberate.", created_at:1779262082, source_id:"chunk-db4a0e7f56cb73058e9f9de5ef38915f<SEP>chunk-0bdbf1797b9374df3923aee96614874c<SEP>chunk-a1980aa574f493c3c88959244cbe1135", entity_id:"Hindu Chant"}}, {_id:4276, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Hindu chant honors five figures as fathers, explaining their roles in giving birth, initiating onto the spiritual path, providing wisdom, feeding, and liberating from fear.", created_at:1779261133, source_id:"chunk-b996638425e80c3edd726b4647655b80", entity_id:"Janakashcha paneetha cha yascha vidyam prayachati, Anadashcha bhyatratha paschaypitara smritaha"}}, {_id:4278, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779261902, description:"Karmic evolution describes the spiritual process of dissolving unwholesome traits and nurturing positive qualities in one's journey toward fulfillment.<SEP>Karmic evolution involves dissolving unwholesome tendencies and nurturing wholesome ones.<SEP>Karmic evolution describes the process of dissolving unwholesome traits and nurturing wholesome ones as part of spiritual growth.<SEP>Karmic evolution refers to the process of dissolving unwholesome tendencies and nurturing wholesome qualities as part of spiritual growth.", source_id:"chunk-db4a0e7f56cb73058e9f9de5ef38915f<SEP>chunk-0bdbf1797b9374df3923aee96614874c<SEP>chunk-accdc31e9607c3940aed49cc5de73ff1<SEP>chunk-213b380b49b8d8407371ccc03fea59a4", entity_id:"Karmic Evolution"}}, {_id:4280, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Success and fulfillment are goals in the journey of human beings, influenced by fatherly figures.<SEP>Success and fulfillment are framed as outcomes of perseverance, benefiting both the individual and their community.<SEP>Success and fulfillment are framed as outcomes of perseverance, benefiting both the individual and their community.", created_at:1779653935, source_id:"chunk-db4a0e7f56cb73058e9f9de5ef38915f<SEP>chunk-55dc4edcd2b102395a856543b6549ab5", entity_id:"Success and Fulfillment"}}, {_id:4281, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Qu5IQo0ghbs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qu5IQo0ghbs)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779648102, description:"<think>
