ncate:"", description:"The practice of organizing and planning time, which the speaker argues is ineffective without a state.<SEP>A time management technique taught in coachings, often leading to short-term compliance but eventual disengagement without a foundational state.", created_at:1779393687, source_id:"chunk-6c4e90f0f66c98634e4d4ac55a3fa81b<SEP>chunk-858bc08530c3ab537fc81f04b5fef0be", entity_id:"Managing Time"}}, {_id:4326, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4_Fqfew1PRk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4_Fqfew1PRk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Various teachings and strategies aimed at managing life aspects like time and tasks.<SEP>Educational or self-improvement programs focused on practical management strategies like time and calendar organization.", created_at:1779393687, source_id:"chunk-6c4e90f0f66c98634e4d4ac55a3fa81b<SEP>chunk-858bc08530c3ab537fc81f04b5fef0be", entity_id:"Coachings and Lessons"}}, {_id:4327, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4_Fqfew1PRk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4_Fqfew1PRk)<SEP>YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779666429, description:"Teachings refer to philosophical lessons emphasizing cultivating the state of being.<SEP>Teachings refer to philosophical lessons emphasizing cultivating the state of being.<SEP>Teachings refer to philosophical lessons emphasizing cultivating the state of being.<SEP>Educational materials and philosophies developed to change consciousness and impact the world.<SEP>Teachings refer to the philosophical principles and methods discussed for managing pressure, emphasizing acceptance and practice.`", source_id:"chunk-117454b5b8cd20e4fb94422bfd8e3b49<SEP>chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a<SEP>chunk-ae2f2a9e144a0416a2b1367a6eab9be2", entity_id:"Teachings"}}, {_id:4328, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A group of five individuals referenced in the text as part of the correct definition of the chant, which was replaced by the garbled repetition.<SEP>Five individuals honored in the chant: the one who gave birth, initiated, gives wisdom, feeds, and liberates from fear.", created_at:1779261885, source_id:"chunk-9eecae952bdf1ea7867999c8da705aa0<SEP>chunk-1439496c0597ca312586a923b138c34d", entity_id:"Five People"}}, {_id:4329, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Guidelines for fixing transcription errors, including handling repetitions and domain-specific terms.", created_at:1779261767, source_id:"chunk-9eecae952bdf1ea7867999c8da705aa0", entity_id:"Correction Instructions"}}, {_id:4330, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Enumerates five individuals considered worthy of honor as a father.>", created_at:1779261828, source_id:"chunk-b988235d793b44b746abc1c8a693367b", entity_id:"List of 5 People"}}, {_id:4331, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A repetitive phrase deemed erroneous in the text, disrupting the structure.>", created_at:1779261828, source_id:"chunk-b988235d793b44b746abc1c8a693367b", entity_id:"Repetition of \"The one who directed your father\""}}, {_id:4332, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A conceptual error identified in the text, disrupting coherence.>", created_at:1779261828, source_id:"chunk-b988235d793b44b746abc1c8a693367b", entity_id:"Error Concept"}}, {_id:4333, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"The original chant contains errors and repetitive phrases that need correction.<SEP>Chanting is a vocal practice integrated into specific yoga movements.", created_at:1779728214, source_id:"chunk-1439496c0597ca312586a923b138c34d<SEP>chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"Chant"}}, {_id:4334, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Original Meaning is a concept that the original meaning of a chant is often garbled and repetitive, requiring correction to align with the author's intended meaning. This perspective highlights that the original meaning is not to be retained absolutely, but rather functions as a constraint during the correction process.

Original Meaning is also described as a constraint that should not be retained absolutely. Multiple descriptions emphasize that the original meaning serves as a constraint, and one view specifically notes that during corrections one must avoid retaining the original non-existent meaning. In practice, this means that while the original meaning may be flawed, it should not be preserved as an absolute truth; instead, corrections should aim to reflect the author's intended meaning, and any attempt to retain the original meaning must be avoided to prevent perpetuating a non-existent interpretation.<SEP>Constraint requiring avoidance of retaining the original non-existent meaning during corrections.", created_at:1779735302, source_id:"chunk-1439496c0597ca312586a923b138c34d<SEP>chunk-3718c86a25fb0b5558d0d13c8bf954d4<SEP>chunk-24979790543830f1142942642c3d852a", entity_id:"Original Meaning"}}, {_id:4335, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The author's intended meaning clarifies the chant as honoring five people, removing errors and repetitions.", created_at:1779261885, source_id:"chunk-1439496c0597ca312586a923b138c34d", entity_id:"Author's Intended Meaning"}}, {_id:4336, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779663371, description:"The prompt specifies that the original meaning should not be retained absolutely, allowing for corrections to prioritize the author's intended meaning over the garbled text.<SEP>Prompt constraints specify rules for correcting transcriptions, including strict adherence to original meaning, avoiding rewrites, and focusing on homophones, domain terms, and punctuation.<SEP>Constraints from the prompt including adherence to formatting rules, output language requirements, and handling of errors.", source_id:"chunk-1439496c0597ca312586a923b138c34d<SEP>chunk-a86eca0b1f90f6c49a60c38f2bf9272a<SEP>chunk-3dcdd5d3569257cdff1dae6995bf7c96", entity_id:"Prompt Constraints"}}, {_id:4337, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Karmic evolution involves dissolving negative traits and nurturing positive ones as part of personal and collective growth.", created_at:1779262056, source_id:"chunk-213b380b49b8d8407371ccc03fea59a4", entity_id:"Dissolving Unwholesome Traits"}}, {_id:4338, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Father's Day fosters healing and connection between fathers and children, addressing loneliness and promoting understanding.", created_at:1779262056, source_id:"chunk-213b380b49b8d8407371ccc03fea59a4", entity_id:"Healing and Connection"}}, {_id:4339, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Sunday of June is a recent tradition celebrated to foster healing and connection between fathers and children, particularly for those with lonely lives.", created_at:1779262082, source_id:"chunk-a1980aa574f493c3c88959244cbe1135", entity_id:"Sunday of June"}}] AS row
