6. \"The awakened state of consciousness is a specific type of transformed state of consciousness.\" (duplicate)
7. \"The awakened state of consciousness is a specific type of transformed state of consciousness.\" (duplicate)
8. \"A heightened level of awareness required to consciously shape destinies, as opposed to passive existence.\"

Thus, the entity is \"Awakened State of Consciousness\". The summary should integrate:

