ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Power of action emphasizes the visible, tangible outcomes of leadership decisions, prioritized by the world due to their observable impact.<SEP>The power of action refers to the ability to take decisive and strategic action, emphasizing balance between engagement and stillness for optimal effectiveness.", created_at:1779395848, source_id:"chunk-8542a80600889bb6e804d31658e4ffdd<SEP>chunk-ba586743a140b7df40d5cacb7f238ed9", entity_id:"Power of Action"}}, {_id:4497, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Strategic action refers to deliberate, visible power dynamics in business decisions, such as investments or exits, driven by calculated intelligence.", created_at:1779395821, source_id:"chunk-8542a80600889bb6e804d31658e4ffdd", entity_id:"Strategic Action"}}, {_id:4498, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779530943, description:"<think>
