We must also note that the first description says it's the archaic, massive part of the human mind that processes information", created_at:1779753081, source_id:"chunk-019177d585b65eb10f97dfb309cde652<SEP>chunk-73d91b3b0282525d04160f092d1f54ac", entity_id:"Unconscious Mind"}}, {_id:4509, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779655488, description:"Decision-making is linked to the conscious mind and prefrontal cortex, with intention shaping its outcomes.<SEP>Decision is a concept where the beneficiary is determined by intention.<SEP>Decision represents a choice made in the face of challenges and uncertainties.<SEP>Decision is the outcome of spiritual action rooted in self-awareness and connection.", source_id:"chunk-019177d585b65eb10f97dfb309cde652<SEP>chunk-de8ced1f0ad24cf1ada29f88e70d381e<SEP>chunk-46d6abd520d390d99cea37e408f7a403<SEP>chunk-419f2bb193b6ad2621108753e0e6993e", entity_id:"Decision"}}, {_id:4510, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spirituality in business is discussed as a key takeaway from the user's experience in Ono.<SEP>Spirituality in Business is considered important in business, more than previously imagined by the user.<SEP>Spirituality in Business is a concept emphasizing the importance of spiritual practices in business operations.<SEP>Spirituality in Business refers to the role of spiritual principles in business decision-making and operations.<SEP>Spirituality in Business is a concept highlighting the role of spiritual principles in business practices.<SEP>Spirituality in business is a concept that the user learned about in Ono and finds important.", created_at:1779396194, source_id:"chunk-38d10efd726b55222a60dd6302bc5fed<SEP>chunk-de8ced1f0ad24cf1ada29f88e70d381e<SEP>chunk-6be585d75cf325a3e49671e7f39dd2b5<SEP>chunk-b54c1c8684702c9200700834a33ecb01<SEP>chunk-e8faa81a993f207602fa6e9806472986<SEP>chunk-d1012dbbd23737bb4a6584bd720f3300", entity_id:"Spirituality in Business"}}, {_id:4511, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"\"Created in You\" is a corrected version of the phrase \"created you\" from the video's text, suggesting a grammatical correction.", created_at:1779395969, source_id:"chunk-38d10efd726b55222a60dd6302bc5fed", entity_id:"Created in You"}}, {_id:4512, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779396153, description:"Business Education refers to the formal study of business principles, which did not include spirituality in business according to the user.<SEP>Business Education refers to formal academic training in business that did not include teachings on spirituality.<SEP>Business Education refers to formal education in business that did not include teachings on spirituality in business.", source_id:"chunk-de8ced1f0ad24cf1ada29f88e70d381e<SEP>chunk-b54c1c8684702c9200700834a33ecb01<SEP>chunk-e8faa81a993f207602fa6e9806472986", entity_id:"Business Education"}}, {_id:4513, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Business at school is a concept where the user studied but was not taught about spirituality in business.", created_at:1779396194, source_id:"chunk-d1012dbbd23737bb4a6584bd720f3300", entity_id:"Business at School"}}, {_id:4514, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Power of Intention is a concept discussed within the O&O Teachings, explaining how intention influences outcomes.", created_at:1779396243, source_id:"chunk-f63f1b5d24ba94b5a3f6d30a788d8dd0", entity_id:"The Power of Intention"}}, {_id:4515, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Energy is a concept representing the flow of influence from states, affecting intention, decisions, and actions.<SEP>Energy is a fundamental aspect of the field, representing its dynamic and active nature.<SEP>Energy is mentioned as being initially high due to anger or frustration but later destructive.<SEP>Energy signifies the initial surge of power or motivation driven by anger or frustration, which later diminishes as addictions take hold.<SEP>Energy represents the capacity of a person to act, which can be directed towards destructive or constructive purposes depending on one's mindset.<SEP>Energy refers to the dynamic force within the program that fosters connection and growth.<SEP>Vital force that can either be dissipated (in stressful states) or focused (in beautiful states), influencing mental clarity and engagement with life.", created_at:1779555235, source_id:"chunk-62aafe5d597e7b4e36bd88d98b8974d0<SEP>chunk-3538d3a6dca3eeca95cabf452a553746<SEP>chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc<SEP>chunk-fafff025e01a29bbcee9969fc4559382<SEP>chunk-ab90f4a2ea15bf468182f88153f57ef6<SEP>chunk-97418c51f26c4090e6f6b986b0a848a6<SEP>chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5", entity_id:"Energy"}}, {_id:4516, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Longing for love from one's husband represents a recurring emotional pattern tied to unresolved personal experiences.", created_at:1779396422, source_id:"chunk-0ddbd4446b0368311d8844f5869734c4", entity_id:"Longing for Love from Husband"}}, {_id:4517, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: zGOKGrTNlk4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGOKGrTNlk4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional state characterized by a desire for affection or connection, particularly from a spouse, linked to inner disturbance experiences.", created_at:1779396467, source_id:"chunk-28084224d33efa95fcb7e18cd0d14748", entity_id:"Longing for Love"}}, {_id:4518, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: zGOKGrTNlk4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGOKGrTNlk4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1_-cZz8YRFw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1_-cZz8YRFw)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779652795, description:"Husband represents a personal relationship figure associated with longing for love in the listener's experience.<SEP>The woman's husband suggested a divorce and was involved in a conflicting relationship with her.<SEP>Husband represents a relational role where comparison may arise from societal or personal expectations.", source_id:"chunk-28084224d33efa95fcb7e18cd0d14748<SEP>chunk-d8c510c8750c7c378759ec2d9cfe2559<SEP>chunk-e27a47feac82bbd6f6606fd0582e97d1", entity_id:"Husband"}}, {_id:4519, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Education stages (e.g., grades, degrees) are used metaphorically to illustrate spiritual progression, with PhD symbolizing enlightenment.<SEP>A reordered and rephrased list of academic stages: first grade, 12th grade, undergraduate, master's, and PhD.", created_at:1779398167, source_id:"chunk-6f4b86894bf06d07d9095036ac74d620<SEP>chunk-dba394b8ea38273841a7f5467d696e0c", entity_id:"Education Stages"}}, {_id:4520, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"The final stage of spirituality is marked by enlightenment and a natural, beautiful inner state reflected in daily life.", created_at:1779397561, source_id:"chunk-6f4b86894bf06d07d9095036ac74d620", entity_id:"Final Stage"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:4521, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The first stage of spirituality involves becoming a person at a foundational, basic level of existence.<SEP>The first stage in spirituality is compared to foundational educational levels like first grade.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-6f4b86894bf06d07d9095036ac74d620<SEP>chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"First Stage"}}, {_id:4522, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779398030, description:"Enlightenment is metaphorically equated to a PhD, representing the highest academic and spiritual achievement.<SEP>PhD symbolizes the highest academic achievement, equated with spiritual enlightenment in the analogy.<SEP>A PhD is metaphorically linked to enlightenment, representing the highest academic and spiritual achievement.", source_id:"chunk-6f4b86894bf06d07d9095036ac74d620<SEP>chunk-1fbe8b29b004fd2a51bfaf808ad4a188<SEP>chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"PhD"}}, {_id:4523, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The process of editing the video's text to improve grammatical accuracy, readability, and coherence while preserving the original tone and intent.<SEP>Grammar corrections involve fixing run-on sentences, punctuation, and word choice to improve text clarity.", created_at:1779673177, source_id:"chunk-8747b8559b6ab050bd73313beb85bb44<SEP>chunk-98921940959422839d1d78085fa664be", entity_id:"Grammar Corrections"}}, {_id:4525, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Undergraduate studies replaces the non-standard term \"undergraduation\" to describe the third stage in the educational analogy.<SEP>Undergraduate studies are equated to the process of becoming a happier person in spiritual terms.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-1fbe8b29b004fd2a51bfaf808ad4a188<SEP>chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"Undergraduate Studies"}}, {_id:4526, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Becoming refers to the foundational stage of spirituality focused on personal growth and happiness.", created_at:1779397741, source_id:"chunk-1fbe8b29b004fd2a51bfaf808ad4a188", entity_id:"Becoming"}}, {_id:4528, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An enlightened person represents the final stage of spiritual development, characterized by profound understanding.<SEP>The final stage of spirituality involves becoming an enlightened person, compared to advanced academic achievements like a PhD.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-1fbe8b29b004fd2a51bfaf808ad4a188<SEP>chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"Enlightened Person"}}, {_id:4529, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"Undergraduation\" is replaced with \"undergraduate studies\" for clarity and consistency.", created_at:1779397743, source_id:"chunk-1fbe8b29b004fd2a51bfaf808ad4a188", entity_id:"Undergraduation"}}, {_id:4530, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Conversational example critiquing fragmented spirituality: \"In the morning, I'll do whatever I want; in the evening, I'll become spiritual.\"", created_at:1779397760, source_id:"chunk-35e15581ad50dde0c800dac7e7b512c1", entity_id:"Spirituality Example"}}, {_id:4531, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Chronological sequence of educational milestones including first grade, 12th grade, undergraduate studies, master's degree, and PhD.", created_at:1779397760, source_id:"chunk-35e15581ad50dde0c800dac7e7b512c1", entity_id:"Educational Stages"}}, {_id:4532, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spouse or child represents external factors that can interrupt or influence actions.", created_at:1779397808, source_id:"chunk-2596b0f6fe118e104aa7005b1e2d7f81", entity_id:"Spouse or Child"}}, {_id:4533, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779398115, description:"A transformed way of living emphasizes natural inner states and their reflection in daily activities.<SEP>Transformed Way of Living refers to a rephrased concept of existence described in the text.<SEP>A transformed way of living that redefines relationships, education, and personal fulfillment, emphasizing spirituality for state change.", source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944<SEP>chunk-a737bc4c3766582aa723ad6e7971898e<SEP>chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08", entity_id:"Transformed Way of Living"}}, {_id:4534, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video Content includes dialogue and comments discussing spirituality and daily life.", created_at:1779397863, source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944", entity_id:"YouTube Video Content"}}, {_id:4535, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Parks represent leisure activities or natural settings that may be overlooked when prioritizing superficial engagement over authentic connection.", created_at:1779397928, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f", entity_id:"Parks"}}, {_id:4536, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Beauty in relationships emphasizes nurturing meaningful connections and appreciating the emotional depth of interpersonal dynamics.", created_at:1779397928, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f", entity_id:"Beauty in Relationships"}}, {_id:4539, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Movie is a metaphor used to describe life, where individuals plan roles for different times of day and social interactions.<SEP>Life is metaphorically compared to a movie, with constant role-playing and planning.", created_at:1779398115, source_id:"chunk-00968a8a5699c4a7cadba065809b18ee<SEP>chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08", entity_id:"Movie"}}, {_id:4540, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The basic stage of spirituality is likened to early educational stages such as 12th grade.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"Basic Stage"}}, {_id:4541, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"First grade symbolizes the initial stage of education, paralleling the first stage of spiritual development.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"First Grade"}}, {_id:4542, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Becoming a happier person is associated with intermediate spiritual development, analogous to undergraduate studies.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"Happier Person"}}, {_id:4543, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"12th grade represents a foundational educational milestone, compared to the basic stage in spirituality.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"12th Grade"}}, {_id:4544, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A master's degree corresponds to advanced spiritual growth, preceding the final stage of enlightenment.", created_at:1779398030, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b", entity_id:"Master's Degree"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:4545, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Rephrased Version is the edited and clarified version of the original text.", created_at:1779398083, source_id:"chunk-a737bc4c3766582aa723ad6e7971898e", entity_id:"Rephrased Version"}}, {_id:4546, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Rephrasing is the process of editing and clarifying the original text for better understanding.", created_at:1779398083, source_id:"chunk-a737bc4c3766582aa723ad6e7971898e", entity_id:"Rephrasing"}}, {_id:4547, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"KTlY-lHs_Ew is a YouTube video hosting the original text content for rephrasing.<SEP>Video identifier \"KTlY-lHs_Ew\" associated with the discussed spiritual concepts.", created_at:1779398246, source_id:"chunk-a737bc4c3766582aa723ad6e7971898e<SEP>chunk-6a5c1cd3abe977e04aa0398546d911a7", entity_id:"KTlY-lHs_Ew"}}, {_id:4548, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Editing involves correcting punctuation and restructuring sentences for clarity.", created_at:1779398083, source_id:"chunk-a737bc4c3766582aa723ad6e7971898e", entity_id:"Editing"}}, {_id:4549, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Role-play", created_at:1779398115, source_id:"chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08", entity_id:"Role-Playing"}}, {_id:4550, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Action and drama are contrasted with beauty, representing the current state of relationships devoid of spiritual harmony.", created_at:1779398246, source_id:"chunk-6a5c1cd3abe977e04aa0398546d911a7", entity_id:"Action and Drama"}}, {_id:4551, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphorical virus symbolizing the destructive force of separation, described as \"the virus of the bacteria\" causing planetary disease.", created_at:1779399161, source_id:"chunk-8c47a43e466f805ea381f194db0fb072", entity_id:"Virus of the Bacteria"}}, {_id:4552, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of disconnection from others and life, identified as the root cause of the metaphorical virus and planetary suffering.<SEP>Sense of separation is identified as the cause of planetary \"diseasing\" according to the text.", created_at:1779399309, source_id:"chunk-8c47a43e466f805ea381f194db0fb072<SEP>chunk-765fe756f31ab4246df055ef09eac89f", entity_id:"Sense of Separation"}}, {_id:4553, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphorical representation of the planet as a living entity affected by disease, synonymous with the terms \"bacteria\" or \"virus\" in the text.<SEP>Organism is referenced in the text as part of the metaphor describing separation and suffering affecting the planet.", created_at:1779399309, source_id:"chunk-8c47a43e466f805ea381f194db0fb072<SEP>chunk-765fe756f31ab4246df055ef09eac89f", entity_id:"Organism"}}, {_id:4554, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The planet is metaphorically described as diseased, caused by a sense of separation rooted in 