nfectious agent capable of causing disease in living organisms.", source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785<SEP>chunk-3da16f4292642f8022ca187ac2cb1ede<SEP>chunk-5f51161e463ac960fab8b2a50bc6505c", entity_id:"Virus"}}, {_id:4579, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Experiencing life from a beautiful state of consciousness enables contributing to the planet's greatness.<SEP>A state of consciousness characterized by connection, love, passion, and peace, which is essential for sustaining drive and willpower.", created_at:1779653848, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc<SEP>chunk-87ae4401ec344e0f145a40afa02041af", entity_id:"Beautiful State of Consciousness"}}, {_id:4580, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Actions in family, organization, or community lead to more suffering.", created_at:1779399655, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc", entity_id:"Actions in Family/Organization/Community"}}, {_id:4581, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Actions in family, organization, or community lead to more suffering.", created_at:1779399655, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc", entity_id:"More Suffering"}}, {_id:4582, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Experiencing life from a beautiful state of consciousness enables contributing to the planet's greatness.", created_at:1779399655, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc", entity_id:"Contributing to Planet's Greatness"}}, {_id:4583, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Mukthi is a state that the planet thirsts for, contributing to the planet's greatness.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc", entity_id:"Planet's Greatness"}}, {_id:4584, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Nurturing a beautiful state of consciousness leads to a happier society.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc", entity_id:"Happier Society"}}, {_id:4585, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrected phrase used as an example of proper preposition usage and linguistic analysis.", created_at:1779399677, source_id:"chunk-aba1fa51c438208d47c78877a58241d4", entity_id:"in suffering"}}, {_id:4586, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Original phrase analyzed for grammatical correctness and homophone consideration.", created_at:1779399677, source_id:"chunk-aba1fa51c438208d47c78877a58241d4", entity_id:"for a suffering"}}] AS row
