UNWIND [{_id:4587, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Correct term used in the revised text, replacing \"diseasing.\"", created_at:1779399709, source_id:"chunk-b7b1fc61be33232fdc568335583f1248", entity_id:"Diseased"}}, {_id:4588, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Incorrect term used in the original text, later corrected to \"diseased.\"", created_at:1779399709, source_id:"chunk-b7b1fc61be33232fdc568335583f1248", entity_id:"Diseasing"}}, {_id:4589, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Original incorrect phrase in the text, later corrected to \"in suffering.\"", created_at:1779399709, source_id:"chunk-b7b1fc61be33232fdc568335583f1248", entity_id:"For a Suffering"}}, {_id:4590, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrected phrase replacing \"for a suffering.\"", created_at:1779399710, source_id:"chunk-b7b1fc61be33232fdc568335583f1248", entity_id:"In Suffering"}}, {_id:4593, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Horses metaphorically represent disorganized efforts when individuals in an organization lack connection.", created_at:1779400755, source_id:"chunk-54304c335de80180a629fdfe3979a92e", entity_id:"Horses"}}, {_id:4594, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Tension describes an inner rush or stress arising from judgment, compelling individuals to correct or control others.", created_at:1779400755, source_id:"chunk-54304c335de80180a629fdfe3979a92e", entity_id:"Tension"}}, {_id:4596, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Forests represent thriving ecosystems where mushrooms and trees engage in symbiotic growth through mutual exchange.<SEP>Forests are being destroyed, contributing to species extinction and ecological imbalance.", created_at:1779663974, source_id:"chunk-54304c335de80180a629fdfe3979a92e<SEP>chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a", entity_id:"Forests"}}, {_id:4597, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Holding a space for another refers to a state of inner spaciousness and non-judgmental connection with others, enabling calm and trust.", created_at:1779400755, source_id:"chunk-54304c335de80180a629fdfe3979a92e", entity_id:"Holding a Space for Another"}}, {_id:4598, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Holding space refers to the capacity to connect with others without judgment, enabling mutual growth and solution-finding.", created_at:1779400802, source_id:"chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed", entity_id:"Holding Space"}}, {_id:4599, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Productivity reflects efficient task completion, negatively affected by stress and judgment.", created_at:1779400802, source_id:"chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed", entity_id:"Productivity"}}, {_id:4600, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Disrespect arises from judgmental behavior, making individuals feel devalued and impacting workplace dynamics.", created_at:1779400802, source_id:"chunk-473520b864e4054af2c84c9215077c94<SEP>chunk-1a4e20db18753630cc0835f806d71f29<SEP>chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed", entity_id:"Disrespect"}}, {_id:4601, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Inner spaciousness is a mental state of calm awareness that allows non-judgmental engagement with others.", created_at:1779400802, source_id:"chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed", entity_id:"Inner Spaciousness"}}, {_id:4602, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"54% of people report feeling disrespected at work, highlighting the prevalence of judgmental environments.", created_at:1779400803, source_id:"chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed", entity_id:"54 Percent"}}, {_id:4603, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)<SEP>YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-Interest refers to one's personal goals or benefits, which can be perceived as threatened by others' judgments, leading to defensive reactions.<SEP>Self-interest refers to limited personal motivations that Dharma emphasizes transcending for the greater good.", created_at:1779519872, source_id:"chunk-a9c35b7e3af59116caff7410890807ed<SEP>chunk-ab90f4a2ea15bf468182f88153f57ef6", entity_id:"Self-Interest"}}, {_id:4604, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphor representing the organization's lack of collective direction, where each member acts independently without shared goals.", created_at:1779400879, source_id:"chunk-6ae1a5128f5bd3988c5b8902bc010873", entity_id:"Hundred Strong Horses"}}, {_id:4605, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"An unfolding phenomenon where brains begin to connect collectively, triggering a shift in organizational dynamics.", created_at:1779400879, source_id:"chunk-6ae1a5128f5bd3988c5b8902bc010873", entity_id:"Strange Happening"}}, {_id:4606, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A unified mental state where ideas flow collectively among organization members as one connected dream.<SEP>Collective Brain refers to the interconnected consciousness and idea-sharing among team members facilitated by The Mystic Secrets.", created_at:1779666070, source_id:"chunk-6ae1a5128f5bd3988c5b8902bc010873<SEP>chunk-20b522ad915c05aa0d61fb0dbb9917a4", entity_id:"Collective Brain"}}, {_id:4607, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: l6svaRx35TI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l6svaRx35TI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A synchronized cognitive connection among individuals, enabling shared goals and inspiration.<SEP>Connected brain is a metaphor for a team that operates as a single, inspired entity.", created_at:1779666024, source_id:"chunk-6ae1a5128f5bd3988c5b8902bc010873<SEP>chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082", entity_id:"Connected Brain"}}, {_id:4608, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Five essential roles of a father recognized in ancient Indian traditions: providing life, sustenance, education, spiritual guidance, and instilling courage.", created_at:1779401918, source_id:"chunk-a0d6a357e4a9a2e2dd0c278e4793f48a", entity_id:"Five Paternal Roles"}}, {_id:4609, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: I6yC-aUQUvw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6yC-aUQUvw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779673144, description:"<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual teaching or concept definition from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and analysis, but I need to focus only on the real content about \"Meaning\".

First, I'll go through each of the provided descriptions. The first few (1-4) talk about meaning as intrinsic purpose, significance, existence, and philosophical contexts. Then description 5 mentions meaning in text corrections, which seems more about semantics or translation. Descriptions 6 and 8 discuss meaning as a product of togetherness, collective actions, and beliefs. There's a duplicate of description 6.

The developer notes mention integrating all key info, noting the different contexts: philosophical, textual, and social/collective. The main themes are philosophical meaning, textual meaning, and collective meaning. The task is to create a summary that covers these aspects without omitting important facts.

I need to make sure to include the entity name \"Meaning\" at the beginning. The summary should be in third-person, objective, and within 1-4 sentences. Also, handle duplicates by mentioning once. The fifth description's context is different (text corrections), so it should be included but noted as a separate aspect. The sixth and eighth are about collective actions, so they should be grouped together.

Putting it all together: Start with \"Meaning\" as the main concept. Then mention the philosophical aspects (intrinsic purpose, existence, intentionality). Then the textual context (intended message in text). Finally, the social/collective context (togetherness, collective actions, beliefs). Make sure it's concise, no bullet points, and in plain English. Check for any conflicts or duplicates and handle them appropriately. Avoid any developer instructions or meta-text. Let me draft that.
</think>

Meaning refers to the intrinsic purpose or significance of existence, life, or actions, central to existential inquiry", source_id:"chunk-075b8e71a3c71d11c785be4bbfe965ed<SEP>chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28<SEP>chunk-e94d81180e7457d6f36d99965cfbf34d<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b<SEP>chunk-d08234aef1ec6afbd127700e08544b48<SEP>chunk-47e1f1988fb8839c7401d731e2c56670<SEP>chunk-4d7d4c6af0d9749ed5b68808bdd2d648<SEP>chunk-e8e24c4cdde1291a97c096da1259ca59", entity_id:"Meaning"}}] AS row
