erficiality.<SEP>Others refers to other individuals, whose sense of self can be expanded and transformed.<SEP>Others refers to other individuals, whose sense of self can be expanded and transformed.<SEP>Others represent people in general, influenced by the individual's consciousness and actions.<SEP>Others represent people in general, influenced by the individual's consciousness and actions.<SEP>Others refers to other people or entities, which are included in the expanded sense of self.", source_id:"chunk-075b8e71a3c71d11c785be4bbfe965ed<SEP>chunk-cd11c060af63780157ebf40717dc0fe2<SEP>chunk-c088c9de5db4ddb6d01a048401214aef<SEP>chunk-607beefb79fd1c2b867abf7979a1dbfc<SEP>chunk-c5b629deefcb32f62e58cbc3ee1d28ae<SEP>chunk-fb3062b3d6881522fcc2387d435da879", entity_id:"Others"}}, {_id:4616, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"constraint", truncate:"", description:"Constraints include outputting only corrected text without summaries, conversational filler, or style changes.", created_at:1779402380, source_id:"chunk-288b6f3cbc1fbe491495841582bf9281", entity_id:"Output Format Requirements"}}, {_id:4617, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"constraint", truncate:"", description:"Constraint to strictly avoid altering the original philosophical meaning during corrections.", created_at:1779402380, source_id:"chunk-288b6f3cbc1fbe491495841582bf9281", entity_id:"Original Meaning Retention"}}, {_id:4618, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mind-created suffering is analyzed as a construct tied to consciousness, with the text suggesting its illusory nature.<SEP>Suffering arising from mental constructs like habits, offense-taking, and negative self-perception.<SEP>Mind-Created Suffering involves emotional distress arising from mental constructs and habits.<SEP>Mind-Created Suffering refers to psychological distress stemming from mental constructs and patterns.", created_at:1779402903, source_id:"chunk-b85547a9c5ce2c1aff2a86073a2bcb87<SEP>chunk-1324fa0c36b3af6d5b8a9fbc0e3a438e<SEP>chunk-e2996dd72088a1d41ccb0a4f9d7e122e<SEP>chunk-81310581d9c3ed56ae9e89492e24dc8b", entity_id:"Mind-Created Suffering"}}, {_id:4619, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Rain droplets are characterized as \"rivulets of existence\" that nourish the earth, emphasizing their functional role in sustaining life.<SEP>Raindrops are metaphorically linked to \"rivulets of existence\" in the text.", created_at:1779402713, source_id:"chunk-cd11c060af63780157ebf40717dc0fe2<SEP>chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28", entity_id:"Rain Droplets"}}, {_id:4620, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The search for meaning is characterized as an existential quest exploring the significance of existence and human experiences.", created_at:1779402544, source_id:"chunk-cd11c060af63780157ebf40717dc0fe2", entity_id:"Search for Meaning"}}, {_id:4621, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Concepts related to societal constructs and material possessions, including marriage, employment, and financial wealth.", created_at:1779402569, source_id:"chunk-06a765717ff85133b42ac4f705cd51ca", entity_id:"Marriage, Job, Money"}}, {_id:4622, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Metaphorical description of life as superficial display without genuine substance, likened to a staged performance.", created_at:1779402569, source_id:"chunk-06a765717ff85133b42ac4f705cd51ca", entity_id:"True Man Show"}}, {_id:4623, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Discontent undermines perceived value in relationships, achievements, and glamour due to superficiality.", created_at:1779402569, source_id:"chunk-06a765717ff85133b42ac4f705cd51ca", entity_id:"Relationships, Achievements, Glamour"}}, {_id:4624, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video titled \"vjEsXpEtpH4\" hosted at URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4, containing a speech discussing discontent, spiritual quests, and depression.<SEP>YouTube video titled \"vjEsXpEtpH4\" hosted on YouTube with URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4, containing philosophical statements about consciousness.<SEP>A YouTube video titled \"vjEsXpEtpH4\" hosted at the provided URL, containing philosophical content about existence and meaning.<SEP>A YouTube video titled \"vjEsXpEtpH4\" that presents a list of options for handling text correction scenarios.", created_at:1779402945, source_id:"chunk-1324fa0c36b3af6d5b8a9fbc0e3a438e<SEP>chunk-0de1ccc44b624a092dc61e8f58c285d6<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b<SEP>chunk-aac1bdddfdcc88e00e0c6a72738f4426", entity_id:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4"}}, {_id:4625, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual Awakening is a transformative state of consciousness and process that transcends mind?created suffering, leading to lasting peace, self?realization, and the halting of cyclical patterns. It can emerge after healing from depression, resulting in a state of consciousness untouched by sorrow, and is described as a journey toward higher consciousness and liberation from mind?created suffering.

It is presented as a solution to conquer the mental infection of violence, emphasizing inner transformation, and as a conceptual framework where spiritual transformation and consciousness alignment are prerequisites for overcoming life's challenges and achieving harmony.

The state enables discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation, and the process involves discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization, fostering profound personal growth.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is described as the state enabling discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is the process of discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is described as the state enabling discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is the process of discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is described as the state enabling discovery of life's purpose and inner transformation.<SEP>Spiritual awakening is the process of discovering one's deeper life purpose through inner realization.", created_at:1779748439, source_id:"chunk-1324fa0c36b3af6d5b8a9fbc0e3a438e<SEP>chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0<SEP>chunk-e2996dd72088a1d41ccb0a4f9d7e122e<SEP>chunk-81310581d9c3ed56ae9e89492e24dc8b<SEP>chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292<SEP>chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e<SEP>chunk-e0a8c9ac09d21e5a96983fd54ff760fd<SEP>chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1<SEP>chunk-53568a329a637c479df4fbddda1889db<SEP>chunk-d367f5c73fdfd0a5ceb6c32909b9ff6a", entity_id:"Spiritual Awakening"}}, {_id:4626, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779665566, description:"A preparatory stage involving addressing depression through mental and physical healing to avoid falling into suffering.<SEP>Healing Process refers to addressing depression through brain and body healing as part of a transformative journey.<SEP>The healing process is initiated by the connection between heart fields and the presence of loving attention.<SEP>The healing process begins when heart consciousness fields connect, emphasizing emotional or spiritual restoration through presence and empathy.", source_id:"chunk-1324fa0c36b3af6d5b8a9fbc0e3a438e<SEP>chunk-81310581d9c3ed56ae9e89492e24dc8b<SEP>chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43<SEP>chunk-112f236855c8c9ac7864c1e2a1d43d1a", entity_id:"Healing Process"}}, {_id:4627, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Surge refers to an intense emotional or energetic state that concludes upon consciousness awakening.", created_at:1779402638, source_id:"chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0", entity_id:"Surge"}}, {_id:4629, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Consciousness awakening ends the surge and initiates living.", created_at:1779402666, source_id:"chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0", entity_id:"Consciousness Awakening"}}, {_id:4630, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Healing depression leads to spiritual awakening, preventing relapse into suffering.", created_at:1779402666, source_id:"chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0", entity_id:"Healing Depression"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:4631, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Single-stop journey directly results in higher states of consciousness.", created_at:1779402666, source_id:"chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0", entity_id:"Single-Stop Journey"}}, {_id:4632, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"A single stop journey, a journey to awakening into higher states of consciousness\" - a philosophical statement about self-discovery.", created_at:1779402690, source_id:"chunk-0de1ccc44b624a092dc61e8f58c285d6", entity_id:"Awakening into Higher States of Consciousness"}}, {_id:4633, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Editing process involving punctuation fixes (e.g., adding a question mark) and minor capitalization adjustments for readability in the text.<SEP>Text corrections include grammatical fixes like adding a comma after \"horizon\" and validating the term \"Ekam\" as conceptually accurate.", created_at:1779652329, source_id:"chunk-0de1ccc44b624a092dc61e8f58c285d6<SEP>chunk-463d3565b6195eb54c22ef1f1f467400", entity_id:"Text Corrections"}}, {_id:4634, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"When your consciousness truly wakes up, the surge ends, living begins\" - a philosophical statement about transitioning from internal struggle to life.", created_at:1779402690, source_id:"chunk-0de1ccc44b624a092dc61e8f58c285d6", entity_id:"Consciousness Awakening and Living"}}, {_id:4635, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrected philosophical question about distinguishing between depression and a deeper search for meaning, originally missing a question mark.", created_at:1779402690, source_id:"chunk-0de1ccc44b624a092dc61e8f58c285d6", entity_id:"How Do You Know If What You're Going Through Is Depression or a Deeper Search for Meaning?"}}, {_id:4636, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Series of imperative statements guiding self-reflection and decision-making.", created_at:1779402690, source_id:"chunk-0de1ccc44b624a092dc61e8f58c285d6", entity_id:"Pause, Know Your Answer, and Your Answer Will Show You the Way Forward"}}, {_id:4637, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4) serves as the source of the analyzed content.", created_at:1779402713, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28", entity_id:"YouTube Video (vjEsXpEtpH4)"}}, {_id:4638, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Critical examination of sentences for grammatical correctness, readability, and philosophical depth.", created_at:1779402713, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28", entity_id:"Sentence Analysis"}}, {_id:4639, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A punctuation error identified in the text analysis, specifically regarding sentence structure and punctuation placement.", created_at:1779402714, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28", entity_id:"Error 3"}}, {_id:4640, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Droplets of rain falling to the ground are described as rivulets of existence.<SEP>Raindrops metaphorically linked to existence and pure being in the philosophical discourse.", created_at:1779402795, source_id:"chunk-e94d81180e7457d6f36d99965cfbf34d<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b", entity_id:"Droplets Of Rain"}}, {_id:4641, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Someone Else's Face is the target of the smile, which brings a smile to this face.", created_at:1779402837, source_id:"chunk-6d3db9b5b3712ac82139a300382b6181", entity_id:"Someone Else's Face"}}, {_id:4642, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"ake, like a true man show is a YouTube video discussed in the text, characterized as \"all display and nothing real.\"", created_at:1779402856, source_id:"chunk-e2996dd72088a1d41ccb0a4f9d7e122e", entity_id:"ake, like a true man show"}}, {_id:4643, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Healing Brain and Body refers to addressing depression through physical and mental recovery.", created_at:1779402856, source_id:"chunk-e2996dd72088a1d41ccb0a4f9d7e122e", entity_id:"Healing Brain and Body"}}, {_id:4644, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Superficiality vs. Reality contrasts outward appearances with genuine truth, as implied by the video's title.", created_at:1779402857, source_id:"chunk-e2996dd72088a1d41ccb0a4f9d7e122e", entity_id:"Superficiality vs. Reality"}}, {_id:4645, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The video presents Option A as the most accurate response when no errors are found.", created_at:1779402945, source_id:"chunk-aac1bdddfdcc88e00e0c6a72738f4426", entity_id:"Option A"}}, {_id:4646, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The video presents Option B as an alternative approach involving re-reading the text.", created_at:1779402945, source_id:"chunk-aac1bdddfdcc88e00e0c6a72738f4426", entity_id:"Option B"}}, {_id:4647, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Option B contains a list of bullet points that serve as examples of philosophical questions.", created_at:1779402946, source_id:"chunk-aac1bdddfdcc88e00e0c6a72738f4426", entity_id:"bullet points"}}, {_id:4648, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A natural object symbolizing nourishment and sustenance.", created_at:1779402975, source_id:"chunk-a9f29aa70d2aed842238204adf8a81c5", entity_id:"Drop of Water"}}, {_id:4650, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"A smile can bring joy and positivity to someone else's face, creating a positive emotional impact.", created_at:1779402976, source_id:"chunk-a9f29aa70d2aed842238204adf8a81c5", entity_id:"someone else's face"}}, {_id:4652, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"God-Realization is an enlightened state of understanding divine unity and cosmic consciousness.<SEP>A transcendent state of union with the divine, achieved through liberation from worldly cycles.", created_at:1779404505, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-e0280d57f075227c7dc8487c44357147", entity_id:"God-Realization"}}] AS row
