UNWIND [{_id:4653, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Craig is a person associated with sharing ancient wisdom to promote global peace and participating in the Peace Festival.<SEP>Individual associated with the Peace Festival, practicing Dharma through sharing ancient wisdom.<SEP>Craig is a person mentioned in the video, associated with living his Dharma and kinship with the speaker.<SEP>Craig is a person with whom the speaker felt a great kinship and believed their conversation would have significance.", created_at:1779404435, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-e41aa29188359857d686593b398cb57d<SEP>chunk-e2e44adeb9e364c8a1e4597e2d7040b0<SEP>chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994", entity_id:"Craig"}}, {_id:4655, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>YouTube Video: uNkgwv4dqEs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNkgwv4dqEs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Peace Festival is a global event focused on fostering peace and unity through collective consciousness and scientific understanding.<SEP>Global event focused on promoting peace and consciousness, referenced in the context of a seventh-day celebration.<SEP>The Peace Festival is an event where the speaker is addressing the audience, mentioned as the seventh day.<SEP>The Peace Festival is an event where the speaker is honored to participate on its seventh day, described as auspicious.<SEP>Original incorrect phrase used in the TED talk transcript, later corrected to \"Limitless Field\".<SEP>An event or state associated with peace, mentioned in the original text and proposed corrections.<SEP>An event or state associated with peace, mentioned in the original text and proposed corrections.", created_at:1779453785, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-e41aa29188359857d686593b398cb57d<SEP>chunk-e2e44adeb9e364c8a1e4597e2d7040b0<SEP>chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994<SEP>chunk-f1f81e864da7b8ec0ed93a28a3397730<SEP>chunk-bf775281b0e0ffbc9e43851a7fa22924", entity_id:"Peace Festival"}}, {_id:4656, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779404505, description:"Human evolution is framed as a progression in consciousness rather than physical traits, enabling deeper creation and harmony.<SEP>Human evolution refers to the progression of consciousness and collective ability to manifest dreams into reality, transcending physical bodily evolution.<SEP>Refers to the advancement of human consciousness and physical aspects, encompassing both bodily strengthening and conscious creation.", source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-427a40a0dca2cdf8c20478622efb52a5<SEP>chunk-e0280d57f075227c7dc8487c44357147", entity_id:"Human Evolution"}}, {_id:4657, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Field refers to the universal energy or consciousness that underlies all existence, described as both the environment and the self.<SEP>Field is a collective consciousness or universal field that mirrors human emotions and thoughts.<SEP>The field is described as a field of energy and consciousness, encompassing all atoms and molecules in the universe.<SEP>The field is a universal concept with multiple names, representing interconnectedness and wisdom.", created_at:1779404435, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-a20fa03637522df32905bf3e04315780<SEP>chunk-3538d3a6dca3eeca95cabf452a553746<SEP>chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994", entity_id:"Field"}}, {_id:4658, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Global Family symbolizes a unified human collective working toward peace and shared aspirations.<SEP>The Global Family represents a collective human structure formed through shared intentions and dreams, influencing the Field with collective consciousness.<SEP>The global family represents a collective of people united by intention and dreams, influencing the field.<SEP>Global Family symbolizes a collective human entity formed through shared intentions and aspirations for peace and unity.", created_at:1779404473, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-427a40a0dca2cdf8c20478622efb52a5<SEP>chunk-3538d3a6dca3eeca95cabf452a553746<SEP>chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1", entity_id:"Global Family"}}, {_id:4661, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The River of Life embodies the continuous flow of existence, uniting all beings and elements.<SEP>The river of life is described as a unified, interconnected force representing the continuity and interconnectedness of all existence, transcending physical form.", created_at:1779404301, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-cd8e8c16e2620c27c2e75a44c149d1ff", entity_id:"River of Life"}}, {_id:4663, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video (AyUE-2Uh5Vg) is the source material containing text requiring correction.", created_at:1779403960, source_id:"chunk-8f6d92a7c7aad4ae25a70478b7e8c51d", entity_id:"YouTube Video (AyUE-2Uh5Vg)"}}, {_id:4664, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Global mental health crisis represents a significant challenge in the current global context.<SEP>Global mental health crisis is listed as one of the crises facing humanity, alongside economic, relationship, pandemic, and climate crises.", created_at:1779404191, source_id:"chunk-d9ec91f3989f17b7d88fc6a13cae7feb<SEP>chunk-a8b37aaaba467c66383f6b5970db43de", entity_id:"Global Mental Health Crisis"}}, {_id:4665, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Global economic crisis is one of the major issues discussed alongside other global crises.<SEP>Global economic crisis is cited as a major challenge impacting humanity, part of the \"significant times\" discussed.", created_at:1779404191, source_id:"chunk-d9ec91f3989f17b7d88fc6a13cae7feb<SEP>chunk-a8b37aaaba467c66383f6b5970db43de", entity_id:"Global Economic Crisis"}}, {_id:4666, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Global relationship crisis is mentioned as part of the global challenges.<SEP>Global relationship crisis is mentioned as a societal challenge contributing to humanity's struggles.", created_at:1779404191, source_id:"chunk-d9ec91f3989f17b7d88fc6a13cae7feb<SEP>chunk-a8b37aaaba467c66383f6b5970db43de", entity_id:"Global Relationship Crisis"}}, {_id:4667, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Global pandemic is listed as one of the crises affecting humanity.<SEP>Global pandemic is listed as a crisis affecting humanity, alongside other global challenges.", created_at:1779404191, source_id:"chunk-d9ec91f3989f17b7d88fc6a13cae7feb<SEP>chunk-a8b37aaaba467c66383f6b5970db43de", entity_id:"Global Pandemic"}}, {_id:4668, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Planetary climate crisis is specifically linked to Earth and its stability.<SEP>Planetary climate crisis is highlighted as a critical threat to Earth, humanity's only known home.", created_at:1779404191, source_id:"chunk-d9ec91f3989f17b7d88fc6a13cae7feb<SEP>chunk-a8b37aaaba467c66383f6b5970db43de", entity_id:"Planetary Climate Crisis"}}, {_id:4669, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Specific event within the Peace Festival, marked as auspicious and significant for spiritual practices.", created_at:1779404026, source_id:"chunk-e41aa29188359857d686593b398cb57d", entity_id:"Seventh Day of the Peace Festival"}}, {_id:4670, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The video serves as the primary medium for sharing teachings about peace and universal fields.", created_at:1779404050, source_id:"chunk-e41aa29188359857d686593b398cb57d<SEP>chunk-2208b834de2276647fea09e4bf25b2bd", entity_id:"content"}}, {_id:4672, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Field is a metaphysical concept described as the interconnected essence of all matter and consciousness, encompassing every atom in human bodies and the environment.", created_at:1779404068, source_id:"chunk-427a40a0dca2cdf8c20478622efb52a5", entity_id:"The Field"}}, {_id:4673, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Field aligns with peace and coherence, suggesting it responds positively to these states.", created_at:1779404100, source_id:"chunk-427a40a0dca2cdf8c20478622efb52a5", entity_id:"Peace/Coherence"}}, {_id:4674, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Field does not respond favorably to attempts at change driven by anger or chaos.", created_at:1779404101, source_id:"chunk-427a40a0dca2cdf8c20478622efb52a5", entity_id:"Chaos/Anger"}}, {_id:4675, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"URL link directing to the YouTube video containing the discussed content.", created_at:1779404167, source_id:"chunk-b737d792c2b87275c077f4a64c8f5999", entity_id:"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg"}}, {_id:4676, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779404473, description:"YouTube Video titled \"AyUE-2Uh5Vg\" hosted on YouTube, referenced as the source material for analysis.<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg is a spiritual content piece discussing consciousness and global crises, with no mention of \"Sri Preethaji\" or \"Deeksha\".<SEP>A YouTube video titled \"AyUE-2Uh5Vg\" hosted on YouTube, containing a discussion about punctuation and stylistic choices in a quoted text.<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg is the source containing the discussed content about consciousness and awakening.<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg is a digital content source discussing concepts of energy, consciousness, and human connection, with specific stylistic critiques on punctuation and structure.", source_id:"chunk-b737d792c2b87275c077f4a64c8f5999<SEP>chunk-a8b37aaaba467c66383f6b5970db43de<SEP>chunk-29779f717d41c769f251b6af1e672ed3<SEP>chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939<SEP>chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1", entity_id:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg"}}, {_id:4677, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>YouTube Video: qDSfb0