Evolution, as described in the text, is a concept representing progression in human consciousness and the ability to create. It is defined as both a recognized idea and a specific notion of advancing human awareness and creative capacity. The text emphasizes its role as a central theme, repeatedly highlighting its importance in exploring human potential and linking it to broader discussions about consciousness and creativity.", source_id:"chunk-3538d3a6dca3eeca95cabf452a553746<SEP>chunk-b08f45193924d9c9045e2c6dd99944d2", entity_id:"Evolution"}}, {_id:4680, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The field represents a metaphysical or universal system that mirrors human consciousness and emotions, influencing responses to change and coherence in existence.", created_at:1779404301, source_id:"chunk-cd8e8c16e2620c27c2e75a44c149d1ff", entity_id:"field"}}, {_id:4681, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Matter is contrasted with consciousness, framed as a traditional view of physical existence separate from the interconnectedness of life and the universe.", created_at:1779404301, source_id:"chunk-cd8e8c16e2620c27c2e75a44c149d1ff", entity_id:"matter"}}, {_id:4682, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Consciousness is equated with the river of life itself, emphasizing their inseparable and eternal nature.", created_at:1779404302, source_id:"chunk-cd8e8c16e2620c27c2e75a44c149d1ff", entity_id:"river of life"}}, {_id:4683, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Consciousness is described as inseparable from Mother Earth and all natural entities, reflecting universal oneness.", created_at:1779404303, source_id:"chunk-cd8e8c16e2620c27c2e75a44c149d1ff", entity_id:"mother earth"}}, {_id:4684, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A written excerpt discussing philosophical choices between destructive and constructive paths, with stylistic and punctuation-related critiques.", created_at:1779404350, source_id:"chunk-29779f717d41c769f251b6af1e672ed3", entity_id:"Quoted Text"}}, {_id:4685, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A grammatical construct involving verb forms (e.g., \"separation-driven\") analyzed for coherence in the quoted text.", created_at:1779404350, source_id:"chunk-29779f717d41c769f251b6af1e672ed3", entity_id:"Participial Phrase"}}, {_id:4686, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chaotic events are contrasted with peace, highlighting peace as a respite between them.", created_at:1779404383, source_id:"chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939", entity_id:"Chaotic Events in Life"}}, {_id:4687, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"These flames represent negative forces that peace aims to quench in oneself and the Earth.", created_at:1779404383, source_id:"chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939", entity_id:"Flames of Pain, Violence, Intolerance, and Exploitation"}}, {_id:4689, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The seventh day of the Peace Festival is considered auspicious and significant for the speaker's participation.", created_at:1779404435, source_id:"chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994", entity_id:"Seventh Day of Peace Festival"}}, {_id:4690, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Science is validating what was intuitively known about humanity's connection to a universal field.", created_at:1779404456, source_id:"chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994", entity_id:"Intuitive Knowledge"}}, {_id:4691, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dharma involves sharing ancient wisdom to create a more peaceful planet.", created_at:1779404456, source_id:"chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994", entity_id:"Sharing Wisdom"}}, {_id:4693, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WwgBOejW_pI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WwgBOejW_pI)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The lands and hills near AECOM were previously dry for many years but have since experienced greening and increased biodiversity.<SEP>The lands and hills near AECOM were dry for many years but have been revitalized with rains, greened vegetation, and increased wildlife activity following awakening processes.", created_at:1779404635, source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a<SEP>chunk-75ff5096ac3ca5ee13943606970189d6", entity_id:"Lands And Hills Near AECOM"}}, {_id:4694, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WwgBOejW_pI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WwgBOejW_pI)<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", created_at:1779652330, description:"Rains occurred as a result of Mother Earth's benevolence, wetting the earth and filling lakes.<SEP>Rains have wetted the earth, filled lakes, and contributed to ecological restoration in the hills near AECOM.<SEP>Rains are natural elements acknowledged in the gratitude practice for their role in food production.", source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a<SEP>chunk-75ff5096ac3ca5ee13943606970189d6<SEP>chunk-463d3565b6195eb54c22ef1f1f467400", entity_id:"Rains"}}, {_id:4695, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WwgBOejW_pI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WwgBOejW_pI)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Birds and animals returned to the hills in greater numbers following the environmental changes.<SEP>Birds and animals have returned to the hills near AECOM in greater numbers after the rains and greening of the area.", created_at:1779404635, source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a<SEP>chunk-75ff5096ac3ca5ee13943606970189d6", entity_id:"Birds And Animals"}}, {_id:4696, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The previously dry lands and hills near AECOM were transformed through ecological restoration efforts.", created_at:1779404589, source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a", entity_id:"Dry Lands And Hills"}}, {_id:4697, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WwgBOejW_pI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WwgBOejW_pI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Weather patterns near AECOM changed dramatically after the awakening processes, leading to rains and ecological renewal.<SEP>Weather patterns near AECOM have changed dramatically, with increased rainfall and ecological restoration following awakening processes.", created_at:1779404635, source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a<SEP>chunk-75ff5096ac3ca5ee13943606970189d6", entity_id:"Weather Patterns"}}, {_id:4698, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WwgBOejW_pI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WwgBOejW_pI)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"AECOM is an organization where profound awakening processes have been conducted, leading to observable environmental transformations.<SEP>AECOM is an organization where profound awakening processes have been conducted, leading to environmental changes in surrounding lands and hills.", created_at:1779404635, source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a<SEP>chunk-75ff5096ac3ca5ee13943606970189d6", entity_id:"AECOM"}}, {_id:4699, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The profound awakening processes at AECOM triggered dramatic changes in weather patterns and ecological restoration.", created_at:1779404589, source_id:"chunk-320aa2dc5a7e3281f4a1c7e49431004a", entity_id:"Profound Awakening Processes"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:4702, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WwgBOejW_pI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WwgBOejW_pI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Not to exploit means taking with deep respect and making loving efforts to replenish what has been taken, applying universally to interactions with the Earth and others.", created_at:1779404636, source_id:"chunk-75ff5096ac3ca5ee13943606970189d6", entity_id:"Not To Exploit"}}, {_id:4703, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Pills symbolize the use of medication to address psychological or emotional issues.<SEP>Pills are pharmaceutical interventions used to manage symptoms of anxiety or depression.", created_at:1779404828, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Pills"}}, {_id:4704, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Secure career choice represents a pursuit of stability and security in professional life.<SEP>Secure career choice refers to pursuing professional stability as a coping mechanism for anxiety or uncertainty.", created_at:1779404828, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Secure Career Choice"}}, {_id:4705, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Inner crisis refers to a state of emotional turmoil and conflict.<SEP>Inner crisis refers to a profound emotional or existential struggle, manifesting as anxiety and dissatisfaction.", created_at:1779404828, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Inner Crisis"}}, {_id:4706, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Secure relationship denotes a stable and fulfilling interpersonal connection.<SEP>Secure relationship denotes seeking relational stability to mitigate feelings of loneliness or anxiety.", created_at:1779404828, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Secure Relationship"}}, {_id:4709, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Habit of disappointment is a recurring pattern of negative emotional responses.<SEP>Habit of disappointment describes a recurring pattern of focusing on negative outcomes, reinforcing mental distress.", created_at:1779404829, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Habit of Disappointment"}}, {_id:4710, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Habit of loneliness is a persistent state of social isolation.<SEP>Habit of loneliness involves persistent feelings of social isolation, exacerbating emotional suffering.", created_at:1779404829, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Habit of Loneliness"}}, {_id:4711, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Habit of anxiety is a chronic condition of excessive worry.<SEP>Habit of anxiety refers to chronic worry patterns that sustain psychological discomfort.", created_at:1779404829, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Habit of Anxiety"}}, {_id:4712, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Prison of the mind symbolizes being trapped in negative thought patterns.<SEP>Prison of the mind symbolizes being trapped in destructive thought patterns and self-perception.", created_at:1779404829, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Prison of the Mind"}}, {_id:4713, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TXAKaPwrBy0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TXAKaPwrBy0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Illusory self refers to a false or constructed sense of identity.<SEP>Illusory self represents a false or rigid self-concept contributing to mental suffering.", created_at:1779404829, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c<SEP>chunk-11932b2b120faedad6d5f80f304ae4f8", entity_id:"Illusory Self"}}, {_id:4714, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The inner crisis prompts the search for change as a response to emotional turmoil.", created_at:1779404783, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c", entity_id:"Seeking Change"}}, {_id:4715, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Destructive tendencies in the mind cause suffering.", created_at:1779404783, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c", entity_id:"Destructive Tendencies in the Mind"}}, {_id:4716, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Future tendencies can cause suffering, requiring proactive management.", created_at:1779404784, source_id:"chunk-0b8200467f9ed7bc0b0109cef2c5f58c", entity_id:"Future Tendencies"}}, {_id:4721, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: q15gR1aGjVs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q15gR1aGjVs)<SEP>YouTube Video: Fbd7ln2i9dw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fbd7ln2i9dw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779665492, description:"Term used in the text to refer to a physical phenomenon, correctly spelled and capitalized.<SEP>The electromagnetic field at 7.83 Hertz is Earth's natural resonance, with human beings also emitting similar fields but currently misaligned due to emotional dissonance.<SEP>Electromagnetic field generated on March 7th, measured to assess its impact on humanity's consciousness.<SEP>The electromagnetic field of the heart expands when one opens up emotionally to their father, initiating a healing response.<SEP>The electromagnetic field of the heart is described as expanding during emotional connection, initiating a healing response.", source_id:"chunk-ec5fa768ea8835276739640bf2a6ee31<SEP>chunk-e1495814eef87b4611431212c4eeb855<SEP>chunk-a0222d44beace656ffcef9e704865afc<SEP>chunk-c93698531b3dac1e84db04c1babfa638<SEP>chunk-2356c92f9a3ba0c0acd302b505ca62a8", entity_id:"Electromagnetic Field"}}, {_id:4722, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: q15gR1aGjVs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q15gR1aGjVs)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779648715, description:"The creature is described as impacting humanity's consciousness, which is a destructive force.<SEP>Collective human consciousness targeted for transformation through the March 7th event and electromagnetic field measurements.<SEP>The shared awareness and perception of humanity towards existence and purpose.", source_id:"chunk-04d56d56ff3befc2a05ebcfab17f9d42<SEP>chunk-a0222d44beace656ffcef9e704865afc<SEP>chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Humanity's Consciousness"}}, {_id:4723, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: q15gR1aGjVs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q15gR1aGjVs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Natural cycles like seasons are described as currently disrupted (\"haywire\") due to humanity's dissonance with Earth's rhythms.", created_at:1779405654, source_id:"chunk-e1495814eef87b4611431212c4eeb855<SEP>chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f", entity_id:"Natural Cycles"}}, {_id:4724, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: q15gR1aGjVs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q15gR1aGjVs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Earth's heart refers to its electromagnetic resonance and living energy, central to the proposed synchronization with human consciousness.", created_at:1779405654, source_id:"chunk-e1495814eef87b4611431212c4eeb855", entity_id:"Earth's Heart"}}, {_id:4729, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The universe is characterized by consciousness, enabling communication across all entities.<SEP>A state of consciousness within the living universe, where communication is non-verbal and universal.", created_at:1779406353, source_id:"chunk-85ff6540f61eaa4adc3ec9e5f4057b70<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719", entity_id:"Conscious Universe"}}, {_id:4730, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The universe is described as living and conscious, with communication occurring between all life forms.<SEP>The living universe is described as a conscious universe where communication occurs among all life forms.<SEP>The living universe is a broader context where consciousness and divine power operate.<SEP>The living universe is a broader context where consciousness and divine power operate.", created_at:1779521854, source_id:"chunk-85ff6540f61eaa4adc3ec9e5f4057b70<SEP>chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719<SEP>chunk-57d13edf70fda1b7b5635305ebadfc8d", entity_id:"Living Universe"}}, {_id:4732, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 8p3zqYg5wuo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8p3zqYg5wuo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Actions and behaviors are another form of communication, but not the only way.", created_at:1779406354, source_id:"chunk-53a1844f9e75d5bbffcc37eefcf95719", entity_id:"Actions and Behaviors"}}] AS row
