939cf6c7cde138464e4bad5e7<SEP>chunk-4b883b28acf7bcbe78afff1c0303d457", entity_id:"Stress Posture"}}, {_id:4798, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGosHULQQk0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779728441, description:"Clearer thinking is a benefit of regular meditation practice.<SEP>Clearer thinking is a mental state fostered by meditation, enhancing cognitive clarity and decision-making.><SEP>Clearer thinking is facilitated by meditation through the influx of energies that reduce mental clutter.<SEP>Clearer thinking results from meditation's effect of flooding the brain with energies for improved mental clarity.<SEP>Clearer thinking is facilitated by meditation through the influx of energies that reduce mental clutter.<SEP>Clearer thinking results from meditation's effect of flooding the brain with energies for improved mental clarity.", source_id:"chunk-1140e04073ac9a83dfcd95f7292712fc<SEP>chunk-0adee7c41f1cb41998ac9e8e2dce0473<SEP>chunk-07cef1cacdb43780b9533bba3a4b7ad2<SEP>chunk-e5a191d0b4c345edce809b4d1989b5be", entity_id:"Clearer Thinking"}}, {_id:4799, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ever-present fullness is a state of being that meditation aims to manifest.", created_at:1779409147, source_id:"chunk-1140e04073ac9a83dfcd95f7292712fc", entity_id:"Ever-Present Fullness"}}] AS row
