 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6rLvPzNyLRw)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The mid-prefrontal cortex is a brain area linked to calmness and intelligent thought, which Serene Mind practice activates.<SEP>The mid-prefrontal cortex is a brain region linked to greater quiet and intelligence, activated through Serene Mind practice.", created_at:1779410733, source_id:"chunk-b0809abd12349c6eef286fd94bb50316<SEP>chunk-2e710eff3b612c7e94cc36d5f20b1111", entity_id:"Mid-Prefrontal Cortex"}}, {_id:4842, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 6rLvPzNyLRw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6rLvPzNyLRw)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Serene Mind meditation practice is a technique designed to break the habit of anxiety by shifting neurological activity in the brain.<SEP>Serene Mind meditation practice is a technique designed to break anxiety habits by shifting neurological activity from the amygdala to the mid-prefrontal cortex, promoting calmness and intelligence.", created_at:1779410733, source_id:"chunk-b0809abd12349c6eef286fd94bb50316<SEP>chunk-2e710eff3b612c7e94cc36d5f20b1111", entity_id:"Serene Mind Meditation Practice"}}, {_id:4843, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: qQmrTz6i2x4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Lunar energies are described as forces aligned with the moon's phases, influencing spiritual or physical alignment.<SEP>Lunar energies are abstract forces associated with the moon's phases, referenced as a key element in alignment and meditation practices.", created_at:1779411599, source_id:"chunk-724531516c99b2814a8e329894ee9bdf<SEP>chunk-faad39bb9ba8730957c6d719dd0fa2bc", entity_id:"Lunar Energies"}}, {_id:4844, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The moon's phases (e.g., new moon) are mentioned as increasing in size and correlating with the growth of 