ource_id:"chunk-83abb98046d1159250c7575ec257ce14", entity_id:"Transcendental Fortune"}}, {_id:5066, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sidi appears as a term connected to wealth creation and karma in the analyzed content.<SEP>Sidi is a dimension of the Oneness Abundance Festival focused on manifestation of wealth creation and obstacle removal.", created_at:1779433736, source_id:"chunk-83abb98046d1159250c7575ec257ce14<SEP>chunk-cee82b1a7026fdd1406998388ea35c61", entity_id:"Sidi"}}, {_id:5068, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Transcendental Destiny represents the ultimate outcome of consciousness development through Riddi.", created_at:1779433181, source_id:"chunk-83abb98046d1159250c7575ec257ce14", entity_id:"Transcendental Destiny"}}, {_id:5069, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Wealth Aspects are discussed as elements within the framework of wealth creation.", created_at:1779433181, source_id:"chunk-83abb98046d1159250c7575ec257ce14", entity_id:"Wealth Aspects"}}, {_id:5070, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 is the source of the analyzed content containing discussions about wealth-related concepts.", created_at:1779433182, source_id:"chunk-83abb98046d1159250c7575ec257ce14", entity_id:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4"}}, {_id:5071, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The YouTube video contains the discussed concepts about wealth and consciousness.", created_at:1779433182, 