haracter who undergoes a profound transformation, becoming a mother to two children and later a loving leader.<SEP>Her daughter is a character who undergoes a profound transformation, becoming a mother to two children and later a loving leader.", created_at:1779443199, source_id:"chunk-ac2f8cb722c994eb19c13fbd7a35cc4f", entity_id:"Her Daughter"}}, {_id:5199, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Two children who experienced a spiritual transformation at the Academy, now in their 60s, embodying joy and care.<SEP>Two children who experienced a spiritual transformation at the Academy, now in their 60s, embodying joy and care.", created_at:1779443199, source_id:"chunk-ac2f8cb722c994eb19c13fbd7a35cc4f", entity_id:"Two Children"}}, {_id:5200, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Space is described as filled with immense, powerful energy and is associated with five cosmic principles aimed at awakening human beings to abundance, peace, and enlightenment.", created_at:1779443236, source_id:"chunk-6c80a3ec5ccf0f1444fae5ef19b8f72a", entity_id:"The Space"}}, {_id:5201, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Power Head at Ease is a unique bird species capable of flying at extreme altitudes (59,000 feet/18,000 meters) and utilizing Golden Spiral energy during their Himalayan journeys.", created_at:1779443236, source_id:"chunk-6c80a3ec5ccf0f1444fae5ef19b8f72a", entity_id:"Power Head at Ease"}}, {_id:5202, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"not be further anymore\" should be corrected to \"no longer be\".", created_at:1779443252, source_id:"chunk-7dd063bc1cf412c37b440d1dc5ebcf9b", entity_id:"no longer be"}}, {_id:5203, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"not be further anymore\" should be corrected to \"no longer be\".", created_at:1779443253, source_id:"chunk-7dd063bc1cf412c37b440d1dc5ebcf9b", entity_id:"not be further anymore"}}, {_id:5204, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"we not only learn\" should be corrected to \"we only learn\" to convey the intended meaning.", created_at:1779443253, source_id:"chunk-7dd063bc1cf412c37b440d1dc5ebcf9b", entity_id:"we not only learn"}}, {_id:5205, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"we not only learn\" should be corrected to \"we only learn\" to convey the intended meaning.", created_at:1779443253, source_id:"chunk-7dd063bc1cf412c37b440d1dc5ebcf9b", entity_id:"we only learn"}}] AS row
