ll\" which should be capitalized.", created_at:1779444451, source_id:"chunk-8efd1503e6ba9f556d5b29e6aef648c7", entity_id:"twenty-eighth paragraph"}}, {_id:5249, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The thirtieth paragraph has the first word \"All\" which should be capitalized.", created_at:1779444451, source_id:"chunk-8efd1503e6ba9f556d5b29e6aef648c7", entity_id:"thirtieth paragraph"}}, {_id:5250, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The twenty-ninth paragraph has the first word \"What\" which should be capitalized.", created_at:1779444451, source_id:"chunk-8efd1503e6ba9f556d5b29e6aef648c7", entity_id:"twenty-ninth paragraph"}}, {_id:5251, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The twenty-seventh paragraph has the first word \"What\" which should be capitalized.", created_at:1779444451, source_id:"chunk-8efd1503e6ba9f556d5b29e6aef648c7", entity_id:"twenty-seventh paragraph"}}, {_id:5252, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HtmLQkxj8ec (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HtmLQkxj8ec)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The thirty-first paragraph has the first word \"What\" which should be capitalized.", created_at:1779444451, source_id:"chunk-8efd1503e6ba9f556d5b29e6aef648c7", entity_id:"thirty-first paragraph"}}] AS row
