Wars are defined as large-scale armed conflicts between nations or groups, often linked to global instability and prolonged destruction. These conflicts can originate from psychological factors such as a \"mental infection of violence\" within human psychology, and are frequently triggered by hate speech, social unrest, or exacerbated by division. Historical examples include the Mahabharata, World War One, and World War Two, which demonstrate their destabilizing, far", source_id:"chunk-e1d5e0073f33e1ee1857e1f6302d5b7f<SEP>chunk-60af06a20529afe356c9b2c29e286a87<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513<SEP>chunk-70484d1909cf7a831cc47f5cf33a0709<SEP>chunk-13f1c611f4cbca7ca30788a6d47f7e15<SEP>chunk-2fcfdd09e7882fdd48ac5703861252ac<SEP>chunk-e13b3b3dd6b43643b1596294c861a1aa<SEP>chunk-3aae932faaf9adc0f11927ad30f84d81", entity_id:"Wars"}}, {_id:5374, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"A sacred gathering of Ekam peace meditators focused on spiritual awakening, peace, and protecting children's innocence.", created_at:1779455794, source_id:"chunk-00b63395d5ef5274c1baeb0f4e99541f", entity_id:"Gathering of Ekam Peace Meditators"}}, {_id:5375, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"COVID is a threat that requires spiritual awakening and conquest.", created_at:1779455816, source_id:"chunk-00b63395d5ef5274c1baeb0f4e99541f", entity_id:"spiritual awakening"}}, {_id:5376, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM contains a message about childhood purity, inner solutions, and societal harmony.", created_at:1779455850, source_id:"chunk-a1a3adb6e659bbb8209f01781e8bec78", entity_id:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM"}}, {_id:5377, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Purity of soul is emphasized as a key aspect of childhood and inner solutions.", created_at:1779455850, source_id:"chunk-a1a3adb6e659bbb8209f01781e8bec78", entity_id:"Purity of soul"}}, {_id:5378, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Purity of heart is highlighted as part of childhood's essence and problem-solving.", created_at:1779455850, source_id:"chunk-a1a3adb6e659bbb8209f01781e8bec78", entity_id:"Purity of heart"}}, {_id:5379, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of making an unknown child smile is presented as an actionable step towards applying inner solutions.", created_at:1779455850, source_id:"chunk-a1a3adb6e659bbb8209f01781e8bec78", entity_id:"Unknown child"}}, {_id:5381, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A list confirming the correct form of the name as 'Sri Krishnaji', used to resolve transcription errors in the text.<SEP>A list confirming the correct form of the name as 'Sri Krishnaji', used to resolve transcription errors in the text.", created_at:1779510704, source_id:"chunk-1a11817d73802fdf08093631bc2f4cf0", entity_id:"List"}}, {_id:5382, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"Limitless Field\" in the text requires capitalization for proper terminology alignment.", created_at:1779510748, source_id:"chunk-bfcad8a2e2d4df5f6523bcfa541887ac", entity_id:"Limitless Field (capitalized)"}}, {_id:5383, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"Limitless Field\" in the text requires capitalization for proper terminology alignment.", created_at:1779510748, source_id:"chunk-bfcad8a2e2d4df5f6523bcfa541887ac", entity_id:"Limitless Field (lowercase)"}}, {_id:5384, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: RGFI6v2Biq0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGFI6v2Biq0)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Car headlights are used as an analogy to illustrate how awareness illuminates potential future challenges, preventing metaphorical \"accidents\" in life.<SEP>Car headlights are used as a metaphor for awareness, illuminating the path ahead.", created_at:1779510899, source_id:"chunk-c2f772787ab946a352d0af09f5686d4b<SEP>chunk-edcb79b79435bcba9facfbb3e2e5ae09", entity_id:"Car Headlights"}}, {_id:5385, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: RGFI6v2Biq0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGFI6v2Biq0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mind content refers to emotions and thoughts (positive or negative) that awareness observes without engagement or resistance, enabling transformative outcomes.", created_at:1779510881, source_id:"chunk-c2f772787ab946a352d0af09f5686d4b", entity_id:"Mind Content"}}, {_id:5386, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: RGFI6v2Biq0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGFI6v2Biq0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unquiet mind is characterized by sentimentality, self-importance, and negative emotions.<SEP>Unquiet mind represents a state driven by fear, aggression, self-importance, and superficiality, contrasting with quiet mind.", created_at:1779510902, source_id:"chunk-edcb79b79435bcba9facfbb3e2e5ae09<SEP>chunk-222632c14fa6c017ed35de349b2ef6bb", entity_id:"Unquiet Mind"}}, {_id:5387, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: RGFI6v2Biq0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGFI6v2Biq0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Quiet mind is associated with total presence, cooperation, and harmony.<SEP>Quiet mind refers to a state of total presence and calmness, characterized by cooperation, harmony, and spiritual flow.", created_at:1779510902, source_id:"chunk-edcb79b79435bcba9facfbb3e2e5ae09<SEP>chunk-222632c14fa6c017ed35de349b2ef6bb", entity_id:"Quiet Mind"}}, {_id:5389, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: RGFI6v2Biq0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RGFI6v2Biq0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-importance is a trait tied to the unquiet mind, reflecting superficial desires for recognition.", created_at:1779510902, source_id:"chunk-222632c14fa6c017ed35de349b2ef6bb", entity_id:"Self-Importance"}}, {_id:5393, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: leypd9opVSc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=leypd9opVSc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An awakened child is one whose brain and nervous system are attuned to peace, with a heart that naturally feels connection and love, and a consciousness that experiences a deep sense of oneness.", created_at:1779511044, source_id:"chunk-d2e81452016e5b21657383d1ac296a64", entity_id:"Awakened Child"}}, {_id:5394, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: leypd9opVSc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=leypd9opVSc)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"An intuitive process that creates expanded awareness in parents, facilitating the birthing of awakened children through connection to mystical planes.", created_at:1779511044, source_id:"chunk-d2e81452016e5b21657383d1ac296a64", entity_id:"Intuitive Process"}}, {_id:5395, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: leypd9opVSc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=leypd9opVSc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The mystical and spiritual events unfolding during conception and pregnancy, influencing the development of the child.<SEP>Divine Drama refers to the spiritual journey and experiences during conception and pregnancy described in the video.", created_at:1779511063, source_id:"chunk-d2e81452016e5b21657383d1ac296a64<SEP>chunk-255bf350d451faa2df8677aa580dc07b", entity_id:"Divine Drama"}}, {_id:5396, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: leypd9opVSc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=leypd9opVSc)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"leypd9opVSc is a YouTube video discussing spiritual experiences during conception and pregnancy, including meditations for parents.", created_at:1779511063, source_id:"chunk-255bf350d451faa2df8677aa580dc07b", entity_id:"leypd9opVSc"}}] AS row
