World Consciousness is a concept representing the collective awakening of humanity to unity and wisdom, characterized by an awareness of interconnectedness among individuals and societies. It emphasizes shared purpose, global unity, and deeper understanding, fostering a transformative process toward harmonious and cooperative ways of living beyond narrow identities. This state of consciousness is explored in philosophical, spiritual", source_id:"chunk-57c07a0512777570587c500dccd8311d<SEP>chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a<SEP>chunk-1ae790eba9b81ee033f955299e2cd86b", entity_id:"World Consciousness"}}, {_id:5446, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The Field of Awakening is a four-day spiritual journey originating from Akam in India, designed to facilitate enlightenment through awakened consciousness and divine energy.", created_at:1779513962, source_id:"chunk-3fe7a56df750b7915fb511efbfa521f5", entity_id:"The Field of Awakening"}}, {_id:5447, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: fYLwmDCmJ0A (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fYLwmDCmJ0A)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Akam in India is the origin of the Field of Awakening spiritual journey.<SEP>Akam in India is the source of the Field of Awakening spiritual journey.", created_at:1779514095, source_id:"chunk-3fe7a56df750b7915fb511efbfa521f5<SEP>chunk-35f97cf3e7167f24e54a2b6e00ad3438", entity_id:"Akam in India"}}, {_id:5448, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"dreaming is one of the three recognized states of human consciousness, involving subconscious activity and imaginative experiences.", created_at:1779513962, source_id:"chunk-3fe7a56df750b7915fb511efbfa521f5", entity_id:"dreaming"}}, {_id:5449, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"waking is one of the three recognized states of human consciousness, representing aler