We need to ensure we mention the full", created_at:1779518928, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-d569a681db9c59e370dae6637f3dbf55<SEP>chunk-6988c802643ab5986cfc41940a6f6b44<SEP>chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290<SEP>chunk-b10ebf50b04723581984202297711043<SEP>chunk-d934a78e12e582c4cd7a16fc71609ccd", entity_id:"One Consciousness Business Circle"}}, {_id:5477, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"anxiety", truncate:"", description:"Represents the limited mind, driven by anxiety and comparison.<SEP>The small bird embodies a chattering mind driven by anxiety and comparison, perpetually oscillating between past/future.\" But according to the instructions, relationships should be between two entities. The original output here has the source as Small Bird and target as \"anxiety, comparison,\" which are keywords, not entities. That's incorrect. The relationship should be between two entities, not between an entity and attributes. This is a formatting error.<SEP>...\" should instead be a relationship between Small Bird and another entity, or the attributes should be part of the entity's description, not a relationship.<SEP>...\" is invalid because \"anxiety, comparison\" are not entities. Similarly for the Big Bird relation.<SEP>The small bird symbolizes the limited mind characterized by anxiety, comparison", created_at:1779518203, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-d569a681db9c59e370dae6637f3dbf55", entity_id:"Small Bird"}}, {_id:5478, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Symbolizes unperturbed consciousness, characterized by calmness and present-moment awareness.<SEP>The big bird represents the power of consciousness, embodying calmness, present-moment awareness, and alignment with universal intelligence.", created_at:1779518203, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-d569a681db9c59e370dae6637f3dbf55", entity_id:"Big Bird"}}, {_id:5479, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An entrepreneur with immense energy and balance, dissolving the divide between matter and consciousness.<SEP>Dynamic Entrepreneur represents a state of awakened consciousness characterized by silent power and harmonious balance with the world.<SEP>Dynamic Entrepreneur represents a state of awakened consciousness characterized by silent power and harmonious balance with the world.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Dynamic Entrepreneur"}}, {_id:5480, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An entrepreneur free from fear, living with effortless ease and creating wealth without fear.<SEP>A state of being unbound by social conditioning or worldly dictates, achieving impact through absorption in life's purpose with effortless ease.", created_at:1779518230, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731", entity_id:"Fearless Entrepreneur"}}, {_id:5481, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An entrepreneur realizing being the One, impacting global business consciousness.<SEP>An enlightened entrepreneur operates from a state of unity with life, transforming global business consciousness by influencing wealth generation, circulation, and utilization.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-b10ebf50b04723581984202297711043", entity_id:"Enlightened Entrepreneur"}}, {_id:5482, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spontaneous events occurring due to awakened consciousness, speeding up life's journey.<SEP>Synchronicities and magical incidents are spontaneous, meaningful events that accelerate personal growth when aligned with heightened consciousness.", created_at:1779518232, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-6988c802643ab5986cfc41940a6f6b44", entity_id:"Synchronicities and Magical Incidents"}}, {_id:5483, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"An internationally known expert in nutritional and metabolic medicine.<SEP>Dr. Ron Rosedale is an internationally recognized expert in nutritional and metabolic medicine known for revolutionary insights linking disease to improper cellular communication.", created_at:1779518232, source_id:"chunk-99901f0ad74048b182a8c4faaaf9f4dd<SEP>chunk-6988c802643ab5986cfc41940a6f6b44", entity_id:"Dr. Ron Rosedale"}}, {_id:5484, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Buddha-driven life refers to a state of being aligned with enlightened principles and infinite intelligence, emerging from awakened consciousness.<SEP>Buddha-driven life signifies attaining a powerful state of consciousness while fostering great prosperity, well-being, and harmony with humanity and the planet.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-d569a681db9c59e370dae6637f3dbf55<SEP>chunk-b10ebf50b04723581984202297711043", entity_id:"Buddha-Driven Life"}}, {_id:5485, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"External influences dictating behavior, which a fearless entrepreneur transcends.", created_at:1779518230, source_id:"chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731", entity_id:"Social Conditioning"}}, {_id:5486, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The core driving force enabling fearlessness and freedom from fear through awakened alignment.", created_at:1779518230, source_id:"chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731", entity_id:"Life's Purpose"}}, {_id:5489, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sconnection is a disease of consciousness manifesting as disconnection from thoughts, family, loved ones, teams, community, and the world, likened to cancerous cells declaring independence from the body.", created_at:1779518230, source_id:"chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731", entity_id:"Sconnection"}}, {_id:5491, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Courageous exploits are actions driven by bravery, explicitly rejected as a source of freedom from fear in the text.", created_at:1779518231, source_id:"chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731", entity_id:"Courageous Exploits"}}, {_id:5492, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Freedom arises from awakening to life's true purpose, not through formations or courage.<SEP>Freedom from Fear refers to a state of living without fear of failure, judgment, or irrelevance, enabling fearless living.<SEP>Freedom from Fear refers to a state of living without fear of failure, judgment, or irrelevance, enabling fearless living.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731<SEP>chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Freedom from Fear"}}, {_id:5494, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"field", truncate:"", description:"Medical science provides principles for understanding bodily health, including Dr. Rosedale's insights on cellular communication and disease origins.", created_at:1779518232, source_id:"chunk-6988c802643ab5986cfc41940a6f6b44", entity_id:"Medical Science"}}, {_id:5496, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"This consciousness dissolves challenges and creates success/abundance through awakened connection.", created_at:1779518233, source_id:"chunk-8b7b22cfd463021890139fccede91731", entity_id:"Heart-Centered Consciousness"}}, {_id:5497, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"WOKBogNTmPI is a YouTube video discussing consciousness, fearlessness, and entrepreneurial transformation.<SEP>WOKBogNTmPI is a YouTube video discussing consciousness, fearlessness, and entrepreneurial transformation.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"WOKBogNTmPI"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5498, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Prana-Filled Life describes a life filled with vital energy and consciousness, likened to a play where life unfolds effortlessly.<SEP>Prana-Filled Life describes a life filled with vital energy and consciousness, likened to a play where life unfolds effortlessly.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Prana-Filled Life"}}, {_id:5499, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Timelessness is a state of awareness where attention is fully present, nurturing all relationships and life aspects.<SEP>Timelessness is a state of awareness where attention is fully present, nurturing all relationships and life aspects.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Timelessness"}}, {_id:5500, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The massive water analogy symbolizes silent potential energy within apparent calmness, representing dynamic consciousness.<SEP>The massive water analogy symbolizes silent potential energy within apparent calmness, representing dynamic consciousness.", created_at:1779518258, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Massive Water Analogy"}}, {_id:5501, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The transcendental nature of consciousness involves unlocking higher states of awareness beyond ordinary perception.<SEP>The transcendental nature of consciousness refers to a state where the divide between matter and consciousness dissolves, enabling effortless manifestation of intentions and harmony with life.<SEP>The transcendental nature of consciousness involves unlocking higher states of awareness beyond ordinary perception.", created_at:1779518259, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290<SEP>chunk-b10ebf50b04723581984202297711043", entity_id:"Transcendental Nature of Consciousness"}}, {_id:5502, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Life's True Purpose refers to the core reason for existence and living with effortless ease, as discussed in the video.<SEP>Life's True Purpose refers to the core reason for existence and living with effortless ease, as discussed in the video.", created_at:1779518259, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Life's True Purpose"}}, {_id:5503, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WOKBogNTmPI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WOKBogNTmPI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The analogy illustrates the dynamic power of awakened consciousness as silent yet immense energy.", created_at:1779518255, source_id:"chunk-79db2134238652230b07da08d8f6f290", entity_id:"Dynamic Power"}}, {_id:5506, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"OCLC (One Consciousness Leader Circle) offers teachings and programs aimed at awakening individuals to One Consciousness and fostering transformational leadership.<SEP>An organization with a mission that drew the speaker in due to its potential for global impact.", created_at:1779518283, source_id:"chunk-d078b842a118a3665da45a82508e955c<SEP>chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a", entity_id:"OCLC"}}, {_id:5507, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"One Consciousness Leader Circle is an organization focused on transforming leaders into awakened states of consciousness to create global impact through connection and oneness.<SEP>An initiative to select and train 1,000 leaders to awaken them to One Consciousness and enhance their leadership abilities.", created_at:1779518283, source_id:"chunk-d078b842a118a3665da45a82508e955c<SEP>chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a", entity_id:"One Consciousness Leader Circle"}}, {_id:5508, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Leader Circle is an event or program under the One Consciousness Leader Circle focused on mentoring leaders to operate from a connected, awakened state.<SEP>Leader Circle is an organization focused on transforming leaders to foster global connection, oneness, and positive impact.", created_at:1779518332, source_id:"chunk-d078b842a118a3665da45a82508e955c<SEP>chunk-62d9c2c61a7070c1d594767ed9814cde", entity_id:"Leader Circle"}}, {_id:5510, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"A category of practices the speaker has engaged in for twenty years to develop personal growth.", created_at:1779518282, source_id:"chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a", entity_id:"Self-help"}}, {_id:5511, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A unique teaching developed to help individuals overcome suffering and achieve freedom.", created_at:1779518282, source_id:"chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a", entity_id:"Pre-30"}}, {_id:5512, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A state of interconnected awareness where individuals generate collective power to fulfill their purposes.", created_at:1779518302, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28", entity_id:"Connected Space"}}, {_id:5513, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Self-help programs the narrator engaged in for twenty years before discovering transformational teachings.", created_at:1779518302, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28", entity_id:"Self-Help Programs"}}, {_id:5514, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Learned principles from OCLC programs that contribute to the narrator's consistent and ever-present sense of love.<SEP>Principles are applied in situations involving moral or ethical conflicts.", created_at:1779655488, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28<SEP>chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1", entity_id:"Principles"}}, {_id:5515, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A unique teaching method developed by the narrator to help people transition from suffering to freedom through connected consciousness.", created_at:1779518302, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28", entity_id:"Transformational Teaching"}}, {_id:5516, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"OCLC Level One is a self-help program that facilitated profound personal transformation in the narrator's wife and later the narrator.", created_at:1779518302, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28", entity_id:"OCLC Level One"}}, {_id:5517, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"OCLC Level Two is an advanced self-help program attended by the narrator to deepen their transformational experience.", created_at:1779518302, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28", entity_id:"OCLC Level Two"}}, {_id:5518, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The wife is a person who underwent transformation through OCLC Level One, inspiring the narrator to pursue the same.<SEP>Wife is the spouse of the CEO, who questioned the CEO's decision-making state and encouraged reflection.<SEP>CEO's spouse who questions his decisions, prompting reflection on family and employee impacts.<SEP>Wife is a role context where comparison can occur due to perceived inadequacies in domestic or relational performance.", created_at:1779652795, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28<SEP>chunk-6c59f41034b90b3918c1775bcca9c910<SEP>chunk-5424541c24943ffc408f99bb3aa45c96<SEP>chunk-e27a47feac82bbd6f6606fd0582e97d1", entity_id:"Wife"}}, {_id:5519, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The collective power generated in a connected space to fulfill individual and shared goals.", created_at:1779518302, source_id:"chunk-338cfb2aa25fb2dee64396603e703b28", entity_id:"Power Generation"}}, {_id:5520, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The speaker has twenty years of self-help experience.", created_at:1779518309, source_id:"chunk-f66651ee848911049e03ee6f58135f0a", entity_id:"Speaker's experience"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5521, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"One Consciousness leaders are presented as a group to which the speaker is mentoring others, indicating a state of unified consciousness.", created_at:1779518322, source_id:"chunk-b5f9e6d225f813417e820a0efdde6d48", entity_id:"One Consciousness leaders"}}, {_id:5522, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Krishna ji is described as an incredible human being who lives his teachings and is associated with the term \"One Consciousness leaders.\"", created_at:1779518322, source_id:"chunk-b5f9e6d225f813417e820a0efdde6d48", entity_id:"Krishna ji"}}, {_id:5523, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A feeling of joy and enthusiasm that is part of the message's content, aimed at inspiring positive change and connection.", created_at:1779518341, source_id:"chunk-7ca551e43031a753f46fc5d256a3cf82", entity_id:"Joy in their heart"}}, {_id:5524, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Leader Circle aims to shift leaders from division to oneness, enabling them to create a more connected world.", created_at:1779518351, source_id:"chunk-62d9c2c61a7070c1d594767ed9814cde", entity_id:"global connection"}}, {_id:5525, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YguId6pF5KI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YguId6pF5KI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Krishna Ji provides clear, structured teachings that emphasize simplicity and transformative awakened experiences.", created_at:1779518351, source_id:"chunk-62d9c2c61a7070c1d594767ed9814cde", entity_id:"teachings and guidance"}}, {_id:5526, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: c2oUDKf6ndo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2oUDKf6ndo)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Akin is a platform or initiative designed to connect and uplift human consciousness through global meditation and conscious awakening.<SEP>Akin is a tool or platform built to connect and uplift human consciousness globally.", created_at:1779518382, source_id:"chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a<SEP>chunk-1ae790eba9b81ee033f955299e2cd86b", entity_id:"Akin"}}, {_id:5527, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: c2oUDKf6ndo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2oUDKf6ndo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Violence towards women encompasses harmful attitudes and actions directed at women, which must be dissolved to achieve global peace.<SEP>Violence towards women is a barrier to achieving world peace and must be dissolved.<SEP>Violence towards women encompasses physical, social, and economic abuse historically perpetuated globally.<SEP>Violence towards women encompasses physical, social, and economic abuse historically perpetuated globally.", created_at:1779701120, source_id:"chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a<SEP>chunk-1ae790eba9b81ee033f955299e2cd86b<SEP>chunk-4728462b4c7e2d372f2b1e40f07184a9", entity_id:"Violence Towards Women"}}, {_id:5529, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Meditating is a practice conducted collectively to focus attention on the 10 most important things and uplift human consciousness.<SEP>Meditating is depicted as an activity where full immersion is frequently absent.<SEP>Meditating is depicted as an activity where full immersion is frequently absent.", created_at:1779676179, source_id:"chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a<SEP>chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f", entity_id:"Meditating"}}, {_id:5530, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The 10 most important things represent the critical global priorities addressed through meditation and conscious awakening, as emphasized in the text.", created_at:1779518372, source_id:"chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a", entity_id:"10 Most Important Things"}}, {_id:5531, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: c2oUDKf6ndo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c2oUDKf6ndo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Recognizing women with total dignity and spiritual power impacts world consciousness.", created_at:1779518382, source_id:"chunk-1ae790eba9b81ee033f955299e2cd86b<SEP>chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a", entity_id:"Seeing Women with Dignity"}}, {_id:5532, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dissolving violence towards women contributes to achieving world peace by addressing a critical source of global conflict.", created_at:1779518428, source_id:"chunk-8371bf8d7e493ffa27d258dec87d349a", entity_id:"Dissolving Violence Towards Women"}}, {_id:5533, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qbJB6ie9Y)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", created_at:1779518924, description:"O&O is a transformative program and organization offering spiritual teachings, peak performance training, and self-discovery experiences to high-achievers.<SEP>O&O is a transformative program and organization offering spiritual teachings, peak performance training, and self-discovery experiences to high-achievers.<SEP>O&O is a transformative program focused on peak performance, high-performance business, entrepreneurship, personal development, and spirituality.<SEP>O&O is a retreat or program offering transformative experiences for high performers to integrate personal and professional growth through consciousness and leadership development.", source_id:"chunk-d934a78e12e582c4cd7a16fc71609ccd<SEP>chunk-97cc62cd33395d4327ecfafbda5320fa<SEP>chunk-07d99cca71c6ec1bd01be96cb1ca22ec", entity_id:"O&O"}}, {_id:5534, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qbJB6ie9Y)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The One Consciousness Business Circle is a program designed to foster wealth creators operating from an enlightened state of consciousness, emphasizing the fusion of truth for a meaningful life.", created_at:1779518901, source_id:"chunk-97cc62cd33395d4327ecfafbda5320fa", entity_id:"The One Consciousness Business Circle"}}, {_id:5535, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qbJB6ie9Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Target Audience includes business owners, entrepreneurs, investors, business executives, and high performers in various fields seeking to elevate personal and professional life.", created_at:1779518901, source_id:"chunk-97cc62cd33395d4327ecfafbda5320fa", entity_id:"Target Audience"}}, {_id:5536, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qbJB6ie9Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-Knowledge refers to understanding one's true self and living in alignment with personal truth, as emphasized in the program.", created_at:1779518901, source_id:"chunk-97cc62cd33395d4327ecfafbda5320fa", entity_id:"Self-Knowledge"}}, {_id:5537, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qbJB6ie9Y)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"O&O focuses on peak performance and related disciplines to drive transformative personal and professional experiences.", created_at:1779518902, source_id:"chunk-97cc62cd33395d4327ecfafbda5320fa", entity_id:"Peak Performance"}}, {_id:5538, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: w2qbJB6ie9Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w2qbJB6ie9Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Focuses on awakening fearless consciousness and self-transcendence through spiritual growth.", created_at:1779518972, source_id:"chunk-c5e7d3c06c118f2330521cd61c1462d6", entity_id:"Journey of Transcending the Self"}}, {_id:5539, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nQpRoOOu5Yc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQpRoOOu5Yc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Astitva is a state of being, pregnant with the power of the divine, characterized by equanimity.<SEP>Astitva represents a spiritually awakened state of being, characterized by equanimity in life's dualities and acceptance of cyclical existence.", created_at:1779519051, source_id:"chunk-6af3220a340f626ce621832ca3542da1<SEP>chunk-f34e8e10dbf92b5936295383ee0c7f10", entity_id:"Astitva"}}, {_id:5540, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nQpRoOOu5Yc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQpRoOOu5Yc)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779675424, description:"Maya is the power that binds and liberates, representing the illusion of the material world.<SEP>Maya is a concept in Hinduism representing illusion or delusion, mentioned in the context of liberation from bondage.<SEP>Maya refers to the illusion of separation or material reality, which spiritual seekers aim to transcend.", source_id:"chunk-6af3220a340f626ce621832ca3542da1<SEP>chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87<SEP>chunk-d333235fcabc3883b17563e023b36fd9<SEP>chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Maya"}}, {_id:5541, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nQpRoOOu5Yc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQpRoOOu5Yc)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Gudi Padwa is another name for the Ugadi festival, marking the start of the Chaitra lunar month and inner transformation.", created_at:1779519051, source_id:"chunk-f34e8e10dbf92b5936295383ee0c7f10", entity_id:"Gudi Padwa"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5542, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nQpRoOOu5Yc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQpRoOOu5Yc)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Ugadi Pachadi, also known as Bevu Bella, is a traditional dish consumed during Ugadi in South India, symbolizing the six tastes of life through its bitter, sweet, sour, spicy, bland, and astringent flavors.", created_at:1779519080, source_id:"chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87", entity_id:"Ugadi Pachadi (Bevu Bella)"}}, {_id:5543, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nQpRoOOu5Yc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nQpRoOOu5Yc)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"South India is a region in India where the Ugadi festival is celebrated, and Ugadi Pachadi is traditionally prepared.", created_at:1779519080, source_id:"chunk-6a05be89bdb9093be2522608eb8c0a87", entity_id:"South India"}}, {_id:5544, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hinduism is one of the world's oldest religions, characterized by timeless spiritual messages communicated through symbols and rituals rather than lengthy explanations.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Hinduism is a religion mentioned in the context of protecting Mother Earth and its connection to nature.<SEP>Hinduism is a religion with deities like Ganesha, who embodies the fusion of nature and life, promoting environmental reverence.<SEP>Hinduism is a religion with deities like Ganesha, who embodies the fusion of nature and life, promoting environmental reverence.<SEP>Hinduism is a religion with deities like Ganesha, who embodies the fusion of nature and life, promoting environmental reverence.<SEP>Hinduism is a major world religion with deities like Shiva and Shakti, centered on spiritual concepts and practices.", created_at:1779553578, source_id:"chunk-5989534d0189dcec707f34732672dbfe<SEP>chunk-b853208a5b22b10c406741d9e385f987<SEP>chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557<SEP>chunk-c09aade9dbfd355fb478c083ce9dcbcd<SEP>chunk-3e6f8e85a056a83c6e414cc14c74ff99", entity_id:"Hinduism"}}, {_id:5545, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Durga embodies the Mother Goddess as the vanquisher of demons, representing the dissolution of ignorance and negative states during Navratri.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Durga is a deity associated with the first three days of Navratri, symbolizing the destruction of demons and dissolution of anger-related states.", created_at:1779519149, source_id:"chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-49d819fbab36af31ec15419ab94d1279", entity_id:"Durga"}}, {_id:5546, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Dussehra, also called Navratri, signifies the victory of good over evil, linked to the dissolution of darkness (tamas) and the awakening of divine consciousness.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Dussehra is the event celebrated as Navratri, meaning nine nights.", created_at:1779519141, source_id:"chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-adf8cda164a53953c2d871599de03c16", entity_id:"Dussehra"}}, {_id:5547, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: RBb_3sgOgFY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RBb_3sgOgFY)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Asura symbolizes the awakened, ignorant, separate self within individuals, representing darkness and ego to be transcended.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Asura represents a class of power-hungry demons in Hindu mythology.", created_at:1779651553, source_id:"chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-d4970d6b99dd25f2175abb5b84e2f52c", entity_id:"Asura"}}, {_id:5548, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Maha Vishnu is a deity in Hinduism associated with cosmic preservation and the Yoga Maya (illusion) that Durga awakens during Navratri.`<SEP>...` -> Correct.<SEP>Maha Vishnu is associated with Yoga Maya, who is awakened by Durga.", created_at:1779519141, source_id:"chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897<SEP>chunk-adf8cda164a53953c2d871599de03c16", entity_id:"Maha Vishnu"}}, {_id:5550, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Navratri's rituals symbolize the dissolution of tamas (darkness) through meditative awareness and spiritual awakening.`", created_at:1779519117, source_id:"chunk-672a64891a721958057240b2cc83a897", entity_id:"tamas"}}, {_id:5552, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Greed is a core suffering state dissolved through spiritual processes during Navratri.<SEP>Greed is described as a dominant force in modern civilization, prioritizing financial gain over skill development or learning.", created_at:1779554064, source_id:"chunk-49d819fbab36af31ec15419ab94d1279<SEP>chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74", entity_id:"Greed"}}, {_id:5555, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The first three days of Navratri focus on Goddess Durga's victory over demons and dissolution of anger-related states.", created_at:1779519150, source_id:"chunk-49d819fbab36af31ec15419ab94d1279", entity_id:"First Three Days of Navratri"}}, {_id:5556, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The fourth to sixth days of Navratri are dedicated to Goddess Mahalakshmi, emphasizing abundance and prosperity.", created_at:1779519150, source_id:"chunk-49d819fbab36af31ec15419ab94d1279", entity_id:"Fourth to Sixth Days of Navratri"}}, {_id:5559, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: WfkCDNu4SuE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WfkCDNu4SuE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The downward collapse of destinies into a disastrous fate when the first milestone of Navratri is crossed, symbolizing the consequences of not transcending suffering states.", created_at:1779519150, source_id:"chunk-49d819fbab36af31ec15419ab94d1279", entity_id:"Downward Collapse of Destinies"}}, {_id:5560, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Interpersonal relationships refer to the connections and interactions between individuals, which have been strained by COVID-19 and modern digital behaviors.", created_at:1779519167, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726<SEP>chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795", entity_id:"Interpersonal Relationships"}}, {_id:5561, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Social Media encompasses digital platforms such as Facebook and YouTube that have become digital spaces replacing in-person interactions, thereby exacerbating social alienation. These platforms also foster interpersonal alienation and create a dependency on digital entertainment, as users increasingly turn to online content for social and recreational needs.  

The usage of Social Media is frequent and often cited as a contributing factor to distraction and agitation. The constant connectivity and rapid flow of content fragment human interactions, leading to shortened attention spans. This environment of perpetual connectivity encourages rapid consumption of information, which can undermine sustained focus and deep engagement.  

Social Media is also recognized as a pervasive platform that fuels comparison. Users are constantly exposed to curated content that showcases idealized or \"better\" lives, prompting upward social comparison. This dynamic perpetuates a cycle of constant comparison, as the platform's design emphasizes visibility and performance, reinforcing feelings of inadequacy or envy.", created_at:1779651435, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726<SEP>chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08<SEP>chunk-4c105f1c2d83f8107fb4042d9f1771a7<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16<SEP>chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-0cd54f605ef5308b827b0b4e872697da", entity_id:"Social Media"}}, {_id:5562, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Spanish Flu was a historical pandemic that caused significant mortality and influenced societal behaviors post-outbreak.<SEP>The Spanish Flu was a historical pandemic that caused massive fatalities and is compared to COVID-19 in terms of lethality.", created_at:1779519184, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726<SEP>chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08", entity_id:"Spanish Flu"}}, {_id:5564, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"humansocieties", truncate:"", created_at:1779519209, description:"Smallpox is a deadly disease that historically caused high mortality and cultural shifts in naming practices and social norms.<SEP>Smallpox is a deadly disease that caused widespread mortality and blindness, used as a historical comparison to COVID-19.<SEP>...\" which is incomplete. That's a formatting error. Also, the original input mentions \"racially segregated quarantine\" leading to apartheid in South Africa. The previous output had a relation between Plague and Europe regarding hygiene, but maybe missed the connection to South Africa's segregation.<SEP>...\" which is incomplete. The correct line should have all five fields.", source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726<SEP>chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08<SEP>chunk-3bbc23f7da347ce4b93776c537570fa8", entity_id:"Smallpox"}}, {_id:5565, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"publichealthpolicy", truncate:"", description:"Plague-era quarantines institutionalized racial segregation...\" but the entity \"Hygiene Practices\" wasn't extracted. The input text says \"people refused to bathe, in fact, only once in a year or once in six months in Europe, somehow believing that water was the cause of plague.\" So \"Hygiene Practices\" should be an entity. The previous output didn't include it, so that's a missed entity.", created_at:1779519167, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726", entity_id:"Racial Segregation"}}, {_id:5566, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The plague refers to historical pandemics that led to long-term societal changes, including racial segregation and hygiene practices.<SEP>Plague is a specific pandemic disease that caused significant societal changes, including altered hygiene practices and racial segregation in some regions.", created_at:1779519209, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726<SEP>chunk-3bbc23f7da347ce4b93776c537570fa8", entity_id:"Plague"}}, {_id:5567, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Parents delayed naming children until they survived smallpox, reflecting pandemic-driven societal shifts.", created_at:1779519167, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726", entity_id:"Naming Practices"}}, {_id:5568, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Spanish Flu led to long-term changes in hygiene habits, such as reduced bathing frequency, persisting for centuries.", created_at:1779519167, source_id:"chunk-13c9585183fe0f71b4560d16c5cd2726", entity_id:"Hygiene Practices"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5569, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Internet-based entertainment streaming (e.g., Netflix, YouTube) fosters dependency and reduces real-world social interactions.", created_at:1779519184, source_id:"chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08", entity_id:"Internet-Based Entertainment Streaming"}}, {_id:5570, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", created_at:1779562099, description:"Netflix is a streaming service driving dependency on digital entertainment.<SEP>Netflix is a streaming service linked to hours of passive consumption, displacing real-world connections.<SEP>Netflix is a streaming service linked to hours of passive consumption, displacing real-world connections.<SEP>A streaming service representing leisure activity in the person's repetitive routine.", source_id:"chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08<SEP>chunk-39252be9066242f35311d64c382dc3da<SEP>chunk-795d6a47694e346b9ff7bde9c51e23ec", entity_id:"Netflix"}}, {_id:5571, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The global economy has been disrupted by COVID-19, leading to financial instability and poverty.", created_at:1779519184, source_id:"chunk-47ba35801c62795c3acbb6bf1357ab08", entity_id:"Global Economy"}}, {_id:5572, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: d0v8RE6i0GM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d0v8RE6i0GM)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"WhatsApp is a messaging app used for digital condolences, reflecting diminished physical empathy.<SEP>WhatsApp is a messaging app used for digital condolences, reflecting diminished physical empathy.", created_at:177951