\"Romantic love is a multifaceted human experience that is often portrayed as a form of love driven by desire and momentary highs, contrasting with the enduring, conscious connection associated with true love. It is described as a specific type of love that most of humanity runs behind, characterized by a romantic high. Romantic love can also be understood as a heartfelt connection that transcends fleeting pleasure, involving empathy and emotional resonance with others' feelings. This perspective emphasizes that romantic love is not merely a fleeting infatuation but a deeper, emotionally resonant bond.

