0e3bfda839778033ca7e4ddfabb670b<SEP>chunk-811e6c42c9ccf4bfac70459d1ccf2336<SEP>chunk-e2d0ff9dea6a5334fbc3569bce6e4413<SEP>chunk-0443cca2d76c87663467e3610969c2ba<SEP>chunk-3198061b7d9cb7c891cdfe291494700c<SEP>chunk-463088ccb7af0ca596d7f4a288f68a78", entity_id:"Romantic Love"}}, {_id:5615, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 3WnNyhhB_4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WnNyhhB_4w)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video discussing the nature of love as a universal phenomenon and its distinction from pleasure.", created_at:1779519797, source_id:"chunk-811e6c42c9ccf4bfac70459d1ccf2336", entity_id:"YouTube Video: 3WnNyhhB_4w"}}, {_id:5616, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 3WnNyhhB_4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WnNyhhB_4w)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Radiance is a quality that shines from individuals who have experienced love, even after many years of living together.<SEP>Radiance symbolizes love's manifestation as a luminous, consciousness-driven force emanating from the self.<SEP>Radiance symbolizes love's manifestation as a luminous, consciousness-driven force emanating from the self.", created_at:1779557180, source_id:"chunk-811e6c42c9ccf4bfac70459d1ccf2336<SEP>chunk-1d477f5607ac5cfb56e2b711bd58f1aa", entity_id:"Radiance"}}, {_id:5617, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 3WnNyhhB_4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WnNyhhB_4w)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Romantic High is a momentary feeling of love, distinct from the deeper experience of love and its awakening.<SEP>The romantic high refers to a transient state of euphoria where the brain perceives ordinary things as extraordinary.<SEP>The romantic high refers to a transient state of euphoria where the brain perceives ordinary things as extraordinary.", 