But we need", created_at:1779669354, source_id:"chunk-7abe568e63ed3025b11ad246b7eb6e12<SEP>chunk-60af06a20529afe356c9b2c29e286a87<SEP>chunk-e2d0ff9dea6a5334fbc3569bce6e4413<SEP>chunk-472321605b70f46b6792fb017a049d8d<SEP>chunk-c5b629deefcb32f62e58cbc3ee1d28ae<SEP>chunk-149f1fa94cc8d81b9d634c9e418c534a<SEP>chunk-4f083f509b73a704942cae198b15e4c6<SEP>chunk-fb3062b3d6881522fcc2387d435da879", entity_id:"Sense of Self"}}, {_id:5622, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The desire to control and dominate others, stemming from a strong sense of self and internal violence.", created_at:1779519946, source_id:"chunk-60af06a20529afe356c9b2c29e286a87", entity_id:"Control and Domination"}}, {_id:5623, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The sense of self refers to an individual's perception of their identity and desire for control, leading to conflict and domination tendencies.", created_at:1779519948, source_id:"chunk-3262d5415ded94fc1fc56ae56e675a4b", entity_id:"sense of self"}}, {_id:5624, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Collective peace refers to shared tranquility that dissolves wars and prevents egoistic leadership by harmonizing human consciousness.", created_at:1779519948, source_id:"chunk-3262d5415ded94fc1fc56ae56e675a4b", entity_id:"collective peace"}}, {_id:5625, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Control and domination describe the tendency to subjugate others, rooted in an unawakened sense of self.", created_at:1779519948, source_id:"chunk-3262d5415ded94fc1fc56ae56e675a4b", entity_id:"control and domination"}}, {_id:5626, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Egoistic leaders emerge from societal discord, perpetuating conflict and imbalance through self-centered governance.", created_at:1779519948, source_id:"chunk-3262d5415ded94fc1fc56ae56e675a4b", entity_id:"egoistic leaders"}}, {_id:5627, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Wars symbolize large-scale conflict arising from unawakened human behavior and ego-driven agendas.<SEP>wars are large-scale armed conflicts often rooted in ideological or communal tensions.<SEP>wars are large-scale armed conflicts between nations or groups, frequently rooted in underlying hatred or ideological divisions.<SEP>wars are large-scale armed conflicts between nations or groups, frequently rooted in underlying hatred or ideological divisions.<SEP>wars are large-scale armed conflicts between nations or groups, frequently rooted in ideological or communal tensions.", created_at:1779708911, source_id:"chunk-3262d5415ded94fc1fc56ae56e675a4b<SEP>chunk-a37d3f6055e6d6441602d68de1d355d5<SEP>chunk-9b00396c3f063ecb56e81be2e9774eeb<SEP>chunk-cd5c2a5ac692f677e327249690402b2c", entity_id:"wars"}}, {_id:5628, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: F-hNATzOz2I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-hNATzOz2I)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779665564, description:"A loved one is an individual whose presence is perceived as irreplaceable and deeply impactful, evoking profound feelings of love and connection.<SEP>A loved one is an individual whose presence is perceived as irreplaceable and deeply impactful, evoking profound feelings of love and connection.<SEP>A loved one is perceived as irreplaceable, with their passing highlighting the sacredness of their presence in life.<SEP>A loved one is an individual within one?s soul circle who receives focused attention and becomes central to the healing dynamic.", source_id:"chunk-9126b7168266feeb5c044ddb65ae0392<SEP>chunk-41c56c693f43ab87b485549113485860<SEP>chunk-5bd21ff5a870ab22c344b6bc7a8c56b4<SEP>chunk-352ac4da97f866ae1e36170e4635504b<SEP>chunk-112f236855c8c9ac7864c1e2a1d43d1a", entity_id:"Loved One"}}, {_id:5629, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Patience is a virtue or beautiful aspect embodied by loved ones, contributing to the experience of love through recognition of its profound impact.<SEP>Patience is a virtue or beautiful aspect embodied by loved ones, contributing to the experience of love through recognition of its profound impact.", created_at:1779520197, source_id:"chunk-5bd21ff5a870ab22c344b6bc7a8c56b4", entity_id:"Patience"}}, {_id:5630, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: F-hNATzOz2I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-hNATzOz2I)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A newborn is a human infant, often associated with feelings of sacredness and irreplaceability in the context of love.<SEP>A newborn is a human infant, often associated with feelings of sacredness and irreplaceability in the context of love.<SEP>A newborn is viewed as a miracle from the universe, evoking profound sacredness and spontaneous presence.", created_at:1779520215, source_id:"chunk-5bd21ff5a870ab22c344b6bc7a8c56b4<SEP>chunk-352ac4da97f866ae1e36170e4635504b", entity_id:"Newborn"}}, {_id:5631, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Joyfulness is a quality or beautiful aspect embodied by loved ones, acknowledged as a key element in the experience of love and its transformative effects.<SEP>Joyfulness is a quality or beautiful aspect embodied by loved ones, acknowledged as a key element in the experience of love and its transformative effects.", created_at:1779520198, source_id:"chunk-5bd21ff5a870ab22c344b6bc7a8c56b4", entity_id:"Joyfulness"}}, {_id:5632, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: aqSM9LwqWgA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aqSM9LwqWgA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dharma calls for overcoming conflict-driven thinking to embrace inherent peacefulness.", created_at:1779519970, source_id:"chunk-3262d5415ded94fc1fc56ae56e675a4b", entity_id:"conflict-driven minds"}}, {_id:5633, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: F-hNATzOz2I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-hNATzOz2I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Preciousness refers to the emotional state of perceiving something or someone as irreplaceable and deeply valued.", created_at:1779520215, source_id:"chunk-352ac4da97f866ae1e36170e4635504b", entity_id:"Preciousness"}}, {_id:5634, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: F-hNATzOz2I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F-hNATzOz2I)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The Other represents a person with imperfections, recognized as irreplaceable due to their unique positive traits and impact.", created_at:1779520215, source_id:"chunk-352ac4da97f866ae1e36170e4635504b", entity_id:"The Other"}}, {_id:5635, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 6j6EGVpQkI8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6j6EGVpQkI8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Invention denotes the creation of new technologies or ideas, contrasted with enlightenment as a transcendent human pursuit rather than a novel invention.", created_at:1779520401, source_id:"chunk-e56919e461f379123fc8b4b2380a2a52", entity_id:"Invention"}}, {_id:5636, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Forgiveness of oneself is the first pillar of the Temple of Peace, addressing inner unhappiness and self-inflicted violence through self-compassion.<SEP>Forgiveness of Oneself is one of the four pillars of peace, emphasizing self-compassion.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795<SEP>chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Forgiveness of Oneself"}}, {_id:5637, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Temple of Peace is a metaphorical framework representing world peace, structured on four pillars: forgiveness, non-judgment, peace education, and collective meditation.<SEP>Temple of Peace is a concept that stands on four pillars, representing the foundation of world peace.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795<SEP>chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Temple of Peace"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5638, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Peace education for children is the third pillar, advocating for integrating peace studies into universal education to nurture future leaders like Gandhi.<SEP>Peace Education for Children is a pillar of peace, focusing on educating children for peace.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795<SEP>chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Peace Education for Children"}}, {_id:5639, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Non-judgment toward others is the second pillar, emphasizing compassion and understanding to dissolve interpersonal conflict.<SEP>Non-Judgment of Others is a pillar of peace, advocating for non-judgment towards others.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795<SEP>chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Non-Judgment of Others"}}, {_id:5640, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Collective meditations and transformation of consciousness are the fourth pillar, aiming to shift human consciousness from violence to peace through mass participation.<SEP>Collective meditations are proposed as a means to shift human consciousness toward peace.", created_at:1779520555, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795<SEP>chunk-1229d4c4d857130f683000d1d6617fab", entity_id:"Collective Meditations"}}, {_id:5641, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Violence and fear represent the current state of human consciousness that the Temple of Peace seeks to transform into peace and compassion.", created_at:1779520408, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795", entity_id:"Violence and Fear"}}, {_id:5642, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Teaching peace education prevents figures like Hitler and cultivates leaders like Gandhi.", created_at:1779520409, source_id:"chunk-d3d330d042772c704e2fd89e4454d795", entity_id:"Historical Figures"}}, {_id:5643, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Inner Unhappiness is a concept discussed as the source of violence and unhappiness.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Inner Unhappiness"}}, {_id:5644, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Meditation for World Peace is a pillar of peace, involving meditation to achieve world peace.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Meditation for World Peace"}}, {_id:5645, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-Inflicted Violence is a concept resulting from inner unhappiness, representing harm inflicted on oneself.", created_at:1779520446, source_id:"chunk-2225477f1ce6601f366c9da4b0d0f105", entity_id:"Self-Inflicted Violence"}}, {_id:5646, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Non-judgment involves releasing superiority-based judgments and embracing empathy to dissolve interpersonal conflict.<SEP>Non-judgment involves releasing superiority-based judgments and embracing empathy to dissolve interpersonal conflict.", created_at:1779520561, source_id:"chunk-3f4d48e02ed3cffc983ab81c8c5b5555", entity_id:"Non-Judgment"}}, {_id:5647, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Peace studies advocate for integrating peace education into school curricula to cultivate global harmony.<SEP>Peace studies advocate for integrating peace education into school curricula to cultivate global harmony.", created_at:1779520561, source_id:"chunk-3f4d48e02ed3cffc983ab81c8c5b5555", entity_id:"Peace Studies"}}, {_id:5648, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Letting go of judgment is a transformative act enabling mutual understanding and emotional release in relationships.<SEP>Letting go of judgment is a transformative act enabling mutual understanding and emotional release in relationships.", created_at:1779520561, source_id:"chunk-3f4d48e02ed3cffc983ab81c8c5b5555", entity_id:"Letting Go of Judgment"}}, {_id:5649, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Bureaucrats are administrative officials who manage government operations and policies.<SEP>Bureaucrats are administrative officials who manage government operations and policies.", created_at:1779520562, source_id:"chunk-3f4d48e02ed3cffc983ab81c8c5b5555", entity_id:"Bureaucrats"}}, {_id:5658, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Teaching children peace and compassion is linked to preventing global conflicts and securing the future.", created_at:1779520556, source_id:"chunk-1229d4c4d857130f683000d1d6617fab", entity_id:"Saving the Future of the World"}}, {_id:5659, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Teaching children peace and compassion is linked to preventing global conflicts and securing the future.", created_at:1779520556, source_id:"chunk-1229d4c4d857130f683000d1d6617fab", entity_id:"Teaching Peace and Compassion"}}, {_id:5660, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Fostering peace in children is associated with avoiding destructive historical outcomes like Hitler?s rise.", created_at:1779520556, source_id:"chunk-1229d4c4d857130f683000d1d6617fab", entity_id:"Preventing Hitlers Arising"}}, {_id:5661, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Ao8Rhhl9E8k (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ao8Rhhl9E8k)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Cultivating peace and compassion is likened to nurturing positive historical figures like Gandhi.", created_at:1779520556, source_id:"chunk-1229d4c4d857130f683000d1d6617fab", entity_id:"Bringing Up Gandhi"}}, {_id:5662, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Bonobos are presented as a hypothetical peaceful ancestor for humanity.<SEP>Bonobos are a species of apes considered more peaceful compared to chimpanzees in the context of human evolutionary speculation.<SEP>Bonobos are a species of apes considered more peaceful compared to chimpanzees in the context of human evolutionary speculation.", created_at:1779520743, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Bonobos"}}, {_id:5663, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Chimpanzees are presented as the actual aggressive ancestor for humanity.<SEP>Chimpanzees are a species of apes associated with aggression and violence in the context of human evolutionary origins.<SEP>Chimpanzees are a species of apes associated with aggression and violence in the context of human evolutionary origins.", created_at:1779520743, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Chimpanzees"}}, {_id:5664, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"World War One is mentioned as a conflict that birthed World War Two.<SEP>World War One is a global conflict that directly led to World War Two and long-term geopolitical instability.<SEP>World War One is a global conflict that directly led to World War Two and long-term geopolitical instability.", created_at:1779520744, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"World War One"}}, {_id:5665, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"World War Two is mentioned as a conflict that was born from World War One.<SEP>World War Two is a catastrophic war with enduring consequences, including global terrorism and societal trauma.<SEP>World War Two is a catastrophic war with enduring consequences, including global terrorism and societal trauma.", created_at:1779520744, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"World War Two"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5666, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779663276, description:"The Mahabharata war is cited as an example of a conflict where victory did not bring joy.<SEP>The Mahabharata War is an ancient conflict resulting in massive loss of life and familial destruction, illustrating the futility of war.<SEP>The Mahabharata War is an ancient conflict resulting in massive loss of life and familial destruction, illustrating the futility of war.<SEP>The Mahabharata War is a historical conflict referenced in the discussion.", source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513<SEP>chunk-5345dea91d4424a106a1b8dd1d7e28bc", entity_id:"Mahabharata War"}}, {_id:5667, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779675622, description:"Aggression is an inbuilt trait of humanity that leads to wars.<SEP>Aggression is a category of stressful states characterized by anger, frustration, or vengefulness.<SEP>Aggression characterizes relationships based on competition rather than cooperation.", source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-0f9934def7b71a5f1166df0b2b2d22fb<SEP>chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Aggression"}}, {_id:5668, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Territoriality is an inbuilt trait of humanity that leads to wars.", created_at:1779520629, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf", entity_id:"Territoriality"}}, {_id:5669, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"War-Mongering is a tendency that increases with hate and leads to more wars.", created_at:1779520629, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf", entity_id:"War-Mongering"}}, {_id:5670, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Victory is described as giving the thrill of crushing the enemy but not true joy.<SEP>Victory in war is questioned as a source of joy, exemplified by the tragic outcomes of the Mahabharata and modern conflicts.<SEP>Victory in war is questioned as a source of joy, exemplified by the tragic outcomes of the Mahabharata and modern conflicts.", created_at:1779520743, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Victory"}}, {_id:5671, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Terrorism is an aftermath of wars like World War Two.<SEP>Terrorism is a modern manifestation of post-war instability, linked to the aftermath of World War Two.<SEP>Terrorism is a modern manifestation of post-war instability, linked to the aftermath of World War Two.", created_at:1779520743, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf<SEP>chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Terrorism"}}, {_id:5672, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Two million years ago is a time reference related to ancestral origins.", created_at:1779520630, source_id:"chunk-8ae1e84c94c9daf68cd33af74bbc6fbf", entity_id:"Two Million Years Ago"}}, {_id:5673, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Polarities describe the contradictory traits of humanity, such as peace versus war and wealth versus insecurity.<SEP>Polarities describe the contradictory traits of humanity, such as peace versus war and wealth versus insecurity.", created_at:1779520743, source_id:"chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Polarities"}}, {_id:5674, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Scars refer to the generational trauma and lasting impacts of wars on societies.<SEP>Scars refer to the generational trauma and lasting impacts of wars on societies.", created_at:1779520744, source_id:"chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Scars"}}, {_id:5675, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Expanding borders is a method used by humanity to address feelings of insecurity and powerlessness.<SEP>Expanding borders is a method used by humanity to address feelings of insecurity and powerlessness.", created_at:1779520744, source_id:"chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Expanding Borders"}}, {_id:5676, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Recorded history spans over 10,000 years, yet humanity has not learned to avoid repeating the cycle of destructive wars.<SEP>Recorded history spans over 10,000 years, yet humanity has not learned to avoid repeating the cycle of destructive wars.", created_at:1779520744, source_id:"chunk-6fa29767ceb8e0fa67cf872f6c5dc513", entity_id:"Recorded History"}}, {_id:5677, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"EhY6npcnSs8 is a YouTube video promoting peace in nations, human beings, and all life through spiritual and cultural messages.", created_at:1779520761, source_id:"chunk-c1132eb602efecba3dcd1e9547e3e420", entity_id:"EhY6npcnSs8"}}, {_id:5678, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: EhY6npcnSs8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EhY6npcnSs8)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The culture expresses a wish for peace in all nations of the world as part of its core values.", created_at:1779520795, source_id:"chunk-c1132eb602efecba3dcd1e9547e3e420", entity_id:"Peace in Nations"}}, {_id:5679, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 5YJ6vynFWFc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YJ6vynFWFc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Role refers to the function or part one plays in a specific context, which may or may not align with their purpose or mission.<SEP>Role refers to the actions or responsibilities a person undertakes to fulfill their mission", created_at:1779520828, source_id:"chunk-4675fae3df6dc621969cec7edcf35797<SEP>chunk-dd506a27566aa3b0948c2e961bb69dbf", entity_id:"Role"}}, {_id:5680, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 5YJ6vynFWFc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YJ6vynFWFc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779520855, description:"Mission describes the specific actions or goals one undertakes to fulfill their purpose, which may or may not align with their role.<SEP>Mission refers to a person's primary objective or goal.<SEP>Mission describes a clear objective, like enabling others to experience awakened states.", source_id:"chunk-4675fae3df6dc621969cec7edcf35797<SEP>chunk-dd506a27566aa3b0948c2e961bb69dbf<SEP>chunk-1118c9b4ddb64c612c4d8aecbb280b07", entity_id:"Mission"}}, {_id:5681, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Life satisfaction relates to contentment and fulfillment derived from aligning role, purpose, and mission.", created_at:1779520809, source_id:"chunk-4675fae3df6dc621969cec7edcf35797", entity_id:"Life Satisfaction"}}, {_id:5682, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 5YJ6vynFWFc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YJ6vynFWFc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Awakened states refer to heightened levels of consciousness or enlightenment.<SEP>Awakened states represent heightened levels of consciousness or awareness.", created_at:1779520855, source_id:"chunk-4675fae3df6dc621969cec7edcf35797<SEP>chunk-1118c9b4ddb64c612c4d8aecbb280b07", entity_id:"Awakened States"}}, {_id:5686, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 5YJ6vynFWFc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YJ6vynFWFc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual Teacher is a role aimed at guiding others into awakened states through purpose and mission.", created_at:1779520855, source_id:"chunk-1118c9b4ddb64c612c4d8aecbb280b07", entity_id:"Spiritual Teacher"}}, {_id:5687, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 5YJ6vynFWFc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YJ6vynFWFc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Director is a role focused on camera work and directing others, not acting.", created_at:1779520855, source_id:"chunk-1118c9b4ddb64c612c4d8aecbb280b07", entity_id:"Director"}}, {_id:5688, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 5YJ6vynFWFc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5YJ6vynFWFc)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Actor is a role requiring active participation in acting, distinct from directing or passive observation.", created_at:1779520855, source_id:"chunk-1118c9b4ddb64c612c4d8aecbb280b07", entity_id:"Actor"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5689, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Satyathi is a peace leader who has discovered his Dharma of safeguarding the innocence and future of children globally.", created_at:1779520879, source_id:"chunk-87e9f6f06dda3bab56cb02db087a043c", entity_id:"Satyathi"}}, {_id:5691, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Satyathi (Satyathiji) is a peace leader who discovered his Dharma of protecting children's innocence and future, fulfilling it through selfless acts.`", created_at:1779520898, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Satyathi/Satyathiji"}}, {_id:5692, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Children who receive love and nurturing until age seven grow into peaceful adults contributing to societal harmony.`", created_at:1779520898, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Peaceful Adults"}}, {_id:5693, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"A selfless act of service involves helping others without expectation of reward, emphasized as a means to protect childhood purity.`", created_at:1779520898, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Selfless Act of Service"}}, {_id:5695, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A collective mental space where human suffering and violence are transmitted across generations, requiring transformation through peace.`<SEP>The thought sphere of humanity represents a collective mental space shaped by current emotions and projected into future generations.", created_at:1779520991, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a<SEP>chunk-523915ad473a2e9b1024913a693f94bb", entity_id:"Thought Sphere of Humanity"}}, {_id:5696, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An unidentified child representing universal childhood innocence, symbolizing the need for compassion and protection.`<SEP>An unknown child is a concept representing the potential for positive change through simple acts of kindness.<SEP>An unknown child is a concept representing the potential for positive change through simple acts of kindness.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a<SEP>chunk-5775fa967c3333ec10bee1ba6077c7ce", entity_id:"Unknown Child"}}, {_id:5697, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An awakened heart enables selfless acts of service and deep connection with children, transcending personal interests.`<SEP>An awakened heart is a state of consciousness necessary for making a difference and improving the world.<SEP>An awakened heart is a state of consciousness necessary for making a difference and improving the world.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a<SEP>chunk-5775fa967c3333ec10bee1ba6077c7ce", entity_id:"Awakened Heart"}}, {_id:5698, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Exposure to violence in domestic environments severely impacts children's psychological development and sense of safety.`", created_at:1779520898, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Violence at Home"}}, {_id:5699, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Abandonment causes profound emotional harm to children, affecting their development.`", created_at:1779520900, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Abandonment"}}, {_id:5700, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Negligence disrupts children's sense of security and growth.`", created_at:1779520901, source_id:"chunk-8af255a304ace2998aadaf7ca47f260a", entity_id:"Negligence"}}, {_id:5701, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Children of the World represents the collective group of children globally who require protection and care.<SEP>Children of the World represents the collective group of children globally who require protection and care.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-37d0d91f60cf0c0cf3f8569ec5103472", entity_id:"Children of the World"}}, {_id:5702, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Protecting Children is a central theme emphasizing the need to safeguard the innocence and future of the world's children.<SEP>Protecting Children is a central theme emphasizing the need to safeguard the innocence and future of the world's children.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-37d0d91f60cf0c0cf3f8569ec5103472", entity_id:"Protecting Children"}}, {_id:5705, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Satyathiji is a speaker who promotes the preservation of childhood qualities and encourages acts of kindness to improve the world.<SEP>Satyathiji is a speaker who promotes the preservation of childhood qualities and encourages acts of kindness to improve the world.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-5775fa967c3333ec10bee1ba6077c7ce", entity_id:"Satyathiji"}}, {_id:5706, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A deep state of peace is achieved through meditation and is linked to making a positive impact.<SEP>A deep state of peace is achieved through meditation and is linked to making a positive impact.", created_at:1779520926, source_id:"chunk-5775fa967c3333ec10bee1ba6077c7ce", entity_id:"Deep State of Peace"}}, {_id:5707, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Children and young people of the world are described as suffering, with their experiences influencing humanity's thought sphere.", created_at:1779520991, source_id:"chunk-523915ad473a2e9b1024913a693f94bb", entity_id:"Children and Young People of the World"}}, {_id:5708, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: s6B81c2uTGg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s6B81c2uTGg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Awakened heart and awakened consciousness are concepts emphasizing spiritual growth and global betterment through meditation.", created_at:1779520991, source_id:"chunk-523915ad473a2e9b1024913a693f94bb", entity_id:"Awakened Heart and Awakened Consciousness"}}, {_id:5709, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: MJYpyUlwxg0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MJYpyUlwxg0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Bliss Sachitananda represents the state of supreme joy and consciousness achieved through the realization of oneness with the universal intelligence.<SEP>Bliss Sachitananda refers to the state of unified consciousness experienced through the realization of oneness with Mahadeva.<SEP>Bliss Sachitananda represents the state of supreme joy and consciousness achieved through the realization of oneness with the universal intelligence.<SEP>Bliss Sachitananda refers to the state of unified consciousness experienced through the realization of oneness with Mahadeva.", created_at:1779521108, source_id:"chunk-a4ec9b97a69f62614437c5e1621469d7<SEP>chunk-2440e826e4f3cf50974cdd2445cd5354", entity_id:"Bliss Sachitananda"}}, {_id:5710, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: MJYpyUlwxg0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MJYpyUlwxg0)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Mahadeva symbolizes the oneness of birth, continuity, and death, serving as the unified source of the diversified universe and embodying the dynamic symphony of existence.<SEP>Mahadeva symbolizes the unified source of the diversified universe and is associated with the dynamic dance representing waves of oneness.<SEP>Mahadeva symbolizes the oneness of birth, continuity, and death, serving as the unified source of the diversified universe and embodying the dynamic symphony of existence.<SEP>Mahadeva symbolizes the unified source of the diversified universe and is associated with the dynamic dance representing waves of oneness.", created_at:1779521108, source_id:"chunk-a4ec9b97a69f62614437c5e1621469d7<SEP>chunk-2440e826e4f3cf50974cdd2445cd5354", entity_id:"Mahadeva"}}, {_id:5711, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: MJYpyUlwxg0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MJYpyUlwxg0)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, observed through inward meditation to unite with Mahadeva and experience divine consciousness.<SEP>Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, during which meditation is performed to enter the realm of consciousness and unite with Mahadeva.<SEP>Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, observed through inward meditation to unite with Mahadeva and experience divine consciousness.<SEP>Maha Shivaratri is the mystic night of oneness, during which meditation is performed to enter the realm of consciousness and unite with Mahadeva.", created_at:1779521108, source_id:"chunk-a4ec9b97a69f62614437c5e1621469d7<SEP>chunk-2440e826e4f3cf50974cdd2445cd5354", entity_id:"Maha Shivaratri"}}, {_id:5712, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The diversified universe represents the multiplicity of existence arising from the unified source, embodying the dynamic interplay of birth, continuity, and death.<SEP>The diversified universe represents the multiplicity of existence arising from the unified source, embodying the dynamic interplay of birth, continuity, and death.", created_at:1779521107, source_id:"chunk-a4ec9b97a69f62614437c5e1621469d7", entity_id:"Diversified Universe"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5713, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: MJYpyUlwxg0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MJYpyUlwxg0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The divine dancer and the dance represent the unified expression of oneness, embodying the dynamic symphony of existence.<SEP>The divine dancer and the dance represent the unified expression of oneness, embodying the dynamic symphony of existence.", created_at:1779521107, source_id:"chunk-2440e826e4f3cf50974cdd2445cd5354", entity_id:"Divine Dancer and the Dance"}}, {_id:5714, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Xk1KsO3efP4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xk1KsO3efP4)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Millions of other species coexist with humans, requiring respect for their boundaries and habitats.<SEP>Millions of other species coexist with humans, requiring respect for their boundaries and habitats.<SEP>Millions of other species coexist with humans, requiring respect for their boundaries and habitats.<SEP>Millions of other species coexist with humans, requiring respect for their boundaries and habitats.", created_at:1779521671, source_id:"chunk-8b2fbaa3ebe33f5b431669abfbee9a40", entity_id:"Millions of Other Species"}}, {_id:5715, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Other life-forms represent all non-human species sharing Earth's ecosystems, requiring respect for their boundaries and living spaces as part of planetary coexistence.<SEP>Other life-forms represent all non-human species sharing Earth's ecosystems, requiring respect for their boundaries and living spaces as part of planetary coexistence.<SEP>Other life-forms represent all non-human species sharing Earth's ecosystems, requiring respect for their boundaries and living spaces as part of planetary coexistence.<SEP>Other life-forms represent all non-human species sharing Earth's ecosystems, requiring respect for their boundaries and living spaces as part of planetary coexistence.", created_at:1779521671, source_id:"chunk-d459696e63e5250812e4b59a48640c43", entity_id:"Other Life-Forms"}}, {_id:5717, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Fn62UQTIMEk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fn62UQTIMEk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Divine power flows when consciousness roadblocks are released, connecting to the living universe.<SEP>Great divine power flowing after a roadblock is released in consciousness.<SEP>Divine power flows when consciousness roadblocks are released, connecting to the living universe.<SEP>Great divine power flowing after a roadblock is released in consciousness.", created_at:1779521854, source_id:"chunk-57d13edf70fda1b7b5635305ebadfc8d<SEP>chunk-c7bf6f021740e165e861766b49fe6388", entity_id:"Divine Power"}}, {_id:5718, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A roadblock in consciousness is released through transformation, enabling divine power flow.<SEP>A roadblock in consciousness is released through transformation, enabling divine power flow.", created_at:1779521853, source_id:"chunk-57d13edf70fda1b7b5635305ebadfc8d", entity_id:"Roadblock in Consciousness"}}, {_id:5719, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Freedom from suffering in one life area impacts other areas like business or career through liberation.<SEP>Freedom from suffering in one life area impacts other areas like business or career through liberation.", created_at:1779521853, source_id:"chunk-57d13edf70fda1b7b5635305ebadfc8d", entity_id:"Freedom from Suffering"}}, {_id:5720, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Fn62UQTIMEk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fn62UQTIMEk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Freedom from suffering in one life area impacting other areas like business and career.<SEP>Freedom from suffering in one life area impacting other areas like business and career.", created_at:1779521853, source_id:"chunk-c7bf6f021740e165e861766b49fe6388", entity_id:"Awakening and Liberation"}}, {_id:5721, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Fn62UQTIMEk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fn62UQTIMEk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Impact on business due to liberation in consciousness.<SEP>Impact on business due to liberation in consciousness.", created_at:1779521853, source_id:"chunk-c7bf6f021740e165e861766b49fe6388", entity_id:"Business Impact"}}, {_id:5722, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Fn62UQTIMEk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fn62UQTIMEk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Impact on career due to liberation in consciousness.<SEP>Impact on career due to liberation in consciousness.", created_at:1779521853, source_id:"chunk-c7bf6f021740e165e861766b49fe6388", entity_id:"Career Impact"}}, {_id:5723, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Transformation in consciousness impacts someone else's heart and desires, even at a distance.", created_at:1779522027, source_id:"chunk-57d13edf70fda1b7b5635305ebadfc8d", entity_id:"Someone Else"}}, {_id:5724, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Freedom in one area impacts unrelated life areas like business or career.", created_at:1779522027, source_id:"chunk-57d13edf70fda1b7b5635305ebadfc8d", entity_id:"Business/Career"}}, {_id:5725, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: PnvNqgTyIFI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnvNqgTyIFI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Genuine emotional states arising from self-awareness and liberation, impacting the world positively.>", created_at:1779522057, source_id:"chunk-bebed8e390bd16e43f908369216b9343", entity_id:"Freedom and Joy"}}, {_id:5726, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: PnvNqgTyIFI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnvNqgTyIFI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The ripple effect of inner transformation on global consciousness and societal change.>", created_at:1779522057, source_id:"chunk-bebed8e390bd16e43f908369216b9343", entity_id:"Impact on the World"}}, {_id:5727, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: PnvNqgTyIFI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnvNqgTyIFI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The absence of mental noise, described as a profound experience of consciousness and being.>", created_at:1779522057, source_id:"chunk-bebed8e390bd16e43f908369216b9343", entity_id:"Silence"}}, {_id:5728, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: PnvNqgTyIFI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnvNqgTyIFI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A transformative state of awareness where one perceives consciousness as the witness, transcending egoic thought.>", created_at:1779522057, source_id:"chunk-bebed8e390bd16e43f908369216b9343", entity_id:"Awakening to the Witness"}}, {_id:5729, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: PnvNqgTyIFI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnvNqgTyIFI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The process of self-exploration and introspection, described as magical and transformative.><SEP>The inward journey symbolizes self-discovery and overcoming external dependencies for true fulfillment.<SEP>Inward journey is described as the path to overcoming addiction and achieving enlightenment through self-awareness.<SEP>The inward journey symbolizes self-discovery and overcoming external dependencies for true fulfillment.<SEP>Inward journey is described as the path to overcoming addiction and achieving enlightenment through self-awareness.<SEP>The metaphorical cure for his addiction, involving self-reflection and personal growth.<SEP>Inward journey refers to self-reflection leading to spiritual growth and decision-making.", created_at:1779655488, source_id:"chunk-bebed8e390bd16e43