ine purpose, or lessons from hardship, which the speaker critiques as flawed rationalizations.", created_at:1779524125, source_id:"chunk-c00a21b2b4928fd2c922f070f0bbfadd", entity_id:"Philosophical Ideas"}}, {_id:5746, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: tegTDWT3SDc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tegTDWT3SDc)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"PTG is the organizing entity behind the Field of Awakening, facilitating healing journeys through spiritual and energetic practices.<SEP>PTG offers a four-day healing journey focusing on inner child exploration, ancestral karma, and abundance-related fears through energy body work.", created_at:1779524451, source_id:"chunk-aaeba0a2e3dac75ac3bf2d72063fa0eb<SEP>chunk-680dd7bb1c61258ea018e46f2177de41", entity_id:"PTG"}}, {_id:5747, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: tegTDWT3SDc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tegTDWT3SDc)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779524484, description:"Pretty G is a facilitator at the Field of Awakening, delivering profound teachings on self-realization and emotional healing.<SEP>Pretty G is a presenter at the event who shared profound insights on overcoming suffering and achieving emotional states.<SEP>Pretty G is a person who conducted a blessing and hands-on Deeksha, contributing to participants' experiences.", source_id:"chunk-aaeba0a2e3dac75ac3bf2d72063fa0eb<SEP>chunk-0e0d394b4b504c272b6565228b821607<SEP>chunk-ea232d61d1eebbbf47a086d1e047bec3", entity_id:"Pretty G"}}, {_id:5748, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: tegTDWT3SDc (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tegTDWT3SDc)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Kritiji is a spiritual leader who imparts Deeksha energy during the event, enhancing participants' transformative experiences.<SEP>Kritiji is a spiritual guide who conducts Deeksha energy sessions and blessings during the program.", created_at:1779524451, source_id:"c