UNWIND [{_id:5785, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Giant stars are celestial bodies that consume smaller stars, illustrating cosmic consumption dynamics.", created_at:1779530984, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e", entity_id:"Giant Stars"}}, {_id:5786, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TQ0TGyaByhs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQ0TGyaByhs)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The Milky Way is the galaxy containing the solar system, predicted to be consumed by the central black hole in the distant future.<SEP>The Milky Way is the galaxy in which our solar system is located, and it is destined to be consumed by a central black hole in the distant future.", created_at:1779531066, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e<SEP>chunk-ce2308cda5fca23d965042def4191e27", entity_id:"Milky Way"}}, {_id:5787, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TQ0TGyaByhs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQ0TGyaByhs)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The black hole at the center of the Milky Way is described as a future consumer of the entire galaxy.<SEP>The black hole at the center of the Milky Way galaxy is predicted to consume the entire galaxy in the distant future.", created_at:1779531066, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e<SEP>chunk-ce2308cda5fca23d965042def4191e27", entity_id:"Black Hole"}}, {_id:5788, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TQ0TGyaByhs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQ0TGyaByhs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Brahmarpanam represents the philosophical idea that everything is one indivisible consciousness (Brahman), acting as both the consumer and the consumed.<SEP>Brahmarpanam is a concept representing the unity of everything as Brahman, or indivisible consciousness.", created_at:1779531066, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e<SEP>chunk-ce2308cda5fca23d965042def4191e27", entity_id:"Brahmarpanam"}}, {_id:5789, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: TQ0TGyaByhs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQ0TGyaByhs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Yagna symbolizes a cosmic fire sacrifice where offerings are consumed and transformed into energy and life force.<SEP>Yagna is a fire sacrifice used as a metaphor for consciousness as a digestive fire.", created_at:1779531066, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e<SEP>chunk-ce2308cda5fca23d965042def4191e27", entity_id:"Yagna"}}, {_id:5791, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Offerings are the entities consumed by the Yagna's fire, which are then transmuted into energy and life force.", created_at:1779530985, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e", entity_id:"Offerings"}}, {_id:5792, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Violence, death, and conflicts are manifestations of societal divisions, seeping into streets and families.<SEP>Violence, death, and conflicts are manifestations of societal divisions, seeping into streets and families.<SEP>Violence, death, and conflicts are manifestations of societal divisions, seeping into streets and families.<SEP>Violence, death, and conflicts are manifestations of societal divisions, seeping into streets and families.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-5eb1940c87be8a3cdd703c8147cf00f5", entity_id:"Violence, Death, Conflicts"}}, {_id:5793, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", created_at:1779663147, description:"Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are urged to prioritize unity over divisiveness, with relationships tested by political differences.<SEP>Citizens are portrayed as collective entities expected to honor those who defend the nation, reflecting societal responsibility and respect.<SEP>Citizens' Dharma is to live with a non-violent consciousness.", source_id:"chunk-5eb1940c87be8a3cdd703c8147cf00f5<SEP>chunk-0360e3d7478d7aa88e74b472aef4bc64<SEP>chunk-4529c1884cd3f5e14f3ad9c161d86e76", entity_id:"Citizens"}}, {_id:5794, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Peace and oneness are advocated as national goals to counter anger and division, framed as a \"coming-of-age ceremony\" for America.<SEP>Peace and oneness are advocated as national goals to counter anger and division, framed as a \"coming-of-age ceremony\" for America.<SEP>Peace and oneness are advocated as national goals to counter anger and division, framed as a \"coming-of-age ceremony\" for America.<SEP>Peace and oneness are advocated as national goals to counter anger and division, framed as a \"coming-of-age ceremony\" for America.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-5eb1940c87be8a3cdd703c8147cf00f5", entity_id:"Peace and Oneness"}}, {_id:5795, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Differing political and social views are acknowledged as natural but must not escalate into enduring anger or hatred.<SEP>Differing political and social views are acknowledged as natural but must not escalate into enduring anger or hatred.<SEP>Differing political and social views are acknowledged as natural but must not escalate into enduring anger or hatred.<SEP>Differing political and social views are acknowledged as natural but must not escalate into enduring anger or hatred.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-5eb1940c87be8a3cdd703c8147cf00f5", entity_id:"Differing Views"}}, {_id:5796, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oSqD_BvF7vA (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSqD_BvF7vA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The coming-of-age ceremony is a metaphorical event symbolizing America's transition towards unity and oneness.<SEP>The coming-of-age ceremony is a metaphorical event symbolizing America's transition towards unity and oneness.<SEP>The coming-of-age ceremony is a metaphorical event symbolizing America's transition towards unity and oneness.<SEP>The coming-of-age ceremony is a metaphorical event symbolizing America's transition towards unity and oneness.", created_at:1779531992, source_id:"chunk-5eb1940c87be8a3cdd703c8147cf00f5", entity_id:"Coming-of-Age Ceremony"}}, {_id:5797, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Giant stars consume smaller stars, demonstrating celestial predation dynamics.", created_at:1779531041, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e", entity_id:"Smaller Stars"}}, {_id:5799, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An obsessive state focused on self-centeredness (\"me, me, and me\") that hinders the ability to find love, joy, or prosperity.", created_at:1779531248, source_id:"chunk-c3b39a7ccf4908b1d880b7e4b31351a8", entity_id:"Obsessive State"}}, {_id:5800, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779669373, description:"The act of prioritizing others' well-being and fostering genuine connections with others.<SEP>Caring for others emphasizes empathy and active concern for the well-being of individuals beyond oneself.<SEP>Caring for others emphasizes empathy and active concern for the well-being of individuals beyond oneself.<SEP>Caring for Others emphasizes emotional investment and mutual growth through compassionate action.", source_id:"chunk-c3b39a7ccf4908b1d880b7e4b31351a8<SEP>chunk-4f083f509b73a704942cae198b15e4c6<SEP>chunk-7aa2539edad7b667d56ec7a44037cb45", entity_id:"Caring for Others"}}, {_id:5801, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: x1Neqc9ytqE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x1Neqc9ytqE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A harmonious system where individuals respect and connect with others' well-being, enabling beauty in life.<SEP>A metaphorical system where interconnectedness and respect for others' well-being foster positive outcomes.", created_at:1779531263, source_id:"chunk-c3b39a7ccf4908b1d880b7e4b31351a8<SEP>chunk-f3307407c5f7e2531c4c02a27d0e2d09", entity_id:"Beautiful Ecosystem"}}, {_id:5804, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: x1Neqc9ytqE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x1Neqc9ytqE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An obsessive state prevents individuals from finding love, joy, or prosperity due to its self-focused nature.<SEP>Concepts representing positive aspects of life that require mutual care and connection to manifest.", created_at:1779531263, source_id:"chunk-c3b39a7ccf4908b1d880b7e4b31351a8<SEP>chunk-f3307407c5f7e2531c4c02a27d0e2d09", entity_id:"Love, Joy, Prosperity"}}, {_id:5805, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"A beautiful ecosystem enables the creation of beautiful families, friendships, and nations through mutual respect.", created_at:1779531249, source_id:"chunk-c3b39a7ccf4908b1d880b7e4b31351a8", entity_id:"Beautiful Families, Beautiful Friendships, Beautiful Nations"}}, {_id:5806, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: x1Neqc9ytqE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x1Neqc9ytqE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Symbolic representations of harmonious social structures built through mutual respect and connection.", created_at:1779531263, source_id:"chunk-f3307407c5f7e2531c4c02a27d0e2d09", entity_id:"Beautiful Families, Friendships, Nations"}}, {_id:5807, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"72 billion land animals are killed by humans annually.<SEP>72 billion land animals are killed by humans annually.", created_at:1779531532, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Land Animal Deaths"}}, {_id:5808, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The process of clearing forests, which has led to a 50% reduction in rainforests.<SEP>The process of clearing forests, which has led to a 50% reduction in rainforests.", created_at:1779531532, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Deforestation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5809, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Humanity constitutes only 0.01% of Earth's total biomass.<SEP>Humanity constitutes only 0.01% of Earth's total biomass.", created_at:1779531532, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Humanity's Biomass"}}, {_id:5810, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The phenomenon where 59% of Earth's vertebrates have gone extinct in the last three decades.<SEP>The phenomenon where 59% of Earth's vertebrates have gone extinct in the last three decades.", created_at:1779531532, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Vertebrate Extinction"}}, {_id:5811, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"1.2 trillion aquatic animals are killed by humans annually.<SEP>1.2 trillion aquatic animals are killed by humans annually.", created_at:1779531532, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Aquatic Animal Deaths"}}, {_id:5812, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: p2HecXyM3tE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2HecXyM3tE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The unethical actions of harming Earth's homes and taking excessively from the planet.<SEP>The unethical actions of harming Earth's homes and taking excessively from the planet.<SEP>Adharma describes unethical actions like excessive resource exploitation and harm to ecosystems.<SEP>Adharma describes unethical actions like excessive resource exploitation and harm to ecosystems.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04<SEP>chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546", entity_id:"Adharma"}}, {_id:5813, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The deforestation of 50% of the rainforests is an environmental impact on the Earth.", created_at:1779531587, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Deforestation of 50% of the rainforests"}}, {_id:5814, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Dharma represents the ethical principles of living sustainably and respecting Earth's boundaries.", created_at:1779531587, source_id:"chunk-aa80ceeb1e8b2dd7460f820d674a1d04", entity_id:"Human actions"}}, {_id:5815, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: p2HecXyM3tE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2HecXyM3tE)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Humanity constitutes only 0.01% of the Earth's biomass despite causing massive ecological disruption.<SEP>Humanity constitutes only 0.01% of the Earth's biomass despite causing massive ecological disruption.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546", entity_id:"Earth's Biomass"}}, {_id:5816, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: p2HecXyM3tE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2HecXyM3tE)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Marine life forms such as fish and cephalopods face a mortality rate of 1.2 trillion per year due to human activity.<SEP>Marine life forms such as fish and cephalopods face a mortality rate of 1.2 trillion per year due to human activity.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546", entity_id:"Aquatic Animals"}}, {_id:5817, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: p2HecXyM3tE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2HecXyM3tE)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Land animals include species like mammals and birds, with 72 billion killed annually by humans.<SEP>Land animals include species like mammals and birds, with 72 billion killed annually by humans.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546", entity_id:"Land Animals"}}, {_id:5818, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: p2HecXyM3tE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2HecXyM3tE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vertebrates represent a biological classification of animals with backbones, 59% of which have gone extinct in three decades.<SEP>Vertebrates represent a biological classification of animals with backbones, 59% of which have gone extinct in three decades.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546", entity_id:"Vertebrates"}}, {_id:5819, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: p2HecXyM3tE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2HecXyM3tE)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Rainforests are natural ecosystems that have experienced 50% deforestation due to human activities.<SEP>Rainforests are natural ecosystems that have experienced 50% deforestation due to human activities.", created_at:1779531990, source_id:"chunk-41597711835923a77b9f33543aee1546", entity_id:"Rainforests"}}, {_id:5820, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: cu-Tx7ehQvM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cu-Tx7ehQvM)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"Perception\". The input is a list of JSON objects, each with a \"Description\" field. The descriptions are in plain text. We need to synthesize them into a single, comprehensive, cohesive summary, in plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must not exceed 600 tokens. Must be in English. Must retain proper nouns.

