pt", truncate:"", description:"Practical methods are proposed to address systemic inequalities in justice and health care systems.", created_at:1779536346, source_id:"chunk-41b4e9e0abfc963f768997931ec90fe9", entity_id:"Practical Ways"}}, {_id:5835, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Eric Solheim is described as a man awakened to his Dharma of bringing peace, with his speech and meditation moves the speaker.", created_at:1779536516, source_id:"chunk-a674092e280907c9a7ef3fa28f1ef9b8<SEP>chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557", entity_id:"Eric Solheim"}}, {_id:5836, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pBQ6Sy444o)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Living beings are described as sentient and interconnected in the \"single fabric called life,\" with peace dependent on their collective well-being.<SEP>Living beings are all entities on Earth that would benefit from America?s positive influence.<SEP>All humans and life forms affected by America's global influence.<SEP>Living beings are all entities on Earth that would benefit from America?s positive influence.<SEP>All humans and life forms affected by America's global influence.", created_at:1779721333, source_id:"chunk-a674092e280907c9a7ef3fa28f1ef9b8<SEP>chunk-6f44feb0c73b510c94a19d581648544c<SEP>chunk-be58ce08f202f47f60f3c79e064a2364", entity_id:"Living Beings"}}, {_id:5837, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Gandhiji is referred to as Mahatma Gandhi and is associated with the concept of greed and its impact on Mother Earth.<SEP>Gandhiji is referenced for his quote on greed versus need, highlighting human impact on Earth's resources.<SEP>Gandhiji is referenced for his quote on greed versus need, highlighting human impact on Earth's resources.<SEP>Gandhiji is referenced for his quote on greed versus need, highlighting human impact on Earth's resources.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557<SEP>chunk-c09aade9dbfd355fb478c083ce9dcbcd", entity_id:"Gandhiji"}}, {_id:5838, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Ganesha is a deity in Hinduism, described as half-animal and half-human, and is a great god bringing nature and life together.<SEP>Ganesha is a Hindu deity depicted as half-animal, half-human, representing the integration of nature and life.<SEP>Ganesha is a Hindu deity depicted as half-animal, half-human, representing the integration of nature and life.<SEP>Ganesha is a Hindu deity depicted as half-animal, half-human, representing the integration of nature and life.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557<SEP>chunk-c09aade9dbfd355fb478c083ce9dcbcd", entity_id:"Ganesha"}}, {_id:5839, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Jainism is a religion with the absolute prohibition of killing any living animal, linked to protecting Mother Earth.<SEP>Jainism advocates strict non-violence, prohibiting harm to any living being and emphasizing ecological harmony.<SEP>Jainism advocates strict non-violence, prohibiting harm to any living being and emphasizing ecological harmony.<SEP>Jainism advocates strict non-violence, prohibiting harm to any living being and emphasizing ecological harmony.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557<SEP>chunk-c09aade9dbfd355fb478c083ce9dcbcd", entity_id:"Jainism"}}, {_id:5840, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Islam is a religion where the color green is significant, and it is associated with protecting Mother Earth.<SEP>Islam associates itself with the color green, symbolizing life and sustainability, rooted in desert survival and oasis imagery.<SEP>Islam associates itself with the color green, symbolizing life and sustainability, rooted in desert survival and oasis imagery.<SEP>Islam associates itself with the color green, symbolizing life and sustainability, rooted in desert survival and oasis imagery.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557<SEP>chunk-c09aade9dbfd355fb478c083ce9dcbcd", entity_id:"Islam"}}, {_id:5841, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-engrossment is a state of being unawakened and self-absorbed, leading to dull senses and a lack of sensitivity.", created_at:1779536517, source_id:"chunk-2c155ca915a56ff1bf0ef30ef075e557", entity_id:"Self-engrossment"}}, {_id:5843, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGosHULQQk0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779728441, description:"The greater intelligence of the universe is the universal intelligence that humans connect with through mystic ways, fostering oneness and spiritual alignment.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is something meditation helps tune into, aligning the practitioner with universal wisdom.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is accessed through meditation by opening the heart to universal wisdom.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is something meditation helps tune into, aligning the practitioner with universal wisdom.<SEP>The greater intelligence of the universe is accessed through meditation by opening the heart to universal wisdom.", source_id:"chunk-a674092e280907c9a7ef3fa28f1ef9b8<SEP>chunk-07cef1cacdb43780b9533bba3a4b7ad2<SEP>chunk-e5a191d0b4c345edce809b4d1989b5be", entity_id:"Greater Intelligence of the Universe"}}, {_id:5844, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)<SEP>YouTube Video: RFx74Q6Oq2c (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFx74Q6Oq2c)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Humans and nature are described as interconnected through mystic bonds, fostering universal intelligence.<SEP>Humans are referred to as individuals designed by the universe to be intelligent decision makers, with potential implanted in their brains.", created_at:1779653344, source_id:"chunk-a674092e280907c9a7ef3fa28f1ef9b8<SEP>chunk-6ef6484c9c5864e2092708e409da731a<SEP>chunk-bed30e61f70b382a4a6595c34ba8a934", entity_id:"Humans"}}, {_id:5845, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sensitivity represents the lost human capacity to perceive and respond to nature's needs, critical for addressing the crisis.<SEP>Sensitivity represents the lost human capacity to perceive and respond to nature's needs, critical for addressing the crisis.<SEP>Sensitivity represents the lost human capacity to perceive and respond to nature's needs, critical for addressing the crisis.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-773bb390e5733f45d0f03f5875cbd4a0<SEP>chunk-ea7262ae497f1dc36bddbc40ddb97a59", entity_id:"Sensitivity"}}, {_id:5846, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The crisis of the 21st century stems from humanity's failure to protect Mother Earth and mothers, leading to environmental and societal instability.<SEP>The crisis of the 21st century stems from humanity's failure to protect Mother Earth and mothers, leading to environmental and societal instability.<SEP>The crisis of the 21st century stems from humanity's failure to protect Mother Earth and mothers, leading to environmental and societal instability.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-773bb390e5733f45d0f03f5875cbd4a0", entity_id:"Crisis of the 21st Century"}}, {_id:5847, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Trees, earth, and waters are elements of nature that embody sacredness and require reverence to restore human connection.<SEP>Trees, earth, and waters are elements of nature that embody sacredness and require reverence to restore human connection.<SEP>Trees, earth, and waters are elements of nature that embody sacredness and require reverence to restore human connection.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-773bb390e5733f45d0f03f5875cbd4a0", entity_id:"Trees, Earth, and Waters"}}, {_id:5848, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unawakened beings are described as self-engrossed individuals who lack sensitivity, empathy, and connection to nature.<SEP>Unawakened beings are described as self-engrossed individuals who lack sensitivity, empathy, and connection to nature.<SEP>Unawakened beings are described as self-engrossed individuals who lack sensitivity, empathy, and connection to nature.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-773bb390e5733f45d0f03f5875cbd4a0", entity_id:"Unawakened Beings"}}, {_id:5849, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: yJoWk10CSjg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yJoWk10CSjg)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Eric is a speaker who delivered a speech and meditation emphasizing harmony with Mother Earth and addressing environmental concerns.<SEP>Eric is a speaker who delivered a speech and meditation emphasizing harmony with Mother Earth and addressing environmental concerns.<SEP>Eric is a speaker who delivered a speech and meditation emphasizing harmony with Mother Earth and addressing environmental concerns.", created_at:1779536880, source_id:"chunk-c09aade9dbfd355fb478c083ce9dcbcd", entity_id:"Eric"}}] AS row
