UNWIND [{_id:5872, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Described as a distracted, chaotic mental state where focus and concentration are impossible, linked to beta waves.<SEP>Described as a distracted, chaotic mental state where focus and concentration are impossible, linked to beta waves.<SEP>Described as a distracted, chaotic mental state where focus and concentration are impossible, linked to beta waves.", created_at:1779555023, source_id:"chunk-4c105f1c2d83f8107fb4042d9f1771a7", entity_id:"Monkey Mind State"}}, {_id:5873, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Beta brainwave mode occurs at 13-30/40 cycles per second, associated with stress, distraction, and the \"monkey mind\" state.<SEP>Beta brainwave mode occurs at 13-30/40 cycles per second, associated with stress, distraction, and the \"monkey mind\" state.<SEP>Beta brainwave mode occurs at 13-30/40 cycles per second, associated with stress, distraction, and the \"monkey mind\" state.", created_at:1779555023, source_id:"chunk-4c105f1c2d83f8107fb4042d9f1771a7", entity_id:"Beta Brainwave Mode"}}, {_id:5874, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Archimedes is a historical figure who discovered the principle of buoyancy and solved the problem of determining the purity of the king's crown.<SEP>Historical scientist who discovered buoyancy principles in an enlightened mental state during a bath.<SEP>Historical scientist who discovered buoyancy principles in an enlightened mental state during a bath.<SEP>Archimedes is a historical figure who discovered the principle of buoyancy and solved the problem of determining the purity of the king's crown.<SEP>A court scientist who discovered the principle of buoyancy while solving the crown problem.<SEP>Archimedes is a historical figure known for discovering the principle of buoyancy while in a Theta state.", created_at:1779555055, source_id:"chunk-1da2512b00580b9e23c48d26a05dd048<SEP>chunk-7ae937704ca1201df5ce3ccc8999552d<SEP>chunk-6390a02d03fdb4770463600e69448a2a<SEP>chunk-89dc7d961c53a5116215f981f7e729a5", entity_id:"Archimedes"}}, {_id:5875, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The crown is a golden artifact whose purity Archimedes needed to verify using the principle of water displacement.<SEP>The crown is a golden artifact whose purity Archimedes needed to verify using the principle of water displacement.<SEP>A golden crown suspected of being impure, central to the king's challenge to Archimedes.", created_at:1779555023, source_id:"chunk-1da2512b00580b9e23c48d26a05dd048<SEP>chunk-6390a02d03fdb4770463600e69448a2a", entity_id:"Crown"}}, {_id:5876, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The King is a ruler who set a deadline for solving the problem of the crown's authenticity and feared Archimedes' potential failure.<SEP>The King is a ruler who set a deadline for solving the problem of the crown's authenticity and feared Archimedes' potential failure.<SEP>The King is a ruler who seeks happiness through external means but remains miserable despite having everything he desires.<SEP>The King is an unhappy ruler who seeks happiness through various means but remains miserable despite having everything he desires.<SEP>The King is a ruler who seeks happiness through external means but remains miserable despite having everything he desires.<SEP>King seeks happiness through various means including kingdoms, marriage, children, and a beggar's shirt, yet remains dissatisfied.", created_at:1779559837, source_id:"chunk-1da2512b00580b9e23c48d26a05dd048<SEP>chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836<SEP>chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4<SEP>chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880", entity_id:"King"}}, {_id:5877, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Eureka refers to Archimedes' moment of discovery, marked by him running naked and shouting \"I have found it.\"<SEP>Eureka refers to Archimedes' moment of discovery, marked by him running naked and shouting \"I have found it.\"", created_at:1779554394, source_id:"chunk-1da2512b00580b9e23c48d26a05dd048", entity_id:"Eureka"}}, {_id:5878, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An enlightened brain state refers to a moment of sudden insight or clarity, as experienced by Archimedes when discovering the solution.<SEP>An enlightened brain state refers to a moment of sudden insight or clarity, as experienced by Archimedes when discovering the solution.", created_at:1779554394, source_id:"chunk-1da2512b00580b9e23c48d26a05dd048", entity_id:"Enlightened Brain State"}}, {_id:5880, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The brain functions through five distinct electrical wave patterns that correlate with mental states and cognitive processes.<SEP>The brain functions through five distinct electrical wave patterns that correlate with mental states and cognitive processes.", created_at:1779554395, source_id:"chunk-1da2512b00580b9e23c48d26a05dd048", entity_id:"Five Electrical Wave Patterns"}}, {_id:5882, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: igSp4H0OWLE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=igSp4H0OWLE)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Conscious breathing involves intentional regulation of inhalation and exhalation, practiced for three cycles of breath to induce calmness.<SEP>Conscious Breathing is a breathing technique practiced during the Serene Mind meditation, emphasizing longer exhalations.<SEP>Conscious breathing involves intentional regulation of inhalation and exhalation, practiced for three cycles of breath to induce calmness.<SEP>Conscious Breathing is a breathing technique practiced during the Serene Mind meditation, emphasizing longer exhalations.", created_at:1779551974, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1<SEP>chunk-511a319a40b03fc2d48c14b1ec8da740", entity_id:"Conscious Breathing"}}, {_id:5883, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: igSp4H0OWLE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=igSp4H0OWLE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Flame symbolizes focused attention and inner energy, visualized at the eyebrow center and later moved to the middle of the brain during meditation.<SEP>Flame is a visualized element in the Eyebrow Center during the meditation, symbolizing focus and calm.<SEP>Flame symbolizes focused attention and inner energy, visualized at the eyebrow center and later moved to the middle of the brain during meditation.<SEP>Flame is a visualized element in the Eyebrow Center during the meditation, symbolizing focus and calm.", created_at:1779551974, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1<SEP>chunk-511a319a40b03fc2d48c14b1ec8da740", entity_id:"Flame"}}, {_id:5884, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: igSp4H0OWLE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=igSp4H0OWLE)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Three cycles of breath are practiced during conscious breathing to achieve a serene state.<SEP>Three cycles of breath are practiced during conscious breathing to achieve a serene state.", created_at:1779551973, source_id:"chunk-511a319a40b03fc2d48c14b1ec8da740", entity_id:"Three Cycles of Breath"}}, {_id:5885, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Conscious breathing is a foundational technique for achieving the serene mind state.", created_at:1779552036, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"serene mind practice"}}, {_id:5886, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The flame is initially visualized at the eyebrow center to concentrate attention.", created_at:1779552036, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"eyebrow center"}}, {_id:5887, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Emotions are recognized and observed without attachment during the practice.", created_at:1779552036, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"emotions (irritation, anxiety, etc.)"}}, {_id:5888, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The flame is mentally moved to the brain's center to deepen meditative absorption.", created_at:1779552036, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"middle of the brain"}}, {_id:5889, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Serene mind is practiced when experiencing distraction or disturbance to restore calmness.", created_at:1779552069, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"distraction/disturbance"}}, {_id:5890, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Serene mind helps redirect attention from past regrets or future anxieties to the present.", created_at:1779552069, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"preoccupation with past/future"}}, {_id:5891, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Serene mind serves as a method to consciously return to equilibrium.", created_at:1779552069, source_id:"chunk-48f438418db1330dddb1b4a3303306e1", entity_id:"returning to calm"}}, {_id:5892, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: igSp4H0OWLE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=igSp4H0OWLE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The practice involves recognizing and acknowledging current emotions like irritation, anxiety, or joy.", created_at:1779552070, source_id:"chunk-511a319a40b03fc2d48c14b1ec8da740", entity_id:"emotions"}}, {_id:5893, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"An everyday practice designed to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State (calm, connected, and creative) through conscious observation and breathwork.<SEP>The Abundant Life Practice is an everyday practice to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State: calm, connected, and creative.<SEP>The Abundant Life Practice is an everyday practice to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State: calm, connected, and creative.<SEP>An everyday practice designed to nurture the three dimensions of the Beautiful State (calm, connected, and creative) through conscious observation and breathwork.", created_at:1779552234, source_id:"chunk-43e5b5923e8d509b9e9edf60b61ff56b<SEP>chunk-e0dd55dc92949c274e0507097e274123", entity_id:"Abundant Life Practice"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5894, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A symbolic visualization in the eyebrow center representing abundance and life-enriching energy.<SEP>A symbolic visualization in the eyebrow center representing abundance and life-enriching energy.<SEP>A symbolic golden lotus imagery at the eyebrow center, associated with creating abundance and enriching lives.", created_at:1779552306, source_id:"chunk-43e5b5923e8d509b9e9edf60b61ff56b<SEP>chunk-4c6054ccc3bee7f9d86c600fc50b5dc7", entity_id:"Golden Lotus Blossom"}}, {_id:5895, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", created_at:1779552233, description:"Anatomical location in the body associated with emotional connections and gratitude during the practice.<SEP>The Heart Center is a physical location in the body that can be observed and connected to through rays of light.<SEP>The Heart Center is a physical location in the body that can be observed and connected to through rays of light.<SEP>Anatomical location in the body associated with emotional connections and gratitude during the practice.", source_id:"chunk-43e5b5923e8d509b9e9edf60b61ff56b<SEP>chunk-e0dd55dc92949c274e0507097e274123", entity_id:"Heart Center"}}, {_id:5896, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Rays of Light are used to connect the heart center to people who have impacted one's life.<SEP>Rays of Light are used to connect the heart center to people who have impacted one's life.", created_at:1779552233, source_id:"chunk-e0dd55dc92949c274e0507097e274123", entity_id:"Rays of Light"}}, {_id:5897, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Refers to individuals who have positively influenced the practitioner's life, visualized as connected through light.", created_at:1779552306, source_id:"chunk-4c6054ccc3bee7f9d86c600fc50b5dc7", entity_id:"People Who Have Impacted You"}}, {_id:5898, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: k0GsZxWhjSE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k0GsZxWhjSE)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A symbolic flame visualized in the brain, signifying inner light and readiness to transition from meditation.", created_at:1779552306, source_id:"chunk-4c6054ccc3bee7f9d86c600fc50b5dc7", entity_id:"Flame in the Middle of Your Brain"}}, {_id:5899, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: M_BYTcsLQuY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_BYTcsLQuY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Aham Brahmasmi is a Sanskrit phrase that functions as a mantra and chant, central to Soul Sync practices and meditation. It is interpreted as meaning ?I am the limitless consciousness? and is used to align the practitioner?s self with universal consciousness. The phrase is also recognized as a classical Advaita Vedanta statement, where it conveys the unity of self and universal consciousness, often rendered as ?I am Brahman.?

Despite textual ambiguities, including an unclear original phrase ?Ahamra, Massmen,? the phrase is considered a likely intended expression and is sometimes presented as a philosophical phrase replacing the unclear wording to fit the spiritual context. The phrase thus serves both as a meditative tool and a philosophical declaration of non?dual identity.", created_at:1779665702, source_id:"chunk-6aebd99b80a116244470eacf183c4202<SEP>chunk-61c0437442c1a79367c1612c9b022b8f<SEP>chunk-82784ea8fabb1f9041b72681c23fac84<SEP>chunk-c2e9ff77673d9126b2f975a8e07b2ddc<SEP>chunk-11324ba4a521604eab0a83749fcd1adc", entity_id:"Aham Brahmasmi"}}, {_id:5900, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: M_BYTcsLQuY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_BYTcsLQuY)<SEP>YouTube Video: co9vrSiN8ak (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=co9vrSiN8ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: utRatnFr-S8 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=utRatnFr-S8)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Sourcing Challenge is a multi-day event focused on meditation and self-discovery through daily challenges.<SEP>The Sourcing Challenge is a multi-day event where participants engage in daily challenges, including meditation practices.<SEP>The Sourcing Challenge is a multi-day event where participants engage in daily challenges, including meditation practices.<SEP>The Sourcing Challenge is a structured program with daily challenges, including Day 60 and Day 7, focused on personal growth and meditation.<SEP>The Sourcing Challenge is a daily meditation program focused on spiritual and consciousness exploration, with Day 60 emphasizing discipline and challenge conquest.<SEP>The next stage of the program following the Soul Sync Meditation Challenge.<SEP>The Sourcing Challenge is a multi-day event where participants engage in competitive tasks to master coherent thinking and intelligence.", created_at:1779553350, source_id:"chunk-6aebd99b80a116244470eacf183c4202<SEP>chunk-61c0437442c1a79367c1612c9b022b8f<SEP>chunk