ental existential questions.<SEP>Ancient civilizations are described as revolving around a fundamental question, with their culture, language, and laws centered on this inquiry.<SEP>Ancient civilizations are described as revolving around a fundamental question, with their culture, language, and laws centered on this inquiry.", created_at:1779554038, source_id:"chunk-3e6f8e85a056a83c6e414cc14c74ff99<SEP>chunk-492e2a7d0bab4e9fd6187e7d33317fb3", entity_id:"Ancient Civilizations"}}, {_id:5981, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZaZOJ6gazYM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779726676, description:"Organs were believed to accompany the deceased in the afterlife.<SEP>Organs are biological systems that suffer negative effects from chronic inflammation.<SEP>Organs are biological components discussed in the context of immunity and strength.", source_id:"chunk-0cbe1e9a1fff09e96a2f2e778a059a9c<SEP>chunk-080d730202516ec2f29ea5332581d23c<SEP>chunk-4d2c2c2bc1a2c6fb294c7b3635af1d45", entity_id:"Organs"}}, {_id:5982, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Chinese civilization explored philosophical questions about cycles, duality, and harmony.<SEP>Chinese Civilization is an ancient civilization that explored questions about cyclical changes in order, disorder, and life cycles.", created_at:1779554046, source_id:"chunk-0cbe1e9a1fff09e96a2f2e778a059a9c<SEP>chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8", entity_id:"Chinese Civilization"}}, {_id:5983, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The yin and yang sign symbolizes duality and cyclical balance in Chinese philosophy.<SEP>The yin and yang sign symbolizes the philosophical concept of opposing forces containing seeds of each other, representing cyclical harmony.", created_at:1779554064, source_id:"chunk-0cbe1e9a1fff09e96a2f2e778a059a9c<SEP>chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74", entity_id:"Yin and Yang Sign"}}, {_id:5984, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The Indus and Saraswati Rivers are geographical landmarks linked to ancient Indian civilization.<SEP>The land between the Indus and Saraswati Rivers is where Ancient Indians lived and explored philosophical questions.", created_at:1779554093, source_id:"chunk-0cbe1e9a1fff09e96a2f2e778a059a9c<SEP>chunk-b45f3a725ee597bc7f79c1f42e7fee1d", entity_id:"Indus and Saraswati Rivers"}}, {_id:5986, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The hourglass held by Shiva symbolizes his mastery over time and existence in the eternal present, unaffected by past or future.", created_at:1779553605, source_id:"chunk-d84a2ad7d8a1b6191ff06ebd1365b495", entity_id:"Hourglass"}}, {_id:5987, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The 16-petaled lotus at the throat chakra represents Vishuddhi energy, signifying peace with life's flow and zero resistance.", created_at:1779553605, source_id:"chunk-d84a2ad7d8a1b6191ff06ebd1365b495", entity_id:"Lotus with 16 Petals"}}, {_id:5988, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The God of Desire symbolizes worldly temptations, destroyed by Shiva through spiritual awakening.", created_at:1779553633, source_id:"chunk-54918f489339662d08104fe4bc09ec58", entity_id:"God of Desire"}}, {_id:5989, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Shivratri is a celebration that serves as a reminder of the potential to be enlightened, symbolizing the journey towards liberation.<SEP>Shivratri is a celebration that serves as a reminder of the potential to be enlightened, symbolizing the journey towards liberation.", created_at:1779554038, source_id:"chunk-492e2a7d0bab4e9fd6187e7d33317fb3", entity_id:"Shivratri"}}, {_id:5990, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shivoham is a mantra and a state of consciousness, serving as a reminder of one's potential to be enlightened and to shed emotional charges from the past.<SEP>Shivoham is a mantra and a state of consciousness, serving as a reminder of one's potential to be enlightened and to shed emotional charges from the past.", created_at:1779554038, source_id:"chunk-492e2a7d0bab4e9fd6187e7d33317fb3", entity_id:"Shivoham"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:5991, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Questions about the afterlife, including the fate of possessions and companions, were central to ancient Egyptian beliefs.", created_at:1779554046, source_id:"chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8", entity_id:"Questions About Afterlife"}}, {_id:5992, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Yin and Yang is a philosophical concept representing the duality and interdependence of opposing forces, central to Chinese thought.<SEP>Yin and Yang represent duality and balance in Chinese philosophy.<SEP>Yin and Yang represent duality and balance in Chinese philosophy.<SEP>Yin and Yang are ancient Chinese concepts symbolizing balance and duality in nature and humanity.<SEP>Yin and Yang are ancient Chinese philosophical concepts representing balance and harmony.", created_at:1779558267, source_id:"chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8<SEP>chunk-f11387cad436a638d2f57c99446730e6<SEP>chunk-15d974d0f7ea61a65c9e59608b247634<SEP>chunk-38e5df82ff329a0c35a595f234ec25a0", entity_id:"Yin and Yang"}}, {_id:5993, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Questions about the cyclical nature of order, disorder, and life cycles were central to Chinese philosophical reflections.", created_at:1779554046, source_id:"chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8", entity_id:"Questions About Order and Disorder"}}, {_id:5994, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Ancient Egyptians are a civilization that grappled with questions about the afterlife and prepared for it by burying possessions and servants.", created_at:1779554046, source_id:"chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8", entity_id:"Ancient Egyptians"}}, {_id:5995, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chinese civilization studied cyclical changes in phenomena such as fame/defame, weak/strong dynamics, and seasonal cycles.", created_at:1779554046, source_id:"chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8", entity_id:"Cyclical Transformations"}}, {_id:5996, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Ancient Egyptians practiced burying possessions, servants, and jewelry with the deceased to accompany them to the afterlife.", created_at:1779554046, source_id:"chunk-2d73de251326fca4fb5294aa59b11bf8", entity_id:"Burial Practices"}}, {_id:5997, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Modern civilization is characterized by a focus on maximizing profit, efficiency, and pleasure through material gains.", created_at:1779554064, source_id:"chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74", entity_id:"Modern Civilization"}}, {_id:5998, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The underlying question of modern civilization revolves around achieving maximum profit with minimal effort and time.", created_at:1779554064, source_id:"chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74", entity_id:"Question of Modern Civilization"}}, {_id:5999, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Billboards are physical manifestations of modern civilization's profit-driven advertisements.", created_at:1779554064, source_id:"chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74", entity_id:"Billboards"}}, {_id:6000, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Advertisements reflect modern civilization's emphasis on profit and consumerism.", created_at:1779554064, source_id:"chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74", entity_id:"Advertisements"}}, {_id:6002, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The yin and yang sign illustrates the interdependence of opposing forces and cyclical transitions between them.", created_at:1779554065, source_id:"chunk-833c73287ea461916c12ac0516e36f74<SEP>chunk-289fa3c790540a34a24858f5f191d9ca", entity_id:"Opposites"}}, {_id:6003, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"An aged individual reflecting on the transient nature of the body and the permanence of consciousness.", created_at:1779554092, source_id:"chunk-6d556ad8b74e04409555169154f3886c", entity_id:"Aged Person"}}, {_id:6004, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The unchanging awareness that observes all experiences and identities without being bound by them.", created_at:1779554092, source_id:"chunk-6d556ad8b74e04409555169154f3886c", entity_id:"Underlying Consciousness"}}, {_id:6005, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The unchanging self beyond the dissolving body and transient experiences, considered the true identity.", created_at:1779554092, source_id:"chunk-6d556ad8b74e04409555169154f3886c", entity_id:"Real 'I'"}}, {_id:6006, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sharira refers to the dissolving and changing physical body, symbolizing impermanence and contrast with the unchanging consciousness.<SEP>Sharira refers to the body, described as something that dissolves and changes shape over time.", created_at:1779554093, source_id:"chunk-6d556ad8b74e04409555169154f3886c<SEP>chunk-b45f3a725ee597bc7f79c1f42e7fee1d", entity_id:"Sharira"}}, {_id:6007, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Positions and relationships are transient social constructs that come and go, dismissed as untrue self-definitions.", created_at:1779554092, source_id:"chunk-6d556ad8b74e04409555169154f3886c", entity_id:"Positions and Relationships"}}, {_id:6008, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Experiences such as anger, fear, love, pleasure, and satiation are transient and arise/cease in the mind.<SEP>Experiences are events or events that gain significance when processed through enlightened awareness.", created_at:1779556161, source_id:"chunk-6d556ad8b74e04409555169154f3886c<SEP>chunk-6d16539213ab1e4cb0268da2ab5977c1", entity_id:"Experiences"}}, {_id:6009, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Hindu civilization focused on exploring the question of self-identity and consciousness over thousands of years.", created_at:1779554093, source_id:"chunk-b45f3a725ee597bc7f79c1f42e7fee1d", entity_id:"Hindu civilization"}}, {_id:6010, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"ung people and adults are described as not focused on skill development, learning, or correct decision-making but prioritizing money-making.", created_at:1779554093, source_id:"chunk-b45f3a725ee597bc7f79c1f42e7fee1d", entity_id:"ung people and adults"}}, {_id:6011, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: CrZuPkgwA6Q (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CrZuPkgwA6Q)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Starlight is mentioned in the context of questioning self-awareness and perception.", created_at:1779554093, source_id:"chunk-b45f3a725ee597bc7f79c1f42e7fee1d", entity_id:"Starlight"}}] AS row
