{\\\"Description\\\": \\\"We need to produce a comprehensive, cohesive summary of the entity \\\\\\\"Aggressive Ambition\\\\\\\\\\\"\". Actually the input list is:<SEP>Aggressive Ambition is a negative trait where a leader prioritizes power through self-centered motives.", created_at:1779719900, source_id:"chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d<SEP>chunk-4da1e45ca993decf20ec10e31d56d36e<SEP>chunk-e22181d45ff680a216a2e1e3bb46c19d", entity_id:"Aggressive Ambition"}}, {_id:6298, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Outward anger expressions include picking fights, shouting, violence, breaking things, road rage, and walking out on people, representing visible manifestations of anger.", created_at:1779557412, source_id:"chunk-bd994984ac776d12f863ed3100d9ce68", entity_id:"Outward Anger Expressions"}}, {_id:6299, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Suppressed anger refers to internalized anger that manifests as chronic disease, addiction, or destructive energy, often transforming into harmful behaviors like stealing, anorexia, or substance abuse.", created_at:1779557412, source_id:"chunk-bd994984ac776d12f863ed3100d9ce68", entity_id:"Suppressed Anger"}}, {_id:6300, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chronic disease is described as a potential outcome of suppressed anger, where internalized anger becomes destructive energy harming oneself and others over time.", created_at:1779557412, source_id:"chunk-bd994984ac776d12f863ed3100d9ce68", entity_id:"Chronic Disease"}}, {_id:6301, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The pressure cooker metaphor symbolizes suppressed anger building internally like steam, which eventually bursts out.", created_at:1779557412, source_id:"chunk-bd994984ac776d12f863ed3100d9ce68", entity_id:"Pressure Cooker"}}, {_id:6302, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Societal norms historically suppressed women's spiritual potential, equating enlightenment with masculinity.", created_at:1779557441, source_id:"chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d", entity_id:"Historical Suppression"}}, {_id:6303, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Societal norms historically suppressed women's spiritual potential, equating enlightenment with masculinity.", created_at:1779557442, source_id:"chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d", entity_id:"Women's Spirituality"}}, {_id:6304, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Women's brain structure enables rapid transitions from logic to mystical states, enhancing intuitive decision-making.", created_at:1779557443, source_id:"chunk-30bdabdce129add775eb3da51d3ffd8d", entity_id:"Mystic Dimension"}}, {_id:6305, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Destructive energy is described as harmful, causing physical and emotional harm to individuals and others, linked to health risks like heart attacks and strokes.<SEP>Destructive energy is described as harmful, causing physical and emotional harm to individuals and others, linked to health risks like heart attacks and strokes.", created_at:1779558040, source_id:"chunk-19097bf7d5cd386b3cd384082e7f375d", entity_id:"Destructive Energy"}}, {_id:6306, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Heart attack risk doubles within two hours of an angry outburst, as per cited health research.<SEP>Heart attack risk doubles within two hours of an angry outburst, as per cited health research.", created_at:1779558040, source_id:"chunk-19097bf7d5cd386b3cd384082e7f375d", entity_id:"Heart Attack"}}, {_id:6308, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Harvard University scientists conducted research on anger's physiological effects, including immunoglobulin A levels.<SEP>Harvard University scientists conducted research on anger's physiological effects, including immunoglobulin A levels.", created_at:1779558040, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-19097bf7d5cd386b3cd384082e7f375d", entity_id:"Harvard University"}}, {_id:6309, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Repressed anger is an unbearable emotional state that triggers destructive behaviors, including addiction and depression.<SEP>Repressed anger is an unbearable emotional state that triggers destructive behaviors, including addiction and depression.", created_at:1779558040, source_id:"chunk-19097bf7d5cd386b3cd384082e7f375d", entity_id:"Repressed Anger"}}, {_id:6310, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)<SEP>YouTube Video: Lst4MvxPCx4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lst4MvxPCx4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stroke risk triples post-anger outburst due to blood clots or brain bleeding, per health studies.<SEP>Stroke risk triples post-anger outburst due to blood clots or brain bleeding, per health studies.<SEP>A medical event often triggered by high blood pressure and other excess-related factors.", created_at:1779562483, source_id:"chunk-19097bf7d5cd386b3cd384082e7f375d<SEP>chunk-458ec7ed8021b6846b23a3c0fa7e9821", entity_id:"Stroke"}}, {_id:6311, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Immunoglobulin A is an antibody critical for immune defense, with levels dropping after recalling angry experiences.<SEP>Immunoglobulin A is an antibody critical for immune defense, with levels dropping after recalling angry experiences.", created_at:1779558040, source_id:"chunk-19097bf7d5cd386b3cd384082e7f375d", entity_id:"Immunoglobulin A"}}, {_id:6312, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Bloody revolutions are historical events driven by anger and violence, leading to negative outcomes.", created_at:1779557464, source_id:"chunk-9d6f79b5d9addaa1bb7ed5a41e6ca13e<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b<SEP>chunk-fdbf9aca2a79a0d5bef7d0b7c7804d67", entity_id:"Bloody Revolutions"}}, {_id:6313, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Theater here refers to the performative aspect of anger, creating superficial changes.", created_at:1779557464, source_id:"chunk-fdbf9aca2a79a0d5bef7d0b7c7804d67", entity_id:"Theater"}}, {_id:6315, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Monster symbolizes the destructive transformation caused by sustained anger.", created_at:1779557464, source_id:"chunk-fdbf9aca2a79a0d5bef7d0b7c7804d67", entity_id:"Monster"}}, {_id:6316, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Solid action is questioned as a constructive use of anger for personal progress.<SEP>Solid action is questioned as a constructive use of anger for personal progress