lightenment.", created_at:1779670978, source_id:"chunk-a9818a0388e6c7fbe12a262f4b70178a<SEP>chunk-8afdbda86ff5c184cd2f7d6fbf294ca1", entity_id:"Realization"}}, {_id:6322, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Crude or sophisticated represents a contrast in the intensity or presentation of anger, indicating whether it is raw or refined in its expression.", created_at:1779558050, source_id:"chunk-a9818a0388e6c7fbe12a262f4b70178a", entity_id:"Crude or Sophisticated"}}, {_id:6323, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Expressive or suppressive describes the dual nature of anger, contrasting overt emotional display with internalized restraint.", created_at:1779558050, source_id:"chunk-a9818a0388e6c7fbe12a262f4b70178a", entity_id:"Expressive or Suppressive"}}, {_id:6324, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The conscious decision to release anger and blame, enabling emotional freedom and transformation.", created_at:1779558115, source_id:"chunk-04a5cce20e9ca029b1d885a9ee7c4ec6", entity_id:"Letting Go of Anger"}}, {_id:6325, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The monkey's mind serves as a metaphor for the human tendency to cling to anger and blame others, illustrating lack of freedom.", created_at:1779558115, source_id:"chunk-04a5cce20e9ca029b1d885a9ee7c4ec6", entity_id:"Monkey's Mind"}}, {_id:6326, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-harm resulting from clinging to anger, where individuals inflict emotional or psychological damage on themselves through persistent resentment.", created_at:1779558115, source_id:"chunk-04a5cce20e9ca029b1d885a9ee7c4ec6", entity_id:"Self-Hurt"}}, {_id:6327, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Freedom from anger is a concept involving liberation from anger through self-awareness, acceptance of inner truth, and the practice of Syrian mind meditation.", created_at:1779558122, source_id:"chunk-10353e11213908c6dce7cb7f38908ef1", entity_id:"Freedom From Anger"}}, {_id:6328, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Anger circuits refer to neural pathways or patterns in the brain associated with anger, which Syrian mind meditation aims to disrupt.", created_at:1779558122, source_id:"chunk-10353e11213908c6dce7cb7f38908ef1<SEP>chunk-9dcd575f5f6aeb9b5b2721f919d303c4", entity_id:"Anger Circuits"}}, {_id:6329, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Destructive emotions like fear and sorrow can be transmitted biologically across three generations through cellular mechanisms.<SEP>Destructive emotions such as fear that can be transmitted across generations through genetic information.", created_at:1779558215, source_id:"chunk-9dcd575f5f6aeb9b5b2721f919d303c4<SEP>chunk-bd811e9228f9bfc5269083708f8eb416", entity_id:"Destructive Emotions"}}, {_id:6335, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: DmzZPgTh7_M (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmzZPgTh7_M)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Janani signifies the maternal or creative aspect of women's consciousness.<SEP>Symbolizing the mother archetype and its biological/spiritual connection to nurturing and sacrifice.", created_at:1779558312, source_id:"chunk-3