906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"Sage"}}, {_id:6352, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The Soldiers are the King's men who search for a happy individual to fulfill the Sage's condition.<SEP>The Soldiers are responsible for searching for a happy man as per the Sage's solution.<SEP>The Soldiers are the King's men who search for a happy individual to fulfill the Sage's condition.", created_at:1779559811, source_id:"chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836<SEP>chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"Soldiers"}}, {_id:6353, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The Happy Man is a man found in the wilderness who embodies joy and contentment, contrasting the King's dissatisfaction.<SEP>The Happy Man is a man found in the wilderness who embodies joy and contentment, contrasting the King's dissatisfaction.", created_at:1779559811, source_id:"chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836", entity_id:"Happy Man"}}, {_id:6355, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The Shirt is a symbolic object representing the King's misguided pursuit of happiness through material means.<SEP>The shirt is an artifact that the man never owned.<SEP>The Shirt is a symbolic object representing the King's misguided pursuit of happiness through material means.", created_at:1779559811, source_id:"chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836<SEP>chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"Shirt"}}, {_id:6356, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"group", truncate:"", description:"The Kingdom's People are the subjects of the King, all of whom are found to have hidden griefs or unfulfilled desires.<SEP>The Kingdom's People are the subjects of the King, all of whom are found to have hidden griefs or unfulfilled desires.", created_at:1779559811, source_id:"chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836", entity_id:"Kingdom's People"}}, {_id:6357, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Eye Consciousness is a state of divided, separated, self?centered awareness marked by destructive emotions such as anger and stress, feelings of loneliness, and persistent judgments. It is characterized by internal conflict and a preoccupation with the self, which limits an individual's perception of interconnectedness with others and the broader environment.

This condition drives a perception in which people view others as competitors or enemies, fostering disturbance, anxiety, and heightened stress. The resulting state is a fragmented consciousness that separates the self from others, leading to a sense of isolation and a distorted view of relationships. Overall, Eye Consciousness reflects a self?centered, conflicted mindset that undermines holistic awareness and promotes negative interpersonal dynamics.", created_at:1779647095, source_id:"chunk-f72de7c8d762c18a6655f15c49149836<SEP>chunk-7dca0f22171b9785fbbab01b79ee3fa3<SEP>chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02<SEP>chunk-5750a413a72601ce81e6195a148e09ad<SEP>chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6<SEP>chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c", entity_id:"Eye Consciousness"}}, {_id:6358, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Steel Company in Brazil is a manufacturing enterprise that faced financial challenges in 2016 but recovered through transformative practices.`<SEP>Steel Company in Brazil is a manufacturing enterprise that faced financial challenges in 2016 but recovered through transformative practices.`<SEP>A Brazilian steel company that faced severe challenges in 2016 due to economic factors and China?s reduced steel imports.", created_at:1779560072, source_id:"chunk-d18ebd8ed5109a40c69cb7a69ecd8f61<SEP>chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2", entity_id:"Steel Company in Brazil"}}, {_id:6359, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Magical Zone refers to a realm of heightened awareness where limitations dissolve, enabling extraordinary achievements and synchronicities.`<SEP>Magical Zone refers to a realm of heightened awareness where limitations dissolve, enabling extraordinary achievements and synchronicities.`<SEP>A transcendent realm where synchronicities and effortless alignment with intentions occur.", created_at:1779560342, source_id:"chunk-d18ebd8ed5109a40c69cb7a69ecd8f61<SEP>chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf", entity_id:"Magical Zone"}}, {_id:6360, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Driverless cars are autonomous vehicles designed to operate without human intervention.<SEP>Driverless cars are autonomous vehicles designed to operate without human intervention.<SEP>Driverless cars are automated vehicles operating without human drivers, exemplifying AI's impact on transportation.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Driverless Cars"}}, {_id:6361, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Automated checkouts are self-service retail systems that reduce the need for human staff.<SEP>Automated checkouts are self-service retail systems that reduce the need for human staff.<SEP>Automated checkouts are self-service systems replacing human cashiers, illustrating AI's role in retail.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Automated Checkouts"}}, {_id:6362, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Robo office assistants are automated tools that perform administrative tasks in workplaces.<SEP>Robo office assistants are automated tools that perform administrative tasks in workplaces.<SEP>Robo office assistants are AI-driven tools automating administrative tasks, reducing human labor in workplaces.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Robo Office Assistants"}}, {_id:6363, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Chefless kitchens are food preparation spaces operated by machines without human chefs.<SEP>Chefless kitchens are food preparation spaces operated by machines without human chefs.<SEP>Chefless kitchens use AI for food preparation, minimizing human intervention in culinary processes.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Chefless Kitchens"}}, {_id:6364, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Robo waitresses are robotic servers that assist in food service without human interaction.<SEP>Robo waitresses are robotic servers that assist in food service without human interaction.<SEP>Robo waitresses are AI-powered service robots replacing human staff in hospitality.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d<SEP>chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Robo Waitresses"}}] AS row
