 King happy without success.", created_at:1779559809, source_id:"chunk-3f35ef057620d3747f3f79daa132d83a<SEP>chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"Musicians"}}, {_id:6372, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Dancers were employed to entertain the king but could not alleviate his unhappiness.<SEP>The Dancers are entertainers who tried to bring joy to the King but failed.", created_at:1779559809, source_id:"chunk-3f35ef057620d3747f3f79daa132d83a<SEP>chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"Dancers"}}, {_id:6374, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Man in Wilderness is a person who was found in the wilderness laughing uncontrollably and became the focus of the King's quest for happiness.", created_at:1779559809, source_id:"chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"Man in Wilderness"}}, {_id:6375, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The High Throne is an artifact that the King associates with his belief in happiness.", created_at:1779559810, source_id:"chunk-2906abe5180c989f9b833008109705f4", entity_id:"High Throne"}}, {_id:6376, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b-MkLkpTeVY)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Beggar is referenced in the context of the King's quest for happiness, though the beggar lacked a shirt.<SEP>The beggar is a character in the text, receiving compassionate acts and serving as the focal point of the compassion discussion.<SEP>The beggar is an individual in the example who receives potential help, illustrating the application of compassion.<SEP>The beggar is an individual in the example who receives potential help, illustrating the application of compassion.<SEP>The beggar is a character in the text, receiving compassionate acts and serving as the focal point of the compassion discussion.", created_at:1779721151, source_id:"chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880<SEP>chunk-56e6dfdbd728360a59cb27db0201ee18<SEP>chunk-951a949f1bbe6eebf76242a6f74be25b", entity_id:"Beggar"}}, {_id:6377, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Bigger Kingdom is one of the King's pursuits for happiness, ultimately unfulfilling.", created_at:1779559838, source_id:"chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880", entity_id:"Bigger Kingdom"}}, {_id:6378, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Beautiful Queen represents another pursuit of the King's happiness, which fails to satisfy.", created_at:1779559838, source_id:"chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880", entity_id:"Beautiful Queen"}}, {_id:6379, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The Happy Beggar's Shirt symbolizes the King's final unfulfilled desire for happiness.", created_at:1779559838, source_id:"chunk-ff3e80d959eda2affcf9fb1d2dff2880", entity_id:"Happy Beggar's Shirt"}}, {_id:6380, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Practicing Oneness consciousness activates cellular cooperation for physical healing and stress reduction.", created_at:1779559843, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d", entity_id:"Health Improvement"}}, {_id:6381, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Awakening Oneness consciousness fosters a reciprocal relationship with the universe for guidance and support.", created_at:1779559843, source_id:"chunk-a0046775dcffdb1de7b7527ea2dfaa5d", entity_id:"Connection with Universe"}}, {_id:6382, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ego Consciousness is described as a destructive state of consciousness focused on self-obsession and limited identity.", created_at:1779559889, source_id:"chunk-7dca0f22171b9785fbbab01b79ee3fa3", entity_id:"Ego Consciousness"}}, {_id:6383, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"These are emotional states linked to Eye Consciousness, marked by obsessive self-focus and limited perspective.", created_at:1779559889, source_id:"chunk-7dca0f22171b9785fbbab01b79ee3fa3", entity_id:"States of Anger/Stress/Loneliness"}}, {_id:6384, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"One Consciousness is described as a constructive state fostering unity and positive change.", created_at:1779559890, source_id:"chunk-7dca0f22171b9785fbbab01b79ee3fa3", entity_id:"Constructive Impact"}}, {_id:6385, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Endurance is a state of Oneness Consciousness reflecting resilience and perseverance.<SEP>Endurance is a state of Oneness Consciousness reflecting resilience and perseverance.", created_at:1779560012, source_id:"chunk-5d0f74c4239eabf7a6fea87da28be5d8<SEP>chunk-feadf97235c8f111320838dcf92b6b01", entity_id:"Endurance"}}, {_id:6386, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"One is Consciousness is a philosophical concept representing universal awareness and unity, described as fostering cooperation, creativity, and harmony.", created_at:1779560072, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2", entity_id:"One is Consciousness"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:6387, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Organizations with an ecosystem are structured to sustain creativity and innovation through interconnected systems, as envisioned by One is Consciousness.", created_at:1779560072, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2", entity_id:"Organizations with an Ecosystem"}}, {_id:6388, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The Committee of Nations is a collective body where One is Consciousness manifests as global harmony and resource-sharing.", created_at:1779560072, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2", entity_id:"Committee of Nations"}}, {_id:6389, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Magical Action is described as a field enabling immense power to alter systems and create abundance through conscious intention.<SEP>Magical Action is described as a field enabling immense power to alter systems and create abundance through conscious intention.", created_at:1779560221, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e", entity_id:"Magical Action"}}, {_id:6390, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Two sales people promoted the company?s produce, driving unexpected growth through dedication and Soul Sync practice.<SEP>Two sales people promoted the company?s produce, driving unexpected growth through dedication and Soul Sync practice.", created_at:1779560221, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e", entity_id:"Sales People"}}, {_id:6391, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dysfunctional System represents structures requiring transformation, which leadership can address through Oneness Consciousness.<SEP>Dysfunctional System represents structures requiring transformation, which leadership can address through Oneness Consciousness.", created_at:1779560224, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e", entity_id:"Dysfunctional System"}}, {_id:6392, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Joyful Surprise describes the employees' reaction to the company's miraculous growth despite minimal advertising efforts.<SEP>Joyful Surprise describes the employees' reaction to the company's miraculous growth despite minimal advertising efforts.", created_at:1779560222, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e", entity_id:"Joyful Surprise"}}, {_id:6393, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The company?s decline was caused by economic challenges and China?s withdrawal from Brazilian steel imports.", created_at:1779560119, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2", entity_id:"Economic Factors"}}, {_id:6407, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The collective environment and values within an organization shaped by leadership.", created_at:1779560342, source_id:"chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf", entity_id:"Organizational Culture"}}, {_id:6408, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A harmonious energy connecting all elements in the universe.", created_at:1779560342, source_id:"chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf", entity_id:"Magical Flow of Life"}}, {_id:6409, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The chaotic, unstructured nature of reality that resolves into patterns for aligned individuals.", created_at:1779560342, source_id:"chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf", entity_id:"Random Universe"}}, {_id:6410, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The rapid speed of global change and societal evolution.", created_at:1779560342, source_id:"chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf", entity_id:"Accelerating Pace"}}, {_id:6411, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Stressful consciousness directly influences human actions, leading to reactive or pressured decisions.", created_at:1779560378, source_id:"chunk-a6934bb5f3e6b9a7dbc975f40692be35", entity_id:"Actions/Choices"}}, {_id:6412, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Technician-less lab tests are automated diagnostic systems reducing reliance on human medical professionals.", created_at:1779560419, source_id:"chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Technician-Less Lab Tests"}}, {_id:6414, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The generation of human beings exhibits diminished attention spans and excitement compared to monkeys, influenced by technology and social media.", created_at:1779560420, source_id:"chunk-1b2894d7e044a8fc57ea102bdd508b16", entity_id:"Generation of Human Beings"}}, {_id:6415, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The healing zone refers to a state where the body?s cells synchronize harmoniously for recovery.<SEP>The healing zone is a state where the body enters harmony through the synchronized activity of its cells.", created_at:1779560467, source_id:"chunk-d89831c29a65e71a84017ad0bb3212c4<SEP>chunk-ffdd34b0438c947d32b8b2d304f135c4", entity_id:"Healing Zone"}}, {_id:6416, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Lungs are a biological organ in the human body, referenced in the context of shrinking due to stress and anxiety.", created_at:1779560423, source_id:"chunk-f1fcfd5a753f74e11984fed8934aec32<SEP>chunk-d89831c29a65e71a84017ad0bb3212c4", entity_id:"Lungs"}}, {_id:6417, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Deep breathing is a technique involving inhaling consciously to calm the mind and prepare for daily practices aimed at expanding connection.", created_at:1779560464, source_id:"chunk-24179c364db0fb884a0fd4e2f2818e29", entity_id:"Deep Breaths"}}, {_id:6418, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"This method involves dedicating three minutes daily in the early morning to deep breathing, reflection on loving experiences, and connecting with the universe to foster oneness.", created_at:1779560464, source_id:"chunk-24179c364db0fb884a0fd4e2f2818e29", entity_id:"Three-Minute Daily Practice"}}, {_id:6419, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Loving experiences refer to past moments where one felt completely loved, understood, appreciated, or accepted, used as a focus during consciousness practices.", created_at:1779560464, source_id:"chunk-24179c364db0fb884a0fd4e2f2818e29", entity_id:"Loving Experiences"}}, {_id:6420, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Intimate relationships are connections between individuals that can transform through mutual understanding and expanded consciousness.", created_at:1779560467, source_id:"chunk-ffdd34b0438c947d32b8b2d304f135c4", entity_id:"Intimate Relationships"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:6421, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)<SEP>YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Circumference metaphorically represents an individual's social and emotional boundaries, which influence connection with the universe.<SEP>Circumference is the original term that was corrected to Consciousness.<SEP>Original term in the text later replaced by \"consciousness\" to better convey the intended meaning.<SEP>Original term in the text later replaced by \"consciousness\" to better convey the intended meaning.", created_at:1779656973, source_id:"chunk-ffdd34b0438c947d32b8b2d304f135c4<SEP>chunk-5df138751f09bcc9c4d02f158a5b7e22<SEP>chunk-c95a104d9da85092c5bc85a30cbd4162<SEP>chunk-237a65ae546a2543e175242df87d7879", entity_id:"Circumference"}}, {_id:6422, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The defensive shell symbolizes emotional or psychological barriers that protect the heart, hindering openness and connection.", created_at:1779560467, source_id:"chunk-ffdd34b0438c947d32b8b2d304f135c4", entity_id:"Defensive Shell"}}, {_id:6423, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Method involving reliving past love experiences to enhance connection and brain activity.", created_at:1779560549, source_id:"chunk-7ce8fefcf62e47ed9c0240fe4b1abc3e", entity_id:"Practice of Heartfelt Connection"}}, {_id:6424, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Brain region associated with cognitive functions and emotional processing.", created_at:1779560549, source_id:"chunk-7ce8fefcf62e47ed9c0240fe4b1abc3e", entity_id:"Mid Prefrontal Cortex"}}, {_id:6425, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Brain region involved in emotional and social cognition.", created_at:1779560549, source_id:"chunk-7ce8fefcf62e47ed9c0240fe4b1abc3e", entity_id:"Anterior Singulate"}}, {_id:6426, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Loving conversation is a communication practice involving non-judgmental listening and compassionate engagement to foster emotional connection and resolve conflicts.<SEP>Loving conversation is a communication practice involving non-judgmental listening and compassionate engagement to foster emotional connection and resolve conflicts.<SEP>Loving conversation is a spiritual art involving non-judgment, compassion, and self-awareness to foster understanding and resolve conflicts.", created_at:1779561300, source_id:"chunk-8c0f80d81b49972daf18e0b85888c919<SEP>chunk-1b0c6f6cf5b3451d482de925f92b2a15<SEP>chunk-a35e19231d7bd0423fa3c980dbea5e47", entity_id:"Loving Conversation"}}, {_id:6427, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779561300, description:"Negative bias refers to the human brain's propensity to prioritize negative experiences and threats over positive ones, rooted in evolutionary survival mechanisms.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the human brain's propensity to prioritize negative experiences and threats over positive ones, rooted in evolutionary survival mechanisms.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the brain's tendency toward pessimistic interpretations, mitigated through awareness and observation.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the brain's tendency toward pessimistic interpretations, mitigated through awareness and observation.<SEP>Negative bias refers to the brain's tendency toward pessimism or stress, which can be mitigated through meditation and mindful communication.", source_id:"chunk-1b0c6f6cf5b3451d482de925f92b2a15<SEP>chunk-2c9bcdcac30e6029287eee4161a0477b<SEP>chunk-a35e19231d7bd0423fa3c980dbea5e47", entity_id:"Negative Bias"}}, {_id:6428, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Blissfulness describes a state of profound joy and contentment achievable through enlightened consciousness and mental clarity.<SEP>Blissfulness describes a state of profound joy and contentment achievable through enlightened consciousness and mental clarity.", created_at:1779560592, source_id:"chunk-1b0c6f6cf5b3451d482de925f92b2a15<SEP>chunk-9645fe2118f4e6de1b034351a972ae59", entity_id:"Blissfulness"}}, {_id:6429, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Creative force is portrayed as a dynamic energy interacting with self to manifest in lived experiences.<SEP>Creative force is portrayed as a dynamic energy interacting with self to manifest in lived experiences.<SEP>A dynamic energy described as flowing into one's life through the \"new sense of self,\" enabling transformative creativity.", created_at:1779561559, source_id:"chunk-d3b0ed6747a54a9af9e558b6935aa651<SEP>chunk-543b676160d9abe4d6b5b39e255b3f9d", entity_id:"Creative Force"}}, {_id:6430, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Negative incidents refer to unpleasant or dangerous events that the human brain prioritizes remembering for survival purposes.", created_at:1779560635, source_id:"chunk-4d55dfbe4972cfb9a0847506f1eaa432", entity_id:"Negative Incidents"}}, {_id:6431, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphorical example illustrating how ancient humans needed to remember threats for survival.", created_at:1779560635, source_id:"chunk-4d55dfbe4972cfb9a0847506f1eaa432", entity_id:"Tiger on a Tree"}}, {_id:6432, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Positive memories are joyful or beautiful experiences that the human brain struggles to retain compared to negative ones.", created_at:1779560635, source_id:"chunk-4d55dfbe4972cfb9a0847506f1eaa432", entity_id:"Positive Memories"}}, {_id:6433, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Fruit-bearing trees symbolize non-critical resources in ancient survival contexts.", created_at:1779560691, source_id:"chunk-729a868fcc915b32e3804866576c1ee4", entity_id:"Fruit-Bearing Tree"}}, {_id:6434, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Modern Times refers to contemporary human civilization with reduced physical threats but persistent mental stressors.", created_at:1779560691, source_id:"chunk-729a868fcc915b32e3804866576c1ee4", entity_id:"Modern Times"}}, {_id:6435, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)<SEP>YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Anxiety and stress are mental states triggered by the brain's negativity bias in modern life.<SEP>Anxiety and stress are psychological states linked to obsessive self-focused thinking.<SEP>Anxiety and stress are psychological states characterized by excessive worry and tension, often linked to self-focused thoughts and external pressures.<SEP>Anxiety and stress are psychological states characterized by excessive worry and tension, often linked to self-focused thoughts and external pressures.", created_at:1779663717, source_id:"chunk-729a868fcc915b32e3804866576c1ee4<SEP>chunk-2abf9b76c25a40660c2457bb0ad9b00e<SEP>chunk-0fd54b20f9240836a740d21443f8c6ce", entity_id:"Anxiety and Stress"}}, {_id:6436, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Negative thoughts about workplace value lead to diminished performance and emotional hurt.", created_at:1779560718, source_id:"chunk-3c35c8046e4068fa71b3df5521e81022", entity_id:"Negative Projections"}}, {_id:6437, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Negative thoughts about workplace value lead to diminished performance and emotional hurt.", created_at:1779560718, source_id:"chunk-3c35c8046e4068fa71b3df5521e81022", entity_id:"Workplace"}}, {_id:6438, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional states linked to amygdala activity, addressed through awareness and prefrontal cortex engagement.<SEP>Emotional states linked to amygdala activity, addressed through awareness and prefrontal cortex engagement.", created_at:1779561286, source_id:"chunk-2c9bcdcac30e6029287eee4161a0477b", entity_id:"Anxiety, Fear, Anger"}}, {_id:6439, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Chaotic imaginations are disruptive mental narratives driven by an overactive amygdala, alleviated through mindful observation.<SEP>Chaotic imaginations are disruptive mental narratives driven by an overactive amygdala, alleviated through mindful observation.", created_at:1779561286, source_id:"chunk-2c9bcdcac30e6029287eee4161a0477b", entity_id:"Chaotic Imaginations"}}, {_id:6440, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The brain is redefined as more than a survival mechanism, emphasizing its capacity for profound consciousness and growth.", created_at:1779561300, source_id:"chunk-a35e19231d7bd0423fa3c980dbea5e47", entity_id:"Survival Mechanism"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
