cal perfection that vary across time and contexts.", created_at:1779561400, source_id:"chunk-641507fc1ac65e5fc2ff612c296612f6", entity_id:"Ideal Body"}}, {_id:6452, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Fashion Houses are companies that influence beauty standards and trends, contributing to the changing ideals of physical perfection.", created_at:1779561400, source_id:"chunk-641507fc1ac65e5fc2ff612c296612f6", entity_id:"Fashion Houses"}}, {_id:6453, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Cosmetic surgeries are procedures performed to alter physical appearance, often driven by dissatisfaction with one's body image.", created_at:1779561409, source_id:"chunk-9f1528e052c091ff9a2052d88bff2e72", entity_id:"Cosmetic Surgeries"}}, {_id:6454, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Beauty appreciation refers to the human tendency to value and admire aesthetic qualities in oneself and surroundings, rooted in ancient cultural practices.", created_at:1779561409, source_id:"chunk-9f1528e052c091ff9a2052d88bff2e72", entity_id:"Beauty Appreciation"}}, {_id:6455, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Einstein is referenced as an example of a historical figure whose preoccupation with appearance (unruly hair) contrasted with his intellectual achievements.<SEP>Einstein is a historical leader referenced as an example of purpose discovery through enlightened connection.<SEP>Einstein is a historical leader referenced as an example of purpose discovery through enlightened connection.", created_at:1779562245, source_id:"chunk-9f1528e052c091ff9a2052d88bff2e72<SEP>chunk-df8fc1ec5d1cc48e4ba2ac7fc6630477", entity_id:"Einstein"}}, {_id:6457, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Human nature refers to the innate tendency in humans to appreciate beauty, as seen in ancient civilizations.", created_at:1779561409, source_id:"chunk-9f1528e052c091ff9a2052d88bff2e72", entity_id:"Human Nature"}}, {_id:6458, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Severe physical suffering inflicted on girls through foot binding, including broken bones and immobility.<SEP>Severe physical suffering inflicted on girls through foot binding, including broken bones and immobility.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"Torture"}}, {_id:6459, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cultural concept promoting extreme physical modifications, such as foot binding, under the guise of aesthetic perfection.<SEP>Cultural concept promoting extreme physical modifications, such as foot binding, under the guise of aesthetic perfection.<SEP>The concept of an idealized beauty standard, criticized for causing psychological distress and depression.", created_at:1779561483, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9<SEP>chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Ideal Beauty"}}, {_id:6460, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Dutch Golden Age painter who portrayed women with rounded features and natural proportions in his works.<SEP>Dutch Golden Age painter who portrayed women with rounded features and natural proportions in his works.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"Rembrandt"}}, {_id:6461, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Time period during which the practice of foot binding was prevalent in China, causing immense suffering to girls.<SEP>Time period during which the practice of foot binding was prevalent in China, causing immense suffering to girls.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"10th-19th Century"}}, {_id:6462, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Lotus Foot refers to the Chinese practice of foot binding where upper-class girls' bones were broken and feet tightly bound to achieve tiny, dainty feet as a beauty ideal.<SEP>The Lotus Foot refers to the Chinese practice of foot binding where upper-class girls' bones were broken and feet tightly bound to achieve tiny, dainty feet as a beauty ideal.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"Lotus Foot"}}, {_id:6463, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Renaissance artist known for paintings depicting women with fuller, more natural body features contrasting with extreme beauty standards.<SEP>Renaissance artist known for paintings depicting women with fuller, more natural body features contrasting with extreme beauty standards.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"Da Vinci"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:6464, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Group of girls from Chinese upper-class families who endured foot binding as part of beauty standards, leading to immobility.<SEP>Group of girls from Chinese upper-class families who endured foot binding as part of beauty standards, leading to immobility.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"Chinese Upper-Class Girls"}}, {_id:6465, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Ancient Indian cave paintings depicting diverse and full-bodied representations of beauty in women and men.<SEP>Ancient Indian cave paintings depicting diverse and full-bodied representations of beauty in women and men.", created_at:1779561468, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9", entity_id:"Ajanta Paintings"}}, {_id:6466, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"Famous painting by Leonardo da Vinci depicting a woman with fuller facial features and rounded arms, contrasting extreme beauty standards of the time.<SEP>Famous painting by Leonardo da Vinci depicting a woman with fuller facial features and rounded arms, contrasting extreme beauty standards of the time.<SEP>The Mona Lisa is a renowned painting by Leonardo da Vinci, often associated with beauty standards and artistic representation.", created_at:1779561483, source_id:"chunk-8809e9b9df76b16743d670ee1736d8d9<SEP>chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Mona Lisa"}}, {_id:6467, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Botox is a cosmetic procedure used to alter facial features, often linked to beauty modifications.", created_at:1779561483, source_id:"chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Botox"}}, {_id:6468, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Ajanta refers to the Ajanta Caves in India, known for ancient Buddhist murals depicting diverse human forms and beauty.", created_at:1779561483, source_id:"chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Ajanta"}}, {_id:6470, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dissolving body concerns leads to self-awareness and inner peace.<SEP>Negative perceptions or judgments toward one's physical form, addressed as a barrier to self-awareness and intelligence.", created_at:1779561559, source_id:"chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96<SEP>chunk-543b676160d9abe4d6b5b39e255b3f9d", entity_id:"Body Issues"}}, {_id:6471, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ajanta's murals celebrate diverse human beauty through ancient art.", created_at:1779561545, source_id:"chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Beauty Diversity"}}, {_id:6472, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Smiling fosters joy and reduces stress linked to beauty anxiety.", created_at:1779561545, source_id:"chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Smiling"}}, {_id:6473, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"India's historical embrace of diverse beauty contrasts with current homogenized standards.", created_at:1779561545, source_id:"chunk-9687f9221e8ea7d2650809521e33cd96", entity_id:"Loss of Beauty Appreciation"}}, {_id:6474, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A heightened state of cognitive awareness and understanding described as accessible through dissolving body-related resistance.", created_at:1779561559, source_id:"chunk-543b676160d9abe4d6b5b39e255b3f9d", entity_id:"Great Intelligence"}}, {_id:6475, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A video discussing self-awareness, body issues, and the connection between dissolving physical resistance and awakening intelligence and creativity.", created_at:1779561559, source_id:"chunk-543b676160d9abe4d6b5b39e255b3f9d", entity_id:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU"}}, {_id:6476, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A transformed self-perception framed as a \"playground\" for intelligence and creativity after overcoming body issues.", created_at:1779561559, source_id:"chunk-543b676160d9abe4d6b5b39e255b3f9d", entity_id:"New Sense of Self"}}, {_id:6477, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The process of conscious exploration and acceptance initiated by the video's message, leading to self-transformation.", created_at:1779561559, source_id:"chunk-543b676160d9abe4d6b5b39e255b3f9d", entity_id:"Self-Awareness Journey"}}, {_id:6478, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sudharma denotes living a purpose aligned with one's true nature and self-discovery.<SEP>Sudharma refers to discovering and livin