ose-driven cause for preservation.<SEP>Rainforests in northeastern India are an ecological region highlighted as an example of a purpose-driven cause for preservation.<SEP>Rainforests in northeastern India are an ecological region highlighted as an example of a purpose-driven cause for preservation.", created_at:1779562063, source_id:"chunk-1f2ebd75b5a73d8a2845b5a7f6f03a0e", entity_id:"Rainforests in Northeastern India"}}] AS row
