UNWIND [{_id:6693, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779651688, description:"Homework symbolizes rigid academic attitudes limiting broader understanding.<SEP>Academic work mentioned in the transcript as part of the speaker's educational activities and responsibilities.<SEP>Academic work mentioned in the transcript as part of the speaker's educational activities and responsibilities.", source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7<SEP>chunk-276e2821a658fe03b04118b0a70183e8<SEP>chunk-f5593ece4d6fefc307d1c996f846a8c5", entity_id:"Homework"}}, {_id:6699, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"This person is the subject of punishment and reflection, with a changing attitude.", created_at:1779565373, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13", entity_id:"This Person"}}, {_id:6701, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"An attitude discussed in the text, with the phrase \\\"Fix us a day\\\" being analyzed as a contextual mismatch.\"}<SEP>A concept central to the video's discussion, with the problematic phrase appearing to reference it contextually.<SEP>A conceptual reference to a person's demeanor or perspective discussed in the transcript context.<SEP>A conceptual reference to a person's demeanor or perspective discussed in the transcript context.<SEP>Concept of attitude discussed in the context of the YouTube Video and potential transcription errors.<SEP>Concept of attitude discussed in the context of the YouTube Video and potential transcription errors.<SEP>An abstract concept central to the video's content, referring to a state of mind or emotional disposition.", created_at:1779652066, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-3df6d7e17b29056ecebd37bab054ca0d<SEP>chunk-557efbfbf9c9ce831df3d12449f77fc2<SEP>chunk-64ea4734b29c6f7afa27243c21ffc049<SEP>chunk-57b00092944096f4ab4f32bdf20fe4b7<SEP>chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e<SEP>chunk-9deb1452ed9eae4ab1315fc2eb8f47d0<SEP>chunk-b8d7dcfd08180c8f4ffab15da2093e12<SEP>chunk-b01bb0caae1e2017827b09d9e858a6e3<SEP>chunk-276e2821a658fe03b04118b0a70183e8<SEP>chunk-f5593ece4d6fefc307d1c996f846a8c5<SEP>chunk-4b36372af05da8e8e3e714562b5f0832", entity_id:"Attitude"}}, {_id:6702, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Role models are discussed as potentially leading to unhealthy comparison despite initial intentions.`<SEP>Role models are individuals or figures mistakenly perceived as healthy comparisons but often leading to negative self-assessment.", created_at:1779652795, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-e27a47feac82bbd6f6606fd0582e97d1", entity_id:"Role Models"}}, {_id:6703, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The economy is connected to the idea that comparison drives economic growth through consumerism.<SEP>The economic system discussed in relation to comparison and societal behavior.<SEP>The economic system discussed in relation to comparison and societal behavior.", created_at:1779652780, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-3a5d8d7606e9b8e3d7ef11bf46090954", entity_id:"Economy"}}, {_id:6704, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"High expectations from oneself and parents are discussed as a source of stress.", created_at:1779565425, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13", entity_id:"High Expectations"}}, {_id:6706, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", created_at:1779648023, description:"The \"broken mirror\" metaphor represents fragmented human identity caused by conflicting ideals, relationships, and existential uncertainty.<SEP>The broken mirror metaphor represents the fragmented and divided nature of human consciousness and society.<SEP>Broken Mirror serves as a metaphor for human beings' fragmented and divided nature.<SEP>The broken mirror serves as a metaphor for human beings' fragmented and imperfect nature, as analyzed in the video.<SEP>The original text mentions a \"broken mirror\" within the context of integration.", source_id:"chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02<SEP>chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47<SEP>chunk-60c1c33e6390faeb5d8d230c828095d7<SEP>chunk-fb20367827f31cb284dc2e32ba2e1bb0<SEP>chunk-89ab86758e55eda4e32bf5581a61d209", entity_id:"Broken Mirror"}}, {_id:6707, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Integration describes the process of unifying fragmented aspects of self and society through the state of oneness, leading to collective healing.<SEP>Integration refers to the process of becoming unified or whole.<SEP>Integration refers to the process of becoming unified or whole.", created_at:1779648098, source_id:"chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02<SEP>chunk-b4ecf7e4c6ac98b4463f375b4140f36f", entity_id:"Integration"}}, {_id:6708, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: RFx74Q6Oq2c (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFx74Q6Oq2c)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"World leaders succeed through relentless study and global awareness.<SEP>The 2017 study at Oxford University discovered the lateral frontal pole's role in human decision-making and future-oriented thinking.", created_at:1779653249, source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7<SEP>chunk-c58820007a8ce164af9a67cbf25bf444", entity_id:"Study"}}, {_id:6709, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"punishment`. The `punishment` keyword is good.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13", entity_id:"punishment, attitude` is a bit vague. A more direct relationship would be `Speaker"}}, {_id:6710, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"punishment` is more direct. The previous output has this, so I'll keep it.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13", entity_id:"punishment, attitude` is okay, but maybe `Speaker"}}, {_id:6711, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dark clouds symbolize humanity's suffering, pain, and problems, which are countered by the \"world Oneness wave\" created through enlightenment.<SEP>Dark clouds symbolize suffering, pain, and problems experienced by humanity.<SEP>Dark clouds symbolize humanity's suffering, pain, and problems, which are countered by the \"world Oneness wave\" created through enlightenment.<SEP>Dark clouds are used to symbolize the suffering, pain, and problems humanity faces.", created_at:1779646688, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713<SEP>chunk-5750a413a72601ce81e6195a148e09ad", entity_id:"Dark Clouds"}}, {_id:6712, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The World Oneness Wave is a transformative energy generated through collective enlightenment, likened to lightning that disrupts dark clouds of suffering.<SEP>The World Oneness Wave is a transformative energy generated through collective enlightenment, likened to lightning that disrupts dark clouds of suffering.", created_at:1779646682, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713", entity_id:"World Oneness Wave"}}, {_id:6713, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"The 30 trillion cells in the human body are stated to achieve harmony in the state of Oneness, reflecting bodily alignment with universal consciousness.<SEP>The 30 trillion cells in the human body are stated to achieve harmony in the state of Oneness, reflecting bodily alignment with universal consciousness.", created_at:1779646682, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713", entity_id:"30 Trillion Cells"}}, {_id:6714, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Deceptiveness is identified as a core problem in the world, driving disconnection and imbalance in human interactions.<SEP>Deceptiveness is identified as a core problem in the world, driving disconnection and imbalance in human interactions.", created_at:1779646682, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713", entity_id:"Deceptiveness"}}, {_id:6715, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Lightning serves as a metaphor for the sudden, powerful impact of the World Oneness Wave against suffering (dark clouds).<SEP>Lightning serves as a metaphor for the sudden, powerful impact of the World Oneness Wave against suffering (dark clouds).", created_at:1779646682, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713", entity_id:"Lightning"}}, {_id:6716, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"symbolism", truncate:"", description:"Dark clouds metaphorically represent humanity's collective suffering and problems.\" But in the original output provided by the assistant, there's no such relationship. Wait, looking back:", created_at:1779565509, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713", entity_id:"Suffering, Pain, Problems"}}, {_id:6717, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Consciousness is defined as a duality of matter and energy, forming the basis of existence.", created_at:1779565569, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713", entity_id:"Matter, Energy"}}, {_id:6718, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Oneness State is the condition where an individual becomes beautiful, extending to family, society, and the world.<SEP>Oneness state is a unified awareness that transforms relationships into love, connection, and compassion, fostering joy and gratitude.<SEP>The Oneness State represents a unified existence characterized by love, connection, and compassion, transforming relationships and fostering joy.<SEP>Oneness State refers to the concept of ultimate unity or singularity, mentioned in the context of a state within the text.<SEP>Oneness State refers to the concept of ultimate unity or singularity, mentioned in the context of a state within the text.<SEP>Oneness State refers to a spiritual condition where divisions and judgments cease, fostering unity with oneself, others, and the world.<SEP>The Oneness State is described as a spiritual condition where divisions, judgments, and disappointments cease to exist, enabling healing of Mother Earth.", created_at:1779648142, source_id:"chunk-5750a413a72601ce81e6195a148e09ad<SEP>chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6<SEP>chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c<SEP>chunk-b64e03d5159fd3c4e333e9641ee8fb81<SEP>chunk-60c1c33e6390faeb5d8d230c828095d7<SEP>chunk-829692316cdc441972a3bef1cc6809ef", entity_id:"Oneness State"}}, {_id:6719, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mother's Ideals refer to the teachings and values imparted by one's mother, contributing to internal conflict in human consciousness.", created_at:1779646752, source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47<SEP>chunk-7988ea96a08eaf2fe8d7d16c8063ffbe", entity_id:"Mother's Ideals"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:6720, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Father's Ideals represent the principles and beliefs taught by one's father, creating fragmentation within human thought processes.", created_at:1779646752, source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47<SEP>chunk-7988ea96a08eaf2fe8d7d16c8063ffbe", entity_id:"Father's Ideals"}}, {_id:6721, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Husband and Wife symbolize a fractured relationship marked by mutual hurt and discord, reflecting societal divisions.", created_at:1779646752, source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47", entity_id:"Husband and Wife"}}, {_id:6722, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"The US is a country currently experiencing a lack of joy, love, and connection among its inhabitants.<SEP>The US is described as currently lacking joy, love, and connection, with a sense of separation from collective well-being.", created_at:1779647080, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6<SEP>chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c", entity_id:"US"}}, {_id:6723, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A fellow human being is perceived as a competitor or enemy in eye consciousness but transforms into a partner in the Oneness state.", created_at:1779646752, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6", entity_id:"Fellow Human Being"}}, {_id:6725, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Fragmented aspects of the self, including ambitions, values, hurts, and conflicts.<SEP>Fragmented aspects of the self, including ambitions, values, hurts, and conflicts.", created_at:1779646960, source_id:"chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6", entity_id:"Broken Pieces"}}, {_id:6726, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The broken pieces (ambitions, hurts, conflicts) within the self cause stress and anxiety.<SEP>Build-up of stress and anxiety caused by internal conflicts, leading to negative behaviors.<SEP>Build-up of stress and anxiety caused by internal conflicts, leading to negative behaviors.", created_at:1779647362, source_id:"chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6<SEP>chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9", entity_id:"Stress and Anxiety"}}, {_id:6727, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Eye Consciousness represents a divided, separated state of awareness driven by judgments and conflict.", created_at:1779647031, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2", entity_id:"eye Consciousness"}}, {_id:6728, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dark clouds symbolize the suffering, pain, and problems experienced by humanity.", created_at:1779647031, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2", entity_id:"dark clouds"}}, {_id:6729, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Society transforms into a beautiful collective under the influence of One Consciousness, characterized by reduced division.<SEP>Society is mentioned as a context where forgiveness needs to be applied.<SEP>Society is mentioned as a context where forgiveness needs to be applied.<SEP>Society is mentioned as a context where forgiveness needs to be applied.<SEP>Society is mentioned as a context where forgiveness needs to be applied.<SEP>Society is mentioned as a context where forgiveness needs to be applied.<SEP>Society is mentioned as a context where forgiveness needs to be applied.", created_at:1779751700, source_id:"chunk-948edf40820be95513a6d203f6c87e9f<SEP>chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2<SEP>chunk-d26a33b7890276490920b92132c786db", entity_id:"society"}}, {_id:6730, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a merged description of the entity \"human beings\". The input list includes multiple descriptions, some repeated. We need to integrate all key information, be objective, third-person, mention the full name at the beginning. Also need to handle conflicts: there are two distinct themes: (1) capacity to shift from conflicted eye Consciousness to unified One Consciousness; (2) ethical responsibilities toward animals and environment; (3) lacking inherent understanding of potential to create destiny, requiring conscious transformation; (4) mentioned in context of standoffs and need for forgiveness.

