als and society.", created_at:1779647056, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2", entity_id:"unity, beauty, harmony"}}, {_id:6736, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Consciousness manifests as either divided eye Consciousness or unified One Consciousness.", created_at:1779647056, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2", entity_id:"eye Consciousness, One Consciousness"}}, {_id:6737, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The US is depicted as lacking joy, love, and connection, reflecting a state of separation from collective unity and self-awareness.", created_at:1779647104, source_id:"chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c", entity_id:"joy, love, connection"}}, {_id:6738, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"In Eye Consciousness, individuals perceive others as competitors, enemies, or challenges, fostering disturbance and stress.", created_at:1779647104, source_id:"chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c", entity_id:"fellow human beings"}}, {_id:6739, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The analysis discusses homophones in the context of misheard words.", created_at:1779647205, source_id:"chunk-b64e03d5159fd3c4e333e9641ee8fb81<SEP>chunk-8ffaaf20919b16eeae537e3baa1da0ab", entity_id:"Analysis"}}, {_id:6740, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"{\"Description\": \"A YouTube video titled \\\"_GEMrEWCiXw\\\" hosted on YouTube, containing a transcript with contextual analysis of a phrase.\"}", created_at:1779651722, source_id:"chunk-8ffaaf20919b16eeae537e3baa1da0ab<SEP>chunk-fb20367827f31cb284dc2e32ba2e1bb0<SEP>chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9<SEP>chunk-829692316cdc441972a3bef1cc6809ef<SEP>chunk-84c10fe557e02dadbe2e1141b93facd2<SEP>chunk-f9f9ec17021f2ddc7e5a41366013282d<SEP>chunk-276e2821a658fe03b04118b0a70183e8", entity_id:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw"}}] AS row
