arents' busyness, lacking parental love.<SEP>A child experiencing neglect due to parents' busyness, lacking parental love.", created_at:1779647362, source_id:"chunk-7988ea96a08eaf2fe8d7d16c8063ffbe", entity_id:"Broken Piece (Child)"}}, {_id:6746, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A philosophical concept representing the search for existential meaning.<SEP>A philosophical concept representing the search for existential meaning.", created_at:1779647363, source_id:"chunk-7988ea96a08eaf2fe8d7d16c8063ffbe", entity_id:"Real Purpose of My Life"}}, {_id:6747, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Rhetorical questions about life's purpose and existential reflection, including repetition of \"what\" as a stylistic choice.<SEP>Rhetorical questions about life's purpose and existential reflection, including repetition of \"what\" as a stylistic choice.", created_at:1779647362, source_id:"chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9", entity_id:"List of Questions"}}, {_id:6748, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotional or psychological hurts identified as a conflicting element within the self.<SEP>Emotional or psychological hurts identified as a conflicting element within the self.", created_at:1779647362, source_id:"chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9", entity_id:"Hurts"}}, {_id:6749, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Damaged relationships caused by stress and anxiety, as described in the text.<SEP>Damaged relationships caused by stress and anxiety, as described in the text.", created_at:1779647363, source_id:"chunk-7acd