 criticized as flawed when equated solely to position or authority.<SEP>The idea of leadership is criticized for being overly simplistic when reducing leadership to position or authority.<SEP>The idea of leadership is criticized for being overly simplistic when reducing leadership to position or authority.<SEP>The idea of leadership is criticized as flawed when equated solely to position or authority.", created_at:1779647916, source_id:"chunk-330c229b9775dad36da206ebfc157ab5<SEP>chunk-550dc3fe2d86679425efdc1841d6bee3", entity_id:"Idea of Leadership"}}, {_id:6762, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The idea of leadership is deemed flawed due to its reductionist view of leadership as position or authority.", created_at:1779648002, source_id:"chunk-330c229b9775dad36da206ebfc157ab5", entity_id:"Flawed Assumption"}}] AS row
