UNWIND [{_id:6786, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: K-AFDVOkIoE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Earthrise photograph inspired the global environmental movement and contributed to ending the Vietnam War.", created_at:1779648324, source_id:"chunk-393e1029671c8cd325c8aaceacba56f1", entity_id:"global environmental movement"}}, {_id:6787, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: K-AFDVOkIoE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Earthrise photograph's emotional impact helped halt the Vietnam War and fostered international cooperation.", created_at:1779648325, source_id:"chunk-393e1029671c8cd325c8aaceacba56f1", entity_id:"war cessation"}}, {_id:6788, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: K-AFDVOkIoE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Planetary crisis denotes potential future ecological collapse, linked to the urgency of spiritual and environmental action.", created_at:1779648349, source_id:"chunk-b1e9b7eb495ce02a274d514dffa406f5", entity_id:"Planetary Crisis"}}, {_id:6789, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Refers to worldwide challenges such as divisiveness, addressed by initiatives like World Oneness Day.<SEP>Refers to worldwide challenges such as divisiveness, addressed by initiatives like World Oneness Day.<SEP>The global problem encompasses issues affecting all of humanity and living beings, requiring collective solutions.", created_at:1779648486, source_id:"chunk-5e293d2f56a82348c78f2cc08b14a7e1<SEP>chunk-64ea4734b29c6f7afa27243c21ffc049", entity_id:"Global Problem"}}, {_id:6790, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Discusses the concept of Oneness, World Oneness Day, and their role in addressing global divisiveness and promoting unity.<SEP>Discusses the concept of Oneness, World Oneness Day, and their role in addressing global divisiveness and promoting unity.", created_at:1779648474, source_id:"chunk-5e293d2f56a82348c78f2cc08b14a7e1", entity_id:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)"}}, {_id:6791, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Every form of living being is part of the global problem that needs to be addressed through collective action.", created_at:1779648486, source_id:"chunk-64ea4734b29c6f7afa27243c21ffc049", entity_id:"Every Form of Living Being"}}, {_id:6792, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Phrasing awkwardness refers to grammatical or structural issues in language expression.", created_at:1779648523, source_id:"chunk-ff648886e29693de0f8c7afb7b4a9d7e", entity_id:"Phrasing Awkwardness"}}, {_id:6793, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Growing up refers to the process of maturation and development in life experiences and perspectives.", created_at:1779648523, source_id:"chunk-ff648886e29693de0f8c7afb7b4a9d7e", entity_id:"Growing Up"}}, {_id:6794, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Sentence Example 2 conceptually explains judgment as an ongoing mental process leading to decision-making challenges.", created_at:1779648527, source_id:"chunk-914607da38aae76b5fda076572b52a4b", entity_id:"Sentence Example 2"}}, {_id:6795, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Sentence Example 1 is a grammatical construct demonstrating judgment through contrasting statements about communication.", created_at:1779648527, source_id:"chunk-914607da38aae76b5fda076572b52a4b", entity_id:"Sentence Example 1"}}, {_id:6796, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Rhetorical device describes a stylistic or communicative technique observed in the transcription, potentially influencing judgment perception.", created_at:1779648527, source_id:"chunk-914607da38aae76b5fda076572b52a4b", entity_id:"Rhetorical Device"}}, {_id:6798, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Phrase \"You know what is this?\" is flagged as awkward and suggested for rephrasing to \"You know what this is?\".", created_at:1779648612, source_id:"chunk-f9f9ec17021f2ddc7e5a41366013282d", entity_id:"You know what is this?"}}, {_id:6799, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The original phrasing \"You know what is this?\" is considered awkward, with a proposed rephrasing to \"You know what this is?\".", created_at:1779648635, source_id:"chunk-f9f9ec17021f2ddc7e5a41366013282d", entity_id:"You know what this is?"}}, {_id:6800, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A mental framework or evaluation influencing perception, discussed as a key focus of the video's content.<SEP>A mental framework or evaluation influencing perception, discussed as a key focus of the video's content.", created_at:1779648715, source_id:"chunk-4423f31046645ba67f62bd4a0861c21d", entity_id:"judgment"}}, {_id:6801, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The state of alignment with reality or factual accuracy, contrasted against judgments and attitudes in the video's message.<SEP>The state of alignment with reality or factual accuracy, contrasted against judgments and attitudes in the video's message.", created_at:1779648715, source_id:"chunk-4423f31046645ba67f62bd4a0861c21d", entity_id:"truth"}}, {_id:6802, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A set of beliefs or perspectives shaping behavior, contrasted with reality in the video's message.<SEP>A set of beliefs or perspectives shaping behavior, contrasted with reality in the video's message.", created_at:1779648715, source_id:"chunk-4423f31046645ba67f62bd4a0861c21d", entity_id:"attitude"}}, {_id:6804, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The collective challenges and conflicts faced by humanity as a whole.", created_at:1779648715, source_id:"chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Humanity's Problem"}}, {_id:6805, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"An optimal approach to address challenges through harmony and understanding.", created_at:1779648715, source_id:"chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Greatest and Most Efficient Way"}}, {_id:6806, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A metaphorical shared experience of collective existence and purpose.", created_at:1779648715, source_id:"chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Journey Together"}}, {_id:6808, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The journey together involves humanity and all living beings in a unified existence.", created_at:1779648751, source_id:"chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Humanity and Living Beings"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:6809, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Attitude and judgment lead to being stuck in life, as per the text's assertion.", created_at:1779648751, source_id:"chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Attitude and Judgment"}}, {_id:6810, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Attitude and judgment lead to being stuck in life, as per the text's assertion.", created_at:1779648751, source_id:"chunk-73d463f43d27a07d4aa8c95e74926d9e", entity_id:"Stuck in Life"}}, {_id:6811, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Phrase discussed in the video, retained as a direct quote despite perceived awkwardness, possibly a fragmented transcription.", created_at:1779648767, source_id:"chunk-560170b29949a93ba6ebb098237e7e3f", entity_id:"This Day, It Needs to Be"}}, {_id:6812, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Phrase analyzed in the video, originally misheard as \"caught in an attitude\" but grammatically correct as \"caught in an attitude\".", created_at:1779648767, source_id:"chunk-560170b29949a93ba6ebb098237e7e3f", entity_id:"Caught in an Attitude"}}, {_id:6813, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Direct question analyzed in the video, rephrased for clarity in context.", created_at:1779648767, source_id:"chunk-560170b29949a93ba6ebb098237e7e3f", entity_id:"What Is This?"}}, {_id:6814, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Specialized terminology requiring correction per provided domain-specific list.", created_at:1779648778, source_id:"chunk-9e6213cd638498d58916c7eb2ee61052", entity_id:"Domain Terms"}}, {_id:6815, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"All this is judgment\" replaces plural \"judgments\" for conceptual consistency.", created_at:1779648812, source_id:"chunk-9e6213cd638498d58916c7eb2ee61052", entity_id:"Singular Form"}}, {_id:6816, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Korea is a country where students study intensively to excel in their fields and compete globally.", created_at:1779648860, source_id:"chunk-40aaf5f6f81cde9add3f7814c3b1e73a", entity_id:"Korea"}}, {_id:6817, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spectrum of knowledge refers to the breadth of understanding required for success in modern challenges.", created_at:1779648860, source_id:"chunk-40aaf5f6f81cde9add3f7814c3b1e73a", entity_id:"Spectrum of Knowledge"}}, {_id:6818, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Understanding global events and trends is critical for attaining success and relevance.", created_at:1779648893, source_id:"chunk-40aaf5f6f81cde9add3f7814c3b1e73a", entity_id:"Understanding of World Events"}}, {_id:6822, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Prisoner represents a state of being trapped by one's own attitudes or judgments, unable to experience life fully.`", created_at:1779648934, source_id:"chunk-9deb1452ed9eae4ab1315fc2eb8f47d0", entity_id:"Prisoner"}}, {_id:6824, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The shell symbolizes the self-imposed confinement caused by attitudes and judgments.`", created_at:1779648935, source_id:"chunk-9deb1452ed9eae4ab1315fc2eb8f47d0", entity_id:"Shell"}}, {_id:6825, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Teaching a lesson through silence reflects an attempt to influence change, though it can perpetuate stagnation.`", created_at:1779648935, source_id:"chunk-9deb1452ed9eae4ab1315fc2eb8f47d0", entity_id:"Lesson"}}, {_id:6827, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Domain-specific term describing boundless, unrestricted joy as a spiritual state.<SEP>Limitless Joy is an unbounded state of happiness and bliss, considered a spiritual achievement.<SEP>Limitless joy describes an unbounded, profound sense of happiness not tied to material circumstances.`<SEP>Domain-specific term describing boundless, unrestricted joy as a spiritual state.<SEP>Limitless Joy is an unbounded state of happiness and bliss, considered a spiritual achievement.<SEP>Limitless joy describes an unbounded, profound sense of happiness not tied to material circumstances.`", created_at:1779650716, source_id:"chunk-7796e9953e60bd3bb11c46251f992983<SEP>chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-5eced850d74f972c1d65bf6b3ae924fd", entity_id:"Limitless Joy"}}, {_id:6828, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Domain-specific term referring to unconditional, selfless love without cause or expectation.<SEP>Causeless Love is a state of unconditional love that is 