UNWIND [{_id:6843, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Connected consciousness refers to a shared or unified state of awareness among individuals or entities.`<SEP>Connected consciousness refers to a shared or unified state of awareness among individuals or entities.`<SEP>Interlinked awareness enabling profound human connections.<SEP>Interlinked awareness enabling profound human connections.", created_at:1779651326, source_id:"chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-1eb764bde7f7f1e1e97d8931c7b9875e", entity_id:"Connected Consciousness"}}, {_id:6844, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A perfect soul mate embodies an idealized partnership characterized by mutual growth and spiritual alignment.`<SEP>A perfect soul mate embodies an idealized partnership characterized by mutual growth and spiritual alignment.`<SEP>A state of being achieved through spiritual awakening, characterized by wholeness, joy, and connected consciousness.<SEP>An idealized partnership formed through spiritual alignment and conscious connection.<SEP>An idealized partnership formed through spiritual alignment and conscious connection.", created_at:1779651326, source_id:"chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1<SEP>chunk-1eb764bde7f7f1e1e97d8931c7b9875e", entity_id:"Perfect Soul Mate"}}, {_id:6846, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Original Meaning Preservation is a constraint that governs how corrections are applied to a text. It requires that any modifications retain the original meaning, prohibiting the introduction of new ideas, the removal of existing content, the addition of interpretations, and the rewriting of style. By preserving the author's intent and the factual and stylistic elements of the original text, this constraint ensures that edits align with the intended message without altering the tone or shifting the meaning.

In practice, Original Meaning Preservation guides editors and proofreaders to make minimal changes that keep the text faithful to its source, maintaining the integrity of the original communication. The principle is applied across various editorial contexts, where it serves as a guiding rule for making the smallest possible adjustments that correct errors while staying true to the original author's voice.

This approach prevents the distortion of the text's core message and ensures that any revisions are transparent and justifiable, thereby upholding the authenticity of the original work. The constraint is succinctly defined as requiring corrections to retain the original meaning without adding interpretations or rewriting style, a concise formulation that captures the essence of the broader description.", created_at:1779700971, source_id:"chunk-5eced850d74f972c1d65bf6b3ae924fd<SEP>chunk-7fd8596e77267f333f42ebc055048d2e", entity_id:"Original Meaning Preservation"}}, {_id:6847, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Toxic comparison involves rigid, negative self-judgment or unhealthy rivalry, hindering personal growth and life satisfaction.<SEP>Toxic comparison involves rigid, negative self-judgment or unhealthy rivalry, hindering personal growth and life satisfaction.", created_at:1779650715, source_id:"chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738", entity_id:"Toxic Comparison"}}, {_id:6848, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Healthy comparison involves constructive evaluation without negative self-judgment, promoting growth and adaptability in life.<SEP>Healthy comparison involves constructive evaluation without negative self-judgment, promoting growth and adaptability in life.", created_at:1779650715, source_id:"chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738", entity_id:"Healthy Comparison"}}, {_id:6850, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The \"system\" refers to societal structures and norms that perpetuate comparative behaviors through cultural conditioning and institutional practices.<SEP>The \"system\" refers to societal structures and norms that perpetuate comparative behaviors through cultural conditioning and institutional practices.<SEP>System denotes the structured approach or framework proposed to overcome pressure through repeated practice and self-mastery.`", created_at:1779666429, source_id:"chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738<SEP>chunk-ae2f2a9e144a0416a2b1367a6eab9be2", entity_id:"System"}}, {_id:6851, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"This YouTube video discusses the concept of attracting a soul mate through consciousness and thought processes, arguing that effects can precede causes in the realm of consciousness.", created_at:1779650813, source_id:"chunk-1e936532a5c53d8221f209a5d79cf8e0", entity_id:"How to Draw Your Soul Mate to You"}}, {_id:6853, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Thought structures refer to mental frameworks or beliefs that shape perceptions, including concepts like limitless joy or bliss, which are argued to lack real-world experience.", created_at:1779650813, source_id:"chunk-1e936532a5c53d8221f209a5d79cf8e0", entity_id:"Thought Structures"}}, {_id:6854, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779651196, description:"Spiritual pertains to a higher level of consciousness and connection to universal principles.<SEP>Key term \"spiritual\" emphasized in the text's thematic context.<SEP>Spiritual enlightenment is a state that can stop the game.", source_id:"chunk-764a97fcc4f5ca27d776b5ca07fae2bf<SEP>chunk-f67d8f163abe6d69ce4daa53dcf46375<SEP>chunk-5033c74f902a9903394abee3925147c5", entity_id:"Spiritual"}}, {_id:6855, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779651237, description:"Awaken is a state of spiritual realization that halts the cyclical nature of existence and enables the discovery of a soul mate.<SEP>\"awaken\" retained as a key term (original text lacks \"awakening\" but includes this variant).<SEP>Awaken refers to a state of spiritual awakening that stops the metaphorical \"game\" of life and leads to finding a soul mate or transforming existing relationships.", source_id:"chunk-764a97fcc4f5ca27d776b5ca07fae2bf<SEP>chunk-f67d8f163abe6d69ce4daa53dcf46375<SEP>chunk-ae734d382508c61512b864b733d3338d", entity_id:"Awaken"}}, {_id:6856, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Referenced platform style in the text, associated with spiritual discourse.", created_at:1779650983, source_id:"chunk-f67d8f163abe6d69ce4daa53dcf46375", entity_id:"Mukthi Guru Platform"}}, {_id:6857, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube video discussing grammatical corrections and spiritual awakening themes.", created_at:1779651032, source_id:"chunk-e0a8c9ac09d21e5a96983fd54ff760fd", entity_id:"1nhXsnx5--Y"}}, {_id:6858, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Rule requiring capitalization of the first word in sentences, emphasized in the video's content.", created_at:1779651032, source_id:"chunk-e0a8c9ac09d21e5a96983fd54ff760fd", entity_id:"Capitalization Rule"}}, {_id:6859, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The URL \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y\" serves as the source link for the referenced YouTube video.", created_at:1779651078, source_id:"chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1", entity_id:"Source URL"}}, {_id:6860, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A philosophical game involving cyclical thought patterns, spiritual awakening, and the pursuit of a \"perfect soul mate\" through self-realization.", created_at:1779651078, source_id:"chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1", entity_id:"Game Concept"}}, {_id:6861, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video titled \"1nhXsnx5--Y\" hosted at the provided URL, containing a transcript with grammatical corrections and philosophical commentary.", created_at:1779651078, source_id:"chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1", entity_id:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y"}}, {_id:6862, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Grammatical edits involving capitalizing the first word of sentences and adjusting punctuation in the original text.", created_at:1779651078, source_id:"chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1", entity_id:"Capitalization Corrections"}}, {_id:6863, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Revised text demonstrating corrected capitalization and punctuation, retaining the original meaning and structure of the philosophical commentary.", created_at:1779651078, source_id:"chunk-5b6ea8ea6a84c14eccce239691136bf1", entity_id:"Final Synthesized Text"}}, {_id:6864, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1nhXsnx5--Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1nhXsnx5--Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The instantaneous alignment of existing relationships into s