utube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779652042, description:"Phrase analyzed for potential mishearing or typo in the context of perception and physical reality.<SEP>\"see beyond the physical, even *totally*\" is a debated phrase analyzed for potential mishearing or typo in the video.<SEP>\"see beyond the physical, even *totally*\" is a phrase analyzed in the video, potentially representing a mishearing or unconventional expression related to transcending physical limitations.", source_id:"chunk-96c40ba90756818741bbddb2688da9b1<SEP>chunk-693990970e9a3acc089ef62a4275e988<SEP>chunk-b1d6243bf1801493190f858e98ebae53", entity_id:"see beyond the physical, even *totally*"}}, {_id:6921, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of perceiving beyond the physical world, central to the video's discussion.", created_at:1779651870, source_id:"chunk-b2829c5543e47705d6bf746f29dc0222", entity_id:"Physical vs. Non-Physical Dimensions"}}, {_id:6922, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Proposed correction for the awkwardly phrased \"even *totally*\" in the original statement.", created_at:1779651870, source_id:"chunk-96c40ba90756818741bbddb2688da9b1", entity_id:"totally"}}, {_id:6923, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779651910, description:"A philosophical concept referring to dimensions beyond the physical, mentioned in the context of perception analysis.<SEP>Concept referenced in the context of perceiving other dimensions beyond the physical.<SEP>the being refers to an entity discussed in the video, analyzed in the context of perceiving dimensions beyond the physical.", source_id:"chunk-b282