ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of perceiving reality beyond physical limitations, mentioned in the video's dialogue.", created_at:1779651931, source_id:"chunk-e44d313f22fce52b1f40cb85ed7cc5d5", entity_id:"Seeing Beyond the Physical"}}, {_id:6935, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"Totally\" is a contested term in the video's transcript, interpreted as part of a non-standard phrase about transcending physical perception.", created_at:1779651931, source_id:"chunk-e44d313f22fce52b1f40cb85ed7cc5d5", entity_id:"Totally"}}, {_id:6936, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: NJQ573JDmAg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NJQ573JDmAg)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"NJQ573JDmAg is a YouTube video discussing perceptions beyond the physical realm and linguistic interpretations of phrases like \"see beyond the physical, even *totally*\".", created_at:1779652042, source_id:"chunk-b1d6243bf1801493190f858e98ebae53", entity_id:"NJQ573JDmAg"}}, {_id:6937, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A phrase from the video transcript interpreted as potentially meaningful in the context of discussing attitudes.", created_at:1779652066, source_id:"chunk-4b36372af05da8e8e3e714562b5f0832", entity_id:"Phrase \"Fix *this* attitude a day\""}}, {_id:6938, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A phrase from the video transcript considered a possible typo or alternative interpretation of \"Fix *this* attitude a day.\"", created_at:1779652066, source_id:"chunk-4b36372af05da8e8e3e714562b5f0832", entity_id:"Phrase \"Fix *it* a day\""}}, {_id:6939, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"The YouTube video with the URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU, serving as the source for the task.<SEP>YouTube Video titled \"ffhDTzE4nDU\" hosted at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU, containing educational content about food stages and eating timing.", created_at:1779652723, source_id:"chunk-0e391fe0cec27f44babfa66b10652acf<SEP>chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312", entity_id:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU"}}, {_id:6941, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Eating disorders and weight gain problems are addressed through mindful eating practices described in the text.<SEP>Eating disorders are psychological conditions characterized by abnormal or irregular eating habits, addressed through conscious eating practices.", created_at:1779652329, source_id:"chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f<SEP>chunk-463d3565b6195eb54c22ef1f1f467400", entity_id:"Eating Disorders"}}, {_id:6942, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An ancient Sanskrit phrase meaning \"food is the embodiment of the universe,\" emphasizing universal consciousness in food.<SEP>Annam Para Brahma Swarupam is a Sanskrit phrase meaning \"food is the embodiment of the divine,\" emphasizing the sacred nature of food in spiritual traditions.<SEP>Ancient saying meaning \"food is the form of the universe,\" emphasizing the universal consciousness in food.<SEP>An ancient saying equating food with divine energy, emphasizing its spiritual significance.", created_at:1779652747, source_id:"chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f<SEP>chunk-463d3565b6195eb54c22ef1f1f467400<SEP>chunk-78435e02477a2c8cddea91202785185f<SEP>chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6", entity_id:"Annam Para Brahma Swarupam"}}, {_id:6943, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Eating time is guided by awareness and natural cycles, with recommendations to eat before sunset and maintain a 14-hour gap between meals.", created_at:1779652162, source_id:"chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f", entity_id:"Eating Time"}}, {_id:6944, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Sadness leaves impressions on clothes and skin, requiring cleansing rituals to remove negative imprints.`", created_at:1779652197, source_id:"chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f", entity_id:"Clothes and Skin"}}, {_id:6945, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The cook's emotional state (anger, sadness, fear) imprints on food, affecting those who consume it.<SEP>Emotional state refers to feelings like anger, sadness, fear, joy, or peace that influence food preparation and consumption.", created_at:1779652747, source_id:"chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f<SEP>chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6", entity_id:"Emotional State"}}, {_id:6946, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Mindful eating practices prevent disorders and promote a joyful, radiant state.", created_at:1779652197, source_id:"chunk-cd2b7f6d90a6185f05822cdaaff1892f", entity_id:"Mindful Eating"}}, {_id:6947, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stages of food are discussed in the text, with four fundamental insights associated with each stage.<SEP>Four stages of food (growing, cooking, etc.) with associated principles and insights.", created_at:1779652259, source_id:"chunk-7abc8246769d79ec45e124d07054c776<SEP>chunk-eaeab9baa97a4cf5f954f6f446db65b6", entity_id:"Stages of Food"}}, {_id:6948, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Four fundamental insights are mentioned in relation to stages of food in the text.<SEP>Key insights corresponding to each stage of food consumption as per the video's educational content.", created_at:1779652723, source_id:"chunk-7abc8246769d79ec45e124d07054c776<SEP>chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312", entity_id:"Four Fundamental Insights"}}, {_id:6949, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Emotions like anger, sadness, or joy during cooking that leave energetic impressions on food.", created_at:1779652259, source_id:"chunk-eaeab9baa97a4cf5f954f6f446db65b6", entity_id:"Emotional Impressions"}}, {_id:6950, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"First stage of food involving plant cultivation with the principle of avoiding harmful substances on crops.", created_at:1779652259, source_id:"chunk-eaeab9baa97a4cf5f954f6f446db65b6", entity_id:"Growing Stage"}}] AS row
