ct rather than ideals.", created_at:1779655593, source_id:"chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6<SEP>chunk-12740ae94c3469761e52a81015d8effe", entity_id:"Traffic Rules"}}, {_id:7107, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Non-idealistic codes governing international conduct.<SEP>Travel regulations are legal requirements for international or domestic travel, categorized under codes of conduct.", created_at:1779655593, source_id:"chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6<SEP>chunk-12740ae94c3469761e52a81015d8effe", entity_id:"Travel Regulations"}}, {_id:7108, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"guidance", truncate:"", description:"Moral conflict arises between what is morally right and wrong.<SEP>Spiritual action provides direction in ethical dilemmas.`", created_at:1779655487, source_id:"chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6<SEP>chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1", entity_id:"Moral Conflict"}}, {_id:7110, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ethical conflict pertains to dilemmas involving ethical decisions.", created_at:1779655487, source_id:"chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1", entity_id:"Ethical Conflict"}}, {_id:7111, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Moral dilemma is a situation requiring difficult choices between conflicting values.<SEP>Moral dilemma describes a situation requiring ethical decision-making, resolved through self-connection.", created_at:1779655589, source_id:"chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1<SEP>chunk-bf98c80e4c8e0ceabdc9951dcc42a4ec", entity_id:"Moral Dilemma"}}, {_id:7112, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 1PlGMOAypCI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1PlGMOAypCI)", entity_type:"concept", trun