Dhara is a name for the Earth goddess, reflecting cultural and spiritual reverence for nature. She is also a personified deity or concept symbolizing the Earth, often associated with fertility and sustenance in cultural contexts.", source_id:"chunk-db646f91c44917314e3ecaeda5d3d784<SEP>chunk-9db93c0b45cbf139f6a12d613ee43436<SEP>chunk-87caa4c6da0d8a78b074c0b3278712b2<SEP>chunk-107c751ebd180e85a682c38218c60f2a<SEP>chunk-a28c71d3080d41b1e18683441ac8c1c6", entity_id:"Dhara"}}, {_id:7174, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779659819, description:"{\"Description\": \"The \\\"life giver\\\" is a concept representing an entity that provides or sustains life, emphasized as being more significant than life itself in the context of celebration.\"}<SEP>The Life Giver is a concept symbolizing the source of all life, closely tied to the celebration of interconnectedness with nature.<SEP>The Life Giver is a concept symbolizing the source of all life, closely tied to the celebration of interconnectedness with nature.<SEP>The Life Giver is a concept symbolizing the source of all life, closely tied to the celebration of interconnectedness with nature.<SEP>Life Giver is a conceptual term in the text relating to entities that sustain life.", source_id:"chunk-9db93c0b45cbf139f6a12d613ee43436<SEP>chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29<SEP>chunk-456304668c2993662550f7a84adc904b", entity_id:"Life Giver"}}, {_id:7175, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"Mr1cjAz2y9I is a YouTube video containing text requiring correction for the Mukthi Guru platform.<SEP>Mr1cjAz2y9I is a YouTube video containing text requiring correction for the Mukthi Guru platform.<SEP>Mr1cjAz2y9I is a video identifier used in YouTube URLs.", created_at:1779659819, source_id:"chunk-49b001b9176c6f2a9840cbab29ab25fc<SEP>chunk-456304668c2993662550f7a84adc904b", entity_id:"Mr1cjAz2y9I"}}, {_id:7176, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ritualistic act describes a formalized, possibly superficial form of celebration contrasted with genuine appreciation in the text.<SEP>Ritualistic act describes a formalized, possibly superficial form of celebration contrasted with genuine appreciation in the text.", created_at:1779658878, source_id:"chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29", entity_id:"Ritualistic Act"}}, {_id:7177, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Heartfelt appreciation is a concept emphasizing sincere gratitude and emotional connection to nature.<SEP>Heartfelt appreciation is a concept emphasizing sincere gratitude and emotional connection to nature.", created_at:1779658878, source_id:"chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29<SEP>chunk-c70b663ec8c2f1951db8e07e51d5edd1", entity_id:"Heartfelt Appreciation"}}, {_id:7178, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The sense of the wind is a natural phenomenon, described as a distinct element in the list of Earth's manifestations.", created_at:1779659337, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40", entity_id:"Sense of the Wind"}}] AS row
