t and awake.", created_at:1779665557, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43", entity_id:"Heart's Consciousness Field"}}, {_id:7407, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Loving attention is the focused care and presence given to a loved one, which is more valuable than solutions.<SEP>Loving attention describes undistracted, patient focus directed toward another person, fostering connection and healing without desperation.", created_at:1779665564, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43<SEP>chunk-112f236855c8c9ac7864c1e2a1d43d1a", entity_id:"Loving Attention"}}, {_id:7408, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Loved one's needs may only require loving attention, not solutions.", created_at:1779665563, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43", entity_id:"Loved One's Needs"}}, {_id:7409, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"An awake heart fosters loving patience.", created_at:1779665563, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43", entity_id:"Awake Heart"}}, {_id:7410, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The heart's consciousness field connects with the loved one's heart field, initiating healing.", created_at:1779665563, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43", entity_id:"Loved One's Heart Field"}}, {_id:7411, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"An awake heart fosters loving patience.", created_at:1779665563, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76edc2c33e41cc81ed43", entity_id:"Loving Patience"}}, {_id:7412, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"An awake heart enables intense attention.", created_at:1779665564, source_id:"chunk-40152a1fb18e76ed