UNWIND [{_id:7422, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Massmen is a transcription error in the text, likely intended to be corrected to a meaningful term related to the context of \"I am.\"`<SEP>Massmen is a problematic term in the text, suspected to be a transcription error or noise in the original statement.`<SEP>Massmen is a transcription error in the text, likely intended to be corrected to a meaningful term related to the context of \"I am.\"`<SEP>Massmen is a problematic term in the text, suspected to be a transcription error or noise in the original statement.`<SEP>Massmen denotes the collective consciousness or universal self, emphasizing unity with all existence.<SEP>Non-standard term \"Massmen\" appearing in the transcript, possibly a phonetic mishearing or ambiguous phrase.<SEP>Massmen represents the collective human consciousness or universal awareness concept discussed in the text.", created_at:1779665845, source_id:"chunk-c2e9ff77673d9126b2f975a8e07b2ddc<SEP>chunk-11324ba4a521604eab0a83749fcd1adc<SEP>chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-b581d80fb3e1672b9184e7ccb9a394ea<SEP>chunk-ed14675eaeee5b36e94642ad031a9dc4", entity_id:"Massmen"}}, {_id:7423, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ahamra appears as a transcription error in the text, likely a mishearing of \"Aham.\"`<SEP>Ahamra is a term considered a potential transcription error in the context of philosophical statements.`<SEP>Ahamra appears as a transcription error in the text, likely a mishearing of \"Aham.\"`<SEP>Ahamra is a term considered a potential transcription error in the context of philosophical statements.`<SEP>Ahamra represents the realization of the self as the ultimate reality, often expressed as \"I am\" in spiritual contexts.<SEP>Unclear term \"Ahamra\" in the transcript, potentially a mishearing of \"Aham Brahmasmi\" or similar concept.<SEP>Ahamra refers to the enlightened state of \"I am\" consciousness as part of cosmic awareness teachings.", created_at:1779665845, source_id:"chunk-c2e9ff77673d9126b2f975a8e07b2ddc<SEP>chunk-11324ba4a521604eab0a83749fcd1adc<SEP>chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-b581d80fb3e1672b9184e7ccb9a394ea<SEP>chunk-ed14675eaeee5b36e94642ad031a9dc4", entity_id:"Ahamra"}}, {_id:7424, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Aham represents the corrected form of \"Ahamra,\" interpreted as a direct reference to the self in philosophical context.`<SEP>Aham represents the corrected form of \"Ahamra,\" interpreted as a direct reference to the self in philosophical context.`", created_at:1779665658, source_id:"chunk-172ec349090cbf826d8d59acfa0cb188<SEP>chunk-c2e9ff77673d9126b2f975a8e07b2ddc<SEP>chunk-11324ba4a521604eab0a83749fcd1adc", entity_id:"Aham"}}, {_id:7425, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"TatTamasee is a term in the text, likely a misspelling of Tatparamasi, and is part of a list of concepts related to transcription errors and corrections.`<SEP>TatTamasee refers to a state of consciousness or philosophical concept discussed in the text.`<SEP>TatTamasee refers to a state of consciousness described in the text, associated with philosophical experience.`<SEP>TatTamasee is a term in the text, likely a misspelling of Tatparamasi, and is part of a list of concepts related to transcription errors and corrections.`<SEP>TatTamasee refers to a state of consciousness or philosophical concept discussed in the text.`<SEP>TatTamasee refers to a state of consciousness described in the text, associated with philosophical experience.`", created_at:1779665657, source_id:"chunk-c2e9ff77673d9126b2f975a8e07b2ddc<SEP>chunk-11324ba4a521604eab0a83749fcd1adc", entity_id:"TatTamasee"}}, {_id:7426, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Advaita Vedanta is the philosophical tradition contextualizing the interpreted statements about self and ultimate reality.`<SEP>Advaita Vedanta is the philosophical tradition contextualizing the interpreted statements about self and ultimate reality.`", created_at:1779665658, source_id:"chunk-c2e9ff77673d9126b2f975a8e07b2ddc", entity_id:"Advaita Vedanta"}}, {_id:7428, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779665894, description:"\"Tatwa Masih\" in the Prov` (This was cut off, but the intent is clear).<SEP>Tatwa Masih refers to an enlightened state of being characterized by the realization of ultimate reality and cosmic consciousness.<SEP>Phonetic mishearing of \"Tatvamasi\" in the transcript, referencing a philosophical concept.<SEP>Original misheard term later corrected to \"Tatvamasi.\"<SEP>Original misspelling of \"Tatvamasi\" in the text.", source_id:"chunk-82784ea8fabb1f9041b72681c23fac84<SEP>chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-b581d80fb3e1672b9184e7ccb9a394ea<SEP>chunk-312a7e6dcdab5fa1268941f1387c1ed0<SEP>chunk-e0651d1d759d9ec9887e923e28bd51f5", entity_id:"Tatwa Masih"}}, {_id:7429, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video discussing corrections for the 'Mukthi Guru' platform's texts.<SEP>A YouTube video discussing corrections for the 'Mukthi Guru' platform's texts.", created_at:1779665656, source_id:"chunk-c00a8eefe100525e46599a752324e087", entity_id:"YouTube Video (oaKWpxmu0YI)"}}, {_id:7430, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vNj7OSHos1I)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"A list of domain-specific terms and homophones to be corrected in the 'Mukthi Guru' platform's texts.<SEP>A list of domain-specific terms and homophones to be corrected in the 'Mukthi Guru' platform's texts.<SEP>List of Corrections contains domain-specific terms and homophones to guide text correction.<SEP>List of Corrections contains domain-specific terms and homophones to guide text correction.<SEP>List of Corrections contains domain-specific terms and homophones to guide text correction.<SEP>List of Corrections contains domain-specific terms and homophones to guide text correction.<SEP>List of Corrections contains domain-specific terms and homophones to guide text correction.", created_at:1779723559, source_id:"chunk-c00a8eefe100525e46599a752324e087<SEP>chunk-25889c9ac840d16fb7ae03c1e584ad1b", entity_id:"List of Corrections"}}, {_id:7431, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779665954, description:"<think>
Okay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to extract the actual spiritual content from the contaminated text provided. The contaminated text includes a lot of developer instructions and conflicting descriptions.

First, I need to identify the real spiritual teachings or definitions. The entity in question is the Brahma-Sutras. The text mentions variations in spelling like \"Brahma-Sutras\" vs \"Brahmasutras\" and different descriptions. 

Looking through the descriptions, the key points are that it's a Sanskrit philosophical text, compiled by Vyasa, discusses enlightened states, reality, consciousness, cosmic consciousness, human potential, and is referenced in teachings. There's also mention of it being part of the Upanishads and having inconsistent capitalization.

I need to reconcile these points. The main elements are the text's content (enlightened states, reality, consciousness), its origin (compiled by Vyasa, Sanskrit), and its references. The variations in spelling and capitalization are noted but don't affect the core content. The conflicting parts about being a single text or multiple texts can be addressed by stating \"texts\" to cover both possibilities.

So, the clean description should mention the Brahma-Sutras as Sanskrit philosophical texts compiled by Vyasa, discussing enlightened states, reality, consciousness, cosmic consciousness, and human potential, with references in teachings and possible variations in spelling and structure.
</think>

The Brahma-Sutras are ancient Sanskrit philosophical texts compiling teachings on enlightened states of consciousness, the nature of reality, and cosmic awareness. Traditionally attributed to Vyasa, they explore concepts like consciousness and human potential, with variations in spelling (Brahma-Sutras/Brahmasutras) and references across different traditions. The texts reconcile diverse interpretations of enlightenment and reality as understood by ancient sages, often addressing both metaphysical principles and practical spiritual growth.", source_id:"chunk-0f41e4f1e81b951f715718bd721d4f9b<SEP>chunk-0f5cc695879f69fa0bc7fb0810db881c<SEP>chunk-312a7e6dcdab5fa1268941f1387c1ed0<SEP>chunk-8f1a363d87bc0be2ccf5c1de79b00140<SEP>chunk-ed14675eaeee5b36e94642ad031a9dc4<SEP>chunk-e0651d1d759d9ec9887e923e28bd51f5<SEP>chunk-85df277d52184fe481533e8c7c5ed363<SEP>chunk-25679c68ddef27fd2e2fa60d50bdcb05", entity_id:"Brahma-Sutras"}}, {_id:7432, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779665932, description:"A Sanskrit phrase meaning \"Truth, Goodness, and Beauty,\" describing enlightened states of consciousness emphasized in the teachings.<SEP>Satyam Shivam Sundaram refers to a sacred state of consciousness characterized by immeasurable beauty and divine sacredness, as described in the Brahma-Sutras.<SEP>Satyam Shivam Sundaram refers to a state of reality where beauty, sacredness, and divine experience are immeasurably present.", source_id:"chunk-0f5cc695879f69fa0bc7fb0810db881c<SEP>chunk-8f1a363d87bc0be2ccf5c1de79b00140<SEP>chunk-25679c68ddef27fd2e2fa60d50bdcb05", entity_id:"Satyam Shivam Sundaram"}}, {_id:7433, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", created_at:1779665974, description:"Mukti Diksha is a spiritual initiation process described in the text, leading to profound states of consciousness.<SEP>A spiritual initiation leading to profound self-realization and unity experiences in the entrepreneur.<SEP>A spiritual initiation leading to profound self-realization and unity experiences in the entrepreneur.<SEP>Mukti Diksha is a spiritual initiation or liberation ritual referenced in the context of an entrepreneur's transformative experience.", source_id:"chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-cd8bf67cc8d8498084f884afbf901342<SEP>chunk-ade616c2567b32dc9ebbc4ced1ffc773", entity_id:"Mukti Diksha"}}, {_id:7434, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A fellow spiritual seeker perceived by the entrepreneur as an extension of his own consciousness during the enlightened state.", created_at:1779665739, source_id:"chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d", entity_id:"Fellow Seeker"}}, {_id:7435, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cosmic consciousness is described as the ultimate state of awareness, linked to the Brahmasutras in the text.<SEP>Cosmic consciousness is portrayed as a universal, limitless state of awareness transcending physical form.", created_at:1779665845, source_id:"chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-ed14675eaeee5b36e94642ad031a9dc4", entity_id:"Cosmic Consciousness"}}, {_id:7436, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Great State of Being describes a profound spiritual condition characterized by enlightenment and unity with the universe.<SEP>A transcendent state of existence marked by vitality and spiritual fulfillment, as exemplified by the man's enduring condition.", created_at:1779665975, source_id:"chunk-e849cfea716f1fa6ab5ddfe4a147b56d<SEP>chunk-ade616c2567b32dc9ebbc4ced1ffc773", entity_id:"Great State of Being"}}, {_id:7437, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Philosophical concept from Hindu traditions meaning \"That thou art,\" representing unity of self and universal consciousness.<SEP>Philosophical concept meaning \"That Thou Art,\" central to Hindu philosophy.<SEP>An enlightened state described as \"immeasurable\" where the sense of self dissolves into universal consciousness.<SEP>An enlightened state described as \"immeasurable\" where the sense of self dissolves into universal consciousness.<SEP>Tatvamasi refers to the enlightened consciousness state of \"I am\" as described in the text.<SEP>Tatvamasi is a Sanskrit term corrected from \"Tatwa Masih\" and \"Tatamasee\" in the text.<SEP>Tatvamasi is an enlightened state described as \"You are that,\" associated with spiritual unity and self-realization.", created_at:1779665974, source_id:"chunk-b581d80fb3e1672b9184e7ccb9a394ea<SEP>chunk-312a7e6dcdab5fa1268941f1387c1ed0<SEP>chunk-cd8bf67cc8d8498084f884afbf901342<SEP>chunk-ed14675eaeee5b36e94642ad031a9dc4<SEP>chunk-e0651d1d759d9ec9887e923e28bd51f5<SEP>chunk-ade616c2567b32dc9ebbc4ced1ffc773", entity_id:"Tatvamasi"}}, {_id:7438, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Uncertainty about whether \"Massmen\" and \"Ahamra\" are errors or intentional non-standard terms.", created_at:1779665760, source_id:"chunk-b581d80fb3e1672b9184e7ccb9a394ea", entity_id:"Transcription Error Ambiguity"}}, {_id:7440, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Brahma-Sutras provide a detailed conceptual framework for understanding enlightened states of consciousness.", created_at:1779665788, source_id:"chunk-8f1a363d87bc0be2ccf5c1de79b00140", entity_id:"enlightened states of consciousness"}}, {_id:7441, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Brahma-Sutras articulate philosophical concepts about the nature of reality and consciousness as perceived by ancient sages.", created_at:1779665788, source_id:"chunk-8f1a363d87bc0be2ccf5c1de79b00140", entity_id:"reality and consciousness"}}, {_id:7442, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Brahma-Sutras serve as a reminder of humanity's capacity to experience enlightened states of consciousness.", created_at:1779665789, source_id:"chunk-8f1a363d87bc0be2ccf5c1de79b00140", entity_id:"humanity's potential"}}, {_id:7443, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Shivam Sundaram is a spiritual teacher discussing enlightened states and sacred experiences in a YouTube video.<SEP>Shivam Sundaram is a spiritual teacher discussing enlightened states and sacred experiences in a YouTube video.", created_at:1779665838, source_id:"chunk-cd8bf67cc8d8498084f884afbf901342", entity_id:"Shivam Sundaram"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7444, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A seeker diagnosed with terminal skin cancer who experienced profound spiritual transformation during a retreat.<SEP>A seeker diagnosed with terminal skin cancer who experienced profound spiritual transformation during a retreat.", created_at:1779665838, source_id:"chunk-cd8bf67cc8d8498084f884afbf901342", entity_id:"Seeker with Skin Cancer"}}, {_id:7446, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The original text refers to \"Brahma Sutras\" without hyphenation, later corrected to \"Brahma-Sutras\".", created_at:1779665845, source_id:"chunk-ed14675eaeee5b36e94642ad031a9dc4", entity_id:"Brahma-Sutras (Original Text)"}}, {_id:7447, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Profound utterances replaced \"pity utterances\" to reflect intended meaning.", created_at:1779665894, source_id:"chunk-e0651d1d759d9ec9887e923e28bd51f5", entity_id:"Profound Utterances"}}, {_id:7448, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Original incorrect term later corrected to \"profound utterances\".", created_at:1779665894, source_id:"chunk-e0651d1d759d9ec9887e923e28bd51f5", entity_id:"Pity Utterances"}}, {_id:7449, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Shivam Sundaram explains these concepts as pathways to sacred experiences and self-realization.", created_at:1779665908, source_id:"chunk-cd8bf67cc8d8498084f884afbf901342", entity_id:"Tatvamasi/Tatparamasi"}}, {_id:7450, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"Retreats are spiritual gatherings organized by the group where seekers explore consciousness and enlightenment.", created_at:1779665932, source_id:"chunk-25679c68ddef27fd2e2fa60d50bdcb05", entity_id:"Retreats"}}, {_id:7451, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Enlightened Sages are spiritual figures whose teachings and experiences of consciousness Vyasa compiled into the Brahma-Sutras.", created_at:1779665932, source_id:"chunk-25679c68ddef27fd2e2fa60d50bdcb05", entity_id:"Enlightened Sages"}}, {_id:7452, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: oaKWpxmu0YI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oaKWpxmu0YI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The seeker perceived the air as sacred during their enlightened experience.", created_at:1779665959, source_id:"chunk-25679c68ddef27fd2e2fa60d50bdcb05", entity_id:"Air"}}, {_id:7453, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The child overcomes bed wetting after understanding the environmental impact of his habits through his mother's guidance.<SEP>The child overcomes bed wetting after understanding the environmental impact of his habits through his mother's guidance.", created_at:1779666020, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1", entity_id:"Five-Year-Old Child"}}, {_id:7455, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Preethaji's Earth Day message highlights environmental responsibility and inspires action to protect Mother Earth.<SEP>Preethaji's Earth Day message highlights environmental responsibility and inspires action to protect Mother Earth.", created_at:1779666020, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1", entity_id:"Earth Day Message"}}, {_id:7456, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"product", truncate:"", description:"Detergent is mentioned as a resource used in washing, contributing to environmental strain on rivers and ecosystems.<SEP>Detergent is mentioned as a resource used in washing, contributing to environmental strain on rivers and ecosystems.", created_at:1779666020, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1", entity_id:"Detergent"}}, {_id:7457, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"product", truncate:"", description:"Soap is listed as a resource used in washing, linked to environmental impact on trees and animals.<SEP>Soap is listed as a resource used in washing, linked to environmental impact on trees and animals.", created_at:1779666020, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1", entity_id:"Soap"}}, {_id:7458, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Rivers are cited as part of Mother Earth's ecosystems affected by excessive resource use.<SEP>Rivers are cited as part of Mother Earth's ecosystems affected by excessive resource use.", created_at:1779666020, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1", entity_id:"Rivers"}}, {_id:7459, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Yatha raja tatha praja is a Sanskrit proverb meaning \"As the king, so the citizens,\" emphasizing the influence of leadership on societal behavior.<SEP>Yatha raja tatha praja is a Sanskrit proverb meaning \"As the king, so the citizens,\" emphasizing the influence of leadership on societal behavior.<SEP>Yatha raja tatha praja is a principle meaning \"as the leader, so the team,\" emphasizing top-down culture.", created_at:1779666024, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1<SEP>chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082", entity_id:"Yatha Raja Tatha Praja"}}, {_id:7460, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"New consciousness refers to a state of awareness required to address challenges in the emerging world, contrasting with old, separation-driven thinking.<SEP>New consciousness refers to a state of awareness required to address challenges in the emerging world, contrasting with old, separation-driven thinking.<SEP>New Consciousness refers to a state of unified awareness and elevated perception beyond individual boundaries, promoted through collective breathing.", created_at:1779735101, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1<SEP>chunk-e59acdfefe902b458f46f2ae6d7334ea", entity_id:"New Consciousness"}}, {_id:7461, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The Lady is a speaker who advises on leadership, consciousness, and organizational purpose.", created_at:1779666024, source_id:"chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082", entity_id:"The Lady"}}, {_id:7462, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Higher purpose is a corporate goal that includes well-being for employees, the environment, and the earth.", created_at:1779666024, source_id:"chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082", entity_id:"Higher Purpose"}}, {_id:7465, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The child resolves bed wetting after understanding the environmental consequences of his actions.", created_at:1779666052, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1", entity_id:"Bed Wetting"}}, {_id:7466, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The Mystic Secrets is an online course described as a powerful spiritual journey for teams to undertake, led by Pritharji.", created_at:1779666070, source_id:"chunk-20b522ad915c05aa0d61fb0dbb9917a4", entity_id:"The Mystic Secrets"}}, {_id:7467, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Pritharji is the leader of The Mystic Secrets and guides participants through a mystic journey.", created_at:1779666070, source_id:"chunk-20b522ad915c05aa0d61fb0dbb9917a4", entity_id:"Pritharji"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7468, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Communal violence refers to conflicts arising from group divisions, often exacerbated by societal anxiety and differences in identity.<SEP>Communal violence refers to conflicts or hostility between groups based on shared identity, often exacerbated by social anxiety.<SEP>Communal violence refers to conflicts or hostility between groups based on shared identity, often exacerbated by social anxiety.", created_at:1779666384, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4<SEP>chunk-10bef6757e8808291f38e464343bf8be", entity_id:"Communal Violence"}}, {_id:7469, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Differences encompass variations in appearance, values, or identity that humans often perceive as threats despite shared biological and emotional commonalities.<SEP>Perception of variation or divergence in characteristics, leading to social division and threat responses.", created_at:1779666379, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4<SEP>chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Differences"}}, {_id:7474, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Research indicates that stress reduces the brain's capacity to accept differences, fostering alienation.<SEP>Scientific investigation demonstrating that stress increases aversion to differences, correlating with social alienation in competitive environments.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4<SEP>chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Research"}}, {_id:7475, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Humans share nearly two million years of evolutionary history, emphasizing biological unity despite superficial divisions.", created_at:1779666081, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4", entity_id:"Evolutionary History"}}, {_id:7476, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Competitive organizations practice social alienation more frequently due to stress-driven environments.", created_at:1779666123, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4", entity_id:"Competitive Organizations"}}, {_id:7477, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Research shows stress reduces the brain's acceptance of differences, increasing alienation.", created_at:1779666123, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4", entity_id:"Brain Behavior"}}, {_id:7478, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Shared evolutionary history underscores the illusion of differences and promotes unity.", created_at:1779666123, source_id:"chunk-1939ef89c77285b5d61536082f605bb4", entity_id:"Human Unity"}}, {_id:7479, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 6-GWHR9_iSU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6-GWHR9_iSU)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"Sarvam khalvidam Brahman\" is one Brahma Sutra stating that all existence is Brahman.<SEP>Sarvam khalvidam Brahman is a philosophical concept representing the unity of all existence as Brahman.<SEP>One of the Brahma Sutras stating \"all that exists is Brahman,\" encapsulating the unity of consciousness.", created_at:1779666246, source_id:"chunk-ef84739ec9f14b6d1ebaee11b611e3e8<SEP>chunk-e62e4366c052c78d46a09bec53d2a9c4<SEP>chunk-5b76959242343174ca2993b42bcf33e0", entity_id:"Sarvam khalvidam Brahman"}}, {_id:7482, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Brahman encompasses all entities including Devas, Suras, and Lokas as part of its indivisible consciousness.", created_at:1779666217, source_id:"chunk-ef84739ec9f14b6d1ebaee11b611e3e8", entity_id:"Devas, Suras, Lokas"}}, {_id:7483, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Spirits are described as pervading other Lokas, indicating their presence across different planes of existence.", created_at:1779666217, source_id:"chunk-ef84739ec9f14b6d1ebaee11b611e3e8", entity_id:"spirits"}}, {_id:7484, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Brahman is described as encompassing both the physical universe and higher consciousness states.", created_at:1779666218, source_id:"chunk-ef84739ec9f14b6d1ebaee11b611e3e8", entity_id:"physical universe, consciousness"}}, {_id:7486, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Domain-Specific Names are terms that are particular to a specific field, requiring careful attention to avoid errors. Because they are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms, they are often targeted for refinement to ensure accuracy and consistency within their respective domains. The correction process involves refining these names to improve precision and reduce the risk of misinterpretation, thereby supporting the overall reliability of technical discourse. By addressing the misuse of domain-specific terms, the correction effort aims to maintain clarity and reliability in technical communication. Domain-Specific Names serve both as identifiers of specialized concepts and as subjects of correction to maintain clarity and reliability in technical communication. Their refinement ensures that terminology remains precise and consistent, which is essential for accurate knowledge transfer and collaborative work across disciplines.

The focus on correction highlights the importance of precise terminology in specialized contexts, where misuse can lead to misunderstandings or errors. Multiple descriptions consistently identify Domain-Specific Names as a focus area for correction, involving specific terms. The correction effort aims to maintain clarity and reliability in technical communication, ensuring that terminology remains precise and consistent across disciplines.<SEP>Domain-Specific Names are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms.<SEP>Domain-Specific Names are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms.<SEP>Domain-Specific Names are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms.<SEP>Domain-Specific Names are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms.<SEP>Domain-Specific Names are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms.<SEP>Domain-Specific Names are a focus area for correction, involving specific terms.", created_at:1779754705, source_id:"chunk-db7d5a106bdc58ffca9bc17f8723f7e5<SEP>chunk-6052761888817e6a639d7d02535dd8c5", entity_id:"Domain-Specific Names"}}, {_id:7487, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk is a video hosted on YouTube with the URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk.", created_at:1779666265, source_id:"chunk-db7d5a106bdc58ffca9bc17f8723f7e5", entity_id:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk"}}, {_id:7488, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Primitive minds are described as a cause of viewing differences as threats, leading to hostility and conflict.<SEP>Primitive minds are described as a cause of viewing differences as threats, leading to hostility and conflict.", created_at:1779666384, source_id:"chunk-10bef6757e8808291f38e464343bf8be", entity_id:"Primitive Minds"}}, {_id:7489, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Elder siblings who alienate younger siblings due to age differences within familial relationships.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Older siblings"}}, {_id:7490, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Younger siblings experiencing alienation from older siblings in home environments.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Younger sibling"}}, {_id:7491, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Group of individuals categorized by social class who exhibit hostility towards those from different classes.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"People of one class"}}, {_id:7492, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Human cognitive tendencies that perceive differences as threats, leading to social division.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Primitive minds"}}, {_id:7493, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Group of individuals categorized by religious affiliation who demonstrate antagonism toward those with differing beliefs.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"People of one religion"}}, {_id:7494, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Behavioral phenomenon where groups or individuals isolate others based on perceived differences.", created_at:1779666378, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Social alienation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7495, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Collective aggression targeting specific communities or groups during periods of societal anxiety.", created_at:1779666379, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Communal violence"}}, {_id:7497, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Violent acts motivated by prejudice against racial or ethnic differences.", created_at:1779666379, source_id:"chunk-df19535ba38680d9457682cc02135690", entity_id:"Racial violence"}}, {_id:7498, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Discrimination and separation are presented as concepts that divide humanity despite shared biological and experiential unity.<SEP>Discrimination and separation as a compound subject in linguistic analysis, with debates over subject-verb agreement and phrasing.<SEP>Discrimination and separation is a compound subject requiring plural verb agreement in formal grammar.<SEP>Discrimination and separation is a compound subject requiring plural verb agreement in grammatical contexts.", created_at:1779667170, source_id:"chunk-8ef9c50f626a2c5bf33ddd61c9795988<SEP>chunk-82910be7ab066a3e5e12d9a354ef4d9a<SEP>chunk-2668d66263a2b6505795cf0f77b429d1<SEP>chunk-8bd898ca539c78d8b6ef24c1d5246fd3", entity_id:"Discrimination and Separation"}}, {_id:7499, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Stress and pressure are inevitable aspects of life, constantly present due to external and internal factors.<SEP>Stress and pressure are central themes in the text, representing internal and external challenges.<SEP>Abstract concepts related to life challenges, including sources like family members.", created_at:1779666649, source_id:"chunk-9de34e6e869087957a9232040a7b6bbb<SEP>chunk-c6481baa2ca6ec863ed7690cee69e3d0<SEP>chunk-2993029c625df32f843cfee8124d0621", entity_id:"Stress and Pressure"}}, {_id:7500, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"other", truncate:"", description:"Family and friends are social groups that often critique and create pressure through their interactions and expectations.", created_at:1779666428, source_id:"chunk-9de34e6e869087957a9232040a7b6bbb", entity_id:"Family and Friends"}}, {_id:7501, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Imperfection is the inherent reality that arises from the futile pursuit of perfection and the acceptance of human limitations.", created_at:1779666428, source_id:"chunk-9de34e6e869087957a9232040a7b6bbb", entity_id:"Imperfection"}}, {_id:7502, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The art of becoming free involves learning to manage and eventually transcend pressure through practice and mindset shifts.", created_at:1779666428, source_id:"chunk-9de34e6e869087957a9232040a7b6bbb", entity_id:"The Art of Becoming Free"}}, {_id:7503, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The struggle refers to the internal conflict between desiring freedom from pressure and the reality of its inevitability.", created_at:1779666428, source_id:"chunk-9de34e6e869087957a9232040a7b6bbb", entity_id:"The Struggle"}}, {_id:7504, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The mountain is used as a metaphor for the challenges in achieving mastery and overcoming pressure.", created_at:1779666429, source_id:"chunk-c6481baa2ca6ec863ed7690cee69e3d0", entity_id:"Mountain"}}, {_id:7505, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Climbing the mountain is a metaphor for personal growth, where initial struggles lead to eventual mastery through repetition.`<SEP>A metaphor for overcoming challenges, used in teaching.", created_at:1779666649, source_id:"chunk-ae2f2a9e144a0416a2b1367a6eab9be2<SEP>chunk-2993029c625df32f843cfee8124d0621", entity_id:"Climbing the Mountain"}}, {_id:7506, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Grammatical rule governing verb conjugation for compound subjects, central to the analysis of the phrase \"Discrimination and separation.\"<SEP>Subject-verb agreement refers to grammatical rules governing verb forms based on subject number and person.<SEP>A grammatical rule requiring plural verbs for compound subjects, which was violated in the original sentence.<SEP>A grammatical rule requiring plural verbs for compound subjects, which was violated in the original sentence.<SEP>Subject-verb agreement refers to grammatical rules governing verb forms based on subject number and person.", created_at:1779667170, source_id:"chunk-82910be7ab066a3e5e12d9a354ef4d9a<SEP>chunk-2668d66263a2b6505795cf0f77b429d1<SEP>chunk-c3bdf300b2509154604072df1057a411<SEP>chunk-8bd898ca539c78d8b6ef24c1d5246fd3", entity_id:"Subject-Verb Agreement"}}, {_id:7507, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Phrasing alternative treating \"discrimination and separation\" as two separate concepts rather than a unified idea.", created_at:1779666471, source_id:"chunk-82910be7ab066a3e5e12d9a354ef4d9a", entity_id:"Show It"}}, {_id:7508, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Linguistic standardization process to address grammatical inaccuracies in compound subjects.", created_at:1779666471, source_id:"chunk-82910be7ab066a3e5e12d9a354ef4d9a", entity_id:"Formal Correction"}}, {_id:7509, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A corrected phrase indicating passing on knowledge, part of teaching philosophy.", created_at:1779666649, source_id:"chunk-2993029c625df32f843cfee8124d0621", entity_id:"The One Can Pass On"}}, {_id:7510, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Teaching process involves instructing others in the pressure management system and mountain climbing metaphor to foster growth and replication of skills.", created_at:1779666682, source_id:"chunk-9e5acd479fd09231c065ea87c13da654", entity_id:"Teaching Process"}}, {_id:7511, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Pressure management system refers to a structured approach to freeing oneself from anxiety and stress through repeated practice and mastery.", created_at:1779666682, source_id:"chunk-9e5acd479fd09231c065ea87c13da654", entity_id:"Pressure Management System"}}, {_id:7512, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mountain climbing serves as a metaphor for overcoming challenges, where repeated attempts lead to gradual mastery and teaching others.", created_at:1779666682, source_id:"chunk-9e5acd479fd09231c065ea87c13da654", entity_id:"Mountain Climbing"}}, {_id:7513, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mastery describes the state of achieving expertise or control over a skill or challenge through repeated practice.", created_at:1779666682, source_id:"chunk-9e5acd479fd09231c065ea87c13da654", entity_id:"Mastery"}}, {_id:7514, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Top performers are individuals capable of handling immense pressure and maintaining a distinct mindset to excel in competitive environments.", created_at:1779666682, source_id:"chunk-9e5acd479fd09231c065ea87c13da654", entity_id:"Top Performers"}}, {_id:7515, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A phrase repeated multiple times in the video, with unclear meaning or context.<SEP>A phrase repeated multiple times in the video, with unclear meaning or context.", created_at:1779666748, source_id:"chunk-e89fe457f279dc3ff35ba4b344e51864", entity_id:"canpassen"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7516, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"contentinclusion", truncate:"", description:"The YouTube video titled \"Unknown\" includes the repetitive phrase \"passen if you can\" as part of its content.", created_at:1779666780, source_id:"chunk-3adc0b00dc9bbe71af03a8a969db534f", entity_id:"passen if you can"}}, {_id:7517, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"Npassen if you can\" is a repetitive phrase with unclear meaning, occurring frequently in the video's content.", created_at:1779666798, source_id:"chunk-e9f83e94ac7e939504ac19489ef21050", entity_id:"Npassen If You Can"}}, {_id:7518, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Compound subject in a sentence initially incorrectly paired with singular verb \"is\" instead of plural \"are.\"<SEP>A phrase analyzed for grammatical correctness, specifically regarding subject-verb agreement in the context of compound subjects.<SEP>A phrase analyzed for grammatical correctness, specifically regarding subject-verb agreement in the context of compound subjects.", created_at:1779667076, source_id:"chunk-d532c9dbfcedb5ca9d62eabfd2c0160e<SEP>chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01", entity_id:"Discrimination and separation"}}, {_id:7519, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video discussing grammatical corrections, specifically addressing subject-verb agreement in the phrase \"Discrimination and separation is no matter how you show it.\"", created_at:1779666826, source_id:"chunk-d532c9dbfcedb5ca9d62eabfd2c0160e", entity_id:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)"}}, {_id:7520, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A declaration presenting information as true or factual, typically used in formal or objective contexts.<SEP>A declaration presenting information as true or real, often used in formal contexts.", created_at:1779666826, source_id:"chunk-d532c9dbfcedb5ca9d62eabfd2c0160e", entity_id:"statement of fact"}}, {_id:7521, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An informal expression or phrase used in everyday language, often deviating from strict grammatical rules.<SEP>A common expression or phrase used informally, which may not follow strict grammatical rules.<SEP>A common informal expression or phrase used in everyday language, often deviating from strict grammatical rules.<SEP>A common informal expression or phrase used in everyday language, often deviating from strict grammatical rules.", created_at:1779667076, source_id:"chunk-d532c9dbfcedb5ca9d62eabfd2c0160e<SEP>chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01", entity_id:"colloquialism"}}, {_id:7522, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Grammatical rule requiring verbs to match the number of their subjects.<SEP>A grammatical rule governing the relationship between subjects and verbs, particularly in cases of compound subjects like \"Discrimination and separation.\"<SEP>A grammatical rule governing the relationship between subjects and verbs, particularly in cases of compound subjects like \"Discrimination and separation.\"", created_at:1779667076, source_id:"chunk-d532c9dbfcedb5ca9d62eabfd2c0160e<SEP>chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01", entity_id:"Subject-verb agreement"}}, {_id:7524, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Grammatical rule requiring plural verbs for subjects containing multiple nouns.", created_at:1779666835, source_id:"chunk-2668d66263a2b6505795cf0f77b429d1", entity_id:"Plural Verb Agreement"}}, {_id:7525, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Proposed correction \"Discrimination and separation *are* no matter how you show it,\" though deemed awkward, to fix subject-verb agreement.<SEP>Proposed correction \"Discrimination and separation *are* no matter how you show it,\" though deemed awkward, to fix subject-verb agreement.", created_at:1779667076, source_id:"chunk-c3bdf300b2509154604072df1057a411", entity_id:"Correction Attempt"}}, {_id:7526, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A grammatical structure where two or more nouns act together as the subject of a sentence, requiring plural verb agreement.<SEP>A grammatical structure where two or more nouns act together as the subject of a sentence, requiring plural verb agreement.", created_at:1779667076, source_id:"chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01", entity_id:"Compound subject"}}, {_id:7527, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A revised version of a statement adhering to formal grammatical standards and language conventions.<SEP>A revised version of a statement adhering to formal grammatical standards and language conventions.", created_at:1779667076, source_id:"chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01", entity_id:"formal correction"}}, {_id:7528, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube Video (nUrc8O7Avvk) is a video discussing grammatical analysis of a statement about discrimination and separation.", created_at:1779667170, source_id:"chunk-8bd898ca539c78d8b6ef24c1d5246fd3", entity_id:"YouTube Video (nUrc8O7Avvk)"}}, {_id:7529, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The child's life is described as being influenced by parental consciousness and actions, particularly suffering transmitted through genes.<SEP>The child's life is described as being influenced by parental consciousness and actions, particularly suffering transmitted through genes.<SEP>The child's life is described as being influenced by parental consciousness and actions, particularly suffering transmitted through genes.<SEP>The child's life is described as being influenced by parental consciousness and actions, particularly suffering transmitted through genes.<SEP>The child's life is described as being influenced by parental consciousness and actions, particularly suffering transmitted through genes.", created_at:1779667817, source_id:"chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1", entity_id:"Child's Life"}}, {_id:7530, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The fabric of intelligence is depicted as a vast system where individual actions manifest karma through interconnected consciousness.<SEP>The fabric of intelligence is depicted as a vast system where individual actions manifest karma through interconnected consciousness.<SEP>The fabric of intelligence is depicted as a vast system where individual actions manifest karma through interconnected consciousness.<SEP>The fabric of intelligence is depicted as a vast system where individual actions manifest karma through interconnected consciousness.<SEP>The fabric of intelligence is depicted as a vast system where individual actions manifest karma through interconnected consciousness.", created_at:1779667817, source_id:"chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1", entity_id:"Fabric of Intelligence"}}, {_id:7531, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"genes are depicted as a biological medium transmitting parental states and actions, perpetuating karmic cycles across generations.", created_at:1779667193, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"genes"}}, {_id:7533, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"karma is described as problems coming into one's life, influenced by consciousness and actions, manifesting through the fabric of intelligence.", created_at:1779667193, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"karma"}}, {_id:7534, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"actions are linked to consciousness and determine life experiences, with misaligned actions spreading negative energy into the \"fabric of intelligence.\"", created_at:1779667193, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"actions"}}, {_id:7536, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Parents are individuals whose conscious states and actions influence their children's lives, transmitting suffering through genes.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"parents"}}, {_id:7537, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Parents' suffering and disconnected states are transmitted through genes to children, affecting their consciousness and karma.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48", entity_id:"children"}}, {_id:7538, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Arma flows in consciousness is a process described as a continuous transmission of one's state and actions through generations, impacting individuals throughout their lives.", created_at:1779667228, source_id:"chunk-e984e154069661974d2a04e43c43e80a", entity_id:"Arma Flows in Consciousness"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7539, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Life Around refers to the surrounding environment and existence that individuals perceive and interact with, influencing their state and actions.", created_at:1779667228, source_id:"chunk-e984e154069661974d2a04e43c43e80a", entity_id:"Life Around"}}, {_id:7540, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A mental state characterized by the absence of conflicting emotions, enabling clear decision-making and connection to divine guidance.", created_at:1779667269, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b", entity_id:"State of Calm"}}, {_id:7541, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A mental state marked by anger, fear, jealousy, or shame that impairs judgment and leads to erroneous decisions.", created_at:1779667269, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b", entity_id:"State of Conflict"}}, {_id:7542, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The intuitive, self-referential guide for discovering answers within oneself during decision-making.<SEP>The inner voice represents introspection and self-reflection, critical for resolving inner conflict and making decisions.`", created_at:1779667269, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b<SEP>chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c", entity_id:"Inner Voice"}}, {_id:7543, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779668478, description:"Spiritual assistance sought to guide decisions and align with higher purpose.<SEP>Divine Support is a core theme of the original text.<SEP>Describes the invocation of higher guidance or spiritual backing in decision-making.", source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b<SEP>chunk-9dc446aa1478fdaca34017fdd93d325e<SEP>chunk-1237050e69d5492ce590be8ab6bd6b1d", entity_id:"Divine Support"}}, {_id:7544, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The process of calming destructive mental patterns to achieve clarity for decision-making.", created_at:1779667270, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b", entity_id:"Dissolving Conflicting Emotions"}}, {_id:7545, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Consideration for others' welfare in decision-making, reflecting compassion and interconnectedness.", created_at:1779667271, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b", entity_id:"Well-Being of the Other"}}, {_id:7546, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Dharma Shastra refers to ancient Indian ethical and legal codes guiding moral conduct and decision-making.`<SEP>A collection of ancient Indian ethical and legal codes that provide guidelines for moral conduct, though their application can lead to conflicts and interpretative challenges.<SEP>An ancient Indian text on dharma, correctly referenced in the video.<SEP>Dharma Shastra is a correct term in the context, referring to ancient Hindu scriptures.<SEP>Dharma Shastra is a correct term in the context, referring to ancient Hindu scriptures.", created_at:1779668308, source_id:"chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c<SEP>chunk-151ea8496c9d62859f2ebee56a03be85<SEP>chunk-a777766ccd192f3d87f1d3e0e9fa98c8<SEP>chunk-4b04f06e1e39aa9c677e71c36e21c89d", entity_id:"Dharma Shastra"}}, {_id:7547, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"The Pandavas are a group of brothers central to the Mahabharata, facing dilemmas about justice and action.`", created_at:1779667271, source_id:"chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c", entity_id:"Pandavas"}}, {_id:7548, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dharma Sankhata describes the conflict of Dharma (moral duty) in complex situations, as discussed in the Mahabharata.`<SEP>A philosophical concept representing the conflict of Dharma (righteous duty) as depicted in the Mahabharata, addressing the dilemma of determining the right course of action in complex moral situations.", created_at:1779667974, source_id:"chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c<SEP>chunk-151ea8496c9d62859f2ebee56a03be85", entity_id:"Dharma Sankhata"}}, {_id:7549, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Two parameters for decision-making: dissolving inner conflict and discovering answers through self-reflection.`", created_at:1779667272, source_id:"chunk-5139546d120bc87201fc62ee64d86e4c", entity_id:"Decision Parameters"}}, {_id:7550, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The characters' commitment to discovery is in conflict with Cruz's vision of control and order.", created_at:1779667384, source_id:"chunk-759e971d3fd810e673364baf690915dd", entity_id:"The Characters"}}, {_id:7551, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Conflicting emotions lead to decisions that cause chaos in oneself and others.", created_at:1779667385, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b", entity_id:"Erroneous Decisions"}}, {_id:7552, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Constraints for Correction include strict adherence to original meaning preservation and avoidance of stylistic rewrites.<SEP>Constraints for Correction include strict adherence to original meaning preservation and avoidance of stylistic rewrites.<SEP>Constraints for Correction include strict adherence to original meaning preservation and avoidance of stylistic rewrites.<SEP>Constraints for Correction include strict adherence to original meaning preservation and avoidance of stylistic rewrites.", created_at:1779667812, source_id:"chunk-46c59d79ae75a285b992cb76b9f206e4", entity_id:"Constraints for Correction"}}, {_id:7555, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Transcendental spirituality focuses on surpassing ordinary human experience to access higher states of consciousness or divine reality.<SEP>Transcendental spirituality involves mystical states, exploration of consciousness, and concepts like past lives, kundalini chakras, and divine communion.<SEP>Transcendental spirituality focuses on surpassing ordinary human experience to access higher states of consciousness or divine reality.", created_at:1779667993, source_id:"chunk-13a0732528361d17a646ba4a3dc581f6<SEP>chunk-86e735695491236221c7103cab19fd22", entity_id:"Transcendental Spirituality"}}, {_id:7556, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The right course of action refers to ethical decision-making in life situations, balancing personal and collective well-being.<SEP>The right course of action refers to ethical decision-making in life situations, balancing personal and collective well-being.", created_at:1779667993, source_id:"chunk-13a0732528361d17a646ba4a3dc581f6", entity_id:"Right Course of Action"}}, {_id:7557, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Engaged spirituality emphasizes applying spiritual principles to everyday life and societal challenges.<SEP>Engaged spirituality refers to the practical application of spiritual principles in daily life, impacting living habits, relationships, work, and leisure activities.<SEP>Engaged spirituality emphasizes applying spiritual principles to everyday life and societal challenges.", created_at:1779667993, source_id:"chunk-13a0732528361d17a646ba4a3dc581f6<SEP>chunk-86e735695491236221c7103cab19fd22", entity_id:"Engaged Spirituality"}}, {_id:7558, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Holidays refers to periods of celebration or pause from regular activities, often tied to cultural or spiritual traditions.<SEP>Holidays refers to periods of celebration or pause from regular activities, often tied to cultural or spiritual traditions.", created_at:1779667993, source_id:"chunk-13a0732528361d17a646ba4a3dc581f6<SEP>chunk-86e735695491236221c7103cab19fd22", entity_id:"Holidays"}}, {_id:7561, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"Holiday\" is corrected to \"holidays\" for grammatical accuracy and contextual relevance.", created_at:1779667956, source_id:"chunk-86e735695491236221c7103cab19fd22", entity_id:"Holiday"}}, {_id:7562, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"\"Past lights\" is interpreted as \"past lives\" due to contextual ambiguity in the text.", created_at:1779667956, source_id:"chunk-86e735695491236221c7103cab19fd22", entity_id:"Past Lights"}}] AS row
