World Environment Day is an annual global event focused on environmental awareness, action, protection, and sustainability. It serves as a platform for international cooperation and raises consciousness about ecological preservation. The observance emphasizes collective responsibility toward sustaining planetary health through conscious practices and policy advocacy.", source_id:"chunk-22e861448de43c78f776c4d84f1409bd<SEP>chunk-2e8cf037a481fa8f6c03056c638fd995<SEP>chunk-b7f51f52125fd52ba3d4f9070154d664<SEP>chunk-5c12b3ed0b19bd1ebb50b224bafcfb2e<SEP>chunk-427deb5cc43b417a4dd893f3e73a5d18<SEP>chunk-c97736465adbd1c78f127386c0a694a1<SEP>chunk-e4cf02903a0735df8c35d1ebc9a0cf97", entity_id:"World Environment Day"}}, {_id:7580, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779670809, description:"<think>
