Vinayaka refers to the Hindu deity Ganesha, commonly associated with wisdom, removal of obstacles, and cultural or ethical contradictions. He is worshipped in India and symbolizes overcoming challenges through divine guidance.", source_id:"chunk-22e861448de43c78f776c4d84f1409bd<SEP>chunk-5f51161e463ac960fab8b2a50bc6505c<SEP>chunk-5c12b3ed0b19bd1ebb50b224bafcfb2e<SEP>chunk-fbc362953fe784a8510b72471b749390<SEP>chunk-8bb4cd3f15349f29218db621b3677f01<SEP>chunk-e67cebe345867bb957f951bf07725fa1", entity_id:"Vinayaka"}}, {_id:7581, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Pregnant Elephant refers to the killed pregnant elephant mentioned in the text, a symbol of environmental cruelty.<SEP>Pregnant Elephant refers to the killed pregnant elephant mentioned in the text, a symbol of environmental cruelty.<SEP>Pregnant Elephant is discussed in the context of heartless killing and sensitivity.", created_at:1779669459, source_id:"chunk-22e861448de43c78f776c4d84f1409bd<SEP>chunk-2e8cf037a481fa8f6c03056c638fd995", entity_id:"Pregnant Elephant"}}, {_id:7582, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sarve Jana Sukhino Bhavantu is a Sanskrit mantra meaning \"May all beings be happy,\" reflecting universal compassion.<SEP>Sarve Jana Sukhino Bhavantu is a Sanskrit mantra meaning \"May all beings be happy,\" reflecting universal compassion.<SEP>A Sanskrit phrase meaning \"May all beings be happy,\" reflecting universal well-wishing.<SEP>Sarve Jana Sukhino Bhavantu is a Sanskrit phrase meaning \"May all people be happy and prosperous.\"<SEP>Sarve Jana Sukhino Bhavantu is a Sanskrit mantra invoking well-being for all beings.", created_at:1779670566, source_id:"chunk-22e861448de43c78f776c4d84f1409bd<SEP>chunk-5f51161e463ac960fab8b2a50bc6505c<SEP>chunk-b7f51f52125fd52ba3d4f9070154d664<SEP>chunk-427deb5cc43b417a4dd893f3e73a5d18", entity_id:"Sarve Jana Sukhino Bhavantu"}}] AS row
