UNWIND [{_id:7650, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Environmental ethics emphasizes harmony between humans and nature through conscious choices.", created_at:1779670566, source_id:"chunk-427deb5cc43b417a4dd893f3e73a5d18", entity_id:"Environmental Ethics"}}, {_id:7651, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=77dJnbTCwsA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Heartlessness is a term that can refer to two distinct concepts. In one sense, heartlessness is condemned when humans engage in actions toward elephants and the environment that are callous or indifferent. This usage highlights moral disapproval of behavior that disregards the welfare of animals and ecological systems.

