UNWIND [{_id:7700, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The apple falling demonstrates the law of gravity in action, used as an analogy for karma.<SEP>An apple falling from a tree is used as an analogy to illustrate natural laws like Karma, which operate without intentional direction.", created_at:1779671929, source_id:"chunk-295ff82e6931c82451b6f00c8154605e<SEP>chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9", entity_id:"Apple"}}, {_id:7701, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sin refers to the failure to fulfill religious duties, involving an agency that enforces punishment, contrasting with Karma's impersonal nature.", created_at:1779671929, source_id:"chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9", entity_id:"Sin"}}, {_id:7702, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"A mango sapling is the initial action in the cause-and-effect chain, leading to mangoes and trees.", created_at:1779671929, source_id:"chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9", entity_id:"Mango Sapling"}}, {_id:7703, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Mangoes represent the direct outcome of planting a mango tree, illustrating Karma's principle of cyclical results.", created_at:1779671929, source_id:"chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9", entity_id:"Mangoes"}}, {_id:7704, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Toxic fruit exemplifies negative consequences in the Karma analogy, showing how harmful actions yield harmful results.", created_at:1779671930, source_id:"chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9", entity_id:"Toxic Fruit"}}, {_id:7705, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Toxic trees result from toxic fruits, demonstrating the cyclical nature of Karma's law.", created_at:1779671930, source_id:"chunk-ed6b93b857d66f4aba7388c8d2b20ca9", entity_id:"Toxic Trees"}}, {_id:7706, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Corrections to grammatical structures, including punctuation and sentence structure, as discussed in the YouTube video.", created_at:1779671965, source_id:"chunk-7975f5d7f00031d3544c8f0ea4e7d340", entity_id:"grammatical corrections"}}, {_id:7707, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A practice involving direct, intentional connection with another individual in an inner state to foster understanding.<SEP>Connecting with another person involves daily reflection and dissolving anxiety or stress through shared inner awareness.", created_at:1779672028, source_id:"chunk-f367b232a1868597453e46a0827c00ef<SEP>chunk-8214f902f81ebb0b2df3cc231089a8c7", entity_id:"Connecting with Another Person"}}, {_id:7709, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual teachers are called to unite with other societal groups to awaken collective consciousness through shared vision.<SEP>Spiritual teachers are called to unite with other societal groups to awaken collective consciousness through shared vision.", created_at:1779672095, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b", entity_id:"Spiritual Teachers"}}, {_id:7713, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Non-violence is presented as a foundational principle taught by India to global society.<SEP>Non-violence is presented as a foundational principle taught by India to global society.", created_at:1779672095, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b", entity_id:"Non-Violence"}}, {_id:7714, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Young people are framed as agents of change capable of challenging societal norms and driving transformation.<SEP>Young people are framed as agents of change capable of challenging societal norms and driving transformation.", created_at:1779672095, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b", entity_id:"Conscious Young People"}}, {_id:7715, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The rage of hunger is described as a destructive force contributing to societal violence and ethical erosion.<SEP>The rage of hunger is described as a destructive force contributing to societal violence and ethical erosion.<SEP>Rage of hunger describes intense frustration and anger stemming from chronic food insecurity and inequality.`", created_at:1779672187, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Rage of Hunger"}}, {_id:7716, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The sacredness of women is highlighted as a historical Indian cultural value with spiritual significance.<SEP>The sacredness of women is highlighted as a historical Indian cultural value with spiritual significance.", created_at:1779672096, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b", entity_id:"Women's Sacredness"}}, {_id:7717, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Frustration and anger toward privileged groups are identified as drivers of social unrest.<SEP>Frustration and anger toward privileged groups are identified as drivers of social unrest.<SEP>Frustration and anger are emotional responses to social and economic disparities, driving destructive behaviors.`", created_at:1779672187, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Frustration and Anger"}}, {_id:7719, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Excessive pursuit of pleasure is portrayed as a destructive force amplified by media influence.<SEP>Excessive pursuit of pleasure is portrayed as a destructive force amplified by media influence.<SEP>Maddening pleasure thirst signifies excessive desires amplified by media influence, exacerbating societal instability.`", created_at:1779672187, source_id:"chunk-01f9faf5a613d1d1b6c6131312eef66b<SEP>chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Maddening Pleasure Thirst"}}, {_id:7720, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Failed education refers to inadequate systems that neglect emotional and ethical development in youth.`", created_at:1779672187, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Failed Education"}}, {_id:7721, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Failed religion indicates spiritual systems that fail to address contemporary moral and existential challenges.`", created_at:1779672187, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Failed Religion"}}, {_id:7722, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Disasters encompass crises like violence, inequality, and social breakdown resulting from systemic failures.`", created_at:1779672187, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Disasters"}}, {_id:7723, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Failed law represents legal systems that inadequately address social inequities and human needs.`", created_at:1779672188, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Failed Law"}}, {_id:7724, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"National education proposes a curriculum emphasizing empathy, meditation, and life wisdom to foster societal harmony.`", created_at:1779672188, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"National Education"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7726, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Life wisdom encompasses ethical and philosophical knowledge to guide human behavior and decision-making.`", created_at:1779672190, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Life Wisdom"}}, {_id:7727, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Destructive habits include harmful behaviors like substance abuse or violence fueled by societal neglect.`", created_at:1779672190, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24", entity_id:"Destructive Habits"}}, {_id:7728, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Described as a universal practice to enhance intelligence and relationship connectivity through blood flow modulation.<SEP>Described as a universal practice to enhance intelligence and relationship connectivity through blood flow modulation.<SEP>Extraordinary Practice is a method involving reflection and dissolving anxiety, which increases blood flow to the prefrontal cortex and anterior cingulate, leading to enhanced intelligence and relationships.", created_at:1779673193, source_id:"chunk-4e775b554bb52f0e7b422520123fe5a4<SEP>chunk-6cf55136aa5e4ce74dabd0e6bc9c5c31", entity_id:"Extraordinary Practice"}}, {_id:7729, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Our mind is described as being composed of thoughts and influencing interactions with the universe through mental states.<SEP>Our mind is described as being composed of thoughts and influencing interactions with the universe through mental states.", created_at:1779672277, source_id:"chunk-a806b7026395d82c6e1fe100191449c6", entity_id:"Our Mind"}}, {_id:7730, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The experiences and circumstances of another individual influenced by the family's dynamics.", created_at:1779672358, source_id:"chunk-0ec81fd92a8028a31f8c6ce341a46fe9", entity_id:"Other Person's Life"}}, {_id:7731, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Harmonious Family is a family unit characterized by unity, mutual respect, and joy derived from nurturing inner states.", created_at:1779672358, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Harmonious Family"}}, {_id:7732, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Separate Individuals highlights the perception of individuals as disconnected entities, despite existing in a shared realm of consciousness.", created_at:1779672384, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Separate Individuals"}}, {_id:7733, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Environment in Consciousness is the shared mental space where individuals' states and experiences mutually influence one another.", created_at:1779672384, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Environment in Consciousness"}}, {_id:7734, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Vision for Career represents goals related to professional achievements, often prioritized over personal or familial well-being.", created_at:1779672384, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Vision for Career"}}, {_id:7736, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Nurturing a beautiful inner state enables the creation of a harmonious family through mutual connection and unity.", created_at:1779672445, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Nurturing Beautiful State"}}, {_id:7737, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Prioritizing career goals over inner state cultivation creates tension between societal expectations and personal harmony.", created_at:1779672445, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Vision for Inner State"}}, {_id:7738, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"An individual's inner state directly affects their ability to feel and connect with others' emotions within the family.", created_at:1779672445, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde", entity_id:"Connection Experience"}}, {_id:7739, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A philosophical concept described in the text as \"a beautiful state of being,\" central to the content's thematic focus.", created_at:1779672475, source_id:"chunk-6bac58b45209f5eef8b575ac021bf0a9", entity_id:"A Beautiful State of Being"}}, {_id:7740, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"homophones", truncate:"", description:"The constraints specify how to fix errors without changing meaning.<SEP>The task involves correcting homophones and domain-specific terms.", created_at:1779672489, source_id:"chunk-c9c744dec97ba4afb7dd420183a0ff7b", entity_id:"Fixing errors"}}, {_id:7741, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A grammatical rule stating that \"We\" should be capitalized at the beginning of a sentence.", created_at:1779672540, source_id:"chunk-72c84a022ffd55d1cd949f308bf71baa", entity_id:"Capitalization Rule for 'We'"}}, {_id:7742, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"This focus area involves correcting punctuation and capitalization to improve readability.", created_at:1779672559, source_id:"chunk-d280003ef7ab568a7c05f623b80e00e6", entity_id:"Punctuation and capitalization for readability"}}, {_id:7743, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"\"hold one\" is a repeated phrase in the video, considered a transcription error, with possible corrections like \"hold on\" or \"hold together\" in the context of family and purpose.", created_at:1779672656, source_id:"chunk-4ec92fe5b5aa3e573ed7fbd2638fb992", entity_id:"hold one"}}, {_id:7745, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hold one's ground is a suggested replacement phrase for \"can hold one\".<SEP>Hold one's ground is a suggested replacement phrase for \"can hold one\".<SEP>An alternative phrase considered in the text, interpreted as a metaphor for resilience or determination.<SEP>An alternative phrase considered in the text, interpreted as a metaphor for resilience or determination.", created_at:1779673005, source_id:"chunk-b15527446075410663fd64389cfca2c8<SEP>chunk-47e1f1988fb8839c7401d731e2c56670", entity_id:"Hold One's Ground"}}, {_id:7746, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Can hold one is a nonsensical phrase discussed in the video.<SEP>Can hold one is a nonsensical phrase discussed in the video.", created_at:1779672822, source_id:"chunk-b15527446075410663fd64389cfca2c8", entity_id:"Can Hold One"}}, {_id:7747, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hold one's purpose is another suggested replacement phrase.<SEP>Hold one's purpose is another suggested replacement phrase.<SEP>A phrase discussed as a potential mishearing in the text, analyzed as a possible interpretation of purpose-driven language.<SEP>A phrase discussed as a potential mishearing in the text, analyzed as a possible interpretation of purpose-driven language.", created_at:1779673004, source_id:"chunk-b15527446075410663fd64389cfca2c8<SEP>chunk-47e1f1988fb8839c7401d731e2c56670", entity_id:"Hold One's Purpose"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7748, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"These phrases are considered potential misheard words or homophones that require clarification.", created_at:1779672932, source_id:"chunk-7265380f9c03aee6859d84871017d191", entity_id:"Phrases like \"can hold one\""}}, {_id:7749, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Immense power is an abstract concept representing the collective strength derived from togetherness.", created_at:1779673000, source_id:"chunk-86cc773cadf6118a5b4bbfcd380c38c3", entity_id:"Immense Power"}}, {_id:7750, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Immense joy is an abstract concept symbolizing the happiness and fulfillment arising from togetherness.", created_at:1779673000, source_id:"chunk-86cc773cadf6118a5b4bbfcd380c38c3", entity_id:"Immense Joy"}}, {_id:7751, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Great meaning is an abstract concept reflecting the significance and purpose found in togetherness.", created_at:1779673000, source_id:"chunk-86cc773cadf6118a5b4bbfcd380c38c3", entity_id:"Great Meaning"}}, {_id:7752, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Great purpose is an abstract concept denoting the overarching objective or mission that drives individuals and families.", created_at:1779673000, source_id:"chunk-86cc773cadf6118a5b4bbfcd380c38c3", entity_id:"Great Purpose"}}, {_id:7754, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Togetherness embodies power, joy, meaning, and purpose as driving forces.", created_at:1779673158, source_id:"chunk-e8e24c4cdde1291a97c096da1259ca59", entity_id:"Power, Joy, Meaning, Purpose"}}, {_id:7755, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The final output is the revised text after applying grammar corrections, punctuation fixes, and word choice improvements.", created_at:1779673177, source_id:"chunk-98921940959422839d1d78085fa664be", entity_id:"Final Output"}}, {_id:7756, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A stray word refers to an unintended or extraneous word in a text that disrupts coherence.", created_at:1779673177, source_id:"chunk-98921940959422839d1d78085fa664be", entity_id:"Stray Word"}}, {_id:7757, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The core task focuses on correcting grammatical errors, punctuation, and word choice without altering the original message or style.", created_at:1779673177, source_id:"chunk-98921940959422839d1d78085fa664be", entity_id:"Core Task"}}, {_id:7758, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Parashakti manifests on Vijayadashami as the ultimate divine power, transcending all three gunas (Sattva, Rajas, Tamas).<SEP>Parashakti is the ultimate divine force animating the universe and multiverses, central to the spiritual narrative.<SEP>Parashakti is a divine feminine energy revered in Hindu traditions, associated with the tenth day of Vijayadashami.", created_at:1779673498, source_id:"chunk-7b3a64aa7e92b879d5649be1dd23a938<SEP>chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe<SEP>chunk-1f71f4118910a584ee2496565d2e6247<SEP>chunk-3d108a7609d2fce897a3df1f09942814", entity_id:"Parashakti"}}, {_id:7760, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779673521, description:"Mahasaraswati represents divine wisdom and transcendence, depicted in white attire riding a Himalayan Swan and Hamsa.<SEP>Mahasaraswati symbolizes the Mother Goddess in her form of wisdom, depicted as a white-dressed deity riding a Himalayan Swan.` -> Correct. `Concept` is a valid type.<SEP>Mahasaraswati is the Mother Goddess who assumes a form symbolizing wisdom and transcendence beyond Sattva.<SEP>Mahasaraswati is a person who is discussed in the context of the video and is associated with the concept of \"Sattva.\"<SEP>Mahasaraswati is a form of the Goddess embodying knowledge and wisdom, worshipped during the seventh to ninth days of Navratri.<SEP>Mahasaraswati is a form of the Divine Mother.", source_id:"chunk-7b3a64aa7e92b879d5649be1dd23a938<SEP>chunk-06509bca67cf9977473996911215a1e2<SEP>chunk-a7efc3b9dab03e6e433daab7a3b11310<SEP>chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe<SEP>chunk-f4789be1157bad19695ee05e51925d91<SEP>chunk-3d108a7609d2fce897a3df1f09942814<SEP>chunk-0d847b42bbc0f3e13f07c034a5c8e0d1", entity_id:"Mahasaraswati"}}, {_id:7761, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mahadurga embodies the destruction of Tamas (darkness) and represents warrior energy during the first days of Navaratri.<SEP>Mahadurga is a form of the Divine Mother associated with overcoming Tamas (dark qualities like laziness and anger).<SEP>Mahadurga is a form of the Goddess worshipped during the first Navratri, symbolizing strength and power.<SEP>Mahadurga is a form of the Divine Mother that overcomes Tamas.", created_at:1779673521, source_id:"chunk-7b3a64aa7e92b879d5649be1dd23a938<SEP>chunk-a7efc3b9dab03e6e433daab7a3b11310<SEP>chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe<SEP>chunk-3d108a7609d2fce897a3df1f09942814<SEP>chunk-0d847b42bbc0f3e13f07c034a5c8e0d1", entity_id:"Mahadurga"}}, {_id:7762, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Shumba and Nishumba represent illusion and separation, depicted as Asuras (dark forces) in mythology.<SEP>Shumba and Nishumba are mythological dark forces symbolizing obstacles or challenges in spiritual mythology.", created_at:1779675419, source_id:"chunk-7b3a64aa7e92b879d5649be1dd23a938<SEP>chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Shumba and Nishumba"}}, {_id:7763, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"The Himalayan Swan symbolizes transcendental consciousness, flying at altitudes beyond ordinary birds.<SEP>The Himalayan Swan is a rare bird associated with the Mother Goddess, representing transcendental consciousness.` -> Correct. `NaturalObject` is a valid type.<SEP>Himalayan Swan is a mythical bird associated with the Divine Mother's symbolism.<SEP>Himalayan Swan is a rare species of bird that is known to fly at high altitudes.<SEP>The Himalayan Swan is a rare species symbolically linked to transcendent consciousness and described as capable of flying beyond ordinary limits.", created_at:1779675419, source_id:"chunk-7b3a64aa7e92b879d5649be1dd23a938<SEP>chunk-06509bca67cf9977473996911215a1e2<SEP>chunk-a7efc3b9dab03e6e433daab7a3b11310<SEP>chunk-f4789be1157bad19695ee05e51925d91<SEP>chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Himalayan Swan"}}, {_id:7765, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", created_at:1779673521, description:"Shumba is one of the two Asuras depicted as dark forces in the scripture, representing illusion and separation.` -> This seems correct. `Creature` is a valid type.<SEP>Shumba is a dark force depicted as an Asura in the scripture.<SEP>Shumba is depicted as a dark force in the scripture.", source_id:"chunk-06509bca67cf9977473996911215a1e2<SEP>chunk-a7efc3b9dab03e6e433daab7a3b11310<SEP>chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe<SEP>chunk-0d847b42bbc0f3e13f07c034a5c8e0d1<SEP>chunk-d333235fcabc3883b17563e023b36fd9", entity_id:"Shumba"}}, {_id:7766, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", created_at:1779673521, description:"Nishumba is the second Asura representing dark forces, paired with Shumba in the scripture.` -> Correct.<SEP>Nishumba is a dark force depicted as an Asura in the scripture.<SEP>Nishumba is depicted as a dark force in the scripture.", source_id:"chunk-06509bca67cf9977473996911215a1e2<SEP>chunk-a7efc3b9dab03e6e433daab7a3b11310<SEP>chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe<SEP>chunk-0d847b42bbc0f3e13f07c034a5c8e0d1<SEP>chunk-d333235fcabc3883b17563e023b36fd9", entity_id:"Nishumba"}}, {_id:7767, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779673498, description:"Vodashram is a location mentioned in the context of the seeker's journey during Navaratri.` -> The text says \"Navaratri, Vodashram\". It's a list. Is `Vodashram` a location? The text doesn't explicitly say. It's just listed. My extraction assumes it's a location. This is a reasonable inference, but is it an error? The instruction says \"If none of the provided entity types apply, do not add new entity type and classify it as `Other`.\" `Vodashram` is a proper noun, likely a place name. `Location` is a valid type. So this seems fine.<SEP>Vodashram is a location mentioned in the context of the seeker's journey during Navaratri.` -> Correct.<SEP>Vodashram represents a spiritual retreat or abode during Navaratri, symbolizing the seeker's journey.<SEP>Vodashram refers to a spiritual retreat or hermitage in Hindu traditions, symbolizing detachment and contemplation.", source_id:"chunk-06509bca67cf9977473996911215a1e2<SEP>chunk-1f71f4118910a584ee2496565d2e6247<SEP>chunk-3d108a7609d2fce897a3df1f09942814", entity_id:"Vodashram"}}, {_id:7768, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The Himalayan Swan embodies undifferentiated consciousness and unity with the divine.` -> Correct.", created_at:1779673265, source_id:"chunk-06509bca67cf9977473996911215a1e2", entity_id:"cosmic consciousness"}}, {_id:7769, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Navaratris is a Hindu festival celebrated by millions, associated with the Mother Goddess.", created_at:1779673333, source_id:"chunk-f8eb8b7d45d2aac2b4ae2a3dfbc604e1", entity_id:"Navaratris"}}, {_id:7770, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Krishnaji leads seekers on the path of enlightenment.", created_at:1779673403, source_id:"chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe", entity_id:"seekers"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7771, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Shumba is depicted in the scripture as an Asura.", created_at:1779673404, source_id:"chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe", entity_id:"scripture"}}, {_id:7772, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Mahasaraswati's Leela is celebrated on Vijayadashami.", created_at:1779673404, source_id:"chunk-0ab03500cfe03bdf3ff37b159be99afe", entity_id:"Vijayadashami"}}, {_id:7773, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Multiverses refer to the theoretical existence of multiple universes or realities, mentioned in the context of Parashakti's influence.", created_at:1779673462, source_id:"chunk-1f71f4118910a584ee2496565d2e6247", entity_id:"multiverses"}}, {_id:7774, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"Vijaya Daswami is a festival symbolizing victory and divine power, celebrated during the spiritual journey of Navaratri.<SEP>Vijaya Daswami is a Hindu festival celebrated on the tenth day of Navratri, marking the victory of good over evil.", created_at:1779673498, source_id:"chunk-1f71f4118910a584ee2496565d2e6247<SEP>chunk-3d108a7609d2fce897a3df1f09942814", entity_id:"Vijaya Daswami"}}, {_id:7779, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unity consciousness signifies the dissolution of separation, emphasizing interconnectedness of all existence.", created_at:1779675419, source_id:"chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Unity Consciousness"}}, {_id:7780, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Transcendental consciousness describes a state beyond worldly chaos, achieved through spiritual progression.", created_at:1779675419, source_id:"chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Transcendental Consciousness"}}, {_id:7781, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Dark forces symbolize challenges or adversarial energies in mythological and spiritual contexts.", created_at:1779675420, source_id:"chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Dark Forces"}}, {_id:7782, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jy4hcpUSBms)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The Universal Mother represents a spiritual entity embodying wisdom and guidance, invoked to transcend separation and Maya during the spiritual journey.", created_at:1779675420, source_id:"chunk-05cc795d538216c463ac6d6e2524a3ee", entity_id:"Universal Mother"}}, {_id:7783, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An ordinary mind is characterized by repetitive thinking patterns and lack of new perception.", created_at:1779675447, source_id:"chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"ordinary mind"}}, {_id:7784, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An awakened state of consciousness enables new perceptions and alters neural connections in the brain.<SEP>An awakened state of consciousness is portrayed as a prerequisite for creating destiny, enabling the manifestation of intentions into reality.<SEP>an awakened state of consciousness is a transformed mode of awareness necessary for creating destiny through spiritual practices like Ekam.<SEP>an awakened state of consciousness is a transformed mode of awareness necessary for creating destiny through spiritual practices like Ekam.", created_at:1779675955, source_id:"chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2<SEP>chunk-c221b35beb5903b6212b49e01a938f47<SEP>chunk-3060fcf971a2939151d1a8320d675a71", entity_id:"awakened state of consciousness"}}, {_id:7785, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Repetitive mind refers to a state of thinking that follows established patterns without innovation.", created_at:1779675447, source_id:"chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"repetitive mind"}}, {_id:7786, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Creativity involves the emergence of new perceptions, worldviews, and life perspectives through conscious awareness.", created_at:1779675447, source_id:"chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"creativity"}}, {_id:7787, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Creativity emerges from and requires new perception and worldview.", created_at:1779675473, source_id:"chunk-69ad193b229bafe28becd7a15ba050a2", entity_id:"new perception"}}, {_id:7788, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hqre34QIMZg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An ordinary mind is characterized by repetitive thinking patterns and lacks transformative creativity.", created_at:1779675473, source_id:"chunk-811f7f6fb4de9a85b774d5d90a726b13", entity_id:"Ordinary Mind"}}, {_id:7789, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hqre34QIMZg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Awareness leads to peace, clarity, intelligence, and stillness within oneself.", created_at:1779675475, source_id:"chunk-811f7f6fb4de9a85b774d5d90a726b13", entity_id:"Peace and Clarity"}}, {_id:7790, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Self-awareness and compassion are proposed as solutions to counteract hate and violence.<SEP>Self-awareness and compassion are proposed as global solutions to conflict, requiring urgent cultivation across all societal levels.", created_at:1779675555, source_id:"chunk-97a582a6bc26174c8bc3002eb473cbb9<SEP>chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Self-Awareness and Compassion"}}, {_id:7791, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779675555, description:"Harmony and equal dignity is a desired state of peaceful coexistence and mutual respect.<SEP>Harmony and Equal Dignity is the desired state, which is sought instead of the current path of hate and violence.<SEP>Harmony and equal dignity are principles sought by individuals but often undermined by divisive actions and unaddressed biases.", source_id:"chunk-97a582a6bc26174c8bc3002eb473cbb9<SEP>chunk-811d40ad37d225c3aaeb783ea8c4d627<SEP>chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Harmony and Equal Dignity"}}, {_id:7795, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Bias and prejudice are identified as root causes of harmful reactions to differences in identity and beliefs.", created_at:1779675555, source_id:"chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Bias and Prejudice"}}, {_id:7796, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Violence and war are consequences of unresolved division and lack of compassion, threatening global stability.", created_at:1779675555, source_id:"chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Violence and War"}}, {_id:7797, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Consciousness, education, and meditation are emphasized as critical tools for training individuals in power to foster compassion.", created_at:1779675555, source_id:"chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Consciousness, Education, and Meditation"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:7798, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Power in authority (e.g., police, military, government) must be wielded by those awakened to compassion to avoid destructive outcomes.", created_at:1779675555, source_id:"chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Power in Authority"}}, {_id:7799, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Expressing anger or hate provides momentary relief but reinforces violent tendencies in the mind.", created_at:1779675556, source_id:"chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Anger/Hate"}}, {_id:7800, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Bias and prejudice drive negative reactions to differences in appearance, culture, or beliefs, perpetuating violence.", created_at:1779675556, source_id:"chunk-8d609fe5e217d48045ea6baa411a7cde", entity_id:"Reactions to Difference"}}, {_id:7801, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Perceived natural advantages or disadvantages influencing prejudice and societal attitudes.", created_at:1779675573, source_id:"chunk-719340217eb366fadb6e6dd8b5dbf568", entity_id:"Natural Blessings"}}, {_id:7804, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XMzZe5aEmTo)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Perceived differences in skin pigmentation contributing to prejudice and societal divisions.", created_at:1779675573, source_id:"chunk-719340217eb366fadb6e6dd8b5dbf568", entity_id:"Skin Color"}}, {_id:7807, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"True friends are defined by mutual protection, shared resources, and absence of competition or jealousy.<SEP>True friends are described as individuals who provide mutual protection, share resources, and engage in meaningful interactions without competition or jealousy.", created_at:1779675622, source_id:"chunk-00a19ff47058297a371a169b18ef727a<SEP>chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"True Friends"}}, {_id:7808, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Business associates engage in relationships motivated by mutual profit rather than genuine friendship.<SEP>Business associates interact primarily for mutual profit rather than friendship.", created_at:1779675622, source_id:"chunk-00a19ff47058297a371a169b18ef727a<SEP>chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Business Associates"}}, {_id:7809, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Roller coaster buddies are individuals who engage in temporary friendships based on shared fun activities but lack commitment beyond those activities.<SEP>Roller coaster buddies engage in temporary, fun-based interactions.", created_at:1779675622, source_id:"chunk-00a19ff47058297a371a169b18ef727a<SEP>chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Roller Coaster Buddies"}}, {_id:7811, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"CHI is a group discussion or forum where participants engage in exploring philosophical questions and shared reflections.<SEP>CHI is an event where discussions on true friendship and related questions will take place.", created_at:1779675642, source_id:"chunk-00a19ff47058297a371a169b18ef727a<SEP>chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54", entity_id:"CHI"}}, {_id:7813, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Varied age groups represent diverse demographics among the seekers.", created_at:1779675622, source_id:"chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Varied Age Groups"}}, {_id:7814, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Profit represents mutual financial gain in transactional relationships.", created_at:1779675623, source_id:"chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Profit"}}, {_id:7815, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Fun describes temporary companionship without deeper commitment.", created_at:1779675623, source_id:"chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408", entity_id:"Fun"}}, {_id:7816, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Possessiveness contradicts the freedom inherent in true friendship.<SEP>Possessiveness is an emotional state characterized by a desire to control or dominate others, leading to relational strain.<SEP>Possessiveness is a state of wanting exclusive ownership or control over someone, often leading to unhealthy relationship dynamics.<SEP>Possessiveness is a state of wanting exclusive ownership or control over someone, often leading to unhealthy relationship dynamics.", created_at:1779687750, source_id:"chunk-f9137367b6fc0c1e310ef8df615fc408<SEP>chunk-37a50ba57b87bf8d444df3da83283e84<SEP>chunk-428c28379181a7cdc217fc69118ccc4d", entity_id:"Possessiveness"}}, {_id:7817, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Fair-weather friends are individuals who associate during positive times but abandon relationships when challenges arise, characterized by superficiality and lack of loyalty.", created_at:1779675642, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54", entity_id:"Fair-Weather Friends"}}, {_id:7818, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Toxic friendship involves negative traits like jealousy, possessiveness, and competition that harm relationships.", created_at:1779675642, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54", entity_id:"Toxic Friendship"}}, {_id:7819, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"True friendship is a concept characterized by mutual respect, loyalty, and absence of competition or jealousy.", created_at:1779675642, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54", entity_id:"True Friendship"}}, {_id:7821, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"creature", truncate:"", description:"Peculiar birds are a specific type of bird that migrates between Siberia and India.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally between Siberia and India, possessing knowledge of food sources and breeding grounds.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally between Siberia and India, possessing knowledge of food sources and breeding grounds.<SEP>Peculiar birds are mentioned as migratory creatures with instinctual seasonal movements between Siberia and India.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally from Siberia to India and back, demonstrating innate navigational knowledge.<SEP>Peculiar birds that migrate seasonally from Siberia to India and back, demonstrating innate navigational knowledge.", created_at:1779687386, source_id:"chunk-4dea19a1ca3602539d80b6f5c46066c4<SEP>chunk-1de41cf0c7dd51f4c24f73f5f21d78fe<SEP>chunk-5637d12f2e1eaf0419e502601bcb1c15<SEP>chunk-5514c96e6a8a624c503ebd06caab2d45", entity_id:"Peculiar Birds"}}, {_id:7822, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pre-written destiny is the idea that a person's future is already determined and requires no action.<SEP>The belief in a fixed, unalterable future predetermined by external forces, which the speaker challenges in favor of self-created destiny.<SEP>The belief in a fixed, unalterable future predetermined by external forces, which the speaker challenges in favor of self-created destiny.<SEP>The belief in a fixed, unalterable future predetermined by external forces, which the speaker challenges in favor of self-created destiny.<SEP>The belief in a fixed, unalterable future predetermined by external forces, which the speaker challenges in favor of self-created destiny.<SEP>Pre-written destiny is a specific concept of destiny that is pre-determined.<SEP>Pre-written destiny is a specific concept of destiny that is pre-determined.", created_at:1779687204, source_id:"chunk-4dea19a1ca3602539d80b6f5c46066c4<SEP>chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d<SEP>chunk-bed30e61f70b382a4a6595c34ba8a934", entity_id:"Pre-written Destiny"}}, {_id:7824, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"We need to produce a merged description of Siberia, integrating all key information from each description. The entity name is Siberia. The descriptions:

