 source_id:"chunk-864956111677c18bfafdc2fe8e5501ce", entity_id:"Creation of Anything"}}, {_id:7850, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A revised draft of the original text discussing destiny as a concept that can be consciously shaped rather than passively accepted.<SEP>A revised draft of the original text discussing destiny as a concept that can be consciously shaped rather than passively accepted.<SEP>A revised draft of the original text discussing destiny as a concept that can be consciously shaped rather than passively accepted.<SEP>A revised draft of the original text discussing destiny as a concept that can be consciously shaped rather than passively accepted.", created_at:1779678362, source_id:"chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d", entity_id:"Corrected Version (Draft 1)"}}, {_id:7851, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Pre-written destiny refers to the idea of a fixed fate determined without individual agency, which the speaker contrasts with self-created destiny.", created_at:1779678567, source_id:"chunk-5637d12f2e1eaf0419e502601bcb1c15", entity_id:"Pre-Written Destiny"}}, {_id:7852, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Refining the Draft involves editing written content for clarity and grammatical correctness, as demonstrated in the example provided.<SEP>Refining the Draft involves editing written content for clarity and grammatical correctness, as demonstrated in the example provided.", created_at:1779686147, source_id:"chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393", entity_id:"Refining the Draft"}}, {_id:7853, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN",