\
So about 69 words.\
\
Paragraph 3:\
\
\"In summary, ?Paid Less Than Men? serves as a precise, neutral alternative to the outdated expression, emphasizing the average wage gap between genders while avoiding the ambiguity and bias inherent in the original wording. Its use facilitates clearer discussions of gender pay disparity and aligns with empirical evidence, making it a valuable term in scholarly, policy, and public discourse.\"\
\
