orical shift in gender norms.<SEP>Women assuming leadership roles in nations marks a historical shift in gender norms.", created_at:1779701121, source_id:"chunk-4728462b4c7e2d372f2b1e40f07184a9", entity_id:"Leaders in Nations"}}, {_id:7907, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Progressive legal and social changes advancing women's rights and representation globally.<SEP>Progressive legal and social changes advancing women's rights and representation globally.<SEP>Positive societal trends involving women entering traditionally male-dominated professions and the need for these trends to strengthen.", created_at:1779701309, source_id:"chunk-4728462b4c7e2d372f2b1e40f07184a9<SEP>chunk-cbdab8b8a66000622cbde940d7277d78", entity_id:"Positive Trends"}}, {_id:7909, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Women are the worst sufferers in crises, as seen in poverty and violence statistics.", created_at:1779701273, source_id:"chunk-4728462b4c7e2d372f2b1e40f07184a9", entity_id:"Calamities"}}, {_id:7911, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Captain of the Indian cricket team, who inspires women and young girls to rise above limitations through her leadership and dharma.", created_at:1779701309, source_id:"chunk-cbdab8b8a66000622cbde940d7277d78", entity_id:"Captain of the Indian Cricket Team"}}, {_id:7912, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Group representing women and young girls being inspired to overcome limitations and embrace empowerment.", created_at:1779701309, source_id:"chunk-cbdab8b8a66000622cbde940d7277d78", entity_id:"Women and Young Girls"}}, {_id:7913, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Woman athlete challenges gender perceptions in sports and advocates for equality.<SEP>Woman athlete challenges gender perceptions in sports and advocates for equality.", created_at:1779701483, source_id:"chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3", entity_id:"Woman Athlete"}}, {_id:7914, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Collective shift describes a projected change in global consciousness driven by women's awakening.<SEP>Collective shift describes a projected change in global consciousness driven by women's awakening.", created_at:1779701483, source_id:"chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3", entity_id:"Collective Shift"}}, {_id:7915, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Tipping point signifies a threshold where collective women's empowerment triggers societal transformation.<SEP>Tipping point signifies a threshold where collective women's empowerment triggers societal transformation.", created_at:1779701483, source_id:"chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3", entity_id:"Tipping Point"}}, {_id:7916, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"New emerging woman symbolizes a transformative archetype capable of creating new systems and generations.<SEP>New emerging woman symbolizes a transformative archetype capable of creating new systems and generations.", created_at:1779701484, source_id:"chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3", entity_id:"New Emerging Woman"}}, {_id:7917, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", entity_type