ated with to promote peace since the Second World War.<SEP>The UN is an international organization that America has collaborated with to promote peace since the Second World War.", created_at:1779721331, source_id:"chunk-6f44feb0c73b510c94a19d581648544c", entity_id:"United Nations (UN)"}}, {_id:7977, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pBQ6Sy444o)<SEP>unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The environment movement is a global initiative America has contributed to, though it is also a major polluter.<SEP>A global initiative focused on environmental conservation and sustainability.<SEP>A global initiative focused on environmental conservation and sustainability.<SEP>The environment movement is a global initiative America has contributed to, though it is also a major polluter.", created_at:1779721332, source_id:"chunk-6f44feb0c73b510c94a19d581648544c<SEP>chunk-be58ce08f202f47f60f3c79e064a2364", entity_id:"Environment Movement"}}, {_id:7978, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pBQ6Sy444o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The future of Earth is described as precarious, requiring America to make wise leadership choices for global stability.<SEP>The future of Earth is described as precarious, requiring America to make wise leadership choices for global stability.", created_at:1779721331, source_id:"chunk-6f44feb0c73b510c94a19d581648544c", entity_id:"Future of Earth"}}, {_id:7979, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pBQ6Sy444o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The dark side refers to aspects of American society characterized by insecurity, intolerance, and prejudice.<SEP>The dark side refers to aspects of American society characterized by insecurity, intolerance, and prejudice.", created_at:1779721331, source_id:"chunk-6f44feb0c73b510c94a19d581648544c", entity_id:"Dark Side"}}, {_id:7981, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-pBQ6Sy444o)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Freedom and openness represent ideals associated with America's positive cultural values and acceptance of diverse lifestyles and cultures.<SEP>Freedom and openness represent ideals associated with America's positive cultural values and acceptance of diverse lifestyles and cultures.", created_at:1779721332, source_id:"chunk-6f44feb0c73b510c94a19d581648544c", entity_id:"Freedom and Openness"}}, {_id:7982, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"organization", truncate:"", description:"The United Nations is an international organization promoting peace and cooperation among nations.<SEP>The United Nations is an international organization promoting peace and cooperation among nations.", created_at:1779721331, source_id:"chunk-be58ce08f202f47f60f3c79e064a2364", entity_id:"UN"}}, {_id:7983, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Environmental degradation caused by human activities, including America's industrial and societal practices.<SEP>Environmental degradation caused by human activities, including America's industrial and societal practices.", created_at:1779721331, source_id:"chunk-be58ce08f202f47f60f3c79e064a2364", entity_id:"Pollution"}}, {_id:7984, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ideals of openness, non-judgment, and acceptance of diverse lifestyles and cultures.<SEP>Ideals of openness, non-judgment, and acceptance of diverse lifestyles and cultures.", created_at:1779721331, source_id:"chunk-be58ce08f202f47f60f3c79e064a2364", entity_id:"Principles of Freedom"}}, {_id:7985, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"America's historical role as a cultural and ideological influencer worldwide.<SEP>America's historical role as a cultur