ncept/person type. Description is good.<SEP>A brave person is someone who admits mistakes and commits to change, as discussed in the original text.<SEP>A brave person is someone who admits mistakes and commits to change, as discussed in the original text.<SEP>A brave person is someone who admits mistakes and commits to change, as discussed in the original text.<SEP>A brave person is someone who admits mistakes and commits to change, as discussed in the original text.", created_at:1779725115, source_id:"chunk-c4b94aac2706cfc4b2e48f3b112a4be6<SEP>chunk-bc1b09239ce293df888dd35c513c09ac", entity_id:"Brave Person"}}, {_id:8013, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Social issue addressed through direct intervention in derogatory remarks.<SEP>A systemic prejudice against individuals based on race, requiring active opposition and awareness.` - Correct. `Racism` is a concept. Description is good.<SEP>A form of discrimination, addressed through proactive measures like calling out derogatory comments.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-c4b94aac2706cfc4b2e48f3b112a4be6<SEP>chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d<SEP>chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Racism"}}, {_id:8014, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Bodies of water requiring protection from pollution, linked to anti-plastic initiatives.` - Correct. `Waterways` is a natural object. Description is good.", created_at:1779723877, source_id:"chunk-c4b94aac2706cfc4b2e48f3b112a4be6", entity_id:"Waterways"}}, {_id:8015, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"location", truncate:"", description:"Retail establishment where plastic products are sold, targeted for anti-plastic advocacy.<SEP>An entity targeted for advocacy to eliminate plastic products and promote sustainable practices.` - Correct. `Supermarket` is an organization. Description is good.<SEP>A retail location where plastic products are sold, a target for reduction efforts.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-c4b94aac2706cfc4b2e48f3b112a4be6<SEP>chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d<SEP>chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Supermarket"}}, {_id:8016, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Harmful statements that perpetuate discrimination, necessitating proactive intervention.` - Correct. `Derogatory Comments` is a concept. Description is good.<SEP>Harmful remarks that should be called out to prevent hurt.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-c4b94aac2706cfc4b2e48f3b112a4be6<SEP>chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Derogatory Comments"}}, {_id:8017, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A movement advocating for reduced plastic consumption and environmental stewardship.` - Correct. `Anti-Plastic` is a concept. Description is good.<SEP>A concept opposing the use of plastic, discussed in the video's text.", created_at:1779724465, source_id:"chunk-c4b94aac2706cfc4b2e48f3b112a4be6<SEP>chunk-c32bf7fcfe6dd8d2fa78dd2f0cb30726", entity_id:"Anti-Plastic"}}, {_id:8019, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"naturalobject", truncate:"", description:"Plastic waste observed on a supermarket shelf, prompting a decision to avoid purchase.", created_at:1779723878, source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d", entity_id:"Plastic on the shelf"}}, {_id:8020, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Environmental issue caused by excessive plastic waste, leading to advocacy efforts.", created_at:1779723878, source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d", entity_id:"Plastic pollution"}}, {_id:8021, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", created_at:1779725116, description:"Philosophical principle asserting \"truth is one,\" emphasizing universal unity.<SEP>Ekam Sat is a philosophical concept emphasizing the unity of all existence beyond physical and ideological differences.<SEP>This phrase is under consideration with a note on spelling variations.", source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d<SEP>chunk-3a0be5644a79b5c40bdef9be1640aecb<SEP>chunk-51ae5339edf74f5e2c9959f6a0626653", entity_id:"Ekam Sat"}}, {_id:8022, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", created_at:1779725116, description:"Sanskrit phrase meaning \"the many are in the one,\" highlighting transcendent unity beyond physical diversity.<SEP>Vipraha Bahuda Vadhanthi is a philosophical concept describing the interconnectedness of all beings and cosmic reality.<SEP>This phrase is under consideration with a note on spelling variations.", source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d<SEP>chunk-3a0be5644a79b5c40bdef9be1640aecb<SEP>chunk-51ae5339edf74f5e2c9959f6a0626653", entity_id:"Vipraha Bahuda Vadhanthi"}}, {_id:8023, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unified existence encompassing all beings beyond physical and ideological differences.", created_at:1779723878, source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d", entity_id:"Cosmic reality"}}, {_id:8024, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Spiritual realization of inner peace and universal interconnectedness.", created_at:1779723878, source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d", entity_id:"Awakening to peace in consciousness"}}, {_id:8025, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Act of advocating for policy changes to reduce plastic availability in supermarkets.<SEP>A method used to influence policies, such as lobbying supermarkets to reduce plastic.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-c80e0226913b764da34321890f62769d<SEP>chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Lobbying"}}, {_id:8026, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A textual anomaly in the analyzed text where the word \"streets\" is repeatedly listed, likely due to mishearing or recording errors.<SEP>A textual anomaly in the analyzed text where the word \"streets\" is repeatedly listed, likely due to mishearing or recording errors.", created_at:1779724080, source_id:"chunk-3db9ad5f02c298caf4a10a42bcc57f29", entity_id:"Repeated 'streets'"}}, {_id:8027, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"artifact", truncate:"", description:"A YouTube video titled \"Unknown\" with the URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw, analyzing text errors including homophones and misheard words.<SEP>A YouTube video titled \"Unknown\" with the URL https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw, analyzing text errors including homophones and misheard words.", created_at:1779724080, source_id:"chunk-232217422a9d55b6c921649f7abed07d<SEP>chunk-4705ba6ae3534b721c0a5b9922b0c577<SEP>chunk-3db9ad5f02c298caf4a10a42bcc57f29", entity_id:"Unknown (YouTube Video)"}}, {_id:8028, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Lokha is the daughter of Sri Preethaji and her partner, referenced in the context of early life experiences.` - This seems correct.<SEP>Lokha is the daughter of Sri Preethaji and her partner, referenced in the context of early life experiences.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779724081, source_id:"chunk-aa435522f2e8968c2579690697fe5849", entity_id:"Lokha"}}, {_id:8029, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Wholesome and Meaningful Life describes an ideal state of existence, corrected from \"whole and a meaningful life\".` - This seems correct.<SEP>Wholesome and Meaningful Life describes an ideal state of existence, corrected from \"whole and a meaningful life\".` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779724081, source_id:"chunk-aa435522f2e8968c2579690697fe5849", entity_id:"Wholesome and Meaningful Life"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:8030, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Career Focus represents a life phase requiring intense professional dedication.` - This seems correct.<SEP>Career Focus represents a life phase requiring intense professional dedication.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779724081, source_id:"chunk-aa435522f2e8968c2579690697fe5849", entity_id:"Career Focus"}}, {_id:8031, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Physical Vitality relates to maintaining bodily health and energy during specific life stages.` - This seems correct.<SEP>Physical Vitality relates to maintaining bodily health and energy during specific life stages.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779724081, source_id:"chunk-aa435522f2e8968c2579690697fe5849", entity_id:"Physical Vitality"}}, {_id:8032, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Career dedication becomes prominent during specific life stages.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779724083, source_id:"chunk-aa435522f2e8968c2579690697fe5849", entity_id:"Life Phases"}}, {_id:8034, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"a philosophical principle emphasizing universal unity (\"one in all, all in one\") and interconnectedness of humanity.", created_at:1779724288, source_id:"chunk-eb6102efa71f284bcc80bab3233a2f4b", entity_id:"Ekam Sat. Vipraha Bahuda Vadhanthi"}}, {_id:8035, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779725184, description:"anti-plastic advocacy includes refusing plastic purchases and lobbying for reduced plastic availability in retail environments.<SEP>anti-plastic is a concept related to environmental initiatives.<SEP>anti-plastic is a concept representing opposition to plastic use and promotion of alternatives.", source_id:"chunk-eb6102efa71f284bcc80bab3233a2f4b<SEP>chunk-237a562741a94e83863123a91f5ccf01<SEP>chunk-3ff8c8f8711e5fea8b4b03b134c17305", entity_id:"anti-plastic"}}, {_id:8036, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A brave person acknowledges past mistakes, apologizes, and commits to proactive change to combat racism.", created_at:1779724288, source_id:"chunk-eb6102efa71f284bcc80bab3233a2f4b", entity_id:"brave person"}}, {_id:8037, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"anti-racism involves actively challenging discriminatory behavior and promoting systemic change through direct intervention.", created_at:1779724288, source_id:"chunk-eb6102efa71f284bcc80bab3233a2f4b", entity_id:"anti-racism"}}, {_id:8038, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"racism refers to systemic discrimination based on race, requiring conscious effort to address through awareness and action.<SEP>racism is a concept involving systemic discrimination and social justice issues.", created_at:1779725184, source_id:"chunk-eb6102efa71f284bcc80bab3233a2f4b<SEP>chunk-3ff8c8f8711e5fea8b4b03b134c17305", entity_id:"racism"}}, {_id:8040, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"perpetrating is a term discussed as a potential transcription error in the<SEP>perpetrating is a term discussed as a potential transcription error in the", created_at:1779724444, source_id:"chunk-8b19a5bd3b3ffedf815babd6eb52e62b", entity_id:"perpetrating"}}, {_id:8041, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"perpetrating is identified as a likely misheard/misread term, with \"pertaining\" proposed as the corrected form in the context of language analysis.", created_at:1779724445, source_id:"chunk-8b19a5bd3b3ffedf815babd6eb52e62b", entity_id:"pertaining"}}, {_id:8042, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A concept suggesting taking initiative, mentioned in the context of being anti-racist.", created_at:1779724465, source_id:"chunk-c32bf7fcfe6dd8d2fa78dd2f0cb30726", entity_id:"Proactive"}}, {_id:8043, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A concept related to opposing racism, discussed in the context of the video's text.", created_at:1779724465, source_id:"chunk-c32bf7fcfe6dd8d2fa78dd2f0cb30726", entity_id:"Anti-Racist"}}, {_id:8044, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"anti-making\" is incorrect and needs to be fixed in the context of \"anti-plastic\".", created_at:1779724466, source_id:"chunk-c32bf7fcfe6dd8d2fa78dd2f0cb30726", entity_id:"Anti-Making"}}, {_id:8045, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"anti-plastic, anti-making sure\" contains a grammatical error where \"making\" is incorrectly used instead of a noun like \"pollution\" or \"waste\".", created_at:1779724497, source_id:"chunk-ace5dae3a207a35dd7f89667f66d0674", entity_id:"anti-plastic, anti-making sure"}}, {_id:8046, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A proposed corrected version of the phrase \"anti-plastic, anti-making sure\", suggesting \"anti-pollution\" as a replacement for \"anti-making\".", created_at:1779724497, source_id:"chunk-ace5dae3a207a35dd7f89667f66d0674", entity_id:"anti-plastic, anti-pollution"}}, {_id:8047, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"clean waterways refer to the maintenance of unpolluted aquatic environments.", created_at:1779724516, source_id:"chunk-237a562741a94e83863123a91f5ccf01", entity_id:"clean waterways"}}, {_id:8048, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"anti-pollution is a concept related to environmental initiatives.<SEP>anti-pollution is a concept related to environmental advocacy and efforts to reduce pollution in waterways.", created_at:1779725184, source_id:"chunk-237a562741a94e83863123a91f5ccf01<SEP>chunk-3ff8c8f8711e5fea8b4b03b134c17305", entity_id:"anti-pollution"}}, {_id:8049, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"anti-making is a phrase that was corrected to \"anti-pollution\" in the text.", created_at:1779724516, source_id:"chunk-237a562741a94e83863123a91f5ccf01", entity_id:"anti-making"}}, {_id:8050, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A related initiative to minimize waste, often combined with anti-plastic efforts.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Anti-Waste"}}, {_id:8051, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A campaign focused on reducing plastic usage, involving anti-plastic and anti-waste initiatives.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Anti-Plastic Campaign"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:8052, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"A proactive method to address derogatory comments and racism.", created_at:1779724619, source_id:"chunk-ab6b594ae56e39d2a27d9720bf296186", entity_id:"Calling Out"}}, {_id:8058, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Vipraha Bahuda Vadhanthi is corrected to Vipra due to a mishearing.", created_at:1779725116, source_id:"chunk-51ae5339edf74f5e2c9959f6a0626653", entity_id:"Vipra"}}, {_id:8062, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"YouTube video discussing six key dimensions for young people to focus on, including health, relationships, creativity, social impact, universal connection, and an unspecified final dimension.", created_at:1779725313, source_id:"chunk-6faa466daa8198f4d13bcd56772915de", entity_id:"The Six Dimensions That Every Young Person Must Be Focused On"}}, {_id:8063, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conceptual framework highlighting the importance of supportive and non-judgmental relationships in personal and professional life.", created_at:1779725313, source_id:"chunk-6faa466daa8198f4d13bcd56772915de", entity_id:"The Dimension Of Personal And Professional Relationships That Are Non-Judgmental And Nurturing"}}, {_id:8064, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conceptual framework focusing on social contribution and community impact as a key focus area.", created_at:1779725313, source_id:"chunk-6faa466daa8198f4d13bcd56772915de", entity_id:"The Dimension Of Expanding Impact In The Social Sphere"}}, {_id:8065, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conceptual framework emphasizing spiritual or universal connection as a guiding principle.", created_at:1779725313, source_id:"chunk-6faa466daa8198f4d13bcd56772915de", entity_id:"The Dimension Of Great Connection With The Universal Intelligence"}}, {_id:8066, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conceptual framework advocating for creativity, joy, and abundance in professional environments.", created_at:1779725313, source_id:"chunk-6faa466daa8198f4d13bcd56772915de", entity_id:"The Dimension Of Joyfulness, Creativity And Abundance At Work"}}, {_id:8067, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Conceptual framework emphasizing physical health and vitality as essential for young people.", created_at:1779725313, source_id:"chunk-6faa466daa8198f4d13bcd56772915de", entity_id:"The Dimension Of Vigor, Health And Vitality Of The Body"}}, {_id:8068, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Summarization is a constraint, not to be added or removed.<SEP>Summarization is a constraint, not to be added or removed.<SEP>Summarization is a constraint, not to be added or removed.<SEP>Summarization is a constraint, not to be added or removed.<SEP>Summarization is a constraint, not to be added or removed.<SEP>Summarization is a constraint, not to be added or removed.", created_at:1779726562, source_id:"chunk-3718c86a25fb0b5558d0d13c8bf954d4", entity_id:"Summarization"}}, {_id:8070, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ayurveda is the ancient Indian science of longevity that describes ojas as the body's vital essence for health and immunity.", created_at:1779725462, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Ayurveda"}}, {_id:8071, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Honey-Colored Bubble symbolizes a transparent shield generated through meditation, protecting against negativity and illnesses.", created_at:1779725462, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Honey-Colored Bubble"}}, {_id:8072, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Moon Alignment refers to the body's synchronization with lunar energies, which enhances ojas and overall vitality.", created_at:1779725462, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Moon Alignment"}}, {_id:8073, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Meditation Method involves guided visualization and relaxation techniques to build ojas, align with lunar energies, and create a honey-colored protective bubble.", created_at:1779725462, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Meditation Method"}}, {_id:8074, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ujash Shakti refers to the radiant energy or luminous power visualized during meditation, manifesting as a protective shield around the body.", created_at:1779725462, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Ujash Shakti"}}, {_id:8075, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Excessive Sensual Stimulation is a modern-day issue that depletes ojas, leading to weakened immunity and physical imbalances.", created_at:1779725462, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Excessive Sensual Stimulation"}}, {_id:8076, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Ojas is the essence governing immunity and strength, shielding the body from diseases and maintaining health.", created_at:1779725463, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Immunity and Strength"}}, {_id:8077, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Excessive sensual stimulation reduces ojas, weakening immunity and causing physical issues.", created_at:1779725463, source_id:"chunk-54e0e109a7c70ff678662d8817f4e00b", entity_id:"Ojas Depletion"}}, {_id:8078, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZaZOJ6gazYM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sensual stimulation is a concept related to depleting ojas, as discussed in the video.", created_at:1779726676, source_id:"chunk-4d2c2c2bc1a2c6fb294c7b3635af1d45", entity_id:"Sensual Stimulation"}}, {_id:8081, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"External violence is associated with the absence of peace in societal contexts.", created_at:1779726827, source_id:"chunk-c4d7f4af9b573478ba698a2b03258543", entity_id:"External Violence"}}, {_id:8082, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"External noise represents disturbances in the environment, contrasted with inner peace.", created_at:1779726827, source_id:"chunk-c4d7f4af9b573478ba698a2b03258543", entity_id:"External Noise"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
