at:1779727925, source_id:"chunk-1e7e55f43ce6e8842a2479ee424af0b9", entity_id:"Interest Rates"}}, {_id:8099, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Regulatory uncertainty relates to unpredictable government policies affecting corporate operations.", created_at:1779727925, source_id:"chunk-1e7e55f43ce6e8842a2479ee424af0b9", entity_id:"Regulatory Uncertainty"}}, {_id:8101, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"event", truncate:"", description:"The upcoming Federal Reserve policy announcement is expected to affect market stability and investor behavior.", created_at:1779727926, source_id:"chunk-1e7e55f43ce6e8842a2479ee424af0b9", entity_id:"Policy Announcement"}}, {_id:8102, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Oneness Yoga Movements are specific physical actions synchronized with breath cycles in the practice.<SEP>Oneness Yoga Movements are specific physical actions synchronized with breath cycles in the practice.", created_at:1779728077, source_id:"chunk-732d750a0827a995cd3b0ecc80ab6c79", entity_id:"Oneness Yoga Movements"}}, {_id:8103, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Breathing Techniques involve deep inhalation and exhalation with a smile, used in Oneness Yoga for Body Bliss to enhance the practice.<SEP>Breathing Techniques involve deep inhalation and exhalation with a smile, used in Oneness Yoga for Body Bliss to enhance the practice.", created_at:1779728077, source_id:"chunk-732d750a0827a995cd3b0ecc80ab6c79", entity_id:"Breathing Techniques"}}, {_id:8104, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Speculation about the policy announcement impacts investor confidence and market stability.", created_at:1779728045, source_id:"chunk-1e7e55