 alignment technique during inhalation.", created_at:1779728214, source_id:"chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"Inhaling Back to the Center"}}, {_id:8112, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"data", truncate:"", description:"45 degrees represents the outward angle for foot placement in yoga poses.", created_at:1779728214, source_id:"chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"45 Degrees"}}, {_id:8113, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Bend the right knee and place the right foot on the side of the left leg's shin or thigh.", created_at:1779728214, source_id:"chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"Bend Right Knee and Place Foot"}}, {_id:8114, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Breathe deeply spread feet as wide as your yoga mat with feet turned outwards 45 degrees.", created_at:1779728214, source_id:"chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"Breathe Deeply Spread Feet"}}, {_id:8115, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Join your palms near your heart is a yoga alignment technique performed during inhalation.", created_at:1779728215, source_id:"chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"Join Your Palms Near Your Heart"}}, {_id:8116, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Unlocking fingers and relaxing hands is a preparatory step in yoga poses to release tension.", created_at:1779728215, source_id:"chunk-555b79d6932fe4cfb28b31ad6eda2607", entity_id:"Unlock Your Fingers and Relax Your Hands"}}, {_id:8117, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o_eg6YTifRE)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", created_at:1779733254, description:"Repeated exhaling sounds present in the YouTube Video, representing the primary audio content.<SEP>A repeated sound of exhaling captured in the video, possibly indicating a breathing pattern or sound effect.<SEP>Exhale is the act of breathing out air, repeatedly performed in the video.<SEP>Exhale refers to the repeated audio of exhalation sounds present in the video, creating a rhythmic pattern.<SEP>The action of releasing breath while producing a humming sound.", source_id:"chunk-b7f759119421796b3672a110c42fe969<SEP>chunk-788e02d72db8748b1249039296af9b2c<SEP>chunk-ba8dd19bc446abc9974fa7f6092497d2<SEP>chunk-9589b2a8d377dfb0414601f07597a5ca<SEP>chunk-739247db73d704aae1538c35019e363b", entity_id:"Exhale"}}, {_id:8118, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"shin or thigh\" is identified as ambiguous and requires clarification.<SEP>The ambiguity in \"shin or thigh\" is addressed by suggesting a clearer phrasing.", created_at:1779728297, source_id:"chunk-dc13fd60e7ca6d6137d4072e9576226a", entity_id:"shin or thigh"}}, {_id:8119, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"arms\" is repeated, which is identified as an error.<SEP>The repetition in the phrase is corrected to improve clarity.", created_at:1779728297, source_id:"chunk-dc13fd60e7ca6d6137d4072e9576226a", entity_id:"inhaling lift your arms above your head join your palms arms looking straight ahead"}}, {_id:8120, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The words \"inhale\" and \"exhaling\" are lowercase, which is an error.<SEP>The capitalization in the phrase is corrected to proper case.", created_at:1779728297, source_id:"chunk-dc13fd60e7ca6d6137d4072e9576226a", entity_id:"inhale deeply exhaling relax your arms and leg"}}, {_id:8121, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The phrase \"exhale\" is repeated multiple times, which is identified as an error.<SEP>The repetition in the phrase is corrected to improve clarity.", created_at:1779728298, source_id:"chunk-dc13fd60e7ca6d6137d4072e9576226a", entity_id:"inhale deeply exhale exhale exhale..."}}, {_id:8122, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The video contains repetitive vocalizations of \"exhale\" as its central auditory content, creating a rhythmic or thematic focus on the term.", created_at:1779728342, source_id:"chunk-b185820707372ddad11918be65909170", entity_id:"exhale"}}, {_id:8123, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A sequence of repeated \"exhale\" sounds, potentially used in breathing techniques or audio demonstrations.", created_at:1779728343, source_id:"chunk-6a39e8c1b3a7746ab3b4831ab07cbbc8", entity_id:"Exhale Repetition"}}, {_id:8124, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGosHULQQk0)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779728441, description:"The blissful nature of existence is the ultimate state of being that meditation aims to reveal through awakened awareness.<SEP>Blissful nature of existence is described as a state of being awakened through meditation, characterized by freedom and universal alignment.<SEP>The blissful nature of existence is the ultimate state of being that meditation aims to reveal through awakened awareness.<SEP>Blissful nature of existence is described as a state of being awakened through meditation, characterized by freedom and universal alignment.", source_id:"chunk-07cef1cacdb43780b9533bba3a4b7ad2<SEP>chunk-e5a191d0b4c345edce809b4d1989b5be", entity_id:"Blissful Nature of Existence"}}, {_id:8125, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h8DQ0GlvD8I)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Guided moving meditations are a method that facilitates awakening to the miracle of life and experiencing a greater presence.<SEP>Guided moving meditations are a practice designed to awaken individuals to the miracle of life and foster wakefulness.", created_at:1779728563, source_id:"chunk-437bb3e52ed8d4dea6395359e9a1e195<SEP>chunk-b5a7b3463fa3f50871fa69b79c291468", entity_id:"Guided Moving Meditations"}}] AS row
