ditation metaphor.<SEP>Open Clearings are mentioned as the destination when walking through conflicting thoughts.<SEP>Open clearings metaphorically represent mental clarity achieved through meditation.<SEP>Open Clearings symbolize moments of clarity or resolution achieved through meditation practice.<SEP>Open Clearings symbolize mental clarity achieved by resolving conflicting thoughts during meditation.", source_id:"chunk-4ffd283bc238983d474b77fd2c547d1f<SEP>chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5<SEP>chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4<SEP>chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae<SEP>chunk-e017c2df57eaa1538f55645a4b11d5a1", entity_id:"Open Clearings"}}, {_id:8221, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", created_at:1779734937, description:"Original term incorrectly written as \"hand hold\"; should be \"hand-hold\".<SEP>hand hold is the original uncorrected phrase discussed in the text, identified as a grammatical error requiring compound verb formatting.<SEP>hand hold is the original uncorrected phrase discussed in the text, identified as a grammatical error requiring compound verb formatting.<SEP>A typo where \"hand hold\" is written without a hyphen, requiring correction to \"hand-hold\".>", source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141<SEP>chunk-02886e80b539cd7ee63b9c4f5a0af110<SEP>chunk-f0b4c182f4c7ce1f24b104d5170609f0", entity_id:"hand hold"}}, {_id:8222, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779734936, description:"Corrected term from \"hand hold\"; refers to providing support or guidance.<SEP>hand-hold is a compound verb formed by combining \"hand\" and \"hold,\" commonly used in grammatical contexts.<SEP>hand-hold is a compound verb formed by combining \"hand\" and \"hold,\" commonly used in grammatical contexts.", source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141<SEP>chunk-02886e80b539cd7ee63b9c4f5a0af110<SEP>chunk-f0b4c182f4c7ce1f24b104d5170609f0", entity_id:"hand-hold"}}, {_id:8223, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Incomplete sentence fragment in the text, identified as a grammatical error.", created_at:1779734370, source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"sentence fragment"}}, {_id:8224, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Error in sentence structure, specifically a missing verb or incomplete sentence.", created_at:1779734370, source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"grammatical error"}}, {_id:8225, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Possible intentional stylistic decision to use a sentence fragment for effect.", created_at:1779734370, source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"stylistic choice"}}, {_id:8226, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Least intrusive correction applied to fix errors without altering original meaning.", created_at:1779734370, source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"minimal fix"}}, {_id:8227, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"More extensive correction involving structural changes to the text.", created_at:1779734370, source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"rewrite"}}, {_id:8228, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Minimal alteration to correct errors while preserving original style and meaning.", created_at:1779734371, source_id:"chunk-116b33bee1824fad76dd5db282ddf141", entity_id:"least intrusive change"}}, {_id:8233, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Hand-hold is a corrected term, fixing a typo from \"hand hold\" to \"hand-hold\".<SEP>Hand-hold refers to a technique or metaphor used in guided meditations to enhance clarity and engagement during the practice.", created_at:1779734672, source_id:"chunk-098d319e8d107d6280ebbc52bae4a3c9<SEP>chunk-619f3a9b9f1a9a2f69d32ef07fbabf7c", entity_id:"Hand-hold"}}, {_id:8235, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779735068, description:"Enduring Results are noted as being created by meditation, requiring intelligence.<SEP>Enduring results are long-term benefits of meditation that require consistent practice and intelligence.<SEP>Enduring results are a key outcome of meditation, requiring intelligence and leading to lasting benefits.<SEP>Enduring Results describe the long-term benefits of meditation that require consistent practice and intellectual engagement.<SEP>Enduring Results refer to long-lasting outcomes achieved through meditation, emphasizing sustainability.", source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5<SEP>chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4<SEP>chunk-30d3f42efa9576e322e258b3d40a98fa<SEP>chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae<SEP>chunk-e017c2df57eaa1538f55645a4b11d5a1", entity_id:"Enduring Results"}}, {_id:8236, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Unguided Consciousness is referenced in the context of exploring it without guidance.", created_at:1779734543, source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5", entity_id:"Unguided Consciousness"}}, {_id:8237, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Results are discussed as both instant and enduring, with meditation creating them.", created_at:1779734543, source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5", entity_id:"Results"}}, {_id:8238, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Instant Result is a concept mentioned as something people hope for, leading to disappointment.<SEP>Instant result is a concept where people hope for quick outcomes, leading to disappointment.<SEP>Instant result refers to the expectation of immediate outcomes from meditation, leading to disappointment among some practitioners.<SEP>Instant Result refers to the expectation of immediate outcomes from meditation, leading to disappointment when unmet.", created_at:1779735063, source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5<SEP>chunk-a10e920484b4b5f03e118c89aee5a8de<SEP>chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4<SEP>chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"Instant Result"}}, {_id:8239, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"Seasoned Meditator is a type of person for whom both guided and unguided methods work.<SEP>Experienced individual capable of handling both guided and unguided meditation practices.<SEP>Seasoned Meditators are experienced practitioners who can use both guided and unguided meditation, and both methods are fine for them.<SEP>Seasoned meditators can effectively engage in both guided and unguided meditation practices.<SEP>A seasoned meditator is an experienced practitioner who can navigate both guided and unguided meditation techniques effectively.<SEP>A seasoned meditator is experienced in meditation practices and considers both guided and unguided approaches suitable for their needs.", created_at:1779734960, source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5<SEP>chunk-b3d60e278a1f47b474049eb9d574026e<SEP>chunk-59826b76f9c0df8dac3d55bfd1895e81<SEP>chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4<SEP>chunk-619f3a9b9f1a9a2f69d32ef07fbabf7c<SEP>chunk-ea2c880e0817109d2e1724af65951447", entity_id:"Seasoned Meditator"}}, {_id:8240, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Guidance is mentioned as a factor in the effectiveness of meditation.", created_at:1779734543, source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5", entity_id:"Guidance"}}, {_id:8241, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Uncharted Consciousness is explored by meditators without guidance.<SEP>Uncharted consciousness represents unexplored aspects of the mind or self-awareness that meditators may explore, often requiring guidance.<SEP>Uncharted consciousness refers to unexplored aspects of the mind or awareness that a seasoned meditator might explore autonomously.<SEP>Uncharted Consciousness refers to the unexplored aspects of the mind that practitioners explore during meditation, either independently or through guided methods.", created_at:1779735063, source_id:"chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5<SEP>chunk-619f3a9b9f1a9a2f69d32ef07fbabf7c<SEP>chunk-ea2c880e0817109d2e1724af65951447<SEP>chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"Uncharted Consciousness"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:8242, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Mentioned practice in the video, possibly referring to meditation techniques or concepts.", created_at:1779734545, source_id:"chunk-b3d60e278a1f47b474049eb9d574026e", entity_id:"itations"}}, {_id:8243, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", created_at:1779734961, description:"Self-directed meditation without external guidance, requiring personal discipline.<SEP>Unguided meditation involves independent exploration of consciousness without external instructions, favored by seasoned practitioners.<SEP>Unguided meditation is the practice of exploring consciousness without guidance, which the seasoned meditator finds acceptable.", source_id:"chunk-b3d60e278a1f47b474049eb9d574026e<SEP>chunk-ea2c880e0817109d2e1724af65951447<SEP>chunk-30d3f42efa9576e322e258b3d40a98fa", entity_id:"Unguided Meditation"}}, {_id:8244, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Expectation of immediate outcomes from meditation, leading to disappointment.<SEP>Instant results represent the desire for immediate outcomes from meditation, often driving preference for guided approaches.", created_at:1779734960, source_id:"chunk-b3d60e278a1f47b474049eb9d574026e<SEP>chunk-ea2c880e0817109d2e1724af65951447", entity_id:"Instant Results"}}, {_id:8245, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Rule 3 addresses punctuation and capitalization for readability, including examples of meditation sentences and list items.", created_at:1779734598, source_id:"chunk-a10e920484b4b5f03e118c89aee5a8de", entity_id:"Rule 3"}}, {_id:8246, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", created_at:1779735068, description:"Distracted days are days when guided meditations are observed to yield great results.<SEP>Distracted Days refer to periods when a meditator's focus is compromised, during which guided meditations are particularly effective according to the content.<SEP>Distracted Days describe periods of mental preoccupation where guided meditation demonstrates effectiveness.", source_id:"chunk-a10e920484b4b5f03e118c89aee5a8de<SEP>chunk-619f3a9b9f1a9a2f69d32ef07fbabf7c<SEP>chunk-e017c2df57eaa1538f55645a4b11d5a1", entity_id:"Distracted Days"}}, {_id:8247, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"List items are examples under Rule 3, such as points 1, 2, and 3, which are grammatically abrupt but part of the rule's content.", created_at:1779734598, source_id:"chunk-a10e920484b4b5f03e118c89aee5a8de", entity_id:"List Items"}}, {_id:8248, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hand-hold is a metaphorical method used in guided meditations to provide support and structure.<SEP>Hand-hold is a grammatical error where \"hand hold\" should be hyphenated as \"hand-hold\" for correctness.", created_at:1779734984, source_id:"chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4<SEP>chunk-8e15fc85d32ce342ec9c480484b3580f", entity_id:"Hand-Hold"}}, {_id:8249, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Guided meditations are particularly effective on days when practitioners are distracted.", created_at:1779734684, source_id:"chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4", entity_id:"Distracted"}}, {_id:8250, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Beginners attempting meditation refers to a grammatical fix for a list structure issue in the original text.<SEP>Beginners attempting meditation refers to a grammatical fix for a list structure issue in the original text.", created_at:1779734936, source_id:"chunk-02886e80b539cd7ee63b9c4f5a0af110", entity_id:"Beginners attempting meditation"}}, {_id:8251, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"category", truncate:"", description:"Exploring the uncharted consciousness... is a sentence fragment requiring integration into a complete sentence for grammatical correctness.<SEP>Exploring the uncharted consciousness... is a sentence fragment requiring integration into a complete sentence for grammatical correctness.<SEP>A grammatical fragment that disrupts sentence flow, requiring rephrasing for clarity.>", created_at:1779734937, source_id:"chunk-02886e80b539cd7ee63b9c4f5a0af110<SEP>chunk-f0b4c182f4c7ce1f24b104d5170609f0", entity_id:"Exploring the uncharted consciousness..."}}, {_id:8252, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The fragment \"Exploring the uncharted consciousness...\" should be integrated into the previous sentence as \"They explore the uncharted consciousness...\" to maintain flow and clarity.>", created_at:1779734937, source_id:"chunk-f0b4c182f4c7ce1f24b104d5170609f0", entity_id:"rewritten sentence"}}, {_id:8253, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The original list item should be revised to \"Beginners attempting meditation\" for parallelism and grammatical accuracy.", created_at:1779734938, source_id:"chunk-02886e80b539cd7ee63b9c4f5a0af110", entity_id:"They give up because 1. Beginners attempt..."}}, {_id:8254, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The fragment \"Exploring the uncharted consciousness...\" needs to be connected to the preceding sentence for coherence.", created_at:1779734938, source_id:"chunk-02886e80b539cd7ee63b9c4f5a0af110", entity_id:"For a seasoned meditator, both work."}}, {_id:8255, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"List item error refers to grammatical inconsistencies in bullet points, such as missing verbs or improper punctuation.", created_at:1779734984, source_id:"chunk-8e15fc85d32ce342ec9c480484b3580f", entity_id:"List Item Error"}}, {_id:8256, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Guided and unguided meditation are presented as alternative approaches for seasoned practitioners.", created_at:1779735014, source_id:"chunk-8e15fc85d32ce342ec9c480484b3580f", entity_id:"Solo Meditation"}}, {_id:8257, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"The corrected version of the list item adds a colon after \"because\" for proper punctuation.", created_at:1779735031, source_id:"chunk-c2bfebf798dda9ae79481c2d7258fd74", entity_id:"Because: 1. Beginners attempt"}}, {_id:8258, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The corrected sentence adds a subject to the original fragment, making it a complete sentence.", created_at:1779735031, source_id:"chunk-c2bfebf798dda9ae79481c2d7258fd74", entity_id:"They explore the uncharted consciousness"}}, {_id:8259, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The original fragment was corrected by adding a subject to form a complete sentence.", created_at:1779735031, source_id:"chunk-c2bfebf798dda9ae79481c2d7258fd74", entity_id:"Exploring the uncharted consciousness"}}, {_id:8260, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The incorrect sentence was corrected by adding a colon after \"because\" to fix the punctuation.", created_at:1779735031, source_id:"chunk-c2bfebf798dda9ae79481c2d7258fd74", entity_id:"They give up because 1. Beginners attempt"}}, {_id:8261, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"People feel disappointed when meditation does not provide instant results as they hoped.", created_at:1779735095, source_id:"chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"disappointed"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:8262, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Beginners often feel daunted when attempting advanced meditation techniques meant for seasoned practitioners.", created_at:1779735095, source_id:"chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"daunted"}}, {_id:8263, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Seasoned practitioners can effectively use guided meditations due to their experience.", created_at:1779735095, source_id:"chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"guided meditations"}}, {_id:8264, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Navigating conflicting thoughts during meditation can lead to the clarity represented by open clearings.", created_at:1779735095, source_id:"chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"open clearings"}}, {_id:8265, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Guided meditations are particularly effective on days when practitioners are distracted.", created_at:1779735095, source_id:"chunk-b750056201bfac82be4d5952fd13e6ae", entity_id:"distracted days"}}, {_id:8266, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Something Larger Than Us represents a collective or existential concept transcending individual boundaries, emphasized in the text as the target of feeling and unity.", created_at:1779735101, source_id:"chunk-e59acdfefe902b458f46f2ae6d7334ea", entity_id:"Something Larger Than Us"}}, {_id:8267, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6EHw_0gYD5w)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Breathing Room is a YouTube video discussing collective consciousness, purpose, and unity through metaphorical breathing as a shared human experience, emphasizing expanded awareness beyond individual selves.", created_at:1779735112, source_id:"chunk-b5c9c09506874671adef98ac6362dfb9", entity_id:"Breathing Room (YouTube Video)"}}, {_id:8268, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6EHw_0gYD5w)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"The YouTube video explores the concept of \"breathing room\" as a metaphor for unified human consciousness and collective purpose through shared breathing symbolism.", created_at:1779735113, source_id:"chunk-b5c9c09506874671adef98ac6362dfb9", entity_id:"Breathing Room (Concept)"}}, {_id:8269, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Soul Sync leads to relaxation of the body.", created_at:1779735143, source_id:"chunk-9eae98d603762cd4fa3b1d7c14d0570e", entity_id:"Relaxation of the body"}}, {_id:8270, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Soul Sync leads to calming of the mind.", created_at:1779735144, source_id:"chunk-9eae98d603762cd4fa3b1d7c14d0570e", entity_id:"Calming of the mind"}}, {_id:8271, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Soul Sync leads to expansion in consciousness.", created_at:1779735144, source_id:"chunk-9eae98d603762cd4fa3b1d7c14d0570e", entity_id:"Expansion in consciousness"}}, {_id:8272, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Observation-Based Meditation is a type of flow-based meditation.", created_at:1779735148, source_id:"chunk-8c69aca406633eaa4420a95f04ee20eb", entity_id:"Flow-Based Meditation"}}, {_id:8273, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Walking Meditation is a type of concentration-based meditation.", created_at:1779735148, source_id:"chunk-8c69aca406633eaa4420a95f04ee20eb", entity_id:"Concentration-Based Meditation"}}, {_id:8274, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Walking Meditation is a type of concentration-based meditation.", created_at:1779735148, source_id:"chunk-8c69aca406633eaa4420a95f04ee20eb", entity_id:"Walking Meditation"}}, {_id:8275, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Observation-Based Meditation is a type of flow-based meditation.", created_at:1779735148, source_id:"chunk-8c69aca406633eaa4420a95f04ee20eb", entity_id:"Observation-Based Meditation"}}, {_id:8276, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"Smiling Meditation is a type of concentration-based meditation.", created_at:1779735149, source_id:"chunk-8c69aca406633eaa4420a95f04ee20eb", entity_id:"Smiling Meditation"}}, {_id:8277, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"States of well-being, calm, peace, and serenity are outcomes of meditation, ranging from trance to divine communion.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"States of Well-Being"}}, {_id:8278, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Intense crises, such as illness or near-death experiences, can trigger spontaneous meditative states.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Intense Crisis"}}, {_id:8279, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Induction methods include intense solitude, fasting, prayer, breath work, and rigorous movement to provoke meditative states.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Induction Methods"}}, {_id:8280, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A mystic or sage is a gifted individual capable of transferring powerful states of consciousness to others.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Mystic or Sage"}}, {_id:8281, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Transcendental states encompass trance, bliss, divine communion, and oneness with the universe.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Transcendental Meditative States"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:8282, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Breathtaking beauty in experiences like skydiving, childbirth, or nature views can induce spontaneous meditative states.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Breathtaking Beauty"}}, {_id:8283, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Meditation as a happening is a spontaneous, non-conscious practice where the meditator acts as a passive receiver rather than an active participant.", created_at:1779735169, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Meditation as a Happening"}}, {_id:8284, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1sMxPhQcvEA)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Passive receiver refers to the meditator's role in spontaneous meditative states, where they receive experiences without conscious effort.", created_at:1779735170, source_id:"chunk-dbd47932643e18935fb4241ff99a2dc0", entity_id:"Passive Receiver"}}, {_id:8285, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Constraint to transform repetitive text into a grammatically correct, meaningful sentence while preserving emphasis through repetition.<SEP>Constraint to transform repetitive text into a grammatically correct, meaningful sentence while preserving emphasis through repetition.", created_at:1779735302, source_id:"chunk-24979790543830f1142942642c3d852a", entity_id:"Readable Sentence"}}, {_id:8286, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Focus area for accurately transcribing specialized names/terms relevant to the 'Mukthi Guru' platform.<SEP>Focus area for accurately transcribing specialized names/terms relevant to the 'Mukthi Guru' platform.", created_at:1779735302, source_id:"chunk-24979790543830f1142942642c3d852a", entity_id:"Domain-Specific Names/Terms"}}, {_id:8287, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"User's Request involves correcting transcription errors in a repetitive text with no original meaning, focusing on readability and grammatical accuracy.<SEP>User's Request involves correcting transcription errors in a repetitive text with no original meaning, focusing on readability and grammatical accuracy.", created_at:1779735302, source_id:"chunk-24979790543830f1142942642c3d852a", entity_id:"User's Request"}}, {_id:8288, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Key element in the input text consisting of repeated \"Each\" words, intended for emphasis or chant-like structure.<SEP>Key element in the input text consisting of repeated \"Each\" words, intended for emphasis or chant-like structure.", created_at:1779735302, source_id:"chunk-24979790543830f1142942642c3d852a", entity_id:"Repetition of \"Each\""}}, {_id:8289, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDcy09esbe8)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Do Not Retain Original Meaning is a constraint requiring meaningful reconstruction of gibberish text.<SEP>Do Not Retain Original Meaning is a constraint requiring meaningful reconstruction of gibberish text.", created_at:1779735300, source_id:"chunk-c78b80b3d190a3dd471274fce89c4224", entity_id:"Do Not Retain Original Meaning"}}, {_id:8290, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Nonsensical String is a placeholder text identified as a transcription error, requiring correction.", created_at:1779735484, source_id:"chunk-da3b18ca25179ccc204d06cf8b447233", entity_id:"Nonsensical String"}}, {_id:8291, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sri Mukthi Guru is a term on the domain-specific list, considered as an alternative to Ekam.", created_at:1779735484, source_id:"chunk-da3b18ca25179ccc204d06cf8b447233", entity_id:"Sri Mukthi Guru"}}, {_id:8292, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A literal representation of absent meaningful text, proposed as a correction for uncorrectable transcription errors.<SEP>A literal representation of absent meaningful text, proposed as a correction for uncorrectable transcription errors.", created_at:1779735846, source_id:"chunk-10cfea730dda35fa45c5ab791a46e19c", entity_id:"Blank String"}}, {_id:8293, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A principle stating that the quality of output depends on the quality of input, referenced in the context of text correction challenges.<SEP>A principle stating that the quality of output depends on the quality of input, referenced in the context of text correction challenges.", created_at:1779736616, source_id:"chunk-18cbd171bb5b60b25e9939f225a974d3", entity_id:"Garbage In, Garbage Out"}}, {_id:8294, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Represents corrupted or placeholder text (\"?l?l?l...\") requiring correction.<SEP>Represents corrupted or placeholder text (\"?l?l?l...\") requiring correction.", created_at:1779736618, source_id:"chunk-18cbd171bb5b60b25e9939f225a974d3", entity_id:"Placeholder Text"}}, {_id:8295, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"A file containing unreadable or placeholder text due to copying errors or corruption.<SEP>A file containing unreadable or placeholder text due to copying errors or corruption.", created_at:1779736617, source_id:"chunk-18cbd171bb5b60b25e9939f225a974d3", entity_id:"Corrupted File"}}, {_id:8296, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Hypothetical corrected version of ambiguous text adhering to context and correction rules.<SEP>Hypothetical corrected version of ambiguous text adhering to context and correction rules.", created_at:1779736617, source_id:"chunk-18cbd171bb5b60b25e9939f225a974d3", entity_id:"Plausible Replacement"}}, {_id:8297, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Placeholder refers to a corrupted or nonsensical string requiring correction to a valid term or phrase.<SEP>Placeholder refers to a corrupted or nonsensical string requiring correction to a valid term or phrase.<SEP>The ambiguous placeholder text \"?l?l?l...\" in the input requires correction to a contextually appropriate term.<SEP>The ambiguous placeholder text \"?l?l?l...\" in the input requires correction to a contextually appropriate term.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-f084c6d7a5e282477927a0fb44b0776a<SEP>chunk-8c2999b4454577d6cb96220edfece137", entity_id:"Placeholder"}}, {_id:8299, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The challenge of correcting an undefined string with no clear context or instructions, framed as a paradoxical request.", created_at:1779736803, source_id:"chunk-69034c36c6b3f03c77aeefef7269f74b", entity_id:"Impossible Task"}}, {_id:8300, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"A non-linguistic character string described as repetitive and contextually ambiguous, requiring interpretation.", created_at:1779736803, source_id:"chunk-69034c36c6b3f03c77aeefef7269f74b", entity_id:"Long Repetitive String"}}, {_id:8301, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Invalid characters are identified as the cause of processing errors in the string, leading to the need for a correction.", created_at:1779736937, source_id:"chunk-bff4f504c3b7e6ef033af89f1f7e3dbf", entity_id:"Invalid Characters"}}, {_id:8302, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The string is described as very long and potentially representing a complex concept, which is the subject of the analysis.", created_at:1779736937, source_id:"chunk-bff4f504c3b7e6ef033af89f1f7e3dbf", entity_id:"String"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row._id}) SET n += row.properties SET n:base;
UNWIND [{_id:8303, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"The concept of transcribable input is mentioned as a negative example, contrasting with the non-transcribable nature of the input text.", created_at:1779736937, source_id:"chunk-bff4f504c3b7e6ef033af89f1f7e3dbf", entity_id:"Transcribable Input"}}, {_id:8304, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"An empty string is proposed as a potential solution to the error caused by invalid characters in the input.", created_at:1779736937, source_id:"chunk-bff4f504c3b7e6ef033af89f1f7e3dbf", entity_id:"Empty String"}}, {_id:8305, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iIduE7RwihM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Creative Dynamism describes the energetic expression and transformative potential arising from inner peace and meditation.<SEP>Creative Dynamism refers to the energetic drive and innovative potential arising from inner peace, enabling impactful life experiences.<SEP>Creative Dynamism refers to the energetic drive and innovative potential arising from inner peace, enabling impactful life experiences.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea<SEP>chunk-ab1636460f25bc9a19f2f9f9e8037a69", entity_id:"Creative Dynamism"}}, {_id:8306, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iIduE7RwihM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Peaceful State is an inner condition characterized by tranquility, enabling synchronization with the external world and harmonious life flow.<SEP>Peaceful State is an internal condition enabling synchronous and harmonious engagement with the external world.<SEP>Peaceful State is an internal condition enabling synchronous and harmonious engagement with the external world.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea<SEP>chunk-ab1636460f25bc9a19f2f9f9e8037a69", entity_id:"Peaceful State"}}, {_id:8307, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iIduE7RwihM)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Infinite Peace Meditations refer to meditation practices aimed at achieving profound inner calm and fostering creative dynamism in life.<SEP>Infinite Peace Meditations are guided practices aimed at cultivating deep inner calm and creative dynamism through breathing techniques.<SEP>Infinite Peace Meditations are guided practices aimed at cultivating deep inner calm and creative dynamism through breathing techniques.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea<SEP>chunk-ab1636460f25bc9a19f2f9f9e8037a69", entity_id:"Infinite Peace Meditations"}}, {_id:8308, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Total Presence signifies full engagement and mindfulness in every life experience, cultivated through sustained peaceful awareness.", created_at:1779736948, source_id:"chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea", entity_id:"Total Presence"}}, {_id:8309, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Breathing Room Meditations is a meditation program designed to cultivate inner peace and creative dynamism through guided practices.", created_at:1779736948, source_id:"chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea", entity_id:"Breathing Room Meditations"}}, {_id:8310, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"person", truncate:"", description:"A Peaceful Person embodies tranquility and mindfulness, enabling full engagement in life experiences through sustained peaceful awareness.", created_at:1779736948, source_id:"chunk-e6a690f0a609097421699843b7a3daea", entity_id:"Peaceful Person"}}, {_id:8312, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iIduE7RwihM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Deep Inner Calm is a state of profound tranquility achieved through meditation, serving as the foundation for peaceful interaction with the world.<SEP>Deep Inner Calm is a state of profound tranquility achieved through meditation, serving as the foundation for peaceful interaction with the world.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-ab1636460f25bc9a19f2f9f9e8037a69", entity_id:"Deep Inner Calm"}}, {_id:8313, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iIduE7RwihM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Synchronous Life describes a state of alignment and fluidity in one's experiences, emerging from sustained inner peace.<SEP>Synchronous Life describes a state of alignment and fluidity in one's experiences, emerging from sustained inner peace.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-ab1636460f25bc9a19f2f9f9e8037a69", entity_id:"Synchronous Life"}}, {_id:8314, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Ambiguity describes the lack of clear meaning in the original placeholder text, complicating the correction task.<SEP>Ambiguity describes the lack of clear meaning in the original placeholder text, complicating the correction task.", created_at:1779736981, source_id:"chunk-8c2999b4454577d6cb96220edfece137", entity_id:"Ambiguity"}}, {_id:8315, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Terms of Art is a list of domain-specific terms used in the context of placeholder correction and rule adherence testing.", created_at:1779737039, source_id:"chunk-a68fd8d47d2618062433543302bda7e8", entity_id:"Terms of Art"}}, {_id:8316, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"Original String refers to the placeholder error consisting of a long sequence of '?l' characters, which was replaced during the correction process.", created_at:1779737039, source_id:"chunk-a68fd8d47d2618062433543302bda7e8", entity_id:"Original String"}}, {_id:8317, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Lyrical meditations are referred to as sacred chants with ancient and mystical qualities.<SEP>Lyrical meditations are referred to as sacred chants with ancient and mystical qualities.", created_at:1779737164, source_id:"chunk-95bb20fa08d8c179f5fbb773fd59108f", entity_id:"Lyrical Meditations"}}, {_id:8318, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Sacred chants are described as lyrical meditations and ancient winds that bring mystic flavors to permeate the heart.<SEP>Sacred chants are described as lyrical meditations and ancient winds that bring mystic flavors to permeate the heart.", created_at:1779737164, source_id:"chunk-95bb20fa08d8c179f5fbb773fd59108f<SEP>chunk-e7b0402c940a526bbabf0773b0c7654b", entity_id:"Sacred Chants"}}, {_id:8319, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Visions of the sages are noted as the source of sacred chants.<SEP>Visions of the sages are noted as the source of sacred chants.<SEP>Visions of the sages are a source of sacred chants, representing ancient wisdom and inspiration.", created_at:1779737166, source_id:"chunk-95bb20fa08d8c179f5fbb773fd59108f<SEP>chunk-e7b0402c940a526bbabf0773b0c7654b", entity_id:"Visions of the Sages"}}, {_id:8320, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"