ence"}}, {_id:8330, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g1tezETHrfY)", entity_type:"method", truncate:"", description:"Calming Breath is a breathing technique used to reduce anxiety and promote bodily healing.", created_at:1779737260, source_id:"chunk-1079fe207ef62da8c4e25771a6e3071f", entity_id:"Calming Breath"}}, {_id:8331, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g1tezETHrfY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Meditative Consciousness is a state of mind that fosters great health through spiritual alignment.", created_at:1779737260, source_id:"chunk-1079fe207ef62da8c4e25771a6e3071f", entity_id:"Meditative Consciousness"}}, {_id:8332, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g1tezETHrfY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Earth's Intelligence refers to the natural wisdom and healing energy derived from the Earth.", created_at:1779737260, source_id:"chunk-1079fe207ef62da8c4e25771a6e3071f", entity_id:"Earth's Intelligence"}}, {_id:8333, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g1tezETHrfY)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Cosmic Energy is the universal life force that restores vitality and spiritual balance.", created_at:1779737260, source_id:"chunk-1079fe207ef62da8c4e25771a6e3071f", entity_id:"Cosmic Energy"}}, {_id:8337, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"They flushed out anxiety by calming their breath.", created_at:1779737261, source_id:"chunk-822d5365ac3942c7ee9d8f85c3a53d77", entity_id:"They flushed out anxiety"}}, {_id:8338, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"UNKNOWN", truncate:"", description:"They flushed out anxiety by calming their breath.", created_at:1779737261, source_id:"chunk-822d5365ac3942c7ee9d8f85c3a53d77", entity_id:"breathing"}}, {_id:8339, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1J0HpmGWsZs)", entity_type:"content", truncate:"", description:"\"Each thank you\" is the title of a YouTube video hosted at https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1J0HpmGWsZs.", created_at:1779737363, source_id:"chunk-b065c9805450731fb70974e5ffd3ecf3", entity_id:"Each thank you"}}, {_id:8340, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Refers to a transcendent state of interconnectedness achieved through heartfelt engagement and meditation practices.", created_at:1779737442, source_id:"chunk-7c9b4082908bfb46d220e1c2f401f693", entity_id:"Magical Dimension of Connection"}}, {_id:8341, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3weAVHuSCxg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Internal freedom refers to the liberation from emotional attachments, enabling personal growth and movement forward.<SEP>Internal Freedom represents liberation from emotional burdens, achieved through self-awareness.", created_at:1779737969, source_id:"chunk-801a54bafa1f63f0a4d091331cafc3d9<SEP>chunk-0bcd34bbf2440bb034ae1a5607edb427", entity_id:"Internal Freedom"}}, {_id:8342, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3weAVHuSCxg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Space to breathe is a conscious choice to create emotional distance, fostering self-awareness and healing.<SEP>Space to Breathe symbolizes emotional release and self-awareness, enabling personal growth.", created_at:1779737968, source_id:"chunk-801a54bafa1f63f0a4d091331cafc3d9<SEP>chunk-0bcd34bbf2440bb034ae1a5607edb427", entity_id:"Space to Breathe"}}, {_id:8343, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3weAVHuSCxg)", entity_type:"concept", truncate:"", description:"Separations refer to the emotional pain and loss exp