tion:"Ekam's processes aim to guide practitioners toward Jeevan Mukta, a state of liberation and union with Universal Consciousness.", created_at:1779228591, source_id:"chunk-6995806c11a29b44fc7094ee22938f78"}}, {start: {name:"Brahman"}, end: {name:"Jeevan Mukta"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", truncate:"", keywords:"liberation,spiritual union", weight:1.0, description:"Jeevan Mukta represents the state of being liberated, ultimately uniting with the universal consciousness (Brahman).", created_at:1779228978, source_id:"chunk-7fd3191dae6c1c66321a24ecdfc2f30a"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {name:"Oneness"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"existential realization,spiritual unity", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam embodies the spiritual realization of oneness with existence, life, and the universe.", created_at:1779232053, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {name:"Suffering"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"evolution,liberation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness evolution enables individuals to transcend suffering and live free from distress.>", created_at:1779238806, source_id:"chunk-2937f9db737764b56ab13c05271ce216"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {name:"Samsara"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"control,cycle", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness influences samsara, which is controlled by karma and vasanas.", created_at:1779432871, source_id:"chunk-f736079de24478bec6cb37255e7aac1e"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {name:"Karma"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)", keywords:"cause-effect,conceptual attributes,conceptual relationship,destiny,flow,life influence,manifestation", truncate:"", weight:7.0, description:"Consciousness has good karma flow, which affects destiny.<SEP>Consciousness is associated with Karma as part of its defining characteristics.<SEP>Consciousness encompasses Karma as part of its structure and impact on human life.<SEP>Karma is generated through consciousness and actions, with the text stating that individual state and actions determine life outcomes.<SEP>Karma is generated through consciousness and actions, with the text stating that individual state and actions determine life outcomes.<SEP>Karma is generated through consciousness and actions, with the text stating that individual state and actions determine life outcomes.<SEP>Karma is generated through consciousness and actions, with the text stating that individual state and actions determine life outcomes.", created_at:1779667928, source_id:"chunk-f736079de24478bec6cb37255e7aac1e<SEP>chunk-43647d3a6ff9b1049b42faa7da2a7b2c<SEP>chunk-ad8cd9c49a16ec95450897f747dabecf<SEP>chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {name:"Ekam"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual link,oneness,philosophical theme,spiritual unity", weight:2.0, description:"Ekam directly relates to discussions about consciousness and unity in the text.<SEP>Ekam (oneness) underlies the interconnected awakening of consciousness to universal purpose.", created_at:1779448281, source_id:"chunk-67c71335838e7d9c72ee9c00d04337d4<SEP>chunk-08f19d081ba1db71567273cb28ac6446"}}, {start: {name:"Brahman"}, end: {name:"Consciousness"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"identity,metaphysical equivalence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness is equated with Brahman, the ultimate reality.", created_at:1779531042, source_id:"chunk-e5bc7202d0a09227aeb490c17e163a8e"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {name:"Oneness"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"duality,enlightenment", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Oneness is framed as the highest state of consciousness, which is experienced as a duality of matter and energy.<SEP>Oneness is framed as the highest state of consciousness, which is experienced as a duality of matter and energy.", created_at:1779646728, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713"}}, {start: {name:"Oneness"}, end: {name:"Suffering"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"disease prevention,harmony restoration", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness consciousness eliminates suffering and restores enzyme harmony to prevent disease.", created_at:1779748311, source_id:"chunk-0218062ded6a8b7c8b783d92c65d1917"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:Concept{name: row.start.name})
