tual,spiritual practice,transcendence", weight:2.0, description:"Divine Inspiration involves chanting the mantra.<SEP>The mantra is chanted in a state of trance during Divine Inspiration to deepen spiritual connection.\" That's correct.", created_at:1779152459, source_id:"chunk-1d93dc520a0588d5566528e75d99011c<SEP>chunk-e485856c846e316df06cb23fc5d1ca15"}}, {start: {_id:453}, end: {name:"Ekam"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"lexical distinction,terminology", weight:1.0, description:"Abundance is not a mishearing of \"Ekam\" but a distinct general term.", created_at:1779152656, source_id:"chunk-57f3f1da68619bd5db8224c6378fdf46"}}, {start: {_id:1976}, end: {name:"Ekam"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction guidelines,domain-specific terms", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam is part of the user's list of domain-specific names to check.", created_at:1779152657, source_id:"chunk-57f3f1da68619bd5db8224c6378fdf46"}}, {start: {_id:1881}, end: {name:"Ekam"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"consistency,correction,includes", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Ekam is standardized to \"Ekam\" across all instances in the text.<SEP>Domain-Specific Terms includes Ekam, which is corrected.", created_at:1779216750, source_id:"chunk-43a8f372eadc4aa61f800152f8f9deed<SEP>chunk-20a2b70c2ce296088175b9c0d1f3ee20"}}, {start: {_id:2154}, end: {name:"Ekam"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"related terms,spiritual concepts", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Antaryamen and Ekam are related spiritual concepts in the context of the text.", created_at:1779157579, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff"}}, {start: {_id:2160}, end: {name:"Oneness"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", keywords:"shared reality,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The crisis reveals universal human experiences, fostering potential unity.", created_at:1779157753, source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852"}}, {start: {_id:2164}, end: {name:"Oneness"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0k5f8G9uXqY)", truncate:"", keywords:"division,unity", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness requires overcoming divisive consciousness rooted in labels and divisions.", created_at:1779157754, source_id:"chunk-90c446d17c5f31f5c15266790a0e5852"}}] AS row
