We need to integrate all key information: the relation is undirected, indicating mutual connection between Noah Carter and carbon-fiber spikes. The core fact: Noah Carter used carbon-fiber spikes to enhance performance during a race. Some accounts note record-breaking achievements (100m sprint record, breaking the record), others focus on general performance improvement. Variation in wording but core fact consistent. Consistency underscores reliability, while differing levels of detail highlight nuance.

We need to mention the full name at the beginning: \"Carbon-Fiber Spikes, Noah Carter, is a relation that describes...\"

We need to be objective, third-person.

