ones of Preethaji and Lokaa becoming drenched.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {_id:105}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"event,participation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Preethaji participated in the family vacation to Big Bear Lake.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {_id:105}, end: {_id:61}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"event,participation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Lokaa participated in the family vacation to Big Bear Lake.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {_id:106}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"event,existential crisis,experience,trauma", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Preethaji experienced the Jet Ski Incident during the family vacation.<SEP>Preethaji's struggle with panic and anger stems from the Jet Ski Incident's impact on her family.", created_at:1779135685, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41<SEP>chunk-30b3ce6bb0954806ce5e0dee5f14e7c3"}}, {start: {_id:110}, end: {_id:115}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"aspiration,resolution", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The concept of Beautiful Life is tied to liberation from separation and suffering.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {_id:106}, end: {_id:61}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"event,experience", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Lokaa experienced the Jet Ski Incident during the family vacation.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {_id:67}, end: {_id:106}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cause,incident", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Jet Ski tipping over caus