UNWIND [{start: {_id:118}, end: {_id:473}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"core principle,foundational concept", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The first sacred secret centers on inner truth as the primary step to greatness.", created_at:1779138114, source_id:"chunk-37e9823f1b7627730cb977ca684bcc4a"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:500}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"expression,love", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Worrying is used as a way to express love, particularly in familial or romantic contexts.", created_at:1779138136, source_id:"chunk-ae6d476e13e2477cf2c7c9d3b6783d89"}}, {start: {_id:89}, end: {_id:502}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"motivation,tool", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Anger is used as a tool to drive oneself, often mistaken for motivation.", created_at:1779138136, source_id:"chunk-ae6d476e13e2477cf2c7c9d3b6783d89"}}, {start: {_id:501}, end: {_id:498}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cost,motivation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Suering states can lead to success but at a great personal cost.", created_at:1779138136, source_id:"chunk-ae6d476e13e2477cf2c7c9d3b6783d89"}}, {start: {_id:499}, end: {_id:502}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"motivation,tool", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Stress is used as a tool to drive oneself, often mistaken for motivation.", created_at:1779138136, source_id:"chunk-ae6d476e13e2477cf2c7c9d3b6783d89"}}, {start: {_id:21}, end: {_id:503}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"analysis,discussion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The document examines suffering as a societal concept and its paradoxical role in success.", created_at:1779138179, source_id:"chunk-4f0272d8b081a768ff5112ff4880e510"}}, {start: {_id:473}, end: {_id:21}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"definition,exploration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The document explores inner truth as a deeper awareness contrasting with suffering.", created_at:1779138179, source_id:"chunk-4f0272d8b081a768ff5112ff4880e510"}}, {start: {_id:17}, end: {_id:503}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"narrative example,philosophical insights", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji?s story illustrates insights about suffering and consciousness.", created_at:1779138179, source_id:"chunk-4f0272d8b081a768ff5112ff4880e510"}}, {start: {_id:178}, end: {_id:503}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cultural norms,societal influence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Society perpetuates the idea that suffering is a blessing and struggle is key to success, shaping societal attitudes.", created_at:1779138180, source_id:"chunk-4f0272d8b081a768ff5112ff4880e510"}}, {start: {_id:59}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,narrative context,spiritual awakening,story context,story setting,teachings", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779183898, description:"Big Bear Lake is the location of Krishnaji?s transformative experience.<SEP>Krishnaji?s story of awakening at Big Bear Lake is referenced as a source of insights about suering.<SEP>Krishnaji's experience at Big Bear Lake informed his insights on suffering and inner truth shared in the text.", source_id:"chunk-4f0272d8b081a768ff5112ff4880e510<SEP>chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612"}}, {start: {_id:473}, end: {_id:503}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"contrasting concepts,societal critique", weight:1.0, description:"The text contrasts suffering with inner truth as paths to understanding and greatness.", created_at:1779138180, source_id:"chunk-4f0272d8b081a768ff5112ff4880e510"}}, {start: {_id:473}, end: {_id:476}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"alignment,compassion,historical reference,nonviolence", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Mahatma Gandhi?s life is cited as an example of alignment with inner truth.<SEP>Gandhi's nonviolent resistance was driven by inner truth and compassion, not personal hatred, as emphasized in the text.", created_at:1779183899, source_id:"chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612"}}, {start: {_id:505}, end: {_id:151}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"liberation,misidentification,personal experience,philosophical perspective", weight:2.0, description:"Christina asserts that \"suering is a choice\" based on her life experiences.<SEP>Christina initially mistook suffering for motivation but later recognized it as a state to transcend for inner freedom.", created_at:1779183899, source_id:"chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612"}}, {start: {_id:504}, end: {_id:151}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"advocacy,conceptual challenge,judgment", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Lee?s career advocating for the poor contrasts with the discussion on suering as a personal choice.<SEP>Lee's advocacy for the poor highlighted societal suffering but also demonstrated how suffering can manifest as judgment toward others.", created_at:1779183899, source_id:"chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612"}}, {start: {_id:473}, end: {_id:276}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"guidance framework,self-awareness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sacred secrets provide insights to extricate individuals from suering and align with inner truth.", created_at:1779138234, source_id:"chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125"}}, {start: {_id:505}, end: {_id:504}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"anger,conflict,dialogue,exploitation,humiliation,insult,reactive engagement,realization", truncate:"", weight:4.0, created_at:1779183898, description:"Lee responds to Christina?s statement about suering, indicating a dynamic exchange of ideas.<SEP>Christina felt humiliated and angry after Lee criticized her in front of others, leading to a conflict.<SEP>Christina's confrontation with Lee led to her realization that suffering is a self-perpetuating state tied to her own consciousness.<SEP>Christina felt insulted and exploited by Lee after providing financial support, leading to anger and bitterness.", source_id:"chunk-3315cd2e438010dca35a1192e534e125<SEP>chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5<SEP>chunk-54ab0057ebb9d14ac4c0eb525f843612<SEP>chunk-b66967ff647e15e2ccfdb242ffc22fb6"}}, {start: {_id:505}, end: {_id:38}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional state,self-reflection", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Christina recognized her \"suering state\" as a result of the interaction with Lee.", created_at:1779138256, source_id:"chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5"}}, {start: {_id:505}, end: {_id:508}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional reaction,initial response", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Christina initially felt humiliated and shocked upon leaving the room.", created_at:1779138256, source_id:"chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5"}}, {start: {_id:511}, end: {_id:505}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional progression,self-awareness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Christina later identified anger as part of her emotional journey after the incident.", created_at:1779138256, source_id:"chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5"}}, {start: {_id:505}, end: {_id:510}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,hypothetical challenge", weight:1.0, description:"Christina contemplates how hard-core evidence against Lee might reignite anger and bitterness.", created_at:1779138256, source_id:"chunk-ce43f1e704f39c7816ab3fb66ad9cae5"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
