UNWIND [{start: {_id:641}, end: {_id:640}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional state,source of struggle", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The inner battleground perpetuates dissatisfaction by trapping individuals in cycles of conflict.", created_at:1779138947, source_id:"chunk-c3c756183e3f4bbcd6f10defea6c686f"}}, {start: {_id:641}, end: {_id:301}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"obstacle to achievement,unfulfilled desires", weight:1.0, description:"The inner battleground prevents the attainment of happiness and freedom due to unresolved conflicts.", created_at:1779138947, source_id:"chunk-c3c756183e3f4bbcd6f10defea6c686f"}}, {start: {_id:641}, end: {_id:115}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"obstacle to achievement,unfulfilled desires", weight:1.0, description:"The inner battleground prevents the attainment of happiness and freedom due to unresolved conflicts.", created_at:1779138947, source_id:"chunk-c3c756183e3f4bbcd6f10defea6c686f"}}, {start: {_id:279}, end: {_id:642}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"consciousness transformation,inner conflict,insecurity,psychological struggle,self-perception,self-realization", truncate:"", weight:6.0, created_at:1779184066, description:"Alex exemplifies the \"Shrinking Self\" through his persistent self-comparison and feelings of inadequacy despite external success.<SEP>Alex experiences the shrinking self concept during his transformation, dissolving inner disharmony and comparison.<SEP>Alex's self-consciousness and inadequacy stem from a shrinking self that seeks external validation through comparisons.<SEP>Alex?s obsessive comparison with others stems from a shrinking self, causing self-consciousness and business dissatisfaction.`<SEP>Alex's obsessive comparison with others stems from the \"Shrinking Self\" concept, causing dissatisfaction despite external success.", source_id:"chunk-670e795b68d71dbf734feac6e97cfa1f<SEP>chunk-063a5196900a330ccb49599d4025a638<SEP>chunk-676c070f41c08ddde395290878529cf3<SEP>chunk-747dd6f3fc344d596e672f021c5892ee<SEP>chunk-cb8bc4106969c883bf9c7f5bf8e466fc"}}, {start: {_id:642}, end: {_id:643}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"inner conflict,psychological state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The \"Shrinking Self\" is presented as an expression of the broader \"Warring Self\" concept, representing destructive self-behavior.", created_at:1779138959, source_id:"chunk-670e795b68d71dbf734feac6e97cfa1f"}}, {start: {_id:279}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"meditation,mystic meditation,spiritual guidance,transformation", truncate:"", weight:4.0, created_at:1779184065, description:"Alex participates in a mystic meditation with Krishnaji, which leads to his transformation in consciousness.<SEP>Alex?s interaction with Krishnaji during meditation led to dissolving inner disharmony and accessing creativity.`<SEP>Alex's interaction with Krishnaji during a mystic meditation led to his dissolution of self-comparison and inner harmony.", source_id:"chunk-063a5196900a330ccb49599d4025a638<SEP>chunk-747dd6f3fc344d596e672f021c5892ee<SEP>chunk-cb8bc4106969c883bf9c7f5bf8e466fc"}}, {start: {_id:279}, end: {_id:644}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness transformation,spiritual growth", weight:1.0, description:"Alex's participation in the mystic meditation with Krishnaji results in his transformation and access to creative states.", created_at:1779138997, source_id:"chunk-063a5196900a330ccb49599d4025a638"}}, {start: {_id:279}, end: {_id:645}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"dissolution,self-realization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Alex dissolves his inner disharmony through mystic meditation, leading to a state of undivided consciousness and cessation of comparison.", created_at:1779138997, source_id:"chunk-063a5196900a330ccb49599d4025a638"}}, {start: {_id:646}, end: {_id:648}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral manifestation,behavioral outcome,emotional imbalance,emotional state,manifestation,obsession,psychological state,retaliation", weight:5.0, created_at:1779179602, description:"Greg's destructive self manifests as hatred and a mission to harm Alicia post-divorce.<SEP>Greg's post-divorce behavior is driven by his destructive self and hatred.<SEP>Greg's post-divorce behavior is driven by the destructive self, manifesting as obsession with revenge and emotional imbalance.<SEP>Greg?s post-divorce behavior reflects a destructive self, driven by blame and aggression toward Alicia.`", source_id:"chunk-13c1b39086ccfd163efe6f6f872777c0<SEP>chunk-a2bc52698450e6bd9eed995a65131be2<SEP>chunk-747dd6f3fc344d596e672f021c5892ee"}}, {start: {_id:642}, end: {_id:651}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"self-evaluation,social dynamics", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The shrinking self is fueled by comparing oneself to others and perceiving inadequacy.", created_at:1779139016, source_id:"chunk-13c1b39086ccfd163efe6f6f872777c0"}}, {start: {_id:650}, end: {_id:649}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"geographical origin,relationship context", weight:1.0, description:"Alicia and Greg are a couple from Switzerland facing marital issues.", created_at:1779139016, source_id:"chunk-13c1b39086ccfd163efe6f6f872777c0"}}, {start: {_id:642}, end: {_id:652}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional response,psychological impact", weight:1.0, description:"The shrinking self leads to self-consciousness and avoidance of life's joys.", created_at:1779139016, source_id:"chunk-13c1b39086ccfd163efe6f6f872777c0"}}, {start: {_id:647}, end: {_id:648}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"blame,power dynamics,resentment", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Greg blames Alicia for his unhappiness and seeks to make her life difficult as retaliation.<SEP>Greg blames Alicia for his unhappiness and becomes obsessed with retaliating against her post-divorce.", created_at:1779184159, source_id:"chunk-a2bc52698450e6bd9eed995a65131be2<SEP>chunk-813e5d6774fbe0673f530d4b67ec6629"}}, {start: {_id:653}, end: {_id:648}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"behavioral change,emotional impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The divorce triggers Greg's transformation into a more aggressive and vengeful state.", created_at:1779139043, source_id:"chunk-a2bc52698450e6bd9eed995a65131be2"}}, {start: {_id:646}, end: {_id:654}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"behavior,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The destructive self is associated with pent-up anger and aggression, which Greg acts upon after his divorce.", created_at:1779139043, source_id:"chunk-a2bc52698450e6bd9eed995a65131be2"}}, {start: {_id:659}, end: {_id:655}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"inner conflict,self-perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Beth's inner war is driven by her comparison with siblings and parental taunts, leading to the Inert Self's characteristics.", created_at:1779139067, source_id:"chunk-3c5cad218c7d45700a257c9263d28c19"}}, {start: {_id:659}, end: {_id:656}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comparison,personal attribute", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Beth's learning disability causes her to feel inferior to her siblings, fueling her inner war.", created_at:1779139067, source_id:"chunk-3c5cad218c7d45700a257c9263d28c19"}}, {start: {_id:658}, end: {_id:655}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comparison,inner conflict", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Inert Self and Competitive Self are both part of the inner war, driven by the need to dominate others.", created_at:1779139067, source_id:"chunk-3c5cad218c7d45700a257c9263d28c19"}}, {start: {_id:659}, end: {_id:658}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"behavioral influence,comparison", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Beth's comparison with siblings drives her Competitive Self, which contributes to the inner war.", created_at:1779139067, source_id:"chunk-3c5cad218c7d45700a257c9263d28c19"}}, {start: {_id:646}, end: {_id:655}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comparison,inner conflict", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Inert Self and Destructive Self are both part of the inner war, driven by the need to dominate others.", created_at:1779139067, source_id:"chunk-3c5cad218c7d45700a257c9263d28c19"}}] AS row
