itual for consistent use.", created_at:1779139881, source_id:"chunk-7dd83058bb2252e3142fded84652392c"}}, {start: {_id:822}, end: {_id:823}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"collective adoption,self-improvement", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The global community is encouraged to adopt the Four Stages for individual and collective growth.", created_at:1779139882, source_id:"chunk-7dd83058bb2252e3142fded84652392c"}}, {start: {_id:824}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"experience manifestation,spiritual interpretation", weight:1.0, description:"Personal deity is another way universal intelligence is perceived during the process.", created_at:1779139882, source_id:"chunk-7dd83058bb2252e3142fded84652392c"}}, {start: {_id:820}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"personal growth,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The student connects to universal intelligence through the Four Stages.", created_at:1779139882, source_id:"chunk-7dd83058bb2252e3142fded84652392c"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional alignment,manifestation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Gratitude is emphasized as crucial for aligning with universal intelligence to manifest desires.", created_at:1779139882, source_id:"chunk-7dd83058bb2252e3142fded84652392c"}}, {start: {_id:830}, end: {_id:829}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"meditation focus,problem-solving", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The practitioner brings a specific life circumstance into their meditation to seek solutions through universal intelligence.", created_at:1779139925, source_id:"chunk-0f71ee987f163ec7e16a16625977c53b"}}, {start: {_id:830}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"communication,interaction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The practitioner speaks to the presence (universal intelligence) as if it were a being, fostering a connection for problem-solving.", created_at:1779139925, source_id:"chunk-0f71ee987f163ec7e16a16625977c53b"}}, {start: {_id:826}, end: {_id:827}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"awareness,focus area", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Practitioners focus on the heart region to connect with universal intelligence.", created_at:1779139925, source_id:"chunk-0f71ee987f163ec7e16a16625977c53b"}}, {start: {_id:827}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"connection,purpose", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The practice aims to align the practitioner with universal intelligence for problem-solving.", created_at:1779139925, source_id:"chunk-0f71ee987f163ec7e16a16625977c53b"}}, {start: {_id:831}, end: {_id:832}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"attendance,participation,transformation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Julie attended the inaugural Ekam World Peace Festival in August 2018.<SEP>Julie attends the Ekam World Peace Festival, which catalyzes her spiritual transformation and realization.", created_at:1779186361, source_id:"chunk-0e2f9a055fb112218647413f8ddc6ac5<SEP>chunk-d46158568d6d67d2d4fe51b282a138b1"}}] AS row
