onships.", created_at:1779140532, source_id:"chunk-aff6c19ce49adbdf7e2d1f8c08ebd1a9"}}, {start: {_id:911}, end: {_id:914}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional barriers,inhibition,psychological effect,self-protection", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Heartbreak creates barriers to emotional openness in future relationships.<SEP>Heartbreak inhibits vulnerability through self-protection mechanisms.", created_at:1779141867, source_id:"chunk-aff6c19ce49adbdf7e2d1f8c08ebd1a9<SEP>chunk-322c357b48b096d2f7b5c99e2d2d2519"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:920}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"employment,work demands", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO works for the multinational company, which necessitates frequent travel affecting their relationship.", created_at:1779140547, source_id:"chunk-2027d5d29fa51b3271fe7bed35b55798"}}, {start: {_id:924}, end: {_id:923}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"foundational framework,relational sustainability", weight:1.0, description:"Vision provides guidance for overcoming challenges and sustaining the relationship.", created_at:1779140547, source_id:"chunk-2027d5d29fa51b3271fe7bed35b55798"}}, {start: {_id:922}, end: {_id:926}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"limited efficacy,superficial intervention", weight:1.0, description:"Adjusting schedules may temporarily reduce distance but requires deeper alignment for lasting impact.", created_at:1779140547, source_id:"chunk-2027d5d29fa51b3271fe7bed35b55798"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:682}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"distance,impact,relational strain,relationship management", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"CEO's travel creates emotional distance between them, straining the relationship.<SEP>The CEO's travel affects their relationship with their partner.", created_at:1779141920, source_id:"chunk-2027d5d29fa51b3271fe7bed35b55798<SEP>chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94"}}, {start: {_id:925}, end: {_id:923}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"resolution mechanism,wisdom application", weight:1.0, description:"Vision offers tools to dissolve challenges and foster mutual understanding.", created_at:1779140548, source_id:"chunk-2027d5d29fa51b3271fe7bed35b55798"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:922}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"experiential focus,proactive inquiry", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO seeks solutions to address distance challenges in their relationship.", created_at:1779140548, source_id:"chunk-2027d5d29fa51b3271fe7bed35b55798"}}, {start: {_id:929}, end: {_id:543}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"foundation,fragility", truncate:"", weight:3.0, description:"Relationships founded on external factors are fragile and prone to collapse under challenges.<SEP>Relationships founded on external factors are fragile.", created_at:1779141950, source_id:"chunk-507268df0c575c1a1dafc320ed55bb49<SEP>chunk-0abffe0fa33b9e8c05e4d3ce9e08d67e"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:543}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"conceptual foundation,consequences,emotional dynamics,foundation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Relationships based on deep connection are more resilient and meaningful than those based on superficial factors.<SEP>Connection forms the basis of relationships characterized by mutual emotional affectation.", created_at:1779141250, source_id:"chunk-507268df0c575c1a1dafc320ed55bb49<SEP>chunk-c4f9e407e113bf4f292d2bfecfb8c361"}}, {start: {_id:932}, end: {_id:929}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"example,superficiality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Beauty and other external factors are highlighted as superficial bases for relationships.", created_at:1779140566, source_id:"chunk-507268df0c575c1a1dafc320ed55bb49"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:931}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"depth,synonym", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The soul-nourishing beautiful state is synonymous with meaningful connection in relationships.", created_at:1779140566, source_id:"chunk-507268df0c575c1a1dafc320ed55bb49"}}, {start: {_id:928}, end: {_id:543}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"consequence,vulnerability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Fragility in relationships leads to doubt and instability during challenges.", created_at:1779140566, source_id:"chunk-507268df0c575c1a1dafc320ed55bb49"}}, {start: {_id:27}, end: {_id:4}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"source document", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The document is the source of the text, providing context for the discussion on relationships and concepts.", created_at:1779140612, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795"}}, {start: {_id:932}, end: {_id:449}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emptiness,materialism,shallow priorities,superficial foundation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The text describes beauty as a superficial foundation for relationships, leading to unhappiness.<SEP>Prioritizing beauty in relationships creates emptiness when deeper connection is absent.", created_at:1779141975, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-af38aa53fa5d28b5d2a8db0db8864a46"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:449}, end: {_id:930}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"disillusionment,materialism,superficial foundation,transient engagement", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Youth is mentioned as a superficial foundation for relationships, similar to beauty.<SEP>Youth-driven relationships often lead to disillusionment when underlying issues resurface.", created_at:1779141975, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-af38aa53fa5d28b5d2a8db0db8864a46"}}, {start: {_id:449}, end: {_id:933}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"instability,materialism,superficial foundation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Wealth is identified as a superficial foundation for relationships, contributing to unhappiness.<SEP>Focusing on wealth in relationships fosters materialism and instability in emotional bonds.", created_at:1779141975, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-af38aa53fa5d28b5d2a8db0db8864a46"}}, {start: {_id:449}, end: {_id:288}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"materialism,regret,superficial foundation,wasted potential", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Time is listed as a superficial foundation for relationships, leading to dissatisfaction.<SEP>Wasting time in unfulfilling relationships results in regret over missed opportunities for growth.", created_at:1779141975, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-af38aa53fa5d28b5d2a8db0db8864a46"}}, {start: {_id:449}, end: {_id:689}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"consequence,consequences,foundation,superficiality", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Unhappiness is the consequence of relationships based on material foundations like beauty, youth, wealth, or time.<SEP>Relationships based solely on superficial factors like wealth or beauty lead to unhappiness if they don't evolve.", created_at:1779186963, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482"}}, {start: {_id:371}, end: {_id:449}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"motivation,temporary relief", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Loneliness motivates the start of new relationships, but the relief is temporary.", created_at:1779140612, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795"}}, {start: {_id:934}, end: {_id:449}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"fleeting engagement,motivation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Boredom also motivates starting new relationships, but the engagement is fleeting.", created_at:1779140612, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795"}}, {start: {_id:935}, end: {_id:449}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"authenticity,depth,purpose", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Relationships should be entered to share the fullness of being, providing depth and purpose.<SEP>Relationships should aim to share one's complete self rather than merely alleviate unhappiness.", created_at:1779186963, source_id:"chunk-9398fca4f7667d8c5a5db620f32a2795<SEP>chunk-5506ec1bf2947c78c3b169a20af36482"}}, {start: {_id:936}, end: {_id:937}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cause,negative impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Shadows of hurt and staleness lead to separation and division in relationships.", created_at:1779140662, source_id:"chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750"}}, {start: {_id:449}, end: {_id:176}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"clarity,connection,foundation,guidance,impact,joy,mutual growth,resilience,solution,transformation", truncate:"", weight:6.0, description:"Relationships thrive and endure challenges when founded on a shared spiritual vision.<SEP>Spiritual Vision transforms relationships by replacing stress with connection and joy (implied).<SEP>Spiritual vision guides the navigation of relationships.<SEP>Spiritual vision provides a foundation for relationships to endure challenges and maintain mutual inner connection.<SEP>A spiritual vision provides answers and clarity for relationship challenges.<SEP>Spiritual vision is proposed as a solution to transform relationships from stress to joy.", created_at:1779186610, source_id:"chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750<SEP>chunk-25a61dd1a643342f5252980f3c78e37e<SEP>chunk-326ece98f6d256a814a626f5e89cbf94<SEP>chunk-dfd063e448fde077331ddbd4cc16008f<SEP>chunk-3e351e3f449821330f87c8b4e26de0d2<SEP>chunk-f2b2bc609a819ebd2af3969d5612164e"}}, {start: {_id:252}, end: {_id:176}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cooperation,cultural impact,culture", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Spiritual vision creates a culture of cooperation in organizations.<SEP>Spiritual vision fosters a culture of cooperation in organizations by aligning shared inner states.", created_at:1779142058, source_id:"chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750<SEP>chunk-dfd063e448fde077331ddbd4cc16008f"}}, {start: {_id:937}, end: {_id:176}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"absence,cause", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Absence of spiritual vision leads to shadows like hurt and staleness.", created_at:1779140662, source_id:"chunk-a0e255c0fa70cf89d2d5b637599c2750"}}, {start: {_id:939}, end: {_id:943}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"creation,reconstruction,transformation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"First fellow reconstructs bones into a skeleton despite warnings from the second fellow.<SEP>First fellow reconstructs the skeleton from bones using his learning, ignoring warnings.", created_at:1779142106, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a"}}, {start: {_id:938}, end: {_id:942}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"caution,warning,warnings", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Second fellow warns the third fellow not to add flesh and meat to the skeleton.<SEP>Second fellow warns the third fellow about the dangers of adding flesh to the skeleton.", created_at:1779142106, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a"}}, {start: {_id:941}, end: {_id:938}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"caution,warning", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Second fellow warns the fourth fellow not to attempt breathing life into the carcass.", created_at:1779140688, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3"}}, {start: {_id:943}, end: {_id:942}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"creation,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Third fellow adds flesh and meat to the skeleton, transforming it into a lion carcass.", created_at:1779140688, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3"}}, {start: {_id:941}, end: {_id:940}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"animation attempt,attempted resurrection,life-giving,risk", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Fourth fellow attempts to breathe life into the lion carcass, ignoring warnings.<SEP>Fourth fellow tries to breathe life into the lion carcass, prompting the second fellow to seek safety.", created_at:1779142106, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a"}}, {start: {_id:938}, end: {_id:946}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"escapade,survival", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Second fellow climbs the tall tree to escape the potential danger caused by the fourth fellow's actions.", created_at:1779140688, source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3"}}, {start: {_id:939}, end: {_id:938}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"caution,relationship,warning,warnings", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779186426, description:"Second fellow warns the first fellow not to proceed with reconstructing the bones.<SEP>Second fellow warns the first fellow about the risks of reconstructing the skeleton.<SEP>The second fellow warned the first fellow against proceeding without knowledge.", source_id:"chunk-241b0a84182cb7058f0907819d2555a3<SEP>chunk-6e9975c29b6eeab07aa117c06143418a<SEP>chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:949}, end: {_id:948}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"conflict,disruption", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"An awful mood can disrupt an evening with a loved one, leading to conflict.", created_at:1779140708, source_id:"chunk-03b29c0cb578765bf920a3ecd5cb3b97"}}, {start: {_id:949}, end: {_id:506}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"causal link,conflict,emotional state,emotional trigger", weight:3.0, description:"Self-obsession is an emotional state that can be triggered by an awful mood, leading to conflict.<SEP>Self-obsession is often triggered by or leads to an awful mood, which disrupts relationships.<SEP>An awful mood can be a symptom or cause of self-obsession, disrupting connections.", created_at:1779140708, source_id:"chunk-03b29c0cb578765bf920a3ecd5cb3b97"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:900}, end: {_id:950}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"conceptual model,process framework", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Three Stages of Disconnection serves as a framework explaining the mechanisms of disconnection.", created_at:1779140731, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b"}}, {start: {_id:951}, end: {_id:950}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"initial phase,stage progression", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Hurt is the first stage in the Three Stages of Disconnection model.", created_at:1779140731, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b"}}, {start: {_id:952}, end: {_id:951}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"escalation,unresolved progression", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Unaddressed hurt can escalate into emotional obsession as per the stages of disconnection.", created_at:1779140731, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b"}}, {start: {_id:951}, end: {_id:953}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"management technique,mitigation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Passive Attention is applied to hurt to prevent its escalation into deeper disconnection.", created_at:1779140731, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b"}}, {start: {_id:954}, end: {_id:951}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"cognitive shift,mental state transition", weight:1.0, description:"Hurt transitions into Complaint Mode when negative thoughts dominate.", created_at:1779140731, source_id:"chunk-98a858d2ad9db1fe93167a9194441c7b"}}, {start: {_id:951}, end: {_id:598}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"atmosphere,creation of judgment,emotional state,progression", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Hurt progresses to judgment if not addressed, leading to emotional disconnection.<SEP>Hurt creates an atmosphere conducive to judgment and relational disconnection.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:900}, end: {_id:598}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"consequence,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Judgment results in disconnection, where partners stop listening and respect diminishes.", created_at:1779140755, source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88"}}, {start: {_id:598}, end: {_id:956}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"consequence,deterioration,emotional state,loss of respect", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Judgment directly undermines respect in the relationship.<SEP>Judgment leads to loss of respect and relationship deterioration through critical evaluation.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88<SEP>chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:603}, end: {_id:598}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"driver,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Inward comparison fuels judgment by reinforcing perceived superiority.", created_at:1779140755, source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88"}}, {start: {_id:598}, end: {_id:543}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional state,impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Judgment deteriorates the relationship through disconnection and loss of respect.", created_at:1779140755, source_id:"chunk-ab8b9e8deff04b22db3cfe26b8508b88"}}, {start: {_id:957}, end: {_id:961}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"distorted experience,negative perception", weight:1.0, description:"Altered brain chemistry results in negative perception and distorted experience of a partner.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:962}, end: {_id:959}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"condence,loss of self-respect", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Aversion damages self-respect and condence through mutual devaluation.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:960}, end: {_id:956}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"condence,loss of respect", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Insensitive expressions erode respect and condence through hurtful communication.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:598}, end: {_id:959}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"breeding ground,disconnection", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Judgment fosters aversion as a stage of disconnection through persistent negativity.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:958}, end: {_id:598}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comparison,judgmental mindset", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Inward comparison fosters a judgmental mindset and relational dissatisfaction.", created_at:1779140777, source_id:"chunk-10c65a85a540bee33fe950b749066f1f"}}, {start: {_id:951}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional obstruction,relational impact", weight:1.0, description:"Lingering hurt obscures feelings of love and drives destructive relationship patterns.", created_at:1779140814, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511"}}, {start: {_id:963}, end: {_id:965}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional distortion,relational conflict", weight:1.0, description:"Loss of respect distorts experiences and perpetuates a painful state of disconnection.", created_at:1779140814, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511"}}, {start: {_id:496}, end: {_id:901}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional paralysis,hopelessness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Anxiety erodes hope for enduring love, leading to unfulfilling relationships.", created_at:1779140814, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511"}}, {start: {_id:39}, end: {_id:965}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional blockage,lack of energy", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Preoccupation with negativity prevents experiencing joy and gratitude.", created_at:1779140814, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511"}}, {start: {_id:964}, end: {_id:965}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cyclical pattern,temporary relief", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Escapes offer fleeting comfort but reinforce the underlying bitterness.", created_at:1779140814, source_id:"chunk-d52f636ec1e248fba87af843ffd93511"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
