eight:1.0, description:"The man's fear of his footsteps underscores the theme of inescapable reality.", created_at:1779140962, source_id:"chunk-77b30b7416e069e15ef954efa82f97bc"}}, {start: {_id:997}, end: {_id:544}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"escapism,futility", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The man panics and runs to escape his shadow, which remains inescapable.", created_at:1779141001, source_id:"chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a"}}, {start: {_id:945}, end: {_id:999}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"avoidance,dopamine-seeking", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"People engage in behaviors to escape the shadow of staleness and seek instant gratification.", created_at:1779141001, source_id:"chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a"}}, {start: {_id:998}, end: {_id:544}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"inevitable reality,self-destruction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The man's attempts to evade his footsteps lead to exhaustion and death.", created_at:1779141001, source_id:"chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a"}}, {start: {_id:711}, end: {_id:945}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"acceptance,evolution", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Observing the shadow without running from it leads to connection and evolution.", created_at:1779141001, source_id:"chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a"}}, {start: {_id:1000}, end: {_id:945}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"distraction,escapism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"People seek relationships for temporary relief from inner emptiness.", created_at:1779141001, source_id:"chunk-af0668111e68a2bdde4d9e62a04e333a"}}, {start: {_id:506}, end: {_id:1003}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"metaphor,psychological state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Labyrinth of Self-Obsession represents the consequences of habitual self-preoccupation.", created_at:1779141035, source_id:"chunk-afc3d1790998d1869d1a1d8355ec71f3"}}, {start: {_id:496}, end: {_id:1001}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional consumption,symbolism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Minotaur symbolizes being devoured by anxiety and regret.", created_at:1779141035, source_id:"chunk-afc3d1790998d1869d1a1d8355ec71f3"}}, {start: {_id:1004}, end: {_id:1001}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"mythological origin,narrative source", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Minotaur originates from Cretan mythology, providing the foundational story for the metaphor of self-destruction.", created_at:1779141035, source_id:"chunk-afc3d1790998d1869d1a1d8355ec71f3"}}, {start: {_id:1002}, end: {_id:1003}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"entrapment,victims", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Slaves in the labyrinth symbolize individuals trapped by self-obsession and consumed by their own suffering states.", created_at:1779141035, source_id:"chunk-afc3d1790998d1869d1a1d8355ec71f3"}}, {start: {_id:1005}, end: {_id:506}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cause and effect,emotional states", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Self-Obsession results in regret through past-focused reminiscences.", created_at:1779141035, source_id:"chunk-afc3d1790998d1869d1a1d8355ec71f3"}}, {start: {_id:496}, end: {_id:506}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cause and effect,emotional states", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Self-Obsession leads to anxiety through future-focused worries.", created_at:1779141036, source_id:"chunk-afc3d1790998d1869d1a1d8355ec71f3"}}, {start: {_id:951}, end: {_id:1015}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional state,self-obsessiveness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Hurt is a self-obsessive emotional state where focus remains on one's own pain.", created_at:1779141085, source_id:"chunk-fa73522aa96594208b9f43ea66a6493e"}}, {start: {_id:1015}, end: {_id:1009}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional state,self-obsessiveness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Staleness is a self-obsessive state of emotional stagnation and lack of vitality.", created_at:1779141085, source_id:"chunk-fa73522aa96594208b9f43ea66a6493e"}}, {start: {_id:900}, end: {_id:951}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional state,relational impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Hurt leads to disconnection, where the other person is not truly acknowledged.", created_at:1779141085, source_id:"chunk-fa73522aa96594208b9f43ea66a6493e"}}] AS row
