y dynamics", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The author felt the father's love more, balancing the mother's love.", created_at:1779141613, source_id:"chunk-533c11dca17ed148bc0fe09075977a5a"}}, {start: {_id:127}, end: {_id:859}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional connection,family dynamics", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The author felt the sister's feelings and had a complex relationship due to the mother's perceived favoritism.", created_at:1779141613, source_id:"chunk-533c11dca17ed148bc0fe09075977a5a"}}, {start: {_id:127}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"mentorship,significant relationship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The author has a significant relationship with Krishnaji, mentioned alongside the mother, possibly a teacher or mentor.", created_at:1779141613, source_id:"chunk-533c11dca17ed148bc0fe09075977a5a"}}, {start: {_id:17}, end: {_id:352}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional support,nurturing care", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji's care mirrors the mother's nurturing, emphasizing emotional attunement.", created_at:1779141655, source_id:"chunk-c85036006eb9517f84fbb3ee7717030e"}}, {start: {_id:17}, end: {_id:689}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"acceptance,emotional support", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji addresses the narrator's unhappiness without avoidance or judgment.", created_at:1779141655, source_id:"chunk-c85036006eb9517f84fbb3ee7717030e"}}, {start: {_id:39}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional unity,shared celebration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji celebrates the narrator's joy as his own.", created_at:1779141655, source_id:"chunk-c85036006eb9517f84fbb3ee7717030e"}}, {start: {_id:1078}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emotional