UNWIND [{start: {_id:172}, end: {_id:50}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: qJxGtSDiayM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM)", truncate:"", keywords:"awareness,learning experience,meaningful coincidences,spiritual alignment", weight:2.0, description:"Students experience synchronicities as part of their engagement with the program.<SEP>They encounter miraculous synchronicities during their transformation.", created_at:1779407950, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334<SEP>chunk-5df4284d1aa76cb89d7850ba8ee300b9"}}, {start: {_id:1307}, end: {_id:1256}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"alternative methodology,philosophical framework", weight:1.0, description:"The approach redefines wealth creation by emphasizing consciousness over traditional techniques.", created_at:1779143569, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334"}}, {start: {_id:1300}, end: {_id:1308}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"operational foundation,philosophical alignment", weight:1.0, description:"The team is established and operates within the principles of peace and passion.", created_at:1779143569, source_id:"chunk-45384d6e9118a3a6dd41204b27b84334"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:1313}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", truncate:"", keywords:"challenge resolution,crisis management,decision-making,fear influence,leadership,leadership challenge,responsibility", weight:4.0, created_at:1779555464, description:"CEO faced pressure to turn around the company during financial crisis.<SEP>CEO?s fear of board perception and desperation to prove success impact his organizational decisions.<SEP>CEO addresses the company?s challenges through spiritual principles and employee empathy.<SEP>The CEO leads the company and feels responsible for its decisions and employees.", source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5<SEP>chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff<SEP>chunk-5424541c24943ffc408f99bb3aa45c96"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:1312}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"decision-making,ethical reflection", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO's wife prompted the CEO to reflect on his motivations (fear vs. love) for layoffs.", created_at:1779143607, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5"}}, {start: {_id:225}, end: {_id:921}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"education,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO participated in the academy's program to awaken conscious wealth creation.", created_at:1779143607, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5"}}, {start: {_id:1315}, end: {_id:921}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"accountability,organizational pressure", weight:1.0, description:"Board of Directors tasked the CEO with resolving the financial crisis.", created_at:1779143607, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:176}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"guidance,initial phase,self-awareness,spiritual journey", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"CEO began his journey by connecting with spiritual vision for conscious decision-making.<SEP>CEO begins his journey by engaging with the first sacred secret to dissolve suffering.", created_at:1779143672, source_id:"chunk-a265b1960381a51edc693638b99c32b5<SEP>chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:473}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"realization,self-awareness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO recognizes his decisions stem from fear and self-obsession during the second sacred secret.", created_at:1779143672, source_id:"chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:1143}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"action,implementation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO applies the fourth sacred secret to align actions with organizational and employee well-being.", created_at:1779143672, source_id:"chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:852}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"decision influence,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO's fear of board perception affects his decisions.", created_at:1779143673, source_id:"chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff"}}, {start: {_id:1316}, end: {_id:921}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"fear,perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CEO fears how the board will perceive him and feels desperate to prove himself.", created_at:1779143673, source_id:"chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff"}}, {start: {_id:921}, end: {_id:1317}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", keywords:"accountability,collaboration,communication,connection,empathy,retention", truncate:"", weight:4.0, created_at:1779555465, description:"CEO envisions employees' feelings, fostering connection and understanding.<SEP>CEO retained employees through shared vision and cost-saving strategies.`<SEP>The CEO feels empathy for employees' potential suffering and acknowledges accountability.<SEP>The CEO addresses employees", source_id:"chunk-408480fb5c52e78fc73c22c8275b38ff<SEP>chunk-d62b0a2e608fc2a0128294d9e544e3ca<SEP>chunk-5424541c24943ffc408f99bb3aa45c96"}}, {start: {_id:1317}, end: {_id:1318}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"connection,empathy", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"He feels deeply connected to his employees and empathizes with their concerns about job security.", created_at:1779143698, source_id:"chunk-ce77326926352a7c47bb2a49044d5832"}}, {start: {_id:1313}, end: {_id:1318}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"inspiration,leadership,responsibility", truncate:"", weight:3.0, description:"He inspires the company to unite as a family and implement cost-saving measures.<SEP>He felt connected to his employees and held intentions for their abundance, driving the company's success.<SEP>He felt connected to his employees and held intentions for their abundance, driving the company's success.", created_at:1779560262, source_id:"chunk-ce77326926352a7c47bb2a49044d5832<SEP>chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:1313}, end: {_id:1319}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"collaboration,implementation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The company collaborates to reduce costs across all operational levels.", created_at:1779143699, source_id:"chunk-ce77326926352a7c47bb2a49044d5832"}}, {start: {_id:1318}, end: {_id:1143}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"application,principle", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"He follows the principle of spiritual right action to guide his decisions and actions.", created_at:1779143699, source_id:"chunk-ce77326926352a7c47bb2a49044d5832"}}, {start: {_id:1313}, end: {_id:1321}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"adaptability,outcome", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The company?s efforts lead to economic improvement and sustained growth.", created_at:1779143699, source_id:"chunk-ce77326926352a7c47bb2a49044d5832"}}, {start: {_id:1326}, end: {_id:1205}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"disconnection,emotional impact,motivation,obsessive longing", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Kama in the Nobody State leads to desperate longing and obsession with external validation.<SEP>Kama transforms into desperate desire for love in the Nobody State.` - Correct.", created_at:1779187668, source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce"}}, {start: {_id:1324}, end: {_id:1205}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"ambition,conflict,isolation,outcome,spiritual liberation,spiritual motivation", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779187668, description:"Mukti in the Nobody State becomes aggressive and driven by a desire to display knowledge.<SEP>Mukti is a state of liberation that contrasts with the conflict and despair arising from the Nobody State.<SEP>Mukti becomes self-serving spiritual display in the Nobody State.` - Correct.", source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b<SEP>chunk-c300bba2ee34914195fc13be0187277e<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce"}}] AS row
