he electron as both a particle and a wave.", created_at:1779145020, source_id:"chunk-4387dd7058fa0d482c87322707ef132a"}}, {start: {_id:152}, end: {_id:1495}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"energy creation,interpersonal impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness creates an energy field that impacts others, influencing their emotional states.", created_at:1779145020, source_id:"chunk-4387dd7058fa0d482c87322707ef132a"}}, {start: {_id:1493}, end: {_id:1497}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness exploration,transcendental experience", weight:1.0, description:"The Limitless Field serves as a medium for experiencing transcendental and enlightened states of consciousness.", created_at:1779145020, source_id:"chunk-4387dd7058fa0d482c87322707ef132a"}}, {start: {_id:1492}, end: {_id:1498}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"awakening,spiritual growth", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The academy is committed to awakening humanity from suffering into enlightened states.", created_at:1779145020, source_id:"chunk-4387dd7058fa0d482c87322707ef132a"}}, {start: {_id:1495}, end: {_id:1499}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"atmospheric effect,emotional resonance", weight:1.0, description:"The energy field around some people induces feelings of tranquility and joy in others.", created_at:1779145020, source_id:"chunk-4387dd7058fa0d482c87322707ef132a"}}, {start: {_id:1500}, end: {_id:1502}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness awakening,energy interaction,neural impact,neuroplasticity", weight:2.0, description:"The Limitless Field affects seekers' neural structures, altering their consciousness.<SEP>The Limitless Field directly influences neural structures to enable higher consciousness states.", created_at:1779188103, source_id:"chunk-ffbd16a80a3f36425c182278e7bb273d<SEP>chunk-9d5ed1319932eeba02c60354b423c137"}}, {start: {_id:1500}, end: {_id:902}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"biochemical modulation,consciousness awakening,energy resonance,neural impact", weight:2.0, description:"The Limitless Field influences neural chemistry, triggering states of awakening.<SEP>The field interacts with neural chemistry to facilitate transcendental experiences.", created_at:1779188103, source_id:"chunk-ffbd16a80a3f36425c182278e7bb273d<SEP>chunk-9d5ed1319932eeba02c60354b423c137"}}, {start: {_id:1501}, end: {_id:1500}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"metaphysical state,realm of occurrence", weight:1.0, description:"The Limitless Field is a realm where 'happening' occurs as a metaphysical process.", created_at:1779145073, source_id:"chunk-ffbd16a80a3f36425c182278e7bb273d"}}, {start: {_id:1513}, end: {_id:116}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"governance,subatomic principles", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The universe operates through sacred laws that redefine cause-and-effect relationships.", created_at:1779145216, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1"}}, {start: {_id:831}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"active creation,collective action,event focus,peace initiative", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The festival is framed as a platform for actively creating peace rather than passive observation.<SEP>The festival centers on exploring and fostering peace through global participation.", created_at:1779188102, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1<SEP>chunk-caff4fa153aca65c602a6ac671b90d21"}}, {start: {_id:1513}, end: {_id:60}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"philosophical concepts,source material", weight:1.0, description:"The document discusses sacred laws governing the universe and human perception of reality.", created_at:1779145216, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1"}}, {start: {_id:1514}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"political decisions,traditional peacemaking", weight:1.0, description:"Symbolize conventional approaches to peace through political agreements and disarmament.", created_at:1779145216, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1"}}, {start: {_id:1515}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"conflict challenge,political response", weight:1.0, description:"Represents a threat addressed through traditional peacemaking frameworks.", created_at:1779145216, source_id:"chunk-633a38cc8828d75aeb3f3d0beb9cf9b1"}}, {start: {_id:179}, end: {_id:1525}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"manifestation,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Transforming one's inner state can manifest a peaceful external world.", created_at:1779145253, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884"}}, {start: {_id:1521}, end: {_id:1522}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"contributes to,facilitation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation for peace contributes to the world's transition toward peace.", created_at:1779145253, source_id:"chunk-6333458ab425b6d36a113393a04c6884"}}] AS row
