UNWIND [{start: {_id:1598}, end: {_id:1595}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"geographic identity,user background", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Nikhil identifies as being from Maharashtra.", created_at:1779146685, source_id:"chunk-e33cc736eed5cf4e4f8010ad3999f876"}}, {start: {_id:1500}, end: {_id:1594}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Tdb7hBwX88)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18)", keywords:"association,audio confusion,correction,correctness,domain-specific terms,expansion,experience,experiential realization,experiential transformation,involvement,metaphor,misheard words,potential,practice,realization,shared goals,spiritual concept,spiritual concepts,spiritual experience,spiritual practice,spiritual realization,verification", truncate:"", weight:30.0, description:"The Limitless Field, Sadhana relation is a concept within Mukthi Guru's spiritual methods. It establishes the Limitless Field as a foundational principle for the practice of Sadhana, which is a spiritual discipline aimed at growth and transformation. The terms are domain-specific, belonging to a particular field of study or practice, and they are recognized as a core element in this spiritual framework.

However, there is contradictory evidence regarding these terms. The source material does not contain these terms, and they were misheard in the transcript, which may affect accurate interpretation. Despite this, the terms are verified as correct, and multiple descriptions note the association, the contradictory evidence, and the mishearing issue. The mishearing may arise from the transcript, but the terms are still considered valid within the context of the spiritual methods.

Sadhana, as a practice, leads to the experience of the Limitless Field. This experience is integral to spiritual growth and is part of the journey of the practitioner. The relation between the Limitless Field and Sadhana is such that the Limitless Field underpins the practice of Sadhana, providing a foundational principle that guides the spiritual development.

In summary, the Limitless Field, Sadhana relation is a well-established concept within Mukthi Guru's spiritual methods. It is domain-specific, and while there is contradictory evidence due to mishearing in the transcript, the terms are verified as correct. Sadhana leads to the experience of the Limitless Field, which is a key aspect of spiritual growth. The relation is a concept linking the Limitless Field as a foundational principle for the practice of Sadhana.<SEP>Sadhana leads to the experience of the Limitless Field.<SEP>Through Sadhana, practitioners experience the Limitless Field as a profound state of consciousness.<SEP>Sadhana leads to the experience of the Limitless Field.<SEP>Sadhana leads to the experience of the Limitless Field.<SEP>Sadhana leads to the experience of the Limitless Field.<SEP>Sadhana leads to the experience of the Limitless Field.", created_at:1779738789, source_id:"chunk-f67324d19ff78e14e0efe04c0d3d7528<SEP>chunk-ac51506cb9445bfb1beada96d9ea1467<SEP>chunk-69f86e69df447249b089f59f0c3c94bd<SEP>chunk-c5ed482aacca91a8db6e0cb5f1c4556f<SEP>chunk-091caf75406175709621a2d9580df462<SEP>chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625<SEP>chunk-193c5fa66362388f7a23833d6a925623<SEP>chunk-1419df1a4c0030a1506a2922c32dc177<SEP>chunk-c81fe30256308b00385018ff69ab7149<SEP>chunk-53319cc6044d059cf5c7ef51c4ac6f3a<SEP>chunk-713ecff22e536a83f42059c42b73b49f<SEP>chunk-e37c6fd50bd11d63df9a857ed5ce0fed<SEP>chunk-412fc2c20e6720ca976312835e81029c<SEP>chunk-838b7376b1d7204ea371e24df9ff589e<SEP>chunk-c57555a46d14250b46e377974720eca3<SEP>chunk-d80cc7c63932ec6bd8dd408809201611"}}, {start: {_id:1597}, end: {_id:325}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI)", keywords:"app,app feature,practice,practice inclusion", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The app includes the Soul Sync Practice as part of its meditation offerings.<SEP>The app offers the soul sync practice.", created_at:1779146887, source_id:"c