scription:"Yoga Nidra is not a substitute for Sleep, which is a must for everyone.", created_at:1779147724, source_id:"chunk-1685a3c1f2fe3dbf55dfa2a4eee6833c"}}, {start: {_id:1660}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yDTGeNo-w0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"demonstration,guided practice", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube video provides instructions and visual guidance for practicing yoga nidra.", created_at:1779147748, source_id:"chunk-7886f1f557a9b4fb1480f7484e40bb20"}}] AS row
