be Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)", keywords:"behavioral adaptation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Species adjust their behavior based on each other's physiological state through non-verbal cues.", created_at:1779149705, source_id:"chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9"}}, {start: {_id:1811}, end: {_id:1812}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)", keywords:"behavioral adaptation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Species like lions and deer maintain distance based on predation state through non-verbal cues.", created_at:1779149705, source_id:"chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9"}}, {start: {_id:1811}, end: {_id:784}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gQiIwfA3mlk)", keywords:"intercellular communication", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The human body facilitates communication between cells through enzymes and neuropeptides.", created_at:1779149705, source_id:"chunk-b4a15d5573c6e5557a85af4c25bbe3f9"}}] AS row
