n focus,error type,focus area,task component,task focus,task scope", truncate:"", weight:11.0, created_at:1779669555, description:"We need to produce a comprehensive summary of the given entity or relation: \"Fix Transcription Errors\" (the relation name). The description list includes multiple descriptions, all basically saying that the Fix Transcription Errors task includes a focus on homophones and misheard words. There's no conflict. So we need to produce a summary in multiple paragraphs, objective third-person, mention the full name of the entity at the beginning. Must be within 600 tokens.

We need to integrate all key information: The task is about fixing transcription errors, and it includes a focus on homophones and misheard words. It's a correction task that addresses homophones and misheard words as part of error correction. The task specifically addresses homophones and misheard words. Homophones and misheard words are a component of the Fix Transcription Errors task.

