akra signifies physical and emotional balance.", created_at:1779150298, source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047"}}, {start: {_id:1840}, end: {_id:1820}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"chakra alignment,energy flow", weight:1.0, description:"Reaching the heart chakra enables transcendence of egoic cravings and access to universal love.", created_at:1779150298, source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:1842}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"chakra alignment,energy flow", weight:1.0, description:"Crossing the throat chakra leads to self-realization and truth expression.", created_at:1779150298, source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:1841}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"chakra alignment,energy flow", weight:1.0, description:"Full Kundalini awakening at Sahasrara results in enlightenment and cosmic unity.", created_at:1779150298, source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:1843}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"fluctuation,spiritual experience", weight:1.0, description:"Practitioners experience Kundalini fluctuations even after reaching higher chakras.", created_at:1779150298, source_id:"chunk-160859532101196271f783ac5fd9a047"}}, {start: {_id:1847}, end: {_id:1849}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual experience,transcendence", weight:1.0, description:"Kundalini Arohanam leads to consciousness states beyond fear, attachment, and illusion.", created_at:1779150323, source_id:"chunk-07876453d655a08b7a5172a50adb976f"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:1847}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"energy process,spiritual ascent", weight:1.0, description:"Kundalini Arohanam represents the process of Kundalini energy rising to elevate consciousness.", created_at:1779150324, source_id:"chunk-07876453d655a08b7a5172a50adb976f"}}, {start: {_id:1829}, end: {_id:1820}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"awakening,energy vortex,mystical power,mystical powerhouse,spiritual energy", weight:3.0, created_at:1779150910, description:"Meditating at Akam Ketra awakens Kundalini through concentrated universal energy flow.<SEP>Kundalini energy is linked to the mystical powerhouse Akam Ketra.<SEP>Kundalini is associated with the mystical powerhouse Akam Ketra.", source_id:"chunk-07876453d655a08b7a5172a50adb976f<SEP>chunk-8fee4dd509610d97c05752528a7b3d25<SEP>chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:1848}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"enlightenment,spiritual cause", weight:1.0, description:"Kundalini awakening is attributed to divine grace, whether through personal effort or mystical intervention.", created_at:1779150324, source_id:"chunk-07876453d655a08b7a5172a50adb976f"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:1845}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"mystic intervention,spiritual awakening", weight:1.0, description:"Someone with mystic powers can awaken Kundalini in others, as described in the context of divine grace.", created_at:1779150324, source_id:"chunk-07876453d655a08b7a5172a50adb976f"}}, {start: {_id:348}, end: {_id:1851}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"reference,source", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video is directly linked to the provided URL as its source.", created_at:1779150495, source_id:"chunk-b2da194d8278fd090cf383109d705fd4"}}] AS row
