sion,source,source and content,transcription", weight:12.0, created_at:1779736759, description:"(Corrected Text, YouTube Video) is a relation where a YouTube video contains corrected text. The corrected text addresses transcription errors and is part of the video's transcript. It serves as the source of the corrected text, and the video also includes the corrected text with improvements.

The corrected text is presented within the transcript of the YouTube video, providing a version that has been corrected for errors. The inclusion of the corrected text with improvements highlights the video's role in refining the original content. The relationship between the corrected text and the YouTube video is thus one of source and inclusion, with the corrected text being an integral part of the video's transcript.<SEP>The YouTube video also includes the corrected text.<SEP>The corrected text is derived from or related to the content of the YouTube Video.", source_id:"chunk-2125d9971ea376618ed0f9bbc1fe1f8e<SEP>chunk-69a4ec67bd6a54f9121bf1b7c9d15b69<SEP>chunk-b72bbb5cf0b255f790de83b4c2787c2c<SEP>chunk-b7b1fc61be33232fdc568335583f1248<SEP>chunk-2fcfdd09e7882fdd48ac5703861252ac<SEP>chunk-af23c97a05caecd83e01d8ca3302b3a0"}}, {start: {_id:1791}, end: {_id:1852}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", keywords:"concept,thematic element", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Corrected Text integrates the concept of \"divine grace\" as a key thematic component.", created_at:1779150861, source_id:"chunk-2125d9971ea376618ed0f9bbc1fe1f8e"}}, {start: {_id:1871}, end: {_id:1791}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", keywords:"instruction,method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Corrected Text prescribes the method of closing eyes as part of its instructions.", created_at:1779150861, source_id:"chunk-2125d9971ea376618ed0f9bbc1fe1f8e"}}, {start: {_id:1791}, end: {_id:1703}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual concept,thematic element", weight:1.0, description:"The Corrected Text emphasizes the concept of \"Power\" as a key thematic element, linking it to divine grace and spiritual awakening.", created_at:1779150861, source_id:"chunk-2125d9971ea376618ed0f9bbc1fe1f8e"}}, {start: {_id:1831}, end: {_id:1852}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"mantra,meaning", weight:1.0, description:"The mantra \"Akam Mantra Hamsa Soham Ekam\" is associated with divine grace.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:1875}, end: {_id:1872}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"mystical powerhouse,spiritual energy", weight:6.0, description:"The divine is experienced in both the self and the mystical powerhouse Akam Ketra.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:1852}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine,grace", weight:1.0, description:"The concept of the divine is linked to divine grace.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:1873}, end: {_id:1872}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine,self", weight:6.0, description:"The divine in the mystical powerhouse is connected to the divine within the self.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:1872}, end: {_id:1874}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine,unity", weight:6.0, description:"The divine in the mystical powerhouse contributes to the idea of being one.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:1873}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine,self", weight:6.0, description:"The divine is present within the self.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:1874}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UrVvSqKYU8c)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine,unity", weight:6.0, description:"The divine is connected to the concept of unity.", created_at:1779150910, source_id:"chunk-dd1dc8cc2e72a766ab8873bdc25d460b"}}] AS row
