vocation,wisdom", weight:1.0, description:"Tapatis ask the Divine to reveal wisdom through their creations.", created_at:1779152202, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c"}}, {start: {_id:1902}, end: {_id:1903}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"creation contrast,natural vs. crafted", weight:1.0, description:"Swayambhu sculptures are contrasted with those sculpted by Tapatis in altered states.", created_at:1779152202, source_id:"chunk-57864d60b80729cde10883d1f7eb863c"}}, {start: {_id:1907}, end: {_id:1911}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", keywords:"artistic creation,carving", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The sculptor carves the Mola Viran, which is the central deity of the temple.", created_at:1779152224, source_id:"chunk-1d93dc520a0588d5566528e75d99011c"}}, {start: {_id:1913}, end: {_id:1910}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"revelation,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"During periods of Tapas, the Divine form is revealed to the devotees.", created_at:1779152224, source_id:"chunk-1d93dc520a0588d5566528e75d99011c"}}, {start: {_id:1907}, end: {_id:1914}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"association,deity,deity association,temple deity", weight:2.0, description:"Mola Viran is the central deity of the temple.<SEP>Mola Viran is the central deity of the temple.", created_at:1779152490, source_id:"chunk-1d93dc520a0588d5566528e75d99011c<SEP>chunk-16d47febfdf4ea34c291088fcb018b9f"}}, {start: {_id:1915}, end: {_id:1916}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"geographical association,religious significance", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam Shetna is a location contextually linked to Sri Balaji's legacy or presence.", created_at:1779152248, source_id:"chunk-9b565339d56c09f532ad6cd52561f8d6"}}, {start: {_id:1921}, end: {_id:1919}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"mythological concept,synonym", weight:1.0, description:"Vasudha is identified as another name for the earth goddess in the narrative.", created_at:1779152248, source_id:"chunk-9b565339d56c09f532ad6cd52561f8d6"}}, {start: {_id:1926}, end: {_id:1928}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"personification,symbolic representation", weight:1.0, description:"The earth goddess is a personification of the creation of the earth goddess, reflecting the interconnectedness of all elements.` The keywords `personification, symbolic representation` are a bit generic. The relationship is more about `personification` and `interconnectedness`. The description is also a bit long. I'll refine it.", created_at:1779152279, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b"}}, {start: {_id:1925}, end: {_id:1929}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine unity,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Sri Devi and Bhudevi are described as interconnected aspects of one divine being, emphasizing their unified nature.", created_at:1779152279, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b"}}, {start: {_id:1927}, end: {_id:1926}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oUCZWSi8zY4)", truncate:"", keywords:"contribution,ecological harmony", weight:1.0, description:"The beetle contributes to the thriving of the rest of creation, reflecting interconnectedness.", created_at:1779152279, source_id:"chunk-9af6dcfed78cd2bcf20d318f9bbc704b"}}] AS row
