urya Bhagavan.", created_at:1779156379, source_id:"chunk-5989534d0189dcec707f34732672dbfe"}}, {start: {_id:2139}, end: {_id:2131}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H_uhawaiO3E)", truncate:"", keywords:"religious practice,reverence", weight:1.0, description:"The Sun is revered in Hinduism, leading to the practice of Surya Namaskar.", created_at:1779156379, source_id:"chunk-5989534d0189dcec707f34732672dbfe"}}, {start: {_id:2139}, end: {_id:2141}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H_uhawaiO3E)", truncate:"", keywords:"religious practice,worship", weight:1.0, description:"Surya Namaskar is performed in reverence to the Sun, considered a central figure in the practice.", created_at:1779156380, source_id:"chunk-5989534d0189dcec707f34732672dbfe"}}, {start: {_id:2150}, end: {_id:2152}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"capitalization,spelling correction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"the atheist and the theist was corrected from \"Meditate\" to \"Meditate\".", created_at:1779157579, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff"}}, {start: {_id:1618}, end: {_id:2151}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"domain-specific,spiritual terms", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"amsa Soham Ekam and Namaste are both spiritual terms discussed in the original text.", created_at:1779157579, source_id:"chunk-a99aa5a4f135b2ba27bcd48a814698ff"}}] AS row
