ht:1.0, description:"The next stage builds on the youth course, offering deeper insights and clarity.", created_at:1779158824, source_id:"chunk-f02bf32393ef9705110f96bbc12d8064"}}, {start: {_id:2189}, end: {_id:2183}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine connection,self-realization", weight:1.0, description:"During meditation, the student achieved a state of divine communion leading to self-realization.", created_at:1779158824, source_id:"chunk-f02bf32393ef9705110f96bbc12d8064"}}, {start: {_id:2183}, end: {_id:2186}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", keywords:"career alignment,passion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The student discovered his passion for creating a difference through Swadharma.", created_at:1779158824, source_id:"chunk-f02bf32393ef9705110f96bbc12d8064"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:2183}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", keywords:"guidance,synchronicities", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The student felt guided by the Divine through synchronicities and breakthroughs in his journey.", created_at:1779158824, source_id:"chunk-f02bf32393ef9705110f96bbc12d8064"}}, {start: {_id:2196}, end: {_id:2186}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", truncate:"", keywords:"causal relationship,societal impact", weight:1.0, description:"Living Swadharma is presented as the catalyst for social, political, cultural, and environmental changes.", created_at:1779158887, source_id:"chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43"}}, {start: {_id:2197}, end: {_id:2188}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", truncate:"", keywords:"agency,capacity", weight:1.0, description:"Young people are framed as the primary agents capable of creating revolutions through their alignment with Swadharma.", created_at:1779158887, source_id:"chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43"}}, {start: {_id:2182}, end: {_id:1782}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", truncate:"", keywords:"collaboration,shared purpose", weight:1.0, description:"Speaker and Pritha Ji collaborate to awaken young people to their Swadharma, aiming to drive societal revolutions.", created_at:1779158887, source_id:"chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43"}}, {start: {_id:2195}, end: {_id:2196}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", truncate:"", keywords:"causal relationship,societal impact", weight:5.0, description:"Inner change is the key to creating external societal changes.\" But in the actual output provided, the line ends with \"cultural, environmental change and environmental change.\" Wait, no, looking back, the user's previous output had a line that was cut off. Let me check again.<SEP>Inner change is the key to creating external societal changes.", created_at:1779158887, source_id:"chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:1782}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Qu5IQo0ghbs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qu5IQo0ghbs)<SEP>YouTube Video: PnvNqgTyIFI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PnvNqgTyIFI)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine experience,guidance,spiritual connection,strengthened relationship,support", weight:3.0, created_at:1779524442, description:"The Divine provides synchronicities and breakthroughs to support the Speaker in their journey toward fulfilling Swadharma.<SEP>Speaker's relationship with the Divine was strengthened through the program.<SEP>Speaker connects with the divine through the program.", source_id:"chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43<SEP>chunk-79727c38a2ca8d63adfca02ee83cd218<SEP>chunk-eff8e4dcfe33dc3f019672706583990a"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:2182}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q4QyNologtw)", truncate:"", keywords:"guidance,support", weight:1.0, created_at:1779158887, description:"The Divine provides synchronic", source_id:"chunk-59bce4ff1aeb155c803871a79e22ee43"}}, {start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:2204}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"conflict,struggle", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings struggle to achieve peaceful coexistence despite common sense suggesting it should be easy.", created_at:1779159732, source_id:"chunk-2ae4b864385ed057e1ee77b088927e7e"}}, {start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:2206}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotion,hurt", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings are often wounded and hurt by their experiences with parents, school, and society.", created_at:1779159732, source_id:"chunk-2ae4b864385ed057e1ee77b088927e7e"}}, {start: {_id:2203}, end: {_id:2204}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"implying,suggesting", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Common sense suggests that peaceful coexistence should be easy for people to achieve.", created_at:1779159732, source_id:"chunk-2ae4b864385ed057e1ee77b088927e7e"}}, {start: {_id:2205}, end: {_id:2204}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"conflict,misunderstanding", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Parents, children, couples, and the elderly often misunderstand each other, leading to conflict.", created_at:1779159732, source_id:"chunk-2ae4b864385ed057e1ee77b088927e7e"}}, {start: {_id:2205}, end: {_id:2206}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotion,hurt", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"These groups can be wounded by their interactions with parents, school, and society.", created_at:1779159732, source_id:"chunk-2ae4b864385ed057e1ee77b088927e7e"}}, {start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:2208}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"metaphor,psychological impact", weight:1.0, description:"The Tenali Rama's cat metaphor illustrates how past emotional wounds (like the cat's burns) lead humans to avoid vulnerability and maintain emotional distance in relationships.", created_at:1779159821, source_id:"chunk-424814fd291a86ed2102f986fe2ec536"}}] AS row
