UNWIND [{start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:2210}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional wounds,intergenerational conflict", weight:1.0, description:"Parents and children argue incessantly due to inherited emotional scars from upbringing and societal pressures.", created_at:1779159821, source_id:"chunk-424814fd291a86ed2102f986fe2ec536"}}, {start: {_id:2209}, end: {_id:2208}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"metaphor,psychological symbolism", weight:1.0, description:"Tenali Rama's cat metaphor illustrates how past emotional trauma (like the cat's burned tongue) leads humans to avoid vulnerability in relationships.", created_at:1779159821, source_id:"chunk-424814fd291a86ed2102f986fe2ec536"}}, {start: {_id:2211}, end: {_id:2207}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"fear of intimacy,relational conflict", weight:1.0, description:"Couples misunderstand each other easily due to fear of emotional exposure and unresolved past hurts.", created_at:1779159821, source_id:"chunk-424814fd291a86ed2102f986fe2ec536"}}, {start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:2212}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"generational disconnect,social intolerance", weight:1.0, description:"Humans struggle to tolerate the elderly, reflecting societal impatience with aging and vulnerability.", created_at:1779159821, source_id:"chunk-424814fd291a86ed2102f986fe2ec536"}}, {start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:178}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective trauma,systemic pressure", weight:1.0, description:"Society perpetuates emotional wounds through systemic expectations and societal norms that strain human connections.", created_at:1779159821, source_id:"chunk-424814fd291a86ed2102f986fe2ec536"}}, {start: {_id:2214}, end: {_id:2213}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"karmic continuity,psychological legacy", weight:1.0, description:"Samskara perpetuates wounds across lifetimes, requiring conscious resolution.", created_at:1779159843, source_id:"chunk-d418467c48468e14dfc470272f04b0d2"}}, {start: {_id:852}, end: {_id:371}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional drivers,psychological tension", weight:1.0, description:"Loneliness is rooted in fear of intimacy and potential emotional harm, creating a cycle of isolation.", created_at:1779159843, source_id:"chunk-d418467c48468e14dfc470272f04b0d2"}}, {start: {_id:533}, end: {_id:479}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,mutual recognition,therapeutic mechanism,transformative outcomes", weight:2.0, description:"Compassion enables healing by fostering understanding of shared wounds between individuals.<SEP>Compassion drives healing by addressing the root causes of emotional distress through presence and empathy.", created_at:1779159861, source_id:"chunk-d418467c48468e14dfc470272f04b0d2<SEP>chunk-8c0f80d81b49972daf18e0b85888c919"}}, {start: {_id:852}, end: {_id:2213}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", keywords:"causation,vulnerability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Fear of being wounded drives self-protective behaviors that deepen emotional wounds.", created_at:1779159843, source_id:"chunk-d418467c48468e14dfc470272f04b0d2"}}, {start: {_id:533}, end: {_id:2213}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional resolution,transcendence", weight:1.0, description:"Compassion addresses wounds by dissolving barriers between self and others through empathy.", created_at:1779159843, source_id:"chunk-d418467c48468e14dfc470272f04b0d2"}}, {start: {_id:2217}, end: {_id:284}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional response,underlying need", weight:1.0, description:"Anger outbursts often mask a deeper need for connection and compassionate understanding.", created_at:1779159860, source_id:"chunk-8c0f80d81b49972daf18e0b85888c919"}}, {start: {_id:533}, end: {_id:2215}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", keywords:"emotional support,healing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Compassionate listening creates a space for healing by prioritizing emotional understanding over problem-solving.", created_at:1779159860, source_id:"chunk-8c0f80d81b49972daf18e0b85888c919"}}, {start: {_id:479}, end: {_id:2215}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwMlR98BgrI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional restoration,mutual recovery", weight:1.0, description:"Acts of listening with compassion lead to mutual healing between parties involved.", created_at:1779159861, source_id:"chunk-8c0f80d81b49972daf18e0b85888c919"}}, {start: {_id:2220}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UZHSssZflFQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness states,philosophical insight", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji's teachings about human states (suffering/beauty) provide a framework for understanding Chit Shakti.", created_at:1779162052, source_id:"chunk-47ff0b70c2d73a9b2c6fbe556ff0baf0"}}, {start: {_id:1707}, end: {_id:2220}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UZHSssZflFQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"historical terminology,philosophical contribution", weight:1.0, description:"The ancients in India referred to consciousness as 'Chit', establishing the foundation for understanding Chit Shakti.", created_at:1779162052, source_id:"chunk-47ff0b70c2d73a9b2c6fbe556ff0baf0"}}, {start: {_id:1620}, end: {_id:2096}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM)", truncate:"", keywords:"professional expertise,request,role assignment,service provision", weight:2.0, description:"User requests the Text Correction Expert to perform text corrections for Mukthi Guru.<SEP>User is identified as a Text Correction Expert responsible for correcting the placeholder.", created_at:1779736695, source_id:"chunk-84358136db251c6d375ca0289d434e7c<SEP>chunk-f084c6d7a5e282477927a0fb44b0776a"}}, {start: {_id:2225}, end: {_id:2222}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"connection,duty", weight:1.0, description:"Sacredness arises from deep connection rather than merely engaging in acts like a duty.", created_at:1779164342, source_id:"chunk-2d3e2b583a33b1dd3f28054d2d3f1c75"}}, {start: {_id:1694}, end: {_id:2224}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"hunger,practice", weight:2.0, description:"The digestive fire signals hunger, which is part of eating with sacredness in ancient Indian practices.<SEP>The digestive fire's signal of hunger is integral to the practice of eating with sacredness.", created_at:1779164342, source_id:"chunk-2d3e2b583a33b1dd3f28054d2d3f1c75"}}, {start: {_id:186}, end: {_id:2222}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"fulfillment,irreplaceability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sacredness arises when one's career is seen as irreplaceable, leading to fulfillment.", created_at:1779164342, source_id:"chunk-2d3e2b583a33b1dd3f28054d2d3f1c75"}}, {start: {_id:2223}, end: {_id:2224}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"hunger,temptation", weight:1.0, description:"Ancient Indians practiced eating only when hungry, not when tempted, as part of sacredness.", created_at:1779164342, source_id:"chunk-2d3e2b583a33b1dd3f28054d2d3f1c75"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:2235}, end: {_id:2238}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"community,sacredness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"A portion of food is offered to ants on Earth as part of the ritual practice.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed"}}, {start: {_id:2227}, end: {_id:2240}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"breath observation,energy alignment", weight:1.0, description:"The method involves checking if breath flows through the right nostril to determine solar energy dominance.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:2239}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"gratitude,ritual", weight:1.0, description:"The group offers thanks to Mother Earth for providing food as part of their ritual.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed"}}, {start: {_id:2227}, end: {_id:2241}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"breath observation,energy alignment", weight:1.0, description:"The method involves checking if breath flows through the left nostril to determine lunar energy dominance.", created_at:1779164373, source_id:"chunk-c98aacc6975e21e9a0248293d5e305ed"}}, {start: {_id:2174}, end: {_id:786}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"connection,spiritual presence", weight:1.0, description:"Antaryamin is present in the heart, symbolizing the connection to the Divine and universal awareness.", created_at:1779164399, source_id:"chunk-f0844ae59861d6cd8c7dc29c46407869"}}, {start: {_id:2235}, end: {_id:1071}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"connection,sacredness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ants are connected to the Earth and all life forms, experiencing sacredness in their actions.", created_at:1779164399, source_id:"chunk-f0844ae59861d6cd8c7dc29c46407869"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:739}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"blessing,spiritual connection", weight:1.0, description:"The Divine is invoked to bless and guide the speaker to embrace the sacredness of family bonds.", created_at:1779164413, source_id:"chunk-92612cb49d206542f94c805b305ba93b"}}, {start: {_id:2246}, end: {_id:2244}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"redundancy,terminology", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The text questions the use of \"pranic veins\" as redundant terminology compared to \"nadis.\"", created_at:1779164441, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc"}}, {start: {_id:2247}, end: {_id:2245}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"repetition,stylistic concern", weight:1.0, description:"The term \"mechanistic\" is used twice, once in \"mechanistic chores,\" which might be repetitive.", created_at:1779164441, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc"}}, {start: {_id:2248}, end: {_id:2222}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"repetition,stylistic concern", weight:1.0, description:"Sacredness is used multiple times, raising concerns about repetition.", created_at:1779164441, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc"}}, {start: {_id:2243}, end: {_id:2248}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"repetition,stylistic concern", weight:1.0, description:"Irreplaceable is used multiple times, potentially causing redundancy.", created_at:1779164441, source_id:"chunk-4b05cbf5e82fc65ca8624163a8734ebc"}}, {start: {_id:2254}, end: {_id:2252}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"modification,style", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Sacredness is associated with the act of eating in a reverent manner.><SEP>Sacredness is associated with the act of eating in a reverent manner.", created_at:1779164472, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a"}}, {start: {_id:2251}, end: {_id:2255}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"correction,terminology", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Pranic veins is suggested to be corrected to pranic channels to avoid mixing concepts.>", created_at:1779164472, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a"}}, {start: {_id:161}, end: {_id:2116}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"investor sentiment,market performance", weight:18.0, created_at:1779748002, description:"The Global Tech Index, Market Selloff relation describes the observed decline in the Global Tech Index, which is part of a broader market selloff driven by investor concerns. Multiple sources consistently report that the decline is not an isolated phenomenon but a component of a larger market selloff. The decline is attributed to investor concerns, prompting a selloff across the market. The consistency of the description underscores the significance of the decline and its connection to the broader market selloff. The Global Tech Index, Market Selloff thus reflects a systemic response to investor sentiment, leading to a coordinated reduction in market valuations. The Global Tech Index's decline, including a 3.4<SEP>The Global Tech Index's decline is part of the broader market selloff driven by investor concerns over interest rates and regulations.<SEP>The decline in the Global Tech Index is part of the broader market selloff driven by investor concerns.`", source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a<SEP>chunk-db92dc43fde6d9177bd2c4457cc76052<SEP>chunk-669447c66f2bd3f92a489ebe05f68fcb<SEP>chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-7248fb4a5efc0d07c14a1dfefd59324e<SEP>chunk-c6fa90e159adddf741412043b38e2756<SEP>chunk-a0501780b62546f91638cd76288d70a0<SEP>chunk-d1911383179e65a76d16c03a5d5707f5<SEP>chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-4dea19a1ca3602539d80b6f5c46066c4<SEP>chunk-5c68b9015fbb59203618736e8841a1fe<SEP>chunk-1e7e55f43ce6e8842a2479ee424af0b9<SEP>chunk-059ace20f2db1cc39262846db5c238d9"}}, {start: {_id:2256}, end: {_id:2255}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"correction,terminology", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Pranic veins is suggested to be corrected to nadis as a more accurate term.>", created_at:1779164472, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a"}}, {start: {_id:2251}, end: {_id:2253}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"energy flow,physiological", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Vital energy is described as flowing through pranic channels.><SEP>Vital energy is described as flowing through pranic channels.", created_at:1779164472, source_id:"chunk-148a826f3cd503f56065e7c6190d8d8a"}}, {start: {_id:2256}, end: {_id:2253}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube