UNWIND [{start: {_id:2261}, end: {_id:2260}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"composition,contrast,negation,routine", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Mechanical chores are part of daily life, characterized by routine tasks.<SEP>Daily life acts are explicitly contrasted with mechanical chores driven by survival.", created_at:1779164720, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a<SEP>chunk-599e9e03a48987549ae86e0c6effc7bb"}}, {start: {_id:2259}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"analysis,content", weight:1.0, description:"The video discusses and analyzes examples of clunky phrasing in text.", created_at:1779164661, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a"}}, {start: {_id:2259}, end: {_id:2263}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"application,editing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Rephrase is applied to clunky phrasing to improve text quality.", created_at:1779164661, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a"}}, {start: {_id:2259}, end: {_id:2262}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"application,editing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Remove is applied to clunky phrasing to eliminate unnecessary elements.", created_at:1779164661, source_id:"chunk-76be76054b3c649cdbd51006f4aee61a"}}, {start: {_id:2269}, end: {_id:2260}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"classification,description", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Acts of daily life are explicitly classified as mechanical chores in the text.", created_at:1779164680, source_id:"chunk-b8fe06323eb7bb1ed460d4a5226c84d8"}}, {start: {_id:2260}, end: {_id:1064}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"causation,cause,motivation", weight:2.0, description:"Mechanical chores are directly linked to survival as the driving force in the statement.<SEP>Mechanical chores are framed as being driven by survival imperatives.", created_at:1779164721, source_id:"chunk-b8fe06323eb7bb1ed460d4a5226c84d8<SEP>chunk-599e9e03a48987549ae86e0c6effc7bb"}}, {start: {_id:2270}, end: {_id:2271}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"contrast,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"daily life is contrasted with mechanical chores driven by survival, suggesting a shift from mundane routines to more meaningful actions.", created_at:1779164702, source_id:"chunk-3fb873ea88668af5350dcd5df2b7ca3a"}}, {start: {_id:2097}, end: {_id:1620}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: uZg9XnRub7w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uZg9XnRub7w)<SEP>YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)<SEP>YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZaZOJ6gazYM)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction,correction area,correction focus,correction task,error correction,focus,focus area,linguistic accuracy,method,misheard words,task,task focus", weight:17.0, description:"---Role---
You are a Knowledge Graph Specialist, proficient in data curation and synthesis.

---Task---
Your task is to synthesize a list of descriptions of a given entity or relation into a single, comprehensive, and cohesive summary.

---Instructions---
1. Input Format: The description list is provided in JSON format. Each JSON object (representing a single description) appears on a new line within the `Description List` section.
2. Output Format: The merged description will be returned as plain text, presented in multiple paragraphs, without any additional formatting or extraneous comments before or after the summary.
3. Comprehensiveness: The summary must integrate all key information from *every* provided description. Do not omit any important facts or details.
4. Context: Ensure the summary is written from an objective, third-person perspective; explicitly mention the name of the entity or relation for full clarity and context.
5. Context & Objectivity:
  - Write the summary from an objective, third-person perspective.
  - Explicitly mention the full name of the entity or relation at the beginning of the summary to ensure immediate clarity and context.
6. Conflict Handling:
  - In cases of conflicting or inconsistent descriptions, first determine if these conflicts arise from multiple, distinct entities or relationships that share the same name.
  - If distinct entities/relations are identified, summarize each one *separately* within the overall output.
  - If conflicts within a single entity/relation (e.g., historical discrepancies) exist, attempt to reconcile them or present both viewpoints with noted uncertainty.
7. Length Constraint:The summary's total length must not exceed 600 tokens, while still maintaining depth and completeness.
8. Language: The entire output must be written in English. Proper nouns (e.g., personal names, place names, organization names) may in their original language if proper translation is not available or would cause ambiguity.
  - The entire output must be written in English.
  - Proper nouns (e.g., personal names, place names, organization names) should be retained in their original language if a proper, widely accepted translation is not available or would cause ambiguity.

---Input---
Relation Name: (Homophones, Text Correction Expert)

Description List:<SEP>The Text Correction Expert is responsible for correcting homophones in the provided text.<SEP>The Text Correction Expert is responsible for correcting homophones in the provided text.<SEP>The Text Correction Expert focuses on correcting homophones.<SEP>Text Correction Expert focuses on correcting homophones.", created_at:1779747747, source_id:"chunk-5865b59d14dd8decb50b71027b168cc8<SEP>chunk-20a2b70c2ce296088175b9c0d1f3ee20<SEP>chunk-f1b80dca74bf6e05c17db254a9158b6f<SEP>chunk-3da16f4292642f8022ca187ac2cb1ede<SEP>chunk-bacc2ffaedbff707e04bb4dfd088672b<SEP>chunk-401f6e4a8020f9da8c11540192c40ac3<SEP>chunk-84f1e964c19dfa7ddd366fc06d563704<SEP>chunk-3718c86a25fb0b5558d0d13c8bf954d4<SEP>chunk-e13cee4b31e3d4e7b5efa06dc673f65d<SEP>chunk-6052761888817e6a639d7d02535dd8c5"}}, {start: {_id:2272}, end: {_id:1620}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction task,focus area", weight:1.0, description:"The expert addresses domain-specific spiritual terms to maintain content integrity.", created_at:1779164774, source_id:"chunk-5865b59d14dd8decb50b71027b168cc8"}}, {start: {_id:2273}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"content hosting,source", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube video hosts the spiritual message content.", created_at:1779164900, source_id:"chunk-28d2d5c18afc1fb40fd31cf708261f0e"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:2273}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"blessing,spiritual concept", weight:1.0, description:"The message emphasizes the Divine's role in blessing and guiding the listener.", created_at:1779164900, source_id:"chunk-28d2d5c18afc1fb40fd31cf708261f0e"}}, {start: {_id:2176}, end: {_id:2273}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"chanting,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"The message encourages chanting the Ekam Mantra for spiritual connection.", created_at:1779164900, source_id:"chunk-28d2d5c18afc1fb40fd31cf708261f0e"}}, {start: {_id:2173}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual focus,repetition,spiritual theme", weight:2.0, description:"The video repeatedly uses \"The Divine\" as a spiritual affirmation.<SEP>The Divine is a recurring spiritual concept in the video, emphasized in blessings and unity messages.", created_at:1779165165, source_id:"chunk-75c783fcdd09bf8a8394a04be5197385<SEP>chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0"}}, {start: {_id:2278}, end: {_id:2275}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,intent", weight:1.0, description:"The text reflects the spiritual message \"We are one\" but uses repetitive phrasing that may obscure its intent.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}, {start: {_id:2280}, end: {_id:2279}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"adherence,rules", weight:1.0, description:"Transcription rules prioritize fixing errors over stylistic adjustments, leading to retention of repetition.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}, {start: {_id:2283}, end: {_id:2273}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"clarity,obstruction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The awkward transition between phrases hinders the clear conveyance of the central message.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}, {start: {_id:2248}, end: {_id:2282}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"context,stylistic choice", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Repetition is interpreted as intentional in a spiritual context, contrasting with perceived errors.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}, {start: {_id:2285}, end: {_id:2284}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"guidelines,instructions", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The prompt outlines the rules governing text correction, directly linking to the established guidelines for error correction.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}, {start: {_id:2276}, end: {_id:2275}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"ambiguity,analysis", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The absence of clear errors complicates the decision to retain or alter the text's repetition.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}, {start: {_id:2281}, end: {_id:2275}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", keywords:"intent,misalignment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The text's repetition creates misalignment between its structure and the intended philosophical point.", created_at:1779165060, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d"}}] AS row
