UNWIND [{start: {_id:2275}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: owC8E_G2fY4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owC8E_G2fY4)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,content hosting,content source,source,task context,textual analysis", weight:4.0, description:"The YouTube video serves as the source of the analyzed text, containing the spiritual message under discussion.<SEP>The YouTube video serves as the source material for the text being analyzed.<SEP>The YouTube Video contains the text to be processed for transcription error correction tasks.<SEP>The YouTube video contains and contextualizes the analyzed text through its transcript.", created_at:1779672499, source_id:"chunk-be9c73e40b66848f42c3e9def2b9ea2d<SEP>chunk-d489685c096e08c1d7c865c1d88afb77<SEP>chunk-365597a058331421bbb5ea9019f3c055<SEP>chunk-6bac58b45209f5eef8b575ac021bf0a9"}}, {start: {_id:2288}, end: {_id:2287}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction,flawed representation", weight:1.0, description:"The garbled text attempts to convey \"We are one\" but includes non-sequitur elements and repetition.", created_at:1779165121, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be"}}, {start: {_id:2288}, end: {_id:2289}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"error removal,simplification", weight:1.0, description:"The user seeks to remove structural errors (e.g., \"a Divine\" repetition) to simplify the text.", created_at:1779165121, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be"}}, {start: {_id:2288}, end: {_id:2286}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"redundancy,textual inconsistency", weight:1.0, description:"The garbled text contains repetitive and nonsensical phrases like \"a Divine\" disrupting the message.", created_at:1779165121, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:2288}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"non-sequitur,textual inconsistency", weight:1.0, description:"The garbled text includes the phrase \"a Divine, a Divine...\" which is a non-sequitur disrupting the intended message.", created_at:1779165121, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be"}}, {start: {_id:2288}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1w-IStuMl3M)", truncate:"", keywords:"content component,content origin,source,textual error", weight:2.0, description:"The garbled text is derived from the YouTube video with the specified URL.<SEP>The garbled text is part of the video's content and identified as an error.", created_at:1779261730, source_id:"chunk-40a8fc219306f641b3d601cff04d44be<SEP>chunk-609eba9953b128ee5842ae83faafcdb9"}}, {start: {_id:2292}, end: {_id:2291}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"contextual conflict,logical inconsistency", weight:1.0, description:"The phrase \"And a Divine...\" conflicts with the repetitive \"We are one\" as a logical inconsistency.", created_at:1779165139, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab"}}, {start: {_id:1883}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"analysis focus,content analysis,content correction,content errors,corrections,data accuracy,error context,error identification,source content", weight:8.0, description:"The relation between transcription errors and a YouTube video (Transcription Errors, YouTube Video) involves a YouTube video that contains transcription errors requiring correction. The errors are of various types, including homophones and grammatical issues.

The YouTube video serves as source material for identifying and correcting transcription errors in its audio content. Additionally, the YouTube video includes corrections for transcription errors in the transcript. Overall, the relation highlights the presence of transcription errors in the video's transcript and the need for correction, with the video acting as a reference for fixing those errors.", created_at:1779703075, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab<SEP>chunk-782fc68234c609b298ab73b8f6469f59<SEP>chunk-4f6d5a893b481dedd63e56f8affd44e3<SEP>chunk-5e8844a4f8874a0bcd6088ecacad676f<SEP>chunk-83b5870805a040aa46ebf56e8d1032f7<SEP>chunk-809f983a7cfe15bffeec6a7d03608d1b<SEP>chunk-b775a8274e96715120b2ae4a1951ae04"}}, {start: {_id:2282}, end: {_id:1883}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"non-error classification,stylistic vs. technical", weight:1.0, description:"Repetition is deemed a stylistic choice, not a transcription error per the rules.", created_at:1779165139, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab"}}, {start: {_id:2291}, end: {_id:2290}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"content preservation,error resolution", weight:1.0, description:"The task focuses on correcting errors while retaining the intended message \"We are one.\"", created_at:1779165139, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab"}}, {start: {_id:2292}, end: {_id:1883}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"contextual mismatch,grammatical inconsistency", weight:1.0, description:"\"And a Divine...\" is identified as a transcription error due to grammatical and contextual mismatch.", created_at:1779165139, source_id:"chunk-a6026e244f217a68dea462dad2036aab"}}, {start: {_id:2274}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"content inclusion,spiritual reference", weight:1.0, description:"The video includes the Ekam mantra as part of its audio content, explicitly mentioned in the text.", created_at:1779165165, source_id:"chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0"}}, {start: {_id:2293}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"error context,textual content", weight:1.0, description:"The video contains the original garbled message with repetitive phrases, later corrected to simplify the content.", created_at:1779165165, source_id:"chunk-ebaf44e9f9b7cf34eed85dc20005c2a0"}}, {start: {_id:739}, end: {_id:2173}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", truncate:"", keywords:"blessing,divine grace,spiritual connection,togetherness", weight:2.0, description:"The Divine is invoked to bless the family, fostering acceptance and unity among members.<SEP>Families are encouraged to seek the Divine's blessings for peace and prosperity through prayer and unity.", created_at:1779254395, source_id:"chunk-62eeebe6c2fe0edb5198c7526c02ef79<SEP>chunk-22fbf22f17126e6b5377570cdb342627"}}, {start: {_id:2176}, end: {_id:739}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual practice,togetherness", weight:1.0, description:"The Ekam Mantra is chanted to promote togetherness with family as part of the blessing, fostering acceptance and unity.", created_at:1779165196, source_id:"chunk-62eeebe6c2fe0edb5198c7526c02ef79"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:2176}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"divine invocation,mantra usage,spiritual guidance,spiritual practice", weight:2.0, description:"The Divine is associated with the Ekam mantra, indicating a connection between the spiritual entity and the chant.<SEP>Ekam Mantra is chanted as part of divine blessings, directly linking it to the concept of the Divine through the phrase \"May the Divine bless you to... chant along with it.\"", created_at:1779165332, source_id:"chunk-fa51e84ddb49268093fbbf38c48a6abb<SEP>chunk-a1a5a74c6d8e05a60b03459a012aa68f"}}, {start: {_id:2176}, end: {_id:2294}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"repetition,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"The Ekam mantra is followed by the declaration of unity, suggesting a progression in the spiritual practice.", created_at:1779165231, source_id:"chunk-fa51e84ddb49268093fbbf38c48a6abb"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:2294}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"blessing,unity", weight:1.0, description:"The Divine is linked to the declaration of unity, showing the Divine's role in fostering togetherness.", created_at:1779165231, source_id:"chunk-fa51e84ddb49268093fbbf38c48a6abb"}}, {start: {_id:2173}, end: {_id:1777}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"acceptance,blessing,celebration", weight:1.0, description:"The Divine blesses individuals to accept and celebrate sacredness and togetherness with their family.", created_at:1779165259, source_id:"chunk-b064115910fcd1227cf02905073a96e1"}}, {start: {_id:2173}, end: {_id:2294}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective consciousness,spiritual unity", weight:1.0, description:"The Divine's blessing extends to fostering unity and collective consciousness among individuals and their families.", created_at:1779165259, source_id:"chunk-b064115910fcd1227cf02905073a96e1"}}] AS row
