 weight:1.0, description:"Nomi carried and touched the woman, an act that violated the Master's rules and caused conflict.", created_at:1779173271, source_id:"chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43"}}, {start: {_id:137}, end: {_id:2383}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"challenge,problem", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Nomi's suffering is exacerbated by the breaking of his car's transmission, a practical life challenge.", created_at:1779173271, source_id:"chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43"}}, {start: {_id:142}, end: {_id:137}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"authority,rule enforcement", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Master?s rules cause Nomi?s suffering by exacerbating inner conflict and self-focused anxiety.", created_at:1779173271, source_id:"chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43"}}, {start: {_id:142}, end: {_id:2387}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"authority,guidance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Master's rules on not looking at, speaking to, or touching women are the foundation of the conflict and suffering.", created_at:1779173272, source_id:"chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43"}}, {start: {_id:2392}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)<SEP>YouTube Video: YkIBYppBtro (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkIBYppBtro)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual contrast,contrast,distinction,experiential focus,nature,philosophical contrast", weight:4.0, created_at:1779562376, description:"Spirituality is differentiated from religion by its emphasis on direct experience over dogma.<SEP>Spirituality is differentiated from religion through the example of evening rituals.<SEP>Spirituality is an internal journey, while religion involves external rules and teachings.", source_id:"chunk-3ba320b05f330dd38ee53d270146e432<SEP>chunk-35e15581ad50dde0c800dac7e7b512c1<SEP>chunk-cea13f2b86c9f827be31632c60cac574"}}, {start: {_id:2390}, end: {_id:2393}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness focus,methodological contrast", weight:1.0, description:"Spirituality contrasts with therapy by prioritizing consciousness over problem-solving.", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-3ba320b05f330dd38ee53d270146e432"}}, {start: {_id:2402}, end: {_id:2395}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"evolution,practice", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Soul-sync practice facilitates personal growth through daily diligent practice, dissolving past suffering and fostering evolution.` -> This looks correct.<SEP>Soul-sync practice facilitates personal growth through daily diligent practice, dissolving past suffering and fostering evolution.` -> This looks fine.", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983"}}, {start: {_id:2397}, end: {_id:781}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"ethics,peace", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Inner peace naturally generates human responsibility as compassionate action toward self and others.` -> This looks correct.", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983"}}, {start: {_id:2082}, end: {_id:2391}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awareness,obstacle,transcendence", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Overcoming ego is essential for achieving enlightened states of oneness.<SEP>Enlightenment involves transcending ego and recognizing its futility in achieving lasting fulfillment.`", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-3ba320b05f330dd38ee53d270146e432<SEP>chunk-02f292000f544446b15f0519998d1dbc"}}, {start: {_id:2394}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual divergence,historical influence", weight:1.0, description:"Psychology has incorporated spiritual philosophies but remains distinct from pure spiritual experiences.", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-3ba320b05f330dd38ee53d270146e432"}}, {start: {_id:2402}, end: {_id:2400}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"journey,symbolism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Growth reframes the Mount Everest symbolism from destination to continuous evolutionary journey.>", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983"}}, {start: {_id:519}, end: {_id:2401}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"consciousness,reality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The world today reflects dominant stressful states of collective human consciousness.>", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:771}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"action,consciousness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Connection fosters kindness as a natural expression of peaceful consciousness.>", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-cb2b247e069cff8e39d34db433289983"}}, {start: {_id:1335}, end: {_id:2082}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual metaphor,symbolic narrative", weight:1.0, description:"Buddha?s story illustrates ego as an obstacle to enlightenment, covered by mud (illusion).", created_at:1779173785, source_id:"chunk-3ba320b05f330dd38ee53d270146e432"}}] AS row
