ng rather than mere idealism.", created_at:1779173829, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f"}}, {start: {_id:2458}, end: {_id:479}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"reconciliation,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The guerrilla leader's healing experience led to a rejection of violence and a commitment to peace.", created_at:1779173829, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f"}}, {start: {_id:2451}, end: {_id:2461}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"community building,sustainability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Loka Foundation uses mud bricks in village construction to promote eco-friendly and locally sourced infrastructure.", created_at:1779173829, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f"}}, {start: {_id:2472}, end: {_id:2426}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion,guest participation,interview,participation", weight:3.0, description:"Sri Sri Krishnaji is a guest on the show.<SEP>Sri Sri Krishnaji participated in the Frankly Speaking show and discussed healing and connecting within.", created_at:1779173829, source_id:"chunk-1c3c80dce751d1f7b79cbb9a20a4e9ce<SEP>chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c"}}, {start: {_id:2491}, end: {_id:2455}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"collaboration,dialogue,leadership,philosophical discussion", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Shri Sri Preethaji and Shri Sri Krishnaji discussed forgiveness, healing, and societal reconciliation during a public discourse.<SEP>Shri Sri Krishnaji and Sri Sri Preethaji co-lead Oneness Changemakers and the Aekam festival, promoting global peace and education.`", created_at:1779174263, source_id:"chunk-701926e51028584695a89ba83fd7e78f<SEP>chunk-136e0828d80d107f75974ede595c760a"}}, {start: {_id:2472}, end: {_id:2473}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"hosting,participation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Navigaji is associated with the Frankly Speaking show, likely as a host or participant.", created_at:1779173830, source_id:"chunk-1c3c80dce751d1f7b79cbb9a20a4e9ce"}}, {start: {_id:1975}, end: {_id:2475}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"organization focus,transformation work", weight:1.0, description:"ACAM focuses on individual transformation.", created_at:1779173830, source_id:"chunk-5c8f3b58191cd7eb20e97c7adfd8085c"}}, {start: {_id:2472}, end: {_id:479}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"discussion,topic", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Frankly Speaking show discussed the concept of healing.", created_at:1779173830, source_id:"chunk-1c3c80dce751d1f7b79cbb9a20a4e9ce"}}] AS row
