UNWIND [{start: {_id:2817}, end: {_id:2818}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"preparation,readiness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The clear slate enables immediate readiness for new experiences without past burden.", created_at:1779183733, source_id:"chunk-6e5caa7e31ebe95d72aef04edb890b5c"}}, {start: {_id:350}, end: {_id:2816}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"attitude,fearlessness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Happy Child approaches mistakes without fear, contrasting with adult self-centric concerns.", created_at:1779183733, source_id:"chunk-6e5caa7e31ebe95d72aef04edb890b5c"}}, {start: {_id:2819}, end: {_id:2820}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"healing,life journey", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The First Life Journey is about healing the Wounded Child.", created_at:1779183733, source_id:"chunk-64bedfe4784f383c0c7cb35f66854285"}}, {start: {_id:1449}, end: {_id:350}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"aspiration,calm conviction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Happy Child's state fosters a serene belief in creating a beautiful destiny effortlessly.", created_at:1779183733, source_id:"chunk-6e5caa7e31ebe95d72aef04edb890b5c"}}, {start: {_id:354}, end: {_id:377}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional transition,societal influence", weight:1.0, description:"The happy child state transitions into the wounded child state due to external pressures and emotional conditioning.`", created_at:1779183763, source_id:"chunk-6b077b95a5e468c5e42f57a37944c07d"}}, {start: {_id:378}, end: {_id:2822}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional resonance,shared experience", weight:1.0, description:"Both sellers? interaction during the rain highlights contrasting emotional states and coping mechanisms.`", created_at:1779183763, source_id:"chunk-6b077b95a5e468c5e42f57a37944c07d"}}, {start: {_id:2823}, end: {_id:2822}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional unrest,subconscious trigger", weight:1.0, description:"The flower basket symbolizes the sh seller?s unresolved feelings and restlessness.`", created_at:1779183763, source_id:"chunk-6b077b95a5e468c5e42f57a37944c07d"}}, {start: {_id:788}, end: {_id:2827}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"metaphor,scientific description", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Rick Hanson describes the brain as tofu-like tissue with neurons and neural connections.", created_at:1779183763, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:401}, end: {_id:2829}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"neuroplasticity,repetition", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Repetitive thoughts and emotions strengthen neural connections, shaping the brain's structure.", created_at:1779183763, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:367}, end: {_id:2836}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"metaphor,self-discovery", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The story illustrates the impact of childhood conditioning and the journey toward self-realization.`", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-6b077b95a5e468c5e42f57a37944c07d"}}, {start: {_id:2824}, end: {_id:2822}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"friendship,shared experience", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The ower seller and sh seller are friends who share a journey to the market and shelter together.", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:788}, end: {_id:2429}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"biological structure,component", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Neurons are a fundamental component of the brain's structure.", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:788}, end: {_id:2828}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"biological structure,component", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Neuroglia are support cells that are part of the brain's composition.", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:2825}, end: {_id:2822}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"avoidance,discomfort", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The sh seller moves the ower basket away due to its smell, which caused her discomfort.", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:788}, end: {_id:401}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"biological structure,component", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Neural connections are the pathways that connect neurons within the brain.", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:2826}, end: {_id:2822}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"self-awareness,sensory reaction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The sh seller brings her own sh closer to inhale its smell, leading to sleep.", created_at:1779183764, source_id:"chunk-1c4d31dfa44d01e98b11093ef31cbb04"}}, {start: {_id:417}, end: {_id:352}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"family conflict,resentment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Jaya harbors bitterness and resentment toward her mother, which permeates her relationships.", created_at:1779183781, source_id:"chunk-0e5b03097ca1fd70284be6d33317832d"}}, {start: {_id:417}, end: {_id:254}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"authority issues,workplace conflict", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Jaya's inability to respect team members and anger at mistakes leads to high employee turnover.", created_at:1779183781, source_id:"chunk-0e5b03097ca1fd70284be6d33317832d"}}, {start: {_id:2831}, end: {_id:417}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"abuse,trauma", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Jaya's abusive childhood experiences with her mother shaped her later emotional state and behaviors.` - This is also a good summary.<SEP>Jaya's traumatic childhood experiences with her mother shaped her later emotional state and behaviors.`*", created_at:1779183782, source_id:"chunk-da0dcd44b642ae88bb5ae6bfa953a323"}}, {start: {_id:417}, end: {_id:401}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"neuroplasticity,repetition", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Jaya's repetitive thoughts about her past kept certain neural connections alive, preventing healing.", created_at:1779183782, source_id:"chunk-da0dcd44b642ae88bb5ae6bfa953a323"}}] AS row
