d patterns and drama.", created_at:1779186250, source_id:"chunk-3e351e3f449821330f87c8b4e26de0d2"}}, {start: {_id:2894}, end: {_id:886}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"accident,emotional impact,responsibility", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Moon's reckless driving caused the car accident and its damage.<SEP>The damaged car symbolizes the accident that triggers Moon's emotional reflection and relationship doubts.` - Correct.", created_at:1779186837, source_id:"chunk-5849ade76c5b4eb2790b0b03a838cc07<SEP>chunk-c8cc27957b68d36b9eca4a85d95d3c9f"}}, {start: {_id:2897}, end: {_id:911}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"carry over,impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Carrying heartbreak into future relationships risks repeating patterns and creating challenges.", created_at:1779186250, source_id:"chunk-3e351e3f449821330f87c8b4e26de0d2"}}, {start: {_id:1095}, end: {_id:449}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"communication,management", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Managing distance requires deeper understanding and communication strategies.", created_at:1779186250, source_id:"chunk-3e351e3f449821330f87c8b4e26de0d2"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:886}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotional growth,self-realization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Moon's insight into shared anxiety with her boyfriend fosters a transformative sense of connection.", created_at:1779186276, source_id:"chunk-5849ade76c5b4eb2790b0b03a838cc07"}}, {start: {_id:886}, end: {_id:276}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"consciousness,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Moon applies the \"second sacred secret of inner truth\" to overcome self-obsession and reconnect.", created_at:1779186277, source_id:"chunk-5849ade76c5b4eb2790b0b03a838cc07"}}, {start: {_id:276}, end: {_id:2910}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"interconnected,necessary", truncate:"", 