ion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"the gut and spinal cord are mentioned as sources of intelligence that can alleviate disconnection.", created_at:1779186362, source_id:"chunk-5e714c1a6ea0e14019d2ce93ffec1a74"}}, {start: {_id:1301}, end: {_id:2911}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"alleviation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The intelligence can alleviate feelings of disconnection.", created_at:1779186362, source_id:"chunk-5e714c1a6ea0e14019d2ce93ffec1a74"}}, {start: {_id:2888}, end: {_id:2891}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"transcendence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"cultural expressions of transcendence are linked to the search for life partners.", created_at:1779186362, source_id:"chunk-5e714c1a6ea0e14019d2ce93ffec1a74"}}, {start: {_id:2899}, end: {_id:950}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"framework,progression,sequence,stage", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Stage One: Hurt is part of the Three Stages of Disconnection framework.<SEP>The Three Stages of Disconnection include Stage One: Hurt as the initial phase.`", created_at:1779187019, source_id:"chunk-e267787286890ad0751663f8a3e06d5c<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc"}}, {start: {_id:2898}, end: {_id:2904}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,death", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The lion sprang into action and killed the three learned fools.", created_at:1779186425, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:2901}, end: {_id:2904}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"death,foolishness,outcome,participants", truncate:"", weight:5.0, description:"The three learned fools were participants in the fable, demonstrating foolishness.<SEP>The three learned fools' outcome was death in the fable.<SEP>The three learned fools met a tragic end in the fable.", created_at:1779186426, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:955}, end: {_id:950}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"framework,stage", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Stage Two: Judgment is part of the Three Stages of Disconnection framework.", created_at:1779186426, source_id:"chunk-e267787286890ad0751663f8a3e06d5c"}}, {start: {_id:2899}, end: {_id:955}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"escalation,progression", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"If Stage One: Hurt is not addressed, it progresses to Stage Two: Judgment.<SEP>Unresolved hurt progresses to Stage Two: Judgment if not addressed.`", created_at:1779187019, source_id:"chunk-e267787286890ad0751663f8a3e06d5c<SEP>chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc"}}, {start: {_id:2900}, end: {_id:950}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"concept", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The shadow of hurt is one of the shadows that create separation in relationships.", created_at:1779186426, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:2901}, end: {_id:2902}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"location,setting", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The four friends were in the forest when they encountered the bones.", created_at:1779186426, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:941}, end: {_id:942}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"relationship,warning", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The second fellow warned the fourth fellow against proceeding without knowledge.", created_at:1779186426, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:941}, end: {_id:2898}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"action,breathing life", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The fourth fellow breathed life into the carcass, causing it to come to life.", created_at:1779186426, source_id:"chunk-e36ac09e9a78a5f6abbc86d3b146881d"}}, {start: {_id:979}, end: {_id:950}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"concept", truncate:"", weight: