We need to ensure we mention the full name of the entity or relation at the beginning of the summary to ensure immediate clarity and context. So we can start with \\\"Global Tech", source_id:"chunk-db92dc43fde6d9177bd2c4457cc76052<SEP>chunk-7248fb4a5efc0d07c14a1dfefd59324e<SEP>chunk-a0501780b62546f91638cd76288d70a0<SEP>chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-5c68b9015fbb59203618736e8841a1fe<SEP>chunk-1e7e55f43ce6e8842a2479ee424af0b9<SEP>chunk-059ace20f2db1cc39262846db5c238d9"}}, {start: {_id:449}, end: {_id:979}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"disconnection,stagnation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Shadow of Staleness leads to emotional stagnation and disconnection in relationships.`", created_at:1779187020, source_id:"chunk-b19b2a822951a545ded34a82295b89dc"}}, {start: {_id:976}, end: {_id:2934}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"process,relationship", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Doris is part of the process that leads to a relationship with Clark.<SEP>Doris and Clark are connected through a process.", created_at:1779187044, source_id:"chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0"}}, {start: {_id:976}, end: {_id:2936}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"partnership,relationship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Doris is in a romantic partnership with Clark.", created_at:1779187044, source_id:"chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0"}}, {start: {_id:977}, end: {_id:2934}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"process,relationship", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Clark is involved in a process that leads to a relationship with Doris.<SEP>Clark and Doris are connected through a process.", created_at:1779187044, source_id:"chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0"}}, {start: {_id:977}, end: {_id:2936}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"partnership,relationship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Clark is in a romantic partnership with Doris.", created_at:1779187045, source_id:"chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0"}}, {start: {_id:2935}, end: {_id:977}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"friendship,relationship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Clark is in an authentic friendship with Doris.", created_at:1779187045, source_id:"chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0"}}, {start: {_id:2935}, end: {_id:976}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"friendship,relationship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Doris is in an authentic friendship with Clark.", created_at:1779187045, source_id:"chunk-f01f7886f64dcda0228048269c532fa0"}}, {start: {_id:1026}, end: {_id:2942}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional distance,financial transaction", weight:1.0, description:"Sunil sent 50% of his salary to his father while working in Mumbai, maintaining financial ties despite emotional estrangement.", created_at:1779187117, source_id:"chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a"}}, {start: {_id:399}, end: {_id:2943}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotional healing,self-awareness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The absence of emotional hurt enables authentic transformation through self-awareness and connection.", created_at:1779187117, source_id:"chunk-924b77c112ecc0d58074213d49a1a3d2"}}, {start: {_id:1026}, end: {_id:2941}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"divorce,emotional disconnect", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sunil's inability to connect emotionally led to divorce, resulting in separated living arrangements.", created_at:1779187117, source_id:"chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a"}}, {start: {_id:1026}, end: {_id:2940}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"joyful connection,transformed relationship", weight:1.0, description:"After his awakening, Sunil developed a loving, present relationship with his daughter.", created_at:1779187117, source_id:"chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a"}}, {start: {_id:2944}, end: {_id:1070}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotional support,healing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Presence to others' emotions fosters healing and nourishment in relationships.", created_at:1779187117, source_id:"chunk-924b77c112ecc0d58074213d49a1a3d2"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:1026}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional transformation,spiritual awakening", weight:1.0, description:"Sunil's realization of connection dissolved his emotional hurt and enabled loving relationships.", created_at:1779187118, source_id:"chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:1026}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotional presence,joyful existence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sunil's awakened state allowed him to experience love as a continuous, joyful connection with life.", created_at:1779187118, source_id:"chunk-9a28e4054912d7c9812d1628ee5acb4a"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:1490}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness expansion,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Human consciousness inherently seeks connection and interconnectedness with life and others.", created_at:1779187119, source_id:"chunk-924b77c112ecc0d58074213d49a1a3d2"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:682}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional intimacy,mutual understanding", weight:1.0, description:"Partnership thrives on connection through emotional intimacy and mutual understanding.", created_at:1779187119, source_id:"chunk-924b77c112ecc0d58074213d49a1a3d2"}}, {start: {_id:2948}, end: {_id:1001}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"confinement,destruction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The labyrinth traps individuals, and the Minotaur symbolizes self-destructive states consuming them.", created_at:1779187232, source_id:"chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912"}}, {start: {_id:2947}, end: {_id:997}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"fear,self-perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The man fears his shadow, symbolizing his fear of confronting his own existence.", created_at:1779187232, source_id:"chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912"}}, {start: {_id:998}, end: {_id:2947}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"escapism,inevitability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The man tries to escape his footsteps, representing his inability to accept his actions and presence.", created_at:1779187232, source_id:"chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:711}, end: {_id:904}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"dissolution,emergence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In a beautiful state of connection, separation is dissolved and replaced by connection.", created_at:1779187232, source_id:"chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0"}}, {start: {_id:711}, end: {_id:2951}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"experience,joy", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Living and relating become joyful experiences in this state of connection.", created_at:1779187233, source_id:"chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0"}}, {start: {_id:2948}, end: {_id:2947}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"entrapment,mental state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Living in the past/future traps individuals in the labyrinth of self-obsession.", created_at:1779187233, source_id:"chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912"}}, {start: {_id:711}, end: {_id:2411}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"acceptance,coexistence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Connection does not eliminate disagreements but transforms their impact through dissolution of separation.", created_at:1779187233, source_id:"chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0"}}, {start: {_id:506}, end: {_id:2949}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"disconnection,self-focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Hurt and staleness are self-obsessive states causing disconnection from others.", created_at:1779187233, source_id:"chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912"}}, {start: {_id:179}, end: {_id:176}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", keywords:"awareness,connection,context,goal,introspection,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779672012, description:"Spiritual vision aligns inner state with beautiful connection and self-awareness.<SEP>Inner State is connected to Spiritual Vision as part of a daily routine.<SEP>The spiritual vision is conducted and experienced within the framework of the inner state.", source_id:"chunk-b37ece05c6dd07c4fd1c02e2cefb7912<SEP>chunk-c47a850c80a21ed6c67cbed2bc4b8ec0<SEP>chunk-f367b232a1868597453e46a0827c00ef"}}, {start: {_id:1024}, end: {_id:1023}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"feeds,perpetuates", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Cultural norms perpetuate modern society's misunderstanding of connection by shaping its foundational beliefs.", created_at:1779187234, source_id:"chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0"}}, {start: {_id:2952}, end: {_id:1023}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"defect,origin", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The connection misunderstanding in modern society originates from a fundamental defect in their understanding of relational dynamics.", created_at:1779187234, source_id:"chunk-21d71f186fdeb1dfcf5eb219529f54f0"}}, {start: {_id:89}, end: {_id:2956}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Anger leads to unwise actions that sabotage intelligence.", created_at:1779187292, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864"}}, {start: {_id:371}, end: {_id:2956}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Loneliness leads to unwise actions that sabotage intelligence.", created_at:1779187293, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864"}}, {start: {_id:1143}, end: {_id:2957}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"action,outcome", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Spiritual right action leads to unexpected events that enhance life.", created_at:1779187293, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864"}}, {start: {_id:1283}, end: {_id:2956}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Insecurity leads to unwise actions that sabotage intelligence.", created_at:1779187293, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864"}}, {start: {_id:1143}, end: {_id:2955}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"alignment,consciousness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Spiritual right action aligns with the unitary fabric of consciousness, fostering harmony.", created_at:1779187293, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864"}}, {start: {_id:852}, end: {_id:2956}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,emotional state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Fear leads to unwise actions that sabotage intelligence.", created_at:1779187293, source_id:"chunk-37c881d41553a8a7658ca326a33a2864"}}, {start: {_id:2965}, end: {_id:2964}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"frustration,job", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man worked at the call center out of necessity but resented it due to self-hate and lack of fulfillment.", created_at:1779187360, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c"}}, {start: {_id:2969}, end: {_id:1163}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"action,reporting", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man reported the stolen horse to Confucius, driven by honesty.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e"}}, {start: {_id:2964}, end: {_id:1164}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"self-discovery,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man's participation in the foundation's program led to self-realization and life change.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c"}}, {start: {_id:2970}, end: {_id:1163}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,motivation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man's report was motivated by the family's starvation, which led to the horse theft.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e"}}, {start: {_id:2966}, end: {_id:2964}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"culinary growth,mentorship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man learned traditional cooking from his mother, leading to his career as a master chef.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c"}}, {start: {_id:1183}, end: {_id:1163}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"application,implementation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Confucian system's principles were applied by the young man in reporting the theft.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
