UNWIND [{start: {_id:2964}, end: {_id:136}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cultural roots,reconciliation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man returned to his village, reconnecting with family and embracing traditional cuisine.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c"}}, {start: {_id:1183}, end: {_id:2969}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"governance,oversight", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The incident involving the stolen horse tested the principles of the Confucian system.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e"}}, {start: {_id:2967}, end: {_id:2964}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"culinary mastery,cultural pride", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The young man's expertise in traditional dishes reflects his mastery and pride in heritage.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-03367dd9ee49f7699a39e3df3605c23c"}}, {start: {_id:1183}, end: {_id:2970}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"reaction,response", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The system's response to family starvation was the theft of the horse, which the young man reported.", created_at:1779187361, source_id:"chunk-fcd1a45c686f83b559e31c346f079d1e"}}, {start: {_id:1202}, end: {_id:1206}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"consequence,financial struggle", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The pit leads to the crocodile, symbolizing how fear-driven actions result in financial problems.", created_at:1779187431, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8"}}, {start: {_id:1204}, end: {_id:1935}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"erosion of hope,time", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The mice nibbling the vine illustrate how hope diminishes over time without conscious effort.", created_at:1779187431, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8"}}, {start: {_id:2973}, end: {_id:1201}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"contrast,fleeting relief", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The honey represents temporary relief sought amid life?s chaos and insecurity.", created_at:1779187431, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8"}}, {start: {_id:1317}, end: {_id:1216}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"abandonment,professional consequences", weight:1.0, description:"Employees leave Mike after the firm's collapse, reflecting his loss of professional influence.", created_at:1779187432, source_id:"chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa"}}, {start: {_id:1145}, end: {_id:380}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"metaphor,spiritual teaching", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The story allegorically explains the Fourth Sacred Secret and conscious wealth creation.", created_at:1779187432, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8"}}, {start: {_id:1216}, end: {_id:2958}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"family influence,intervention", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mike's daughter insists he attend the course, catalyzing his self-reflection.", created_at:1779187432, source_id:"chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa"}}, {start: {_id:1145}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"authority,explanation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji authored the text to elaborate on the Fourth Sacred Secret and its principles.", created_at:1779187432, source_id:"chunk-f85d41f2377858e80129dfbf7af31bf8"}}, {start: {_id:1216}, end: {_id:2959}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"behavioral issue,self-realization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mike acknowledges his previous \"focus and drive\" as an addiction during the course, marking a key self-awareness moment.", created_at:1779187432, source_id:"chunk-2093a273636983f00fe7dc86ea163faa"}}, {start: {_id:1216}, end: {_id:2960}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_so