_source", keywords:"event hosting,organization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Ekam Enlightenment Festival is organized by O&O Academy as part of its consciousness transformation programs.", created_at:1779188199, source_id:"chunk-68272ee7ebb0f34dcf88d287b8d9983d"}}, {start: {_id:1508}, end: {_id:21}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"meditation content,teachings", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Ekam Enlightenment Festival incorporates meditations from The Four Sacred Secrets to guide participants through enlightened states.", created_at:1779188199, source_id:"chunk-68272ee7ebb0f34dcf88d287b8d9983d"}}, {start: {_id:1508}, end: {_id:3034}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness transformation,global participation", weight:1.0, description:"The festival involves global participants in collective meditation to amplify consciousness and achieve blissful states.", created_at:1779188199, source_id:"chunk-68272ee7ebb0f34dcf88d287b8d9983d"}}] AS row
