dhana\" for conceptual clarity.<SEP>Original text uses \"sadhana\" which is corrected to \"Sadhana\" (capitalized) as a domain-specific spiritual concept.", created_at:1779218225, source_id:"chunk-d22846f24d18f20fdaf21ce0958a7d11<SEP>chunk-52ad42f8f8d7bf6cdf3a96f95c014a7c"}}, {start: {_id:1500}, end: {_id:3165}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)<SEP>YouTube Video: Vr3PS2DdbDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"capitalization,term correction,terminology", weight:3.0, description:"\"limitless field\" is corrected to \"Limitless Field\" as a conceptual entity.<SEP>The term \"limitless field\" is corrected to \"Limitless Field\" for proper capitalization as a specific concept.", created_at:1779395946, source_id:"chunk-d22846f24d18f20fdaf21ce0958a7d11<SEP>chunk-06b512c92e682b8d2052145d11d7fba4"}}, {start: {_id:3177}, end: {_id:3176}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", truncate:"", keywords:"event content,presentation format", weight:1.0, description:"Transcript serves as the content for the spiritual/career talk event.", created_at:1779190243, source_id:"chunk-c095541368132f0551b7c47961463ae4"}}, {start: {_id:3173}, end: {_id:3172}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", truncate:"", keywords:"historical contrast,thematic elements", weight:1.0, description:"Old World History and New World are referenced together as thematic elements.", created_at:1779190243, source_id:"chunk-c095541368132f0551b7c47961463ae4"}}, {start: {_id:17}, end: {_id:3175}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4ZR5U8VuQY)", truncate:"", keywords:"content creation,correction process", weight:1.0, description:"Krishnaji is involved in the speech writing and correction process.", created_at:1779190243, source_id:"chunk-c09554136813