historical recurrence,historical repetition,ideals,recurring events,response,societal issue,systemic issues,values", weight:6.0, description:"America has experienced recurring racial violence, indicating a pattern of historical repetition.<SEP>America has addressed racial violence, but often in a way that pushes it back into the shadows.<SEP>Racial violence in America is a recurring event, contributing to historical repetition.<SEP>America addresses racial violence through values and ideals, though systemic failures persist.<SEP>Racial violence has repeatedly erupted in America, been suppressed, and resurfaced throughout history.<SEP>Address racial violence with values and ideals.", created_at:1779193793, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc<SEP>chunk-3ae96ad01fcb39bd7a75f6d45072f0d6<SEP>chunk-638abb6fbdf727a0284e50fe14e82b1f<SEP>chunk-acb941e2e31d401b209b5294a9065fb1"}}, {start: {_id:3281}, end: {_id:3276}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause and effect", weight:13.0, description:"Anger and hate lead to unthinkable cruelty.", created_at:1779192012, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc"}}, {start: {_id:3275}, end: {_id:3270}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause and effect", weight:1.0, description:"Racial violence is caused by insane amounts of anger and hate.", created_at:1779192012, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc"}}, {start: {_id:3254}, end: {_id:3279}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cyclical patterns,historical actions", weight:1.0, description:"America's actions over the years show cyclical patterns of addressing racial violence, indicating repeating history.", created_at:1779192012, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc"}}, {start: {_id:3281}, end: {_id:3277}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause and effect", weight:14.0, description:"Anger and hate can result in burning down someone's home.<SEP>Anger and hate can cause burning down someone's home.<SEP>Anger and hate can result in burning down someone'", created_at:1779192012, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc"}}, {start: {_id:3281}, end: {_id:3270}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause and effect", weight:1.0, description:"Anger and hate are causes of racial violence.", created_at:1779192013, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc"}}, {start: {_id:3281}, end: {_id:3275}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause and effect", weight:1.0, description:"Anger and hate are causes of insane amounts of anger and hate.", created_at:1779192013, source_id:"chunk-a1ec36477897e4ff74fcbce70331c0fc"}}, {start: {_id:3283}, end: {_id:3284}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional drivers,societal impact", weight:2.0, description:"Prejudices and hates perpetuate anger and insecurity, fueling violence.<SEP>Prejudices and hates are interconnected, with prejudices often escalating into hatred.", created_at:1779192415, source_id:"chunk-3ae96ad01fcb39bd7a75f6d45072f0d6<SEP>chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d"}}, {start: {_id:3090}, end: {_id:2500}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"gender discrimination,global issue,societal behavior,universal problem", weight:3.0, created_at:1779193257, description:"Discrimination is a universal challenge faced by all nations, not exclusive to America.<SEP>Discrimination is a universal problem observed across nations, manifesting in different forms like race, caste, and religion.<SEP>Many nations discriminate based on gender, contributing to global social issues.", source_id:"chunk-3ae96ad01fcb39bd7a75f6d45072f0d6<SEP>chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d<SEP>chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480"}}, {start: {_id:89}, end: {_id:1283}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional contagion,emotional cycle,emotional factors,emotional interplay,emotional states,emotional triggers,generational spread,generational trauma,psychological state,societal conflict", weight:6.0, created_at:1779193411, description:"Anger and insecurity spread across individuals and generations, sustaining division.<SEP>Anger and insecurity reinforce each other, perpetuating discrimination and violence.<SEP>Anger and insecurity are intertwined emotions perpetuated through generational trauma.`<SEP>Anger and insecurity are interconnected emotional states.<SEP>Anger and insecurity are linked to fear and hate, driving societal tensions.<SEP>Anger and insecurity are linked through generational trauma.", source_id:"chunk-3ae96ad01fcb39bd7a75f6d45072f0d6<SEP>chunk-7d81041aa6a8c1ffd7fa363d2179e32d<SEP>chunk-08f2f333c27085728d7608b7e47baa48<SEP>chunk-f97c33bc1c34505752dbdf13ce792596<SEP>chunk-0cb21e09915c74bf08c75e2e9b3c1480<SEP>chunk-4be5f58baaab4360b84499e4e9c8f89b"}}] AS row
