e current generation is enduring and facing the greatest pressure in history.", created_at:1779221493, source_id:"chunk-349671a87ed47c9a9189c9696547ad85"}}, {start: {_id:1789}, end: {_id:2096}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"constraint,rule", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The User must adhere to specific constraints.", created_at:1779221493, source_id:"chunk-7651e3f88938aa416a882ccdc7e8497a"}}, {start: {_id:2221}, end: {_id:2219}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"elimination of pressure,purpose", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The vision of Ekam Youth Changemakers is to eliminate pressure and help individuals live beautifully.", created_at:1779221493, source_id:"chunk-349671a87ed47c9a9189c9696547ad85"}}, {start: {_id:2369}, end: {_id:499}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: nCkbv_lvFfg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nCkbv_lvFfg)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qr_pw4E-REk)", keywords:"cause,causes,co-occurring concepts,internalization,interrelated factors,leads to", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779666630, description:"Pressure causes stress, which is mentioned as a consequence of the pressure faced by the youth.<SEP>Stress arises when pressure is internalized, transforming external challenges into internal anxiety or frustration.<SEP>Stress and pressure are presented as interconnected experiences in the speaker's analysis.", source_id:"chunk-349671a87ed47c9a9189c9696547ad85<SEP>chunk-2171a2444f1340eb8e26b9e8bb9ef9cc<SEP>chunk-00da1afa0adf0cfcf3ae2d5ef072e1fa"}}, {start: {_id:2198}, end: {_id:2096}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"method,process", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The User must follow a systematic correction method.", created_at:1779221493, source_id:"chunk-7651e3f88938aa416a882ccdc7e8497a"}}, {start: {_id:2201}, end: {_id:2369}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"causes,leads to", truncate:"", 