kzRqQOvjRhA)", keywords:"causality,communication", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Guilt signals imbalance to the field of consciousness, perpetuating chaotic life circumstances.", created_at:1779223110, source_id:"chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b"}}, {start: {_id:251}, end: {_id:2495}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", keywords:"causality,communication", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Insecurity disrupts the field of consciousness, opening pathways for chaos as outlined in the text.", created_at:1779223110, source_id:"chunk-8f35cfdcddeef4d10f1b5998a3a18b8b"}}] AS row
