s and inner conflict.", created_at:1779224838, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db<SEP>chunk-954c4e66e25d390d543a0361e6284f30"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:2606}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"coping mechanism,escape", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Addictions are used as a means to escape deep unhappiness or dissatisfaction in life.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d"}}, {start: {_id:2597}, end: {_id:1507}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"healing,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The festival's environment facilitated the coach's son's shift from public shame to redemption through shared spiritual impact.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db"}}, {start: {_id:2595}, end: {_id:2601}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"demographic,statistics", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Alcohol addiction statistics define the scale of the demographic affected.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d"}}, {start: {_id:2597}, end: {_id:2593}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"family dynamics,reconciliation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The coach's experience at the festival fostered reconciliation and emotional healing with his son.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-91b4190f855a81f99cd10dbd03ae90db"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:479}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"resolution,symptom", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Addictions are symptoms of inner turmoil, requiring healing for resolution.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d"}}, {start: {_id:2603}, end: {_id:2596}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"activity,addiction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Internet gaming transitions into addiction through compulsive use.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d"}}, {start: {_id:2599}, end: {_id:2602}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause,effect", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Smoking is the behavioral manifestation of nicotine addiction.", created_at:1779224563, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:2604}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 3ITFXvYIPqg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3ITFXvYIPqg)", keywords:"addictions,result,societal,systemic", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Civilization?s addictive tendencies reflect broader societal behaviors and values.<SEP>The civilization's actions result in societal addictions.", created_at:1779524542, source_id:"chunk-e2bd3f4cf43dab42e9cb72ed41ed496d<SEP>chunk-287c3c0f3f95498058ee40d18602c6a5"}}, {start: {_id:2594}, end: {_id:2144}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", truncate:"", keywords:"awareness,topic discussion", weight:1.0, description:"The original text discusses Mental Health Awareness Month.", created_at:1779224750, source_id:"chunk-65e592e96dcb520be6fd6fe6ab9612ea"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:2144}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", keywords:"analysis,topic discussion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The original text discusses addictions in the context of mental health.", created_at:1779224750, source_id:"chunk-65e592e96dcb520be6fd6fe6ab9612ea"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:2594}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mmungGgDNw)", keywords:"awareness,topic focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mental Health Awareness Month addresses addiction as a critical issue impacting mental and emotional health.", created_at:1779224794, source_id:"chunk-287b5379ffe15e81cc3508670d4597aa"}}] AS row
