779227301, source_id:"chunk-d7334bb946031c17a3fae04787a343d3"}}, {start: {_id:27}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8XASiz30oE)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg)", truncate:"", keywords:"Video Content,content,content delivery,content hosting,editing,punctuation,source,video", weight:12.0, created_at:1779728327, description:"The (Content, YouTube Video) relation describes a YouTube Video that serves as the primary source of content. This video contains material that has been edited to add or remove commas. It hosts the content being analyzed and corrected in the text, and it is the source of the analyzed text, with its URL serving as its identifier.

The YouTube Video also provides commentary and context for the discussion, and its primary content includes concepts on healing and awakening as well as a specific quote and analysis. The video is the main material being corrected and analyzed, and it encompasses the discussed concepts and the specific quote.<SEP>The YouTube video is the source of the input text, providing context for the corrections and analysis.", source_id:"chunk-882d76920b3090965bf2446e891e6b80<SEP>chunk-565f31c778a5c7a7dca6ba7639c9783c<SEP>chunk-9247a31b8f196a4d7832bfb8b3761954<SEP>chunk-182da401b194aa84428b54cf768730cd<SEP>chunk-f84d092d5f110856868650619246d106<SEP>chunk-c41b1940fe688b602b0faf9703f688e0<SEP>chunk-75cd94439105286110a38283159573c6<SEP>chunk-dc13fd60e7ca6d6137d4072e9576226a"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussing love,emotional resilience,motivational theme,philosophical concepts", weight:2.0, description:"The video emphasizes love as a catalyst for personal transformation and overcoming emotional struggles.<SEP>The YouTube Video discusses philosophical concepts about love and human connection.", created_at:1779247573, source_id:"chunk-5ba6b51b3b4faf505c857914f0743425<SEP>chunk-d1580b380e66d60231e8bb1500c438e9"}}, {start: {_id:3056}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", keywords:"existential struggle,hope", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video addresses loneliness and meaninglessness as temporary states that can be overcome through self-reflection and love.", created_at:1779227383, source_id:"chunk-5ba6b51b3b4faf505c857914f0743425"}}, {start: {_id:3058}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", keywords:"oppression,resolution", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video asserts that tyranny will end, symbolizing the resolution of oppressive forces.", created_at:1779227383, source_id:"chunk-5ba6b51b3b4faf505c857914f0743425"}}, {start: {_id:3057}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", truncate:"", keywords:"low point,overcoming adversity", weight:1.0, description:"The video references hitting rock bottom as a starting point for transformation.", created_at:1779227383, source_id:"chunk-5ba6b51b3b4faf505c857914f0743425"}}, {start: {_id:3053}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral influence,self-awareness", weight:1.0, description:"The video encourages observing the force of habit to foster self-awareness and change.", created_at:1779227384, source_id:"chunk-5ba6b51b3b4faf505c857914f0743425"}}, {start: {_id:3065}, end: {_id:3059}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", truncate:"", keywords:"dictate future,negative influence", weight:2.0, description:"Old wounds and new hurts are dictating the direction of the future, indicating a negative influence on one's life.<SEP>Old wounds and new hurts are dictating the direction of the future, indicating a negative influence.", created_at:1779227417, source_id:"chunk-23221c5b17e3851e48fb2c99d16575d0"}}, {start: {_id:3061}, end: {_id:3064}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", truncate:"", keywords:"disconnection,negative impact", weight:1.0, description:"The old habit of the mind is causing a disconnection from love and care, leading to emotional isolation.", created_at:1779227417, source_id:"chunk-23221c5b17e3851e48fb2c99d16575d0"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:3066}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jW3JDLY0cDA)", keywords:"influence,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Divine is described as a force capable of changing the \"winds of life\" for individuals.", created_at:1779227516, source_id:"chunk-f78b0e4aa7017a9c67d7f42fb709f53c"}}] AS row
