c5ar2g2rnI)", truncate:"", keywords:"doctrinal support,historical document,historical documentation,historical source,religious text,supports belief in", weight:3.0, created_at:1779229239, description:"The Dead Sea Scrolls document early Jewish beliefs that align with reincarnation concepts.<SEP>The Dead Sea Scrolls provide textual evidence for Jewish beliefs in reincarnation.<SEP>Dead Sea Scrolls contain references to reincarnation beliefs in Jewish tradition.", source_id:"chunk-7909a6563f5b96191ad7c41fa18cd126<SEP>chunk-5a061c3e192c4aaa5026aa79274bb0f1<SEP>chunk-98219edafe8ffc379bb20679c2f8f076"}}, {start: {_id:3231}, end: {_id:3240}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", truncate:"", keywords:"historical belief,historical context,religious belief,religious doctrine,spiritual belief,spiritual concepts,supports belief in,theological doctrine", weight:4.0, description:"Early Christianity historically included teachings on reincarnation and life after death.<SEP>Early Christianity incorporated beliefs in reincarnation and life after death.<SEP>Early Christianity believed in reincarnation and life after death.<SEP>Early Christianity also believed in reincarnation and life after death as part of its theological framework.", created_at:1779229240, source_id:"chunk-7909a6563f5b96191ad7c41fa18cd126<SEP>chunk-5a061c3e192c4aaa5026aa79274bb0f1<SEP>chunk-7ac9109abdb5bdc9de2685e960e358c1<SEP>chunk-98219edafe8ffc379bb20679c2f8f076"}}, {start: {_id:3259}, end: {_id:3280}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oc5ar2g2rnI)", truncate:"", keywords:"afterlife state,ritual purpose", weight:1.0, description:"Mahal-e-amavasya is a ritual for the afterlife, dedicated to appeasing the spirits of ancestors.", created_at:1779228916, source_id:"chunk-bfc222041dab5af4f8a47b40b1c47cc5"}}, {start: {_id:3274}, end: {_id:3411}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://ww