UNWIND [{start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:81}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awareness,spirituality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The narrator emphasizes gratitude as spontaneous awareness, not forced compulsion, to avoid self-imposed prisons.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779231695, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e"}}, {start: {_id:3497}, end: {_id:3498}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"conflict,duality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The gentleman's conscious values (gratitude) clash with unconscious emotions (anger, hate), creating internal division.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779231695, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e"}}, {start: {_id:3495}, end: {_id:352}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7NVPsHdyw_Y)", keywords:"conflict,emotional complexity,gratitude,internal conflict,parental influence", truncate:"", weight:3.0, description:"The gentleman practices gratitude toward his mother while unconsciously harboring anger and resentment due to her harsh upbringing.` - This seems correct.<SEP>The gentleman practices gratitude toward his mother for her role in his success but struggles with unconscious anger and ingratitude from childhood experiences.<SEP>The mother's demanding behavior shaped the gentleman's career success, though it also fostered unresolved negative emotions in him.", created_at:1779231794, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e<SEP>chunk-85380b1903edbe83293a14871258c806"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:3499}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"action,impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Genuine gratitude fosters responsibility and action to improve the world, as explained by the narrator.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779231695, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e"}}, {start: {_id:3495}, end: {_id:300}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"internal conflict,self-awareness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The gentleman struggles to reconcile conscious gratitude with unconscious negative emotions, seeking genuine awareness.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779231695, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e"}}, {start: {_id:2714}, end: {_id:3495}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"achievement,parental influence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The gentleman attributes his professional success to his mother's push for excellence, despite their strained relationship.` - This seems correct.", created_at:1779231695, source_id:"chunk-95ede5878070f28d1b63e5213e0a1f6e"}}, {start: {_id:3497}, end: {_id:3495}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7NVPsHdyw_Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"internal conflict,psychological aspects", weight:1.0, description:"The gentleman's conscious mind advocates for gratitude, while his unconscious harbors negative emotions.", created_at:1779231795, source_id:"chunk-85380b1903edbe83293a14871258c806"}}, {start: {_id:352}, end: {_id:501}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7NVPsHdyw_Y)", keywords:"influence,motivation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The mother pushed the gentleman towards success and excellence, shaping his career path.", created_at:1779231795, source_id:"chunk-85380b1903edbe83293a14871258c806"}}, {start: {_id:3495}, end: {_id:3498}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7NVPsHdyw_Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"internal conflict,psychological aspects", weight:1.0, description:"The gentleman experiences anger, hate, and ingratitude unconsciously, conflicting with his conscious values.", created_at:1779231795, source_id:"chunk-85380b1903edbe83293a14871258c806"}}, {start: {_id:3495}, end: {_id:501}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7NVPsHdyw_Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"achievement,internal conflict", weight:1.0, description:"The gentleman achieved success but remains conflicted about his mother's role in it.", created_at:1779231795, source_id:"chunk-85380b1903edbe83293a14871258c806"}}, {start: {_id:1517}, end: {_id:605}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"cause,conflict,destruction,disharmony,effect,fear,happiness,harmony,love,pain,peace,pleasure,sorrow", weight:43.0, description:"Division causes conflict and disharmony in nature and destruction to earth.<SEP>Division causes conflict, leading to pain and destruction.<SEP>Division leads to conflict, causing pain and destruction.<SEP>Division causes conflict,<SEP>Division perpetuates conflict through cycles of power imbalance and injustice.", created_at:1779536466, source_id:"chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-122b26a4cc30222007d37133d11cda63"}}, {start: {_id:2160}, end: {_id:123}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"shared experience,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Humanity shares the same human experience, emphasizing oneness.", created_at:1779231964, source_id:"chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea"}}, {start: {_id:3509}, end: {_id:2116}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"market reaction,safe-haven investment", weight:11.0, created_at:1779748094, description:"Gold Futures, Market Selloff: During a market selloff, gold futures and gold prices rose as investors sought or shifted to safe?haven assets. Multiple descriptions indicate that gold prices increased because investors moved toward safe?haven assets during the market selloff. Some descriptions note that gold futures specifically rose, while others refer to gold prices. The variation in wording (sought vs. shifted) reflects the same underlying behavior of investors reallocating to safe?haven assets.

Additionally, one description mentions a relationship between humanity and each concept, with keywords shared experience and unity. This conceptual relationship is distinct from the market selloff dynamics but is part of the provided information.<SEP>Gold prices rose as investors shifted to safe-haven assets during the market selloff.<SEP>Gold prices rose as investors shifted to safe-haven assets during the market selloff.<SEP>Gold prices rose as investors sought safe-haven assets during the market selloff.`", source_id:"chunk-38cc24446242038f9819315d8c8098ea<SEP>chunk-7248fb4a5efc0d07c14a1dfefd59324e<SEP>chunk-d1911383179e65a76d16c03a5d5707f5<SEP>chunk-6bd1265c66d1065be54810dd4e52f30a<SEP>chunk-5c68b9015fbb59203618736e8841a1fe<SEP>chunk-1e7e55f43ce6e8842a2479ee424af0b9<SEP>chunk-059ace20f2db1cc39262846db5c238d9"}}, {start: {_id:123}, end: {_id:2533}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective existence,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Humanity is unified through shared experiences and existence despite perceived differences.", created_at:1779232053, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {_id:605}, end: {_id:3503}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity formation,social structure", weight:1.0, description:"The educational system promotes division by emphasizing differences and superiority.", created_at:1779232053, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {_id:123}, end: {_id:116}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"cosmic unity,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Humanity is described as one with the universe and all life forms.", created_at:1779232053, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {_id:3510}, end: {_id:3503}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"achievement foundation,social structure", weight:1.0, description:"Career achievements are built on divisions taught through the educational system.", created_at:1779232053, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {_id:123}, end: {_id:2452}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"destruction,environmental impact", weight:1.0, description:"Human actions cause disharmony in nature and destruction on earth.", created_at:1779232054, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {_id:3511}, end: {_id:3503}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity formation,social structure", weight:1.0, description:"The educational system promotes division by emphasizing differences and superiority.", created_at:1779232054, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}, {start: {_id:605}, end: {_id:123}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AB-t5CoxMHM)", truncate:"", keywords:"conflict,identity formation", weight:1.0, description:"Division arises from emphasizing differences and leads to conflict and disharmony.", created_at:1779232054, source_id:"chunk-c69cfc9260a595202e649b77a2983253"}}] AS row
