lationship.", created_at:1779235082, source_id:"chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5"}}, {start: {_id:3602}, end: {_id:956}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)", keywords:"foundation,mutual respect", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Respect forms the foundation of friendship between parents and children.", created_at:1779235082, source_id:"chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5"}}, {start: {_id:3605}, end: {_id:3603}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional response,self-awareness", weight:1.0, description:"Parents may experience disappointment and shock, requiring self-awareness to manage reactions.", created_at:1779235082, source_id:"chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5"}}, {start: {_id:3606}, end: {_id:3603}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)", truncate:"", keywords:"developmental phase,mutual experience", weight:1.0, description:"Both parents and children experience confusion and conflict during this phase.", created_at:1779235082, source_id:"chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5"}}, {start: {_id:533}, end: {_id:3603}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional growth,understanding", weight:1.0, description:"Understanding leads to compassion, fostering emotional growth in the relationship.", created_at:1779235082, source_id:"chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5"}}, {start: {_id:3333}, end: {_id:3603}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hcNDrMy6gCE)", keywords:"challenges,support", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Children face life experiences like failure and rejection, requiring parental support.", created_at:1779235082, source_id:"chunk-0f68110de8267e6218462a761b2a3bb5"}}] AS row
