UNWIND [{start: {_id:3912}, end: {_id:3917}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"moved away from daily activities", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Bill Gates moved away from everyday activities.", created_at:1779245311, source_id:"chunk-550e13cc834f4b3fe1d51617d1c42fa2"}}, {start: {_id:2703}, end: {_id:3918}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"period of seclusion enables creativity", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The period of seclusion is a time for creativity.", created_at:1779245311, source_id:"chunk-550e13cc834f4b3fe1d51617d1c42fa2"}}, {start: {_id:479}, end: {_id:3918}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"period of seclusion enables healing", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The period of seclusion is a time for healing.", created_at:1779245311, source_id:"chunk-550e13cc834f4b3fe1d51617d1c42fa2"}}, {start: {_id:3922}, end: {_id:3919}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", truncate:"", keywords:"origin,residence", weight:1.0, description:"Nitu is from Bangalore, which is his residence.", created_at:1779245498, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3920}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,psychological effect", weight:1.0, description:"Seclusion leads to mental sickness as a psychological effect.", created_at:1779245498, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:934}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,psychological effect", weight:1.0, description:"Seclusion causes boredom due to lack of activity.", created_at:1779245498, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3919}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,source", weight:1.0, description:"Nitu's message is hosted on the YouTube Video as its primary content.", created_at:1779245498, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:916}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,psychological effect", weight:1.0, description:"Seclusion results in emotional and psychological pain.", created_at:1779245498, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3921}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", keywords:"metaphor,perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Seclusion is metaphorically described as a punishment.", created_at:1779245498, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3910}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", keywords:"inspiration,method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Christ employed seclusion during critical periods of his life.", created_at:1779245500, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3924}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", keywords:"inspiration,method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Sages of India practiced seclusion as a crucial life phase strategy.", created_at:1779245500, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3912}, end: {_id:2007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", keywords:"inspiration,method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Bill Gates utilized seclusion to foster innovation and creativity.", created_at:1779245500, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:2007}, end: {_id:1240}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cI7D2aO34yw)", keywords:"inspiration,method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Steve Jobs adopted seclusion to drive technological advancements.", created_at:1779245500, source_id:"chunk-89ad31026dfac5cb5747676ec6d57a32"}}, {start: {_id:3927}, end: {_id:1256}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"spiritual growth,wealth creation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Business leaders realize that spiritual growth is essential for wealth creation.", created_at:1779245795, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9"}}, {start: {_id:3925}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"mainstream integration,societal adoption", weight:1.0, description:"Spirituality has transitioned from being limited to seekers to being absorbed into mainstream society.", created_at:1779245795, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9"}}, {start: {_id:3926}, end: {_id:3928}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"evolution,new focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Self-help has evolved from motivation to a focus on spiritual experience.", created_at:1779245795, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9"}}, {start: {_id:2647}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)", truncate:"", keywords:"exclusivity,historical limitation,past exclusivity", weight:2.0, description:"Spirituality was historically limited to seekers, but now it is mainstream.<SEP>Spirituality was previously limited to a group called \"seekers,\" reflecting its restricted accessibility in the past.", created_at:1779245894, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-caa27124110ab8f48fb861e8a2ed482e"}}, {start: {_id:2390}, end: {_id:1256}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)", keywords:"holistic success,integration,interconnected,interconnectedness,societal thriving,spiritual growth,spirituality-wealth,wealth creation", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"Spirituality and wealth creation are interconnected for societal thriving.<SEP>Spiritual growth is seen as essential for effective wealth creation by business leaders.<SEP>Wealth creation is framed as inseparable from spiritual values, rejecting material-spiritual divides.<SEP>Wealth creation and spirituality are described as interconnected, not distinct.", created_at:1779246278, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-203b5a3ea5b85d8a381ff6db8958a7d3<SEP>chunk-ec5154bb4ad96ae0dc3ba90ae132dc81<SEP>chunk-bd96767e11f046d35a62e0d27fa43bb7"}}, {start: {_id:2390}, end: {_id:499}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)", keywords:"coping mechanism,necessity,stress management", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Spirituality helps individuals cope with stress.<SEP>Spirituality provides a framework to cope with stress, which is increasingly necessary in modern life.", created_at:1779246006, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-726187f271aa2043554d659991d39748"}}, {start: {_id:1301}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZGvKY4mPfIc)", truncate:"", keywords:"holistic understanding,integration,intelligence,interconnected,interconnectedness,spiritual growth,spirituality,spirituality-intelligence", weight:4.0, description:"Spirituality and intelligence are interconnected and not separate.<SEP>Intelligence emerges as a result of spiritual growth, enabling innovative solutions to complex problems.<SEP>Spirituality and intelligence are interconnected and not separate, representing a unified state of being.<SEP>Spirituality and intelligence are presented as unified, not separate concepts.", created_at:1779246278, source_id:"chunk-56f853a0a75bc670e443ac6d80941ce9<SEP>chunk-ec5154bb4ad96ae0dc3ba90ae132dc81<SEP>chunk-99430e4042493d6e8f0a7ec8dfcc1cb3<SEP>chunk-bd96767e11f046d35a62e0d27fa43bb7"}}] AS row
