one of the most painful experiences of life.", created_at:1779247815, source_id:"chunk-4a6a915d04810354808f8de013c1de1f"}}, {start: {_id:3976}, end: {_id:3973}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"error correction,redundancy removal", weight:1.0, description:"Fixing errors involves eliminating repetitive clauses to enhance clarity and readability.", created_at:1779248043, source_id:"chunk-7876881b163cb9e8fd183208ace12836"}}, {start: {_id:710}, end: {_id:3975}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"clarity improvement,context adaptation", weight:1.0, description:"Rewriting sentences ensures the message accounts for the recipient's disconnected state to improve perception.", created_at:1779248043, source_id:"chunk-7876881b163cb9e8fd183208ace12836"}}, {start: {_id:710}, end: {_id:3974}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"affection perception,emotional state", weight:1.0, description:"Expressing love may not be perceived if the recipient is in a disconnected state.", created_at:1779248043, source_id:"chunk-7876881b163cb9e8fd183208ace12836"}}, {start: {_id:1978}, end: {_id:3973}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"readability,sentence structure", weight:1.0, description:"Attempting to resolve repetitive clauses with punctuation, though it may not fully address the redundancy.", created_at:1779248043, source_id:"chunk-7876881b163cb9e8fd183208ace12836"}}, {start: {_id:2144}, end: {_id:2096}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"error correction,text editing", weight:1.0, description:"The User applies correction methods to fix errors in the Original Text.", created_at:1779248098, source_id:"chunk-6a8565db59854363b13f98314cd08234"}}, {start: {_id:1791}, end: {_id:3978}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", keywords:"audience,dissemination", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The corrected text is shared to the Readers as part of the dissemination process.", created_at:1779248098, source_id:"chunk-6a8565db59854363b13f98314cd08234"}}, {start: {_id:3980}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional growth,self-love", weight:1.0, description:"Love is nurtured by dissolving suffering states and transitioning into love-consciousness.", created_at:1779248217, source_id:"chunk-69c518552350983af20c342ffe0b1ce1"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:3979}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional growth,inner transformation", weight:1.0, description:"Consciously moving into a state of love allows for authentic love experience and sharing.", created_at:1779248217, source_id:"chunk-69c518552350983af20c342ffe0b1ce1"}}, {start: {_id:3981}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", keywords:"intensity comparison", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Love is described as more powerful than the effects of cocaine.", created_at:1779248345, source_id:"chunk-e29b9a0f77294e2d9a7261f00ae497fd"}}] AS row
