UNWIND [{start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", keywords:"experiential capacity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"A human being can experience love and its effects on the brain.", created_at:1779248345, source_id:"chunk-e29b9a0f77294e2d9a7261f00ae497fd"}}, {start: {_id:3982}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek)", keywords:"discussion,research", truncate:"", weight:3.0, description:"The YouTube video discusses the power of love and its comparison to cocaine.<SEP>The video discusses the power of love and its comparison to cocaine.", created_at:1779248378, source_id:"chunk-c6fa90e159adddf741412043b38e2756"}}, {start: {_id:3985}, end: {_id:564}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"mindfulness,remedy", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Serene Mind Practice helps individuals exit disturbed states and consciousness through mindfulness.", created_at:1779248745, source_id:"chunk-c9caee3e34754dd743fb5e0f90ac1a6b"}}, {start: {_id:172}, end: {_id:564}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ_r5sYeTyY)", truncate:"", keywords:"disturbance resolution,practice application", weight:1.0, description:"Students use the Serene Mind Practice to help individuals exit states of inner disturbance.", created_at:1779248783, source_id:"chunk-132b8aaee32a493c686704b9df170e0b"}}, {start: {_id:1892}, end: {_id:564}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ_r5sYeTyY)", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness adjustment,state management", weight:1.0, description:"The practice enables individuals to step out of disturbed states and adjust their consciousness.", created_at:1779248784, source_id:"chunk-132b8aaee32a493c686704b9df170e0b"}}, {start: {_id:1892}, end: {_id:3986}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ_r5sYeTyY)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause and effect,suffering perpetuation", weight:1.0, description:"Disturbed individuals generate suffering that spreads across personal and organizational levels, contributing to global issues.", created_at:1779248784, source_id:"chunk-132b8aaee32a493c686704b9df170e0b"}}, {start: {_id:1358}, end: {_id:564}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CZ_r5sYeTyY)", truncate:"", keywords:"global influence,life transformation", weight:1.0, description:"The practice's three-minute duration creates significant positive changes in personal lives and potentially the world.", created_at:1779248784, source_id:"chunk-132b8aaee32a493c686704b9df170e0b"}}, {start: {_id:3989}, end: {_id:3990}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"pressure,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Mariana Trench's extreme pressure facilitated the transformation of decomposed marine life into fossil fuels over geological timescales.` This seems correct.", created_at:1779249996, source_id:"chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a"}}, {start: {_id:3991}, end: {_id:123}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"extraction,industrialization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Humans extract and process fossil fuels through refineries, driving technological advancements and transportation systems.` This seems correct.", created_at:1779249996, source_id:"chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a"}}, {start: {_id:3993}, end: {_id:3994}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"environmental responsibility,practice", weight:1.0, description:"Practicing sustainability at home is a key action for One Earth Citizens to reduce their ecological footprint.", created_at:1779249996, source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1"}}, {start: {_id:3992}, end: {_id:3987}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"adaptation,endurance,migration,survival", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Bar-headed geese demonstrate remarkable adaptation to survive extreme Himalayan conditions.<SEP>Bar-headed geese effortlessly soar over the Himalayan ranges during migration, demonstrating remarkable adaptability to high-altitude conditions.` This seems correct and well-formed.", created_at:1779249996, source_id:"chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a<SEP>chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:3993}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"global stewardship,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"One Earth Citizens recognize their well-being as tied to Mother Earth's health, fostering collective responsibility.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1"}}, {start: {_id:3988}, end: {_id:123}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"role model,sustainability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Humans are encouraged to adopt Grandmother Earth as a role model for sustainable practices to ensure planetary longevity.` This seems correct.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a"}}, {start: {_id:3996}, end: {_id:295}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"foundation,holistic health", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Living is the basis for well-being, which aligns with environmental stewardship.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1"}}, {start: {_id:3995}, end: {_id:3993}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"community engagement,inspiration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Documenting progress and sharing it within groups helps inspire others to adopt sustainable practices.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1"}}, {start: {_id:3991}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecological balance,energy source,environmental impact,natural cycle,resource dependency,resource extraction,resource origin,resource provision", weight:4.0, description:"Mother Earth's resources, including fossil fuels, highlight the interdependence between human activities and planetary health.` This seems correct.<SEP>Fossil fuels originate from decomposed organic matter processed within \"Mother Earth's womb.\"<SEP>Fossil fuels are derived from Mother Earth but contribute to resource depletion and environmental strain.<SEP>Fossil fuels originate from decomposed organic matter processed within Mother Earth's natural cycles.", created_at:1779252018, source_id:"chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a<SEP>chunk-7c57553df2850654b5a35e1ee26c7149<SEP>chunk-b83c8b00df8935f2c00062b416bf9b2c<SEP>chunk-e1984cc91b0da578d9648e1604a3db60"}}, {start: {_id:1302}, end: {_id:3993}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"motivation,purpose", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"One Earth Citizens act to serve the greater good through sustainable practices.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1"}}, {start: {_id:3989}, end: {_id:3991}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"biological origin,energy resource,energy source,origin,transformation", weight:3.0, description:"Fossil fuels originate from decomposed organic matter through geological processes over millennia.<SEP>Fossil fuels originate from decomposed ancient organisms buried in the ocean, serving as a critical energy source for modern civilization.` This seems correct.<SEP>Decomposed organic matter from creatures transformed into fossil fuels over geological time, serving as an energy source for human civilization.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-6586d0e1f5d54248cb5be73a7d3a343a<SEP>chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668<SEP>chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:295}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", keywords:"dependency,ecological balance,holistic health,interconnectedness,interdependence", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779252204, description:"Human well-being is inseparable from the health of Mother Earth.<SEP>Human well-being is intrinsically linked to the health of Mother Earth.<SEP>Well-being is intrinsically linked to the health of Mother Earth, with the video asserting their inseparability.", source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1<SEP>chunk-9332e7a3f9bcce1d2eddd640a5990242<SEP>chunk-de9bbf67da91036286c4d2bcad673eb7"}}, {start: {_id:3997}, end: {_id:3993}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"community engagement,inspiration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sharing progress in groups fosters collective inspiration for sustainability.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-0b42f74219f351f21f19d957f36b74f1"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:3998}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"interconnectedness,stewardship", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth's cultural processes and ecological balance are foundational to sustainable living practices.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:3999}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"balance,ethics", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth's systems exemplify the balance between power and responsibility in natural cycles.", created_at:1779249997, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668"}}, {start: {_id:3991}, end: {_id:4001}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"dependency,exploitation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human reliance on fossil fuels drives industrial processes but creates ecological challenges.", created_at:1779249998, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668"}}, {start: {_id:4002}, end: {_id:3998}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"action,impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Practicing sustainability at home reduces fossil fuel consumption and supports Earth's replenishment.", created_at:1779249998, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668"}}, {start: {_id:3988}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"metaphor,symbolism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Grandmother Earth symbolizes the Earth's nurturing role and generative power in cultural contexts.", created_at:1779249998, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668"}}, {start: {_id:3993}, end: {_id:3998}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", keywords:"action,identity,responsibility,role", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Adopting the One Earth Citizen identity promotes conscious choices for planetary sustainability.<SEP>One Earth citizens actively engage in sustainability to protect the planet.", created_at:1779251186, source_id:"chunk-bb29e2ed1d32a5cd538be88c0d484668<SEP>chunk-9332e7a3f9bcce1d2eddd640a5990242"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:4004}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", keywords:"interconnection,sustainability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth and other life forms share mutual dependence for prolonged health and survival.", created_at:1779250201, source_id:"chunk-2d0322e7ce560c7699ac3778c3495571"}}, {start: {_id:4013}, end: {_id:4015}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"industrial development,processing", weight:1.0, description:"Human genius led to the creation of refineries for processing fossil fuels into usable products.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:1024}, end: {_id:3988}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"cultural influence,sustainability", weight:1.0, description:"Grandmother Earth is portrayed as setting in motion a culture of sustaining life through its natural processes.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:4013}, end: {_id:4014}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", keywords:"logistics,transportation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human genius resulted in the invention of vessels for transporting fossil fuels globally.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:3988}, end: {_id:4018}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"cultural paradox,human behavior", weight:1.0, description:"The personification of Earth contrasts with the human tendency to cling to uninformed perspectives about natural resources.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:4016}, end: {_id:4013}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"daily use,mechanical innovation", weight:1.0, description:"Human genius developed combustion engines to harness fossil fuels for transportation and daily activities.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:4017}, end: {_id:4013}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"industrial development,processing", weight:1.0, description:"Human ingenuity led to the creation of large-scale factories for refining and processing fossil fuels.", created_at:1779250323, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:3991}, end: {_id:4013}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", keywords:"extraction,utilization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human genius enabled the extraction and industrial use of fossil fuels through technological innovations.", created_at:1779250324, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177"}}, {start: {_id:3991}, end: {_id:3988}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"cultural symbolism,historical legacy,paradox,sustainability", weight:2.0, description:"While Grandmother Earth sustained life originally, fossil fuels represent a paradoxical reliance on decomposed life forms for modern sustainability.<SEP>Grandmother Earth's cultural legacy includes the transformation of ancient life into fossil fuels.", created_at:1779250536, source_id:"chunk-d10d3062cabaaccfc33ac170d7845177<SEP>chunk-29504d0af63a387f3edf40d4bb13cddc"}}, {start: {_id:1193}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecological impact,ecosystem,planetary health,sustainability", weight:2.0, description:"The health of the planet is crucial for the survival and well-being of all life forms, linking location to health.<SEP>The planet's health is directly tied to sustaining life and ecosystems, including forests.", created_at:1779250629, source_id:"chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa<SEP>chunk-82b4b0dbb1bf7ada138b9c4293afb2ad"}}, {start: {_id:4022}, end: {_id:4005}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", keywords:"mitigation,process", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The possibility of slowing down decay and death is explored as a means to achieve prolonged life, connecting these concepts.", created_at:1779250348, source_id:"chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:4021}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"location,manufacturing process,process", weight:2.0, description:"Primary manufacturing is metaphorically located within the \"womb\" of Mother Earth.<SEP>Primary manufacturing is described as occurring inside the womb of Mother Earth, establishing a location and process relationship.", created_at:1779251244, source_id:"chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa<SEP>chunk-6f3e5e132510b3ae3b819a0ab2aeb318"}}, {start: {_id:4005}, end: {_id:4019}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"longevity,scientific exploration", weight:1.0, description:"The discussion includes the potential for prolonging the life of stars through scientific advancements, linking natural objects to the concept.", created_at:1779250348, source_id:"chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa"}}, {start: {_id:4021}, end: {_id:4023}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU)", truncate:"", keywords:"origin,process", weight:1.0, description:"Primary manufacturing is metaphorically located within the \"womb\" of Mother Earth, symbolizing its origin.", created_at:1779250348, source_id:"chunk-8dc923334a22952ab64751bb371544aa"}}] AS row
