hat is being corrected for punctuation and structure.<SEP>Soham and Hamsa are analyzed for their repetition and role in the text's structure.", created_at:1779255741, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2<SEP>chunk-52bc2f160d5933b804fba7010cd61529"}}, {start: {_id:3755}, end: {_id:4149}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual juxtaposition,rhythmic pairing", weight:1.0, description:"\"We come\" is paired with \"Hamsa\" in the corrected text, creating a rhythmic and symbolic structure.", created_at:1779254880, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2"}}, {start: {_id:4148}, end: {_id:2144}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", truncate:"", keywords:"structural analysis,textual correction", weight:1.0, description:"The editing process is applied to the original text to generate readable versions through punctuation and repetition adjustments.", created_at:1779254880, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2"}}, {start: {_id:4139}, end: {_id:4149}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual framing,contextual emphasis", weight:1.0, description:"\"We come\" is positioned alongside \"Soham\" in the corrected versions, reinforcing its role in the mantra-like structure.", created_at:1779254881, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2"}}, {start: {_id:4147}, end: {_id:4148}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)", truncate:"", keywords:"readability enhancement,textual transformation", weight:1.0, description:"The editing process produces corrected versions with improved clarity and grammatical structure.", created_at:1779254881, source_id:"chunk-a9194a082af2660cd6f682f46026e1e2"}}, {start: {_id:4148}, end: {_id:4149}, properties:{file_