 as Mahadurka in the practice.", created_at:1779259271, source_id:"chunk-a348f3e70c609d0d7798352cd61a2781"}}, {start: {_id:1788}, end: {_id:1883}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=207izZBbqVg)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction focus,error targeting", weight:1.0, description:"Text correction focuses on fixing homophones, domain terms, and punctuation in transcription errors.", created_at:1779259271, source_id:"chunk-a348f3e70c609d0d7798352cd61a2781"}}] AS row
