 systems.", created_at:1779263951, source_id:"chunk-0de990c9c98448c49e9565dc513c171a"}}, {start: {_id:4367}, end: {_id:4366}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)", truncate:"", keywords:"destruction,economic impact", weight:1.0, description:"Virus infestations can lead to the destruction of financial structures, causing economic instability.", created_at:1779263985, source_id:"chunk-070ab85d13e241f53294ba4c4f14edc8"}}, {start: {_id:4365}, end: {_id:4354}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)", keywords:"development,implementation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"World leaders are expected to develop and implement sustainable economic solutions to address global challenges.", created_at:1779263985, source_id:"chunk-070ab85d13e241f53294ba4c4f14edc8"}}, {start: {_id:2500}, end: {_id:4366}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)", truncate:"", keywords:"disruption,economic decline", weight:1.0, description:"Virus infestations can result in nations experiencing significant economic decline and disruption.", created_at:1779263985, source_id:"chunk-070ab85d13e241f53294ba4c4f14edc8"}}, {start: {_id:4349}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)", keywords:"greeting,salutation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Pranam Krishnaji and Preethaji are mentioned together in a salutation.", created_at:1779264008, source_id:"chunk-5794169a657bef1dbd99e3cafd5f72b2"}}, {start: {_id:4368}, end: {_id:4346}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M7ItOHTrvz8)", truncate:"", keywords:"economic status,employment", weight:1.0, description:"Rajiv discusses job loss, which is related to his economic status and employment situation.", created_at:1779264008, source_id:"chunk-5794169a657bef1dbd