ch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective potential,enlightenment", weight:1.0, description:"The group is capable of achieving awakening, as stated by the Buddha.", created_at:1779391096, source_id:"chunk-205423882b48f788157f2fc6f5ec5467"}}, {start: {_id:3730}, end: {_id:4431}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective reference,grammatical usage", weight:1.0, description:"Everyone refers to the group as a whole.", created_at:1779391138, source_id:"chunk-abf954b4076fde8130baee4b61745658"}}, {start: {_id:4430}, end: {_id:1335}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual potential,teaching", weight:1.0, description:"The Buddha taught that everyone can be Buddha.", created_at:1779391138, source_id:"chunk-abf954b4076fde8130baee4b61745658"}}, {start: {_id:4429}, end: {_id:4432}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", truncate:"", keywords:"grammatical usage,individual reference", weight:1.0, description:"Every One Of Us refers to each person in the group individually.", created_at:1779391138, source_id:"chunk-abf954b4076fde8130baee4b61745658"}}, {start: {_id:4429}, end: {_id:3730}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", truncate:"", keywords:"grammatical distinction,linguistic analysis", weight:1.0, description:"The distinction between Every One Of Us and Everyone lies in their grammatical usage.", created_at:1779391138, source_id:"chunk-abf954b4076fde8130baee4b61745658"}}, {start: {_id:1335}, end: {_id:4425}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: UNdwPjyLGn0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UNdwPjyLGn0)", truncate:"", keywords:"enlightenment,spiritual potential", weight:1.0, description:"The Buddha asserted that everyone can achieve Buddhahood