 description:"Frustration is a result of inner state, leading to emotional responses.<SEP>Inner state leads to frustration, which can cause emotional outbursts.", created_at:1779397832, source_id:"chunk-2596b0f6fe118e104aa7005b1e2d7f81"}}, {start: {_id:348}, end: {_id:4534}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"contains,source", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video contains the discussed content.", created_at:1779397902, source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944"}}, {start: {_id:2390}, end: {_id:4534}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"discusses,topic", weight:1.0, description:"The content discusses the concept of spirituality.", created_at:1779397903, source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944"}}, {start: {_id:4533}, end: {_id:4534}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"discusses,topic", weight:1.0, description:"The content discusses a transformed way of living.", created_at:1779397903, source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944"}}, {start: {_id:179}, end: {_id:4534}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"discusses,topic", weight:1.0, description:"The content discusses the concept of inner state.", created_at:1779397903, source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944"}}, {start: {_id:2261}, end: {_id:4534}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"discusses,topic", weight:1.0, description:"The content discusses the impact on daily life.", created_at:1779397903, source_id:"chunk-5d8f3893ed8d4a9bbfe512ce1d2b7944"}}, {start: {_id:3648}, end: {_id:4535}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"avoidance,superficiality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Movies and parks symbolize conventional distractions avoided in pursuit of spiritual awareness.", created_at:1779397955, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f"}}, {start: {_id:4536}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional depth,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"Spirituality emphasizes nurturing beauty in relationships as a path to deeper fulfillment.", created_at:1779397955, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f"}}, {start: {_id:238}, end: {_id:449}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"drama,imbalance", weight:1.0, description:"Current relationships are dominated by reactive action and drama rather than intentional beauty.", created_at:1779397955, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f"}}, {start: {_id:2390}, end: {_id:4506}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"contrast,rejection", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Spirituality rejects superficial engagement with life experiences in favor of meaningful connection.", created_at:1779397956, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f"}}, {start: {_id:4536}, end: {_id:4499}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"growth,mindfulness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Cultivating beauty in educational pursuits reflects spiritual intentionality.", created_at:1779397956, source_id:"chunk-70c4972427bbbb91625b1858ddbe811f"}}, {start: {_id:287}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"spirituality,state change", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Changing one's state in life requires spirituality, as life's mechanical nature can only be transformed through spiritual means.", created_at:1779398010, source_id:"chunk-00968a8a5699c4a7cadba065809b18ee"}}, {start: {_id:287}, end: {_id:4539}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral analogy,comparison,metaphor,metaphorical comparison", weight:2.0, description:"Life is metaphorically described as a movie where individuals plan roles for different times of day and social interactions.<SEP>Life is compared to a movie, emphasizing constant role-playing and planning.", created_at:1779398146, source_id:"chunk-00968a8a5699c4a7cadba065809b18ee<SEP>chunk-79200bb3b73a3f0e6cc0591fef7b2d08"}}, {start: {_id:4528}, end: {_id:4544}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"analogy,comparison", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The enlightened state is equated to advanced academic achievements like a master's degree.", created_at:1779398060, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b"}}, {start: {_id:4542}, end: {_id:4525}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"analogy,comparison", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Becoming a happier person parallels the process of undergraduate academic studies.", created_at:1779398060, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b"}}, {start: {_id:4541}, end: {_id:4521}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: KTlY-lHs_Ew (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew)", keywords:"analogy,comparison", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The first stage of spirituality is explicitly compared to first grade in education.", created_at:1779398060, source_id:"chunk-3671b49c0db3dedf797a14f78cb2a87b"}}] AS row
