ht:1.0, description:"Separation is a cause of division, as the text states that separation leads to division in the world.", created_at:1779399359, source_id:"chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa"}}, {start: {_id:1193}, end: {_id:3720}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"liberation,solution", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Achieving Mukthi is presented as a solution to the problems caused by suffering and separation, leading to health.", created_at:1779399359, source_id:"chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa"}}, {start: {_id:284}, end: {_id:1193}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"liberation,solution", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The text implies that health requires connection, as it is linked to moving out of suffering and experiencing deep connection with life and people.", created_at:1779399359, source_id:"chunk-77a2fc8481ea11ffad7cb8ddb5fb08aa"}}, {start: {_id:4563}, end: {_id:4562}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"grammatical correction,idiom adjustment", weight:1.0, description:"\"most part of your life\" is corrected to \"most of your life\" for proper idiom usage.", created_at:1779399432, source_id:"chunk-334fd7ae5c5e2a302187da9543c55e71"}}, {start: {_id:4561}, end: {_id:4564}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"grammatical analysis,stylistic repetition", weight:1.0, description:"The Fourth Paragraph addresses the repetition of \"the actions that you perform\" as stylistically poor but not a direct error.", created_at:1779399432, source_id:"chunk-334fd7ae5c5e2a302187da9543c55e71"}}, {start: {_id:4567}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"contains,content,source", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video is the source of the original text block.", created_at:1779399474, source_id:"chunk-64d54298df57b1892c48a4e852d0c736"}}, {start: {_id:4567}, end: {_id:4565}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"method,requires", weight:1.0, description:"The original text block requires punctuation correction to be properly formatted.", created_at:1779399474, source_id:"chunk-64d54298df57b1892c48a4e852d0c736"}}, {start: {_id:4566}, end: {_id:4567}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"method,requires", weight:1.0, description:"The original text block requires capitalization adjustment for correct grammar.", created_at:1779399474, source_id:"chunk-64d54298df57b1892c48a4e852d0c736"}}, {start: {_id:4567}, end: {_id:4568}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"method,requires", weight:1.0, description:"The original text block requires sentence splitting for readability.", created_at:1779399474, source_id:"chunk-64d54298df57b1892c48a4e852d0c736"}}, {start: {_id:4569}, end: {_id:4570}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"destiny,influence", weight:1.0, description:"The individual state influences the destiny of the planet.", created_at:1779399551, source_id:"chunk-13115d12efdf6f06cb94255cf212ccfd"}}, {start: {_id:1815}, end: {_id:39}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"joy,negative impact", weight:1.0, description:"Actions remove joy.", created_at:1779399551, source_id:"chunk-13115d12efdf6f06cb94255cf212ccfd"}}] AS row
