iption:"The video references the idea of a \"holistic society\" in its narrative.", created_at:1779399578, source_id:"chunk-cade8d11fc8a5595d7c46892ff807c10"}}, {start: {_id:4557}, end: {_id:4574}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"content,thematic focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video advocates for a \"joyful society\" as part of its core message.", created_at:1779399579, source_id:"chunk-cade8d11fc8a5595d7c46892ff807c10"}}, {start: {_id:4557}, end: {_id:4573}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"content,thematic focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video emphasizes the importance of a \"beautiful state of consciousness\" for societal progress.", created_at:1779399579, source_id:"chunk-cade8d11fc8a5595d7c46892ff807c10"}}, {start: {_id:2404}, end: {_id:904}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"disconnection,suffering", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Individuals in suffering experience disconnection and perpetuate planetary division.", created_at:1779399612, source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785"}}, {start: {_id:3720}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective health,liberation", weight:1.0, description:"Planetary health depends on individuals attaining Mukthi and overcoming suffering.", created_at:1779399612, source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785"}}, {start: {_id:2404}, end: {_id:3720}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"liberation,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Individuals achieving Mukthi can heal the planet and create collective well-being.", created_at:1779399612, source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785"}}, {start: {_id:4020}, end: {_id:4578}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"disease,metaphor", weight:1.0, description:"The planet's diseased state is metaphorically described using the concept of a virus.", created_at:1779399612, source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785"}}, {start: {_id:3898}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"disease,ecological collapse,emergence,metaphor", weight:2.0, description:"The planet's disease is metaphorically linked to bacteria, symbolizing separation and suffering.<SEP>Emerging bacteria reflect the planet's ecological degradation and destruction.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785<SEP>chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}, {start: {_id:2404}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"destiny,state", weight:1.0, description:"Individual states directly influence the planet's destiny and health.", created_at:1779399612, source_id:"chunk-1a7e64bb8a0d59d10204b5dfcccfe785"}}, {start: {_id:4580}, end: {_id:4581}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"causes", weight:1.0, description:"Actions in family, organization, or community lead to more suffering.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc"}}, {start: {_id:4579}, end: {_id:4582}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"enables", weight:1.0, description:"Experiencing life from a beautiful state of consciousness enables contributing to the planet's greatness.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc"}}, {start: {_id:3720}, end: {_id:4583}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"contributing", weight:1.0, description:"Mukthi is a state that the planet thirsts for, contributing to the planet's greatness.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc"}}, {start: {_id:4579}, end: {_id:4584}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"leads to", weight:1.0, description:"Nurturing a beautiful state of consciousness leads to a happier society.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc"}}, {start: {_id:2207}, end: {_id:3720}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", keywords:"state of liberation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human Being is in a state of Mukthi, which is a state of liberation.", created_at:1779399656, source_id:"chunk-82a093ab08d9f314edca90dbf19072fc"}}, {start: {_id:4586}, end: {_id:4585}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pTnZt0SqDFM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTnZt0SqDFM)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction,language analysis", weight:1.0, description:"Original phrase \"for a suffering\" is corrected to \"in suffering\" for grammatical accuracy and proper preposition usage.", created_at:1779399678, source_id:"chunk-aba1fa51c438208d47c78877a58241d4"}}] AS row
