cate:"", keywords:"readability impact,textual flaw", weight:1.0, description:"Punctuation errors are identified as flaws in the text's structure during analysis.", created_at:1779402734, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28"}}, {start: {_id:3032}, end: {_id:4619}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"existential metaphor,natural process", weight:1.0, description:"Raindrops are described as \"rivulets of existence\" to illustrate pure being.", created_at:1779402734, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28"}}, {start: {_id:1619}, end: {_id:4638}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", keywords:"critique,platform content", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The analysis critiques content relevant to the Mukthi Guru platform's stylistic and philosophical themes.", created_at:1779402734, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28"}}, {start: {_id:4639}, end: {_id:4050}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"grammatical correction,punctuation error", weight:1.0, description:"Error 3 refers to a punctuation error in the sentence structure, highlighting the need for proper punctuation placement.", created_at:1779402734, source_id:"chunk-8ac203494cdcc9d8041ac912b2411f28"}}, {start: {_id:4640}, end: {_id:3032}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"existence,metaphorical connection,natural phenomena,philosophical symbolism", weight:2.0, description:"Raindrops are equated to rivulets of existence, emphasizing their role in existential contemplation.<SEP>Raindrops are equated to \"rivulets of existence\" in the text.", created_at:1779402818, source_id:"chunk-e94d81180e7457d6f36d99965cfbf34d<SEP>chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b"}}, {start: {_id:32}, end: {_id:1932}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecological function,symbolic analysis", weight:1.0, description:"The tree's purpose is analyzed as serving life forms and Earth's ecosystem.", created_at:1779402818, source_id:"chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b"}}, {start: {_id:1071}, end: {_id:1932}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", truncate:"", keywords:"dependence,ecological interdependence,foundation,grounding,habitat,metaphor,stability", weight:4.0, description:"The tree's existence is necessary for Earth's ecological balance and life forms.<SEP>The tree's roots are metaphorically connected to the earth, symbolizing the need for a strong foundation.<SEP>The tree's strength and stability derive from its roots being firmly anchored to the earth, mirroring how consciousness grounds human resilience.<SEP>The tree draws strength and stability from its connection to the earth through roots.", created_at:1779654075, source_id:"chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b<SEP>chunk-56da25e7d132b4ecea54c551b7809f75<SEP>chunk-e5d8a73bfe09b1e5fab115705dfa0fe7<SEP>chunk-46d6abd520d390d99cea37e408f7a403"}}, {start: {_id:4609}, end: {_id:4624}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"abstract concepts,existential themes", weight:1.0, description:"The video interrogates the concept of meaning in existence through rhetorical questions.", created_at:1779402818, source_id:"chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b"}}, {start: {_id:3882}, end: {_id:4609}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"existential questioning,human experience", weight:1.0, description:"Breathing is questioned for its intrinsic meaning in the context of existence.", created_at:1779402818, source_id:"chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b"}}, {start: {_id:4609}, end: {_id:2805}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"daily actions,existential inquiry", weight:1.0, description:"Waking up is analyzed for its potential significance in defining existence.", created_at:1779402819, source_id:"chunk-89ddb9ac19fba38ddebc97bcf3b40b3b"}}] AS row
