om/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,examples", weight:1.0, description:"Option B contains a list of bullet points that serve as examples of philosophical questions.", created_at:1779402946, source_id:"chunk-aac1bdddfdcc88e00e0c6a72738f4426"}}, {start: {_id:4645}, end: {_id:4646}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", keywords:"alternative approaches", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Option A and Option B are presented as alternative methods for handling the scenario.", created_at:1779402946, source_id:"chunk-aac1bdddfdcc88e00e0c6a72738f4426"}}, {start: {_id:4648}, end: {_id:1071}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", keywords:"nourishing,sustenance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The drop of water nourishes the earth, symbolizing sustenance and life support.", created_at:1779402976, source_id:"chunk-a9f29aa70d2aed842238204adf8a81c5"}}, {start: {_id:4283}, end: {_id:4650}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,positivity", weight:1.0, description:"A smile can bring joy and positivity to someone else's face, creating a positive emotional impact.", created_at:1779402976, source_id:"chunk-a9f29aa70d2aed842238204adf8a81c5"}}, {start: {_id:4657}, end: {_id:2371}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", keywords:"cosmic understanding,science,understanding,validation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Science validates the existence of the universal Field, bridging empirical knowledge and spiritual truth.<SEP>Science helps to understand the field and its response to human actions.", created_at:1779404149, source_id:"chunk-3269918410ef2996ad74d621f6f6159f<SEP>chunk-a20fa03637522df32905bf3e04315780"}}] AS row
