iolence, intolerance, and exploitation.", created_at:1779404411, source_id:"chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939"}}, {start: {_id:1071}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"environmental harmony,global impact", weight:1.0, description:"Radiating peace is linked to addressing negative forces affecting the Earth.", created_at:1779404412, source_id:"chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939"}}, {start: {_id:4686}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"contrast,respite", weight:1.0, description:"Peace is presented as a brief respite between chaotic events in life.", created_at:1779404412, source_id:"chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939"}}, {start: {_id:1474}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: uNkgwv4dqEs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNkgwv4dqEs)", truncate:"", keywords:"awakening,harmony,outcome,philosophical connection,result,spiritual outcome,transformative goal,transformative result", weight:4.0, description:"Awakening emphasizes peace as a transformative force to counter negative forces.<SEP>Awakening leads to peace and love as described in the prompt.<SEP>Awakening to peace involves achieving a state of harmony and tranquility.<SEP>Awakening results in an extraordinary state of peace.", created_at:1779453405, source_id:"chunk-57d159fcbeb4a2d1b510ba7e5557d939<SEP>chunk-67c71335838e7d9c72ee9c00d04337d4<SEP>chunk-06677578ca40c691ebe5110657b20260<SEP>chunk-33d7c3c80b54f2e14938cedf8a3a292d"}}, {start: {_id:4655}, end: {_id:4689}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"auspiciousness,event timing", weight:1.0, description:"The seventh day of the Peace Festival is highlighted as an auspicious occasion for the speaker's participation.", created_at:1779404456, source_id:"chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994"}}, {start: {_id:4690}, end: {_id:2371}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"universal truth,validation", weight:1.0, description:"Science is validating what was intuitively known about humanity's connection to a universal field.", created_at:1779404457, source_id:"chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994"}}, {start: {_id:4653}, end: {_id:1782}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"conversation significance,kinship", weight:1.0, description:"The speaker felt great kinship with Craig and believed their conversation would mean a lot to the audience.", created_at:1779404457, source_id:"chunk-bbe524f38300203502fa50c361b4f994"}}, {start: {_id:2468}, end: {_id:4676}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual discussion,content presentation", weight:1.0, description:"The video presents the Field of Energy as a foundational concept in its narrative about human connection and existence.", created_at:1779404474, source_id:"chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1"}}, {start: {_id:2468}, end: {_id:4658}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"intentional influence,metaphysical interaction", weight:1.0, description:"The formation of the Global Family is described as infusing the Field of Energy with human aspirations and emotions.", created_at:1779404474, source_id:"chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1"}}, {start: {_id:251}, end: {_id:4676}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual discussion,content presentation", weight:1.0, description:"The video discusses the Field of Consciousness as an extension of collective human awareness and its role in unity.", created_at:1779404474, source_id:"chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1"}}, {start: {_id:2468}, end: {_id:784}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: AyUE-2Uh5Vg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg)", truncate:"", keywords:"atomic composition,metaphysical connection", weight:1.0, description:"The human body's atoms and molecules are described as constantly emerging from and collapsing into the field of energy, illustrating a fundamental unity between biological existence and universal energy.", created_at:1779404474, source_id:"chunk-f4e78af21ffa64a146419829fbc464c1"}}] AS row
