lightenment Experience is a key component of the paradigm shift.", created_at:1779420638, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4965}, end: {_id:4964}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"density,origin", weight:1.0, description:"Zero Point and Pure Love are foundational concepts related to the origin and density.", created_at:1779420638, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4952}, end: {_id:4960}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"cooperation,shift", weight:1.0, description:"Comparison-Driven is part of the first paradigm shift from cooperation-driven.", created_at:1779420638, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4954}, end: {_id:4960}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"comparison,shift", weight:1.0, description:"Cooperation-Driven is the target state in the first paradigm shift.", created_at:1779420638, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:2578}, end: {_id:4973}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"shifts,unrest", weight:1.0, description:"Economic Unrest is addressed through shifts in thinking and action.", created_at:1779420639, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4960}, end: {_id:4953}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"purpose,shift", weight:1.0, description:"Pleasure-Driven is part of the second paradigm shift from purpose-driven.", created_at:1779420639, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4960}, end: {_id:4955}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"pleasure,shift", weight:1.0, description:"Purpose-Driven is the target state in the second paradigm shift.", created_at:1779420639, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4960}, end: {_id:4956}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"oneness,shift", weight:1.0, description:"Separation-Driven is part of the ultimate paradigm shift from oneness-driven.", created_at:1779420639, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:4958}, end: {_id:4960}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"separation,shift", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness-Driven is the target state in the ultimate paradigm shift.", created_at:1779420639, source_id:"chunk-4f108a1313b1da3a2fa234ff5f49d6e5"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:4967}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional distance,separation", weight:1.0, description:"Pain and suffering arise from separation from love, not as love's direct opposite.", created_at:1779420694, source_id:"chunk-44b4ed2b95749854883160c9435c1c98"}}, {start: {_id:4975}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"destructive behavior,separation", weight:1.0, description:"Anger and hostility are presented as outcomes of separation from love, not its antithesis.", created_at:1779420694, source_id:"chunk-44b4ed2b95749854883160c9435c1c98"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:4969}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual progression,transcendence,unity", weight:2.0, description:"Achieving \"one mind in one heart\" results from overcoming separation and aligning with love's universal nature.<SEP>Approaching love fosters unity of consciousness, as described in the text.", created_at:1779420973, source_id:"chunk-44b4ed2b95749854883160c9435c1c98<SEP>chunk-af881796b97d19f020179697b9daf675"}}, {start: {_id:4950}, end: {_id:4978}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", keywords:"participant,speaker", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Dr. Joe Dispenza is a featured participant and speaker in the YouTube video.", created_at:1779420719, source_id:"chunk-dcbde403840148f165365cfd6299b08f"}}, {start: {_id:4943}, end: {_id:4978}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion topic,leadership philosophy", weight:1.0, description:"The video explores the concept of a conscious political leader viewing their country as family.", created_at:1779420719, source_id:"chunk-dcbde403840148f165365cfd6299b08f"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:4978}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QAnRefsK-3Y (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QAnRefsK-3Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecological perspective,metaphor", weight:1.0, description:"The video frames Earth and its inhabitants as a unified family system requiring collective care.", created_at:1779420719, source_id:"chunk-dcbde403840148f165365cfd6299b08f"}}] AS row
