UNWIND [{start: {_id:1432}, end: {_id:1500}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"correction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The term \"Field of Abundance\" in the text is an error that should be corrected to \"Limitless Field.\"", created_at:1779435021, source_id:"chunk-f75a0e9daa5e637539a5dd564ff6b877"}}, {start: {_id:1432}, end: {_id:5106}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"hosting,location", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The next Field of Abundance is located in Los Angeles.", created_at:1779435021, source_id:"chunk-f7e5ecaab61ab54b9302cd0d698fd41a"}}, {start: {_id:1432}, end: {_id:4291}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"interest,participation,tool provision", weight:2.0, description:"The father participated in the Field of Abundance, which provided tools for connecting with his inner self.<SEP>The father is interested in the next Field of Abundance in Los Angeles for his sons.", created_at:1779435021, source_id:"chunk-f7e5ecaab61ab54b9302cd0d698fd41a"}}, {start: {_id:860}, end: {_id:1620}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"influence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Friends influence the decision to attend the event, which is observed by the Text Correction Expert.", created_at:1779435070, source_id:"chunk-f75a0e9daa5e637539a5dd564ff6b877"}}, {start: {_id:5105}, end: {_id:1620}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"observation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Text Correction Expert observes the Father-Daughter Relationship in the text.", created_at:1779435070, source_id:"chunk-f75a0e9daa5e637539a5dd564ff6b877"}}, {start: {_id:862}, end: {_id:81}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: y2ZgKdt4Cj0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y2ZgKdt4Cj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"separation,strained relationship", weight:1.0, description:"The narrator describes a distant and unclose relationship with their daughter, marked by emotional separation.", created_at:1779435139, source_id:"chunk-84c6a3d9c8b4cde9bffa20b37bd7d9c0"}}, {start: {_id:1432}, end: {_id:81}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: y2ZgKdt4Cj0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y2ZgKdt4Cj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"attending,seeking connection", weight:1.0, description:"The narrator attended the Field of Abundance to connect with their daughter and father.", created_at:1779435140, source_id:"chunk-84c6a3d9c8b4cde9bffa20b37bd7d9c0"}}, {start: {_id:862}, end: {_id:1432}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: y2ZgKdt4Cj0 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y2ZgKdt4Cj0)", keywords:"attending,family activity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The daughter attended the Field of Abundance with the narrator and father as part of a family effort.", created_at:1779435140, source_id:"chunk-84c6a3d9c8b4cde9bffa20b37bd7d9c0"}}, {start: {_id:5108}, end: {_id:5107}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cause-and-effect,concept", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The concept of one butterfly flapping its wings causing a hurricane is contrasted with the concept of one stone changing the course of an entire river.", created_at:1779436312, source_id:"chunk-316ba27d464629159f19769b7b42f8cc"}}, {start: {_id:5109}, end: {_id:5110}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"concept,thematic link", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The field of abundance is described as being about discovering harm within oneself, connection with the other, and creation of abundance, which is part of the interconnected web of life.", created_at:1779436312, source_id:"chunk-316ba27d464629159f19769b7b42f8cc"}}, {start: {_id:5111}, end: {_id:5110}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"grammatical structure", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The field of abundance is analyzed for its punctuation, specifically the use of commas in a list.", created_at:1779436312, source_id:"chunk-316ba27d464629159f19769b7b42f8cc"}}, {start: {_id:5107}, end: {_id:5111}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"grammatical structure", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The concept of one stone changing the course of an entire river is analyzed for its punctuation and capitalization.", created_at:1779436312, source_id:"chunk-316ba27d464629159f19769b7b42f8cc"}}, {start: {_id:5108}, end: {_id:5111}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"grammatical structure", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The concept of one butterfly flapping its wings causing a hurricane is analyzed for its punctuation and capitalization.", created_at:1779436312, source_id:"chunk-316ba27d464629159f19769b7b42f8cc"}}, {start: {_id:1432}, end: {_id:4887}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"application,aspect,component,content,context,element,feature,part,purpose,style,theme", weight:50.0, description:"The Field of Abundance is a concept within spiritual writing that functions as a thematic example and a thematic theme of spiritual writing's goals. It is also described as a component, element, aspect, feature, and part of spiritual writing, underscoring its multifaceted role.

Spiritual writing, in turn, is a method that encompasses the Field of Abundance concept, is applied through the Field of Abundance framework, and", created_at:1779436330, source_id:"chunk-3dec9ae2729a31a5655fed97d0a0165a"}}, {start: {_id:5115}, end: {_id:5109}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 2JL1ZgMS7nY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2JL1ZgMS7nY)", truncate:"", keywords:"interconnectedness,ripple effect", weight:1.0, description:"Conscious and compassionate actions in one part of the web create massive effects across the entire system.", created_at:1779436362, source_id:"chunk-62f545b8a18583cad0e4d9409246e40c"}}, {start: {_id:5113}, end: {_id:5109}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 2JL1ZgMS7nY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2JL1ZgMS7nY)", keywords:"cause-effect,example", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Butterfly effect exemplifies the interconnected web's cause-effect dynamics.", created_at:1779436363, source_id:"chunk-62f545b8a18583cad0e4d9409246e40c"}}, {start: {_id:5109}, end: {_id:5114}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 2JL1ZgMS7nY (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2JL1ZgMS7nY)", keywords:"example,systemic impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Stone and river metaphor illustrates systemic impact within the interconnected web.", created_at:1779436363, source_id:"chunk-62f545b8a18583cad0e4d9409246e40c"}}, {start: {_id:1820}, end: {_id:5117}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: LrMyaDh_MSo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LrMyaDh_MSo)", keywords:"energy activation,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The challenge involves experiencing Kundalini awakenings through chakra-focused yoga.<SEP>The challenge involves experiencing Kundalini energy awakenings as part of its spiritual practices.", created_at:1779438770, source_id:"chunk-e498b48686581e075f9dda4ece13a213<SEP>chunk-137d57cb5d3f1e7f343f8ada3151e285"}}, {start: {_id:5118}, end: {_id:1820}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: LrMyaDh_MSo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LrMyaDh_MSo)", truncate:"", keywords:"mystical experience,spiritual imagery,symbolic manifestation,symbolism", weight:2.0, description:"Kundalini energy is associated with visions of the Great Serpent Fire during its rise.<SEP>The Great Serpent Fire is a symbolic representation of Kundalini energy manifesting as mystic visions during the challenge.", created_at:1779438770, source_id:"chunk-e498b48686581e075f9dda4ece13a213<SEP>chunk-137d57cb5d3f1e7f343f8ada3151e285"}}, {start: {_id:5117}, end: {_id:5119}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LrMyaDh_MSo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LrMyaDh_MSo)", truncate:"", keywords:"content source,educational material", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube video discusses and explains aspects of the Oneness Chakra Yoga Challenge, including Kundalini experiences.", created_at:1779438770, source_id:"chunk-137d57cb5d3f1e7f343f8ada3151e285"}}] AS row
