tion:"The peaceful world contrasts with the reality of domestic violence and suffering.", created_at:1779445477, source_id:"chunk-7f34b765e8eccb327fac73e52a1c873a"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:640}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"causation,destruction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Dissatisfaction leads to addictions, which are destructive.", created_at:1779447130, source_id:"chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc"}}, {start: {_id:5273}, end: {_id:930}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"dissatisfaction,psychological state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Youth experience dissatisfaction due to disconnected consciousness.", created_at:1779447130, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:5274}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,consciousness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders must awaken consciousness to peace for societal transformation.", created_at:1779447130, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:5278}, end: {_id:657}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cycle,prevention", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The vicious cycle prevents finding meaning or purpose in life.", created_at:1779447130, source_id:"chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc"}}, {start: {_id:5274}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,consciousness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders must awaken consciousness to love for interconnectedness.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:5274}, end: {_id:5275}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,consciousness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders must awaken consciousness to a greater purpose for leadership.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:657}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)", truncate:"", keywords:"association,consumption,cycle,dependency,entrapment,integration,self-perpetuating,self-perpetuation", weight:5.0, created_at:1779447637, description:"Addictions create a vicious cycle where individuals become trapped, unable to find meaning or achieve fulfillment.<SEP>Addictions create a vicious cycle consuming individuals physically/emotionally.<SEP>Addictions form a vicious cycle, which prevents achieving meaning in life.<SEP>Addictions create a cycle that consumes individuals and prevents meaningful achievement.<SEP>Addictions create a self-sustaining cycle that consumes individuals and prevents escape, perpetuating physical and emotional decline.", source_id:"chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc<SEP>chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7<SEP>chunk-e53aa20908f0e3dc300b2226e52897f3<SEP>chunk-e27c90d3f030c932363441c1ed78bf62<SEP>chunk-fafff025e01a29bbcee9969fc4559382"}}, {start: {_id:5274}, end: {_id:4498}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)", keywords:"domain,leadership,professional field", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Future leaders will govern politics to drive societal progress.<SEP>Future leaders apply awakened consciousness in political leadership.", created_at:1779447486, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7<SEP>chunk-e27c90d3f030c932363441c1ed78bf62"}}, {start: {_id:5277}, end: {_id:5273}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"behavior,cause", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Dissatisfaction state leads to a disconnected mindset, manifesting as destructive and hurtful paths.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-e53aa20908f0e3dc300b2226e52897f3"}}, {start: {_id:44}, end: {_id:5274}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"domain,leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders will lead business to foster economic stability.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:5273}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause,causes,consequence,destructive cycle,progression,psychological effect", weight:3.0, description:"Dissatisfaction state leads to addictions, which perpetuate a self-destructive cycle that erodes purpose and meaning in life.<SEP>Dissatisfaction state leads to addictions as a coping mechanism.<SEP>Dissatisfaction drives individuals toward addictive behaviors as a coping mechanism.", created_at:1779447486, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7<SEP>chunk-e53aa20908f0e3dc300b2226e52897f3<SEP>chunk-e27c90d3f030c932363441c1ed78bf62"}}, {start: {_id:5274}, end: {_id:2390}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"domain,leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders will guide spirituality for holistic development.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:5274}, end: {_id:5276}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"domain,leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders will engage in social work to address community needs.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-fd0cf329c3a40648553339d60f0ac0b7"}}, {start: {_id:5279}, end: {_id:5273}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral outcome,causal relationship", weight:1.0, description:"Disconnected consciousness directly causes dissatisfaction leading to self-destruction.", created_at:1779447326, source_id:"chunk-390580a8c4bf54c69179d629a432021f"}}] AS row
