UNWIND [{start: {_id:5351}, end: {_id:4973}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"internal transformation,self-awareness", weight:1.0, description:"Solutions are born within individuals, requiring internal focus rather than external problem-solving.", created_at:1779455329, source_id:"chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292"}}, {start: {_id:5346}, end: {_id:4625}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"conflict resolution,confrontation,internal change,resolution", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The mental infection of violence necessitates spiritual awakening to transform human behavior.<SEP>The text suggests that overcoming the mental infection requires spiritual awakening and inner conquest.", created_at:1779455647, source_id:"chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292<SEP>chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e"}}, {start: {_id:430}, end: {_id:4625}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"purity,spiritual foundation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Maintaining childhood purity is linked to spiritual growth and collective peace.", created_at:1779455329, source_id:"chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292"}}, {start: {_id:5347}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"peace advocacy,spiritual leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Preethaji advocates for collective peace to foster harmony and prevent external conflicts.", created_at:1779455349, source_id:"chunk-c31c96b585957b3d969c1f44467db292"}}, {start: {_id:3952}, end: {_id:2018}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"focus area,task", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Fixing transcription errors is a task with focus areas including homophones, domain terms, and punctuation.", created_at:1779455474, source_id:"chunk-40386efc054d2a63eab72a4be3e3ca8d"}}, {start: {_id:3952}, end: {_id:1684}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"focus area,task component", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Homophones and misheard words are a focus area for the task of fixing transcription errors.", created_at:1779455475, source_id:"chunk-40386efc054d2a63eab72a4be3e3ca8d"}}, {start: {_id:3952}, end: {_id:1685}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"focus area,task component", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Domain-specific names and terms are a focus area for the task of fixing transcription errors.", created_at:1779455475, source_id:"chunk-40386efc054d2a63eab72a4be3e3ca8d"}}, {start: {_id:3952}, end: {_id:1760}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"focus area,task component", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Punctuation and capitalization are a focus area for the task of fixing transcription errors.", created_at:1779455475, source_id:"chunk-40386efc054d2a63eab72a4be3e3ca8d"}}, {start: {_id:3952}, end: {_id:1789}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"guidelines,task constraints", weight:1.0, description:"Constraints are guidelines for the text correction task.", created_at:1779455475, source_id:"chunk-40386efc054d2a63eab72a4be3e3ca8d"}}, {start: {_id:1500}, end: {_id:5355}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"capitalization,consistency", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Inconsistent capitalization in \"limitless Field\" is corrected to \"Limitless Field\" for conceptual clarity.", created_at:1779455617, source_id:"chunk-8e11843c5e5d416ebb2d563613787d4b"}}, {start: {_id:5354}, end: {_id:1500}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,source", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube video mentions the term \"Limitless Field\" with corrected capitalization.", created_at:1779455626, source_id:"chunk-8e11843c5e5d416ebb2d563613787d4b"}}, {start: {_id:5346}, end: {_id:5357}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"psychological origin,root cause", weight:1.0, description:"Wars are instigated by the internal \"war within our minds\" driven by violent mental states.", created_at:1779455647, source_id:"chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e"}}, {start: {_id:5356}, end: {_id:5358}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"global priorities,resource allocation", weight:1.0, description:"The statement suggests that resources spent on war preparation could instead resolve drinking water issues.", created_at:1779455647, source_id:"chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e"}}, {start: {_id:5346}, end: {_id:5359}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"internal conflict,manifestation", weight:1.0, description:"The mental infection of violence creates a violent battleground in every person's mind and heart.", created_at:1779455647, source_id:"chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e"}}, {start: {_id:2582}, end: {_id:5346}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"comparison,danger level,severity", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The mental infection of violence is described as \"much more dangerous\" than hiding from COVID, highlighting its pervasive nature.<SEP>The text equates the mental infection of violence to COVID, framing both as dangerous, pervasive threats.", created_at:1779455773, source_id:"chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e<SEP>chunk-e1d5e0073f33e1ee1857e1f6302d5b7f"}}, {start: {_id:5346}, end: {_id:5361}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"continuity,transmission", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The infection has been passed through generations and communities, indicating its persistent and contagious nature.", created_at:1779455648, source_id:"chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e"}}, {start: {_id:5346}, end: {_id:5362}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", keywords:"inescapability,inevitability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The statement \"You can't hide from it\" underscores the inescapable reality of confronting the mental infection.", created_at:1779455648, source_id:"chunk-195432225c839e4aa9996bf06701d94e"}}, {start: {_id:5345}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction,domain-specific term", weight:1.0, description:"ACOM is mentioned in the video but should be replaced with \"Ekam\" in the context of peace meditators.", created_at:1779455727, source_id:"chunk-967a1ebc79cd7d83afc2b43d42c8ab36"}}, {start: {_id:5367}, end: {_id:5366}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)", truncate:"", keywords:"funding allocation,global impact", weight:1.0, description:"A small percentage of war spending could end global starvation.", created_at:1779455745, source_id:"chunk-3a7068f2a209054e42abe5d72250029a"}}, {start: {_id:5356}, end: {_id:5366}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 4LIZkNHlNaM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4LIZkNHlNaM)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"financial impact,humanitarian needs,resource allocation,resource reallocation", weight:2.0, description:"Minimal war spending could resolve drinking water issues worldwide.<SEP>Less than 1% of war spending could resolve global drinking water issues.", created_at:1779519923, source_id:"chunk-3a7068f2a209054e42abe5d72250029a<SEP>chunk-7abe568e63ed3025b11ad246b7eb6e12"}}] AS row
