youtube.com/watch?v=qDSfb0DZ0PE)", keywords:"facilitation,mystic space", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Entity A is created as a mystic space to facilitate human awakening processes.\" Here, \"awakening\" is part of the relationship description but not an entity. However, in the input text, \"awakening\" is a central concept. The input says \"awakening experiences\", \"awakening to God, realization, and Self-realization\", \"awakening is the evolution for which you have prepared for several lifetimes.\" So \"awakening\" is a key concept that should be an entity.", created_at:1779519775, source_id:"chunk-2d6aa6f1c06baa8bf16178bfef309ddc"}}, {start: {_id:4677}, end: {_id:5610}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: qDSfb0DZ0PE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDSfb0DZ0PE)", truncate:"", keywords:"enduring solutions,problem-solving", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness consciousness enables political solutions through evolved consciousness.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-2d6aa6f1c06baa8bf16178bfef309ddc"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:4423}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: qDSfb0DZ0PE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDSfb0DZ0PE)", keywords:"future,rejuvenation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Awakening offers Mother Earth a chance to rejuvenate and thrive in the future.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-2d6aa6f1c06baa8bf16178bfef309ddc"}}, {start: {_id:5587}, end: {_id:5593}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", truncate:"", keywords:"correlation,discussion topic", weight:1.0, description:"The video connects mental illness trends to societal and ancestral influences.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:4677}, end: {_id:5611}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: qDSfb0DZ0PE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDSfb0DZ0PE)", truncate:"", keywords:"enduring solutions,problem-solving", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness consciousness enables financial solutions through evolved consciousness.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-2d6aa6f1c06baa8bf16178bfef309ddc"}}, {start: {_id:89}, end: {_id:5595}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", truncate:"", keywords:"developmental concern,emotional expression", weight:1.0, description:"Young children exhibit anger, indicating early signs of psychological distress.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:371}, end: {_id:5593}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion topic,generational focus", weight:1.0, description:"The video highlights loneliness as a key issue among youngsters.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:3704}, end: {_id:5593}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", keywords:"discussion topic,legacy", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video explores how ancestral legacies shape current collective consciousness.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:4677}, end: {_id:5612}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: qDSfb0DZ0PE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDSfb0DZ0PE)", truncate:"", keywords:"enduring solutions,problem-solving", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness consciousness enables environmental solutions through evolved consciousness.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-2d6aa6f1c06baa8bf16178bfef309ddc"}}, {start: {_id:5594}, end: {_id:3704}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", truncate:"", keywords:"impact projection,transformation", weight:1.0, description:"The number represents attendees expected to positively influence collective consciousness through enlightenment.", created_at:1779519776, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:3274}, end: {_id:3704}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", keywords:"legacy,transmission", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ancestors' suffering is transmitted through generations, affecting current mental health trends.", created_at:1779519777, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:3274}, end: {_id:5587}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: LapJqYf9hzI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LapJqYf9hzI)", truncate:"", keywords:"cyclical impact,historical influence", weight:1.0, description:"Ancestors' suffering manifests as mental health issues in present generations.", created_at:1779519778, source_id:"chunk-b4ef0432d09dd625d180cc94f3e0ef2e"}}, {start: {_id:5617}, end: {_id:5614}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: 3WnNyhhB_4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WnNyhhB_4w)", keywords:"high,romantic love", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Romantic love is associated with the romantic high.", created_at:1779519834, source_id:"chunk-811e6c42c9ccf4bfac70459d1ccf2336"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:2753}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: 3WnNyhhB_4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WnNyhhB_4w)<SEP>YouTube Video: ajMAwlKh3YM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ajMAwlKh3YM)", keywords:"aspect,comparison,component,contrast,limitation,love,non-dependence,pleasure,transcendence", truncate:"", weight:5.0, description:"Love is distinguished from pleasure, which is transient and partial, while love encompasses empathy and enduring connection.<SEP>Pleasure is acknowledged as a small, fleeting part of love but not its essence.<SEP>Pleasure is a fleeting part of love, while love is a deeper heartfelt connection.<SEP>Pleasure is a fleeting aspect of love, while love encompasses deeper emotional connection and empathy.<SEP>Love is distinguished from pleasure-driven motivations, emphasizing its independence.", created_at:1779557206, source_id:"chunk-30e3bfda839778033ca7e4ddfabb670b<SEP>chunk-811e6c42c9ccf4bfac70459d1ccf2336<SEP>chunk-463088ccb7af0ca596d7f4a288f68a78<SEP>chunk-1d477f5607ac5cfb56e2b711bd58f1aa"}}, {start: {_id:5613}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"consciousness shift,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Love's awakening represents a revolutionary shift in consciousness beyond superficial desires.", created_at:1779519834, source_id:"chunk-30e3bfda839778033ca7e4ddfabb670b"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
