are all present.", created_at:1779555314, source_id:"chunk-2996cf05c59c4a2d1ccea6c5e1750952"}}, {start: {_id:311}, end: {_id:6080}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", keywords:"cause-effect,decision-making", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The stressful state leads to repetitive thinking and unwise decisions due to mental clutter.", created_at:1779555314, source_id:"chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5"}}, {start: {_id:3333}, end: {_id:311}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", keywords:"disconnection,inability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In a stressful state, one cannot fully experience life or connect with others' feelings.", created_at:1779555314, source_id:"chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5"}}, {start: {_id:2373}, end: {_id:311}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", keywords:"cause-effect,mental state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The stressful state leads to repetitive, unproductive thoughts due to mental clutter.", created_at:1779555314, source_id:"chunk-19daeaae096340ea0105da39649682b5"}}, {start: {_id:6077}, end: {_id:311}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", truncate:"", keywords:"glucose release,physiological response", weight:1.0, description:"Chronic stress triggers excessive glucose release as a survival mechanism.", created_at:1779555314, source_id:"chunk-2996cf05c59c4a2d1ccea6c5e1750952"}}, {start: {_id:6077}, end: {_id:6078}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: U23yKxWbIcI (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI)", truncate:"", keywords:"hormonal regulation,metabolic impact", weight:1.0, description:"Elevated glucose increases insulin production, straining bodily systems.", created_at:1779555314, source_id:"chunk-2996cf05c59c4a2d1ccea6c5e1750