/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"harmony,resource-sharing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"One is Consciousness manifests as global harmony and equitable resource distribution in the Committee of Nations.", created_at:1779560120, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2"}}, {start: {_id:1389}, end: {_id:544}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"empathy,leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The man?s connection to employees inspired vitality and commitment, revitalizing the company?s culture.", created_at:1779560120, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2"}}, {start: {_id:1317}, end: {_id:544}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"collective growth,respect", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The man?s bond with employees fostered mutual respect and shared purpose, overcoming prior challenges.", created_at:1779560120, source_id:"chunk-efa4c5bf9fb4c404dc37b33820d8f9f2"}}, {start: {_id:4677}, end: {_id:50}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"causation,phenomenon", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Synchronicities manifest as a result of operating in a Oneness Consciousness state, enabling magical action.<SEP>Synchronicities manifest as a result of operating in a Oneness Consciousness state, enabling magical action.", created_at:1779560282, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:6389}, end: {_id:4677}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", truncate:"", keywords:"mechanism,power", weight:2.0, description:"Magical Action is accessed through Oneness Consciousness, granting transformative capabilities to leaders and entrepreneurs.<SEP>Magical Action is accessed through Oneness Consciousness, granting transformative capabilities to leaders and entrepreneurs.", created_at:1779560282, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:1313}, end: {_id:6390}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", truncate:"", keywords:"dedication,growth", weight:2.0, description:"The Sales People?s dedication and Soul Sync practice directly contributed to the company?s unexpected growth.<SEP>The Sales People?s dedication and Soul Sync practice directly contributed to the company?s unexpected growth.", created_at:1779560263, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:1317}, end: {_id:6392}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional response,outcome", weight:2.0, description:"Employees experienced joyful surprise at the company?s success despite minimal advertising efforts.<SEP>Employees experienced joyful surprise at the company?s success despite minimal advertising efforts.", created_at:1779560262, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:1318}, end: {_id:4677}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", truncate:"", keywords:"abundance,spiritual connection", weight:2.0, description:"He achieved spiritual connection through Soul Sync, enabling intentions for abundance for all employees and himself.<SEP>He achieved spiritual connection through Soul Sync, enabling intentions for abundance for all employees and himself.", created_at:1779560282, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:6391}, end: {_id:1318}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"leadership,transformation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"He?s empowered to change dysfunctional systems through the power derived from Oneness Consciousness.<SEP>He?s empowered to change dysfunctional systems through the power derived from Oneness Consciousness.", created_at:1779560283, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:453}, end: {_id:2646}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"creating abundance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Entrepreneurs create abundance and achieve success.", created_at:1779560282, source_id:"chunk-8fe41869f1b0fa2b6e988f652c7091c5"}}] AS row
