 weight:1.0, description:"World Oneness Day addresses humanity's collective challenges through Oneness.", created_at:1779565492, source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7"}}, {start: {_id:6708}, end: {_id:4354}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"dedication,success", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"World leaders succeed through relentless study and global awareness.", created_at:1779565492, source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7"}}, {start: {_id:3021}, end: {_id:6692}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"limitation,tradition", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Classrooms symbolize traditional learning vs. real-world knowledge integration.", created_at:1779565492, source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7"}}, {start: {_id:6690}, end: {_id:3921}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"obsession,rigidity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Punishment results from obsessive attitudes ignoring situational changes.", created_at:1779565492, source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7"}}, {start: {_id:5341}, end: {_id:707}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"distortion,reality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Judgments distort truth, requiring awareness to perceive reality accurately.", created_at:1779565492, source_id:"chunk-3f2351d7bbf12ee7e6a879305b4fddf7"}}, {start: {_id:603}, end: {_id:6703}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"behavioral economics,economic impact,societal dynamics", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Comparison is linked to economic growth through consumerism and societal projections.<SEP>Comparison is linked to economic flourishing through consumer behavior.", created_at:1779652862, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-3a5d8d7606e9b8e3d7ef11bf46090954"}}, {start: {_id:6283}, end: {_id:195}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"generational influence,uniqueness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Parents and grandparents are referenced in the context of individuality and generational information.", created_at:1779565492, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13"}}, {start: {_id:603}, end: {_id:195}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"conditioning,familial conditioning,social learning,societal influence", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Parents and societal systems are seen as fostering comparison through constant comparisons.<SEP>Parents contribute to the development of comparative behaviors through implicit social interactions.", created_at:1779650749, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738"}}, {start: {_id:6704}, end: {_id:195}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"pressure,stress", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"High expectations from parents are mentioned as a source of stress and pressure.", created_at:1779565493, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13"}}, {start: {_id:603}, end: {_id:5561}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"amplification,constant exposure,environmental influence,unhealthy behavior", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Social media is tied to perpetuating comparison through constant exposure to \"better\" lives.<SEP>Social media exacerbates comparative behavior through constant exposure to curated content.", created_at:1779651478, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-0cd54f605ef5308b827b0b4e872697da"}}, {start: {_id:603}, end: {_id:6702}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"misconception,negative outcome,role model paradox,unhealthy comparison", weight:2.0, description:"Role models are discussed as potentially leading to unhealthy comparison despite initial intentions.<SEP>Role models are often mistakenly seen as healthy comparisons but lead to negative self-assessment and unrealistic expectations.", created_at:1779652865, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-e27a47feac82bbd6f6606fd0582e97d1"}}, {start: {_id:603}, end: {_id:1617}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"clarity,cognitive analysis,conditioning,healing,inherent trait,psychological origin", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779652863, description:"The mind's tendency to compare is addressed as requiring clarity and healing to overcome.<SEP>The mind's comparative nature is shaped by familial and societal conditioning from early life.<SEP>Comparison originates from the mind, driven by hurt and lack of clarity.", source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13<SEP>chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738<SEP>chunk-3a5d8d7606e9b8e3d7ef11bf46090954"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:1782}, end: {_id:6699}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"attitude,punishment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The speaker plans to punish \"this person\" due to their attitude and actions.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13"}}, {start: {_id:6357}, end: {_id:499}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"conflict,suffering", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Fragmented awareness perpetuates stress and anxiety through constant internal and external conflict.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02"}}, {start: {_id:6701}, end: {_id:6699}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"attitude,judgment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The person's attitude and judgment are described as trapping them in a shell.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13"}}, {start: {_id:39}, end: {_id:5443}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotional fulfillment,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Unified consciousness fosters joy and love, addressing societal deficiencies in the US.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02"}}, {start: {_id:6699}, end: {_id:6709}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"This Person", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"punishment`. The `punishment` keyword is good.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13"}}, {start: {_id:6699}, end: {_id:6710}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"This Person", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"punishment` is more direct. The previous output has this, so I'll keep it.", created_at:1779565494, source_id:"chunk-6beab04bb204a738c7bc57c3d444cb13"}}, {start: {_id:123}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"gratitude,mutual dependence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness restores reciprocal respect between humans and the planet, healing ecological disconnection.", created_at:1779565495, source_id:"chunk-1d104bf7b587259887bc9a25750b3a02"}}, {start: {_id:6711}, end: {_id:6712}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"conflict resolution,transformation", weight:2.0, description:"The wave disrupts dark clouds (suffering) like lightning striking pain and problems.<SEP>The wave disrupts dark clouds (suffering) like lightning striking pain and problems.", created_at:1779646710, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713"}}, {start: {_id:6714}, end: {_id:123}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"disconnection,problem", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Deceptiveness is identified as a root cause of humanity's separation from Mother Earth and Oneness.<SEP>Deceptiveness is identified as a root cause of humanity's separation from Mother Earth and Oneness.", created_at:1779646710, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713"}}, {start: {_id:6711}, end: {_id:6716}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"representation,symbolism", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Dark clouds metaphorically represent humanity's collective suffering and challenges.<SEP>Dark clouds metaphorically represent humanity's collective suffering and challenges.", created_at:1779646711, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713"}}, {start: {_id:6715}, end: {_id:6712}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"energy,metaphor", weight:2.0, description:"The wave is explicitly compared to lightning in its sudden, impactful nature.<SEP>The wave is explicitly compared to lightning in its sudden, impactful nature.", created_at:1779646711, source_id:"chunk-c2d71d77d8cb4da3ae9b2dde12795713"}}, {start: {_id:6357}, end: {_id:5443}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual growth,transition", weight:1.0, description:"There is a capacity to move from Eye Consciousness to One Consciousness.", created_at:1779646728, source_id:"chunk-5750a413a72601ce81e6195a148e09ad"}}, {start: {_id:6706}, end: {_id:1799}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"fragmentation,human nature,judgment,metaphor,self-description,separation", weight:3.0, created_at:1779647320, description:"Human beings are likened to a broken mirror, characterized by internal fragmentation, separation, and judgment.<SEP>Human beings are likened to a broken mirror, symbolizing their fragmented existence.<SEP>The broken mirror metaphor directly describes human beings as fragmented and imperfect.", source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47<SEP>chunk-60c1c33e6390faeb5d8d230c828095d7<SEP>chunk-fb20367827f31cb284dc2e32ba2e1bb0"}}, {start: {_id:1799}, end: {_id:6719}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"conflicting values,internal conflict", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings harbor conflicting ideals from their mothers, contributing to internal fragmentation.", created_at:1779646783, source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47"}}, {start: {_id:6706}, end: {_id:6721}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"marital discord,societal division", weight:1.0, description:"The broken mirror metaphor explicitly includes the strained relationship between husband and wife as a manifestation of societal divisions.", created_at:1779646783, source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47"}}, {start: {_id:6720}, end: {_id:1799}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"conflicting values,internal conflict", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings also internalize conflicting ideals from their fathers, exacerbating their divided nature.", created_at:1779646783, source_id:"chunk-04194c7a50041fcd44dfdf1f76e27a47"}}, {start: {_id:6357}, end: {_id:6723}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"conflict,division", weight:1.0, description:"In eye consciousness, humans view each other as competitors and enemies, fostering disturbance and stress.", created_at:1779646804, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6"}}, {start: {_id:6718}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"gratitude,interconnectedness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Awakening to Oneness fosters gratitude and love for the planet and all living beings.", created_at:1779646804, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6"}}, {start: {_id:6357}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"disconnection,separation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In eye consciousness, humans perceive themselves as separated from the planet and each other.", created_at:1779646804, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6"}}, {start: {_id:6723}, end: {_id:6718}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"love,partnership", weight:1.0, description:"In the Oneness state, relationships with others transform into love, connection, and partnership.", created_at:1779646804, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"personification,symbolism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth symbolizes the planet and all living beings, representing interconnectedness.", created_at:1779646805, source_id:"chunk-acd33e9d80650cd874ca18c3457f81a6"}}, {start: {_id:6725}, end: {_id:6726}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"cause,internal conflict", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The broken pieces (ambitions, hurts, conflicts) within the self cause stress and anxiety.", created_at:1779647006, source_id:"chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6"}}, {start: {_id:2598}, end: {_id:6726}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral impact,consequences,coping mechanism,negative behavior", weight:2.0, description:"Stress and anxiety lead to addictive behaviors as a coping mechanism.<SEP>Stress and anxiety lead to addictive behaviors as per the transcript's assertion.", created_at:1779647442, source_id:"chunk-abcd9205e6cb81b428a3257c9dbf7dc6<SEP>chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9"}}, {start: {_id:6728}, end: {_id:6734}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"representation,symbolism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Dark clouds metaphorically represent humanity's collective suffering and challenges.", created_at:1779647056, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:5443}, end: {_id:6735}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"outcomes,transformative effects", weight:1.0, description:"Embracing One Consciousness leads to beauty in individuals and society.", created_at:1779647056, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:6733}, end: {_id:6727}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"characteristics,psychological state", weight:1.0, description:"Eye Consciousness is marked by judgments, conflict, and disturbance.", created_at:1779647056, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:5443}, end: {_id:6730}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"potential,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings can transition to One Consciousness for personal and collective harmony.", created_at:1779647057, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:6727}, end: {_id:6730}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"experience,psychological state", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings often operate from eye Consciousness, resulting in internal division.", created_at:1779647057, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:5443}, end: {_id:1777}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"transformation,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Living in One Consciousness leads to beautiful, harmonious families.", created_at:1779647057, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:5443}, end: {_id:6729}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"transformation,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"One Consciousness fosters beautiful societal cohesion and beauty.", created_at:1779647057, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:5443}, end: {_id:6731}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"transformation,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Nations become beautiful through the dissolution of divisions via One Consciousness.", created_at:1779647057, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:5443}, end: {_id:6732}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"transformation,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Global beauty emerges when the world collectively embraces Oneness.", created_at:1779647057, source_id:"chunk-c4dd697e014967c1d2f280a84164c9e2"}}, {start: {_id:6722}, end: {_id:6737}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"absence,separation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The US is depicted as lacking joy, love, and connection, reflecting a state of separation from collective unity and self-awareness.", created_at:1779647104, source_id:"chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c"}}, {start: {_id:6357}, end: {_id:6738}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"conflict,perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In Eye Consciousness, individuals perceive others as competitors, enemies, or challenges, fostering disturbance and stress.", created_at:1779647104, source_id:"chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c"}}, {start: {_id:6718}, end: {_id:6738}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"harmony,perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In the Oneness State, relationships transform into love, connection, partnership, and joy, dissolving conflict.", created_at:1779647104, source_id:"chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:6718}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"blessings,gratitude,healing,spiritual concept,spiritual connection", weight:3.0, created_at:1779648169, description:"Awakening to Oneness fosters profound gratitude and love toward Mother Earth, recognizing mutual interdependence.<SEP>In the Oneness State, individuals heal Mother Earth and receive her blessings.<SEP>The", source_id:"chunk-1a41bff298d480e5ee5d61353c7e062c<SEP>chunk-60c1c33e6390faeb5d8d230c828095d7<SEP>chunk-829692316cdc441972a3bef1cc6809ef"}}, {start: {_id:6739}, end: {_id:2097}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion,topic", weight:1.0, description:"The analysis discusses homophones in the context of misheard words.", created_at:1779647205, source_id:"chunk-b64e03d5159fd3c4e333e9641ee8fb81"}}, {start: {_id:6739}, end: {_id:3953}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion,topic", weight:1.0, description:"The analysis examines misheard words and their implications.", created_at:1779647205, source_id:"chunk-b64e03d5159fd3c4e333e9641ee8fb81"}}, {start: {_id:6739}, end: {_id:6740}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"content", weight:1.0, description:"The input text is an analysis of a YouTube video, focusing on domain-specific terms and punctuation.", created_at:1779647248, source_id:"chunk-8ffaaf20919b16eeae537e3baa1da0ab"}}, {start: {_id:6706}, end: {_id:6740}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", keywords:"human nature,metaphor", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video uses the broken mirror metaphor to describe human beings' fragmented state.", created_at:1779647320, source_id:"chunk-fb20367827f31cb284dc2e32ba2e1bb0"}}] AS row
