://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"contributing factors,internal conflict", weight:1.0, description:"Insecurity is mentioned as a factor in the internal conflict and resulting stress.", created_at:1779647442, source_id:"chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9"}}, {start: {_id:6749}, end: {_id:6726}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"consequences,relational impact", weight:1.0, description:"Stress and anxiety result in damaged relationships according to the text.", created_at:1779647442, source_id:"chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9"}}, {start: {_id:6750}, end: {_id:6726}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"consequences,interpersonal impact", weight:1.0, description:"Stress and anxiety cause harm to others as described in the transcript.", created_at:1779647442, source_id:"chunk-7acdb8dcc103d74a206701373f78fcb9"}}, {start: {_id:5438}, end: {_id:5779}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJM00IqGKtc)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"equivalence,equivalence assumption,flawed concept,misconception", weight:2.0, description:"The text critiques the assumption that leadership equals position, calling it a flawed understanding.<SEP>Leadership is incorrectly assumed to be equivalent to holding a position.", created_at:1779648002, source_id:"chunk-550dc3fe2d86679425efdc1841d6bee3<SEP>chunk-330c229b9775dad36da206ebfc157ab5"}}, {start: {_id:6760}, end: {_id:5438}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJM00IqGKtc)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual error,equivalence,equivalence assumption,misconception", weight:2.0, description:"The text argues against equating leadership with authority over others, deeming it a flawed perspective.<SEP>Leadership is mistakenly equated to authority over others.", created_at:1779648002, source_id:"chunk-550dc3fe2d86679425efdc1841d6bee3<SEP>chunk-330c229b9775dad36da206ebfc157ab5"}}] AS row
