Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,error,error cause,error manifestation,linguistic ambiguity,linguistic anomaly", weight:3.0, created_at:1779652130, description:"The phrase is hypothesized to be a transcription error disrupting the text's coherence.<SEP>The transcription error includes the phrase \"Fix us a day,\" which is considered nonsensical.<SEP>The phrase \"Fix us a day\" exemplifies a transcription error resulting in nonsensical phrasing within the transcript.", source_id:"chunk-b8d7dcfd08180c8f4ffab15da2093e12<SEP>chunk-f5593ece4d6fefc307d1c996f846a8c5<SEP>chunk-4b36372af05da8e8e3e714562b5f0832"}}, {start: {_id:6894}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"content inclusion,contextual analysis", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube video contains the phrase \"Fix us a day,\" which is analyzed as a non-sequitur in the context of discussing attitudes.", created_at:1779651654, source_id:"chunk-b01bb0caae1e2017827b09d9e858a6e3"}}, {start: {_id:6701}, end: {_id:6891}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"contextual mismatch,non-sequitur,thematic relevance", weight:2.0, description:"The phrase is analyzed as irrelevant to the discussion of \"attitude\" in the text.<SEP>The phrase is analyzed as a non-sequitur potentially related to the concept of \"attitude\" in the transcript.", created_at:1779651722, source_id:"chunk-b8d7dcfd08180c8f4ffab15da2093e12<SEP>chunk-276e2821a658fe03b04118b0a70183e8"}}, {start: {_id:6893}, end: {_id:6894}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction suggestion,linguistic adjustment", weight:1.0, description:"\"Fix it a day\" is proposed as a plausible correction to resolve the non-sequitur nature of the original phrase.", created_at:1779651654, source_id:"chunk-b01bb0caae1e2017827b09d9e858a6e3"}}, {start: {_id:6892}, end: {_id:6894}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"contextual alignment,correction suggestion", weight:1.0, description:"\"Fix this attitude a day\" is suggested as a correction integrating the theme of attitude into the phrase.", created_at:1779651655, source_id:"chunk-b01bb0caae1e2017827b09d9e858a6e3"}}] AS row
