ideo: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional impact,well-being", weight:1.0, description:"Practicing the method leads to a joyful and radiant emotional state.", created_at:1779652570, source_id:"chunk-015d119d7681255e33a079f69eb0532c"}}, {start: {_id:6978}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", keywords:"nutritional advice,timing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video outlines recommended eating times based on solar cycles and fasting intervals.", created_at:1779652570, source_id:"chunk-78435e02477a2c8cddea91202785185f"}}, {start: {_id:3649}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"mindfulness,spiritual significance", weight:1.0, description:"The video emphasizes mindful eating practices involving gratitude and sensory awareness of food.", created_at:1779652571, source_id:"chunk-78435e02477a2c8cddea91202785185f"}}, {start: {_id:6978}, end: {_id:6985}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"natural rhythm,solar cycle", weight:1.0, description:"Eating is advised while the sun is still visible, aligning with natural light-dark cycles.", created_at:1779652572, source_id:"chunk-78435e02477a2c8cddea91202785185f"}}, {start: {_id:6979}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"dietary guidance,stage structure", weight:1.0, description:"The video explicitly outlines the fourth stage of eating as part of its nutritional teachings.", created_at:1779652572, source_id:"chunk-78435e02477a2c8cddea91202785185f"}}, {start: {_id:6988}, end: {_id:6986}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"cooking practice,energetic influence", weight:1.0, description:"The second stage highlights the importance of conscious emotional states during cooking to avoid negative impressions.", created_at:1779652586, source_id:"chunk-8699f9cbb008056691a7d8286116e456"}}, {start: {_id:6989}, end: {_id:6990}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"agricultural principle,health impact", weight:1.0, description:"The first stage emphasizes not using harmful substances on plants to prevent energetic transfer of suffering to humans.", created_at:1779652586, source_id:"chunk-8699f9cbb008056691a7d8286116e456"}}, {start: {_id:6987}, end: {_id:6988}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"cultural ritual,impression removal", weight:1.0, description:"Indian practices like showering and changing clothes parallel the need to remove emotional impressions during cooking.", created_at:1779652586, source_id:"chunk-8699f9cbb008056691a7d8286116e456"}}, {start: {_id:6978}, end: {_id:3148}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", keywords:"clarity,punctuation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Adding a comma improved readability by separating clauses in the \"best time to eat\" description.", created_at:1779652723, source_id:"chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312"}}, {start: {_id:6971}, end: {_id:6939}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,educational material", weight:1.0, description:"The video explains the four stages of food and their associated insights for optimal eating schedules.", created_at:1779652723, source_id:"chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312"}}, {start: {_id:6948}, end: {_id:6939}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,educational material", weight:1.0, description:"The video details four fundamental insights aligned with each stage of food consumption.", created_at:1779652723, source_id:"chunk-89dfa3ffec6d1e4a1024414f267e4312"}}, {start: {_id:6991}, end: {_id:6992}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional assessment,evaluation criteria", weight:1.0, description:"The campus evaluates chefs based on their happiness levels and emotional balance.", created_at:1779652748, source_id:"chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6"}}, {start: {_id:6993}, end: {_id:2139}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"eating timing,natural rhythm", weight:1.0, description:"The optimal eating time is tied to the sun's position, avoiding eating after sunset.", created_at:1779652748, source_id:"chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6"}}, {start: {_id:6994}, end: {_id:3649}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"consumption effects,emotional transfer", weight:1.0, description:"Food prepared with joy/peace uplifts eaters, while negative emotions create similar thoughts in them.", created_at:1779652749, source_id:"chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6"}}, {start: {_id:738}, end: {_id:3649}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)", truncate:"", keywords:"physical response,suitability", weight:1.0, description:"Food suitability is determined by the body's post-eating response (heavy vs. light, drowsy vs. alert).\" That's correct based on the input text.", created_at:1779652750, source_id:"chunk-55aaec42564a83029ead3fc6a21e8be6"}}] AS row
