c6fb16e132d4daf00b8aa1d"}}, {start: {_id:1638}, end: {_id:7131}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dqUq_a0DyLs)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,example", weight:2.0, description:"The YouTube video contains examples of the phrase \"overcome from\".", created_at:1779655742, source_id:"chunk-02c5e43b77fdf9a3ec7b659000d09be6"}}, {start: {_id:1620}, end: {_id:7133}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction,linguistic accuracy", weight:2.0, description:"Text Correction Expert corrects \"one's\" as a valid term in the example.<SEP>Text Correction Expert corrects \"one's\" as a valid term in the example.", created_at:1779656566, source_id:"chunk-c391a595a103c05727c9d5b88922a252"}}, {start: {_id:7135}, end: {_id:32}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"biological activation,biological adaptation,impact on health,purpose-driven longevity", weight:4.0, description:"Having a purpose triggers genetic mechanisms that promote longevity and health.<SEP>A sense of purpose, when focused on impacting others, triggers longevity genes in the body.<SEP>Having a purpose triggers genetic mechanisms that promote longevity and health.<SEP>A sense of purpose, when focused on impacting others, triggers longevity genes in the body.", created_at:1779656696, source_id:"chunk-b2b3f4e0ec4ca323c0c90b860c94bdb5<SEP>chunk-efef91f79f63a3dccc0da4a26bee1fef"}}, {start: {_id:7134}, end: {_id:7089}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"intergenerational support,nurturing,species survival,survival necessity", weight:4.0, description:"Grandmother whales are essential for the survival of younger killer whales, providing care and support.<SEP>The grandmother whale?s role ensures the continuation of the killer whale species.<SEP>Grandmother whales are essential for the survival of younger killer whales, providing care and support.<SEP>The grandmother whale?s role ensures the continuation of the killer whale species.", created_at:1779656695, source_id:"chunk-b2b3f4e0ec4ca323c0c90b860c94bdb5"}}, {start: {_id:6283}, end: {_id:5323}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"child-rearing,evolutionary adaptation", weight:2.0, description:"Humans evolved extended longevity to support grandchildren, similar to grandmother whales.<SEP>Humans evolved extended longevity to support grandchildren, similar to grandmother whales.", created_at:1779656695, source_id:"chunk-b2b3f4e0ec4ca323c0c90b860c94bdb5"}}, {start: {_id:5323}, end: {_id:7135}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"evolutionary advantage,genetic adaptation,genetic advantage,intergenerational care", weight:4.0, description:"Longevity genes in humans are tied to their historical role in nurturing grandchildren.<SEP>Humans possess longevity genes that contribute to extended lifespan, linked to intergenerational support.<SEP>Longevity genes in humans are tied to their historical role in nurturing grandchildren.<SEP>Humans possess longevity genes that contribute to extended lifespan, linked to intergenerational support.", created_at:1779656695, source_id:"chunk-b2b3f4e0ec4ca323c0c90b860c94bdb5<SEP>chunk-efef91f79f63a3dccc0da4a26bee1fef"}}, {start: {_id:6283}, end: {_id:6073}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)", truncate:"", keywords:"child rearing,intergenerational roles,nurturing role,societal structure", weight:3.0, description:"In hunter-gatherer societies, grandparents assume nurturing roles for children due to parents' survival-focused activities.<SEP>In hunter-gatherer societies, grandparents assume nurturing roles for children due to parents' survival-focused activities.<SEP>In hunter-gatherer societies, grandparents nurtured children due to parents' occupational demands.", created_at:177965