Now", created_at:1779659688, source_id:"chunk-db646f91c44917314e3ecaeda5d3d784"}}, {start: {_id:7173}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cultural symbolism,reverence", truncate:"", weight:9.0, description:"The relation Dhara, Mother Earth, is presented in multiple descriptions as a direct equivalence between Mother Earth and the goddess Dhara. This identification underscores cultural and spiritual connections, emphasizing the goddess as a personification of the Earth.  

The repeated phrasing across eight descriptions highlights the consistency of this conceptual link, indicating that in the contexts where this relation is discussed, Dhara is invoked to represent the Earth, reinforcing shared cultural and spiritual values. The relation thus serves as a symbolic bridge between the natural world and the divine feminine, reflecting how the deity Dhara embodies the Earth's nurturing and sustaining aspects.<SEP>\"She is Dhara\" directly equates Mother Earth with the goddess Dhara, reinforcing cultural and spiritual ties.", created_at:1779659733, source_id:"chunk-db646f91c44917314e3ecaeda5d3d784"}}, {start: {_id:7175}, end: {_id:1619}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"platform requirement,source content", weight:2.0, description:"The YouTube video content is the source material requiring correction for the Mukthi Guru platform.<SEP>The YouTube video content is the source material requiring correction for the Mukthi Guru platform.", created_at:1779657300, source_id:"chunk-49b001b9176c6f2a9840cbab29ab25fc"}}, {start: {_id:7177}, end: {_id:7176}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"contrast,depth", weight:1.0, description:"The text contrasts superficial ritualistic acts with deeper heartfelt appreciation.", created_at:1779658978, source_id:"chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:6367}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,inseparability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Gratitude arises from recognizing inseparability from Mother Nature.", created_at:1779658978, source_id:"chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29"}}, {start: {_id:3082}, end: {_id:7174}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"emphasis,priority", weight:1.0, description:"The text emphasizes celebrating the \"life giver\" more than life itself.", created_at:1779658978, source_id:"chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29"}}, {start: {_id:3082}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"content analysis,discussion", weight:1.0, description:"The video analyzes themes of celebration and gratitude.", created_at:1779658978, source_id:"chunk-b8622311ef519679baca472d8a689e29"}}, {start: {_id:3833}, end: {_id:1071}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"exploitation,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Exploiting creatures and earth creates a paradoxical opportunity for renewed perception and inclusive action through reconnection.", created_at:1779659025, source_id:"chunk-c70b663ec8c2f1951db8e07e51d5edd1"}}, {start: {_id:7177}, end: {_id:6367}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"gratitude,spiritual connection", weight:1.0, description:"Heartfelt appreciation arises from recognizing one's inseparability from Mother Nature, fostering gratitude and spiritual awareness.", created_at:1779659025, source_id:"chunk-c70b663ec8c2f1951db8e07e51d5edd1"}}, {start: {_id:3833}, end: {_id:6367}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"exploitation,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"The paradox of becoming the creature one exploits leads to a chance for renewed perception and action.", created_at:1779659025, source_id:"chunk-c70b663ec8c2f1951db8e07e51d5edd1"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"emotional depth,personification", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth is depicted as a \"good soul\" to fall in love with, emphasizing her personified and nurturing qualities.", created_at:1779659303, source_id:"chunk-b0aa1897202602a9be2a7516d39d5400"}}, {start: {_id:238}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"duality,inclusivity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Action is linked to love through its dual nature (\"considered\" and \"inclusive\"), reflecting philosophical themes of balance and connection.", created_at:1779659303, source_id:"chunk-b0aa1897202602a9be2a7516d39d5400"}}, {start: {_id:3366}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"encompasses,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Love includes friendship as one of its forms, as explicitly stated in the text.", created_at:1779659303, source_id:"chunk-b0aa1897202602a9be2a7516d39d5400"}}, {start: {_id:1022}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"encompasses,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Love encompasses romantic affection (\"a beloved\"), per the text's description.", created_at:1779659303, source_id:"chunk-b0aa1897202602a9be2a7516d39d5400"}}, {start: {_id:299}, end: {_id:218}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"encompasses,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Love extends to parental bonds, as noted in the text's enumeration of love's facets.", created_at:1779659303, source_id:"chunk-b0aa1897202602a9be2a7516d39d5400"}}, {start: {_id:7181}, end: {_id:7179}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"equivalence,metaphor", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The waters of the Earth are equated to human blood and tears.", created_at:1779659337, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}, {start: {_id:7178}, end: {_id:7179}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"embodiment,spirit presence", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is embodied in the sense of the wind, indicating a deep connection between the two.", created_at:1779659337, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
CREATE (start)-[r:DIRECTED]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {_id:7180}, end: {_id:3362}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"equivalence,metaphor", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The soil of the Earth is equated to human flesh.", created_at:1779659338, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}, {start: {_id:7182}, end: {_id:3360}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"equivalence,metaphor", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The waters of the Earth are equated to human tears.", created_at:1779659338, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}, {start: {_id:3385}, end: {_id:7179}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"embodiment,spirit presence", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is embodied in the colors of the changing seasons, showing its pervasive influence.", created_at:1779659338, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}, {start: {_id:7181}, end: {_id:3360}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"equivalence,metaphor", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The waters of the Earth are equated to human blood.", created_at:1779659338, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}, {start: {_id:7183}, end: {_id:3362}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"equivalence,metaphor", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The soil of the Earth is equated to human bones.", created_at:1779659338, source_id:"chunk-492f527e534c0851925d26b6a1dafb40"}}, {start: {_id:3353}, end: {_id:3009}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity,name", weight:1.0, created_at:1779659365, description:"She is identified as Pachamama.", source_id:"chunk-87caa4c6da0d8a78b074c0b3278712b2"}}, {start: {_id:7172}, end: {_id:3009}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity,name", weight:1.0, created_at:1779659366, description:"She is identified as Kaya.", source_id:"chunk-87caa4c6da0d8a78b074c0b3278712b2"}}, {start: {_id:7173}, end: {_id:3009}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity,name", weight:1.0, created_at:1779659401, description:"She is identified as Dhara.", source_id:"chunk-87caa4c6da0d8a78b074c0b3278712b2"}}, {start: {_id:7172}, end: {_id:3353}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"equivalence,identity,spiritual equivalence,synonymy", weight:2.0, description:"Pachamama and Kaya are equated in the text, suggesting they are the same entity or concept.<SEP>Kaya and Pachamama are presented as related terms for mother earth figures.", created_at:1779659889, source_id:"chunk-107c751ebd180e85a682c38218c60f2a<SEP>chunk-a28c71d3080d41b1e18683441ac8c1c6"}}, {start: {_id:7173}, end: {_id:3353}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"equivalence,identity,spiritual equivalence,synonymy", weight:2.0, description:"Dhara and Pachamama are equated in the text, suggesting they are the same entity or concept.<SEP>Pachamama and Dhara are used interchangeably as earth deities or concepts.", created_at:1779659890, source_id:"chunk-107c751ebd180e85a682c38218c60f2a<SEP>chunk-a28c71d3080d41b1e18683441ac8c1c6"}}, {start: {_id:7173}, end: {_id:7172}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity,spiritual equivalence", weight:1.0, description:"Dhara and Kaya are equated in the text, suggesting they are the same entity or concept.", created_at:1779659731, source_id:"chunk-107c751ebd180e85a682c38218c60f2a"}}, {start: {_id:3361}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"breath,breeze", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth's breeze flows into humans as breath, connecting the personified Earth to natural elements.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:7184}, end: {_id:7188}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is present in the rocks, indicating a deep connection.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:7188}, end: {_id:1798}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is present in the trees, showing its embodiment in nature.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:3360}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"body_part,waters", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth's waters are equated to human blood and tears, linking the entity to human physiology.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:7188}, end: {_id:3382}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth flows through the stream, signifying its presence in water.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:2232}, end: {_id:3362}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", truncate:"", keywords:"body_part,soil", weight:1.0, description:"Mother Earth's soil is equated to human flesh and bones, further connecting the entity to human form.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:3380}, end: {_id:7188}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is present in the flower, linking it to natural life.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:1931}, end: {_id:7188}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is present in the bee, connecting it to nature.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}, {start: {_id:3383}, end: {_id:7188}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)", keywords:"connection,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The spirit of Earth is present in the bird, indicating its embodiment in avian life.", created_at:1779659842, source_id:"chunk-831e414d3c516304d3109f8ff76d5f01"}}] AS row
