d to transcending self-centricity into love and compassion.` - OK", created_at:1779661753, source_id:"chunk-355c42e8aaaf893df441489ff3a44b86<SEP>chunk-9f245e3153d92a2c38134afd812338bf"}}, {start: {_id:7205}, end: {_id:7193}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual,spiritual state", weight:1.0, description:"Transformation Experience involves a state of cause, possibly related to space of cause.", created_at:1779661501, source_id:"chunk-355c42e8aaaf893df441489ff3a44b86"}}, {start: {_id:7206}, end: {_id:7204}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion,themes", weight:1.0, description:"The video explores \"love and compassion\" as central themes in spiritual transformation.", created_at:1779661518, source_id:"chunk-3589746193d218d51479dd14e70466b0"}}, {start: {_id:7206}, end: {_id:7208}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)", truncate:"", keywords:"energy symbolism,metaphorical use", weight:1.0, description:"\"Massive joules of electricity\" is used metaphorically to describe spiritual intensity.", created_at:1779661518, source_id:"chunk-3589746193d218d51479dd14e70466b0"}}, {start: {_id:7206}, end: {_id:7211}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)", truncate:"", keywords:"philosophical concept,spiritual framework", weight:1.0, description:"The video references \"non-duality\" as part of its spiritual discourse.", created_at:1779661518, source_id:"chunk-3589746193d218d51479dd14e70466b0"}}, {start: {_id:7206}, end: {_id:7209}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: HELtP96Dd4w (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w)", truncate:"", keywords:"dynamic process,spiritual energy", weight:1.0, description:"\"Spiritual current surges\" illustrates dynamic s