ological degradation and destruction.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}, {start: {_id:123}, end: {_id:7362}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"biodiversity,ecological impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Humanity's actions accelerate species extinction and ecological imbalance.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}, {start: {_id:116}, end: {_id:7364}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cosmic scale,emergence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Viruses and bacteria are emerging and spreading, reaching out to the universe.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}, {start: {_id:1947}, end: {_id:123}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"self-centered,unwise signals", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Humanity's self-centered behavior and unwise signals exacerbate global crises.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}, {start: {_id:7363}, end: {_id:4020}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"collapse,destruction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ocean life destruction exemplifies the planet's overall ecological collapse.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}, {start: {_id:3898}, end: {_id:116}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"cosmic scale,emergence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Viruses and bacteria are emerging and spreading, reaching out to the universe.", created_at:1779663998, source_id:"chunk-014f762e43b25d198c755c424f29f67a"}}] AS row
