)", truncate:"", keywords:"philosophical concept,proverb origin", weight:1.0, description:"The ancients are credited with originating the proverb \"Yatha raja tatha praja,\" which underscores the impact of leadership on societal behavior.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:1696}, end: {_id:4100}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"energy consumption,habitat disruption", weight:1.0, description:"Electricity use disrupts natural habitats and affects animal life.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:7456}, end: {_id:7458}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", keywords:"pollution,resource strain", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Excessive detergent use harms rivers and ecosystems.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:7457}, end: {_id:1798}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecosystem impact,resource depletion", weight:1.0, description:"Soap consumption contributes to environmental degradation of trees and animals.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:7460}, end: {_id:3173}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"problem-solving,societal transformation", weight:1.0, description:"New consciousness is essential for addressing challenges in the new world, contrasting with outdated, self-centered approaches.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:7453}, end: {_id:352}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral guidance,habit change", weight:1.0, description:"The mother guides her son to adopt restroom habits by linking them to environmental protection.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:7455}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecological impact,environmental advocacy", weight:1.0, description:"The message emphasizes protecting Mother Earth by reducing resource consumption.", created_at:1779666051, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:7465}, end: {_id:7453}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"environmental motivation,habit resolution", weight:1.0, description:"The child resolves bed wetting after understanding the environmental consequences of his actions.", created_at:1779666052, source_id:"chunk-3d98a7ecb8a0eae8eb12c9d7525576d1"}}, {start: {_id:1317}, end: {_id:7461}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"employee support,leadership influence", weight:1.0, description:"The Lady influences employees to support the organization through a higher purpose and consciousness.", created_at:1779666053, source_id:"chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082"}}, {start: {_id:7462}, end: {_id:7461}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo)", truncate:"", keywords:"corporate purpose,employee well-being", weight:1.0, description:"The Lady's advice connects the organization's higher purpose to employee well-being.", created_at:1779666053, source_id:"chunk-b5d50cf4e2baff26a499b709d68ef082"}}] AS row
