on type,language style", weight:1.0, description:"The phrase is identified as a colloquialism reflecting informal language usage in the original statement.", created_at:1779667157, source_id:"chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01"}}, {start: {_id:7518}, end: {_id:7527}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", truncate:"", keywords:"grammatical accuracy,language revision", weight:1.0, description:"The phrase undergoes analysis for formal correction to address subject-verb agreement and improve grammatical precision.", created_at:1779667157, source_id:"chunk-f0f19eec129e73f84ecea88d04afbf01"}}, {start: {_id:7498}, end: {_id:7528}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: nUrc8O7Avvk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk)", truncate:"", keywords:"analysis,linguistic critique", weight:1.0, description:"The video analyzes grammatical structure of the statement containing \"Discrimination and separation.\"", created_at:1779667171, source_id:"chunk-8bd898ca539c78d8b6ef24c1d5246fd3"}}, {start: {_id:2170}, end: {_id:2560}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", keywords:"cause-effect,thematic", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"spreading anger leads to problems related to anger, reflecting karmic alignment.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48"}}, {start: {_id:7531}, end: {_id:353}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", keywords:"biological,transmission", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"suffering is transmitted through genes as part of karmic legacy from parents to children.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48"}}, {start: {_id:152}, end: {_id:7533}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", keywords:"cause,manifestation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"karma originates from and operates at the level of consciousness, with individual states determining karmic outcomes.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48"}}, {start: {_id:7537}, end: {_id:7536}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", truncate:"", keywords:"biological transmission,karmic inheritance", weight:1.0, description:"Parents' suffering and disconnected states are transmitted through genes to children, affecting their consciousness and karma.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48"}}, {start: {_id:7534}, end: {_id:152}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", keywords:"interconnected,transmission", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"consciousness and actions are intertwined, with actions reflecting and reinforcing conscious states.", created_at:1779667194, source_id:"chunk-6476052f135f5eca34d34e455193dc48"}}, {start: {_id:7538}, end: {_id:2466}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", keywords:"consciousness,transmission", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Arma flows in consciousness directly influence and transmit the individual's state through generations.", created_at:1779667229, source_id:"chunk-e984e154069661974d2a04e43c43e80a"}}, {start: {_id:7538}, end: {_id:7539}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", keywords:"interaction,perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Arma flows in consciousness affects how individuals perceive and interact with their surrounding life.", created_at:1779667229, source_id:"chunk-e984e154069661974d2a04e43c43e80a"}}, {start: {_id:7162}, end: {_id:2466}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: V2WQ20Ocw_o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2WQ20Ocw_o)", truncate:"", keywords:"genetic transmission,heredity", weight:2.0, description:"The state is transmitted through genes from one generation to the next, perpetuating the cycle.<SEP>The state is transmitted", created_at:1779667229, source_id:"chunk-e984e154069661974d2a04e43c43e80a"}}, {start: {_id:7529}, end: {_id:195}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"genetic transmission,influence", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"Parental consciousness and state transmitted through genes affect the child's karma and life experiences.<SEP>Parental consciousness and state transmitted through genes affect the child's karma and life experiences.<SEP>Parental consciousness and state transmitted through genes affect the child's karma and life experiences.<SEP>Parental consciousness and state transmitted through genes affect the child's karma and life experiences.", created_at:1779667929, source_id:"chunk-e346b8f3e13471227b92c08380bf14d1"}}, {start: {_id:3455}, end: {_id:7540}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"decision-making,spiritual alignment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Decisions made from calmness attract blessings and positive outcomes.", created_at:1779667385, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b"}}, {start: {_id:1789}, end: {_id:1883}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"correction guidelines,focus,limitations,task rule", truncate:"", weight:22.0, description:"---Role---
You are a Knowledge Graph Specialist, proficient in data curation and synthesis.

---Task---
Your task is to synthesize a list of descriptions of a given entity or relation into a single, comprehensive, and cohesive summary.

---Instructions---
1. Input Format: The description list is provided in JSON format. Each JSON object (representing a single description) appears on a new line within the `Description List` section.
2. Output Format: The merged description will be returned as plain text, presented in multiple paragraphs, without any additional formatting or extraneous comments before or after the summary.
3. Comprehensiveness: The summary must integrate all key information from *every* provided description. Do not omit any important facts or details.
4. Context: Ensure the summary is written from an objective, third-person perspective; explicitly mention the name of the entity or relation for full clarity and context.
5. Context & Objectivity:
  - Write the summary from an objective, third-person perspective.
  - Explicitly mention the full name of the entity or relation at the beginning of the summary to ensure immediate clarity and context.
6. Conflict Handling:
  - In cases of conflicting or inconsistent descriptions, first determine if these conflicts arise from multiple, distinct entities or relationships that share the same name.
  - If distinct entities/relations are identified, summarize each one *separately* within the overall output.
  - If conflicts within a single entity/relation (e.g., historical discrepancies) exist, attempt to reconcile them or present both viewpoints with noted uncertainty.
7. Length Constraint:The summary's total length must not exceed 600 tokens, while still maintaining depth and completeness.
8. Language: The entire output must be written in English. Proper nouns (e.g., personal names, place names, organization names) may in their original language if proper translation is not available or would cause ambiguity.
  - The entire output must be written in English.
  - Proper nouns (e.g., personal names, place names, organization names) should be retained in their original language if a proper, widely accepted translation is not available or would cause ambiguity.

---Input---
Relation Name: (Constraints, Transcription Errors)

Description List:<SEP>The constraints guide the approach to fixing errors without changing the original meaning.<SEP>The constraints guide the approach to fixing errors without changing the original meaning.<SEP>The constraints guide the approach to fixing errors without changing the original meaning.<SEP>The constraints guide the approach to fixing errors without changing the original meaning.<SEP>The constraints guide the approach to fixing errors without changing the original meaning.", created_at:1779701326, source_id:"chunk-759e971d3fd810e673364baf690915dd<SEP>chunk-f0667e52dc3615874dc363675ea43bd1"}}, {start: {_id:281}, end: {_id:7550}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"ideological conflict,vision", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The characters' commitment to discovery is in conflict with Cruz's vision of control and order.", created_at:1779667385, source_id:"chunk-759e971d3fd810e673364baf690915dd"}}, {start: {_id:7551}, end: {_id:7541}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"emotional turbulence,poor judgment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Conflicting emotions lead to decisions that cause chaos in oneself and others.", created_at:1779667385, source_id:"chunk-53131f764276ce52ce7f19b715bd8d7b"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
