 weight:1.0, description:"Mukthi Guru corrected the name Draupati to Draupadi.", created_at:1779668368, source_id:"chunk-4b04f06e1e39aa9c677e71c36e21c89d"}}, {start: {_id:7571}, end: {_id:2144}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,themes", weight:1.0, description:"The decision-making theme is part of the original text's content.", created_at:1779668368, source_id:"chunk-9dc446aa1478fdaca34017fdd93d325e"}}, {start: {_id:7546}, end: {_id:1619}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"content accuracy,term validation", weight:1.0, description:"Mukthi Guru confirmed that Dharma Shastra is a correct term.", created_at:1779668368, source_id:"chunk-4b04f06e1e39aa9c677e71c36e21c89d"}}, {start: {_id:2144}, end: {_id:295}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,themes", weight:1.0, description:"The well-being theme is part of the original text's content.", created_at:1779668368, source_id:"chunk-9dc446aa1478fdaca34017fdd93d325e"}}, {start: {_id:7543}, end: {_id:2144}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"content,themes", weight:1.0, description:"The divine support theme is part of the original text's content.", created_at:1779668369, source_id:"chunk-9dc446aa1478fdaca34017fdd93d325e"}}, {start: {_id:348}, end: {_id:7572}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"typo correction", weight:1.0, description:"The stray character \"n.\" in the source text is identified as a transcription artifact and removed during correction to align with the intended meaning.", created_at:1779668443, source_id:"chunk-fd21d2b8f77b77ecda29029645f27574"}}, {start: {_id:5007}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", keywords:"content source,source", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube video is the source of the text content that needs editing.", created_at:1779668444, source_id:"chunk-5a16ce69085f18e09cde69c778c0498d"}}, {start: {_id:7573}, end: {_id:5007}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", keywords:"application,correction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The rule is applied to the text content to fix punctuation and capitalization issues.", created_at:1779668445, source_id:"chunk-5a16ce69085f18e09cde69c778c0498d"}}, {start: {_id:7576}, end: {_id:7575}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"moral alignment,spiritual guidance", weight:1.0, description:"The consideration for others' well-being serves as a foundation for discovering one's dharma through connected decision-making.", created_at:1779668478, source_id:"chunk-1237050e69d5492ce590be8ab6bd6b1d"}}, {start: {_id:7543}, end: {_id:7576}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0)", truncate:"", keywords:"ethical clarity,spiritual validation", weight:1.0, description:"Seeking divine support aids in confirming the alignment of actions with one's dharma.", created_at:1779668478, source_id:"chunk-1237050e69d5492ce590be8ab6bd6b1d"}}] AS row
