:"The video describes a transition from sitting and judging others to supporting them with one's arms.", created_at:1779668988, source_id:"chunk-18f022fb885e6a466d44b91626fa7777"}}, {start: {_id:7587}, end: {_id:7602}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"expansion,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The expanded sense of self includes supporting others.", created_at:1779668988, source_id:"chunk-18f022fb885e6a466d44b91626fa7777"}}, {start: {_id:7600}, end: {_id:7604}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"correction,mishearing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The word \"kind\" is a misheard word for \"kindly,\" which is related to caring for others.", created_at:1779668988, source_id:"chunk-18f022fb885e6a466d44b91626fa7777"}}, {start: {_id:7587}, end: {_id:7601}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"expansion,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The expanded sense of self includes impacting others.", created_at:1779668988, source_id:"chunk-18f022fb885e6a466d44b91626fa7777"}}, {start: {_id:7587}, end: {_id:7603}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"expansion,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The expanded sense of self includes transforming others.", created_at:1779668988, source_id:"chunk-18f022fb885e6a466d44b91626fa7777"}}, {start: {_id:7606}, end: {_id:1883}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", truncate:"", keywords:"correction focus,subcategory", weight:2.0, description:"Punctuation and capitalization errors are prioritized for correction in the transcription.<SEP>Punctuation and capitalization errors are prioritized for correction in the transcription.", created_at:1779669154, source_id:"chunk-83b5870805a040aa46ebf56e8d1032f7"}}, {start: {_id:904}, end: {_id:25}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", truncate:"", keywords:"dissolution,unity", weight:1.0, description:"Transformation leads to the dissolution of separation between self and others.", created_at:1779669125, source_id:"chunk-607beefb79fd1c2b867abf7979a1dbfc"}}, {start: {_id:333}, end: {_id:610}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"interconnectedness,support", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Self and loved ones become interconnected, enabling support and impact.", created_at:1779669125, source_id:"chunk-607beefb79fd1c2b867abf7979a1dbfc"}}, {start: {_id:1782}, end: {_id:3176}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"discussion,editing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Speaker actively discusses and edits the Transcript, addressing transcription errors and conceptual content.", created_at:1779669188, source_id:"chunk-b56929fa3724f6c3aa9b138899e446f7"}}, {start: {_id:7607}, end: {_id:1782}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"contextual contrast", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Speaker contrasts transcription errors with grammatical concerns, emphasizing the focus on original wording.", created_at:1779669188, source_id:"chunk-b56929fa3724f6c3aa9b138899e446f7"}}, {start: {_id:430}, end: {_id:7610}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"experience,reflection", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Childhood is characterized by numerous instances and experiences that are reflected upon.", created_at:1779669193, source_id:"chunk-e9d2d065e530e86a6fbd6e76094e9842"}}, {start: {_id:7612}, end: {_id:5621}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"inclusion,self-perception", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Expanded Sense includes the sense of self, indicating a broader self-concept.", created_at:1779669210, source_id:"chunk-c5b629deefcb32f62e58cbc3ee1d28ae"}}, {start: {_id:1473}, end: {_id:7613}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"enables,transformation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Consciousness Transformation enables the ability to support others through a transformed perspective.<SEP>Supporting Others is enabled by a transformed consciousness.", created_at:1779669210, source_id:"chunk-c5b629deefcb32f62e58cbc3ee1d28ae"}}, {start: {_id:1473}, end: {_id:5621}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"enables,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness Transformation enables the expansion of the sense of self.", created_at:1779669210, source_id:"chunk-c5b629deefcb32f62e58cbc3ee1d28ae"}}, {start: {_id:7611}, end: {_id:7613}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg)", keywords:"behavioral shift,contrast", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Supporting Others contrasts with judging others, indicating a shift from judgment to support.", created_at:1779669210, source_id:"chunk-c5b629deefcb32f62e58cbc3ee1d28ae"}}] AS row
