://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", truncate:"", keywords:"animal cruelty,environmental message", weight:1.0, description:"The video highlights the ethical implications of products linked to animal harm.", created_at:1779670690, source_id:"chunk-c97736465adbd1c78f127386c0a694a1"}}, {start: {_id:348}, end: {_id:7653}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", truncate:"", keywords:"media link,source reference", weight:1.0, description:"The URL corresponds to the YouTube video mentioned as the source of the discussed content.", created_at:1779670721, source_id:"chunk-8d1a8549fbac34e55ddc01431ba10b47"}}, {start: {_id:123}, end: {_id:7631}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", keywords:"compassion,remorse", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Symbolic acknowledgment of suffering caused to animals and their offspring, fostering mutual respect between species.", created_at:1779670735, source_id:"chunk-e4cf02903a0735df8c35d1ebc9a0cf97"}}, {start: {_id:7654}, end: {_id:7579}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", truncate:"", keywords:"environmental impact,ethical consumption", weight:1.0, description:"Promotion of avoiding purchases of objects linked to animal harm during the event.", created_at:1779670735, source_id:"chunk-e4cf02903a0735df8c35d1ebc9a0cf97"}}, {start: {_id:7655}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VTx4G0KEuUE)", truncate:"", keywords:"ecological responsibility,forgiveness", weight:1.0, description:"Call to apologize for cruelty perpetrated against nature and its creatures, emphasizing collective accountability.", created_at:1779670735, source_id:"chunk-e4cf02903a0735df8c35d1ebc9a0cf97"}}, {start: {_id:7642}, end: {_id:7659}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v