 divine embodies various forms such as gods, sages, light, and a guiding voice.", created_at:1779671726, source_id:"chunk-400e315e5a3403fb5857cbc8c2ee89e6"}}, {start: {_id:7675}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"becoming,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The universal intelligence becomes what one wants it to be in the personal divine experience.", created_at:1779671726, source_id:"chunk-400e315e5a3403fb5857cbc8c2ee89e6"}}, {start: {_id:7673}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"embodiment,manifestation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The unmanifest divine is experienced as the field of universal intelligence.", created_at:1779671726, source_id:"chunk-400e315e5a3403fb5857cbc8c2ee89e6"}}, {start: {_id:785}, end: {_id:7678}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual basis,intelligence field", weight:1.0, description:"The unmanifest divine is characterized as a field of universal intelligence.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:7679}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual framework,divine aspects", weight:2.0, description:"The divine encompasses both manifest and unmanifest forms as distinct aspects of its nature.\" But the same relationship was listed twice with different delimiters. Wait, looking at the previous output:<SEP>The divine encompasses both manifest and unmanifest forms as distinct aspects of its nature.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:3121}, end: {_id:7678}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"experiential outcome,spiritual phenomena", weight:1.0, description:"Connecting with the unmanifest divine can lead to experiencing miracles.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:1950}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"manifestation,symbolic representation", weight:1.0, description:"Universal intelligence manifests as gods in the context of the manifest divine.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:2120}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"manifestation,symbolic representation", weight:1.0, description:"Universal intelligence manifests as sages in the context of the manifest divine.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:50}, end: {_id:7678}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"experiential outcome,spiritual phenomena", weight:1.0, description:"Connecting with the unmanifest divine can lead to experiencing synchronicities.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:7679}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", keywords:"embodiment,form-taking", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The manifest divine embodies universal intelligence in specific forms meaningful to the individual.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:108}, end: {_id:7678}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual framework,divine aspects", weight:1.0, description:"The divine encompasses both manifest and unmanifest forms as distinct aspects of its nature.", created_at:1779671782, source_id:"chunk-4cc14bf88dd43cd119814fe9dae9a53c"}}, {start: {_id:307}, end: {_id:7680}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", truncate:"", keywords:"health impact,neuroscience", weight:1.0, description:"The video explains how negative states reduce blood flow to the prefrontal cortex and anterior cingulate.", created_at:1779671811, source_id:"chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625"}}, {start: {_id:7681}, end: {_id:7682}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", keywords:"spiritual methods,synergy", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The video suggests combining inner awareness with connection practices for mental and relational benefits.", created_at:1779671811, source_id:"chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625"}}, {start: {_id:2365}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", truncate:"", keywords:"content analysis,mental health", weight:1.0, description:"The video discusses negative thoughts as a problem affecting consciousness and their impact on the universe.", created_at:1779671832, source_id:"chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625"}}, {start: {_id:176}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", truncate:"", keywords:"content discussion,content focus,content source,instructional material,solution proposal,spiritual concept,spiritual practice,spirituality", weight:4.0, description:"The video proposes a spiritual vision as a solution to negative mental states.<SEP>The YouTube video discusses the spiritual vision as part of its content on grammatical corrections.<SEP>The video discusses or presents the spiritual vision concept and its application.<SEP>The YouTube Video discusses the spiritual vision of connecting with another person in an inner state.", created_at:1779672066, source_id:"chunk-fb4ec1b021168c6010bcec1085967625<SEP>chunk-7975f5d7f00031d3544c8f0ea4e7d340<SEP>chunk-f367b232a1868597453e46a0827c00ef<SEP>chunk-8214f902f81ebb0b2df3cc231089a8c7"}}] AS row
