 fulfillment.", created_at:1779672444, source_id:"chunk-0ec81fd92a8028a31f8c6ce341a46fe9"}}, {start: {_id:1703}, end: {_id:32}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"influence,meaning", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Power and purpose are interconnected in family dynamics.", created_at:1779672444, source_id:"chunk-0ec81fd92a8028a31f8c6ce341a46fe9"}}, {start: {_id:1500}, end: {_id:1096}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"potential,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Togetherness leads to a limitless field of potential.", created_at:1779672444, source_id:"chunk-0ec81fd92a8028a31f8c6ce341a46fe9"}}, {start: {_id:2365}, end: {_id:4973}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM)", keywords:"problem,resolution", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Negative thoughts require a solution to resolve the issue.", created_at:1779672445, source_id:"chunk-9174f4aac6278b492855cabdc7a615b1"}}, {start: {_id:739}, end: {_id:32}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z7w7soyXmHs)", keywords:"driving force,essential element,family dynamics,meaning", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Family togetherness provides a driving force and meaning.<SEP>Purpose is described as essential for every family in the context of togetherness and shared meaning.", created_at:1779673077, source_id:"chunk-0ec81fd92a8028a31f8c6ce341a46fe9<SEP>chunk-4d7d4c6af0d9749ed5b68808bdd2d648"}}, {start: {_id:39}, end: {_id:1703}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"happiness,influence", truncate:"", created_at:1779672445, weight:1.0, description:"Power brings joy and fulfillment.", source_id:"chunk-0ec81fd92a8028a31f8c6ce341a46fe9"}}, {start: {_id:7731}, end: {_id:7736}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"collective well-being,harmony", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Nurturing a beautiful inner state enables the crea