oncept of true friendship and related questions.", created_at:1779675654, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54"}}, {start: {_id:7817}, end: {_id:7819}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", truncate:"", keywords:"opposition,relational dynamics", weight:1.0, description:"Fair-weather friendships lack loyalty and mutual respect present in true friendships.", created_at:1779675654, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54"}}, {start: {_id:7811}, end: {_id:1099}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", truncate:"", keywords:"content focus,self-reflection", weight:1.0, description:"CHI includes questions about friendship dynamics and personal growth.", created_at:1779675654, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54"}}, {start: {_id:7817}, end: {_id:7818}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", truncate:"", keywords:"negative traits,similarity", weight:1.0, description:"Both fair-weather and toxic friendships exhibit self-interest but differ in overt hostility versus opportunism.", created_at:1779675654, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54"}}, {start: {_id:7811}, end: {_id:7817}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RvgN5Mfbd5A)", keywords:"contrast,social behavior", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"CHI will contrast fair-weather friendships with true/beneficial friendships during discussions.", created_at:1779675654, source_id:"chunk-9cc56b700806e7150baa610634e46d54"}}, {start: {_id:7821}, end: {_id:7824}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"migration,seasonal movement", weight:3.0, created_at:1779687460, description:"Peculiar birds migrate from Siberia to India during a particular season.<SEP>Peculiar birds migrat