060fcf971a2939151d1a8320d675a71"}}, {start: {_id:7826}, end: {_id:7827}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"contrasting concepts,philosophical debate", weight:1.0, description:"Pre-written destiny and self-created destiny are contrasting concepts discussed in the text.", created_at:1779676034, source_id:"chunk-60b9693eb51ffe4e2e8a3252b647cd9b"}}, {start: {_id:684}, end: {_id:3658}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", truncate:"", keywords:"activity transition,playfulness", weight:2.0, description:"Children move between games in a playful and happy manner.<SEP>Children move between games in a playful and happy manner.", created_at:1779676221, source_id:"chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f"}}, {start: {_id:1804}, end: {_id:1798}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavior,movement", weight:2.0, description:"Birds fly between trees and sing songs during morning hours.<SEP>Birds fly between trees and sing songs during morning hours.", created_at:1779676221, source_id:"chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f"}}, {start: {_id:4613}, end: {_id:7829}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause,consequence", weight:2.0, description:"Incompleteness in experiences generates discontent.<SEP>Incompleteness in experiences generates discontent.", created_at:1779676221, source_id:"chunk-20d55a95f1cbc94a40998bcd62b8a62f"}}, {start: {_id:4613}, end: {_id:7832}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E8N04l1Lptk)", truncate:"", keywords:"cause,consequence", weight:2.0, description:"Discontent prompts the existential question about life's purpose.<SEP>Discontent prompts the existential question about life's purpose.", crea