We must ensure we mention that the constraints, Mukthi Guru relation is a well-defined and stable component of the", created_at:1779701409, source_id:"chunk-f0667e52dc3615874dc363675ea43bd1"}}, {start: {_id:4405}, end: {_id:7849}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"creation,necessity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Awakening is necessary for the creation of anything.", created_at:1779677385, source_id:"chunk-864956111677c18bfafdc2fe8e5501ce"}}, {start: {_id:1449}, end: {_id:124}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness transformation,creation,manifestation,prerequisite", weight:2.0, description:"Creating destiny requires a transformed state of consciousness.<SEP>Creating destiny requires a transformed state of consciousness and spiritual awakening.", created_at:1779678540, source_id:"chunk-864956111677c18bfafdc2fe8e5501ce<SEP>chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d"}}, {start: {_id:4405}, end: {_id:124}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness states,progression,spiritual growth,transformation", weight:2.0, description:"The awakened state of consciousness is a specific type of transformed state of consciousness.<SEP>Awakened consciousness serves as a foundation for achieving the transformed state needed for destiny creation.", created_at:1779678540, source_id:"chunk-864956111677c18bfafdc2fe8e5501ce<SEP>chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d"}}, {start: {_id:1696}, end: {_id:1449}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"destination,survival", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Animals have destinations, which is used to argue that destiny is necessary for a meaningful life.", created_at:1779677952, source_id:"chunk-47e8f33a6c085de5c83afa558a11cf07"}}, {start: {_id:1804}, end: {_id:7824}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"migration,migration route,seasonal movement", weight:2.0, description:"Birds migrate from Siberia to India seasonally and return, demonstrating innate navigational knowledge.<SEP>Birds migrate from Siberia to India during a particular season.", created_at:1779687235, source_id:"chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d<SEP>chunk-bed30e61f70b382a4a6595c34ba8a934"}}, {start: {_id:7850}, end: {_id:7822}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual challenge,ideological disagreement", weight:1.0, description:"The draft challenges the concept of pre-written destiny in favor of self-created future narratives.", created_at:1779678540, source_id:"chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d"}}, {start: {_id:1804}, end: {_id:486}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"migration,migration route,seasonal movement", weight:2.0, description:"Birds migrate to India during specific seasons before returning to Siberia.<SEP>Birds migrate to India from Siberia during a particular season.", created_at:1779687235, source_id:"chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d<SEP>chunk-bed30e61f70b382a4a6595c34ba8a934"}}, {start: {_id:1449}, end: {_id:1799}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"agency,conscious creation,creation,potential", weight:2.0, description:"Human beings can create destinies through awakened states of consciousness and clear intention, as opposed to passive acceptance of pre-determined outcomes.<SEP>Human beings can create their own destiny through consciousness and action, contrasting with pre-written fate.", created_at:1779678611, source_id:"chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d<SEP>chunk-5637d12f2e1eaf0419e502601bcb1c15"}}, {start: {_id:1449}, end: {_id:4036}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"actualization,mechanism", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Clear intention combined with conscious states enables the manifestation of desired destinies.", created_at:1779678540, source_id:"chunk-e42bf74a0fbf1f4b3957648d5d4ff42d"}}, {start: {_id:1799}, end: {_id:7851}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"agency,rejection", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings reject pre-written destiny as it negates the need for action, emphasizing conscious creation of fate instead.", created_at:1779678612, source_id:"chunk-5637d12f2e1eaf0419e502601bcb1c15"}}, {start: {_id:1799}, end: {_id:7821}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"contrast,instinctual behavior", weight:1.0, description:"Human beings lack inherent destinations, while peculiar birds exhibit instinctual migratory behavior for survival.", created_at:1779678612, source_id:"chunk-5637d12f2e1eaf0419e502601bcb1c15"}}, {start: {_id:7853}, end: {_id:7852}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"clarity,editing", weight:1.0, description:"Refining the Draft demonstrates the process of improving written content for clarity and correctness.", created_at:1779686210, source_id:"chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393"}}, {start: {_id:4405}, end: {_id:7842}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"prerequisite,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Creating a magical destiny requires an awakened and transformed state of consciousness.", created_at:1779686211, source_id:"chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393"}}, {start: {_id:7842}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"destiny creation,discusses", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video discusses the concept of creating a magical destiny for a child through living in a connected and beautiful state.", created_at:1779686718, source_id:"chunk-fedec056ab462ac623268f5f37e05639"}}, {start: {_id:4036}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"destiny creation,intention holding", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video discusses the concept of holding an intention as part of creating a destiny.", created_at:1779686720, source_id:"chunk-fedec056ab462ac623268f5f37e05639"}}, {start: {_id:7854}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"clarity,destiny creation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video emphasizes being clear about what you want in the context of creating a destiny.", created_at:1779686721, source_id:"chunk-fedec056ab462ac623268f5f37e05639"}}] AS row
MATCH (start:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.start._id})
MATCH (end:`UNIQUE IMPORT LABEL`{`UNIQUE IMPORT ID`: row.end._id})
