UNWIND [{start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:352}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"healing,wholeness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Cultivating gratitude toward one?s mother promotes emotional healing and wholeness.", created_at:1779687913, source_id:"chunk-439f02067105223fb4f1c1b8d3263e52"}}, {start: {_id:7867}, end: {_id:352}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQEGJ0OaIPo)", keywords:"cultural philosophy,cultural saying,maternal reverence,maternal role", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The saying \"Maatru Devo Baba\" underscores the mother?s divine role in creation and sustenance.<SEP>The concept of Maatru Devo Baba is linked to the mother's divine and creative role, reflecting cultural symbolism.", created_at:1779687982, source_id:"chunk-439f02067105223fb4f1c1b8d3263e52<SEP>chunk-b99209818242fa366169c6ab46e01f5f"}}, {start: {_id:355}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQEGJ0OaIPo)", truncate:"", keywords:"child development,maternal influence", weight:1.0, description:"The video highlights the child's dependence and growth through maternal influence and emotional healing.", created_at:1779687982, source_id:"chunk-b99209818242fa366169c6ab46e01f5f"}}, {start: {_id:7869}, end: {_id:355}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQEGJ0OaIPo)", truncate:"", keywords:"caregiving,emotional support", weight:1.0, description:"The child receives care and love from a caregiver who acts as a mother figure.", created_at:1779687982, source_id:"chunk-b99209818242fa366169c6ab46e01f5f"}}, {start: {_id:742}, end: {_id:300}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bMGaQ2nUE5Y)", keywords:"awareness,awareness development,emotional state,growth", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Gratitude is an awareness that grows from recognizing others' contributions.<SEP>Gratitude arises spontaneously as awareness of others' contributions grows within an individual.", created_at:1779688285, source_id:"chunk-4cce82363fc6230a01c314614c6acbf3<SEP>chunk-737fcc2550e7f9481acd8dc6c1689aab"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:3608}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,cultivation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Nurturing is a method used to awaken the state of gratitude.", created_at:1779688216, source_id:"chunk-4cce82363fc6230a01c314614c6acbf3"}}, {start: {_id:742}, end: {_id:2990}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bMGaQ2nUE5Y)", keywords:"basis for gratitude,cause,contributions,recognition", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Awareness is about the contributions of people, which cause it to grow.<SEP>Awareness of others' contributions serves as the foundation for gratitude to emerge naturally.", created_at:1779688285, source_id:"chunk-4cce82363fc6230a01c314614c6acbf3<SEP>chunk-737fcc2550e7f9481acd8dc6c1689aab"}}, {start: {_id:300}, end: {_id:1638}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bMGaQ2nUE5Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"discussion topic,educational content", weight:1.0, description:"The video discusses gratitude as a natural awareness of others' contributions, not a forcefully cultivated attitude.", created_at:1779688284, source_id:"chunk-737fcc2550e7f9481acd8dc6c1689aab"}}, {start: {_id:7878}, end: {_id:7881}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07NOYJmkkFo)", keywords:"emotional connection,examples,illustration,shared traits", truncate:"", weight:3.0, description:"Penguins and polar bears are both creatures mentioned in the input text, with the user suggesting they share emotional traits towards newborns.<SEP>Penguins and polar bears are both creatures mentioned in the input text, wi