itation"}, end: {_id:2353}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"achieving,method", truncate:"", weight:10.0, description:"Yasmi uses meditation to achieve the Beautiful State.<SEP>Yasmi uses meditation", created_at:1779173116, source_id:"chunk-665f72ba5123be26210ce8f477e2012f"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:137}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Nomi is not mentioned in relation to meditation.", created_at:1779173152, source_id:"chunk-665f72ba5123be26210ce8f477e2012f"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:2424}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"brain changes,cellular impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation changes the brain and body's ecosystem, including the communication of trillion cells.", created_at:1779173789, source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:2425}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"energy,vibration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation alters the vibration around the body, affecting the energetic state.", created_at:1779173789, source_id:"chunk-4d59e72aadbbf0c922fc8ed13db1693a"}}, {start: {name:"Soul Sync"}, end: {_id:2588}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"spiritual guidance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sri Pritharjee developed Soul Sync to help individuals navigate karmic challenges through brainwave alignment.", created_at:1779174297, source_id:"chunk-0ad786d49405bb1a57cd1b61b45c9d47"}}, {start: {name:"Soul Sync"}, end: {_id:2683}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"activation,physiological effect,physiological response,relaxation", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779183689, description:"Soul Sync practice activates the vagus nerve, enhancing parasympathetic response and brain efficiency.`<SEP>Soul Sync activates the Vagus Nerve, which in turn relaxes the autonomic nervous system.<SEP>Soul Sync a