e:"Soul Sync"}, end: {_id:2811}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"concept,interconnectedness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Soul Sync emphasizes the concept of a unitary field of consciousness.", created_at:1779183688, source_id:"chunk-6e3b92943a430e127a61bead1ab61d60"}}, {start: {name:"Soul Sync"}, end: {_id:2812}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"concept,non-duality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Soul Sync treats thought and matter as unified in the practice.", created_at:1779183688, source_id:"chunk-6e3b92943a430e127a61bead1ab61d60"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:544}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JYqlxlBZHc4)", keywords:"self-discovery,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation facilitates the man's inner journey and profound self-awareness.", created_at:1779188834, source_id:"chunk-165a6947c193c6485a15dca83d2b7887"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4795}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", keywords:"healing,medical application,therapy,treatment", truncate:"", weight:5.0, created_at:1779409653, description:"Meditation helps heal psychosomatic ailments through its therapeutic effects.<SEP>Meditation is used to heal psychosomatic ailments through therapeutic practices.<SEP>Meditation helps heal psychosomatic ailments through mind-body connection.<SEP>Meditation is used to heal psychosomatic ailments through mind-body connection.<SEP>Meditation aids in healing psychosomatic ailments through stress reduction and mental balance.>", source_id:"chunk-1140e04073ac9a83dfcd95f7292712fc<SEP>chunk-4a8a747b20d8cc64be6f0587f83f75f8<SEP>chunk-94fd769ad6dd92d26be8bab1935e1e46<SEP>chunk-837bb3388ec47b611e5d50b7a992682e<SEP>chunk-0adee7c41f1cb41998ac9e8e2dce0473"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4797}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", keywords:"mental health,physiological impact,posture,stress management,stress reduction,unconventional terminology", truncate:"", weight:5.0, created_at:1779409768, description:"Meditation reduces stress and alleviates stress posture.<SEP>Meditation is described as a \"stress posture\" in the text.<SEP>Meditation helps manage stress posture and its physical manifestations.<SEP>Meditation serves as a stress posture, managing physical and mental stress responses.><SEP>Meditation is used to manage stress and improve mental health.", source_id:"chunk-1140e04073ac9a83dfcd95f7292712fc<SEP>chunk-4a8a747b20d8cc64be6f0587f83f75f8<SEP>chunk-837bb3388ec47b611e5d50b7a992682e<SEP>chunk-0adee7c41f1cb41998ac9e8e2dce0473<SEP>chunk-4b883b28acf7bcbe78afff1c0303d457"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:499}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"relaxation,stress management", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation helps reduce stress and promotes relaxation.", created_at:1779409246, source_id:"chunk-295b4d40d94af80e1044c8f96fbb93cd"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:1599}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", keywords:"diversity,specialization", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation includes varied practices targeting different outcomes.", created_at:1779409246, source_id:"chunk-295b4d40d94af80e1044c8f96fbb93cd"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:1619}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"platform alignment,terminology", weight:1.0, description:"Mukthi Guru?s platform requires meditation-related content to include specific terms.", created_at:1779409285, source_id:"chunk-b66dbb231f9e1be7773d5bb448709c92"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4805}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"benefit,purpose", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation is framed as promoting physical and mental well-being.", created_at:1779409286, source_id:"chunk-b66dbb231f9e1be7773d5bb448709c92"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4806}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", keywords:"characterization,method", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation is characterized as a non-invasive approach.", created_at:1779409286, source_id:"chunk-b66dbb231f9e1be7773d5bb448709c92"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4816}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"achievement,benefit,psychological effect,spiritual experience", weight:2.0, description:"Meditation is described as leading to the experience of inner peace.<SEP>Meditation is described as providing an experience of longed-for inner peace.", created_at:1779409484, source_id:"chunk-4a8a747b20d8cc64be6f0587f83f75f8<SEP>chunk-0d0baf2487eabd0e12d4724df2c206b7"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4822}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"method characteristic,thematic emphasis", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation is characterized by a non-invasive approach, central to the text's message.", created_at:1779409411, source_id:"chunk-def9e98765150221e40ee9eeb24fba6e"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:1594}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual link,core component,mindfulness,part of,practice categorization,spiritual practice,teaching", weight:5.0, created_at:1779409768, description:"Meditation is a core part of Sadhana, a discipline taught by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji.<SEP>Meditation is presented as a specific type of Sadhana (spiritual practice) within the text.<SEP>Meditation is a core part of the Sadhana practice.<SEP>Meditation is a fundamental part of the Sadhana practice taught by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji.<SEP>Sadhana incorporates meditation as a core spiritual practice for consciousness expansion.", source_id:"chunk-94fd769ad6dd92d26be8bab1935e1e46<SEP>chunk-0d0baf2487eabd0e12d4724df2c206b7<SEP>chunk-f9cb26e7b3e7b78f3a46a447d2d553c9<SEP>chunk-837bb3388ec47b611e5d50b7a992682e<SEP>chunk-4b883b28acf7bcbe78afff1c0303d457"}}, {start: {name:"Meditation"}, end: {_id:4819}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual focus,content source,discusses topic,educational content", weight:2.0, description:"The YouTube video discusses and integrates meditation-related terms into its content.<SEP>YouTube Video discusses meditation and its benefits, including stress reduction and mental well-being.", created_at:1779409540, source_id:"chunk-0d0baf2487eabd0e12d4724df2c206b7<SEP>chunk-2edc534faf7b6bbf2b2ec7d16e5d5b29"}}] AS row
