UNWIND [{start: {_id:62}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"creation,creator,meditation tool,originator,practice development,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"Preethaji developed Soul Sync as a tool to facilitate spiritual awakening and access to beautiful states.<SEP>Preethaji developed Soul Sync as a sacred practice to transition individuals into beautiful states.<SEP>Preethaji created Soul Sync as a sacred practice to manifest intentions through conscious states.<SEP>Preethaji developed Soul Sync as a sacred practice to help individuals achieve beautiful states of consciousness.", created_at:1779183689, source_id:"chunk-978e910d5dd4b8ed86a3da7fe7d2237c<SEP>chunk-41c1bda9fe4419dedb032ea23f9b8780<SEP>chunk-08a8bfd8ab34e14f6fb9afe4224d7966<SEP>chunk-d2f3e8c672dcb84b8e0b2d792d3193eb"}}, {start: {_id:226}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"activation,connection,consciousness,consciousness activation,consciousness expansion,mystical foundation,mystical practice,neuroscience,spiritual practice", weight:7.0, created_at:1779183689, description:"Soul Sync activates Brahma Garbha, a concept tied to limitless consciousness in the brain.<SEP>Soul Sync activates Brahma Garbha to transcend common consciousness.<SEP>Soul Sync activates the concept of Brahma Garbha, linking ancient wisdom with modern neuroscience to manifest intentions.`<SEP>Soul Sync connects to Brahma Garbha, facilitating access to a state of limitless consciousness.<SEP>Soul Sync activates Brahma Garbha to enable transformative consciousness experiences.<SEP>Soul Sync combines mystical principles of Brahma Garbha with scientific understanding of brain function.<SEP>Soul Sync activates the concept of Brahma Garbha, leading to expanded consciousness and synchronicities.", source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-