h activated consciousness.<SEP>Soul Sync is used to manifest heartfelt intentions through sensory engagement and reality alignment.", created_at:1779728797, source_id:"chunk-225162dccd0463ee4cfcd32a8b2858a0<SEP>chunk-6f90bcd92d07d52aa1d337005e488437"}}, {start: {_id:244}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"calms blood pressure,improves", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"Soul Sync improves sleep quality and calms blood pressure through meditation.\" But since Sleep Quality and Blood Pressure are now entities, the relationships should be separate.<SEP>Soul Sync improves sleep quality and calms blood pressure through meditation.\" Since Sleep Quality<SEP>Soul Sync improves sleep quality and calms blood pressure through meditation.<SEP>Soul Sync improves sleep quality through meditation.", created_at:1779136438, source_id:"chunk-7e21cbebb168cec17df5a464a689a4f9"}}, {start: {_id:237}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"breath observation,thought slowing", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"STEP THREE is part of Soul Sync to observe breath pauses and slow thoughts.", created_at:1779136439, source_id:"chunk-7e21cbebb168cec17df5a464a689a4f9"}}, {start: {_id:243}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"calms", weight:1.0, description:"Soul Sync calms blood pressure through meditation.", created_at:1779136439, source_id:"chunk-7e21cbebb168cec17df5a464a689a4f9"}}, {start: {_id:249}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"calming,preparation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Practiced in the morning to calm oneself and set intentions for the day.", created_at:1779136470, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794"}}, {start: {_id:247}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"decision-making,focus,mindfulness,practice timing,preparation", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779183688, description:"Used before critical decisions to foster clarity and alignment.<SEP>Soul Sync is applied before important decisions to align intent with higher awareness.<SEP>Soul Sync is used before important decisions to seek clarity.", source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-6a673bc29a23c9663aab9afdf1dc3d74<SEP>chunk-6e3b92943a430e127a61bead1ab61d60"}}, {start: {_id:250}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"de-stressing,emotional regulation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Employed to transition from agitation to calmness.", created_at:1779136470, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794"}}, {start: {_id:252}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"calming,collective vision", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Practiced by groups to align team members and establish shared objectives.", created_at:1779136470, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794"}}, {start: {_id:246}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"collective intention,goal achievement,group dynamics", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Enables groups to channel unified energy for achieving common purposes.<SEP>Soul Sync can harness collective power when practiced in groups to achieve common goals.", created_at:1779179043, source_id:"chunk-e69d17b5a95c66d86550266e6f75a794<SEP>chunk-b694dcc1bb7e7bd6fa7878c3592e7c19"}}, {start: {_id:248}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"desire manifestation,manifestation,visualization", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Practitioners focus on heartfelt desires to manifest them in the present.<SEP>Soul Sync practitioners visualize heartfelt desires as present realities to manifest outcomes.", 