on is explicitly contrasted with being a fad, as it is not a transient trend.", created_at:1779553517, source_id:"chunk-f23630b9a3bbcb8da2d31a0a2eac21bd<SEP>chunk-4516f9311c2e84fab0f3a3d114030507"}}, {start: {_id:5960}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"path to,state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation involves uncluttering the mind to achieve a state of ease.", created_at:1779553515, source_id:"chunk-f23630b9a3bbcb8da2d31a0a2eac21bd"}}, {start: {_id:39}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: zFOxZ2oo8-U (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFOxZ2oo8-U)", keywords:"leads to,path to,positive outcome,state", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Meditation leads to sustained joy as a core outcome.<SEP>Meditation is portrayed as a path to sustained joy.", created_at:1779553517, source_id:"chunk-f23630b9a3bbcb8da2d31a0a2eac21bd<SEP>chunk-4516f9311c2e84fab0f3a3d114030507"}}, {start: {_id:5962}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: zFOxZ2oo8-U (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFOxZ2oo8-U)", keywords:"leads to,path to,positive outcome,state", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Meditation fosters empowerment through mental clarity.<SEP>Meditation fosters empowerment as part of its transformative potential.", created_at:1779553517, source_id:"chunk-f23630b9a3bbcb8da2d31a0a2eac21bd<SEP>chunk-4516f9311c2e84fab0f3a3d114030507"}}, {start: {_id:5964}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"contrast,exclusion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation is distinguished from being merely an exercise in concentration and self-control.", created_at:1779553515, source_id:"chunk-f23630b9a3bbcb8da2d31a0a2eac21bd"}}, {start: {_id:5961}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: zFOxZ2oo8-U (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFOxZ2oo8-U)", keywords:"contrasted with,negation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation is distinguished from fashion, rejecting its classification as a passing cultural practice.", created_at:1779553516, source_id:"chunk-4516f9311c2e84fab0f3a3d114030507"}}, {start: {_id:5966}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: zFOxZ2oo8-U (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zFOxZ2oo8-U)", keywords:"contrasted with,negation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation transcends mere concentration and self-control, encompassing deeper transformative outcomes.", created_at:1779553516, source_id:"chunk-4516f9311c2e84fab0f3a3d114030507"}}, {start: {_id:992}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"manifestation,practice", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The couple used Soul Sync meditation to manifest abundance for employees and themselves.` - This seems correct.<SEP>The couple used Soul Sync meditation to manifest abundance for employees and themselves.`", created_at:1779559843, source_id:"chunk-d18ebd8ed5109a40c69cb7a69ecd8f61"}}, {start: {_id:1313}, end: {name:"Soul Sync"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"growth,synchronicity", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The company's growth was linked to employees' practice of Soul Sync and living in a state of Oneness Consciousness.<SEP>The company's growth was linked to employees' practice of Soul Sync and living in a state of Oneness Consciousness.", created_at:1779560262, source_id:"chunk-0b4b50ece94eb88406439eee33f9f28e"}}, {start: {_id:788}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: BZDXIQwOPdU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BZDXIQwOPdU)", keywords:"mitigation,practice", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Regular meditation practice helps reduce the brain's negative bias and rewires neural pathways.", created_at:1779561335, source_id:"chunk-a35e19231d7bd0423fa3c980dbea5e47"}}, {start: {_id:5341}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: _GEMrEWCiXw (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_GEMrEWCiXw)", truncate:"", keywords:"mindfulness practice,self-awareness", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation enables individuals to observe and reframe judgments about others and life circumstances.", created_at:1779650749, source_id:"chunk-15d5c49dad57bbf0bfa887044a164738"}}, {start: {_id:1301}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk)", keywords:"condition,outcome,practice,requirement,resolution", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"Meditating on self-focused thoughts unlocks problem-solving intelligence to address challenges.<SEP>Meditation requires intelligence to create enduring results.<SEP>Meditation requires intelligence to be effective.<SEP>Meditation requires intelligence to yield enduring results.", created_at:1779734684, source_id:"chunk-28f74829653c4417f524f54649fb5c5d<SEP>chunk-9dc502f9eccca1fa3646d12dc84a20b5<SEP>chunk-59826b76f9c0df8dac3d55bfd1895e81<SEP>chunk-a6282514b611392194d87cce5b2c4ab4"}}, {start: {_id:7727}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA)", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral change,counteracts", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation helps dissolve frustration and insecurity through mindful practices.`", created_at:1779672228, source_id:"chunk-4e900263f52a257effc9757bdfd34e24"}}, {start: {_id:8084}, end: {name:"Meditation"}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iikr2xzAK6Y)", truncate:"", keywords:"collective energy,practice", weight:1.0, description:"Meditation generates a force field that minimizes conflicts and violence.", created_at:1779726913, source_id:"chunk-64efe8180cefe24f9560acd6c262cd84"}}] AS row
