 Preethaji are discussed together in the context of resolving transcription discrepancies in names.", created_at:1779456049, source_id:"chunk-c1d8dd3f6ee4794537974077b8f6d5c9<SEP>chunk-9f8b0701a1ef7e4365563a4d66474949"}}, {start: {_id:5345}, end: {name:"Sri Krishnaji"}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"community gathering,spiritual leadership", weight:1.0, description:"Sri Krishnaji is acknowledged as a leader fulfilling his Dharma at the ACOM gathering of peace meditators.", created_at:1779455328, source_id:"chunk-c1d8dd3f6ee4794537974077b8f6d5c9"}}] AS row
