MATCH (end:Concept{name: row.end.name})
CREATE (start)-[r:EXPOUNDS]->(end) SET r += row.properties;
UNWIND [{start: {name:"Oneness"}, end: {_id:15}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"organizational mission,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"Oneness is dedicated to helping individuals transform their consciousness.", created_at:1779135291, source_id:"chunk-8ee3e05777e56f75a0285ee42d5cac0e"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"association,co-reference,conceptual focus,consciousness,philosophy,spiritual teaching,teaching", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"Krishnaji is associated with the beautiful state of being.<SEP>Krishnaji teaches about the \"beautiful state\" as a core concept in his philosophy.<SEP>Krishnaji co-teaches the \"beautiful state\" as a transformative consciousness concept.<SEP>Krishnaji?s text explains the philosophy and benefits of cultivating a beautiful state to overcome suffering.` - This looks correct.", created_at:1779183318, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9<SEP>chunk-2d7f2293587016371499185adff2fbdb<SEP>chunk-d83a359a3b08bc2ee4dd9304ff1558fc<SEP>chunk-ddc2a8c2bf46af1d243c4bae41044efd"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:26}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"outcome,state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state results in a joyful and effortless life.", created_at:1779135341, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9"}}, {start: {name:"Four Sacred Secrets"}, end: {_id:25}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"attunement,purpose", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The four sacred secrets facilitate transformation by attuning individuals.", created_at:1779135341, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:28}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"life,outcome", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state brings opportunities into life.", created_at:1779135341, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:30}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"journey,outcome", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state brings help at every step of the journey.", created_at:1779135342, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:34}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"outcome,state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state prevents feeling stuck.", created_at:1779135342, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:35}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"outcome,state", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state allows true connection with loved ones.", created_at:1779135342, source_id:"chunk-159b60743c404c64b4b2bc2c5ee55cc9"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:21}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"focus,philosophical foundation,self-awareness,transformation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The book focuses on transforming consciousness as<SEP>The Four Sacred Secrets emphasize living from a transformed state of consciousness.", created_at:1779144562, source_id:"chunk-44c5424a50aefa089772fd12a4f10112<SEP>chunk-37f26db11e149c4af43719c414b748ce"}}, {start: {name:"Oneness"}, end: {_id:75}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"founder,spiritual leadership", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Sri Bhagavan founded the Oneness organization and serves as its spiritual leader.<SEP>Sri Bhagavan founded the spiritual organization Oneness.", created_at:1779179956, source_id:"chunk-c7663462a3304e2d98120c719432966f<SEP>chunk-df1ee8c2e900dce3525e47875fd865ea"}}, {start: {name:"Brahman"}, end: {_id:108}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"equivalence,synonym", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Brahman and the Divine are presented as equivalent concepts in the text.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {name:"Suffering"}, end: {_id:109}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cause-effect,interconnected concepts", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Suffering is linked to internal conflict (War Within Ourselves) as a source of human pain.", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {name:"Brahman"}, end: {_id:113}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"identity,universality", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Brahman is described as the unified universal organism (The One).", created_at:1779135636, source_id:"chunk-d3d95285c3a8dfac657e743e02300c41"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:131}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"philosophical foundation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness is framed as the key to transcending human limitations and achieving unity with the universe.", created_at:1779135780, source_id:"chunk-5e9d081084055b2f138ca25676b72aed"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:135}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"behavioral outcome,character representation,compassion,embodiment,non-suffering,presence,release,representation,state embodiment,state representation,teaching", weight:9.0, created_at:1779183593, description:"We need to produce a merged description of the entity or relation (Beautiful State, Yesmi). The input is a list of JSON objects each with a \"Description\" field. The output must be plain text, multiple paragraphs, no extra formatting. Must be objective, third-person, mention the full name of the entity or relation at the beginning. Must integrate all key information, no omission. Must be within 600 tokens. Must be in English. Must handle conflicts: if there are conflicting or inconsistent descriptions, determine if they arise from distinct entities or relationships that share same name. If distinct, summarize each separately. If conflicts within a single entity, reconcile or present both viewpoints with noted uncertainty.

We have many descriptions. Let's parse them.

The relation name: (Beautiful State, Yesmi). So the relation is between Beautiful State and Yesmi? Or the relation is \"Beautiful State, Yesmi\". The description says \"Yesmi embodies the beautiful state in the narrative.\" So Yesmi is the subject, embodying the beautiful state.

We have many descriptions:

1. \"Yesmi embodies the beautiful state in the narrative.\"
2. \"Yesmi embodies the beautiful state, characterized by presence and absence of rumination.\"
3. \"Yesmi's actions embody connection and liberation, aligning with the Beautiful State principles.\"
4. \"Yesmi exemplifies the beautiful state through compassionate actions and present-moment awareness.\"
5. \"Yesmi embodies the Beautiful State through calmness and connection to the present moment.\"
6. \"Yesmi exemplifies a beautiful state of consciousness through compassionate action and presence in the fable.\"
7. \"Yesmi?s actions reflect a beautiful state, marked by presence and total departure from past events.\"
8. \"Yesmi exemplifies the \\\"beautiful state\\\" through calmness and compassion.\"

Also there is a description: {\"Description\": \"Yesmi embodies and represents the beautiful state through his peaceful actions and presence.\"}

We need to integrate all key information.

