n \"presence and absence of rumination\" (2). Others mention \"connection and liberation\" (3). Others mention \"compassionate actions and present-moment awareness\" (4). Others mention \"calmness and connection to the present moment\" (5). Others mention \"compassionate action and presence in the fable\" (6). Others mention \"calmness and compassion\" (8). Others mention \"presence and total departure from past events\" (7). Others mention \"presence and absence of rumination\" (2). Others mention \"connection and liberation\" (3). Others mention \"compassionate actions and present-moment awareness\" (4). Others mention \"calmness and connection to the present moment\" (5). Others mention \"compassionate action and presence in the fable\" (6). Others mention \"calmness and compassion\" (8). Others mention \"presence and total departure from past events\" (7). Others mention \"presence and absence of rumination\" (2). Others mention \"connection and liberation\" (3). Others mention \"compassionate actions and present-moment awareness\" (4). Others mention \"calmness and connection to the present moment\" (5). Others mention \"compassionate action and presence in the fable\"", source_id:"chunk-852cc1672a2a3a688bdf18076d61f76f<SEP>chunk-184f463e79b52fec37638a498735f009<SEP>chunk-bdc4a608530faeb54a567f51d21bad5a<SEP>chunk-1fc805671f75f5c49fede8b02e05b8db<SEP>chunk-6299fc30fbbfe258eb23a6bd35458a43<SEP>chunk-23f4ae85323a27ae180ceca7fa33c13a<SEP>chunk-bd28b1a048122e44541304a8505b07db<SEP>chunk-1ba7f5be1d21e67ddd5d6d9988215271<SEP>chunk-8b68736730809289d016abf18cb33a9d"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:147}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"intentional alignment,meaningful coincidences", weight:1.0, description:"Synchronicities manifest as expressions of the beautiful state, reflecting the universe's alignment with heartfelt intentions.", created_at:1779135947, source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:149}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness expansion,example of,manifestation,spiritual evolution,spiritual growth,transcendence", weight:3.0, created_at:1779183236, description:"The beautiful state serves as a foundation for transcending into higher states of consciousness and universal awareness.<SEP>Transcendental states like peace and compassion are examples of beautiful states achieved through heightened awareness.<SEP>The beautiful state evolves into higher transcendental states like peace and compassion.>", source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80<SEP>chunk-3a296ec9ad2af5d46dab6c458e4a48dd<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:150}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"healing,transformation", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The beautiful state facilitates the healing of damaged relationships and their transformation into harmonious connections.<SEP>The beautiful state repairs damaged relationships and fosters new, nourishing connections.>", created_at:1779183235, source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:148}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"emergence,nourishment", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state fosters the emergence of nourishing new relationships, enhancing interpersonal harmony.", created_at:1779135947, source_id:"chunk-487b91c855d8e28a2bbb8cbe8ce91d80"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:170}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"opportunity,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Beautiful State opens new doors for individuals, enabling them to access opportunities and solutions.", created_at:1779136111, source_id:"chunk-9ed2c626e4ecfc75e917140a3a7bfdbb"}}] AS row
