UNWIND [{start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:173}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"enhancement,innovation,problem-solving", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The Beautiful State fosters creative solutions to even the most significant challenges.<SEP>The beautiful state fosters creativity, enabling innovative solutions to major problems.", created_at:1779136140, source_id:"chunk-9ed2c626e4ecfc75e917140a3a7bfdbb<SEP>chunk-57a709334836e0a4dc7c14a173461dce"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:182}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"antidote,contrast,negative impact,transformation", weight:2.0, description:"The prevalence of negative thoughts (80%) contrasts with the desired beautiful state (20%), necessitating conscious reversal.<SEP>Increasing the beautiful state ratio counteracts negative thoughts, promoting psychological well-being.", created_at:1779136182, source_id:"chunk-f16606148225c6dd5acaeaaa44fa569d"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:200}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"construction,execution,project execution", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779183416, description:"Larssen & Toubro was contracted to build Ekam on the sacred site.<SEP>Larssen & Toubro was contracted to build Ekam, mobilizing resources and workforce for the project.<SEP>Larssen & Toubro was contracted to build Ekam on the sacred site in the national forest.", source_id:"chunk-d6d985847ffebe163bb1dd6d9757e27c<SEP>chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87<SEP>chunk-08a8bfd8ab34e14f6fb9afe4224d7966"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:203}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"regulatory action,site access", truncate:"", weight:3.0, description:"The Forest Department issued a notice to stop work on Ekam due to its location in a national forest.<SEP>They demanded that we stop work immediately.", created_at:1779136253, source_id:"chunk-d6d985847ffebe163bb1dd6d9757e27c"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:214}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"meditation,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The road is used daily for meditation at Ekam to achieve awakening and world peace.", created_at:1779136298, source_id:"chunk-9c97a5c948e2a2d2773c3f2ccee7edeb"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:239}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"non-separation,unity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness unifies desire and reality in the expanded state.", created_at:1779136438, source_id:"chunk-7e21cbebb168cec17df5a464a689a4f9"}}, {start: {name:"Suffering"}, end: {_id:267}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"contrast,illustration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The text contrasts suffering and beautiful states to illustrate their impact on experiences.", created_at:1779136589, source_id:"chunk-d86f83774f270c01370f6d935b6fb012"}}, {start: {name:"Four Sacred Secrets"}, end: {_id:17}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"advocacy,author,spiritual guidance,spiritual teachings,teaching", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779178878, description:"Krishnaji actively promotes and applies the Four Sacred Secrets in his professional and personal life.<SEP>Krishnaji authored the Four Sacred Secrets, providing spiritual insights.<SEP>Krishnaji co-authored the Four Sacred Secrets to help others achieve their intentions through consciousness.", source_id:"chunk-70942d26a880fbcb86160b99c85d8f76<SEP>chunk-8e03152ba26c428e5446f721ab8114a4<SEP>chunk-dad86cc04528a53c723f853b94021683"}}, {start: {name:"Four Sacred Secrets"}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"advocacy,author,spiritual guidance,teaching", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Preethaji collaborates with Krishnaji in sharing and demonstrating the Four Sacred Secrets.<SEP>Preethaji co-authored the Four Sacred Secrets to help others achieve their intentions through consciousness.", created_at:1779178877, source_id:"chunk-70942d26a880fbcb86160b99c85d8f76<SEP>chunk-dad86cc04528a53c723f853b94021683"}}, {start: {name:"Four Sacred Secrets"}, end: {_id:4}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"content,source", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The document contains and details the Four Sacred Secrets for public dissemination.", created_at:1779136638, source_id:"chunk-70942d26a880fbcb86160b99c85d8f76"}}, {start: {name:"Four Sacred Secrets"}, end: {_id:275}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cosmic influence,transformation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Four Sacred Secrets leverage the universe's role in aiding individuals, leading to transformative life outcomes.", created_at:1779136638, source_id:"chunk-70942d26a880fbcb86160b99c85d8f76"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:283}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual contrast,thematic opposition", weight:1.0, description:"The two states are presented as opposing forces in human experience.", created_at:1779136763, source_id:"chunk-184f463e79b52fec37638a498735f009"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:60}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"conceptual framework,source content", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The document explores the beautiful state as a central theme.", created_at:1779136763, source_id:"chunk-184f463e79b52fec37638a498735f009"}}, {start: {name:"Suffering"}, end: {_id:288}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"cyclical nature,pattern observation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Time reveals recurring cycles of suffering and its destructive consequences.", created_at:1779136789, source_id:"chunk-ae33a0629a1035831d09370dbcb6fa05"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:298}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"comprises,emotional foundation,includes,inclusion", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The beautiful state includes serenity as part of its experiences.<SEP>Serenity is a core emotional component of the beautiful state, enabling clarity and peace.>", created_at:1779183236, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:50}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: mmpmX3-qfc4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mmpmX3-qfc4)", keywords:"causation,causes,harmony,manifestation,meaningful alignment,opportunity,pattern alignment,purpose fulfillment,spiritual resonance,triggers", truncate:"", weight:7.0, description:"A beautiful state leads to the occurrence of synchronicities.<SEP>Living in a beautiful state attracts synchronicities, aligning the universe with one?s intentions.<SEP>In a beautiful state, meaningful coincidences unfold as the universe aligns with one's intentions.><SEP>Beautiful states trigger synchronicities as harmonious responses to intentions.<SEP>Living in a beautiful state attracts synchronicities that fulfill intentions through magical alignment.` - This seems correct.<SEP>Living in a beautiful state attracts synchronicities that fulfill intentions through magical alignment.`<SEP>Synchronicities manifest as the universe aligns to fulfill heartfelt intentions.", created_at:1779560390, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc<SEP>chunk-bd28b1a048122e44541304a8505b07db<SEP>chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72<SEP>chunk-98ebbba09ead01df2486b7e4f58bcc9b<SEP>chunk-d18ebd8ed5109a40c69cb7a69ecd8f61<SEP>chunk-fb34444d5342f0a266be4edca9184fcf"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:301}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comprises,includes", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state includes happiness as one of its experiences.", created_at:1779136810, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:300}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comprises,includes", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state includes gratitude as one of its experiences.", created_at:1779136810, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:299}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"comprises,emotional health,includes,self-love", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The beautiful state includes love as one of its experiences.<SEP>Love forms part of the beautiful state that enables holistic well-being.", created_at:1779524873, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc<SEP>chunk-3d3e1db7059b50ed67e675540955de81"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:41}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"comprises,includes", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state includes courage as one of its experiences.", created_at:1779136810, source_id:"chunk-2d11e54d95e2fbe498a16da1a0974afc"}}] AS row
