UNWIND [{start: {name:"Dharma"}, end: {_id:60}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"philosophical concepts,textual focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The document explores Dharma as a central theme in the context of different states of being.", created_at:1779143792, source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:1324}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"authentic seeking,creativity,outcome,positive transformation,spiritual motivation", truncate:"", weight:3.0, created_at:1779187669, description:"Mukti in the Beautiful State aligns with genuine liberation and interconnectedness.<SEP>Mukti can be pursued from a beautiful state, leading to positive outcomes.<SEP>Mukti becomes genuine spiritual growth in the Beautiful State.` - Correct.", source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b<SEP>chunk-dc9927460d19d840d6ca22cca3f93322<SEP>chunk-be5de8ed1db1e01f9ee5a260fb8d11ce"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:1330}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"awareness,positive impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In the Beautiful State, there is a recognition of interconnectedness, leading to nurturing actions that benefit the larger whole.", created_at:1779143793, source_id:"chunk-2cfb508b00ca21845f924f5069b94f9b"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:294}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"creativity,presence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Work becomes a \"playing field\" of universal intelligence when inspired by a beautiful state.", created_at:1779143976, source_id:"chunk-e897fef731236d55e77f48600e6eadf5"}}, {start: {name:"Four Sacred Secrets"}, end: {_id:1416}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"balance,spiritual principles", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The Four Sacred Secrets outline the Grand Vision, emphasizing balance between consciousness and prosperity.", created_at:1779144500, source_id:"chunk-8e03152ba26c428e5446f721ab8114a4"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:5}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"human transformation,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"A transformed state of consciousness enables the creation of prosperity and love.", created_at:1779144562, source_id:"chunk-37f26db11e149c4af43719c414b748ce"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1463}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"existence,interconnectedness", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"People are part of consciousness, existing within it and connected to it.", created_at:1779144760, source_id:"chunk-b82acee7d3be480cf3951b301cba9fd2"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1462}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source", keywords:"manifestation,perception,subjective experience", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"God is a manifestation of consciousness, experienced subjectively by individuals.<SEP>God is a subjective experience that individuals perceive and realize through the academy.", created_at:1779187965, source_id:"chunk-b82acee7d3be480cf3951b301cba9fd2<SEP>chunk-0ee45ed086ccf00bec8f02b0098563bd"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1464}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"aspect,composition,existence,exploration", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Consciousness is composed of the physical aspect, which includes tangible realities like the sun rising and the universe with senses.<SEP>Consciousness encompasses the physical aspect, which is explored through material means.", created_at:1779144811, source_id:"chunk-dcb6a1f0f87f4f034ec66dd0f9b129f6<SEP>chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1465}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"composition,existence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness includes the experiential aspect, involving subjective experiences and", created_at:1779144787, source_id:"chunk-dcb6a1f0f87f4f034ec66dd0f9b129f6"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1469}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"internalization,metaphorical representation", weight:1.0, description:"The mythical war occurs metaphorically within human consciousness as a spectrum of awareness.", created_at:1779144810, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1466}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"self-focused,spectrum endpoint", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"I-consciousness occupies one end of the consciousness spectrum characterized by self-obsession.", created_at:1779144810, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1467}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"spectrum endpoint,unified awareness", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"One-consciousness represents the other end of the spectrum marked by transcendent unity.", created_at:1779144810, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:4}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"conceptual framework,source material", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Document discusses consciousness exploration and transformation between I-consciousness and One-consciousness.", created_at:1779144811, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1471}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"aspect,exploration", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness includes the experiential dimension, explored through internal and spiritual transformation.", created_at:1779144811, source_id:"chunk-35e48385a0a3608b5da5a16afae83eaa"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:60}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual foundation,document discussion", weight:1.0, description:"The document uses consciousness as the foundational concept for analyzing different states of experience.", created_at:1779144958, source_id:"chunk-3cb8947ae1a7d163a44b8090dbb139a7"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:1500}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf<SEP>unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: stUPu1-W4bE (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=stUPu1-W4bE)<SEP>YouTube Video: ffhDTzE4nDU (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ffhDTzE4nDU)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Tdb7hBwX88)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18)", keywords:"audio confusion,conceptual connection,correction,correctness,domain-specific correction,generation,metaphysical concepts,misheard relationship,misheard words,non-duality,oneness,philosophical concept,shared context,spiritual realization,term replacement,text,thematic relevance,truth,unified state,unity,verification", truncate:"", weight:15.0, created_at:1779738602, description:"Ekam, Limitless Field refers to a pair of metaphysical concepts that are integrated into the text. According to the descriptions, Ekam generates the Limitless Field, which is described as a realm of consciousness without separation. Together, they describe the unity of existence and are repeatedly mentioned in the text, suggesting a thematic or conceptual link.

However, there are indications of correction and mishearing. Domain-specific correction instructions replace Ekam with \"Limitless Field,\" and in the transcript, Limitless Field was not found while Ekam was found, indicating a correction was made for Ekam. Additionally, the terms were misheard in the transcript, which may have contributed to the correction.

Despite these issues, Ekam and Limitless Field are presented as related metaphysical concepts, and their integration into the text highlights their significance in describing the unity of existence and the realm of consciousness without separation.<SEP>Ekam and Limitless Field are terms that were misheard in the transcript.<SEP>Limitless Field is not in the text, but the text mentions it.<SEP>Ekam is in the text, Limitless Field is not.<SEP>Ekam and Limitless Field are both concepts verified as correct despite possible misheard versions.<SEP>The Limitless Field is connected to the realization of Ekam, representing ultimate unity.<SEP>Experiencing the Limitless Field leads to the realization of Ekam.", source_id:"chunk-ffbd16a80a3f36425c182278e7bb273d<SEP>chunk-37d176f97b7ba2ae42fdf4ae41e9150e<SEP>chunk-2e434306df5b4f2083250fff41e8b701<SEP>chunk-69f86e69df447249b089f59f0c3c94bd<SEP>chunk-c98ca02a6bec59f7fd2e10703ed31704<SEP>chunk-7abc8246769d79ec45e124d07054c776<SEP>chunk-091caf75406175709621a2d9580df462<SEP>chunk-32aff80d2d5f9db94bfe729568b3680f<SEP>chunk-193c5fa66362388f7a23833d6a925623<SEP>chunk-e37c6fd50bd11d63df9a857ed5ce0fed<SEP>chunk-838b7376b1d7204ea371e24df9ff589e"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:1485}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"meditation,transcendence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam's processes lead to enlightened states through meditation on psychic energy centers.", created_at:1779145124, source_id:"chunk-7e637a18b58bf595a06a2db9ad36bf77"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:60}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"documentation,source", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf contains the description and purposes of Ekam.", created_at:1779145125, source_id:"chunk-7e637a18b58bf595a06a2db9ad36bf77"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:1506}, properties:{file_path:"The_Four_Sacred_Secrets.pdf", keywords:"construction,location", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam is built on a very rare ground, which serves as its physical foundation and source of unique energetic properties.", created_at:1779145125, source_id:"chunk-7e637a18b58bf595a06a2db9ad36bf77"}}] AS row
