We have the following descriptions:

1. Description: \"The relation (Ekam, Mukthi Guru) identifies Ekam as a domain-specific term within the Mukthi Guru platform. Mukthi Guru employs a Text Correction Expert to fix transcriptions involving Ekam, and its role includes correcting the term. Ekam requires standardized capitalization in Mukthi Guru's content and is a core spiritual concept taught through the platform. The term is also associated with the platform and may be misheard in the text. These aspects highlight Ekam's significance as both a technical and spiritual element within the Mukthi Guru ecosystem.\"

2. Description: \"Muk\"

3. Description: \"Ekam is a term associated with the Mukthi Guru platform.\"

