onal forest, leading to legal disputes over construction access.", created_at:1779174955, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:2692}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"spiritual purpose,structural component", weight:1.0, description:"The sanctum is a central feature of Ekam designed to facilitate transformative spiritual experiences.", created_at:1779174956, source_id:"chunk-6fc0263d49e5375ab049da188ead9d87"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:2702}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"location,structure", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Ekam stands like a jewel at the heart of the academy.", created_at:1779178844, source_id:"chunk-fb514840089d6805bbfb2598cae38dae"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:215}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"access denial,conflict,legal conflict,permission", truncate:"", weight:27.0, description:"The construction was halted by the National Forest Department.<SEP>The National Forest Department initially blocked access to the construction site due to strict forest laws but later permitted road use.", created_at:1779183417, source_id:"chunk-fb514840089d6805bbfb2598cae38dae<SEP>chunk-08a8bfd8ab34e14f6fb9afe4224d7966"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:2703}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"enhanced expression", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In a beautiful state, creativity and solutions to challenges emerge effortlessly.", created_at:1779178876, source_id:"chunk-bd28b1a048122e44541304a8505b07db"}}, {start: {name:"Oneness"}, end: {_id:2762}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"founding,spiritual leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Sri Bhagavan and Amma founded Oneness to help individuals move from survival to living.", created_at:1779179736, source_id:"chunk-b11b8892f4c01791209e67f4d7241cea"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"teaching,transformative focus", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Preethaji teaches the power of transformed consciousness as central to the book's message.", created_at:1779179736, source_id:"chunk-b11b8892f4c01791209e67f4d7241cea"}}, {start: {name:"Oneness"}, end: {_id:62}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"inner conflict,spiritual realization", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Preethaji's experience of Oneness during the Incident conflicted with her lingering anger and suffering.<SEP>Preethaji's experience of Oneness during the Incident conflicted with her lingering anger and suffering.", created_at:1779183210, source_id:"chunk-50d6ad908c447f2c1930066f85129418"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:289}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"absence,emotional contrast", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state eliminates frustration and other negative emotions, replacing them with harmony.>", created_at:1779183235, source_id:"chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:2770}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"connection,emergence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state fosters the emergence of supportive, nourishing relationships.>", created_at:1779183236, source_id:"chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:2772}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"creativity,problem-solving", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"In a beautiful state, individuals experience enhanced creativity and clarity, leading to the emergence of solutions to challenges.", created_at:1779183236, source_id:"chunk-fee40675765ad977a79817e44542ea72"}}] AS row
