d by suffering states.", created_at:1779222481, source_id:"chunk-1821dd190f52a60ee5308675e2253b71"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:2466}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"awareness,communication,responsibility,state of being", weight:2.0, description:"The state communicates with the field of consciousness and is responsible for chaos or order.<SEP>Consciousness and state are factors that can create one's destiny.", created_at:1779675760, source_id:"chunk-29839d6d7d0e5b2cd1270aaf6c732c38<SEP>chunk-4dea19a1ca3602539d80b6f5c46066c4"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:2468}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", keywords:"definition,existence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness is explicitly defined as a field of energy and life.", created_at:1779223083, source_id:"chunk-29839d6d7d0e5b2cd1270aaf6c732c38"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1381}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kzRqQOvjRhA)", truncate:"", keywords:"presence,scope", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness is noted to exist within the world and around individuals.", created_at:1779223083, source_id:"chunk-29839d6d7d0e5b2cd1270aaf6c732c38"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:1594}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak)<SEP>YouTube Video: vjEsXpEtpH4 (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vjEsXpEtpH4)<SEP>YouTube Video: Mr1cjAz2y9I (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mr1cjAz2y9I)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5Tdb7hBwX88)<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUku