.com/watch?v=nQpRoOOu5Yc)", keywords:"event participation,inner transformation,philosophical intent,ritual practice,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:31.0, created_at:1779519051, description:"Ugadi is the event where the Sankalpa is observed.<SEP>Ugadi involves the practice of Sankalpa to create a new inner universe.<SEP>Ugadi involves creating a new inner universe through Sankalpa, a sacred vow for life's cyclical journey.", source_id:"chunk-6b7fcb0be46e5dc8bc514960fa89b8be<SEP>chunk-6af3220a340f626ce621832ca3542da1<SEP>chunk-f34e8e10dbf92b5936295383ee0c7f10"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:3531}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"temporal significance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam is immensely powerful during sunset.", created_at:1779232628, source_id:"chunk-6b7fcb0be46e5dc8bc514960fa89b8be"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:3533}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"temporal significance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam is immensely powerful during midday.", created_at:1779232629, source_id:"chunk-6b7fcb0be46e5dc8bc514960fa89b8be"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:3534}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"temporal significance", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam is immensely powerful during midnight.", created_at:1779232629, source_id:"chunk-6b7fcb0be46e5dc8bc514960fa89b8be"}}, {start: {name:"Sankalpa"}, end: {_id:3536}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UbCEX5KBbPw)", truncate:"", keywords:"intentionality,spiritual practice", weight:1.0, description:"Sankalpa is a core ritual of Ugadi, reflecting conscious alignment with life's cycles.", created_at:1779232717, source_id:"chunk-61d286a10ba0271970a579e1cf354cf5"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:3561}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"correction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The term \"achared\" was corrected to \"acharet\".", created_at:1779234657, source_id:"chunk-1c73a5c2c2a2898e93a8be652417081d"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:794}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", keywords:"advocacy,promotion", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Deeksha advocates for the rise of heart intelligence as a means to heal the world.", created_at:1779236843, source_id:"chunk-d1d61cdae8bf4b3876281c2ab93a30b0"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:2577}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk)", truncate:"", keywords:"advocacy,goal", weight:1.0, description:"Deeksha promotes the healing of the world through heart intelligence.", created_at:1779236843, source_id:"chunk-d1d61cdae8bf4b3876281c2ab93a30b0"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8)<SEP>YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>YouTube Video: Fn62UQTIMEk (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fn62UQTIMEk)", keywords:"analysis,content,content source,discusses,discussion,speech,thematic focus", truncate:"", weight:4.0, description:"The YouTube Video discusses the concept of consciousness in the context of personal growth.<SEP>The YouTube video features a speech that discusses the concept of consciousness and its role in leadership.<SEP>YouTube Video hosts content discussing consciousness and purpose as central themes.<SEP>The video discusses consciousness and its mystical aspects.", created_at:1779522028, source_id:"chunk-36bdef1e637cf3b20139be1d1d34aa7d<SEP>chunk-18bc78e6744f00b7477a42dba8a8367d<SEP>chunk-08f19d081ba1db71567273cb28ac6446<SEP>chunk-c7bf6f021740e165e861766b49fe6388"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:785}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ypG1mlekNY)", truncate:"", keywords:"science of consciousness,study domain", weight:1.0, description:"Universal Intelligence is central to the science of consciousness, which mirrors natural sciences in complexity.", created_at:1779240231, source_id:"chunk-f940ec19ccd97303c9d26e6890cdec27"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:3751}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ypG1mlekNY)", truncate:"", keywords:"comparative analysis,scientific disciplines", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness is compared to natural sciences in terms of vastness and intricacy.", created_at:1779240232, source_id:"chunk-f940ec19ccd97303c9d26e6890cdec27"}}, {start: {name:"Mantra"}, end: {_id:2096}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"error correction,transcription", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The user attempts to correct garbled mantra transcriptions into coherent spiritual phrases.", created_at:1779240848, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79"}}, {start: {name:"Mantra"}, end: {_id:3763}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"deity association,invocation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Saraswati is invoked in the mantra as a central deity.", created_at:1779240848, source_id:"chunk-04853834df8aa59c8dac460b12fa6f79"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:3764}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=owXqW04b08o)", truncate:"", keywords:"concept association,mantra correction", weight:1.0, description:"Devi is associated with Deeksha, which is corrected from \"jushamana\" in the mantra.", created_at:1779241028, source_id:"chunk-b8d18accff7354006bbf1baf5cc50967"}}] AS row
