_source", keywords:"awakening,requirement", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Future leaders must awaken consciousness to guide the world.", created_at:1779447130, source_id:"chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:5272}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,causation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Awakening consciousness leads to a greater purpose in life.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-30142fb409cd6113794311c0e52cc0fc"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:5274}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"awakening,leadership", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Awakened consciousness to peace and purpose is essential for future leaders to drive positive societal transformation.", created_at:1779447131, source_id:"chunk-e53aa20908f0e3dc300b2226e52897f3"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:755}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: odNtpKqbCQo (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odNtpKqbCQo)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"aspect,awakening,harmony,mental state,problem-solving,state", weight:3.0, created_at:1779452366, description:"Awakened consciousness includes embracing peace for holistic well-being.<SEP>The speech states that consciousness must awaken to peace as part of becoming a leader.<SEP>Peace and consciousness are interconnected as awakening to consciousness facilitates the pursuit of peace to address global issues.", source_id:"chunk-e27c90d3f030c932363441c1ed78bf62<SEP>chunk-18bc78e6744f00b7477a42dba8a8367d<SEP>chunk-06677578ca40c691ebe5110657b20260"}}] AS row
