UNWIND [{start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:7047}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", keywords:"foundation,sustaining", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state serves as the foundation for sustaining willpower and drive, preventing collapse.", created_at:1779653612, source_id:"chunk-37eeb06653208eee260f3881daf51f3a"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:157}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", keywords:"absence leads to challenges", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Without a beautiful state, challenges and problems are more likely to arise, leading to potential quitting.", created_at:1779653612, source_id:"chunk-37eeb06653208eee260f3881daf51f3a"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:7062}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU)", keywords:"empowerment,foundation", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness serves as the root enabling drive and willpower to thrive, much like the earth supports the tree.", created_at:1779653846, source_id:"chunk-e5d8a73bfe09b1e5fab115705dfa0fe7"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:2275}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"consistency,correction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam should be consistently capitalized in the text.", created_at:1779655545, source_id:"chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:7114}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"enabler,harmony", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"A beautiful state allows individuals to act freely and harmoniously.", created_at:1779655555, source_id:"chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:1179}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"contrast,freedom", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"The beautiful state contrasts with ideal-driven paralysis.", created_at:1779655572, source_id:"chunk-95adc2eca3ca128f7e7b2f4a7bf1a8d6"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:610}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"answer,condition", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"A beautiful state of connection with oneself is a condition for finding answers.", created_at:1779655573, source_id:"chunk-a6affe7a665bbb46d2be844611d794d1"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:4509}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"mindset foundation,moral clarity", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Decisions stem from a beautiful state of self-connection.", created_at:1779655573, source_id:"chunk-419f2bb193b6ad2621108753e0e6993e"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:2452}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: QzJ_Ft1de1o (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QzJ_Ft1de1o)", truncate:"", keywords:"awareness,metaphorical grounding", weight:2.0, description:"Consciousness expansion mirrors engagement with natural systems.<SEP>Consciousness expansion mirrors engagement with natural systems.", created_at:1779657003, source_id:"chunk-237a65ae546a2543e175242df87d7879"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"guidance,initiation", truncate:"", weight:9.0, description:"Deeksha, Mother Earth is a relation that describes the concept of Deeksha, which is defined as spiritual initiation. The description indicates that the terms 'awakened perception' and 'renewed action' align with this concept, highlighting the transformative nature of Deeksha. This alignment suggests that Deeksha involves a shift in consciousness and a commitment to action, reflecting a deeper understanding of spiritual growth.

The repeated occurrence of this description across multiple entries underscores its consistency and importance in defining the relation. In summary, Deeksha, Mother Earth is characterized by the spiritual initiation process that involves awakened perception and renewed action, reflecting a deeper understanding of the term Deeksha. The consistency of the description across entries reinforces the centrality of Deeksha as a foundational element within the Deeksha, Mother Earth relation.", created_at:1779659666, source_id:"chunk-db646f91c44917314e3ecaeda5d3d784"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:2232}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"oneness,unity", truncate:"", weight:9.0, description:"The relation Ekam (Mother Earth) is defined by the principle that in her, we are one, linking the entity to the concept of unity. This connection emphasizes that the Earth embodies a fundamental oneness, suggesting that recognizing this unity fosters a sense of interconnectedness among all beings.

By associating Ekam with unity, the relation underscores the idea that the Earth is a unifying force, promoting harmony and collective identity.<SEP>The text emphasizes \"in her, we are one,\" connecting Mother Earth to the concept of Ekam (unity).", created_at:1779659645, source_id:"chunk-db646f91c44917314e3ecaeda5d3d784"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:7254}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vch9C_hNjGs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vch9C_hNjGs)", keywords:"awareness,transcendence", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness transcends emotional obsessions, enabling effortless action aligned with universal well-being.", created_at:1779662712, source_id:"chunk-c9bb5b4ae7e13a7674f385925b990906"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:7257}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: vch9C_hNjGs (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vch9C_hNjGs)", truncate:"", keywords:"identity dissolution,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness arises from realizing the oneness of all life, dissolving separation between self and universe.", created_at:1779662712, source_id:"chunk-c9bb5b4ae7e13a7674f385925b990906"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:7338}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", truncate:"", keywords:"discrepancy,reference error", weight:1.0, description:"Deeksha appears in the list but lacks a textual basis in the provided content.", created_at:1779663305, source_id:"chunk-5345dea91d4424a106a1b8dd1d7e28bc"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:7338}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", truncate:"", keywords:"discrepancy,reference error", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam is included in the list but not present in the original text, creating a mismatch.", created_at:1779663346, source_id:"chunk-5345dea91d4424a106a1b8dd1d7e28bc"}}, {start: {name:"Dharma"}, end: {_id:2913}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: ftFDBaH7RFg (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ftFDBaH7RFg)", truncate:"", keywords:"concept inclusion,terminology compliance", weight:1.0, description:"Dharma is mentioned in the text and matches the terminology list.", created_at:1779663348, source_id:"chunk-a86eca0b1f90f6c49a60c38f2bf9272a"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:7353}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)", truncate:"", keywords:"proofreading task,term to be checked", weight:1.0, description:"The list includes \"Ekam\" as a term to check for errors in the text.", created_at:1779663583, source_id:"chunk-dcbb7175c90efc697c5220666cba3363"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:7353}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: k8iO5daXllM (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8iO5daXllM)", truncate:"", keywords:"proofreading task,term to be checked", weight:1.0, description:"The list includes \"Deeksha\" as a term to check for errors in the text.", created_at:1779663583, source_id:"chunk-dcbb7175c90efc697c5220666cba3363"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:7371}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pPHQMD3w9-s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pPHQMD3w9-s)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual relationship,thematic connection", weight:1.0, description:"The phrase \"send out beautiful signals\" is thematically connected to the concept of Deeksha.", created_at:1779664210, source_id:"chunk-3b6255658181910e27221370c039616c"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:7370}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: pPHQMD3w9-s (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pPHQMD3w9-s)", truncate:"", keywords:"conceptual relationship,thematic connection", weight:1.0, description:"The phrase \"sform our state\" is thematically linked to the concept of Ekam as a core idea.", created_at:1779664210, source_id:"chunk-3b6255658181910e27221370c039616c"}}] AS row
