UNWIND [{start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:7733}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"interconnectedness,mutual impact", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"A beautiful state in one individual creates ripples in the shared consciousness, positively affecting others' experiences.", created_at:1779672445, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:7732}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"illusion of separation,interconnectedness", weight:1.0, description:"Despite the perception of being separate, individuals remain interconnected in the realm of consciousness.", created_at:1779672445, source_id:"chunk-836e578c5eddb352fd28d56ce3144bde"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:6098}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source<SEP>YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"course,creation,spiritual practice", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"Ekam is presented as a program that teaches how to create a \"magical destiny\" through specific conscious states.<SEP>Ekam serves as a method to consciously create personal or collective destiny through intentional living in a connected state.", created_at:1779675957, source_id:"chunk-c221b35beb5903b6212b49e01a938f47<SEP>chunk-3060fcf971a2939151d1a8320d675a71"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:7842}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"consciousness,enabler,manifestation,transformation", weight:2.0, description:"Living in a beautiful state is suggested as a means to create a \"magical destiny,\" though specifics are unclear.<SEP>Living in a beautiful state facilitates the creation of a magical destiny through positive alignment.", created_at:1779686210, source_id:"chunk-1de41cf0c7dd51f4c24f73f5f21d78fe<SEP>chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:1449}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", keywords:"creation,self-determination", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Consciousness creates destiny through self-determination, opposing the idea of a pre-written destiny.", created_at:1779677952, source_id:"chunk-47e8f33a6c085de5c83afa558a11cf07"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:7842}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"creation,purpose", weight:1.0, description:"Ekam serves as a platform or course for creating a magical destiny through conscious state transformation.", created_at:1779686210, source_id:"chunk-02c05cf3a61d20e46704cb3f714b9393"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI)", truncate:"", keywords:"destiny creation,state exploration", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video explores the concept of living in a beautiful state to create a destiny.", created_at:1779686720, source_id:"chunk-fedec056ab462ac623268f5f37e05639"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:7884}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"correction,mishearing", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The homophone rule applies to the term Ekam, which is a mishearing.<SEP>The homophone rule applies to the term Ekam, which is a mishearing.", created_at:1779695423, source_id:"chunk-b08f45193924d9c9045e2c6dd99944d2"}}, {start: {name:"Ekam"}, end: {_id:7885}, properties:{file_path:"unknown_source", keywords:"correction,homophones", truncate:"", weight:2.0, description:"The text correction task involves correcting homophones like Ekam.<SEP>The text correction task involves correcting homophones like Ekam.", created_at:1779695423, source_id:"chunk-b08f45193924d9c9045e2c6dd99944d2"}}, {start: {name:"Consciousness"}, end: {_id:5344}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4)", keywords:"awakening,problem-solving", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Mass awakening in consciousness is presented as the solution to current global challenges.", created_at:1779701605, source_id:"chunk-c2a3583743d6818c48f0ebcba32019d3"}}, {start: {name:"Oneness"}, end: {_id:7967}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=77dJnbTCwsA)", truncate:"", keywords:"focus,unity", weight:1.0, description:"Right Leader focuses on creating oneness between different entities.", created_at:1779720032, source_id:"chunk-1d15cc391db5233b171a090b389c4081"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:533}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b-MkLkpTeVY)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"enabling factor,foundation,necessity,psychological condition", weight:2.0, description:"Compassion is sustained and effective only when performed from a beautiful state, which provides the energy and mindset required.<SEP>The \"beautiful state\" enables compassionate acts by maintaining energy and preventing frustration.", created_at:1779721206, source_id:"chunk-951a949f1bbe6eebf76242a6f74be25b<SEP>chunk-56e6dfdbd728360a59cb27db0201ee18"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:1301}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b-MkLkpTeVY)<SEP>unknown_source", truncate:"", keywords:"associated concept,cognitive benefit,decision-making,discernment", weight:2.0, description:"The beautiful state grants intelligence to discern necessary actions, avoiding unnecessary or forced compassion.<SEP>The \"beautiful state\" is linked to intelligence, as it allows sustained compassion without energy loss.", created_at:1779721207, source_id:"chunk-951a949f1bbe6eebf76242a6f74be25b<SEP>chunk-56e6dfdbd728360a59cb27db0201ee18"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:7974}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b-MkLkpTeVY)", keywords:"consequence,sustainability", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Without the beautiful state, compassion leads to energy depletion and frustration, as seen in the example of yelling at the beggar.", created_at:1779721204, source_id:"chunk-951a949f1bbe6eebf76242a6f74be25b"}}, {start: {name:"Beautiful State"}, end: {_id:7975}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b-MkLkpTeVY)", keywords:"absence of state,reaction", truncate:"", weight:1.0, description:"Lack of the beautiful state results in negative reactions like yelling, contrasting with compassionate acts.", created_at:1779721205, source_id:"chunk-951a949f1bbe6eebf76242a6f74be25b"}}, {start: {name:"Karma"}, end: {_id:7989}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FP5O9F9JiOk)", truncate:"", keywords:"generation,psychological impact", weight:1.0, description:"Karma generates thoughts and desires within individuals, which in turn drive actions and behaviors aligned with past actions.", created_at:1779722028, source_id:"chunk-e6bccf95254b72b0d63718f7708bb634"}}, {start: {name:"Karma"}, end: {_id:348}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FP5O9F9JiOk)", truncate:"", keywords:"contextual reference,source", weight:1.0, description:"The YouTube Video serves as the source for the discussion on karma, including the specific term \"Buddhi karma nusare\" and related philosophical analysis.", created_at:1779722029, source_id:"chunk-e6bccf95254b72b0d63718f7708bb634"}}, {start: {name:"Deeksha"}, end: {_id:8021}, properties:{file_path:"YouTube Video: Unknown (URL: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vIUY446FVPw)", truncate:"", keywords:"guidance,philosophical concept", weight:1.0, description:"Deeksha represents spiritual guidance within the framework of Ekam Sat's teachings.", created_at:1779724382, source_id:"chunk-3a0be5644a7